values
  ('249820991220999526', 'Boy Missing', 2016, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Mar Targarona, Sergi Bartrolí', 'Oriol Paulo', 'Blanca Portillo, Jose Coronado, Antonio Dechent, Macarena Gómez, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Nausicaa Bonnín, Josep Maria Pou, Marc Domenech', null, 'When her son''s alleged kidnapper is released for lack of solid evidence, a reputable and well-known attorney takes matters into her own hands with unintended and spectacularly disastrous consequences.', 'When her son''s alleged kidnapper is released for lack of solid evidence, a reputable and well-known attorney takes matters into her own hands with unintended and spectacularly disastrous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BLDTCJSbBSRNJFd9Q5Za10grCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403509'),
  ('540954244776410749', 'Boy on a Dolphin', 1957, 'Adventure, Romance, Drama', 'Jean Negulesco, Carlo Lastricati, Eli Dunn', 'Dwight Taylor, Ivan Moffat', 'Alan Ladd, Sophia Loren, Clifton Webb, Alex Minotis, Jorge Mistral, Laurence Naismith, Piero Giagnoni, Gertrude Flynn', 'NR', 'Phaedra is a poor sponge diver on the lovely Greek isle of Hydra. While diving, she discovers an ancient brass and gold statue of a boy riding a dolphin, which is said to have the magical power to grant wishes. Her shiftless boyfriend wants to sell it to an unscrupulous art collector, but Phaedra wants to give it to anthropologist Jim Calder, who would return it to the Greek government.', 'Phaedra is a poor sponge diver on the lovely Greek isle of Hydra. While diving, she discovers an ancient brass and gold statue of a boy riding a dolphin, which is said to have the magical power to grant wishes. Her shiftless boyfriend wants to sell it to an unscrupulous art collector, but Phaedra wants to give it to anthropologist Jim Calder, who would return it to the Greek government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufLLWel63yrovBmM2boGkw096w2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37596'),
  ('786961233853970396', 'Boy Undone', 2017, 'Drama', 'Leopoldo Laborde', 'Leopoldo Laborde', 'Paul Act, Eduardo Longoria, Rodrigo Lopezcarranza, Luis Fernando Schivy, Xavier Loyá, Abril Ramos Xochiteotzin', 'NR', 'Two young men spend the night together after meeting the previous evening in a notorious gay club. The next day, however, the host wakes to find the boy he picked up bewildered and confused, unable remember his name or anything about his past. Lacking any type of identification or obvious clues, the boys begin to search for the truth among fragments of memories that may or may not prove reliable.', 'Two young men spend the night together after meeting the previous evening in a notorious gay club. The next day, however, the host wakes to find the boy he picked up bewildered and confused, unable remember his name or anything about his past. Lacking any type of identification or obvious clues, the boys begin to search for the truth among fragments of memories that may or may not prove reliable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOBsUuK4qoW4S8Qm5hNZpno9mVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526024'),
  ('865975717368094552', 'Boy Wonder', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Morrissey', 'Michael Morrissey', 'James Russo, Tracy Middendorf, Zulay Henao, Bill Sage, Roberta Wallach, Nicole Patrick, Kether Donohue, Caleb Steinmeyer', 'R', 'A young Brooklyn boy witnesses the brutal murder of his mother and grows up obsessed with finding her killer. Thus begins his life as a quiet, straight-A student by day and a self-appointed hero at night. But what is a real hero? And who decides what is right or wrong? As the boundaries blur, Sean''s dual life wears on his psyche and his two worlds careen dangerously close to colliding. Like a graphic novel you can''t put down, Boy Wonder challenges morality, distorting perceptions of what is right and what is justified, as it races to its shocking conclusion.', 'A young Brooklyn boy witnesses the brutal murder of his mother and grows up obsessed with finding her killer. Thus begins his life as a quiet, straight-A student by day and a self-appointed hero at night. But what is a real hero? And who decides what is right or wrong? As the boundaries blur, Sean''s dual life wears on his psyche and his two worlds careen dangerously close to colliding. Like a graphic novel you can''t put down, Boy Wonder challenges morality, distorting perceptions of what is right and what is justified, as it races to its shocking conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKYynKG4qVemVNd2BUF6vgY9TJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80188'),
  ('907003179692129496', 'Boy, Did I Get a Wrong Number!', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Marshall, Lionel Lindon', 'George Kennett', 'Bob Hope, Elke Sommer, Marjorie Lord, Phyllis Diller, Cesare Danova, Joyce Jameson, Norman Leavitt, Terry Burnham', 'NR', 'Tom Meade mistakenly dials the gorgeous European film star Didi at her Oregon hotel. Didi, who has escaped Hollywood to avoid being typecast as a bombshell, takes up Meade''s offer to hide away at his backwoods cabin. Meade, with the help of his housekeeper, goes to absurd lengths to help the actress evade discovery by both the public and his suspicious wife.', 'Tom Meade mistakenly dials the gorgeous European film star Didi at her Oregon hotel. Didi, who has escaped Hollywood to avoid being typecast as a bombshell, takes up Meade''s offer to hide away at his backwoods cabin. Meade, with the help of his housekeeper, goes to absurd lengths to help the actress evade discovery by both the public and his suspicious wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6sITOCTE4OfjtQDp3ct85UYOn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39214'),
  ('346840402892169283', 'Boychoir', 2015, 'Music, Drama', 'François Girard, David Franco', 'Ben Ripley', 'Dustin Hoffman, Kevin McHale, Josh Lucas, Debra Winger, Kathy Bates, Garrett Wareing, Joe West, River Alexander', null, 'A troubled and angry 11-year-old orphan from a small Texas town, ends up at a Boy Choir school after the death of his single mother. Completely out of his element, he finds himself in a battle of wills with a demanding Choir Master who recognises a unique talent in this young boy as he pushes him to discover his creative heart and soul in music.', 'A troubled and angry 11-year-old orphan from a small Texas town, ends up at a Boy Choir school after the death of his single mother. Completely out of his element, he finds himself in a battle of wills with a demanding Choir Master who recognises a unique talent in this young boy as he pushes him to discover his creative heart and soul in music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jh2xStYNXhSK5JYFUApMEqgn0yT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286519'),
  ('722833064073713118', 'Boyfriend in Sight', 1954, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Luis García Berlanga, Miguel Fernández Mila, Cecilio Paniagua', 'Edgar Neville, José Luis Colina, Juan Antonio Bardem', 'Josette Arno, Jorge Vico, José María Rodero, Antonio Vico, Julia Caba Alba, Antonio Riquelme, Julia Lajos, Irene Caba Alba', null, 'In 1918, a young woman is taken to a coastal resort by her parents to find her a suitable husband.', 'In 1918, a young woman is taken to a coastal resort by her parents to find her a suitable husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qXZg9IJiqFt7MhzBuLeJrF0EZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51838'),
  ('776679905660126932', 'Boyfriends', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tom Hunsinger, Neil Hunter', 'Neil Hunter, Tom Hunsinger', 'James Dreyfus, Mark Sands, Andrew Ableson, Michael Urwin, David Coffey, Darren Petrucci, Michael McGrath, Russell Higgs', 'NR', 'Paul, Matt, and Will (in their 30s) have been friends for years. They converge at the seaside for the weekend, each with a boyfriend in tow. Paul is with Ben, his companion of five years: their relationship is on the rocks after months of Paul''s moodiness since his brother Mark died. Matt brings Owen, whom he''s dated for three months and wants to live with; to everyone else, they seem singularly.', 'Paul, Matt, and Will (in their 30s) have been friends for years. They converge at the seaside for the weekend, each with a boyfriend in tow. Paul is with Ben, his companion of five years: their relationship is on the rocks after months of Paul''s moodiness since his brother Mark died. Matt brings Owen, whom he''s dated for three months and wants to live with; to everyone else, they seem singularly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPnvdN7Db9VkOVE9dFSCyhmND9R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32700'),
  ('1126779723236418092', 'Boyfriends and Girlfriends', 1987, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Éric Rohmer, Bernard Lutic', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Emmanuelle Chaulet, Sophie Renoir, François-Eric Gendron, Éric Viellard, Anne-Laure Meury', null, 'Middle-class Parisian suburbs: Blanche and Léa, office worker and student, meet and become friends. Léa is going out with Fabien, but is thinking of leaving him. Blanche falls for Léa''s handsome and witty friend Alexandre, but is tongue-tied whenever she meets him. Léa goes on holiday and Blanche, still smitten with the dashing Alexandre, begins to get to know Fabien.', 'Middle-class Parisian suburbs: Blanche and Léa, office worker and student, meet and become friends. Léa is going out with Fabien, but is thinking of leaving him. Blanche falls for Léa''s handsome and witty friend Alexandre, but is tongue-tied whenever she meets him. Léa goes on holiday and Blanche, still smitten with the dashing Alexandre, begins to get to know Fabien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obfJYuVMGFZRlMeNQklFlvhShFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64544'),
  ('767509345382127104', 'Boyfriends of Christmas Past', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Don McBrearty, Peter Benison', 'Lisa Parsons', 'Catherine Haena Kim, Raymond Ablack, Paul Sun-Hyung Lee, Karn Kalra, Jon McLaren, Ish Morris, Jordan Kronis, Jenna Katz', 'G', 'Leading up to Christmas, marketing executive, Lauren, is visited by the ghosts of four ex-boyfriends. She must learn to open her heart or risk losing her best friend, Nate.', 'Leading up to Christmas, marketing executive, Lauren, is visited by the ghosts of four ex-boyfriends. She must learn to open her heart or risk losing her best friend, Nate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AtCO9ZLk0yOolkabEj3TFfBpSB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874162'),
  ('243050140803552710', 'Boyhood', 1951, 'Drama, War', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Sumie Tanaka', 'Akiko Tamura, Akira Ishihama, Chishū Ryū, Rentaro Mikuni, Toshiko Kobayashi, Mutsuko Sakura, Takeshi Sakamoto, Ryuji Kita', null, 'When a family has to relocate due to the war, they are ostracized by their new community.', 'When a family has to relocate due to the war, they are ostracized by their new community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uk3lEeHzKipxVJ8usPE7uHSUlyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112959'),
  ('1080145283148418655', 'Boyhood', 2014, 'Drama', 'Richard Linklater, Lee Daniel, Shane F. Kelly', 'Richard Linklater', 'Ellar Coltrane, Patricia Arquette, Ethan Hawke, Lorelei Linklater, Libby Villari, Marco Perella, Brad Hawkins, Jamie Howard', 'R', 'The film tells a story of a divorced couple trying to raise their young son. The story follows the boy for twelve years, from first grade at age 6 through 12th grade at age 17-18, and examines his relationship with his parents as he grows.', 'The film tells a story of a divorced couple trying to raise their young son. The story follows the boy for twelve years, from first grade at age 6 through 12th grade at age 17-18, and examines his relationship with his parents as he grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BvtvDUyxiMJ4dmKfiQf4qdOHQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85350'),
  ('479490302111864841', 'Boyhood Daze', 1957, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Dick Beals, Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Ralph gets sent to his room for breaking a window. There, he passes the time in Walter Mitty-type fashion, daydreaming that he''s a parent-saving jungle explorer, an alien-fighting jet ace and a convict.', 'Ralph gets sent to his room for breaking a window. There, he passes the time in Walter Mitty-type fashion, daydreaming that he''s a parent-saving jungle explorer, an alien-fighting jet ace and a convict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJml0xegdCtktLEQ9VeRq5eOKta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83745'),
  ('842270808489929799', 'Boyka: Undisputed IV', 2016, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Tim Man, Todor Chapkanov, Mariana Vodenicharova', 'Tony Mosher, David N. White', 'Scott Adkins, Teodora Duhovnikova, Alon Aboutboul, Julian Vergov, Martyn Ford, Brahim Achabbakhe, Paul Chahidi, Petio Petkov', 'R', 'In the fourth installment of the fighting franchise, Boyka is shooting for the big leagues when an accidental death in the ring makes him question everything he stands for. When he finds out the wife of the man he accidentally killed is in trouble, Boyka offers to fight in a series of impossible battles to free her from a life of servitude.', 'In the fourth installment of the fighting franchise, Boyka is shooting for the big leagues when an accidental death in the ring makes him question everything he stands for. When he finds out the wife of the man he accidentally killed is in trouble, Boyka offers to fight in a series of impossible battles to free her from a life of servitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QGdIJWWTkPhVjpQ0zA6z69khod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348893'),
  ('1002880753627282361', 'Boynu Bükük Küheylan', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erdoğan Tokatlı, Savaş Akova, Kemal Yildirim', 'Erdoğan Tokatlı', 'Kemal Sunal, Füsun Demirel, Aydan Burhan, Murat Güler, Sevim Çalışgir, Nurettin Şen, Işık Aras, Oğuz Fırıldak', null, 'With his 2 wives Kuheylan started as a doorkeeper in an apartment after immigrating from small town to city. While Kuheylan was dreaming to be rich, his wives got impressed under city culture and joined their forses agains their husband.', 'With his 2 wives Kuheylan started as a doorkeeper in an apartment after immigrating from small town to city. While Kuheylan was dreaming to be rich, his wives got impressed under city culture and joined their forses agains their husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RuFycVwJVCQ4GkYHGEziJRk8SM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80840'),
  ('495632671867596002', 'Boys', 1977, 'Drama', 'Nils Malmros, Morten Bruus, Morten Arnfred', 'Frederick Cryer, Nils Malmros', 'Mads Ole Erhardsen, Jesper Hede, Mette Marie Hede, Lone Rode, Poul Clemmensen, Lotte Hermann, Mikkel Hede, Karen-Margrethe Nyborg', null, 'A boy, as seen through three ages and episodes of his life: as a small boy having a boy cousin as his house guest, as a high-school boy in abject love, and as a young stud trying to bed down a nurse.', 'A boy, as seen through three ages and episodes of his life: as a small boy having a boy cousin as his house guest, as a high-school boy in abject love, and as a young stud trying to bed down a nurse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZR1ajnvOevfY73gaGfsZ6DERfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121530'),
  ('1139246660788764450', 'Boys', 1996, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Stacy Cochran, Robert Elswit', 'James Salter, Stacy Cochran', 'Winona Ryder, Lukas Haas, John C. Reilly, James Le Gros, Skeet Ulrich, Wiley Wiggins, Catherine Keener, Jessica Harper', 'PG-13', 'Fed up with boarding school and frustrated with the way others have planned his life, John Baker Jr. wants a change -- anything to shake up his staid routine. The moment arrives when he stumbles upon a woman, Patty Vare, unconscious in a field. Deciding to risk it, John takes her to his dorm to look after her, much to the disapproval of his friends. John''s decision proves fateful as he and Patty grow close to one another. However, she may be keeping secrets from him.', 'Fed up with boarding school and frustrated with the way others have planned his life, John Baker Jr. wants a change -- anything to shake up his staid routine. The moment arrives when he stumbles upon a woman, Patty Vare, unconscious in a field. Deciding to risk it, John takes her to his dorm to look after her, much to the disapproval of his friends. John''s decision proves fateful as he and Patty grow close to one another. However, she may be keeping secrets from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxpLUlvqptToQbLZJbQ7YO4MUAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43634'),
  ('163433492782646794', 'Boys', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'V. Manikandan, K. V. Anand, Shankar', 'Sujatha Rangarajan', 'Siddharth, Genelia D''Souza, Bharath Srinivasan, S. Thaman, Nakul, Vivek, Senthil, Janaki Sabesh', null, 'The story centers on six youngsters, who experience the downfalls of teenage life. The film conveys a message about the importance of a good education and career over other distractions, such as romance and sex.', 'The story centers on six youngsters, who experience the downfalls of teenage life. The film conveys a message about the importance of a good education and career over other distractions, such as romance and sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQBEA5Slv40HHHM5WA1ey8D7nnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75076'),
  ('910812103954279115', 'Boys', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Lorenzo De Nicola, Emanuele Pasquet, Davide Ferrario', 'Cristiana Mainardi, Davide Ferrario', 'Neri Marcorè, Marco Paolini, Giovanni Storti, Giorgio Tirabassi, Paolo Giangrasso, Saba Anglana, Giorgia Würth, Linda Messerklinger', null, 'Joe, Carlo, Bobo and Giacomo have always been friends, each with their own life and problems, but united by an authentic bond and the passion that brought them together: music. The Boys, the band''s name, had had lightning-fast success in the 1970s. In their routine - between love and personal affairs - a possibility bursts that takes them on a new journey: they will have to deal with the dreams and ambitions of the past and the world of today, but even more they will discover the meaning of their friendship. .', 'Joe, Carlo, Bobo and Giacomo have always been friends, each with their own life and problems, but united by an authentic bond and the passion that brought them together: music. The Boys, the band''s name, had had lightning-fast success in the 1970s. In their routine - between love and personal affairs - a possibility bursts that takes them on a new journey: they will have to deal with the dreams and ambitions of the past and the world of today, but even more they will discover the meaning of their friendship. .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xqIchs55rtvmq200qTEaSskAdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836526'),
  ('930803191806973923', 'Boys and Girls', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ralf D. Bode, Robert Iscove, Michael Stone', 'Andrew Lowery, Andrew Miller', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Claire Forlani, Jason Biggs, Amanda Detmer, Alyson Hannigan, Brendon Ryan Barrett, Gay Thomas Wilson, Raquel Beaudene', 'PG-13', 'Ryan and Jennifer are opposites who definitely do not attract. At least that''s what they always believed. When they met as twelve-year-olds, they disliked one another. When they met again as teenagers, they loathed each other. But when they meet in college, the uptight Ryan and the free-spirited Jennifer find that their differences bind them together and a rare friendship develops.', 'Ryan and Jennifer are opposites who definitely do not attract. At least that''s what they always believed. When they met as twelve-year-olds, they disliked one another. When they met again as teenagers, they loathed each other. But when they meet in college, the uptight Ryan and the free-spirited Jennifer find that their differences bind them together and a rare friendship develops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdVnV2wSESbgrXX4uRD3J0D8dBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10571'),
  ('577539053653974018', 'Boys Beware', 1961, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Sid Davis', null, 'Sid Davis', null, 'This anti-homosexual social "scare" short film focuses on the dangers of young boys talking to strangers.', 'This anti-homosexual social "scare" short film focuses on the dangers of young boys talking to strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scUiZ0b9mybftw9YC2zBG74K4e7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44355'),
  ('182051129407079825', 'Boys Cry', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Damiano D''Innocenzo, Fabio D''Innocenzo, Paolo Carnera', 'Fabio D''Innocenzo, Damiano D''Innocenzo', 'Andrea Carpenzano, Matteo Olivetti, Milena Mancini, Luca Zingaretti, Michela De Rossi, Max Tortora, Giordano De Plano, Yan Lovga', null, 'Mirko and Manolo are best friends and live in the suburbs of Rome. They both live in poor conditions with their single parents, are still in school and struggle with occasional odd jobs to make ends meet. Together they share dreams of women, of sex and money, of a better life to come. Then, after killing a man in a hit-and-run one night, they get involved with the local mafia and their lives change dramatically.', 'Mirko and Manolo are best friends and live in the suburbs of Rome. They both live in poor conditions with their single parents, are still in school and struggle with occasional odd jobs to make ends meet. Together they share dreams of women, of sex and money, of a better life to come. Then, after killing a man in a hit-and-run one night, they get involved with the local mafia and their lives change dramatically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZpkx4mEqglDaOEQvJMJ6hBKIUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500849'),
  ('264395256208523672', 'Boys Don''t Cry', 1999, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kimberly Peirce, Jim Denault, Jim LaClair', 'Kimberly Peirce, Andy Bienen', 'Hilary Swank, Chloë Sevigny, Peter Sarsgaard, Brendan Sexton III, Alicia Goranson, Alison Folland, Jeannetta Arnette, Rob Campbell', 'R', 'A young transgender man explores his gender identity and searches for love in rural Nebraska.', 'A young transgender man explores his gender identity and searches for love in rural Nebraska.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eB505ycEhFVfMwGglIzXNUyKAIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226'),
  ('106106760747386087', 'Boys Don''t Cry', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Olaf Lubaszenko, Martin Štrba', 'Mikołaj Korzyński', 'Maciej Stuhr, Cezary Pazura, Michał Milowicz, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Monika Ambroziak, Magdalena Mazur, Anna Mucha, Wojciech Klata', null, 'A young aspiring violinist unwittingly becomes involved with a criminal gang.', 'A young aspiring violinist unwittingly becomes involved with a criminal gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FGCC1CkEr1EvI3OJnSnzF53uNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36380'),
  ('930500841253349985', 'Boys from County Hell', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Ryan Kernaghan, Erin Hagan, Chris Baugh', 'Chris Baugh', 'Jack Rowan, Nigel O''Neill, Louisa Harland, Michael Hough, John Lynch, Fra Fee, Morgan C. Jones, Andrea Irvine', 'NR', 'A crew of hardy road workers, led by a bickering Father and Son, must survive the night when they accidentally awaken an ancient Irish vampire.', 'A crew of hardy road workers, led by a bickering Father and Son, must survive the night when they accidentally awaken an ancient Irish vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DAmmAxTeZd2oh6cveD0yyysjcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680631'),
  ('208702651527387923', 'Boys from the Streets', 1949, 'Drama', 'Ulf Greber, Arne Skouen, Ragnar Sørensen', 'Arne Skouen', 'Tom Tellefsen, Ivar Thorkildsen, Pål Bang-Hansen, Svein Byhring, Per Arne Knobelauch, Ella Hval, Jack Fjeldstad, Finn Bernhoft', null, 'The movie takes place on Oslo''s east side sometime during the twenties. It depicts the workers'' environment by traditional elements like unemployment, strike, poverty, alcoholism, absent fathers, wise and tired mothers, the dream of a better life and the friendship between the boys in the street.', 'The movie takes place on Oslo''s east side sometime during the twenties. It depicts the workers'' environment by traditional elements like unemployment, strike, poverty, alcoholism, absent fathers, wise and tired mothers, the dream of a better life and the friendship between the boys in the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cN1juUpBxzjvYjvxWduN8QCO3Ns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56690'),
  ('421536091101415050', 'Boys in Brazil', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alexandre Carvalho', 'André Collazi', 'Marcello Airoldi, André Bankoff, Luis Vaz, Mauricio Evanns, Silvetty Montilla, Titi Müller, Rafael Lozano, Angela Ribeiro', 'NR', 'Two teenagers decide to attend attend São Paulo''s annual Gay Pride Parade, encouraged by one of their uncles, a successful - although closeted - business executive. After witnessing an incident of shocking violence at the parade, the group makes a pact - they all have one year to come out of the closet.', 'Two teenagers decide to attend attend São Paulo''s annual Gay Pride Parade, encouraged by one of their uncles, a successful - although closeted - business executive. After witnessing an incident of shocking violence at the parade, the group makes a pact - they all have one year to come out of the closet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8lgNyDUVFdejfaHEenu5D7hdxs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262782'),
  ('657533755375448634', 'Boys in Brown', 1949, 'Crime', 'Montgomery Tully, Cyril Bristow, Gordon Lang', 'Montgomery Tully, Reginald Beckwith', 'Dirk Bogarde, Richard Attenborough, Jack Warner, Jimmy Hanley, Barbara Murray, Andrew Crawford, Patrick Holt, Thora Hird', null, 'Jackie lives in poverty with his widowed mother. In a bid to escape poverty he gets involved in a robbery that sees him sentenced to three years in Borstal where he meets a tough crowd, tougher than anything on the outside.', 'Jackie lives in poverty with his widowed mother. In a bid to escape poverty he gets involved in a robbery that sees him sentenced to three years in Borstal where he meets a tough crowd, tougher than anything on the outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zqueruJh4kVozBE7is55orD4de.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183918'),
  ('97680539642488838', 'Boys in the Trees', 2016, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Nicholas Verso', 'Nicholas Verso', 'Toby Wallace, Gulliver McGrath, Justin Holborow, Mitzi Ruhlmann, Terence Crawford, Tom Russell, Georgie deLaine, Amalia Krueger', null, 'On Halloween 1997, two estranged teen skaters embark on a surreal journey through their memories, dreams and fears.', 'On Halloween 1997, two estranged teen skaters embark on a surreal journey through their memories, dreams and fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZzSxliBkqVqRaXKCnQVr59VcNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409164'),
  ('602591797725365361', 'Boys Life', 1994, 'Drama', 'Brian Sloan, Raoul O''Connell, Robert Lee King', 'Raoul O''Connell, Brian Sloan, Robert Lee King', 'James Andrews, Mary Beth Aylesworth, Mike Barbour, Steve Bilich, Wendy Brokaw, BoJesse Christopher, Dennis Christopher, Adrian Davey', 'NR', 'Each of the three short films in this collection presents a young gay man at the threshold of adulthood. In "Pool Days," Justin is a 17-year old Bethesda lad, hired as the evening life guard at a fitness center. In the course of the summer, he realizes and embraces that he''s gay. In "A Friend of Dorothy," Winston arrives from upstate for his freshman year at NYU. He has to figure out, with some help from Anne, a hometown friend, how to build a social life as a young gay man in the city. In "The Disco Years," Tom looks back on 1978, the year in high school that he came out of the closet after one joyful and several painful encounters', 'Each of the three short films in this collection presents a young gay man at the threshold of adulthood. In "Pool Days," Justin is a 17-year old Bethesda lad, hired as the evening life guard at a fitness center. In the course of the summer, he realizes and embraces that he''s gay. In "A Friend of Dorothy," Winston arrives from upstate for his freshman year at NYU. He has to figure out, with some help from Anne, a hometown friend, how to build a social life as a young gay man in the city. In "The Disco Years," Tom looks back on 1978, the year in high school that he came out of the closet after one joyful and several painful encounters', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXKecGbSp36C486myi1pbe6EKAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39953'),
  ('688501446615662920', 'Boys Like Us', 2014, 'Drama', 'Patric Chiha', 'Raphaël Bouvet, Nicolas Ducray, Patric Chiha', 'Florian Carove, Raphaël Bouvet, Jonathan Capdevielle, Inge Maux, Gisèle Vienne, Kerstin Daley-Baradel, Simon Morzé, Dennis Cubic', null, 'Rudolf, a bookshop salesman, Gabriel, an actor, and Nicolas, a bar waiter, share more than one common point: the three of them are thirty-something, gay and... neurotic! So what a shock when following a sentimental break-up, Rudolf decides to leave Paris (and his two friends at the same time). What he wants is to put order in his life and it seems to him the best thing to do is to move back to the village of his birth, somewhere in the Austrian mountains, far from the chaos of Parisian life. After a moment of panic, Gabriel and Nicolas decide to follow Rudolf to Styria. Little do they know how eventful their trip will be...', 'Rudolf, a bookshop salesman, Gabriel, an actor, and Nicolas, a bar waiter, share more than one common point: the three of them are thirty-something, gay and... neurotic! So what a shock when following a sentimental break-up, Rudolf decides to leave Paris (and his two friends at the same time). What he wants is to put order in his life and it seems to him the best thing to do is to move back to the village of his birth, somewhere in the Austrian mountains, far from the chaos of Parisian life. After a moment of panic, Gabriel and Nicolas decide to follow Rudolf to Styria. Little do they know how eventful their trip will be...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qVFnSLd4Dl2YluVMQQkOjsYxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287578'),
  ('138151024727705260', 'Boys Love', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kotaro Terauchi, Kotaro Terauchi', 'Carolco, Kotaro Terauchi, Senoo Saki', 'Takumi Saitoh, Yoshikazu Kotani, Hiroya Matsumoto, Masashi Taniguchi, Atsumi Kanno', null, 'Magazine editor Mamiya is intrigued by high school model Noeru''s talent and attitude, but soon realizes his feelings go beyond professional curiosity.', 'Magazine editor Mamiya is intrigued by high school model Noeru''s talent and attitude, but soon realizes his feelings go beyond professional curiosity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g22DsZFq0uY3tbRC01Jzz3UnmHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73517'),
  ('190907387074995807', 'Boys of Abu Ghraib', 2014, 'Drama, War, Thriller', 'Luke Moran', 'Luke Moran', 'Luke Moran, Sean Astin, Sara Paxton, Michael Welch, John Heard, Elijah Kelley, John Robinson, Kristen DeVore Rakes', 'R', 'An American soldier deployed at Abu Ghraib finds himself behind the walls of the infamous Hard Site, where he develops a secret friendship with an Iraqi detainee.', 'An American soldier deployed at Abu Ghraib finds himself behind the walls of the infamous Hard Site, where he develops a secret friendship with an Iraqi detainee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nsGii9M9LJCoWYGxe3B20mJQqP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256969'),
  ('470922907793285009', 'Boys of the City', 1940, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Arthur Hammond, Bobby Ray', 'William Lively', 'Bobby Jordan, Leo Gorcey, Hal E. Chester, Frankie Burke, Vince Barnett, Inna Gest, Dave O''Brien, Sunshine Sammy Morrison', null, 'Street kids get sent to the country, where they get mixed up in murder and a haunted house.', 'Street kids get sent to the country, where they get mixed up in murder and a haunted house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCEJlmQCKbCd7gtdehMGcJwRwuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87870'),
  ('97474360606102399', 'Boys on the Outside', 1990, 'Drama', 'Marco Risi, Tony Sperandeo, Dominick Tambasco', 'Marco Risi, Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Francesco Benigno, Alessandra Di Sanzo, Roberto Mariano, Maurizio Prollo, Alfredo Li Bassi, Salvatore Termini, Filippo Genzardi, Vincenza Attardo', null, 'Young men with no future have little in the present as well. Natale is released from prison: he takes up with his friends again but none can find work. Claudio, from Palermo, gets out of juvenile detention in Naples and he''s met by Vita, a girl who''s come from home to run away with him. Where can they go? A young dad, whose potato stall at the market is shut down because he has no permit, takes his two small children to the beach and yells at them. Mario, gay, a prostitute in drag, gets a visit from his mom; he offers tea, then finds the water to his apartment is shut off. Social workers drop by, parole officers file reports. What hope is there? What options besides crime?', 'Young men with no future have little in the present as well. Natale is released from prison: he takes up with his friends again but none can find work. Claudio, from Palermo, gets out of juvenile detention in Naples and he''s met by Vita, a girl who''s come from home to run away with him. Where can they go? A young dad, whose potato stall at the market is shut down because he has no permit, takes his two small children to the beach and yells at them. Mario, gay, a prostitute in drag, gets a visit from his mom; he offers tea, then finds the water to his apartment is shut off. Social workers drop by, parole officers file reports. What hope is there? What options besides crime?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHsD93ofMgnvPTCe23Tk7ylvDvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52811'),
  ('87758937950145998', 'Boys on the Run', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Daisuke Miura, Takashi Matsuo, Shinya Kimura', 'Daisuke Miura', 'Kazunobu Mineta, Mei Kurokawa, Ryuhei Matsuda, Denden, Lily Franky, Kaoru Kobayashi, YOU, Kiyohiko Shibukawa', null, 'A socially awkward salesman for a toy-capsule company tries to change his nerdy ways when a slick rival moves in on the beautiful co-worker he loves.', 'A socially awkward salesman for a toy-capsule company tries to change his nerdy ways when a slick rival moves in on the beautiful co-worker he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmFIRz4MuIwN9xhqG2DQ0JjZN05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55344'),
  ('464848223996879916', 'Boys on the Side', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Donald E. Thorin, Herbert Ross, Barry K. Thomas', 'Don Roos', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Mary-Louise Parker, Drew Barrymore, Matthew McConaughey, James Remar, Billy Wirth, Anita Gillette, Dennis Boutsikaris', 'R', 'After breaking up with her girlfriend, a nightclub singer, Jane, answers a personal ad from Robin, a real estate agent with AIDS, seeking a cross-country travel partner. On their journey from New York City to Los Angeles, the two stop by Pittsburgh to pick up Jane''s friend Holly, who is trying to escape an abusive relationship. With three distinct personalities, the women must overcome their differences to help one another.', 'After breaking up with her girlfriend, a nightclub singer, Jane, answers a personal ad from Robin, a real estate agent with AIDS, seeking a cross-country travel partner. On their journey from New York City to Los Angeles, the two stop by Pittsburgh to pick up Jane''s friend Holly, who is trying to escape an abusive relationship. With three distinct personalities, the women must overcome their differences to help one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dhZnfBjiza5TupvOupRU4hFAcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9382'),
  ('129651103137255229', 'Boys State', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Amanda McBaine, Jesse Moss, Thorsten Thielow', null, 'Ben Feinstein, Steven Garza, Robert MacDougall, René Otero, Eddy Proietti Conti', 'PG-13', 'This raucous journey into the heart of democracy captures an unusual rite of passage: 1,100 teenage boys from across Texas coming together to build a representative government from the ground up.', 'This raucous journey into the heart of democracy captures an unusual rite of passage: 1,100 teenage boys from across Texas coming together to build a representative government from the ground up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuvt3ImM3wQdijib7OeIH48uRfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653723'),
  ('842115789400960415', 'Boys Town', 1938, 'Drama', 'Norman Taurog, Sidney Wagner, Horace Hough', 'Dore Schary, John Meehan', 'Spencer Tracy, Mickey Rooney, Henry Hull, Leslie Fenton, Gene Reynolds, Edward Norris, Addison Richards, Minor Watson', 'NR', 'Devout but iron-willed Father Flanagan leads a community called Boys Town, a different sort of juvenile detention facility where, instead of being treated as underage criminals, the boys are shepherded into making themselves better people. But hard-nosed petty thief and pool shark Whitey Marsh, the impulsive and violent younger brother of an imprisoned murderer, might be too much for the good father''s tough-love system.', 'Devout but iron-willed Father Flanagan leads a community called Boys Town, a different sort of juvenile detention facility where, instead of being treated as underage criminals, the boys are shepherded into making themselves better people. But hard-nosed petty thief and pool shark Whitey Marsh, the impulsive and violent younger brother of an imprisoned murderer, might be too much for the good father''s tough-love system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGwKOZvPItNSocHFAg1USbhKR6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42390'),
  ('694709184275045540', 'Boys Will Be Boys', 1935, 'Comedy', 'William Beaudine, Charles Van Enger', 'Will Hay, Robert Edmunds', 'Will Hay, Gordon Harker, Jimmy Hanley, Davy Burnaby, Norma Varden, Claude Dampier, Charles Farrell, Clive Dunn', null, 'Alec Smart, who is engaged teaching in a prison, applies for the job of headmaster at a nearby public school to replace the previous headmaster who has been convicted of writing forged cheques and has just been sent to prison. Smart appeals to the Governor to write him a good reference which he pretends to. Afterwards he writes his real recommendation which is very negative about Smart''s talents. The trustee who works as the Governor''s secretary, Faker Brown, "accidentally" gets the two letters mixed up and delivers the one praising Smart. On the basis of the letter, Lady Dorking, the who runs the Board of Governors appoints Smart to the job. This angers her deputy, Colonel Crableigh, who had favoured promoting his nephew, the Deputy head.', 'Alec Smart, who is engaged teaching in a prison, applies for the job of headmaster at a nearby public school to replace the previous headmaster who has been convicted of writing forged cheques and has just been sent to prison. Smart appeals to the Governor to write him a good reference which he pretends to. Afterwards he writes his real recommendation which is very negative about Smart''s talents. The trustee who works as the Governor''s secretary, Faker Brown, "accidentally" gets the two letters mixed up and delivers the one praising Smart. On the basis of the letter, Lady Dorking, the who runs the Board of Governors appoints Smart to the job. This angers her deputy, Colonel Crableigh, who had favoured promoting his nephew, the Deputy head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA1LSdyulj1aioWX1Lxm0OJRlGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110468'),
  ('727471945205649004', 'Boys Will Be Boys', 1976, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Věra Plívová-Šimková, Emil Sirotek, Drahomíra Králová', 'Jan Procházka', 'Michael Dymek, Petr Voříšek, Petr Starý, Magdalena Reifová, Jitka Chalupníková, David Vlček, Bohumil Luxík, Iva Janžurová', null, 'Three friends - Tomás, Hubert and Jozka - are boys growing up in a little town. Tomás lives with his aunt Apolena and uncle Václav. Tomás is a boy with lots of ideas that often end up getting him into trouble not only with his teachers and aunt, but with the other inhabitants of the town as well. He has a crush on his schoolmate Blanka and for her sake he decides to try to get the prize for the best pupil in the school.', 'Three friends - Tomás, Hubert and Jozka - are boys growing up in a little town. Tomás lives with his aunt Apolena and uncle Václav. Tomás is a boy with lots of ideas that often end up getting him into trouble not only with his teachers and aunt, but with the other inhabitants of the town as well. He has a crush on his schoolmate Blanka and for her sake he decides to try to get the prize for the best pupil in the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4S1YBBA8XPpgmBcol7iCjErhboc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67957'),
  ('88194103551464510', 'Boys'' Night Out', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur E. Arling, Michael Gordon', 'Ira Wallach', 'Kim Novak, James Garner, Tony Randall, Howard Duff, Janet Blair, Patti Page, Jessie Royce Landis, Oskar Homolka', 'NR', 'Fred, George, Doug and Howie are quickly reaching middle-age. Three of them are married, only Fred is still a bachelor. They want something different than their ordinary marriages, children and TV-dinners. In secret, they get themselves an apartment with a beautiful young woman, Kathy, for romantic rendezvous. But Kathy does not tell them that she is a sociology student researching the sexual life of the white middle-class male.', 'Fred, George, Doug and Howie are quickly reaching middle-age. Three of them are married, only Fred is still a bachelor. They want something different than their ordinary marriages, children and TV-dinners. In secret, they get themselves an apartment with a beautiful young woman, Kathy, for romantic rendezvous. But Kathy does not tell them that she is a sociology student researching the sexual life of the white middle-class male.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TBuWjbgXxR52cEwYEQpEAqeDVR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35057'),
  ('210381833307863570', 'Boys'' School', 1938, 'Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Christian-Jaque, Jacques Hawadier', 'Jean-Henri Blanchon, Jacques Prévert', 'Erich von Stroheim, Michel Simon, Armand Bernard, Serge Grave, Marcel Mouloudji, Robert Le Vigan, Aimé Clariond, Jean Claudio', null, 'In a college, three friends form a secret society. Their objective - going to America. One night, after one of their secret meetings, one of them sees a man coming out from a wall. The next day, after he talks about it, he disappears. Then, the second one vanishes. Are they gone to their dreams? That''s when the art teacher is murdered. Suspicions now are too high so the third one decides to investigate.', 'In a college, three friends form a secret society. Their objective - going to America. One night, after one of their secret meetings, one of them sees a man coming out from a wall. The next day, after he talks about it, he disappears. Then, the second one vanishes. Are they gone to their dreams? That''s when the art teacher is murdered. Suspicions now are too high so the third one decides to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRtX2gRTIT860yd2V0O91sEZ4nS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64442'),
  ('964979905491683943', 'Boystown', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Juan Flahn, Javier Arriaga, Hector Figueredo', 'Félix Sabroso', 'Pepón Nieto, Pablo Puyol, Concha Velasco, Rosa María Sardà, Carlos Fuentes, Edu Soto, Mariola Fuentes, Joan Crosas', null, 'Victor works in a real estate agency in the well-known Chueca neighborhood of Madrid. He hides a terrible secret: he makes apartments available for sale by murdering the old ladies owners that live in them. Then, refurbishes and decorates the apartments to sell them to gay couples with high purchasing power. His ultimate objective is to transform Chueca into a kind of London Soho area.', 'Victor works in a real estate agency in the well-known Chueca neighborhood of Madrid. He hides a terrible secret: he makes apartments available for sale by murdering the old ladies owners that live in them. Then, refurbishes and decorates the apartments to sell them to gay couples with high purchasing power. His ultimate objective is to transform Chueca into a kind of London Soho area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh16oUUBsk6AcEK7MF75qfDgN2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26641'),
  ('336910687926578600', 'Boyz n the Hood', 1991, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Singleton, Charles Mills', 'John Singleton', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Laurence Fishburne, Ice Cube, Morris Chestnut, Angela Bassett, Nia Long, Tyra Ferrell, Regina King', 'R', 'In the middle of the Los Angeles ghetto, drugs, robberies and shootings dominate everyday life. During these times, Furious tries to raise his son Tre to be a decent person. Tre''s friends, on the other hand, have little regard for the law and drag the entire neighborhood into a street war...', 'In the middle of the Los Angeles ghetto, drugs, robberies and shootings dominate everyday life. During these times, Furious tries to raise his son Tre to be a decent person. Tre''s friends, on the other hand, have little regard for the law and drag the entire neighborhood into a street war...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4ox4aSCNT5vyLXl4Q71JiWwCXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650'),
  ('942476272577978982', 'Brácula: Condemor II', 1997, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Álvaro Sáenz de Heredia, Tomás Mas', 'Andrés Sáenz de Heredia, Álvaro Sáenz de Heredia', 'Chiquito de la Calzada, Bigote Arrocet, Nadiuska, Javivi, Carla Hidalgo, Rubén Gálvez, Héctor Cantolla, Aramis Ney', null, 'After their adventures in Aquí llega Condemor (el Pecador de la Pradera) (1996), Condemor and Lucas take a ship to Europe, but it sinks, and they save themselves from being drowned by climbing on a coffin. Floating on it, they arrive on the shore, where a group of spooky, ghostly characters mistake Condemor for Count Dracula, whose arrival they have been expecting for 200 years.', 'After their adventures in Aquí llega Condemor (el Pecador de la Pradera) (1996), Condemor and Lucas take a ship to Europe, but it sinks, and they save themselves from being drowned by climbing on a coffin. Floating on it, they arrive on the shore, where a group of spooky, ghostly characters mistake Condemor for Count Dracula, whose arrival they have been expecting for 200 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZUFrPC8jnEnbFDBAwrdiyTs04G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166206'),
  ('567902660246206803', 'Brad Pitt: More Than a Pretty Face', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Adrien Dénouette, Thibaut Sève', 'Adrien Dénouette', 'Brad Pitt, Sarah-Jane Sauvegrain', null, 'Brad Pitt is a singular actor in Hollywood''s glamorous world, breaking through his "playboy image" and embodying American cinema''s renewal. At the beginning there was a humble Midwestern aware of being a smokescreen for the illusions of his time, who has managed to keep control of his image to better serve the most talented directors of our time. To name but a few: David Fincher, Quentin Tarantino, the Coen brothers, Terrence Malick, James Gray and soon Damien Chazelle. This documentary dives into the brain of a complex, brilliant and endearing personality, far from the cliché of a world-famous movie icon to discover the hidden side of the most handsome man in the world.', 'Brad Pitt is a singular actor in Hollywood''s glamorous world, breaking through his "playboy image" and embodying American cinema''s renewal. At the beginning there was a humble Midwestern aware of being a smokescreen for the illusions of his time, who has managed to keep control of his image to better serve the most talented directors of our time. To name but a few: David Fincher, Quentin Tarantino, the Coen brothers, Terrence Malick, James Gray and soon Damien Chazelle. This documentary dives into the brain of a complex, brilliant and endearing personality, far from the cliché of a world-famous movie icon to discover the hidden side of the most handsome man in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euK4kW6tkeDdVFTFeDpIgYffLYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033548'),
  ('572429971420276493', 'Brad''s Status', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mike White, Buck Deachman, Lisa Diallo', 'Mike White', 'Ben Stiller, Austin Abrams, Jenna Fischer, Michael Sheen, Jemaine Clement, Luke Wilson, Shazi Raja, Luisa Lee', 'R', 'Although Brad has a satisfying career, a sweet wife and a comfortable life in suburban Sacramento, things aren''t quite what he imagined during his college glory days. When he accompanies his musical prodigy son on a university tour, he can''t help comparing his life with those of his four best college friends who seemingly have more wealthy and glamorous lives. But when circumstances force him to reconnect with his former friends, Brad begins to question whether he has really failed or if their lives are actually more flawed than they appear.', 'Although Brad has a satisfying career, a sweet wife and a comfortable life in suburban Sacramento, things aren''t quite what he imagined during his college glory days. When he accompanies his musical prodigy son on a university tour, he can''t help comparing his life with those of his four best college friends who seemingly have more wealthy and glamorous lives. But when circumstances force him to reconnect with his former friends, Brad begins to question whether he has really failed or if their lives are actually more flawed than they appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXiNpvig7EMq18VyNBUTlWrmN0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425980'),
  ('502374271098817272', 'Braddock: Missing in Action III', 1988, 'Action, War, Adventure', 'Aaron Norris, João Fernandes', 'Chuck Norris, James Bruner', 'Chuck Norris, Aki Aleong, Yehuda Efroni, Floyd Levine, Jack Rader, Keith David, Jeff Habberstad, BJ Davis', 'R', 'When Colonel James Braddock is told that his Asian wife and 12-year-old son are still alive in Communist Vietnam, he mounts a one-man assault to free them. Armed with the latest high-tech firepower, Braddock fights his way into the heart of the country and ends up battling his way out with several dozen abused Amerasian children in tow! Struggling to keep them alive while outmaneuvering a sadistic Vietnamese officer, Braddock ignites the jungle in a blazing cross-country race for freedom.', 'When Colonel James Braddock is told that his Asian wife and 12-year-old son are still alive in Communist Vietnam, he mounts a one-man assault to free them. Armed with the latest high-tech firepower, Braddock fights his way into the heart of the country and ends up battling his way out with several dozen abused Amerasian children in tow! Struggling to keep them alive while outmaneuvering a sadistic Vietnamese officer, Braddock ignites the jungle in a blazing cross-country race for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8Gp0TAQr8Z2Cy4ROSYzvOiMEMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27352'),
  ('405910652026451069', 'Brado', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ciro Scognamiglio, Matteo Cocco, Giuseppe Barletta', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Saul Nanni, Kim Rossi Stuart, Barbora Bobuľová, Viola Sofia Betti, Federica Pocaterra, Alma Noce, Paola Lavini, Ivan Bacchi', null, 'On a ranch surrounded by nature, a man broken by life spends his days taming wild horses, the only creatures he could ever relate to. When he hears that his dad is embarking on yet another dangerous endeavor, his son Tommaso comes back home to try and dissuade him. It is a chance for them to bond again and to face the resentment that has long been keeping them apart. Day by day, father and son will learn to face each other to heal from their pain and walk together on the steep path to forgiveness.', 'On a ranch surrounded by nature, a man broken by life spends his days taming wild horses, the only creatures he could ever relate to. When he hears that his dad is embarking on yet another dangerous endeavor, his son Tommaso comes back home to try and dissuade him. It is a chance for them to bond again and to face the resentment that has long been keeping them apart. Day by day, father and son will learn to face each other to heal from their pain and walk together on the steep path to forgiveness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ikaEuDkjnpGjbZj2GJCgU15xPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:770719'),
  ('716738610999854915', 'Brady Bunch Home Movies', 1995, 'Family', 'Daniel Helfgott', 'Daniel Helfgott', 'Florence Henderson, Christopher Knight, Mike Lookinland, Barry Williams, Eve Plumb, Susan Olsen, Maureen McCormick, Robert Reed', 'G', 'The Brady Bunch Home Movies was aired on CBS, May 24, 1995. It is hosted by several former cast members and is a collection of clips from Super 8 camera''s as well as selections from the television show. Each cast member of the ''Brady Bunch'' received a camera from Robert Reed and some of the footage is of their trips abroad.', 'The Brady Bunch Home Movies was aired on CBS, May 24, 1995. It is hosted by several former cast members and is a collection of clips from Super 8 camera''s as well as selections from the television show. Each cast member of the ''Brady Bunch'' received a camera from Robert Reed and some of the footage is of their trips abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Gf3DMRHeU2qMToO9V6Nc3Vk5gZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526960'),
  ('345808323932572294', 'Brahmachari', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bhappi Sonie, Taru Dutt', 'Sachin Bhowmick', 'Shammi Kapoor, Rajshree, Pran Sikand, Mumtaz Askari, Dhumal, Mohan Choti, Manmohan, Jagdeep', null, 'Abandoned as a child, Brahmachari lives in a mortgaged house with twelve young orphans. He saves a woman from dying, and she changes his life forever. But first she has to deal with her own affairs.', 'Abandoned as a child, Brahmachari lives in a mortgaged house with twelve young orphans. He saves a woman from dying, and she changes his life forever. But first she has to deal with her own affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pggTSNGOfY0gVKCfLAb163QJ6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110846'),
  ('472148391007202988', 'Brahmāstra Part One: Shiva', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Sudeep Chatterjee, Niharika Bijli, Vikash Nowlakha', 'Ayan Mukerji', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Alia Bhatt, Mouni Roy, Amitabh Bachchan, Nagarjuna Akkineni, Shah Rukh Khan, Dimple Kapadia, Saurav Gurjar', 'PG-13', 'The story of Shiva – a young man on the brink of an epic love, with a girl named Isha. But their world is turned upside down when Shiva learns that he has a mysterious connection to the Brahmāstra... and a great power within him that he doesn’t understand just yet - the power of Fire.', 'The story of Shiva – a young man on the brink of an epic love, with a girl named Isha. But their world is turned upside down when Shiva learns that he has a mysterious connection to the Brahmāstra... and a great power within him that he doesn’t understand just yet - the power of Fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x61qdvHIsr9U53FwoLVDQqAGur0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496331'),
