  ('1047255974674842785', 'Brain Dead', 1990, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Adam Simon, Rohn Schmidt, Philippe Browning', 'Adam Simon, Charles Beaumont', 'Bill Pullman, Bill Paxton, Bud Cort, Nicholas Pryor, Patricia Charbonneau, George Kennedy, Brian Brophy, David Sinaiko', 'R', 'In a battle of man versus machine, Martin, a top neurosurgeon who''s studying brain malfunctions that cause mental illness, delves deep into his own mind to save himself from a megalomaniacal corporation.', 'In a battle of man versus machine, Martin, a top neurosurgeon who''s studying brain malfunctions that cause mental illness, delves deep into his own mind to save himself from a megalomaniacal corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaoGvqROCuJTKKKRUze8ZUSlzba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5898'),
  ('778982175956335046', 'Brain Dead', 2007, 'Horror', 'Kevin Tenney, Patrick McGowan, Alex Simon', 'Dale Gelineau', 'Joshua Benton, Sarah Grant Brendecke, Michelle Tomlinson, David Crane, Andy Forrest, Cristina Tiberia, Tess McVicker, Greg Lewolt', 'NR', 'A sleepy fishing port town is consumed with terror when a small crater crash-lands nearby and releases a slimy parasitic agent that transforms the residents into brain-eating zombies. Cornered in an abandoned fishing lodge, six strangers are forced to band together to stave off the blood-sucking monsters clawing the walls outside.', 'A sleepy fishing port town is consumed with terror when a small crater crash-lands nearby and releases a slimy parasitic agent that transforms the residents into brain-eating zombies. Cornered in an abandoned fishing lodge, six strangers are forced to band together to stave off the blood-sucking monsters clawing the walls outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqur2OKhF31Xirjb95NYvljx9Qm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29833'),
  ('206883134063393136', 'Brain Donors', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Dennis Dugan, David M. Walsh', 'Pat Proft', 'Mel Smith, Bob Nelson, John Turturro, Teri Copley, George De La Pena, John Savident, Spike Alexander, Juliana Donald', 'PG', 'Three manic idiots—a lawyer, a cab driver and a handyman—team up to run a ballet company to fulfil the will of a millionaire. Stooge-like antics result as the trio try to outwit the rich widow and her scheming big-shot lawyer, who also wants to run the ballet.', 'Three manic idiots—a lawyer, a cab driver and a handyman—team up to run a ballet company to fulfil the will of a millionaire. Stooge-like antics result as the trio try to outwit the rich widow and her scheming big-shot lawyer, who also wants to run the ballet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r928uiKrN1mvPrqyHy2djLUBlAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32450'),
  ('1093897106646247701', 'Brain Drain', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fernando González Molina, Patricia Nieto, Sergio Delgado', 'Curro Velázquez, Álex Pina', 'Mario Casas, Alberto Amarilla, Amaia Salamanca, Canco Rodríguez, Gorka Lasaosa, Pablo Penedo, Blanca Suárez, Sarah Mühlhause', null, 'Emilio, a shy, not too brilliant pupil at a humble local secondary school, has always harboured a secret love for Natalia, the cutest, brightest girl in the class. On the last day of the school year, when he finally decides to declare his love, Natalia is awarded a scholarship to study Medicine at Oxford. It would seem that all is lost for Emilio, but his drop-out school-pals are not ready to throw in the towel. After faking qualifications and scholarships, this band of brainless nuts land in Oxford, causing havoc in the normally peaceful campus existence.', 'Emilio, a shy, not too brilliant pupil at a humble local secondary school, has always harboured a secret love for Natalia, the cutest, brightest girl in the class. On the last day of the school year, when he finally decides to declare his love, Natalia is awarded a scholarship to study Medicine at Oxford. It would seem that all is lost for Emilio, but his drop-out school-pals are not ready to throw in the towel. After faking qualifications and scholarships, this band of brainless nuts land in Oxford, causing havoc in the normally peaceful campus existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7PmqkLlk9pUJaNeBLedvAdFUgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18120'),
  ('766072819393620016', 'Brain Drain', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Paolo Ruffini, Stéfano Ruggeri, Federico Masiero', 'Curro Velázquez, Álex Pina', 'Paolo Ruffini, Frank Matano, Guglielmo Scilla, Luca Peracino, Andrea Pisani, Olga Kent, Rosalia Porcaro, Biagio Izzo', null, 'Five friends forge their resumes and enroll to Oxford in orders to help one of them end up with the girl he''s in love with.', 'Five friends forge their resumes and enroll to Oxford in orders to help one of them end up with the girl he''s in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfZXag3DkaHfakSrojG92C2R2Gy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238930'),
  ('225672747178428239', 'Brain Drain 2', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Carlos Therón', 'Curro Velázquez, Álex Pina', 'Adrián Lastra, Patricia Montero, Gorka Lasaosa, Alberto Amarilla, Canco Rodríguez, Loles León, El Langui, Mariano Peña', null, 'Alfonso, pursues the girl of his life to Harvard, determined to conquer her under the same friends and outlandish plans that his brother used in Oxford. But when you least expect it appears Martha, the girl he fell in love while at school.', 'Alfonso, pursues the girl of his life to Harvard, determined to conquer her under the same friends and outlandish plans that his brother used in Oxford. But when you least expect it appears Martha, the girl he fell in love while at school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMjGY0PZwHMWUfUreNBhdP1Lp6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80105'),
  ('37152179151756654', 'Brain Freeze', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Julien Knafo, Marc Simpson-Threlford', 'Jean Barbe, Julien Knafo', 'Roy Dupuis, Iani Bédard, Claire Ledru, Léonie Ledru, Marianne Fortier, Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Claudia Ferri, Mylène Mackay', null, 'A fertilizer used in a rich gated community becomes the source of a genetic mutation that transforms its residents into zombies. Can a teenager and his baby sister break free from the quarantined island before turning into grass?', 'A fertilizer used in a rich gated community becomes the source of a genetic mutation that transforms its residents into zombies. Can a teenager and his baby sister break free from the quarantined island before turning into grass?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zd7pCt02fHpbJjjU060iNVy4p83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672437'),
  ('524530673692820849', 'Brain of Blood', 1971, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Louis Horvath, Al Adamson', 'Joe Van Rodgers', 'Grant Williams, Kent Taylor, Regina Carrol, Vicki Volante, Angelo Rossitto, Reed Hadley, Zandor Vorkov, Richard Smedley', null, 'Amir, the benevolent ruler of Kalid, is dying, but there is hope. Freshly deceased, he is flown to the United States where Dr. Trenton transplants his brain into the body of a simpleton in a classic "assistant got the wrong kind of body" plot line. Dr. Trenton has a few nefarious plot twists of his own in mind, and then there''s the thing with the dwarf and the women chained in the basement. It''s up to Amir''s friend Bob and wife Tracey to try and salvage this tale.', 'Amir, the benevolent ruler of Kalid, is dying, but there is hope. Freshly deceased, he is flown to the United States where Dr. Trenton transplants his brain into the body of a simpleton in a classic "assistant got the wrong kind of body" plot line. Dr. Trenton has a few nefarious plot twists of his own in mind, and then there''s the thing with the dwarf and the women chained in the basement. It''s up to Amir''s friend Bob and wife Tracey to try and salvage this tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE0ozCS7qlPBOAKRRAxaU55L4K0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42477'),
  ('636461882027984633', 'Brain on Fire', 2017, 'Drama', 'Gerard Barrett, Yaron Orbach', 'Gerard Barrett', 'Chloë Grace Moretz, Thomas Mann, Richard Armitage, Carrie-Anne Moss, Jenny Slate, Tyler Perry, Alex Zahara, Jenn MacLean-Angus', 'PG-13', 'Susannah Cahalan, an up-and-coming journalist at the New York Post becomes plagued by voices in her head and seizures, causing a rapid descent into insanity.', 'Susannah Cahalan, an up-and-coming journalist at the New York Post becomes plagued by voices in her head and seizures, causing a rapid descent into insanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEwI53HNDO0ajSUWh4HSsGrlF6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340027'),
  ('594950357495753784', 'Brain Sex', 1988, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Hisayasu Satō, Kōichi Saitō, Tadami Ohara', 'Shirō Yumeno', 'Marino Fujisawa, Simon Kumai, Kazuhiro Sano, Kiyomi Itō, Taketoshi Watari, Saori Yoshimura, Yuka Minamizaki, Reika Kazami', null, 'A teenage couple drive around improvising radio shows, following night stalkers and rapists or peeping on various sexual escapades, describing what they see in detail, feigning shock and screams as the attackers become more violent.', 'A teenage couple drive around improvising radio shows, following night stalkers and rapists or peeping on various sexual escapades, describing what they see in detail, feigning shock and screams as the attackers become more violent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RSSE0cz76XyR5gJITxNGGmRE2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264467'),
  ('569170373491432955', 'Brain Smasher... A Love Story', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Albert Pyun, Mark Cotone, Laura Nisbet Peters', 'Albert Pyun', 'Andrew Dice Clay, Teri Hatcher, Yuji Okumoto, Deborah Van Valkenburgh, Brion James, Tim Thomerson, Charles Rocket, Nicholas Guest', null, 'A professional model, Sam Crain, is asked by her sister to smuggle a package from Europe to Portland Oregon, where she discovers that her sister is battling Chinese Shaolin Monks (not ninjas!). Fleeing the monks, Sam unwittingly involves Ed "Brainsmasher" Molloy, a nightclub bouncer.', 'A professional model, Sam Crain, is asked by her sister to smuggle a package from Europe to Portland Oregon, where she discovers that her sister is battling Chinese Shaolin Monks (not ninjas!). Fleeing the monks, Sam unwittingly involves Ed "Brainsmasher" Molloy, a nightclub bouncer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKafo8AqHsFi42uAmRUn334HQn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25706'),
  ('419071948946980946', 'Brain Twisters', 1991, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Tomasz Magierski, Jerry Sangiuliano', 'Jerry Sangiuliano', 'Farrah Forke, Terry Londeree, Joe Lombardo, Donna Bostany, Elle Thompson, Shura McComb, Heather Ann Barclay, Robert T. Hughes', null, 'Employees of a software company discover a conspiracy to use the games made by the company to control the thoughts of its customers.', 'Employees of a software company discover a conspiracy to use the games made by the company to control the thoughts of its customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BUucYCfyZWDnTxNt4vHHz78Fiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81425'),
  ('952487811492997416', 'Braindead', 1992, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Peter Jackson, Murray Milne', 'Fran Walsh, Peter Jackson, Stephen Sinclair', 'Timothy Balme, Diana Peñalver, Elizabeth Moody, Ian Watkin, Brenda Kendall, Stuart Devenie, Jed Brophy, Elizabeth Brimilcombe', 'R', 'When a Sumatran rat-monkey bites Lionel Cosgrove''s mother, she''s transformed into a zombie and begins killing (and transforming) the entire town while Lionel races to keep things under control.', 'When a Sumatran rat-monkey bites Lionel Cosgrove''s mother, she''s transformed into a zombie and begins killing (and transforming) the entire town while Lionel races to keep things under control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pa39D8TQs6aNw3hiUs4jLjHVUB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763'),
  ('914005794771293276', 'Brainscan', 1994, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Flynn, François Protat', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Edward Furlong, Frank Langella, T. Ryder Smith, Amy Hargreaves, Jamie Marsh, Victor Ertmanis, David Hemblen, Vlasta Vrana', 'R', 'A lonely teenage horror-movie fan discovers a mysterious computer game that uses hypnosis to custom-tailor the game into the most terrifying experience imaginable. When he emerges from the hypnotic trance he is horrified to find evidence that the brutal murder depicted in the game actually happened -- and he''s the killer.', 'A lonely teenage horror-movie fan discovers a mysterious computer game that uses hypnosis to custom-tailor the game into the most terrifying experience imaginable. When he emerges from the hypnotic trance he is horrified to find evidence that the brutal murder depicted in the game actually happened -- and he''s the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JqamPZC7W5rzRNweMGhqltcsIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14237'),
  ('946118251006314906', 'Brainstorm', 1965, 'Thriller', 'Sam Leavitt, William Conrad', 'Mann Rubin', 'Jeffrey Hunter, Anne Francis, Dana Andrews, Viveca Lindfors, Stacy Harris, Kathie Browne, Phillip Pine, Michael Pate', 'NR', 'Scientist Jim Grayam saves his boss'' wife from suicide but then falls in love with her.', 'Scientist Jim Grayam saves his boss'' wife from suicide but then falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6k80yVsymeT0Ap1xVdA4OweTdcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28497'),
  ('488959194114485510', 'Brainstorm', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Douglas Trumbull, Bob Jeffords, Eugene Mazzola', 'Philip Frank Messina, Robert Stitzel', 'Christopher Walken, Natalie Wood, Louise Fletcher, Cliff Robertson, Jordan Christopher, Donald Hotton, Alan Fudge, Joe Dorsey', 'PG', 'Two brilliant research scientists have invented a device capable of recording and playing back sensory experiences only to have devastating results when one of them records their own death.', 'Two brilliant research scientists have invented a device capable of recording and playing back sensory experiences only to have devastating results when one of them records their own death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afiRgLXIfH12NemvtthCkrwNtAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15050'),
  ('838033393043883180', 'Brainstorm', 2001, 'Drama', 'Laís Bodanzky, Inez Mulin', 'Luiz Bolognesi', 'Rodrigo Santoro, Othon Bastos, Cássia Kis, Dani Nefussi, Jairo Mattos, Altair Lima, Lineu Dias, Caco Ciocler', null, 'Neto is a middle class teenager living a normal life. After his father finds a marijuana cigarette on his pocket, he is sent to a mental institution, where he gets to know a completely absurd and inhumane reality in which people are devoured by a corrupt and cruel system.', 'Neto is a middle class teenager living a normal life. After his father finds a marijuana cigarette on his pocket, he is sent to a mental institution, where he gets to know a completely absurd and inhumane reality in which people are devoured by a corrupt and cruel system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6NXI2jvi9iKbzjjHRMtZ7mCPjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53961'),
  ('156102366074969892', 'Brainwashed', 1960, 'Drama', 'Gerd Oswald, Günther Senftleben, Wolfgang Bellenbaum', 'Gerd Oswald, Harold Medford, Herbert Reinecker', 'Curd Jürgens, Claire Bloom, Hansjörg Felmy, Mario Adorf, Hans Söhnker, Rudolf Forster, Jan Hendriks, Albert Lieven', null, 'Werner von Basil, a Austrian intellectual, was captured by the Nazis in 1938. They want to break him to confess smuggling. Without any mental sustenance, the only thing left to keep his mind busy is an old tactics book for chess.', 'Werner von Basil, a Austrian intellectual, was captured by the Nazis in 1938. They want to break him to confess smuggling. Without any mental sustenance, the only thing left to keep his mind busy is an old tactics book for chess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrBNANYBy8S60hJ24Ml6BjIXU8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153694'),
  ('1145862485989836908', 'Brainwashed: Sex-Camera-Power', 2022, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', 'Nina Menkes, Shana Hagan', null, 'Nina Menkes, Rosanna Arquette, Penelope Spheeris, Catherine Hardwicke, Julie Dash, Sheila Frazier, Joey Soloway, Eliza Hittman', null, 'Investigates the politics of cinematic shot design, and how this meta-level of filmmaking intersects with the twin epidemics of sexual abuse/assault and employment discrimination against women, with over 80 movie clips from 1896 - 2020.', 'Investigates the politics of cinematic shot design, and how this meta-level of filmmaking intersects with the twin epidemics of sexual abuse/assault and employment discrimination against women, with over 80 movie clips from 1896 - 2020.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqklSVRTxlC92VnhXyCPCVEnAzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:817127'),
  ('259875271519724717', 'BrainWaves', 1983, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ulli Lommel, Bruce Pearn, Jon Kranhouse', 'Ulli Lommel', 'Keir Dullea, Suzanna Love, Vera Miles, Tony Curtis, Ryan Seitz, Percy Rodriguez, Paul Willson, Eve Brent', 'R', 'After a traffic accident Kaylie is in coma for months and her doctors want to try a new procedure on her. To regain her consciousness, they stimulate her brain with the neural patterns of a woman who has just died. It works and Kaylie fully recovers. However, she begins to relive the dying moments of her donor and realizes that she was murdered! Along with her husband and mother, she tries to find out what happened.', 'After a traffic accident Kaylie is in coma for months and her doctors want to try a new procedure on her. To regain her consciousness, they stimulate her brain with the neural patterns of a woman who has just died. It works and Kaylie fully recovers. However, she begins to relive the dying moments of her donor and realizes that she was murdered! Along with her husband and mother, she tries to find out what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDziaXX0iU2L2KG6OESxuEfczyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91609'),
  ('332903237563532036', 'Brake', 2012, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Gabe Torres, James Mathers, Jon Recher', 'Timothy Mannion', 'Stephen Dorff, Chyler Leigh, JR Bourne, Tom Berenger, Kali Rocha, Kent Shocknek, Jaylen Moore, Stephen J. Bridgewater', 'R', 'A Secret Service Agent is held captive in the trunk of a car and endures high-speed mental and physical torture as terrorists attempt to extract needed information for their sinister plot.', 'A Secret Service Agent is held captive in the trunk of a car and endures high-speed mental and physical torture as terrorists attempt to extract needed information for their sinister plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKDoK8hUt8fGGXKpvAnt3AQVUvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85414'),
  ('602771383889317915', 'Bram Stoker''s Dracula', 1992, 'Romance, Horror', 'Roman Coppola, Peter Giuliano, Kate Davey', 'James V. Hart', 'Gary Oldman, Winona Ryder, Anthony Hopkins, Keanu Reeves, Sadie Frost, Cary Elwes, Richard E. Grant, Billy Campbell', 'R', 'Count Dracula, a 15th-century prince, is condemned to live off the blood of the living for eternity. Young lawyer Jonathan Harker is sent to Dracula''s castle to finalise a land deal, but when the Count sees a photo of Harker''s fiancée, Mina, the spitting image of his dead wife, he imprisons him and sets off for London to track her down.', 'Count Dracula, a 15th-century prince, is condemned to live off the blood of the living for eternity. Young lawyer Jonathan Harker is sent to Dracula''s castle to finalise a land deal, but when the Count sees a photo of Harker''s fiancée, Mina, the spitting image of his dead wife, he imprisons him and sets off for London to track her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSxCIZXudp5q8wQO8VERGX8hRAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6114'),
  ('1142937887731964981', 'Bram Stoker''s Van Helsing', 2021, 'Horror', 'Steve Lawson', 'Steve Lawson', 'Mark Topping, Charlie Bond, Tom Hendryk, Joe Street, Helen Crevel, Demi Savva', null, 'England, 1897. Abraham Van Helsing receives a letter from his former student Dr John Seward requesting his urgent assistance in the northern town of Whitby, where his fiancée Lucy is showing all the signs of vampirism. Van Helsing follows the bloody trail to the coffin of Count Dracula himself. Van Helsing is a fresh take on the legend of Dracula through the eyes of his greatest enemy.', 'England, 1897. Abraham Van Helsing receives a letter from his former student Dr John Seward requesting his urgent assistance in the northern town of Whitby, where his fiancée Lucy is showing all the signs of vampirism. Van Helsing follows the bloody trail to the coffin of Count Dracula himself. Van Helsing is a fresh take on the legend of Dracula through the eyes of his greatest enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lO5m60w5C6xLdg4hA7ecDRjSvO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:789413'),
  ('948323501179715694', 'Bramadero', 2007, 'Romance', 'Julián Hernández, Ernesto Martínez Arévalo, Julio Quezada Orozco', 'Julián Hernández', 'Cristhian Rodríguez, Sergio Almazán', null, 'The beautiful and erotic Bramadero finds Hassen and Jonás on the outskirts of Mexico City. Away from it all, they’ve found a spot where they can seduce one another and merge into one; where sex becomes desire, desire becomes love, and only death will separate them.', 'The beautiful and erotic Bramadero finds Hassen and Jonás on the outskirts of Mexico City. Away from it all, they’ve found a spot where they can seduce one another and merge into one; where sex becomes desire, desire becomes love, and only death will separate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9NR05lh2x0C37BX9vTTG9t1rGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113407'),
  ('313223936954549563', 'Bramayugam', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Rahul Sadasivan, Shehnad Jalal, Ajith Somanadh', 'Rahul Sadasivan', 'Arjun Ashokan, Mammootty, Sidharth Bharathan, Manikandan Achari, Amalda Liz, Aluva Sheeba Sebastian, Akash Chandran, Rafnas Rafeek', null, 'A folk singer in 17th-century Kerala discovers a mansion. Inside, he encounters an enigmatic cook and a powerful master, setting in motion a chain of events that changes his life.', 'A folk singer in 17th-century Kerala discovers a mansion. Inside, he encounters an enigmatic cook and a powerful master, setting in motion a chain of events that changes his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snQLwRrfQAl5YFKVefZq9Lbscki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1166133'),
  ('187201870119153686', 'Bran Nue Dae', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael McDermot, Rachel Perkins, Andrew Lesnie', 'Rachel Perkins, Reg Cribb, Jimmy Chi', 'Rocky McKenzie, Geoffrey Rush, Jessica Mauboy, Ernie Dingo, Missy Higgins, Tom Budge, Deborah Mailman, Dan Sultan', 'PG-13', 'In the Summer of 1965 a young man is filled with the life of the idyllic old pearling port Broome - fishing, hanging out with his mates and his girl. However his mother returns him to the religious mission for further schooling. After being punished for an act of youthful rebellion, he runs away from the mission on a journey that ultimately leads him back home.', 'In the Summer of 1965 a young man is filled with the life of the idyllic old pearling port Broome - fishing, hanging out with his mates and his girl. However his mother returns him to the religious mission for further schooling. After being punished for an act of youthful rebellion, he runs away from the mission on a journey that ultimately leads him back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tB7mr0OqHsgATo58PAtSNJpaP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38415'),
  ('675693887544823848', 'Brancaleone at the Crusades', 1970, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Mario Monicelli, Aldo Tonti, Mario Forges Davanzati', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Mario Monicelli', 'Vittorio Gassman, Adolfo Celi, Sandro Dori, Beba Lončar, Gigi Proietti, Gianrico Tedeschi, Paolo Villaggio, Lino Toffolo', null, 'After saving an infant of royal blood, knight Brancaleone forms a new army and sets out to return the baby to his father: a prince fighting in the Crusades.', 'After saving an infant of royal blood, knight Brancaleone forms a new army and sets out to return the baby to his father: a prince fighting in the Crusades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iML7nTQ7uZTaZQlkZwdNcCLLm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49321'),
  ('451581453027409858', 'Brand Upon the Brain!', 2007, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Guy Maddin, Noel Paul, Apryl Richards', 'Guy Maddin, Louis Negin, George Toles', 'Isabella Rossellini, Erik Steffen Maahs, Sullivan Brown, Gretchen Krich, Maya Lawson, Jake Morgan-Scharhon, Andrew Loviska, Kellan Larson', 'NR', 'After returning home to his long-estranged mother upon a request from her deathbed, a man raised by his parents in an orphanage has to confront the childhood memories that have long haunted him.', 'After returning home to his long-estranged mother upon a request from her deathbed, a man raised by his parents in an orphanage has to confront the childhood memories that have long haunted him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCnZaP8QUUYrqoMoE9JOkvUOvQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27359'),
  ('180921613103865218', 'Branded', 1950, 'Western', 'Rudolph Maté, Charles Lang, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Sydney Boehm, Cyril Hume', 'Alan Ladd, Mona Freeman, Charles Bickford, Robert Keith, Joseph Calleia, Peter Hansen, Selena Royle, Tom Tully', 'NR', 'A gunfighter takes part in a scheme to bilk a wealthy cattle family out of half a million dollars by pretending to be their son, who was kidnapped as child.', 'A gunfighter takes part in a scheme to bilk a wealthy cattle family out of half a million dollars by pretending to be their son, who was kidnapped as child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e84Md7wUVzpOHaAPt02i2yUc061.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160783'),
  ('660719637770907310', 'Branded', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Aleksandr Dulerayn, Jamie Bradshaw, Rogier Stoffers', 'Jamie Bradshaw, Aleksandr Dulerayn', 'Ed Stoppard, Leelee Sobieski, Max von Sydow, Jeffrey Tambor, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Anna Abonisimova, Andrey Kaykov, Atanas Srebrev', 'R', 'In a dystopian future, where corporate brands have created a disillusioned population, one man''s effort to unlock the truth behind the conspiracy leads to an epic battle with hidden forces that control the world.', 'In a dystopian future, where corporate brands have created a disillusioned population, one man''s effort to unlock the truth behind the conspiracy leads to an epic battle with hidden forces that control the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YE4OfV1sHketYGy78AOCMI7j7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112090'),
  ('1110685060838640741', 'Branded to Kill', 1967, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Seijun Suzuki, Kazue Nagatsuka, Masami Kuzū', 'Seijun Suzuki, Seiichirō Yamaguchi, Chūsei Sone', 'Joe Shishido, Kōji Nanbara, Isao Tamagawa, Annu Mari, Mariko Ogawa, Hiroshi Minami, Hiroshi Chō, Atsushi Yamatoya', null, 'After botching his latest assignment, a third-ranked Japanese hit man becomes the target of another assassin.', 'After botching his latest assignment, a third-ranked Japanese hit man becomes the target of another assassin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asiSCq1SFrCV4gy7PJzw8c3m0yL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17905'),
  ('325956393449108222', 'Brannigan', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Douglas Hickox, Gerry Fisher, Ted Sturgis', 'Michael Butler, William P. McGivern, William W. Norton', 'John Wayne, Richard Attenborough, Judy Geeson, Mel Ferrer, John Vernon, Ralph Meeker, Barry Dennen, Lesley-Anne Down', 'PG', 'A hard-nosed Chicago cop is sent to London to bring back an American mobster being held for extradition. Brannigan in his Irish-American way brings American law to the people of Scotland Yard but has to contend with a stuffy old London first.', 'A hard-nosed Chicago cop is sent to London to bring back an American mobster being held for extradition. Brannigan in his Irish-American way brings American law to the people of Scotland Yard but has to contend with a stuffy old London first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1kLe6y8hiPEOH9DhZcX7c12IP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27396'),
  ('1144105545153273415', 'Bras de fer', 1985, 'Drama', 'Gérard Vergez', 'Gérard Vergez', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Christophe Malavoy, Ángela Molina, Mathieu Carrière, Pierre-Loup Rajot, François Lalande, Agnès Garreau, Thierry Ravel', null, 'Complex and more cerebral than a wartime action-thriller, this espionage drama focuses on the relationship of two former buddies who were fencing masters before the war and in love with the same woman. Now Delancourt (Bernard Giraudeau) is apparently living a good life managing a gym in a Paris hotel under Nazi control, where he meets his former friend Pierre (Christophe Malavoy), who is on a secret assignment to mislead the Nazis on the date of the Normandie invasion. Pierre, alias Augustin, cannot figure out if Delancourt is a real resistance fighter or if he is a double agent. Circumstances create a larger and larger gap between the former friends while the plot goes through several twists and turns before Pierre''s doubts are resolved.', 'Complex and more cerebral than a wartime action-thriller, this espionage drama focuses on the relationship of two former buddies who were fencing masters before the war and in love with the same woman. Now Delancourt (Bernard Giraudeau) is apparently living a good life managing a gym in a Paris hotel under Nazi control, where he meets his former friend Pierre (Christophe Malavoy), who is on a secret assignment to mislead the Nazis on the date of the Normandie invasion. Pierre, alias Augustin, cannot figure out if Delancourt is a real resistance fighter or if he is a double agent. Circumstances create a larger and larger gap between the former friends while the plot goes through several twists and turns before Pierre''s doubts are resolved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4e7bHsKBlCVw83D46cgF5qf3h2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267073'),
  ('1048215531794438153', 'Brasilia, Contradictions of a New City', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Affonso Beato, Jean-Claude Bernardet', 'Luís Saia, Jean-Claude Bernardet, Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Ferreira Gullar', null, 'In 1967, de Andrade was invited by the Italian company Olivetti to produce a documentary on the new Brazilian capital city of Brasília. Constructed during the latter half of the 1950s and founded in 1960, the city was part of an effort to populate Brazil’s vast interior region and was to be the embodiment of democratic urban planning, free from the class divisions and inequalities that characterize so many metropolises. Unsurprisingly, Brasília, Contradições de uma Cidade Nova (Brasília, Contradictions of a New City, 1968) revealed Brasília to be utopic only for the wealthy, replicating the same social problems present in every Brazilian city. (Senses of Cinema)', 'In 1967, de Andrade was invited by the Italian company Olivetti to produce a documentary on the new Brazilian capital city of Brasília. Constructed during the latter half of the 1950s and founded in 1960, the city was part of an effort to populate Brazil’s vast interior region and was to be the embodiment of democratic urban planning, free from the class divisions and inequalities that characterize so many metropolises. Unsurprisingly, Brasília, Contradições de uma Cidade Nova (Brasília, Contradictions of a New City, 1968) revealed Brasília to be utopic only for the wealthy, replicating the same social problems present in every Brazilian city. (Senses of Cinema)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8Zynm9ZTr3SonYRJStGOLyq1rn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258071'),
  ('504022630252836476', 'Brass Knuckle Boys', 2009, 'Comedy, Music', 'Kazushige Tanaka, Masaya Takahashi, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Koichi Sato, Yuichi Kimura, Tomorowo Taguchi, Hiroki Miyake, Ryo Katsuji, Yusuke Santamaria, Pierre Taki', null, 'A record company office worker named Kanna discovers a punk rock band called Shonen Meriken Sakku ''Brass Knuckle Boys'' through the internet and subsequently decides to represent them on behalf of her company. What Kanna did not know was that the Brass Knuckle Boys consists of all middle aged men.', 'A record company office worker named Kanna discovers a punk rock band called Shonen Meriken Sakku ''Brass Knuckle Boys'' through the internet and subsequently decides to represent them on behalf of her company. What Kanna did not know was that the Brass Knuckle Boys consists of all middle aged men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2y7qPShS71gl5AKLZQlc892Tq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28832'),
  ('925560790595115463', 'Brass Target', 1978, 'Action', 'John Hough, Tony Imi, Stefaan Schieder', 'Alvin Boretz', 'Sophia Loren, John Cassavetes, Max von Sydow, George Kennedy, Robert Vaughn, Patrick McGoohan, Bruce Davison, Edward Herrmann', 'PG', 'General George S. Patton died in a car accident in 1945. But was his death actually a murder. Is he targeted by Nazis angered by Germany''s defeat? Or by Russians who knew that Patton had argued in favor of invading the Soviet Union towards the end of the war? Or is it because Patton is investigating the theft of a quarter of a billion dollars of Nazi gold? Or is it because his subordinate Colonels - the flamboyantly gay Colonel and his worried lover are fearful that he is getting too close to discovering the truth.', 'General George S. Patton died in a car accident in 1945. But was his death actually a murder. Is he targeted by Nazis angered by Germany''s defeat? Or by Russians who knew that Patton had argued in favor of invading the Soviet Union towards the end of the war? Or is it because Patton is investigating the theft of a quarter of a billion dollars of Nazi gold? Or is it because his subordinate Colonels - the flamboyantly gay Colonel and his worried lover are fearful that he is getting too close to discovering the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhzqZFiJ0HF3aeSgIqufkpmAf1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72412'),
  ('367763032142633902', 'Brassed Off', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Mark Herman, Andy Collins', 'Mark Herman', 'Ewan McGregor, Tara Fitzgerald, Pete Postlethwaite, Jim Carter, Stephen Tompkinson, Philip Jackson, Sue Johnston, Peter Martin', 'R', 'A Yorkshire coal mine is threatened with closure and the only hope is for the men to enter their Grimley Colliery Brass Band into a national competition. They believe they have no hope until Gloria appears carrying her Flugelhorn. At first mocked for being a woman, she soon becomes the only chance for the band to win.', 'A Yorkshire coal mine is threatened with closure and the only hope is for the men to enter their Grimley Colliery Brass Band into a national competition. They believe they have no hope until Gloria appears carrying her Flugelhorn. At first mocked for being a woman, she soon becomes the only chance for the band to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qS2cZYWn2jlQs4Ej5O42LVIANQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9450'),
  ('453509990689411848', 'Brats', 1930, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, George Stevens', 'Oliver Hardy, James Parrott, Charley Rogers', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy', 'NR', 'Stanley and Oliver are trying to spend a relaxing night at home playing checkers, but the antics of their mischievous sons keep interrupting their recreation.', 'Stanley and Oliver are trying to spend a relaxing night at home playing checkers, but the antics of their mischievous sons keep interrupting their recreation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ap5coZMWR6dUQYZJGlEewXygFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50828'),
  ('320649417035258366', 'BRATS', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Andrew McCarthy, Evans Brown, Adrian Buitenhuis', null, 'Andrew McCarthy, Emilio Estevez, Ally Sheedy, Demi Moore, Rob Lowe, Timothy Hutton, Lea Thompson, Jon Cryer', null, 'In the 1980s, Andrew McCarthy was part of a young generation of actors who were set to take over Hollywood after a string of successful teen movies. However, when the New York magazine cover story in 1985 dubs them the Brat Pack, stars in the making suddenly find themselves losing control over the trajectory of their careers. Now, almost forty years later, McCarthy looks to reconnect with peers and co-stars so that together they can reflect on their respective legacies.', 'In the 1980s, Andrew McCarthy was part of a young generation of actors who were set to take over Hollywood after a string of successful teen movies. However, when the New York magazine cover story in 1985 dubs them the Brat Pack, stars in the making suddenly find themselves losing control over the trajectory of their careers. Now, almost forty years later, McCarthy looks to reconnect with peers and co-stars so that together they can reflect on their respective legacies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kXKxkFo1KC0pwvjbaKg4ruXG6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999621'),
  ('958206138732388821', 'Bratz', 2007, 'Comedy, Music, Family', 'Sean McNamara, Joseph D. Urbanczyk, Christian Sebaldt', 'Susan Estelle Jansen', 'Logan Browning, Janel Parrish, Nathalia Ramos, Skyler Shaye, Chelsea Kane, Anneliese Van Der Pol, Melise, Ian Nelson', 'PG', 'The popular Bratz dolls come to life in their first live-action feature film. Finding themselves being pulled further and further apart, the fashionable four band together to fight peer pressure, learn what it means to stand up for your friends, be true to oneself and live out your dreams.', 'The popular Bratz dolls come to life in their first live-action feature film. Finding themselves being pulled further and further apart, the fashionable four band together to fight peer pressure, learn what it means to stand up for your friends, be true to oneself and live out your dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkhA8Crs7K0JHIZgSdvBeBe2QF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14123'),
  ('299786881735455055', 'Bratz Kidz: Sleep-Over Adventure', 2007, 'Animation, Family', 'Sean McNamara', 'Robert Schlueter', 'Britt McKillip, Nicole Muñoz, Dorla Bell, Bridgette Taylor, Jianna Ballard, Cherilynn Fullbright, Kathleen Barr, Ian James Corlett', 'G', 'Cloe, Yasmin, Jade, Sasha, and Meygan are invited to the new girl in the neighborhood''s sleepover. But no sleepover is complete without staying up late telling scary stories.', 'Cloe, Yasmin, Jade, Sasha, and Meygan are invited to the new girl in the neighborhood''s sleepover. But no sleepover is complete without staying up late telling scary stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LxISs8dAQZvzDIYpPWJC3TwUo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43069'),
  ('362485898532657976', 'Bratz the Video: Starrin'' & Stylin''', 2004, 'Family, Animation', 'Nick Rijgersberg, Marcos Da Silva, Al Jeffrey', 'Megan Martin, Norah Lally', 'Nikki Kaffee, Jillian Thompson, India Thomas, Janice Kawaye, Ogie Banks, Yuri Lowenthal, Kate Higgins', 'G', 'Cloe, Yasmin, Jade, and Sasha must balance a school art project and preparing for prom.', 'Cloe, Yasmin, Jade, and Sasha must balance a school art project and preparing for prom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3FwwCrt4O5xI48vgcbR6Cn69fj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60382'),
  ('626058161442359509', 'Bratz: Babyz - The Movie', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Music', 'Davis Doi', 'John Doolittle', 'Maryke Hendrikse, Ashleigh Ball, Alexandra Carter, Chantal Strand, Britt McKillip, Kelly Sheridan, Kathleen Barr, Ian James Corlett', null, 'When twins Nora and Nita''s puppy is lost at the mall, Yasmin, Cloe, Jade, and Sasha help them escape daycare and rock a karaoke contest to buy it back from the bully who stole it.', 'When twins Nora and Nita''s puppy is lost at the mall, Yasmin, Cloe, Jade, and Sasha help them escape daycare and rock a karaoke contest to buy it back from the bully who stole it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aU2a1O7JGURpRKLWd06RIpQiTd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35281'),
  ('52241003790061961', 'Bratz: Fashion Pixiez', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'David Mucci Fassett, Sean McNamara', 'Bart Jennett', 'Britt McKillip, Brittney Wilson, Ashleigh Ball, Maryke Hendrikse, Janyse Jaud, Chantal Strand, Sarah Edmondson, Jillian Michaels', 'NR', 'When a new girl transfers into school and their classmate Cymbeline starts acting strange, Cloe, Jade, Sasha, and Yasmin discover the secret magical world of pixies.', 'When a new girl transfers into school and their classmate Cymbeline starts acting strange, Cloe, Jade, Sasha, and Yasmin discover the secret magical world of pixies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlLE2uwmZyVUk3bxvG7cDf95C63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60129'),
