  ('304904564986555441', 'Bratz: Passion 4 Fashion - Diamondz', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'David Mucci Fassett, Nick Rijgersberg, Josh Prikryl', 'Janna King, Carter Bryant, Jen Klein', 'Olivia Hack, Soleil Moon Frye, Tia Mowry, Dionne Quan, Wendie Malick, Kaley Cuoco, Lacey Chabert, Greg Ellis', 'PG', 'Bratz girls Cloe, Jade, Sasha, and Yasmin drive across the country in search of contestants for reality TV producer Byron Powell''s America Rocks fashion show.', 'Bratz girls Cloe, Jade, Sasha, and Yasmin drive across the country in search of contestants for reality TV producer Byron Powell''s America Rocks fashion show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfhjR3VAk79FyQSBt5mBnw9MHbz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35940'),
  ('186091679352259076', 'Bratz: Rock Angelz', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'David Mucci Fassett', 'Peggy Nicoll', 'Dionne Quan, Olivia Hack, Soleil Moon Frye, Tia Mowry, Wendie Malick, Kaley Cuoco, Lacey Chabert, Charlie Schlatter', 'NR', 'After starting up their own teen magazine, Bratz girls Yasmin, Cloe, Jade, and Sasha fly to London to cover a rock concert.', 'After starting up their own teen magazine, Bratz girls Yasmin, Cloe, Jade, and Sasha fly to London to cover a rock concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LJUOZgpiCs6r8uKj6bWY2Ja9uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47599'),
  ('797926894071257308', 'Bratz: Super Babyz', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction', 'David Mucci Fassett, Jijesh Nair, Vijay Raibole', 'John Doolittle', 'Britt McKillip, Britt Irvin, Dorla Bell, Maryke Hendrikse, Cathy Weseluck, Jan Rabson, Jay Brazeau, Sam Vincent', 'NR', 'After visiting an amusement park, the Bratz babies encounter a potato-like alien species and accidentally obtain superpowers.', 'After visiting an amusement park, the Bratz babies encounter a potato-like alien species and accidentally obtain superpowers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79r0IkXUusTeItgFY9ezfkibHrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46116'),
  ('773694312087052428', 'Brava', 2017, 'Drama', 'Roser Aguilar', 'Roser Aguilar, Alejandro Hernández', 'Laia Marull, Francesc Orella, Bruno Todeschini, Sergio Caballero, Mikel Iglesias, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Maria Ribera, Roger Príncep', null, 'Janine works in a bank giving credits to clients to buy houses and receives the offer of a promotion to work in a future branch in China for which she takes Mandarin classes. One night he travels from work to his home on the subway. There is attacked by two young delinquents a very old woman and Janine tries to avoid it. The young follow her and it is then that they steal and attack her sexually. After recovering from the blows and the anguish he gets up and sees his attackers raping a helpless young girl. Janine, instead of taking some initiative to stop them, flees home. From that situation her life is disrupted and her job promotion to China, her consolidated partner and her present as an independent woman become secondary and worthless issues. Janine lives in anguish and tormented by the memory of that traumatic situation. To try to recompose himself, he travels to the countryside to see his father who is a widower and is trying to rebuild his life after the death of his wife.', 'Janine works in a bank giving credits to clients to buy houses and receives the offer of a promotion to work in a future branch in China for which she takes Mandarin classes. One night he travels from work to his home on the subway. There is attacked by two young delinquents a very old woman and Janine tries to avoid it. The young follow her and it is then that they steal and attack her sexually. After recovering from the blows and the anguish he gets up and sees his attackers raping a helpless young girl. Janine, instead of taking some initiative to stop them, flees home. From that situation her life is disrupted and her job promotion to China, her consolidated partner and her present as an independent woman become secondary and worthless issues. Janine lives in anguish and tormented by the memory of that traumatic situation. To try to recompose himself, he travels to the countryside to see his father who is a widower and is trying to rebuild his life after the death of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oo8EQ0JTUMA7l5b1iq9F0VGcOzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447072'),
  ('962740502455716556', 'Brave', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Brenda Chapman, Robert Anderson, Mark Andrews', 'Mark Andrews, Brenda Chapman, Steve Purcell', 'Kelly Macdonald, Emma Thompson, Billy Connolly, Julie Walters, Robbie Coltrane, Kevin McKidd, Craig Ferguson, Peigi Barker', 'PG', 'In the mystical Scottish Highlands, Merida is the princess of a kingdom ruled by King Fergus and Queen Elinor. An unruly daughter and an accomplished archer, Merida one day defies a sacred custom of the land and inadvertently brings turmoil to the kingdom. In an attempt to set things right, Merida seeks out an eccentric old Wise Woman and is granted an ill-fated wish. Also figuring into Merida''s quest — and serving as comic relief — are the kingdom''s three lords: the enormous Lord MacGuffin, the surly Lord Macintosh, and the disagreeable Lord Dingwall.', 'In the mystical Scottish Highlands, Merida is the princess of a kingdom ruled by King Fergus and Queen Elinor. An unruly daughter and an accomplished archer, Merida one day defies a sacred custom of the land and inadvertently brings turmoil to the kingdom. In an attempt to set things right, Merida seeks out an eccentric old Wise Woman and is granted an ill-fated wish. Also figuring into Merida''s quest — and serving as comic relief — are the kingdom''s three lords: the enormous Lord MacGuffin, the surly Lord Macintosh, and the disagreeable Lord Dingwall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XAuDtMWpL0sYSFK0R6EZate2Ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62177'),
  ('498886294230606019', 'Brave Citizen', 2023, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Park Jin-pyo, Kim Yong-seong, Bae Il-hyuck', 'Hyeon Choong-yeol, Yeoh Gee-na', 'Shin Hye-sun, Lee Jun-young, Park Jung-woo, Lee Chan-hyeong, Park Hyuk-kwon, Cha Chung-hwa, Son Sook, Bae Hyeon-jun', null, 'An expelled boxing champion, who now is a high-school teacher, witnesses intolerable violence and throws her first punch to build justice against it, while putting on a mask.', 'An expelled boxing champion, who now is a high-school teacher, witnesses intolerable violence and throws her first punch to build justice against it, while putting on a mask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixQoOExnnvIxYvnqGgfhaWqXeXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897160'),
  ('741622906466030896', 'Brave Father Online - Our Story of Final Fantasy XIV', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Teruo Noguchi, Kiyoshi Yamamoto', 'Kota Fukihara', 'Kentaro Sakaguchi, Kotaro Yoshida, Kiara Minegishi, Yui Sakuma, Maika Yamamoto, Ryuta Sato, Naomi Zaizen, Yoshino Nanjo', null, 'Akio wishes he had a better relationship with his reserved father Akira. One day Akira suddenly quits his job and retires without giving out any explanation to the family. Thinking it could be a good tool to be close to his father, Akio gives him software of online game "Final Fantasy XIV". By teaching his father how to play the game and secretly interacting with him as an anonymous online avatar, Akio hopes to know his father better through the adventures with other players in the game; little does the young man know what Akira is going through...', 'Akio wishes he had a better relationship with his reserved father Akira. One day Akira suddenly quits his job and retires without giving out any explanation to the family. Thinking it could be a good tool to be close to his father, Akio gives him software of online game "Final Fantasy XIV". By teaching his father how to play the game and secretly interacting with him as an anonymous online avatar, Akio hopes to know his father better through the adventures with other players in the game; little does the young man know what Akira is going through...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqZSnYjRFJEwEnzlVMKd1popGAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611424'),
  ('711354731455471133', 'Brave Hearts: Umizaru', 2012, 'Action, Drama', 'Eiichiro Hasumi, Tomoo Ezaki', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Hideaki Ito, Ai Kato, Ryuta Sato, Riisa Naka, Shohei Miura, Hiroyuki Hirayama, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Saburo Tokito', null, 'Mika is a flight attendant on board an airplane scheduled to land at Haneda Airport. On the way to the airport the airplane''s engine starts to burn. In order to save the 346 people on board the airplane, sea marshall Daisuke Senzaki and his team are called into action ...', 'Mika is a flight attendant on board an airplane scheduled to land at Haneda Airport. On the way to the airport the airplane''s engine starts to burn. In order to save the 346 people on board the airplane, sea marshall Daisuke Senzaki and his team are called into action ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cSybCAkcyO9FnK5TsVhEfLzyhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162006'),
  ('687404095050676113', 'Brave Little Tailor', 1938, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Bill Roberts, Burt Gillett, Mike Holoboff', null, 'Walt Disney, Eddie Holden, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'When a giant threatens the land, the cityfolk mistake Mickey''s boast of killing seven flies with one blow to be giants. He is then forced to fight the giant for real.', 'When a giant threatens the land, the cityfolk mistake Mickey''s boast of killing seven flies with one blow to be giants. He is then forced to fight the giant for real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbBFDpTMP38daRi8zxHPjTKs3EZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57472'),
  ('865664004939005151', 'Brave New World', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Drama, TV Movie', 'Harry L. Wolf, Burt Brinckerhoff', null, 'Julie Cobb, Bud Cort, Keir Dullea, Ron O''Neal, Marcia Strassman, Kristoffer Tabori, Dick Anthony Williams, Jonelle Allen', null, 'A man who grew up in a primitive society educating himself by reading Shakespeare is allowed to join the futuristic society where his parents are from. However, he cannot adapt to their repressive ways.', 'A man who grew up in a primitive society educating himself by reading Shakespeare is allowed to join the futuristic society where his parents are from. However, he cannot adapt to their repressive ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBxmm8PeNmhiEaQry6P17XVtlgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38699'),
  ('732956087420620709', 'Brave New World', 1998, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Leslie Libman, Larry Williams, Ronald Víctor García', null, 'Leonard Nimoy, Peter Gallagher, Tim Guinee, Rya Kihlstedt, Sally Kirkland, Patrick J. Dancy, Wendy Benson-Landes, Steven Schub', null, 'In a futuristic totalitarian utopian society, babies are created through genetic engineering, everyone has a predestined place in society and their minds are conditioned to follow the rules. A tragic outsider jeopardizes the status quo.', 'In a futuristic totalitarian utopian society, babies are created through genetic engineering, everyone has a predestined place in society and their minds are conditioned to follow the rules. A tragic outsider jeopardizes the status quo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fQP7c3TPOvi84onjU5XMbOcbeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27260'),
  ('823694200363522038', 'Brave Story', 2006, 'Animation, Adventure, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Koichi Chigira, Yoshio Hirooka, Hiroshi Shirai', 'Ichiro Okouchi, Reiko Yoshida', 'Takako Matsu, Eiji Wentz, Shirō Itō, Ayako Kawasumi, Chiwa Saito, Satomi Korogi, Takako Tokiwa, Yo Oizumi', null, 'Jr. High School Student Wataru and his friends like playing in an abandond building and looking for ghosts. However it seems he is not the only one. Another mysterious student Mitsuru shows Wataru that there is a magical door to another world where one can go and get the Goddess of Fortune to grant one wish! When tragedy strikes Wataru''s family he decides to open the door for himself.', 'Jr. High School Student Wataru and his friends like playing in an abandond building and looking for ghosts. However it seems he is not the only one. Another mysterious student Mitsuru shows Wataru that there is a magical door to another world where one can go and get the Goddess of Fortune to grant one wish! When tragedy strikes Wataru''s family he decides to open the door for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6Nf0izdEXKvVi8T8vinuqmfMpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17566'),
  ('1081806673282940462', 'Brave the Dark', 2025, 'Drama', 'Damian Harris, Julio Macat', 'Dale G. Bradley, Lynn Robertson Hay, Nathaniel Deen', 'Jared Harris, Nicholas Hamilton, Jamie Harris, Sasha Bhasin, Will Price, Kimberly S. Fairbanks, Tobias Segal, Martin Jarvis', 'PG-13', 'When Mr. Deen discovers one of his students has been living out of his car and thrown into jail, he decides to bail him out. Determined to curb Nate’s self-destructive behavior, Deen quickly discovers a host of dark secrets slowly tearing Nate apart. What began as a good deed becomes a desperate fight to save Nate from his own demons. As Nate spirals deeper into despair, Deen must decide how far he’s willing to go to save a kid on the brink of losing everything—even himself.', 'When Mr. Deen discovers one of his students has been living out of his car and thrown into jail, he decides to bail him out. Determined to curb Nate’s self-destructive behavior, Deen quickly discovers a host of dark secrets slowly tearing Nate apart. What began as a good deed becomes a desperate fight to save Nate from his own demons. As Nate spirals deeper into despair, Deen must decide how far he’s willing to go to save a kid on the brink of losing everything—even himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMmy9CICGEyFDcXM9fIXU2bDEcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659956'),
  ('292180256541693583', 'Brave: Gunjyou Senki', 2021, 'Action, History, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Hiroyuki Kase', 'Toru Yamamoto, Masahiro Yamaura', 'Mackenyu, Hirona Yamazaki, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Tatsuomi Hamada, Hiroki Iijima, Keisuke Watanabe, Haruma Miura, Kenichi Matsuyama', null, 'Students, including Aoi Nishino, take part in class and sports activity at a prestigious high school. Aoi Nishino is a member of the school''s archery club. He practices archery studiously and doesn''t socialize much with the other students. His childhood friend Haruka Seno is also a member of the archery club, but she worries about Aoi Nishino. One day, thunder strikes the school grounds. After that, the ordinary lives of the students changes drastically. Many samurai descend on the school grounds. It appears that the entire school has traveled back in time to the Sengoku period. Making things worse, they realize that they are in the time right before the Battle of Okehazama takes place.', 'Students, including Aoi Nishino, take part in class and sports activity at a prestigious high school. Aoi Nishino is a member of the school''s archery club. He practices archery studiously and doesn''t socialize much with the other students. His childhood friend Haruka Seno is also a member of the archery club, but she worries about Aoi Nishino. One day, thunder strikes the school grounds. After that, the ordinary lives of the students changes drastically. Many samurai descend on the school grounds. It appears that the entire school has traveled back in time to the Sengoku period. Making things worse, they realize that they are in the time right before the Battle of Okehazama takes place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmQ2ITqePFSHtIcTerBHPtOe98J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726657'),
  ('66224124653506546', 'Braveheart', 1995, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Mel Gibson, John Toll, Clare Langan', 'Randall Wallace', 'Mel Gibson, Catherine McCormack, Sophie Marceau, Patrick McGoohan, Angus Macfadyen, Brendan Gleeson, James Robinson, James Cosmo', 'R', 'Enraged at the slaughter of Murron, his new bride and childhood love, Scottish warrior William Wallace slays a platoon of the local English lord''s soldiers. This leads the village to revolt and, eventually, the entire country to rise up against English rule.', 'Enraged at the slaughter of Murron, his new bride and childhood love, Scottish warrior William Wallace slays a platoon of the local English lord''s soldiers. This leads the village to revolt and, eventually, the entire country to rise up against English rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/or1gBugydmjToAEq7OZY0owwFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197'),
  ('481218275592499732', 'Braven', 2018, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Lin Oeding, Brian Andrew Mendoza, Hilary Thomson', 'Thomas Pa''a Sibbett, Michael Nilon', 'Jason Momoa, Stephen Lang, Garret Dillahunt, Zahn McClarnon, Jill Wagner, Brendan Fletcher, Sala Baker, Teach Grant', 'R', 'A logger defends his family from a group of dangerous drug runners.', 'A logger defends his family from a group of dangerous drug runners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/253Bw5I3Zj3e2thCThjO7byEUCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459910'),
  ('466551983747978880', 'BraveStarr: The Legend', 1988, 'Animation, Western, Action, Science Fiction', 'Tom Tataranowicz', 'Bob Forward', 'Charlie Adler, Susan Blu, Pat Fraley, Ed Gilbert, Alan Oppenheimer', 'PG', 'Marshall Bravestarr is the lawman of the wild-west planet "New Texas" with help from Thirty-Thirty, his cybernetic talking horse and Deputy Fuzz, his sidekick and Shaman, his mentor. Bravestarr with his special powers fights the outlaw Tex-Hex, the leader of the Carrion Bunch, who are after the mineral Kerium, Bravestarr sets out to set things right and enforce peace and justice on "New Texas".', 'Marshall Bravestarr is the lawman of the wild-west planet "New Texas" with help from Thirty-Thirty, his cybernetic talking horse and Deputy Fuzz, his sidekick and Shaman, his mentor. Bravestarr with his special powers fights the outlaw Tex-Hex, the leader of the Carrion Bunch, who are after the mineral Kerium, Bravestarr sets out to set things right and enforce peace and justice on "New Texas".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JRTpKWwpPXyNVEBeAGpjLHRJU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66454'),
  ('695591712954784437', 'BraveStorm', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Junya Okabe', 'Junya Okabe', 'Shunsuke Daitoh, Mitsu Dan, Shu Watanabe, Chihiro Yamamoto, Tom Fujita, Soran Tamoto, Yuki Matsuzaki, Yasufumi Terawaki', null, 'In the year 2050, mankind is extinct. The last survivors travel back in time to stop the invader, Killgis, aided by roboticist Kenichiro Kurenai. When they arrive at the past, they start to build a giant robot, Red Baron, and the pilot of the Red Baron races against time aided by reinforced humans to identify the alien in a fierce battle which starts in Tokyo for the survival of Earth. This is a re-imagining of the 1970s TV series'' "Silver Kamen" and "Super Robot Red Baron".', 'In the year 2050, mankind is extinct. The last survivors travel back in time to stop the invader, Killgis, aided by roboticist Kenichiro Kurenai. When they arrive at the past, they start to build a giant robot, Red Baron, and the pilot of the Red Baron races against time aided by reinforced humans to identify the alien in a fierce battle which starts in Tokyo for the survival of Earth. This is a re-imagining of the 1970s TV series'' "Silver Kamen" and "Super Robot Red Baron".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1QJ02oiRfuCF5xM22LOrHampaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459075'),
  ('1016350668420038281', 'Bravetown', 2015, 'Drama, Music', 'Daniel Duran, Angel Barroeta', 'Oscar Orlando Torres', 'Josh Duhamel, Maria Bello, Laura Dern, Katrina Norman, Lucas Till, Tom Everett Scott, Jae Head, Shamier Anderson', null, 'After an accidental drug overdose, a talented teenage DJ goes to live with his estranged father in a small Army town, where he gets to the bottom of his own pain and learns empathy for others.', 'After an accidental drug overdose, a talented teenage DJ goes to live with his estranged father in a small Army town, where he gets to the bottom of his own pain and learns empathy for others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aM5c1cu9dqt8Rqrv1FdMna4oThD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300666'),
  ('409435450814509499', 'Bravissimo', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Folco Quilici, Marco Scarpelli, Luigi Filippo D''Amico', 'Luigi Filippo D''Amico, Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Alberto Sordi, Giancarlo Zarfati, Patrizia Della Rovere, Irene Cefaro, Irène Tunc, Riccarda Momo, Mario Riva, Gianrico Tedeschi', null, 'The master Impallato takes care of the boys in a suburban after-school. Here he discovers a pupil with an extraordinary baritone voice.', 'The master Impallato takes care of the boys in a suburban after-school. Here he discovers a pupil with an extraordinary baritone voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRlWkmFIpFk834kmX9xASk6gyMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82346'),
  ('958204166692934582', 'Bravo Bene!', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Franco Maresco, Alessandro Abate', 'Franco Maresco, Claudia Uzzo, Francesco Guttuso', 'Umberto Cantone, Franco Maresco, Francesco Conticelli, Marco Alessi, Bernardo Greco, Francesco Puma, Saverio D''Amico, Toti Mancuso', null, 'Filming on Franco Maresco''s film about Carmelo Bene is abruptly halted after yet another on-set accident. Producer Andrea Occhipinti pulls the plug, exasperated by the endless takes and repeated delays. Angered, the director simply disappears. Maresco''s friend, Umberto Cantone, attempts to mend the rift by calling witnesses from all those involved in the project, in an investigation that offers an opportunity to retrace the personality and ideas of the most corrosive and apocalyptic auteur in Italian cinema.', 'Filming on Franco Maresco''s film about Carmelo Bene is abruptly halted after yet another on-set accident. Producer Andrea Occhipinti pulls the plug, exasperated by the endless takes and repeated delays. Angered, the director simply disappears. Maresco''s friend, Umberto Cantone, attempts to mend the rift by calling witnesses from all those involved in the project, in an investigation that offers an opportunity to retrace the personality and ideas of the most corrosive and apocalyptic auteur in Italian cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xKygU0ce9Sd0q7zo6Cg7PPbAgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276271'),
  ('1015375721790323831', 'Bravo Two Zero', 1999, 'War, Action, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Andy McNab', 'Sean Bean, Steve Nicholson, Rick Warden, Robert Hobbs, Richard Graham, Jamie Bartlett, Ian Curtis, Kevin Collins', 'R', 'When an elite eight-man British SAS team is dropped behind enemy lines, their mission is clear: take out Saddam Hussein''s SCUD missile systems. But when communications are cut and the team finds themselves surrounded by Saddam''s army, their only hope is to risk capture and torture in a desperate 185-kilometer run to the Syrian border. Based on the true story of a British Special Forces unit behind enemy lines during the Gulf War, Bravo Two Zero explores the tragedies and triumphs of men taken to the edge of survival in the Persian Gulf War.', 'When an elite eight-man British SAS team is dropped behind enemy lines, their mission is clear: take out Saddam Hussein''s SCUD missile systems. But when communications are cut and the team finds themselves surrounded by Saddam''s army, their only hope is to risk capture and torture in a desperate 185-kilometer run to the Syrian border. Based on the true story of a British Special Forces unit behind enemy lines during the Gulf War, Bravo Two Zero explores the tragedies and triumphs of men taken to the edge of survival in the Persian Gulf War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYQnIBew0Tv2BPT0kpNSekxmAyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116333'),
  ('1039721817729532301', 'Brawl in Cell Block 99', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Dave Halls, Cassandra Santiago, Maggie Ruder', 'S. Craig Zahler', 'Vince Vaughn, Jennifer Carpenter, Don Johnson, Udo Kier, Dion Mucciacito, Geno Segers, Mustafa Shakir, Marc Blucas', 'NR', 'After working as a drug courier and getting into a brutal shootout with police, a former boxer finds himself at the mercy of his enemies as they force him to instigate violent acts that turn the prison he resides in into a battleground.', 'After working as a drug courier and getting into a brutal shootout with police, a former boxer finds himself at the mercy of his enemies as they force him to instigate violent acts that turn the prison he resides in into a battleground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfB1J6jsjdGWKjXxKQ5hNd1OyAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398175'),
  ('983638118002669265', 'Brazen', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Monika Mitchell, Robert Aschmann, Blair Dykes', 'Donald Martin, Edithe Swensen, Suzette Couture', 'Alyssa Milano, Sam Page, Malachi Weir, Emilie Ullerup, Matthew Finlan, Alison Araya, Colleen Wheeler, David James Lewis', null, 'Mystery writer Grace Miller has killer instincts when it comes to motive - and she''ll need every bit of expertise to help solve her sister''s murder.', 'Mystery writer Grace Miller has killer instincts when it comes to motive - and she''ll need every bit of expertise to help solve her sister''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7e4n1GfC9iky9VQzH3cDQz9wYpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916740'),
  ('382233693256232386', 'Brazil', 1944, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Joseph Santley, Jack A. Marta', 'Frank Gill Jr., Laura Kerr', 'Tito Guízar, Virginia Bruce, Edward Everett Horton, Robert Livingston, Richard Lane, Veloz, Yolanda, Fortunio Bonanova', null, 'Brazil is perhaps the best of the handful of US films made by singing sensation Tito Guizar. In typical screwball-comedy fashion, the plot is set in motion by authoress Nicky Henderson, who has hit the best-seller charts with her latest tome, Why Marry a Latin? While researching her next book in Rio De Janeiro, she finds out "why" when she meets handsome songwriter Miguel Soares. Upon learning about Nicky''s book, Miguel decides to teach her a few lessons in the affairs of the heart. Edward Everett Horton is also on hand, twittering his way through the role of a well-meaning buttinsky. Thanks to the "Good Neighbor" policy of the 1940s, South American musicals were a glut on the market, but Brazil was good enough on its own merits to pay its way at the box office.', 'Brazil is perhaps the best of the handful of US films made by singing sensation Tito Guizar. In typical screwball-comedy fashion, the plot is set in motion by authoress Nicky Henderson, who has hit the best-seller charts with her latest tome, Why Marry a Latin? While researching her next book in Rio De Janeiro, she finds out "why" when she meets handsome songwriter Miguel Soares. Upon learning about Nicky''s book, Miguel decides to teach her a few lessons in the affairs of the heart. Edward Everett Horton is also on hand, twittering his way through the role of a well-meaning buttinsky. Thanks to the "Good Neighbor" policy of the 1940s, South American musicals were a glut on the market, but Brazil was good enough on its own merits to pay its way at the box office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDpqZLKRKv0jmLjJwSflOtKDcc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218090'),
  ('696771562206482786', 'Brazil', 1985, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Terry Gilliam, Roger Pratt, Françoise Benoît-Fresco', 'Tom Stoppard, Charles McKeown, Terry Gilliam', 'Jonathan Pryce, Robert De Niro, Katherine Helmond, Ian Holm, Bob Hoskins, Michael Palin, Ian Richardson, Peter Vaughan', 'R', 'Low-level bureaucrat Sam Lowry escapes the monotony of his day-to-day life through a recurring daydream of himself as a virtuous hero saving a beautiful damsel. Investigating a case that led to the wrongful arrest and eventual death of an innocent man instead of wanted terrorist Harry Tuttle, he meets the woman from his daydream, and in trying to help her gets caught in a web of mistaken identities, mindless bureaucracy and lies.', 'Low-level bureaucrat Sam Lowry escapes the monotony of his day-to-day life through a recurring daydream of himself as a virtuous hero saving a beautiful damsel. Investigating a case that led to the wrongful arrest and eventual death of an innocent man instead of wanted terrorist Harry Tuttle, he meets the woman from his daydream, and in trying to help her gets caught in a web of mistaken identities, mindless bureaucracy and lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aewan59WcFThBimkTVVoNf2o5Vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68'),
  ('276821263334248833', 'Brazil 2002: The Real Story', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Luis Ara, Fermin Turban, Alejandro Berger', 'Luis Ara, Arianna Perretta', 'Ronaldo, Roberto Carlos, Ronaldinho, Cafú, Denílson, Juliano Belletti, David Beckham', null, 'A behind-the-scenes look at Brazil''s 2002 World Cup-winning soccer team, with unseen footage and interviews with the players.', 'A behind-the-scenes look at Brazil''s 2002 World Cup-winning soccer team, with unseen footage and interviews with the players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyPxjm5oWorlaIWeZZiVFhoXGHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024539'),
  ('843773545320906182', 'Brazil: A Report on Torture', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Saul Landau, Haskell Wexler, Haskell Wexler', null, 'Maria Auxiliadora Lara Barcelos', null, 'The filmmakers spoke to ex-political prisoners who had been tortured by the military government who were at that point supported by the US government.', 'The filmmakers spoke to ex-political prisoners who had been tortured by the military government who were at that point supported by the US government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwuP0Q5NHw9XNgYMGojXQp6hT9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141484'),
  ('818409269102763444', 'Brazilian Holocaust', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Mauro Pianta, Armando Mendz, Daniela Arbex', 'Daniela Arbex, Pilar Fazito', 'Helvécio Ratton', null, 'Award-winning journalist Daniela Arbex examines the horrors of the Colônia psychiatric hospital, where more than 60,000 people were killed over decades.', 'Award-winning journalist Daniela Arbex examines the horrors of the Colônia psychiatric hospital, where more than 60,000 people were killed over decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76muwL3vWeojBD5N2ARsgFrtXPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417548'),
  ('5193365066527673', 'Brazilian Western', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Western, Romance', 'René Sampaio, Gustavo Hadba', 'Paulo Lins', 'Fabrício Boliveira, Isis Valverde, Felipe Abib, Antonio Calloni, César Troncoso, Marcos Paulo, Cinnara Leal, Léo Rosa', null, 'When João goes to Brazil in search of a better life, he meets punk music enthusiast Maria and falls in love with her. But his involvement in the local drug trade makes him the target of a vicious drug lord.', 'When João goes to Brazil in search of a better life, he meets punk music enthusiast Maria and falls in love with her. But his involvement in the local drug trade makes him the target of a vicious drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XHb7KdI0qnTQhUzEubhmuvsYZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195423'),
  ('646470576256837916', 'Breach', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, History', 'Billy Ray, Tak Fujimoto, Richard L. Fox', 'Billy Ray, Adam Mazer, William L. Rotko', 'Chris Cooper, Ryan Phillippe, Laura Linney, Caroline Dhavernas, Gary Cole, Dennis Haysbert, Kathleen Quinlan, Bruce Davison', 'PG-13', 'Eric O''Neill, a low-level surveillance expert with the FBI, believes he is accomplishing his dream of becoming a full-fledged agent, with his unexpected promotion and assignment to clerk for Robert Hanssen, a renowned senior agent with 25 years in the FBI. However, he soon learns the reason for his promotion is to gain Hanssen''s trust and find proof that he is a traitor to the country. Determined to draw the suspected double-agent out of deep cover, O''Neill finds himself in a lethal game of spy vs. spy, where nothing is as it seems.', 'Eric O''Neill, a low-level surveillance expert with the FBI, believes he is accomplishing his dream of becoming a full-fledged agent, with his unexpected promotion and assignment to clerk for Robert Hanssen, a renowned senior agent with 25 years in the FBI. However, he soon learns the reason for his promotion is to gain Hanssen''s trust and find proof that he is a traitor to the country. Determined to draw the suspected double-agent out of deep cover, O''Neill finds himself in a lethal game of spy vs. spy, where nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2iVkJPxDrrink7NiE412nFBMQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4169'),
  ('358379114255773400', 'Breach', 2009, 'Drama', 'Iván Noel, Marta Solís', 'Iván Noel, Francisco Alfonsin', 'Francisco Alfonsin, José Ramón Lafita, Lola Mendoza, Maica Sánchez, Benito Cordero, Carmen Caro Quiñones, Manuel Pazos, Victoria Romero de Torre', null, 'Recently released from jail, Andrés experiences an emotional rupture from his 12-year-old son, José Ramón, following a dark family tragedy that nobody is bold enough to confront.', 'Recently released from jail, Andrés experiences an emotional rupture from his 12-year-old son, José Ramón, following a dark family tragedy that nobody is bold enough to confront.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUy1wZXl98D6pFOMvYwEu3z8zr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108714'),
  ('514373713280001338', 'Breach', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'John Suits, Will Stone, Logan Thomas Peterson', 'Corey Large, Edward Drake', 'Cody Kearsley, Bruce Willis, Rachel Nichols, Kassandra Clementi, Johnny Messner, Corey Large, Callan Mulvey, Timothy V. Murphy', 'R', 'A hardened mechanic must stay awake and maintain an interstellar ark fleeing the dying planet Earth with a few thousand lucky souls on board... the last of humanity. Unfortunately, humans are not the only passengers. A shapeshifting alien creature has taken residence, its only goal is to kill as many people as possible. The crew must think quickly to stop this menace before it destroys mankind.', 'A hardened mechanic must stay awake and maintain an interstellar ark fleeing the dying planet Earth with a few thousand lucky souls on board... the last of humanity. Unfortunately, humans are not the only passengers. A shapeshifting alien creature has taken residence, its only goal is to kill as many people as possible. The crew must think quickly to stop this menace before it destroys mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13B6onhL6FzSN2KaNeQeMML05pS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651571'),
  ('52607265544263469', 'Breach of Faith: A Family of Cops II', 1997, 'Action, Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Ronald Orieux, David Greene, Brad Warshaw', 'Joel Blasberg', 'Charles Bronson, Angela Featherstone, Barbara Williams, Sebastian Spence, Kim Weeks, Diane Ladd, Joe Penny, Andrew Jackson', 'PG-13', 'The family of cops is back, this time dealing with the murder of a priest tied in with the Russian Mafia, who proceed to try to draw the family off the case.', 'The family of cops is back, this time dealing with the murder of a priest tied in with the Russian Mafia, who proceed to try to draw the family off the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri5AwG4a9uaJg4aNaQqK8smVJQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110109'),
  ('1098495953190888872', 'Bread', 1971, 'Music, Comedy', 'Stanley A. Long, Stuart Black, John Fiddy', 'Stanley A. Long, Suzanne Mercer', 'Anthony Nigel, Peter Marinker, Dick Haydon, Noelle Rimmington, Liz White, Yocki Rhodes, Michael McStay, Penny Brahms', null, 'On their way home from the Isle of Wight Pop Festival, Jeff, Trev and Mick along with girlfriends Marty and Cathy decide to pitch a tent on private land. In the morning the land''s owner Rafe turns up and orders them to get off his lawn but changes his mind when one of the girls emerges naked from the tent. Rafe explains he only comes down to the house at weekends and lets them stay providing they redecorate his house. The squatters agree but once Rafe leaves they plot to organize a pop festival at the house. Attempting to raise cash for the venture, the men coerce their girlfriends into making a blue movie. When this proves disastrous Jeff goes to London and poses as a pop journalist in order to book the groups "Crazy Mabel" and "The Juicy Lucy" for the festival.', 'On their way home from the Isle of Wight Pop Festival, Jeff, Trev and Mick along with girlfriends Marty and Cathy decide to pitch a tent on private land. In the morning the land''s owner Rafe turns up and orders them to get off his lawn but changes his mind when one of the girls emerges naked from the tent. Rafe explains he only comes down to the house at weekends and lets them stay providing they redecorate his house. The squatters agree but once Rafe leaves they plot to organize a pop festival at the house. Attempting to raise cash for the venture, the men coerce their girlfriends into making a blue movie. When this proves disastrous Jeff goes to London and poses as a pop journalist in order to book the groups "Crazy Mabel" and "The Juicy Lucy" for the festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tnuli7vBLb5wyT2HlIDmnFp1R2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106869'),
  ('849246901417700326', 'Bread and Chocolate', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Franco Brusati, Luciano Tovoli, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Jaja Fiastri, Nino Manfredi, Franco Brusati', 'Nino Manfredi, Johnny Dorelli, Anna Karina, Paolo Turco, Ugo D''Alessio, Tano Cimarosa, Gianfranco Barra, Giorgio Cerioni', null, 'An Italian immigrant tries to make a new life in Switzerland, taking on a series of increasingly menial jobs in order to do it. He attempts to fit into his new home and society but fails at every turn. Unable to go home again, will his tenacity and optimism be enough to live on?', 'An Italian immigrant tries to make a new life in Switzerland, taking on a series of increasingly menial jobs in order to do it. He attempts to fit into his new home and society but fails at every turn. Unable to go home again, will his tenacity and optimism be enough to live on?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24D3e6xBPEvqlFoq4tSMVqVQ3TO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51242'),
  ('1090250027398217710', 'Bread and Roses', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ken Loach, Ricardo Méndez Matta, Bradley Morris', 'Paul Laverty', 'Pilar Padilla, Adrien Brody, Jack McGee, Monica Rivas, Frankie Davila, Lillian Hurst, Maria Orellana, Melody Garrett', null, 'Maya is a quick-witted young woman who comes over the Mexican border without papers and makes her way to the LA home of her older sister Rosa. Rosa gets Maya a job as a janitor: a non-union janitorial service has the contract, the foul-mouthed supervisor can fire workers on a whim, and the service-workers'' union has assigned organizer Sam Shapiro to bring its "justice for janitors" campaign to the building. Sam finds Maya a willing listener, she''s also attracted to him. Rosa resists, she has an ailing husband to consider. The workers try for public support; management intimidates workers to divide and conquer. Rosa and Maya as well as workers and management may be set to collide.', 'Maya is a quick-witted young woman who comes over the Mexican border without papers and makes her way to the LA home of her older sister Rosa. Rosa gets Maya a job as a janitor: a non-union janitorial service has the contract, the foul-mouthed supervisor can fire workers on a whim, and the service-workers'' union has assigned organizer Sam Shapiro to bring its "justice for janitors" campaign to the building. Sam finds Maya a willing listener, she''s also attracted to him. Rosa resists, she has an ailing husband to consider. The workers try for public support; management intimidates workers to divide and conquer. Rosa and Maya as well as workers and management may be set to collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNk0yx0xRcs66OdByiy2pJaFhI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37691'),
  ('406792041278171971', 'Bread and Tulips', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Silvio Soldini, Luca Bigazzi, Alessandro Savioli', 'Silvio Soldini, Doriana Leondeff', 'Licia Maglietta, Bruno Ganz, Giuseppe Battiston, Antonio Catania, Marina Massironi, Felice Andreasi, Vitalba Andrea, Tatiana Lepore', null, 'An endearing light comedy about a woman who spontaneously becomes a resident of Venice after her family left her behind. While enjoying the wonderful people she meets she achieves a new life and the first time independent of her family.', 'An endearing light comedy about a woman who spontaneously becomes a resident of Venice after her family left her behind. While enjoying the wonderful people she meets she achieves a new life and the first time independent of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijCBLF08KQsam3cOBAnit05iiV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552'),
  ('932717048617971989', 'Bread Day', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Vladimir Oryol, Sergei Dvortsevoy, Alisher Khamidkhodzhaev', 'Sergei Dvortsevoy', null, null, 'Depicts a community of pensioners living in near isolation outside of St. Petersberg as it enacts the weekly ritual of bringing a delivery of bread—left at a rail junction two hours away—into the village for distribution.', 'Depicts a community of pensioners living in near isolation outside of St. Petersberg as it enacts the weekly ritual of bringing a delivery of bread—left at a rail junction two hours away—into the village for distribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dv9hWCSkQKlDxkJw5UgFZgl70WS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360167'),
  ('949941860355743596', 'Bread of Happiness', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yukiko Mishima, Ryu Segawa', 'Yukiko Mishima', 'Tomoyo Harada, Yo Oizumi, Yuta Hiraoka, Kanna Mori, Kimiko Yo, Reika Kirishima, Morio Agata, Nobue Iketani', null, 'A couple decide to relocate from Tokyo to the northern island of Hokkaido where they settle and establish a bakery and café called Mani. One cooks. The other bakes. Everyone walks out happy.', 'A couple decide to relocate from Tokyo to the northern island of Hokkaido where they settle and establish a bakery and café called Mani. One cooks. The other bakes. Everyone walks out happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bobuzQbQpN4FrcakPC8zSZoRif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135598'),
  ('944355517490963417', 'Bread, Love and Andalucia', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Javier Setó, Luisa Alessandri, Franco Montemurro', 'Luciana Corda, Ettore Maria Margadonna, Sandro Continenza', 'Vittorio De Sica, Carmen Sevilla, Lea Padovani, Peppino De Filippo, Mario Carotenuto, Columba Domínguez, Vicente Parra, Dolores Palumbo', null, 'Determined to postpone his own wedding, a former marshal leaves his bride-to-be and participates in an international music festival in Spain, where he falls for a young dancer.', 'Determined to postpone his own wedding, a former marshal leaves his bride-to-be and participates in an international music festival in Spain, where he falls for a young dancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wR7jtFZpMdm7ePtONt8oI2YURN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62701'),
  ('578148911453419671', 'Bread, Love and Dreams', 1953, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Luigi Comencini, Luisa Alessandri, Franco Montemurro', 'Luigi Comencini, Ettore Maria Margadonna', 'Vittorio De Sica, Gina Lollobrigida, Marisa Merlini, Tina Pica, Maria Pia Casilio, Memmo Carotenuto, Roberto Risso, Virgilio Riento', null, 'When a veteran marshal is sent to a small town, he quickly falls for two women: a midwife and an earthy young woman nicknamed "Frisky".', 'When a veteran marshal is sent to a small town, he quickly falls for two women: a midwife and an earthy young woman nicknamed "Frisky".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFZa1OU1Kbp0yDQN9RvU5bmWNAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56402'),
  ('879384625331866947', 'Breadcrumbs', 2016, 'Drama', 'Matías ''Lucho'' Viera, Illana Cossio, Manane Rodríguez', 'Manane Rodríguez, Xavier Bermúdez', 'Cecilia Roth, Patxi Bisquert, Justina Bustos, Ignacio Cawen, Ernesto Chao, Stefanía Crocce, Andrea Davidovics, Ulises Di Roma', 'PG-13', 'When Liliana decides to return to Uruguay she will have to face up to a new dilemma, perhaps the last great dilemma of her life: To choose between supporting a collective case for female prisoners, raped during the time of the dictatorship, or to reconcile with her son and be able to live peacefully as a mother and a grandmother.', 'When Liliana decides to return to Uruguay she will have to face up to a new dilemma, perhaps the last great dilemma of her life: To choose between supporting a collective case for female prisoners, raped during the time of the dictatorship, or to reconcile with her son and be able to live peacefully as a mother and a grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwAwZX8S0KAfekto5x52jnqdayD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416369'),
  ('684802428779862611', 'Break', 2009, 'Action, Horror', 'Matthias Olof Eich, Robert von Munchhofen, Andrea Wunder', 'Matthias Olof Eich', 'Lili Schackert, Esther Maaß, Ralph Willmann, Marina Anna Eich, Thelma Buabeng, Sebastian Badenberg, Patrick Jahns, Annette Kreft', null, 'Four young girls head out into the Canadian woods for some outdoors fun. They wind up running into 2 brutal and sadistically inhuman rednecks. A blood-soaked fight for survival ensues.', 'Four young girls head out into the Canadian woods for some outdoors fun. They wind up running into 2 brutal and sadistically inhuman rednecks. A blood-soaked fight for survival ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBss1480NrIhLzGaFtIqk8xcZuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55939'),
  ('753960435366722318', 'Break', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Fouchard', 'Marc Fouchard', 'Sabrina Ouazani, Kévin Mischel, Slimane, Hassam Ghancy, Maxime Pambet, Christophe Reymond, Camille Japy, Salomon Azaro', null, 'Lucie, a young dancer suffers an accident. When she wakes up from a coma, she and her partner start training for a dance show. On the way, she starts looking for her estranged father, a path that might lead her to life-changing love.', 'Lucie, a young dancer suffers an accident. When she wakes up from a coma, she and her partner start training for a dance show. On the way, she starts looking for her estranged father, a path that might lead her to life-changing love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwK4PMUppMKlm2CwspO8EKuhj7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525938'),
  ('884184844241962193', 'Break', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Tigran Sahakyan, Sergey Dyshuk, Karina Mirzoyan', 'Evgeniy Yuranov, Tigran Sahakyan, Oleg Smagin', 'Irina Antonenko, Andrey Nazimov, Ingrid Olerinskaya, Anastasiya Grachyova, Denis Kosyakov, Mikhail Filippov, Vladimir Gusev, Aleksandr Nikitchenko', null, 'The company of three guys and two girls makes their way to the old funicular to have an unforgettable New Year’s Eve celebration at the top of the mountain. A fun adventure turns into a nightmare when the funicular stops over the abyss. Coldness, height and fear of a slow death make them reveal their true essence and get in a fight with each other.', 'The company of three guys and two girls makes their way to the old funicular to have an unforgettable New Year’s Eve celebration at the top of the mountain. A fun adventure turns into a nightmare when the funicular stops over the abyss. Coldness, height and fear of a slow death make them reveal their true essence and get in a fight with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66OBBkqi9v5txzDPLzGULqVeB30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517024'),
  ('856294413718087541', 'Break Every Chain', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tim Searfoss, Tim Searfoss', 'Tim Searfoss, Daniel Fajardo', 'Ignacyo Matynia, Krystian Leonard, Dean Cain, Brayden Lacer, Collins Randolph, Sterling Morse Jr., Dennis P. Marburger, Jeremiah Clark', 'PG', 'Drowning in the depths of depression and sadness, burning with anger, and chained down by alcoholism, Jonathan couldn’t do it anymore. After the loss of his father as a young boy, facing countless horrific death scenes in the line of duty, and the death of his son, Jonathan turned to the world for answers — finding only darkness. Faced with the threat of losing all that is left to him, Jonathan turns to faith and finds hope and redemption.', 'Drowning in the depths of depression and sadness, burning with anger, and chained down by alcoholism, Jonathan couldn’t do it anymore. After the loss of his father as a young boy, facing countless horrific death scenes in the line of duty, and the death of his son, Jonathan turned to the world for answers — finding only darkness. Faced with the threat of losing all that is left to him, Jonathan turns to faith and finds hope and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CBhCjBlT92Hivvke3laZn3rNkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841575'),
  ('121184154291400216', 'Break Free', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gianluca Maria Tavarelli, Laura Muccino, Roberto Forza', 'Angelo Carbone, Gianluca Maria Tavarelli, Leonardo Fasoli', 'Elio Germano, Nicole Grimaudo, Anita Zagaria, Rosa Pianeta, Myriam Catania, Sebastiano Nardone, Luigi Ciavarelli, Francesco De Vito', null, 'The film follows Vince, a dissatisfied young man from a Roman mountain village, who moves to Pescara to work as a cook. He falls for Genny, a waitress with a travel phobia, but his father Cenzo arrives, seeking Vince’s help to win back his ex-wife Paola.', 'The film follows Vince, a dissatisfied young man from a Roman mountain village, who moves to Pescara to work as a cook. He falls for Genny, a waitress with a travel phobia, but his father Cenzo arrives, seeking Vince’s help to win back his ex-wife Paola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqIdURszzcnvMjaZyf3STAC2585.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84739'),
  ('247749290253349948', 'Break Ke Baad', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Danish Aslam, Aarti Bhatia, Pooja Singh', 'Renuka Kunzru', 'Imran Khan, Deepika Padukone, Shahana Goswami, Sharmila Tagore, Lillete Dubey, Navin Nischol, Gaurav Nanda, Suparna Marwah', null, 'Aaliya is not ready for commitment even after a decade-long friendship with Abhay. She remains indifferent when he follows her to Australia, but is finally shaken when he announces his marriage.', 'Aaliya is not ready for commitment even after a decade-long friendship with Abhay. She remains indifferent when he follows her to Australia, but is finally shaken when he announces his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFrpvaP98ZBu0c6PxzmTqFZd4K8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50099'),
  ('109893870171535042', 'Break of Dawn', 2002, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alexandre Arcady, Alexandre Aja, Grégory Levasseur', 'Alexandre Arcady, Grégory Levasseur, Alexandre Aja', 'Richard Berry, Saïd Taghmaoui, Joaquim de Almeida, Anouk Grinberg, Etienne Chicot, Moussa Maaskri, Cristian Iacob, Alexandru Repan', null, 'An ex-con suffering from terminal cancer and a suicidal ex-legionnaire are hired to participate in a staged assassination attempt on a Romanian politician. As part of the plan, the two must themselves be murdered in order to make their target appear more powerful. But while their circumstances make them perfect fall guys, their lives are initially spared when the attack descends into chaos. Staying alive thereafter involves the two strangers working together to dodge both fellow conspirators and the police.', 'An ex-con suffering from terminal cancer and a suicidal ex-legionnaire are hired to participate in a staged assassination attempt on a Romanian politician. As part of the plan, the two must themselves be murdered in order to make their target appear more powerful. But while their circumstances make them perfect fall guys, their lives are initially spared when the attack descends into chaos. Staying alive thereafter involves the two strangers working together to dodge both fellow conspirators and the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5FCCyLTPnwlHG7UEeBHg0Jn73L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62086'),
  ('105852468327977952', 'Break Out', 2002, 'Comedy, Action', 'Son Hee Chang, Shin Hak-sung, Chang Hang-jun', 'Park Jung-woo', 'Kim Seung-woo, Cha Seung-won, Park Young-kyu, Kang Seong-jin, Lee Moon-sik, Kim Chae-yeon, Bae Joong-sik, Park Jae-hyeon', null, 'Bent on reclaiming a lighter which is his only possession, a broke man pursues the thief, who turns out to be a mob boss planning to hijack a train.', 'Bent on reclaiming a lighter which is his only possession, a broke man pursues the thief, who turns out to be a mob boss planning to hijack a train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlWAst6k4Qdy9lLZL439h5ZoiAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128039'),
  ('344616801007220603', 'Break Point', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas, Jim Frohna', 'Gene Hong, Jeremy Sisto', 'Amy Smart, J.K. Simmons, Adam Devine, Jeremy Sisto, David Walton, Chris Parnell, Kate Flannery, Jenny Wade', 'R', 'Jimmy Price is a reckless man-child on the last leg of his career as a doubles tennis player. When his latest partner drops him, he realizes he''s officially burned all of his bridges on the pro circuit. He decides to make one last ditch effort to revive his career, reaching outside of the tennis world and convincing his childhood partner -- his estranged brother Darren, now an apathetic substitute teacher - to team up with him. The mismatched pair, with the help of a unique 11-year-old named Barry, make an unlikely run at a grand slam tournament and are forced to re-discover their game, and their brotherhood.', 'Jimmy Price is a reckless man-child on the last leg of his career as a doubles tennis player. When his latest partner drops him, he realizes he''s officially burned all of his bridges on the pro circuit. He decides to make one last ditch effort to revive his career, reaching outside of the tennis world and convincing his childhood partner -- his estranged brother Darren, now an apathetic substitute teacher - to team up with him. The mismatched pair, with the help of a unique 11-year-old named Barry, make an unlikely run at a grand slam tournament and are forced to re-discover their game, and their brotherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJFAg3vc2s9aHV14CWirg3JNFOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250572'),
  ('47997433901913660', 'Break the Silence: The Movie', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Park Jun-soo', null, 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'K-pop sensation BTS embark on their 2019 ''Love Yourself: Speak Yourself'' Tour, as the seven members begin to candidly tell personal stories they have never voiced before.', 'K-pop sensation BTS embark on their 2019 ''Love Yourself: Speak Yourself'' Tour, as the seven members begin to candidly tell personal stories they have never voiced before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1VK2L971GmEevIjFbjcimxSeMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730647'),
  ('1043530620378482319', 'Break Through the Darkness', 2021, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Lü Yulai', 'Fan Jing, Jiang Lihua, Yue Xiaojun', 'Jiang Wu, Zhang Songwen, Jin Shijia, Li Qian, Zhao Yi, You Yongzhi, Liu Lin, Dong Borui', null, 'Film tells about Song Yirui, the leader of a certain anti-criminal task force, who led the team to conduct an in-depth investigation of a land acquisition case.', 'Film tells about Song Yirui, the leader of a certain anti-criminal task force, who led the team to conduct an in-depth investigation of a land acquisition case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7P8ZjqjnZkcsnABPwj8Mfy9yPgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821699'),
  ('402924569786446012', 'Break Up', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Enrico Maria Salerno, Eduardo Salerno, Nicola Salerno', 'Dino Maiuri, Enrico Maria Salerno, Giorgio Saviane', 'Ornella Muti, Tony Musante, Monica Guerritore, Mario Scaccia, Laura Trotter, Gerardo Amato, Umberto Benedetto, Enrico Bergier', null, 'Paolo has been reasonably happy for the past 10 years; he has a job at the university and has Sena as a lover all these years. When she suddenly decides to leave the relationship, it comes as a shock to him, and he desperately wants to know the reason.', 'Paolo has been reasonably happy for the past 10 years; he has a job at the university and has Sena as a lover all these years. When she suddenly decides to leave the relationship, it comes as a shock to him, and he desperately wants to know the reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMnxWF87khpNJ5fO0aPqYcKII11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73118'),
  ('221755657028839118', 'Break Up', 1998, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Paul Marcus, Hubert Taczanowski', 'Anne Amanda Opotowsky', 'Bridget Fonda, Kiefer Sutherland, Hart Bochner, Steven Weber, Penelope Ann Miller, Tippi Hedren, Leslie Stefanson, Anna Getty', 'R', 'Housewife Jimmy Dade stays with her violent husband, Frankie, even after his abuse leads to the loss of her hearing. When his car is found with an unidentifiable dead body inside, police officers John Box and Andrew Ramsey suspect Jimmy has killed him. But, after discovering her bank account has been emptied, Jimmy fears that Frankie is still alive, and she goes on the run -- with the police in pursuit.', 'Housewife Jimmy Dade stays with her violent husband, Frankie, even after his abuse leads to the loss of her hearing. When his car is found with an unidentifiable dead body inside, police officers John Box and Andrew Ramsey suspect Jimmy has killed him. But, after discovering her bank account has been emptied, Jimmy fears that Frankie is still alive, and she goes on the run -- with the police in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10VG3K8B0pJvtmpjQQIPgNVOAYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67849'),
  ('169971119219893023', 'Break Up Man', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Torsten Künstler, Bernhard Jasper', 'Doron Wisotzky', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Milan Peschel, Nadja Uhl, Anna Bederke, Heiner Lauterbach, Catherine de Léan, Genija Rykova, Gennadi Vengerov', null, 'BREAK UP MAN is an odd couple road movie and tells the story of Henri, who works for a break up agency in Berlin and on behalf of those who want to separate themselves from their future “ex”-partners. To complete his most important mission he is confronted with an unwanted partner, Toto, who spoils more or less everything and makes Henri’s life a nightmare.', 'BREAK UP MAN is an odd couple road movie and tells the story of Henri, who works for a break up agency in Berlin and on behalf of those who want to separate themselves from their future “ex”-partners. To complete his most important mission he is confronted with an unwanted partner, Toto, who spoils more or less everything and makes Henri’s life a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3b9tQFCfnCGFcM7kRKWJAZcw2qA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160085'),
  ('59071150958534215', 'Break Up the Dance', 1957, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Roman Polanski', 'Roman Polanski', null, null, 'Youths get ready for a party, decorating the dance floor, cleaning out the fountain of a pond. That evening, the party starts and guests arrive: everyone has a ticket, and a guy at the gate, wearing a formal shirt, tails, and shorts, makes sure only those with tickets gain entrance.', 'Youths get ready for a party, decorating the dance floor, cleaning out the fountain of a pond. That evening, the party starts and guests arrive: everyone has a ticket, and a guy at the gate, wearing a formal shirt, tails, and shorts, makes sure only those with tickets gain entrance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zh3onuSvSblHco5UfngTwjBn5pA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116459'),
  ('142070356871402041', 'Break-Out to the Unknown', 2018, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Kai Wessel', null, 'Fabian Busch, Sabine Palfi, Maria Simon, Michael Grimm, Naima Sebe, Maurice Carpede, Athena Strates, Ben Gertz', null, 'In the near future: Europe is in chaos. Right-wing extremists have taken power in many countries. The democratic state that once was Germany has become a totalitarian system that persecutes dissenters, Muslims and homosexuals. Jan Schneider has stood as a lawyer on the side of dispossessed victims. When he learns that the regime wants to jail him again, he decides to flee with his family. His goal is the South African Union, which enjoys political and economic stability after an economic boom. A freighter is to bring him, his wife Sarah and the two children Nora and Nick together with other refugees to Cape Town, but the tugs abandon their passengers in much too small boats off the coast of Namibia. On rough seas, it comes to disaster, the little Nick is lost, and no one knows if he could reach the shore...', 'In the near future: Europe is in chaos. Right-wing extremists have taken power in many countries. The democratic state that once was Germany has become a totalitarian system that persecutes dissenters, Muslims and homosexuals. Jan Schneider has stood as a lawyer on the side of dispossessed victims. When he learns that the regime wants to jail him again, he decides to flee with his family. His goal is the South African Union, which enjoys political and economic stability after an economic boom. A freighter is to bring him, his wife Sarah and the two children Nora and Nick together with other refugees to Cape Town, but the tugs abandon their passengers in much too small boats off the coast of Namibia. On rough seas, it comes to disaster, the little Nick is lost, and no one knows if he could reach the shore...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f090U3J5KXKyTBOmsVOtFbFksVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503985'),
  ('940660997507413829', 'Breakaway', 1967, 'Music', 'Bruce Conner', null, 'Toni Basil', null, 'Breakaway plays out like a visual symphony. A prototype for the best (but still, lesser) contemporary formalist music videos, like Peter Care’s “What’s the Frequency, Kenneth?” and “Drive” (both for REM), Conner’s movie is an experiment in the visual language of film. But no matter how powerful a formal analysis of his filmmaking process may be in suggesting how Conner’s rhythms affect us, there is much in Breakaway – in Basilotta’s brash and unbridled self-assertiveness, in Conner’s feverish camera style, and even in the uncomplicated honesty of Cobb’s catchy lyrics and tune – that defies verbalisation… and must simply be loved! -- Senses of Cinema', 'Breakaway plays out like a visual symphony. A prototype for the best (but still, lesser) contemporary formalist music videos, like Peter Care’s “What’s the Frequency, Kenneth?” and “Drive” (both for REM), Conner’s movie is an experiment in the visual language of film. But no matter how powerful a formal analysis of his filmmaking process may be in suggesting how Conner’s rhythms affect us, there is much in Breakaway – in Basilotta’s brash and unbridled self-assertiveness, in Conner’s feverish camera style, and even in the uncomplicated honesty of Cobb’s catchy lyrics and tune – that defies verbalisation… and must simply be loved! -- Senses of Cinema', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7l4VgOAReB80Mma2ISvxsZcOHM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132367'),
  ('570855932322350700', 'Breakaway', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hugues Hariche, Joseph Areddy, Benoît Monney', 'Hugues Hariche, Joanne Giger', 'Flavie Delangle, Sarah Bramms, Camille Rutherford, Clémence Till, Claude Fugère, Faustine Mathieu, Tom Nappiot, Guillaume Henry', null, 'After running away to try to find her father, Manon manages to free herself from this family bond and to rebuild herself in an unexpected way in order to reconnect with her dream: becoming a professional ice hockey player.', 'After running away to try to find her father, Manon manages to free herself from this family bond and to rebuild herself in an unexpected way in order to reconnect with her dream: becoming a professional ice hockey player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kScNJK24q2n7DD3OmaHtCx27qgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962314'),
  ('636686609172554123', 'Breakdown', 1997, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Jonathan Mostow, Douglas Milsome, Charles Simmers', 'Jonathan Mostow, Sam Montgomery', 'Kurt Russell, J.T. Walsh, Kathleen Quinlan, M.C. Gainey, Jack Noseworthy, Rex Linn, Ritch Brinkley, Moira Sinise', 'R', 'On their cross-country drive, a married couple, Jeff and Amy Taylor, experience car trouble after their SUV breaks down. Stranded in the New Mexico desert, the two catch a break when a passing truck driver offers Amy a ride to a nearby café to call for help. Meanwhile, Jeff is able to fix the car and make his way to the café, but Amy isn''t there. He tracks down the trucker ― who tells the police he''s never seen Jeff or his wife before. Jeff then begins a desperate, frenzied search for Amy.', 'On their cross-country drive, a married couple, Jeff and Amy Taylor, experience car trouble after their SUV breaks down. Stranded in the New Mexico desert, the two catch a break when a passing truck driver offers Amy a ride to a nearby café to call for help. Meanwhile, Jeff is able to fix the car and make his way to the café, but Amy isn''t there. He tracks down the trucker ― who tells the police he''s never seen Jeff or his wife before. Jeff then begins a desperate, frenzied search for Amy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3VB59ppr1RlpxNUYRUfZTgjgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2163'),
  ('658307508029755542', 'Breakdown: 1975', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Morgan Neville', null, 'Jodie Foster, Albert Brooks, Ellen Burstyn, Frank Rich, Martin Scorsese, Josh Brolin, Oliver Stone, James Risen', 'R', 'In 1975, as America faced social and political upheaval, filmmakers turned chaos into art.', 'In 1975, as America faced social and political upheaval, filmmakers turned chaos into art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LirpQnBmBpAOa5Me1lBCBBy90e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1584125'),
  ('921022982911646269', 'Breaker', 2017, 'Science Fiction', 'Philippe McKie', 'Philippe McKie', 'Allie Hanzawa, Kazuya Shimizu, Yuka Tomatsu', null, 'In tomorrow''s Tokyo, the technologically-enhanced body of a young mercenary hacker is overrun by a sentient data weapon. Wanted, the parasitic A.I becomes her only ally as she is chased across the city by those seeking to salvage it.', 'In tomorrow''s Tokyo, the technologically-enhanced body of a young mercenary hacker is overrun by a sentient data weapon. Wanted, the parasitic A.I becomes her only ally as she is chased across the city by those seeking to salvage it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WXKEzR4HbsMp2wXd5mMBsjgfK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463668'),
  ('147744403811586100', 'Breaker Morant', 1980, 'Drama, History, War', 'Bruce Beresford, Donald McAlpine', 'Jonathan Hardy, David Stevens, Bruce Beresford', 'Edward Woodward, Jack Thompson, John Waters, Bryan Brown, Charles Tingwell, Terence Donovan, Vincent Ball, Ray Meagher', 'PG', 'During the Boer War, three Australian lieutenants are on trial for shooting Boer prisoners. Though they acted under orders, they are being used as scapegoats by the General Staff, who hopes to distance themselves from the irregular practices of the war. The trial does not progress as smoothly as expected by the General Staff, as the defence puts up a strong fight in the courtroom.', 'During the Boer War, three Australian lieutenants are on trial for shooting Boer prisoners. Though they acted under orders, they are being used as scapegoats by the General Staff, who hopes to distance themselves from the irregular practices of the war. The trial does not progress as smoothly as expected by the General Staff, as the defence puts up a strong fight in the courtroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Nr46BDNjBtz3s0wRvm84eK3PXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13783'),
  ('775277817106929138', 'Breaker! Breaker!', 1977, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Don Hulette, Mario DiLeo', 'Terry Chambers', 'Chuck Norris, George Murdock, Terry O''Connor, Don Gentry, John Di Fusco, Ron Cedillos, Michael Augenstein, Jack Nance', 'PG', 'Truck driver searches for his brother, who has disappeared in a town run by a corrupt judge.', 'Truck driver searches for his brother, who has disappeared in a town run by a corrupt judge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfYp4WG1l4uk5eoUf3Iqe3knwZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19108'),
  ('1082261942906431582', 'Breakfast', 1974, 'Animation, Horror', 'Patrick Bokanowski', 'Patrick Bokanowski', 'Daniel Bard, Thierry Doublet, Josette Lassaque, Jacques Faure', null, 'Relentlessly reworking ‘real’ images, using techniques borrowed from painting and animated film, Patrick Bokanowski is an author of stature, capable of creating an insane and cataclysmic universe of unquestionable beauty.', 'Relentlessly reworking ‘real’ images, using techniques borrowed from painting and animated film, Patrick Bokanowski is an author of stature, capable of creating an insane and cataclysmic universe of unquestionable beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CLWoJyK0grodos6Cu499jVdoeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228442'),
  ('559843010344711522', 'Breakfast (Table-Top Dolly)', 1976, null, 'Michael Snow', null, null, null, 'A continuous zoom traverses the space of a breakfast table, serving as a grand metaphor for indigestion.', 'A continuous zoom traverses the space of a breakfast table, serving as a grand metaphor for indigestion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDGMjjhRi3P8zUc3hoM1xmnTFHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145336'),
  ('39771320687585308', 'Breakfast at Tiffany''s', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Blake Edwards, Franz Planer, William McGarry', 'George Axelrod', 'Audrey Hepburn, George Peppard, Patricia Neal, Buddy Ebsen, Martin Balsam, José Luis de Vilallonga, John McGiver, Alan Reed', 'NR', 'Holly Golightly is an eccentric New York City playgirl determined to marry a Brazilian millionaire. But when young writer Paul Varjak moves into her apartment building, her past threatens to get in their way.', 'Holly Golightly is an eccentric New York City playgirl determined to marry a Brazilian millionaire. But when young writer Paul Varjak moves into her apartment building, her past threatens to get in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79xm4gXw4l7A5D0XukUOJRocFYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164'),
  ('557822849941515394', 'Breakfast for Two', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alfred Santell, J. Roy Hunt, Alfred Herman', 'Charles Kaufman, Paul Yawitz, Viola Brothers Shore', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Herbert Marshall, Glenda Farrell, Eric Blore, Donald Meek, Etienne Girardot, Frank M. Thomas, Pierre Watkin', 'NR', 'After a night on the town, Jonathan Blair wakes to find that Texan Valentine Ransome has escorted him home. Valentine is attracted to Jonathan and sets out first to reform him, and his family''s near-bankrupt shipping company, and then to marry him. In her way is Jonathan''s fiancée, actress Carol Wallace.', 'After a night on the town, Jonathan Blair wakes to find that Texan Valentine Ransome has escorted him home. Valentine is attracted to Jonathan and sets out first to reform him, and his family''s near-bankrupt shipping company, and then to marry him. In her way is Jonathan''s fiancée, actress Carol Wallace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amtKYOhdWh0jxQtRJdciPZOrwvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83240'),
  ('994526412002441803', 'Breakfast of Champions', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Elliot Davis, Alan Rudolph', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Bruce Willis, Albert Finney, Nick Nolte, Barbara Hershey, Glenne Headly, Lukas Haas, Omar Epps, Vicki Lewis', 'R', 'A millionaire car salesman who runs the biggest dealership in Midland City, Dwayne Hoover is a celebrity, loved and trusted by everyone. Then one day, he wakes up and realizes that his life is a total mess! But between the headaches posed by his pill-popping wife, a mistress who won''t leave him alone, and a cross-dressing sales manager, Dwayne has picked a bad week for a midlife crisis.', 'A millionaire car salesman who runs the biggest dealership in Midland City, Dwayne Hoover is a celebrity, loved and trusted by everyone. Then one day, he wakes up and realizes that his life is a total mess! But between the headaches posed by his pill-popping wife, a mistress who won''t leave him alone, and a cross-dressing sales manager, Dwayne has picked a bad week for a midlife crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uNVeZNt7qxDWLJAZ0PER03WtKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12479'),
  ('175259426351458551', 'Breakfast on Pluto', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Neil Jordan, Declan Quinn', 'Pat McCabe, Neil Jordan', 'Cillian Murphy, Stephen Rea, Brendan Gleeson, Liam Neeson, Eva Birthistle, Ruth Negga, Laurence Kinlan, Bryan Ferry', 'R', 'In the 1970s, a young transgender woman called “Kitten” leaves her small Irish town for London in search of love, acceptance, and her long-lost mother.', 'In the 1970s, a young transgender woman called “Kitten” leaves her small Irish town for London in search of love, acceptance, and her long-lost mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14tmdb1PiLNDZf3VD29S2nUKVV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1420'),
  ('18170454918231830', 'Breakfast on the Grass', 1987, 'Animation', 'Siiri Suur, Merle Rajandu, Priit Pärn', 'Priit Pärn', 'Aarne Üksküla, Maria Klenskaja, Jüri Krjukov, Karl Kalkun, Maile Hiiet', null, 'Several episodes, each focusing on a different figure. Towards the end they all come together to replicate the famous painting by Édouard Manet that provides the title.', 'Several episodes, each focusing on a different figure. Towards the end they all come together to replicate the famous painting by Édouard Manet that provides the title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KP73Edre1vunOrjZJsID52Zbxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85410'),
  ('893569438944433005', 'Breakfast with Hunter', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Wayne Ewing', null, 'Hunter S. Thompson, Matt Dillon, John Cusack, Benicio del Toro, Terry Gilliam, Johnny Depp', null, 'Breakfast with Hunter is a feature length documentary starring the infamous outlaw journalist Dr. Hunter S. Thompson. Edited by director Wayne Ewing from cinema verite film and digital video that he shot over many years on the road with Dr. Thompson, Breakfast with Hunter follows several story lines in the trials (literally) and triumphs of this cultural icon who created his own genre of writing - Gonzo journalism.', 'Breakfast with Hunter is a feature length documentary starring the infamous outlaw journalist Dr. Hunter S. Thompson. Edited by director Wayne Ewing from cinema verite film and digital video that he shot over many years on the road with Dr. Thompson, Breakfast with Hunter follows several story lines in the trials (literally) and triumphs of this cultural icon who created his own genre of writing - Gonzo journalism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78kYQQZ1tTK4oXlI1P1PxLQJbFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39848'),
  ('493062715832276206', 'Breakfast with Scot', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Laurie Lynd, David A. Makin', 'Sean Reycraft', 'Tom Cavanagh, Ben Shenkman, Noah Bernett, Benz Antoine, Jeananne Goossen, Graham Greene, Travis Ferris, Fiona Reid', null, 'The lives of Eric, an ex hockey player, and his partner Sam, are thrown into turmoil when they are forced to take in Scot, a flamboyant 11-year-old.', 'The lives of Eric, an ex hockey player, and his partner Sam, are thrown into turmoil when they are forced to take in Scot, a flamboyant 11-year-old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Awq2OLMA56LNvs7wMhOdkpyqiy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16240'),
  ('337471038564813829', 'Breakheart Pass', 1975, 'Thriller, Western, Mystery', 'Tom Gries, Lucien Ballard, Kim Swados', 'Alistair MacLean', 'Charles Bronson, Ben Johnson, Richard Crenna, Jill Ireland, Charles Durning, Ed Lauter, Bill McKinney, David Huddleston', null, 'At the height of the frontier era, a train races through the Rocky Mountains on a classified mission to a remote army post. But one by one the passengers are being murdered, and their only hope is the mysterious John Deakin, who''s being transported to face trial for murder.', 'At the height of the frontier era, a train races through the Rocky Mountains on a classified mission to a remote army post. But one by one the passengers are being murdered, and their only hope is the mysterious John Deakin, who''s being transported to face trial for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li6BdgpVeMsgIjDugiVfHJGwPTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8043'),
  ('772231828429748550', 'Breakin''', 1984, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Joel Silberg, Hanania Baer', 'Gerald Scaife', 'Lucinda Dickey, Adolfo Quinones, Michael Chambers, Ben Lokey, Christopher McDonald, Phineas Newborn III, Ice-T, Bruno Falcon', 'PG', 'A struggling young dancer joins forces with two breakdancers and together they become a street sensation.', 'A struggling young dancer joins forces with two breakdancers and together they become a street sensation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwIqaI4yXKDlRurc9zTrgavMrFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15259'),
  ('271721810223915952', 'Breakin'' 2: Electric Boogaloo', 1984, 'Drama, Music', 'Sam Firstenberg, Karen Grossman, Hanania Baer', 'Jan Ventura, Julie Reichert, Charles Parker', 'Lucinda Dickey, Adolfo Quinones, Michael Chambers, Susie Coelho, Harry Caesar, Jo De Winter, John Christy Ewing, Steve Notario', 'PG', 'The dance crew from "Breakin''" bands together to save a community center from a greedy developer bent on building a shopping center in its place.', 'The dance crew from "Breakin''" bands together to save a community center from a greedy developer bent on building a shopping center in its place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RV0NNZ8p3XcdVnrr8bLILuH1x9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17464'),
  ('517187478676020543', 'Breakin'' All the Rules', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daniel Taplitz, David Hennings, Todd Amateau', 'Daniel Taplitz', 'Jamie Foxx, Morris Chestnut, Gabrielle Union, Peter MacNicol, Jennifer Esposito, Bianca Lawson, Jill Ritchie, Heather Headley', 'PG-13', 'After being dumped by his model girlfriend, aspiring writer Quincy Watson quits his job and is inspired to pen the ultimate how-to book on breaking up. When it becomes a smash bestseller, he starts giving his player cousin, Evan, choice tips on how to win the battle of the sexes. But when Evan''s beautiful girlfriend Nikki gets wind of the plan, it''s these players that end up getting played.', 'After being dumped by his model girlfriend, aspiring writer Quincy Watson quits his job and is inspired to pen the ultimate how-to book on breaking up. When it becomes a smash bestseller, he starts giving his player cousin, Evan, choice tips on how to win the battle of the sexes. But when Evan''s beautiful girlfriend Nikki gets wind of the plan, it''s these players that end up getting played.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piEqcDe7CTbxxPUSwswrsoKWzMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16428'),
  ('1085449576066961893', 'Breaking', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Doug Emmett, Josh Montes, Abi Damaris Corbin', 'Abi Damaris Corbin, Kwame Kwei-Armah', 'John Boyega, Michael Kenneth Williams, Nicole Beharie, Connie Britton, Selenis Leyva, Jeffrey Donovan, Olivia Washington, London Covington', 'PG-13', 'Desperate for money and running out of options, Marine veteran Brian Brown-Easley holds several people hostage inside a bank, setting the stage for a tense confrontation with police.', 'Desperate for money and running out of options, Marine veteran Brian Brown-Easley holds several people hostage inside a bank, setting the stage for a tense confrontation with police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKbgbzJbVM7MLjN7EwdO1QcIXCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801965'),
  ('256445497863517066', 'Breaking & Exiting', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Hamilton, Peter Facinelli', 'Jordan Danger', 'Milo Gibson, Jordan Danger, Adam Huber, Joaquim de Almeida, Justine Wachsberger, James Kyson, Lily Anne Harrison, Cecile Cubiló', null, 'Harry, a charming house thief, gets more than he bargains for during an attempted burglary when he stumbles upon Daisy and decides to save her from herself, sending both of them into a darkly comedic journey of self discovery and love.', 'Harry, a charming house thief, gets more than he bargains for during an attempted burglary when he stumbles upon Daisy and decides to save her from herself, sending both of them into a darkly comedic journey of self discovery and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucZnGl4GJoTuIoJV2cX74k0WfK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533550'),
  ('642184401271855312', 'Breaking All the Rules', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Orr, René Verzier', 'Edith Rey, David Preston', 'Carl Marotte, Carolyn Dunn, Thor Bishopric, Rachel Hayward, Michael Rudder, Pierre-Andre LaRoque, Papusha Demitro, Vlasta Vrana', 'R', 'Three robbers hide a stolen jewel inside a stuffed animal at one of the midway games in an amusement park. When Jack—a teen with a part-time summer job in the park—his best friend David and two girls hang out at the park, they get mixed up in the robbers'' scheme to take back their jewel.', 'Three robbers hide a stolen jewel inside a stuffed animal at one of the midway games in an amusement park. When Jack—a teen with a part-time summer job in the park—his best friend David and two girls hang out at the park, they get mixed up in the robbers'' scheme to take back their jewel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K0ZjTX6IjTcpFlaF12Yx51CJ9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44672'),
  ('995444093281205847', 'Breaking and Entering', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anthony Minghella, Benoît Delhomme, Simon Finney', 'Anthony Minghella', 'Jude Law, Juliette Binoche, Vera Farmiga, Robin Wright, Martin Freeman, Rafi Gavron, Poppy Rogers, Ray Winstone', 'R', 'Set in a blighted, inner-city neighbourhood of London, Breaking and Entering examines an affair which unfolds between a successful British landscape architect and Amira, a Bosnian woman – the mother of a troubled teen son – who was widowed by the war in Bosnia and Herzegovina.', 'Set in a blighted, inner-city neighbourhood of London, Breaking and Entering examines an affair which unfolds between a successful British landscape architect and Amira, a Bosnian woman – the mother of a troubled teen son – who was widowed by the war in Bosnia and Herzegovina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VZWsOQGbxfPuqMBcLaQLxNvLzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1253'),
  ('123757027734004100', 'Breaking and Re-entering', 2024, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wang Ding-Lin, Hong Shi-hao, Garvin Chan', 'Hui-Chu Wang, Yu-Fang Wen, Wang Ding-Lin', 'Chen Bolin, Cecilia Choi, Kent Tsai, JC Lin, Frederick Lee, Wu Kang-ren, Ven Kao, McFly Wu', null, 'Double-crossed after a bank heist, a team of professional thieves attempts an even more challenging mission: returning the money they stole.', 'Double-crossed after a bank heist, a team of professional thieves attempts an even more challenging mission: returning the money they stole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPn85RMPzt8S2SiAxKAFOpzMp2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1166073'),
  ('244040138512627676', 'Breaking Away', 1979, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Yates, Matthew F. Leonetti, Michael Grillo', 'Steve Tesich', 'Dennis Christopher, Dennis Quaid, Daniel Stern, Jackie Earle Haley, Barbara Barrie, Paul Dooley, Robyn Douglass, Hart Bochner', 'PG', 'Dave, nineteen, has just graduated high school, with his three friends: the comical Cyril, the warm hearted but short-tempered Moocher, and the athletic, spiteful but good-hearted Mike. Now, Dave enjoys racing bikes and hopes to race the Italians one day, and even takes up the Italian culture, much to his friends'' and parents'' annoyance.', 'Dave, nineteen, has just graduated high school, with his three friends: the comical Cyril, the warm hearted but short-tempered Moocher, and the athletic, spiteful but good-hearted Mike. Now, Dave enjoys racing bikes and hopes to race the Italians one day, and even takes up the Italian culture, much to his friends'' and parents'' annoyance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7b5GsVJK1hfdwoYqcczN9pBba6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20283'),
  ('882485624253814826', 'Breaking Boundaries: The Science of Our Planet', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Jonathan Clay, Shannon Wilson-McClinton', null, 'David Attenborough, Johan Rockström, Elena Bennett, Jason Box, Terry Hughes, Maria Neira, Anne Larigauderie, Cheikh Mbow', 'PG', 'David Attenborough and scientist Johan Rockström examine Earth''s biodiversity collapse and how this crisis can still be averted.', 'David Attenborough and scientist Johan Rockström examine Earth''s biodiversity collapse and how this crisis can still be averted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRs7kdlw06DVkxOVidWloqZ3HCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828146'),
  ('28897504714300287', 'Breaking Dawn', 2004, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Mark Edwin Robinson', 'Mark Edwin Robinson', 'Kelly Overton, James Haven, Sarah-Jane Potts, Hank Harris, Edie McClurg, Isaac C. Singleton, Jr., Diane Venora, Kathryn Joosten', 'R', 'Within the confines of an insane asylum languish many would-be seers and messiahs. Medical students meet them day in, day out. But when Eve meets Don Wake, she discovers he''s not your run-of-the-mill paranoic. In fact, his visions of her life on the outside tread the line between fantasy and reality as a stalker becomes known to her. She could be in danger; it could all be in her head.', 'Within the confines of an insane asylum languish many would-be seers and messiahs. Medical students meet them day in, day out. But when Eve meets Don Wake, she discovers he''s not your run-of-the-mill paranoic. In fact, his visions of her life on the outside tread the line between fantasy and reality as a stalker becomes known to her. She could be in danger; it could all be in her head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nK89Nb7qHXEp1scxlJdoCywTdnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32707'),
  ('453725425144413415', 'Breaking Fast', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mike Mosallam, Anka Malatynska, Tineka Becker', 'Mike Mosallam', 'Haaz Sleiman, Michael Cassidy, Veronica Cartwright, Patrick Sabongui, Aline Elasmar, Diane Sellers, Amin El Gamal, Brian Dare', null, 'Mo, a practicing Muslim living in West Hollywood, is learning to navigate life post heartbreak. Enter Kal, an All-American guy who surprises Mo by offering to break fast with him during the holy month of Ramadan.', 'Mo, a practicing Muslim living in West Hollywood, is learning to navigate life post heartbreak. Enter Kal, an All-American guy who surprises Mo by offering to break fast with him during the holy month of Ramadan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RoiHMzCeWXqL0kvM1UP6UxU9nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680880'),
  ('950745195587667535', 'Breaking Glass', 1980, 'Music, Drama', 'Brian Gibson, Stephen Goldblatt', 'Brian Gibson', 'Hazel O''Connor, Phil Daniels, Jon Finch, Jonathan Pryce, Peter-Hugo Daly, Mark Wingett, Gary Tibbs, Charles Wegner', 'PG', 'Breaking Glass is the story of punk singer Kate and her meteoric rise to stardom. Starting out in the rock pubs of London, Kate, assisted by her manager Danny, becomes a huge star overnight. Once at the top the pressure is immense as Kate''s band are squeezed out and she is left to cope alone in the spotlight.', 'Breaking Glass is the story of punk singer Kate and her meteoric rise to stardom. Starting out in the rock pubs of London, Kate, assisted by her manager Danny, becomes a huge star overnight. Once at the top the pressure is immense as Kate''s band are squeezed out and she is left to cope alone in the spotlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zUj2uAPqx45hGMZk66CMHpmoe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26803'),
  ('380145571511374055', 'Breaking Glass: The Pat Summitt Story', 2026, 'Documentary, Sport', 'Dawn Porter', null, 'Pat Summitt, Peyton Manning, Tamika Catchings, Billie Jean King, Dawn Staley', 'PG', 'Profiles the extraordinary women''s college basketball coach who forever changed the game, and whose boundary-breaking career impacted far beyond the court.', 'Profiles the extraordinary women''s college basketball coach who forever changed the game, and whose boundary-breaking career impacted far beyond the court.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FCk1ZHDTgOAQt1ZQl4FOHYYIQsz.jpg', 'plex:movie:breaking-glass-the-pat-summitt-story-2026'),
  ('797613306229001273', 'Breaking Horizons', 2012, 'Drama', 'Pola Beck', 'Burkhardt Wunderlich', 'Aylin Tezel, Henrike von Kuick, Tómas Lemarquis, Godehard Giese, Marion Mitterhammer, Lutz Blochberger, Kai Michael Müller, Marie-Lou Sellem', null, '“Congratulations, you’re pregnant!” Lara can hardly believe what the doctor has just told her. The 25-year-old spends her nights hanging around Berlin with best friend Nora, having lost interest in her architectural studies long ago. She has no idea what to do with her life – she does a lot, but nothing properly. She now finds herself pregnant after a night of passion with a charming barman she met at a party. Nora is thrilled by the news though, proclaiming: “we’re having a baby!” After some initial doubts, Lara too begins to see her pregnancy as a chance. Together with Nora, she sets about painting the nursery and goes in search of the baby’s father. Then the gynaecologist gives Lara some bad news…', '“Congratulations, you’re pregnant!” Lara can hardly believe what the doctor has just told her. The 25-year-old spends her nights hanging around Berlin with best friend Nora, having lost interest in her architectural studies long ago. She has no idea what to do with her life – she does a lot, but nothing properly. She now finds herself pregnant after a night of passion with a charming barman she met at a party. Nora is thrilled by the news though, proclaiming: “we’re having a baby!” After some initial doubts, Lara too begins to see her pregnancy as a chance. Together with Nora, she sets about painting the nursery and goes in search of the baby’s father. Then the gynaecologist gives Lara some bad news…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpUfhQRDyxfCoMBSp2pAZRQRSB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130641'),
  ('654217730694984580', 'Breaking In', 1989, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Bill Forsyth, Michael Coulter', 'John Sayles', 'Burt Reynolds, Casey Siemaszko, Sheila Kelley, Lorraine Toussaint, Albert Salmi, Harry Carey, Jr., Maury Chaykin, Stephen Tobolowsky', 'R', 'Professional thief Ernie takes Mike on as an apprentice, but while Mike clearly has "larceny in his heart", it will take him a long time to get as good as Ernie.', 'Professional thief Ernie takes Mike on as an apprentice, but while Mike clearly has "larceny in his heart", it will take him a long time to get as good as Ernie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73Ge3aqdj577nLkFmGetFtOlB8n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69828'),
  ('793299366426718974', 'Breaking In', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'James McTeigue, Aldric La''Auli Porter, Lillian Awa', 'Ryan Engle', 'Gabrielle Union, Billy Burke, Richard Cabral, Ajiona Alexus, Levi Meaden, Seth Carr, Mark Furze, Jason George', 'PG-13', 'Shaun Russell takes her son and daughter on a weekend getaway to her late father''s secluded, high-tech vacation home in the countryside. The family soon gets an unwelcome surprise when four men break into the house to find hidden money. After managing to escape, Shaun must now figure out a way to turn the tables on the desperate thieves and save her captive children.', 'Shaun Russell takes her son and daughter on a weekend getaway to her late father''s secluded, high-tech vacation home in the countryside. The family soon gets an unwelcome surprise when four men break into the house to find hidden money. After managing to escape, Shaun must now figure out a way to turn the tables on the desperate thieves and save her captive children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuCxJwcQOEKYoiHTgcf4em8TxWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497814'),
  ('1003434582998796603', 'Breaking News', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung, Yuen Bun', 'Yip Tin-Shing, Chan Hing-Kai', 'Kelly Chen, Richie Jen, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Lam Suet, Simon Yam, You Yongzhi, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Maggie Shiu', null, 'After a disastrous failure to stop a robber gang, the police attempt to redeem themselves through a series of publicity stunts and shootouts.', 'After a disastrous failure to stop a robber gang, the police attempt to redeem themselves through a series of publicity stunts and shootouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trPz3zKnEMhe4VQ9nAKWzzCWNXX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12543'),
  ('803217142011612859', 'Breaking News in Yuba County', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Joe Landry, Christina Alexandra Voros, Cleta Elaine Ellington', 'Amanda Idoko', 'Allison Janney, Mila Kunis, Regina Hall, Awkwafina, Wanda Sykes, Ellen Barkin, Matthew Modine, Jimmi Simpson', 'R', 'An overlooked pencil-pusher catches her husband in bed with another woman, the shock of which causes him to die of a heart attack. So she buries his body and takes advantage of the growing celebrity status that comes from having a missing husband. But she quickly finds herself in over her head, dodging cops and criminals, all while trying to keep the truth from her sister, a local news anchor who’s desperate for a story.', 'An overlooked pencil-pusher catches her husband in bed with another woman, the shock of which causes him to die of a heart attack. So she buries his body and takes advantage of the growing celebrity status that comes from having a missing husband. But she quickly finds herself in over her head, dodging cops and criminals, all while trying to keep the truth from her sister, a local news anchor who’s desperate for a story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMyCYtgfBmMisX3RFc5eH6zIV5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556867'),
  ('209053207878839452', 'Breaking Olympia: The Phil Heath Story', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Brett Harvey, Brett Harvey', 'Brett Harvey', 'Phil Heath, Dwayne Johnson, Jay Cutler, Kai Greene, Brandon Curry, Ronnie Coleman, Dexter Jackson', 'NR', 'Follow the extraordinary life story of 7-time Mr. Olympia, Phil Heath, as he rises through the ranks, battles the scrutiny of the media and takes on body building’s scariest foes in an attempt to reclaim the throne of Mr. Olympia and cement his legacy as one of the greatest bodybuilders to ever walk the earth.', 'Follow the extraordinary life story of 7-time Mr. Olympia, Phil Heath, as he rises through the ranks, battles the scrutiny of the media and takes on body building’s scariest foes in an attempt to reclaim the throne of Mr. Olympia and cement his legacy as one of the greatest bodybuilders to ever walk the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpUCaLaf5xjuM0OmPJWOPf1wrow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201117'),
  ('472985117172123335', 'Breaking Out', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Lind Lagerlöf, Jens Fischer, Kristina Kjellin', 'Malin Lind Lagerlöf', 'Björn Kjellman, Peter Haber, Viveka Seldahl, Thomas Hanzon, Oliver Loftéen, Göran Ragnerstam, Michael Nyqvist, Shanti Roney', null, 'The enthusiastic Reine is forced to take a job as a social worker at Kumla prison.', 'The enthusiastic Reine is forced to take a job as a social worker at Kumla prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAkO326MnSo8844f7rZmwJY092o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49940'),
  ('1064028532574682324', 'Breaking Point', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Rémy Chevrin, Justine Niel, Baptiste Bonin', 'Yvan Attal, Yaël Langmann, Eric Assous', 'Yvan Attal, Maïwenn, Guillaume Canet, Marie-Josée Croze, Alma Jodorowsky, Victor Belmondo, Michaël Erpelding, Loan Visioli', null, 'Mathieu owes everything to his friend Vincent : his house, his job, and even his life, ten years ago. With their wives, they are an inseparable quartet, and live the easy life on the French Riviera. But Mathieu discovers Vincent is cheating on his wife.', 'Mathieu owes everything to his friend Vincent : his house, his job, and even his life, ten years ago. With their wives, they are an inseparable quartet, and live the easy life on the French Riviera. But Mathieu discovers Vincent is cheating on his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMfzNO3lpATB5mxc8D06PR9T2nO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037827'),
  ('216128115064026334', 'Breaking Surface', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Joachim Hedén, Anna Patarakina', 'Joachim Hedén', 'Moa Gammel, Madeleine Martin, Lena Hope, Trine Wiggen, Maja Söderström, Olle Wirenhed, Jitse Jonathan Buitnik, Irma Hallberg', null, 'Two Swedish/Norwegian half sisters go on a winter diving trip in Northern Norway, when they get trapped after a rockslide.', 'Two Swedish/Norwegian half sisters go on a winter diving trip in Northern Norway, when they get trapped after a rockslide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlOvKg5WkXcwcmqy2KaiXoXLAky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616803'),
  ('878155188367048398', 'Breaking the Code', 1996, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Herbert Wise, Robin Vidgeon', 'Hugh Whitemore', 'Derek Jacobi, Alun Armstrong, Blake Ritson, Prunella Scales, Harold Pinter, Julian Kerridge, Richard Johnson, Amanda Root', null, 'A biography of the English mathematician Alan Turing, who was one of the inventors of the digital computer and one of the key figures in the breaking of the Enigma code, used by the Germans to send secret orders to their U-boats in World War II. Turing was also a homosexual in Britain at a time when this was illegal, besides being a security risk.', 'A biography of the English mathematician Alan Turing, who was one of the inventors of the digital computer and one of the key figures in the breaking of the Enigma code, used by the Germans to send secret orders to their U-boats in World War II. Turing was also a homosexual in Britain at a time when this was illegal, besides being a security risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOmQ19Kzw4U3rmqW9lBmfdAMFqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90755'),
  ('944996522445246866', 'Breaking the Girls', 2013, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jamie Babbit, Jeffrey Waldron', 'Guinevere Turner', 'Agnes Bruckner, Madeline Zima, Shawn Ashmore, Shanna Collins, Kate Levering, John Stockwell, Melanie Mayron, Tiya Sircar', 'NR', 'A naive college student loses a scholarship at the hands of a classmate and makes a pact with a mysterious friend to kill off each other''s enemies.', 'A naive college student loses a scholarship at the hands of a classmate and makes a pact with a mysterious friend to kill off each other''s enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uS5zSDRhSzdghcLP8bZOZcOURl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136850'),
  ('455042891068574575', 'Breaking the Limits', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'Piotr Sobociński Jr., Łukasz Palkowski, Jan Belina Brzozowski', 'Agatha Dominik, Maciej Karpiński', 'Jakub Gierszał, Kamila Kamińska, Anna Próchniak, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Janusz Gajos, Artur Żmijewski, Magdalena Cielecka, Adam Woronowicz', null, 'Based on true events. In 1980s Poland, Jerzy Górski is a young man who finds the determination to struggle against his drug addiction through athletic training, with the aim of competing in the US Ironman Triathlon.', 'Based on true events. In 1980s Poland, Jerzy Górski is a young man who finds the determination to struggle against his drug addiction through athletic training, with the aim of competing in the US Ironman Triathlon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9ZwoLW1sD2DST53lAQAE8Fog0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470360'),
  ('125745385402623041', 'Breaking the Rules', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Neal Israel, James Hayman, Matthew Carlisle', 'Paul W. Shapiro', 'Jason Bateman, C. Thomas Howell, Jonathan Silverman, Annie Potts, Krista Tesreau, Shawn Phelan, Jackey Vinson, Marty Belafsky', 'PG-13', 'Two friends take their dying buddy on one last road trip.', 'Two friends take their dying buddy on one last road trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1LL8Guqz4MqTl1R9y2IiKxnMuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180162'),
  ('374357276511381536', 'Breaking the Silence', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jérôme Cornuau', 'Raphaëlle Roudaut', 'Caroline Anglade, Clovis Cornillac, Noam Halegua, Alice David, Samira Lachhab, Farid Bentoumi, Rémi Pedevilla, Lilou Fogli', null, 'When Marina crosses the door of the police station, it''s because she has finally found the courage to file a complaint against her ex-partner for rape.', 'When Marina crosses the door of the police station, it''s because she has finally found the courage to file a complaint against her ex-partner for rape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KZfxKsJDeDmKe1zmX2HegOZ7oC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978008'),
  ('218695606267699598', 'Breaking the Silence: The Maria Soledad Case', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Lorena Muñoz', null, null, 'PG-13', 'In ''90s Argentina, the murder of a high school student sparks widespread protests. Retold by her loved ones, this documentary shows their fight for justice.', 'In ''90s Argentina, the murder of a high school student sparks widespread protests. Retold by her loved ones, this documentary shows their fight for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cbUELk2kQw5QqETOvJ26D3V9TZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362480'),
  ('885902398921621805', 'Breaking the Surface', 2006, 'Drama', 'Felicitas Korn, Kay Gauditz', 'Felicitas Korn', 'Henriette Heinze, Golo Euler, Sabine Bach, Wolfgang Packhäuser, Till Trenkel, Patrick Güldenberg, Claire Oelkers, Marcus Morlinghaus', null, 'Having just landed a gig with a trendy magazine, young photographer Nadja celebrates at the local disco, where she bumps into Darius, a 20-year-old skateboarder. Although her frankness at first scares him, the two quickly become a couple, and as their intoxicating affair takes off, they seem like passionate soul mates. Soon, however, career demands and emotional intensity gradually put a strain on their rapport, and things turn even more complicated...', 'Having just landed a gig with a trendy magazine, young photographer Nadja celebrates at the local disco, where she bumps into Darius, a 20-year-old skateboarder. Although her frankness at first scares him, the two quickly become a couple, and as their intoxicating affair takes off, they seem like passionate soul mates. Soon, however, career demands and emotional intensity gradually put a strain on their rapport, and things turn even more complicated...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPB609vfOSIn4bFceyErf03mUFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65442'),
  ('1019297324111257195', 'Breaking the Surface: The Greg Louganis Story', 1997, 'Drama', 'Steven Hilliard Stern, Michael Slovis', 'Alan Haines', 'Mario López, Michael Murphy, Jeffrey Meek, Rosemary Dunsmore, Aki Aleong, Bruce Weitz, Patrick David, Megan Leitch', null, 'Breaking the Surface is about the tough times Greg Louganis had on his way to becoming one of the world''s top Olympic divers.', 'Breaking the Surface is about the tough times Greg Louganis had on his way to becoming one of the world''s top Olympic divers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeBZIb36gkOV808JbhAEk2iVkHJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61382'),
  ('619230050617928686', 'Breaking the Taboo', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Fernando Grostein Andrade, Fernando Grostein Andrade, Rafael Levy', 'Fernando Grostein Andrade, Ilona Szabó de Carvalho, Thomaz Souto Corrêa', 'Richard Nixon, Ronald Reagan, Fernando Henrique Cardoso, Vitor Onofre, Allan Turnowski, Carlos Oliveira, Dráuzio Varella, Bill Clinton', null, 'Narrated by Morgan Freeman, this groundbreaking new documentary uncovers the UN sanctioned war on drugs, charting its origins and its devastating impact on countries like the USA, Colombia and Russia. Featuring prominent statesmen including Presidents Clinton and Carter, the film follows The Global Commission on Drug Policy on a mission to break the political taboo and expose the biggest failure of global policy in the last 50 years', 'Narrated by Morgan Freeman, this groundbreaking new documentary uncovers the UN sanctioned war on drugs, charting its origins and its devastating impact on countries like the USA, Colombia and Russia. Featuring prominent statesmen including Presidents Clinton and Carter, the film follows The Global Commission on Drug Policy on a mission to break the political taboo and expose the biggest failure of global policy in the last 50 years', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOpX1BZwvyrQ0ZpijcXHLvVfRAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79893'),
  ('360430065370802835', 'Breaking the Waves', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robby Müller, Lars von Trier, Kristoffer Nyholm', 'David Pirie, Peter Asmussen, Lars von Trier', 'Emily Watson, Stellan Skarsgård, Katrin Cartlidge, Jean-Marc Barr, Adrian Rawlins, Jonathan Hackett, Sandra Voe, Udo Kier', 'R', 'In a small, conservative Scottish village, an oilman is paralyzed in an accident. His wife, who prayed for his return, feels guilty; even more, when he urges her to have sex with another.', 'In a small, conservative Scottish village, an oilman is paralyzed in an accident. His wife, who prayed for his return, feels guilty; even more, when he urges her to have sex with another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQWMcdHXUOSHtr7ypOCa5T79JMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145'),
  ('705613561174382403', 'Breaking Through', 2015, 'Music, Drama', 'John Swetnam, Jonathan Hall, Milton Kingsley Cheng', 'John Swetnam', 'Sophia Aguiar, Robert Roldan, Jordan Rodrigues, Julie Warner, Shaun Brown, Larry Bourgeois, Laurent Bourgeois, Lindsey Stirling', null, 'When Casey, a dancer who is discovered on YouTube, gets thrust into the modern world of internet celebrity and culture, she must find a way to balance her true identity with her online persona, or risk losing everything she cares about.', 'When Casey, a dancer who is discovered on YouTube, gets thrust into the modern world of internet celebrity and culture, she must find a way to balance her true identity with her online persona, or risk losing everything she cares about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DjDNtuMX0Jc6kofURN0ENAtUG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254800'),
  ('78200155810136582', 'Breaking Up', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Robert Greenwald, Mauro Fiore', 'Michael Cristofer', 'Russell Crowe, Salma Hayek Pinault, Abraham Alvarez, Carlo Corazon, Marty Granger, Mary Ann Schmidt', 'R', 'An aloof, struggling food photographer thinks he has found true love with a fiery grade-school teacher. At first, the relationship is all wine and roses, but as they realize they have little in common besides great sex, the romance wanes, and they struggle through a succession of break-ups and reunions as they try to work things out.', 'An aloof, struggling food photographer thinks he has found true love with a fiery grade-school teacher. At first, the relationship is all wine and roses, but as they realize they have little in common besides great sex, the romance wanes, and they struggle through a succession of break-ups and reunions as they try to work things out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWOQOOAvwDA3KbDCSQH3NoBgimc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26393'),
  ('309758369239631208', 'Breaking Up in Rome', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Alessandro Casale, Edoardo Leo, Fabio Zamarion', 'Edoardo Leo, Damiano Bruè, Lisa Riccardi', 'Edoardo Leo, Marta Nieto, Claudia Gerini, Stefano Fresi, Gigio Morra, Paola Sotgiu, Esther Ortega, Anna Dalton', null, 'Aspiring writer Tommaso makes a living by penning the self-help column of a women''s magazine. One day he receives a letter from a reader asking for advice on how to break up with her man: it is none other than Zoe, his partner of ten years, unaware of his pseudonymous side job. Tommaso can''t believe his eyes and answers her in private to learn more.', 'Aspiring writer Tommaso makes a living by penning the self-help column of a women''s magazine. One day he receives a letter from a reader asking for advice on how to break up with her man: it is none other than Zoe, his partner of ten years, unaware of his pseudonymous side job. Tommaso can''t believe his eyes and answers her in private to learn more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QBRtW9mFjbcginDFQWAL3Q0Lhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666622'),
  ('685727418340827460', 'Breaking Upwards', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daryl Wein, Alexander Bergman', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Daryl Wein, Peter Duchan', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Daryl Wein, Julie White, Andrea Martin, Peter Friedman, LaChanze, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Olivia Thirlby', null, '''Breaking Upwards'' explores a young, real-life New York couple who, four years in and battling codependency, decide to intricately strategize their own break up. Based on an actual experiment devised by director/actor Daryl Wein and actress Zoe Lister-Jones, the film loosely interprets a year in their lives exploring alternatives to monogamy, and the madness that ensues. An uncensored look at young love, lust, and the pangs of codependency, ''Breaking Upwards'' follows its characters as they navigate each others'' emotions across the city they love. It begs the question: is it ever possible to grow apart together?', '''Breaking Upwards'' explores a young, real-life New York couple who, four years in and battling codependency, decide to intricately strategize their own break up. Based on an actual experiment devised by director/actor Daryl Wein and actress Zoe Lister-Jones, the film loosely interprets a year in their lives exploring alternatives to monogamy, and the madness that ensues. An uncensored look at young love, lust, and the pangs of codependency, ''Breaking Upwards'' follows its characters as they navigate each others'' emotions across the city they love. It begs the question: is it ever possible to grow apart together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEA5Vs7LoVS4dtotal9dc0kdgHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44990'),
  ('96799562467089337', 'Breaking Walls', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Borja Cobeaga, Bet Rourich, Mayca Sanz', 'Borja Cobeaga, Valentina Viso', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Juan Diego Botto, Mikel Losada, Iñaki Ardanaz, Laura Weissmahr, Ramón Barea, Sofía Otero, Irati García Pérez', null, 'In the late 1980s, in a working-class neighborhood on the outskirts of Bilbao, Basque Country, Spain. A girls'' rhythmic gymnastics team has the opportunity to compete in a tournament in Berlin; but since the girls'' mothers cannot take time off work, it is the fathers who must accompany them on the trip.', 'In the late 1980s, in a working-class neighborhood on the outskirts of Bilbao, Basque Country, Spain. A girls'' rhythmic gymnastics team has the opportunity to compete in a tournament in Berlin; but since the girls'' mothers cannot take time off work, it is the fathers who must accompany them on the trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7gNjaRCkwgd3d6OpC4cRpkolh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187315'),
