  ('995614742733301934', 'Brick', 2025, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Philip Koch, Alexander Fischerkoesen', 'Philip Koch', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Ruby O. Fee, Frederick Lau, Salber Lee Williams, Murathan Muslu, Sira-Anna Faal, Axel Werner, Alexander Beyer', 'R', 'When a mysterious brick wall encloses their apartment building overnight, Tim and Olivia must unite with their wary neighbors to get out alive.', 'When a mysterious brick wall encloses their apartment building overnight, Tim and Olivia must unite with their wary neighbors to get out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTX9CxFNEQOlfXsgqec7xmc5UtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1425045'),
  ('195161997208837673', 'Brick Lane', 2007, 'Drama', 'Sarah Gavron, Robbie Ryan', 'Abi Morgan, Laura Jones', 'Tannishtha Chatterjee, Satish Kaushik, Christopher Simpson, Naeema Begum, Lana Rahman, Lalita Ahmed, Harvey Virdi, Harsh Nayyar', 'PG-13', 'The grind of daily life as a Brick Lane Bangladessi as seen through the eyes of Nazneen (Chatterjee), who at 17 enters an arranged marriage with Chanu (Kaushik). Years later, living in east London with her family, she meets a young man Karim (Simpson).', 'The grind of daily life as a Brick Lane Bangladessi as seen through the eyes of Nazneen (Chatterjee), who at 17 enters an arranged marriage with Chanu (Kaushik). Years later, living in east London with her family, she meets a young man Karim (Simpson).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOi0il1YvBj0d6wE5OyGIqMPV4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21074'),
  ('1017256813427827056', 'Brick Mansions', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Camille Delamarre, Jean-Philippe Carignan, Christophe Collette', 'Luc Besson, Robert Mark Kamen', 'Paul Walker, David Belle, RZA, Robert Maillet, Carlo Rota, Kalinka Pétrie, Bruce Ramsay, Kwasi Songui', 'PG-13', 'In a dystopian Detroit, grand houses that once housed the wealthy are now homes of the city''s most-dangerous criminals. Surrounding the area is a giant wall to keep the rest of Detroit safe. For undercover cop Damien Collier, every day is a battle against corruption as he struggles to bring his father''s killer, Tremaine, to justice. Meanwhile, Damien and an ex-con named Lino work together to save the city from a plot to destroy it.', 'In a dystopian Detroit, grand houses that once housed the wealthy are now homes of the city''s most-dangerous criminals. Surrounding the area is a giant wall to keep the rest of Detroit safe. For undercover cop Damien Collier, every day is a battle against corruption as he struggles to bring his father''s killer, Tremaine, to justice. Meanwhile, Damien and an ex-con named Lino work together to save the city from a plot to destroy it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OopiNRk7lWP0hPsY0eYqq2kQTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254473'),
  ('734427003778145596', 'Bricol''girls', 1999, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Alain Chabat', 'Alain Chabat, Christian Maury', 'Suzanne Stokes, Camille Cousin, Elena Vladimirovna, Alain Chabat, Christophe Mulai, Jamel Debbouze', null, 'DIY lesson for Dummies, by Dummies and given by Suzanne, Camille and Elena, all commented by Alain Chabat.', 'DIY lesson for Dummies, by Dummies and given by Suzanne, Camille and Elena, all commented by Alain Chabat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQQaC2ubkme3ChhYclPXuGivlKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50746'),
  ('1145665593373730304', 'Bridal Wave', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michael M. Scott, Adam Sliwinski, Matthew Blecha', 'Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Arielle Kebbel, Andrew W. Walker, Jaclyn Smith, David Haydn-Jones, Colleen Wheeler, Daryl Shuttleworth, Anna Van Hooft, Tony Alcantar', null, 'With her wedding day rapidly approaching, an anxious bride-to-be has doubts about her pending marriage. At a romantic island resort, she encounters a handsome kindred spirit and must now decide if her "perfect" fiancé is really her true love.', 'With her wedding day rapidly approaching, an anxious bride-to-be has doubts about her pending marriage. At a romantic island resort, she encounters a handsome kindred spirit and must now decide if her "perfect" fiancé is really her true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZMUAsU9MxTDls737iU23XeywND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317114'),
  ('1100662569243761609', 'Bride & Prejudice', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Gurinder Chadha, Adam Dale, Santosh Sivan', 'Gurinder Chadha, Paul Mayeda Berges', 'Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Martin Henderson, Naveen Andrews, Daniel Gillies, Indira Varma, Marsha Mason, Nadira Babbar, Anupam Kher', 'PG-13', 'Mrs. Bakshi is eager to find suitors for her four unmarried daughters when a family friend introduces them to handsome American Will Darcy. A Bollywood-style modern adaptation of Jane Austen''s classic novel.', 'Mrs. Bakshi is eager to find suitors for her four unmarried daughters when a family friend introduces them to handsome American Will Darcy. A Bollywood-style modern adaptation of Jane Austen''s classic novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqqo00GZqyG0dijKCqBbdQLUvht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57825'),
  ('836837506224763118', 'Bride Flight', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ben Sombogaart, Piotr Kukla, Brett Schwieters', 'Marieke van der Pol', 'Karina Smulders, Waldemar Torenstra, Anna Drijver, Rutger Hauer, Pleuni Touw, Petra Laseur, Elise Schaap, Willeke van Ammelrooy', 'R', 'A romantic drama that charts the lives of three women from different backgrounds, forever changed when they emigrate to New Zealand as war brides.', 'A romantic drama that charts the lives of three women from different backgrounds, forever changed when they emigrate to New Zealand as war brides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuOqthWOWOeX72jnH7emYzu0vuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17347'),
  ('9449419255282848', 'Bride for the Quarterback', 2026, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Mila Pohrebyska', null, 'Christine Oswald, Ryder Harde, Marvon Hardy, Lora Hogan, Cody Sean Morgan', null, 'A struggling single mother working as a cleaner agrees to a fake engagement with a disgraced star quarterback to save his career and her son''s future. They must navigate a public romance that masks growing private tension and secrets.', 'A struggling single mother working as a cleaner agrees to a fake engagement with a disgraced star quarterback to save his career and her son''s future. They must navigate a public romance that masks growing private tension and secrets.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:bride-for-the-quarterback'),
  ('998266087032555613', 'Bride Hard', 2025, 'Action, Comedy', 'Simon West, Alan Caudillo, Paul Schmitz', 'Shaina Steinberg', 'Rebel Wilson, Anna Camp, Anna Chlumsky, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Gigi Zumbado, Sherry Cola, Sam Huntington, Michael O''Neill', 'R', 'Sam is a secret agent whose toughest mission to date is pleasing her bride-to-be best friend at a lavish destination wedding. When a team of mercenaries crashes the party and takes the guests hostage, Sam is thrown into a fight unlike any before — one where she can’t risk blowing her cover or ruining the big day. As she takes on the bad guys in a high-stakes battle disguised as a fairy-tale affair, she realizes the real threat might be closer than she thinks.', 'Sam is a secret agent whose toughest mission to date is pleasing her bride-to-be best friend at a lavish destination wedding. When a team of mercenaries crashes the party and takes the guests hostage, Sam is thrown into a fight unlike any before — one where she can’t risk blowing her cover or ruining the big day. As she takes on the bad guys in a high-stakes battle disguised as a fairy-tale affair, she realizes the real threat might be closer than she thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mExdWLSxAiUCb4NMcYmxSkO7n4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124619'),
  ('890249905529253031', 'Bride in Sneakers', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', null, null, 'Kim Jin-woo, Lee Chung-ah, Lee Yi-kyung, Park Young-seo', null, 'What are the chances that you will meet a bride in a wedding gown with sneakers on the subway? Just when Hee-soon was running out of sources to write about and found himself in front of a brick wall, a woman arouses his curiosity! Web-toon artist Hee-soon followed her. Bo-kyeong calls herself the ''unlucky one'' and blames herself for everything including the time when her groom ran away from the wedding. Why did he run away? She didn''t know, but she didn''t want to resent him for it. So she sets out to look for him but the buses have stopped running and she has no money for taxi. However, a loser but a nice looking guy asks her where she''s going. How long will he follow her?', 'What are the chances that you will meet a bride in a wedding gown with sneakers on the subway? Just when Hee-soon was running out of sources to write about and found himself in front of a brick wall, a woman arouses his curiosity! Web-toon artist Hee-soon followed her. Bo-kyeong calls herself the ''unlucky one'' and blames herself for everything including the time when her groom ran away from the wedding. Why did he run away? She didn''t know, but she didn''t want to resent him for it. So she sets out to look for him but the buses have stopped running and she has no money for taxi. However, a loser but a nice looking guy asks her where she''s going. How long will he follow her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpihSL0DjogcLoXZh0t4PnOmFV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444941'),
  ('446804142617043187', 'Bride of Boogedy', 1987, 'Horror, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Oz Scott, King Baggot', 'Michael Janover', 'Richard Masur, Eugene Levy, Mimi Kennedy, David Faustino, Leonard Frey, Tammy Lauren, Vincent Schiavelli, Ray Girardin', 'G', 'In this sequel to the made-for-television Disney family classic, Mr. Boogedy, the Davis family deals with the return of Mr. Boogedy and his never-ending hunt for Widow Marion as well as a rival gag-store competitor who really has it out for Carleton. Meanwhile, the town of Lucifer Falls is planning a big carnival which the mean Mr. Lynch seeks to ruin- if Boogedy doesn''t see to that first.', 'In this sequel to the made-for-television Disney family classic, Mr. Boogedy, the Davis family deals with the return of Mr. Boogedy and his never-ending hunt for Widow Marion as well as a rival gag-store competitor who really has it out for Carleton. Meanwhile, the town of Lucifer Falls is planning a big carnival which the mean Mr. Lynch seeks to ruin- if Boogedy doesn''t see to that first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xidl8ruxIPbkA3LkeWBVtSV4tU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47631'),
  ('1084454165710982690', 'Bride of Chucky', 1998, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Ronny Yu, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Don Mancini', 'Brad Dourif, Jennifer Tilly, Katherine Heigl, Nick Stabile, Alexis Arquette, Gordon Michael Woolvett, John Ritter, Lawrence Dane', 'R', 'For ten years, the tortured soul of serial killer Charles Lee Ray has been imprisoned inside a child''s doll. Chucky is reborn when his old flame, Tiffany, rescues his battered doll parts from a police impound. But Chucky wants his new playmate cut down to size, so he transforms his blushing bride into a stunning little terror. Chucky and Tiffany can''t wait to start their own homicidal honeymoon. When this demonic duo hits the road and hooks up with a pair of unsuspecting newlyweds, they leave a trail of murder and mayhem behind them. Chucky''s back!', 'For ten years, the tortured soul of serial killer Charles Lee Ray has been imprisoned inside a child''s doll. Chucky is reborn when his old flame, Tiffany, rescues his battered doll parts from a police impound. But Chucky wants his new playmate cut down to size, so he transforms his blushing bride into a stunning little terror. Chucky and Tiffany can''t wait to start their own homicidal honeymoon. When this demonic duo hits the road and hooks up with a pair of unsuspecting newlyweds, they leave a trail of murder and mayhem behind them. Chucky''s back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaIPNOcC7ZRuwH3maNwP9qzIo5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11932'),
  ('1063560376525215365', 'Bride of Deimos', 1988, 'Animation, Mystery', 'Rintaro, Kinichi Ishikawa, Hiroshi Hamasaki', null, 'Mayumi Shou, Kaneto Shiozawa, Reiko Mutoh, Takeshi Kusao, Nachi Nozawa, Toshiko Fujita', null, 'A brother and sister grow beautiful and rare orchids out in the middle of nowhere, however, anyone who visits their house seems to vanish suspiciously. What is the secret of this orchid house?', 'A brother and sister grow beautiful and rare orchids out in the middle of nowhere, however, anyone who visits their house seems to vanish suspiciously. What is the secret of this orchid house?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JgzPDEGr5uCYrKX9nHv4JTDbyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172124'),
  ('320066333438062853', 'Bride of Frankenstein', 1935, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John J. Mescall, James Whale, Harry Mancke', 'Edmund Pearson, William Hurlbut', 'Boris Karloff, Colin Clive, Valerie Hobson, Ernest Thesiger, Elsa Lanchester, Gavin Gordon, Douglas Walton, Una O''Connor', 'NR', 'Dr. Frankenstein and his monster both turn out to be alive after being attacked by an angry mob. The now-chastened scientist attempts to escape his past, but a former mentor forces him to assist with the creation of a new creature.', 'Dr. Frankenstein and his monster both turn out to be alive after being attacked by an angry mob. The now-chastened scientist attempts to escape his past, but a former mentor forces him to assist with the creation of a new creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5241zUwe7rC17MNc2QpCBKKdp1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229'),
  ('427541528225207309', 'Bride of Re-Animator', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Brian Yuzna, Rick Fichter', 'Brian Yuzna, Rick Fry, Woody Keith', 'Jeffrey Combs, Bruce Abbott, Claude Earl Jones, Fabiana Udenio, David Gale, Kathleen Kinmont, Mel Stewart, Irene Cagen', 'R', 'Unperturbed by the disastrous outcome of his previous meddling with the dead, Dr. West continues his research into the phenomenon of re-animation; only this time, he plans to create life – starting with the heart of his young protégé Dan''s dearly deceased Meg Halsey.', 'Unperturbed by the disastrous outcome of his previous meddling with the dead, Dr. West continues his research into the phenomenon of re-animation; only this time, he plans to create life – starting with the heart of his young protégé Dan''s dearly deceased Meg Halsey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7t9PmI65umna8yq0BPU9YoKn62I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18111'),
  ('244929549134684656', 'Bride of the Earth', 1968, 'Drama, Western', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney, Nebahat Çehre, Hayati Hamzaoğlu, Nihat Ziyalan, Danyal Topatan, İhsan Gedik, Necla Aksoy, Çetin Başaran', null, 'In this rural revenge drama, Güney plays Seyyit Han, a poor man in love with a woman from his Anatolian village who returns his affection. Seyyit Han postpones their marriage so that he can make his fortune elsewhere and return to the village to claim his "bride of the earth." During his prolonged absence, a rich landowner begins to woo the lonely woman, and her brother, intent upon making this propitious wedding happen, spreads the rumor that Seyyit Han has died.', 'In this rural revenge drama, Güney plays Seyyit Han, a poor man in love with a woman from his Anatolian village who returns his affection. Seyyit Han postpones their marriage so that he can make his fortune elsewhere and return to the village to claim his "bride of the earth." During his prolonged absence, a rich landowner begins to woo the lonely woman, and her brother, intent upon making this propitious wedding happen, spreads the rumor that Seyyit Han has died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVdOc3z1U62JytOyzIxvMRsNrV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126560'),
  ('445581559098046345', 'Bride of the Gorilla', 1951, 'Horror', 'Curt Siodmak, Charles Van Enger', 'Curt Siodmak', 'Raymond Burr, Barbara Payton, Lon Chaney Jr., Tom Conway, Paul Cavanagh, Gisela Werbisek, Carol Varga, Paul Maxey', null, 'The owner of a plantation in the jungle marries a beautiful woman. Shortly afterward, he is plagued by a strange voodoo curse which transforms him into a gorilla. But is his transformation real or is it all in his head?', 'The owner of a plantation in the jungle marries a beautiful woman. Shortly afterward, he is plagued by a strange voodoo curse which transforms him into a gorilla. But is his transformation real or is it all in his head?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sk3yl6zhpQptkqu0eqiqHSox7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22856'),
  ('1100294402974014903', 'Bride of the Incredible Hulk', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Kenneth Johnson, Charles W. Short, Walt Gilmore', 'Kenneth Johnson', 'Bill Bixby, Jack Colvin, Lou Ferrigno, Mariette Hartley, Brian Cutler, Diane Markoff, Duncan Gamble, Meeno Peluce', null, 'In one of the saga''s most emotional stories, David Banner travels to Hawaii to find Dr. Caroline Fields, a psychiatrist who has developed a hypnotherapy technique that could cure him. Discovering they share the burden of an incurable condition—Caroline suffers from a terminal illness—the two fall in love and marry, offering Banner a glimpse of happiness. However, tragedy looms when Jack McGee''s relentless pursuit and a devastating hurricane threaten their brief moment of peace.', 'In one of the saga''s most emotional stories, David Banner travels to Hawaii to find Dr. Caroline Fields, a psychiatrist who has developed a hypnotherapy technique that could cure him. Discovering they share the burden of an incurable condition—Caroline suffers from a terminal illness—the two fall in love and marry, offering Banner a glimpse of happiness. However, tragedy looms when Jack McGee''s relentless pursuit and a devastating hurricane threaten their brief moment of peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3apbGlabEmgR1jEgJgqg7FUMqCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79989'),
  ('1119531076171258817', 'Bride of the Monster', 1955, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Edward D. Wood Jr., William C. Thompson, Robert Farfan', 'Edward D. Wood Jr., Alex Gordon', 'Bela Lugosi, Tor Johnson, Tony McCoy, Loretta King, Harvey B. Dunn, George Becwar, Paul Marco, Don Nagel', null, 'Dr. Eric Vornoff, with the help of his mute assistant Lobo, captures twelve men for a grisly experiment; His goal to turn them into supermen using atomic energy. Reporter Janet Lawton, fiancée of the local lieutenant, vows to investigate Vornoff''s supposedly haunted house.', 'Dr. Eric Vornoff, with the help of his mute assistant Lobo, captures twelve men for a grisly experiment; His goal to turn them into supermen using atomic energy. Reporter Janet Lawton, fiancée of the local lieutenant, vows to investigate Vornoff''s supposedly haunted house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mk9uXv3MGHu2FGRAlqatMtGlk0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36489'),
  ('1020006353220342817', 'Bride of the Orient', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Urs Odermatt, Manuel Siebenmann, Rainer Klausmann', 'Urs Odermatt', 'Wolfram Berger, Werner Herzog, Helen Vita, Annamirl Bierbichler, Arunotai Jitreekan, Mathias Gnädinger, Günter Meisner, Michael Gempart', null, 'After the death of his mother, a lonely farmer in rural Switzerland considers finally starting a family of his own. Eventually he pays for a bride from Thailand. The couple don''t share a language, but being to know each other. However the village neighbors are suspicious of foreigners.', 'After the death of his mother, a lonely farmer in rural Switzerland considers finally starting a family of his own. Eventually he pays for a bride from Thailand. The couple don''t share a language, but being to know each other. However the village neighbors are suspicious of foreigners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVviJCM1aGg5pFpVqFJ10dzTXI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287840'),
  ('113104214170953053', 'Bride Wars', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gary Winick, Frederick Elmes, Glen Trotiner', 'Greg DePaul, Casey Wilson, June Diane Raphael', 'Kate Hudson, Anne Hathaway, Bryan Greenberg, Chris Pratt, Steve Howey, Candice Bergen, Kristen Johnston, Michael Arden', 'PG', 'Two best friends become rivals when their respective weddings are accidentally booked for the same day.', 'Two best friends become rivals when their respective weddings are accidentally booked for the same day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyXT8tmUoyHrg7YX1UVjmecHCWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10521'),
  ('928022829303578186', 'Bride Wars', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ho Yiu-Leung, Tony Chan', 'Gu Wei', 'Ni Ni, AngelaBaby, Zhu Yawen, Chen Xiao, He Jiong, Huang Xiaoming, William Feng, Jing Boran', null, 'Mary and Jing are childhood best friends. When they were kids, they dreamed about their ideal weddings. Ten years later, on the day of their weddings, however, a mistake by the wedding planner pits them against each other, in a battle of wits.', 'Mary and Jing are childhood best friends. When they were kids, they dreamed about their ideal weddings. Ten years later, on the day of their weddings, however, a mistake by the wedding planner pits them against each other, in a battle of wits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GYlV6X5EHSm66pifFl5t3o6Fia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362519'),
  ('870128566019474743', 'Bridegroom', 2013, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Linda Bloodworth-Thomason', 'Linda Bloodworth-Thomason', 'Thomas Bridegroom, Shane Bitney Crone, Cindy Bitney, David Crone, Lizzy Mohl, Judy Crone, Pat Managhan, Jessica Mitchell', 'R', 'A documentary that tells the emotional journey of Shane and Tom, two young men in a loving and committed relationship — a relationship that was cut tragically short by a misstep off the side of a roof.', 'A documentary that tells the emotional journey of Shane and Tom, two young men in a loving and committed relationship — a relationship that was cut tragically short by a misstep off the side of a roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnv3D6895YxYet3NWMrHxXB5l3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174366'),
  ('605298130592600768', 'Brideless Groom', 1947, 'Comedy', 'Edward Bernds, Vincent J. Farrar', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Moe Howard, Shemp Howard, Larry Fine, Emil Sitka, Dee Green, Christine McIntyre', null, 'Shemp has to get married within seven hours in order to inherit $500,000. Now that''s incentive! The bumbling threesome set to work right away with hilarious results.', 'Shemp has to get married within seven hours in order to inherit $500,000. Now that''s incentive! The bumbling threesome set to work right away with hilarious results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkFcZ9OJMIF9awc2pi8u41yu8Xd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72012'),
  ('787872481594491617', 'Brides', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Pantelis Voulgaris, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Ioanna Karystiani', 'Evi Saoulidou, Victoria Haralabidou, Andréa Ferréol, Damian Lewis, Eleni Roussinou, Dimitris Katalifos, Eirini Inglesi, Steven Berkoff', null, 'A young female character, Nikki Douka, from Samothraki, is sailing to the U.S. to fulfill a marriage contract and save her family honor. Her skills as a seamstress keep her busily sewing throughout the voyage to alter wedding dresses for the third-class voyagers. But along the way, she meets a young American photographer who is returning from the Middle East where he was snapping shots of the war in Smyrna, 1922. Her honesty, pride, and beauty attract the attention of the American who falls in love with her. Tribulations abound during the voyage, following the dramas of several unfortunate young women upon whom nasty characters preyed, as Nikki struggles with her feelings for the photographer.', 'A young female character, Nikki Douka, from Samothraki, is sailing to the U.S. to fulfill a marriage contract and save her family honor. Her skills as a seamstress keep her busily sewing throughout the voyage to alter wedding dresses for the third-class voyagers. But along the way, she meets a young American photographer who is returning from the Middle East where he was snapping shots of the war in Smyrna, 1922. Her honesty, pride, and beauty attract the attention of the American who falls in love with her. Tribulations abound during the voyage, following the dramas of several unfortunate young women upon whom nasty characters preyed, as Nikki struggles with her feelings for the photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TQLUonavjMF9aEt2dnA5TALlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24223'),
  ('205941461551878347', 'Brides of Blood', 1968, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Gerardo de Leon, Eddie Romero', 'Cesar Amigo', 'Kent Taylor, Beverly Powers, John Ashley, Mario Montenegro, Eva Darren, Oscar Keesee, Bruno Punzalan, Andres Centenera', 'NR', 'Americans investigating the results of nuclear radiation discover a man-eating monster on a remote island.', 'Americans investigating the results of nuclear radiation discover a man-eating monster on a remote island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dh2IzvZ4ND6n3s3QW2TvSfMaysY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77889'),
  ('1092107766634042218', 'Brideshead Revisited', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jess Hall, Julian Jarrold, Lynne Huitson', 'Andrew Davies, Jeremy Brock', 'Matthew Goode, Ben Whishaw, Hayley Atwell, Emma Thompson, Michael Gambon, Patrick Malahide, Ed Stoppard, Greta Scacchi', 'PG-13', 'Befriended by aristocrat Sebastian Flyte, Oxford student Charles Ryder finds that the power and privilege experienced by the family is seductive. On a visit to the ancestral home, Brideshead, he falls in love with his friend''s sister, Julia. However, as his ties to the Flytes deepen, Ryder finds himself at odds with their strong Roman Catholicism.', 'Befriended by aristocrat Sebastian Flyte, Oxford student Charles Ryder finds that the power and privilege experienced by the family is seductive. On a visit to the ancestral home, Brideshead, he falls in love with his friend''s sister, Julia. However, as his ties to the Flytes deepen, Ryder finds himself at odds with their strong Roman Catholicism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1IqGWVNIRcXnfw9vjye7oQYUg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12568'),
  ('194980339705228925', 'Bridesmaids', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Feig, Robert D. Yeoman', 'Annie Mumolo, Kristen Wiig', 'Kristen Wiig, Maya Rudolph, Rose Byrne, Chris O''Dowd, Melissa McCarthy, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Ellie Kemper, Jill Clayburgh', 'R', 'Annie''s life is a mess. But when she finds out her lifetime best friend is engaged, she simply must serve as Lillian''s maid of honor. Though lovelorn and broke, Annie bluffs her way through the expensive and bizarre rituals. With one chance to get it perfect, she’ll show Lillian and her bridesmaids just how far you’ll go for someone you love.', 'Annie''s life is a mess. But when she finds out her lifetime best friend is engaged, she simply must serve as Lillian''s maid of honor. Though lovelorn and broke, Annie bluffs her way through the expensive and bizarre rituals. With one chance to get it perfect, she’ll show Lillian and her bridesmaids just how far you’ll go for someone you love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJtA7hYsBMQ7EM3sPBMUdBfU7a0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55721'),
  ('542777060716813543', 'Bridge of Dragons', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Romance', 'Isaac Florentine, Yossi Wein', 'Carlton Holder', 'Dolph Lundgren, Valerie Chow, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Gary Hudson, John Bennett, Scott L. Schwartz, Jo Kendall, Dave Nichols', null, 'The tough and cold mercenary Warchild, is working for the man who took care of his war training and upbringing, the greedy General Ruechang. Ruechang is planning to take over the country by marrying Princess Halo. But Halo discovers that Ruechang killed her father to gain more power than he had working for the King, so she decides to run away. Warchild is the one who has to bring her back to Ruechang, but the one thing no one counted on happens... Warchild and Halo falls in love, and together they take on the forces of Ruechang... Written by Zorteper -', 'The tough and cold mercenary Warchild, is working for the man who took care of his war training and upbringing, the greedy General Ruechang. Ruechang is planning to take over the country by marrying Princess Halo. But Halo discovers that Ruechang killed her father to gain more power than he had working for the King, so she decides to run away. Warchild is the one who has to bring her back to Ruechang, but the one thing no one counted on happens... Warchild and Halo falls in love, and together they take on the forces of Ruechang... Written by Zorteper -', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5jzAQ1pyoUnytzCC8X9S4nayBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36293'),
  ('720119155108373086', 'Bridge of Spies', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Ryan Heck', 'Joel Coen, Matt Charman, Ethan Coen', 'Tom Hanks, Mark Rylance, Amy Ryan, Alan Alda, Sebastian Koch, Austin Stowell, Billy Magnussen, Michael Simon Hall', 'PG-13', 'During the Cold War, the Soviet Union captures U.S. pilot Francis Gary Powers after shooting down his U-2 spy plane. Sentenced to 10 years in prison, Powers'' only hope is New York lawyer James Donovan, recruited by a CIA operative to negotiate his release. Donovan boards a plane to Berlin, hoping to win the young man''s freedom through a prisoner exchange. If all goes well, the Russians would get Rudolf Abel, the convicted spy who Donovan defended in court.', 'During the Cold War, the Soviet Union captures U.S. pilot Francis Gary Powers after shooting down his U-2 spy plane. Sentenced to 10 years in prison, Powers'' only hope is New York lawyer James Donovan, recruited by a CIA operative to negotiate his release. Donovan boards a plane to Berlin, hoping to win the young man''s freedom through a prisoner exchange. If all goes well, the Russians would get Rudolf Abel, the convicted spy who Donovan defended in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmOOjHAQzxr0c1sfcY4qkiSRBH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296098'),
  ('1042066791617343833', 'Bridge of the Doomed', 2022, 'Horror, Action', 'Michael Su, Michael Su, Marvin ''Knife'' Sotelo', 'Adrian Milnes', 'Michael Paré, Robert LaSardo, Sarah French, Kate Watson, Charles Solomon Jr., Lisa Hinds, Maisy Kay, Mark Justice', null, 'A group of soldiers are ordered to hold a bridge during a zombie outbreak, but what lives underneath the bridge, proves to be even more deadly.', 'A group of soldiers are ordered to hold a bridge during a zombie outbreak, but what lives underneath the bridge, proves to be even more deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0cijKdZ0YZtxrZ0L3g63BIeyke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995810'),
  ('906222466224076496', 'Bridge to Terabithia', 1985, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Eric Till', 'Nancy Sackett', 'Julian Coutts, Julie Beaulieu, Annette O''Toole, Gloria Carlin, Tom Heaton, Jennifer Matichuk, Peter Dvorsky, Darlene Bradley', null, 'Jess Aarons and new girl Leslie Burke create a world of their own and call it Terabithia and pretend to be the king and queen. They return to their magical kingdom every day after school.', 'Jess Aarons and new girl Leslie Burke create a world of their own and call it Terabithia and pretend to be the king and queen. They return to their magical kingdom every day after school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgGXFILzosg9cwcVsE6X5gM9kyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169009'),
  ('696649515869033862', 'Bridge to Terabithia', 2007, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Gábor Csupó, Michael Chapman, Siobhan Nolan O''Driscoll', 'Jeff Stockwell', 'Josh Hutcherson, AnnaSophia Robb, Zooey Deschanel, Robert Patrick, Bailee Madison, Kate Butler, Devon Wood, Emma Fenton', 'PG', 'Jesse Aarons trained all summer to become the fastest runner in school. So he''s very upset when newcomer Leslie Burke outruns him and everyone else. Despite this and other differences including that she''s rich, he''s poor, she''s a city girl, and he''s a country boy the two become fast friends. Together they create Terabithia, a land of monsters, trolls, ogres, and giants where they rule as king and queen.', 'Jesse Aarons trained all summer to become the fastest runner in school. So he''s very upset when newcomer Leslie Burke outruns him and everyone else. Despite this and other differences including that she''s rich, he''s poor, she''s a city girl, and he''s a country boy the two become fast friends. Together they create Terabithia, a land of monsters, trolls, ogres, and giants where they rule as king and queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xFxGodKPMFLheS8rujFSmLfcq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265'),
  ('951599141035772787', 'Bridge to the Sun', 1961, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Étienne Périer, Marcel Weiss, William J. Kelly', 'Charles Kaufman', 'Carroll Baker, James Shigeta, James Yagi, Tetsuro Tamba, Hiroshi Tomono, Yoshiko Hiromura, Sean Garrison, Ruth Masters', null, 'Tells the true story of American Gwen Terasaki, who falls in love with, then marries a Japanese diplomat. When World War II breaks out, they encounter animosity and trouble from both sides.', 'Tells the true story of American Gwen Terasaki, who falls in love with, then marries a Japanese diplomat. When World War II breaks out, they encounter animosity and trouble from both sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b54wIWguJiZroA0j9bBlPlaI4XD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119926'),
  ('1138338731807679547', 'Bridgend', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jeppe Rønde, Magnus Nordenhof Jønck', 'Torben Bech, Peter Asmussen, Jeppe Rønde', 'Hannah Murray, Josh O''Connor, Steven Waddington, Adrian Rawlins, Patricia Potter, Nia Roberts, Aled Llyr Thomas, Elinor Crawley', null, 'Over a 5-year period in Bridgend in Wales, 79 people, many of them teenagers, committed suicide without leaving any clue as to why. This is the starting point for this mysterious social drama.', 'Over a 5-year period in Bridgend in Wales, 79 people, many of them teenagers, committed suicide without leaving any clue as to why. This is the starting point for this mysterious social drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mYC98zfbhJtC5Mso4rPBqMAQGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316885'),
  ('670071879744926914', 'Bridges-Go-Round 1', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Shirley Clarke, Shirley Clarke', null, null, null, 'New York City’s bridges dissolve into shifting abstractions through montage, superimposition, and color. Set to an electronic score by Louis and Bebe Barron, the film transforms familiar urban structures into an uncanny, alien landscape (an alternate version of the film features a jazz score by Teo Macero).', 'New York City’s bridges dissolve into shifting abstractions through montage, superimposition, and color. Set to an electronic score by Louis and Bebe Barron, the film transforms familiar urban structures into an uncanny, alien landscape (an alternate version of the film features a jazz score by Teo Macero).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gvAcqLWajIdAKWiqpMj1zestAL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163230'),
  ('596757373035457196', 'Bridget Jones: Mad About the Boy', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Morris, Suzie Lavelle, Jelle Rebry', 'Helen Fielding, Dan Mazer, Abi Morgan', 'Renée Zellweger, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Leo Woodall, Hugh Grant, Jim Broadbent, Gemma Jones, Colin Firth, Sarah Solemani', 'R', 'Bridget Jones navigates life as a widow and single mum with the help of her family, friends, and former lover, Daniel. Back to work and on the apps, she''s pursued by a younger man and maybe – just maybe – her son''s science teacher.', 'Bridget Jones navigates life as a widow and single mum with the help of her family, friends, and former lover, Daniel. Back to work and on the apps, she''s pursued by a younger man and maybe – just maybe – her son''s science teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5VR3nhLYG60znxaqU84wv4VSCb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1272149'),
  ('20891636247508018', 'Bridget Jones: The Edge of Reason', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Beeban Kidron, Adrian Biddle, David Warren', 'Andrew Davies, Helen Fielding, Richard Curtis', 'Renée Zellweger, Colin Firth, Hugh Grant, Jacinda Barrett, Jim Broadbent, Gemma Jones, Sally Phillips, Celia Imrie', 'R', 'Bridget Jones is still dating her new love, barrister Mark Darcy, for a perfect six weeks. However, while on assignment in Thailand with her disreputable ex, Daniel Cleaver, claiming to be reformed, Bridget questions if she has everything she''s ever dreamed of having.', 'Bridget Jones is still dating her new love, barrister Mark Darcy, for a perfect six weeks. However, while on assignment in Thailand with her disreputable ex, Daniel Cleaver, claiming to be reformed, Bridget questions if she has everything she''s ever dreamed of having.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDthRXkGnwFIWI0zWcJyS7h6lUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9801'),
  ('578417078319480963', 'Bridget Jones''s Baby', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sharon Maguire, Andrew Dunn, James Manning', 'Helen Fielding, Dan Mazer, Emma Thompson', 'Renée Zellweger, Colin Firth, Patrick Dempsey, Jim Broadbent, Gemma Jones, Emma Thompson, Sally Phillips, James Callis', 'R', 'After breaking up, Bridget Jones'' happily-ever-after hasn''t quite gone according to plan. Fortysomething and single again, she decides to focus on her job and surround herself with old friends and new. For once, Bridget has everything completely under control. Then her love life takes a turn when she meets Jack. A week later, she runs into Mark before she finds herself pregnant, but with one hitch - she''s not sure of the identity of her baby''s father - Mark or Jack.', 'After breaking up, Bridget Jones'' happily-ever-after hasn''t quite gone according to plan. Fortysomething and single again, she decides to focus on her job and surround herself with old friends and new. For once, Bridget has everything completely under control. Then her love life takes a turn when she meets Jack. A week later, she runs into Mark before she finds herself pregnant, but with one hitch - she''s not sure of the identity of her baby''s father - Mark or Jack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hHomngoPZrNoXOPlyaHV6eXaQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95610'),
  ('752937776492867978', 'Bridget Jones''s Diary', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Sharon Maguire, Stuart Dryburgh, Paul Inglis', 'Helen Fielding, Andrew Davies, Richard Curtis', 'Renée Zellweger, Colin Firth, Hugh Grant, Jim Broadbent, Gemma Jones, James Callis, Sally Phillips, Shirley Henderson', 'R', 'Bridget Jones is an average woman struggling against expectations. As a New Year''s resolution, Bridget decides to take control of her life, starting by keeping a diary in which she will always tell the complete truth. Her charming boss takes an interest in her, and she cannot stop running into a rather disagreeable acquaintance whom Bridget cannot help finding quietly attractive.', 'Bridget Jones is an average woman struggling against expectations. As a New Year''s resolution, Bridget decides to take control of her life, starting by keeping a diary in which she will always tell the complete truth. Her charming boss takes an interest in her, and she cannot stop running into a rather disagreeable acquaintance whom Bridget cannot help finding quietly attractive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkauRl9TosBFikftrC3OVcKWDoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634'),
  ('139393807283597764', 'Brief Crossing', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Breillat, Éric Gautier', 'Catherine Breillat', 'Sarah Pratt, Gilles Guillain, Marc Filipi, Laetitia Lopez, Marc Jablonski, Christelle Dacosta', null, 'A young French man and an older English woman spend one night together on a ship.', 'A young French man and an older English woman spend one night together on a ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nT8wLojXXdUEjpISv0cCJ7XqPiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39770'),
  ('532595495272291893', 'Brief Encounter', 1976, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Alan Bridges, Dominic Fulford, Arthur Ibbetson', 'John Bowen', 'Richard Burton, Sophia Loren, Jack Hedley, Rosemary Leach, John Le Mesurier, Gwen Cherrell, Jumoke Debayo, Madeleine Hinde', null, 'Two strangers, both married to others, meet in a railway station and soon find themselves in a brief but intense affair.', 'Two strangers, both married to others, meet in a railway station and soon find themselves in a brief but intense affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWOGh7PV64ClCdIaW4fht3FIFgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115497'),
