  ('1026764700533077706', 'Brigade Miscellaneous in the Mountains and at the Sea', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Mircea Drăgan', 'Nicolae Țic, Mircea Drăgan', 'Toma Caragiu, Dem Rădulescu, Ion Finteşteanu, Puiu Călinescu, Jean Constantin, Sebastian Papaiani, Ioana Drăgan, Dumitru Furdui', null, 'Misc. Brigade must solve a drug traffic case, in their own way', 'Misc. Brigade must solve a drug traffic case, in their own way', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbN4uUjVpGLbMJ3bqsX6yD4GRPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94097'),
