  ('332747969701503252', 'Brillantes', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sylvie Gautier, Yoan Cart, Max Besnard', 'Sylvie Gautier, Sylvie Gautier', 'Céline Sallette, Eye Haïdara, Thomas Gioria, Camille Lellouche, Souad Amidou, Julie Ferrier, Bruno Salomone, Mathias Minne', null, 'Karine, a housekeeper of 34, is the full-time mother of 17 year-old Ziggy. When the company that employed her is taken over, subject to the laws of capitalism, Karine will have to choose between being true to herself, or lie to protect herself and her family.', 'Karine, a housekeeper of 34, is the full-time mother of 17 year-old Ziggy. When the company that employed her is taken over, subject to the laws of capitalism, Karine will have to choose between being true to herself, or lie to protect herself and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jdFFoRtlwI67K5bFcZX4TkvgcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973604'),
  ('1095913404243474615', 'Brillantissime', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kika Ungaro, Michèle Laroque', 'Benjamin Morgaine, Michèle Laroque, Lionel Dutemple', 'Michèle Laroque, Kad Merad, Françoise Fabian, Gérard Darmon, Rossy de Palma, Pascal Elbé, Oriane Deschamps, Michaël Youn', null, 'After getting dumped on Christmas Eve, Angela must rebuild her life surrounded by her rebellious teenager, her tyrannical mother, her hysterical best friend, and a weird psychologist.', 'After getting dumped on Christmas Eve, Angela must rebuild her life surrounded by her rebellious teenager, her tyrannical mother, her hysterical best friend, and a weird psychologist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UKSrbrIKboRcRVJgkoM8rzBJqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462979'),
