  ('791346999823652625', 'Bring Him to Me', 2023, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Luke Sparke, John Reynolds, Frederik Wiedmann', 'Tom Evans', 'Barry Pepper, Jamie Costa, Liam McIntyre, Rachel Griffiths, Sam Neill, Zachary Garred, Alex Fleri, Marcus Johnson', 'R', 'Under orders from a ruthless crime boss, a getaway driver must battle his conscience and drive an unsuspecting crew member to an ambush execution. There is a long drive ahead.', 'Under orders from a ruthless crime boss, a getaway driver must battle his conscience and drive an unsuspecting crew member to an ambush execution. There is a long drive ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QGAUtP5YvEFRMdYl2iEhgHybDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059126'),
  ('286523281681272594', 'Bring It On', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Peyton Reed, Shawn Maurer, Jennifer Anderson', 'Jessica Bendinger', 'Kirsten Dunst, Eliza Dushku, Jesse Bradford, Gabrielle Union, Sherry Hursey, Holmes Osborne, Clare Kramer, Nicole Bilderback', 'PG-13', 'The Toro cheerleading squad from Rancho Carne High School in San Diego has got spirit, spunk, sass and a killer routine that''s sure to land them the national championship trophy for the sixth year in a row. But for newly-elected team captain Torrance, the Toros'' road to total cheer glory takes a shady turn when she discovers that their perfectly-choreographed routines were in fact stolen.', 'The Toro cheerleading squad from Rancho Carne High School in San Diego has got spirit, spunk, sass and a killer routine that''s sure to land them the national championship trophy for the sixth year in a row. But for newly-elected team captain Torrance, the Toros'' road to total cheer glory takes a shady turn when she discovers that their perfectly-choreographed routines were in fact stolen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnVby0qI0dS7YunbShP7mw68HY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1588'),
  ('880243027218030698', 'Bring It On Again', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Damon Santostefano, Richard Crudo, Michael A. Allowitz', 'Claudia Grazioso, Brian Gunn, Mark Gunn', 'Anne Judson-Yager, Faune Chambers Watkins, Bree Turner, Bethany Joy Lenz, Richard Lee Jackson, Bryce Johnson, Chris Carmack, Felicia Day', 'PG-13', 'When new students can''t get onto their college cheerleading team, they form their own squad and prepare for a cheer off.', 'When new students can''t get onto their college cheerleading team, they form their own squad and prepare for a cheer off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slevjvJcGRvFZ3vwfbDdRfdLHG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12540'),
  ('537307612481082593', 'Bring It On: All or Nothing', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Steve Rash, Victor J. Kemper, Jerram A. Swartz', 'Alyson Fouse', 'Hayden Panettiere, Solange, Jake McDorman, Kiersten Warren, Emme Rylan, Gustavo Carr, Giovonnie Samuels, Francia Raísa', 'PG-13', 'A transfer student at a rough high school tries joining the cheer-leading squad and finds that she not only has to face off against the head cheerleader, but also against her former school in preparation for a cheer-off competition.', 'A transfer student at a rough high school tries joining the cheer-leading squad and finds that she not only has to face off against the head cheerleader, but also against her former school in preparation for a cheer-off competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UqEB9uR3z3BDxYFyn7YDZRLFZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11211'),
  ('626079711323448591', 'Bring It On: Cheer Or Die', 2022, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Karen Lam, Aaron Wintringham, Danilo Jurisich', 'Rebekah McKendry, Dana Schwartz', 'Kerri Medders, Tiera Skovbye, Samuel Braun, Alec Carlos, Missi Pyle, Alten Wilmot, Sierra Holder, Alexandra Beaton', 'PG-13', 'When a cheer squad practices their routines on Halloween weekend in an abandoned school, they are picked off one by one by an unknown killer.', 'When a cheer squad practices their routines on Halloween weekend in an abandoned school, they are picked off one by one by an unknown killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nw3dM0QsneYjBio0ggFpnVkuVvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831410'),
  ('590478751224118844', 'Bring It On: Fight to the Finish', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Bille Woodruff, Vince Duque, Van Hayden', 'Elena Song, Alyson Fouse', 'Christina Milian, Cody Longo, Rachele Brooke Smith, Holland Roden, Laura Cerón, David Starzyk, Gabrielle Dennis, Meagan Holder', 'PG-13', 'When her mother falls for a wealthy man, Lina Cruz must move in with her new stepfather and transfer from an urban East Los Angeles public high school to an exclusive prep school in Malibu, where she struggles to fit in with her affluent new peers. After snooty cheerleading captain Avery blocks Lina from varsity, Lina recruits her best friends from her old school to help her whip the pathetic junior varsity cheerleading squad -- the Sea Lions -- into fighting shape.', 'When her mother falls for a wealthy man, Lina Cruz must move in with her new stepfather and transfer from an urban East Los Angeles public high school to an exclusive prep school in Malibu, where she struggles to fit in with her affluent new peers. After snooty cheerleading captain Avery blocks Lina from varsity, Lina recruits her best friends from her old school to help her whip the pathetic junior varsity cheerleading squad -- the Sea Lions -- into fighting shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3zsel0aCcBWgOCytyFa9FxuPTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21474'),
  ('923672633413930316', 'Bring It On: In It to Win It', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Steve Rash, Levie Isaacks, Michael Finn', 'Alyson Fouse, Elena Song', 'Ashley Benson, Michael Copon, Cassie Scerbo, Anniese Taylor Dendy, Jennifer Tisdale, Noel Areizaga, Kierstin Koppel, Lisa Glaze', 'PG-13', 'Fourth ''Bring It On'' movie is set at a cheerleader camp in Florida with a ''West Side Story'' musical feel has the female captain of the West Side Sharks meeting and romancing a male member of the East Coast Jets amid their different team rivalries.', 'Fourth ''Bring It On'' movie is set at a cheerleader camp in Florida with a ''West Side Story'' musical feel has the female captain of the West Side Sharks meeting and romancing a male member of the East Coast Jets amid their different team rivalries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMRjQuTZQ8bZNrwqkKhBgbh8MkF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15261'),
  ('1099813766690849531', 'Bring It On: Worldwide #Cheersmack', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jon-Luke Lourens, Andile Vuyolwethu Pakade, Erin Cloete', 'Alyson Fouse', 'Cristine Prosperi, Jordan Rodrigues, Gia Lodge-O''Meally, Sophie Vavasseur, Sven Ruygrok, Stephan Lee Benson, Natalie Walsh, Vivica A. Fox', 'PG-13', 'When Destiny, captain of three-time national champions "The Rebels," is challenged to a global cheer showdown by an edgy new team called "The Truth," the Cheer Goddess organizes a virtual battle for squads from all around the world. It seems like the whole world wants to take down Destiny and her team, and they just might succeed, unless Destiny can rise to the challenge, set her ego aside and figure out who her real friends are.', 'When Destiny, captain of three-time national champions "The Rebels," is challenged to a global cheer showdown by an edgy new team called "The Truth," the Cheer Goddess organizes a virtual battle for squads from all around the world. It seems like the whole world wants to take down Destiny and her team, and they just might succeed, unless Destiny can rise to the challenge, set her ego aside and figure out who her real friends are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miZRlFZ1GfQdWySEsteuvdwGAzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467248'),
  ('521260828858783328', 'Bring Me Home', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lee Seong-hwan, Kim Seung-woo, Lee Mo-gae', 'Kim Seung-woo', 'Lee Young-ae, You Chea-myung, Park Hae-joon, Lee Won-keun, Jeong Ae-hwa, Heo Dong-won, Jin Yoo-young, Kim Jong-soo', null, 'Jung-yeon receives a tip-off that her son who went missing six years ago is in a fishing village. Local officers get in her way, trying to cover up a secret that might be related to her case.', 'Jung-yeon receives a tip-off that her son who went missing six years ago is in a fishing village. Local officers get in her way, trying to cover up a secret that might be related to her case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwuyP02WDpJrWNvkNl8UgdDsjfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507773'),
  ('915458743056442077', 'Bring Me the Head of Alfredo Garcia', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Sam Peckinpah, Álex Phillips Jr., William Davidson', 'Sam Peckinpah, Gordon T. Dawson', 'Warren Oates, Isela Vega, Robert Webber, Gig Young, Helmut Dantine, Emilio Fernández, Kris Kristofferson, Chano Urueta', 'R', 'An American bartender and his prostitute girlfriend go on a road trip through the Mexican underworld to collect a $1 million bounty on the head of a dead gigolo.', 'An American bartender and his prostitute girlfriend go on a road trip through the Mexican underworld to collect a $1 million bounty on the head of a dead gigolo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRWVf3InNlIlFT3WB9MnFdOwcYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11942'),
  ('56282831461154342', 'Bring Me the Head of Mavis Davis', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Carrie Rodd, Catrin Strong, Steve Carter', 'Craig Strachan', 'Rik Mayall, Danny Aiello, Nick Bartlett, Philip Martin Brown, Heathcote Williams, Mark Heap, Jane Horrocks, Marc Warren', null, 'Marla Darland is blessed with the voice of an angel, a singing legend. But when her agent, Marty Starr, finds his agency in trouble, he concocts a sinister plot to bring up her record sales. Amazed at the posthumous record sales of Elvis and Jimi Hendrix, Marty becomes determined to arrange a similar fate for Marla, staging the perfect tragic demise. But he didn''t count on Marla not being quite ready to go.', 'Marla Darland is blessed with the voice of an angel, a singing legend. But when her agent, Marty Starr, finds his agency in trouble, he concocts a sinister plot to bring up her record sales. Amazed at the posthumous record sales of Elvis and Jimi Hendrix, Marty becomes determined to arrange a similar fate for Marla, staging the perfect tragic demise. But he didn''t count on Marla not being quite ready to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taEPnuX71Cy2nezILeUhESqoC1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78232'),
  ('1004539529256954227', 'Bring Me the Head of the Machine Gun Woman', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Nicolás Ibieta, Ernesto Díaz Espinoza, Benjamín Luna', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza', 'Fernanda Urrejola, Matías Oviedo, Jorge Alis, Sofía García, Nicolás Ibieta, Alex Rivera, Mauricio Pesutic, Nicolás Oyarce', null, 'A powerful Argentine gangster uses everything in his power to stop the woman that wants to kill him, a sexy mercenary known as "the machine gun woman". The staggering sum of cash he offers for her head sets in motion an army of hitmen. And also, by accident, bursts in the life of naïve DJ Santiago, a common youth that will have to steel his guts against the underworld, and above all, survive the irresistible - and bloodthirsty - Machine Gun Woman.', 'A powerful Argentine gangster uses everything in his power to stop the woman that wants to kill him, a sexy mercenary known as "the machine gun woman". The staggering sum of cash he offers for her head sets in motion an army of hitmen. And also, by accident, bursts in the life of naïve DJ Santiago, a common youth that will have to steel his guts against the underworld, and above all, survive the irresistible - and bloodthirsty - Machine Gun Woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRLfAug1FgrhNIP90ZZXq8gUp7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232195'),
  ('1065143855376209849', 'Bring Me the Horizon: L.I.V.E. in São Paulo', 2026, 'Music, Documentary, Musical', 'Oliver Sykes, CiRCUS HEaD', null, 'Oliver Sykes, MAT NICHOLLS, Lee Malia', 'R', 'The band''s best show yet, this film expands POST HUMAN''s visual world with high-end production, fan perspectives, and iconic characters E.V.E, Selene, and M8. Multi-camera footage, drones, and fan videos create an immersive experience.', 'The band''s best show yet, this film expands POST HUMAN''s visual world with high-end production, fan perspectives, and iconic characters E.V.E, Selene, and M8. Multi-camera footage, drones, and fan videos create an immersive experience.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FdHnCH7HoVE7MBwc2lvgbSM3jXg7.jpg', 'plex:movie:bring-me-the-horizon-l-i-v-e-in-sao-paulo'),
  ('966150308277395227', 'Bring the Law', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Scout Taylor-Compton, Scout Taylor Compton', 'Josh Ridgway', 'Brendan Fehr, Danielle Harris, Nicky Whelan, Mickey Rourke, Peter Facinelli', null, 'A disgraced LA cop is chosen to lead a task force against a local crime syndicate and uncovers a conspiracy of corruption in his own department.', 'A disgraced LA cop is chosen to lead a task force against a local crime syndicate and uncovers a conspiracy of corruption in his own department.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F3%2Fgracenote%2F344e39e74ec530be745ed0d66117774d.jpg', 'plex:movie:bring-the-law'),
  ('1143969865147820672', 'Bring the Soul: The Movie', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', 'Park Jun-soo', null, 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'A glimpse into K-pop group BTS’ world away from the stage, featuring intimate group discussions alongside spectacular concert performances from their world tour.', 'A glimpse into K-pop group BTS’ world away from the stage, featuring intimate group discussions alongside spectacular concert performances from their world tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x5CguA0MxHqbSjhi14UEuK7c95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611291'),
  ('865628952647753805', 'Bring Them Down', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Christopher Andrews, Nick Cooke, Tony Aherne', 'Christopher Andrews, Jonathan Hourigan', 'Christopher Abbott, Barry Keoghan, Colm Meaney, Susan Lynch, Nora-Jane Noone, Paul Ready, Aaron Heffernan, Conor MacNeill', 'R', 'When the ongoing rivalry between farmers Michael and Jack suddenly escalates, it triggers a chain of events that take increasingly violent and devastating turns, leaving both families permanently altered.', 'When the ongoing rivalry between farmers Michael and Jack suddenly escalates, it triggers a chain of events that take increasingly violent and devastating turns, leaving both families permanently altered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jskL5eOFTQknpRalJ4chVYyuFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804862'),
  ('60305336787770902', 'Bringing Christmas Home', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Mike Rohl', 'Casie Tabanou', 'Jill Wagner, Paul Greene, Simon Arblaster, Cameron Paisley, Jess Brown, Lauren Acala', null, 'Retired military officer, now Military History professor, Caroline Upton is enlisted to assist antiques store owner, Russell Carlisle in finding the family of WWII Army officer Orin Newton before Christmas with the hope of returning precious personal artifacts – Orin’s dress uniform, medals, and a stack of love letters from his beloved Alice who waits for him back home. Epaulettes and insignia provide initial clues, though the search seems to dead end when Caroline discovers Orin was captured and listed as MIA. Caroline and Russell then search the love letters for clues as to what happened to Orin and whether he ever made it home to Alice.', 'Retired military officer, now Military History professor, Caroline Upton is enlisted to assist antiques store owner, Russell Carlisle in finding the family of WWII Army officer Orin Newton before Christmas with the hope of returning precious personal artifacts – Orin’s dress uniform, medals, and a stack of love letters from his beloved Alice who waits for him back home. Epaulettes and insignia provide initial clues, though the search seems to dead end when Caroline discovers Orin was captured and listed as MIA. Caroline and Russell then search the love letters for clues as to what happened to Orin and whether he ever made it home to Alice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXjZ75x4hoR3FaSnGfot1PKQasV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142767'),
  ('897258976579488273', 'Bringing Down the House', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Adam Shankman, Julio Macat, Conte Mark Matal', 'Jason Filardi', 'Steve Martin, Queen Latifah, Eugene Levy, Joan Plowright, Jean Smart, Kimberly J. Brown, Angus T. Jones, Missi Pyle', 'PG-13', 'Uptight lawyer Peter Sanderson wants to dive back into dating after his divorce and has a hard time meeting the right women. He tries online dating and lucks out when he starts chatting with a fellow lawyer. The two agree to meet in the flesh, but the woman he meets — an escaped African-American convict named Charlene — is not what he expected. Peter is freaked out, but Charlene tries to convince him to take her case and prove her innocence. Along the way, she wreaks havoc on his middle-class life as he gets a lesson in learning to lighten up.', 'Uptight lawyer Peter Sanderson wants to dive back into dating after his divorce and has a hard time meeting the right women. He tries online dating and lucks out when he starts chatting with a fellow lawyer. The two agree to meet in the flesh, but the woman he meets — an escaped African-American convict named Charlene — is not what he expected. Peter is freaked out, but Charlene tries to convince him to take her case and prove her innocence. Along the way, she wreaks havoc on his middle-class life as he gets a lesson in learning to lighten up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jic0ULHTcqQQaCSIEw6SAhHhIPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10678'),
  ('622688760498121445', 'Bringing Out the Dead', 1999, 'Drama', 'Martin Scorsese, Robert Richardson, Christopher Surgent', 'Paul Schrader', 'Nicolas Cage, Patricia Arquette, John Goodman, Ving Rhames, Tom Sizemore, Marc Anthony, Mary Beth Hurt, Cliff Curtis', 'R', 'Once called "Father Frank" for his efforts to rescue lives, Frank Pierce sees the ghosts of those he failed to save around every turn. He has tried everything he can to get fired, calling in sick, delaying taking calls where he might have to face one more victim he couldn''t help, yet cannot quit the job on his own.', 'Once called "Father Frank" for his efforts to rescue lives, Frank Pierce sees the ghosts of those he failed to save around every turn. He has tried everything he can to get fired, calling in sick, delaying taking calls where he might have to face one more victim he couldn''t help, yet cannot quit the job on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gE2Q8mL0m0EA6HakRyc92uzSPJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8649'),
  ('611438065217613774', 'Bringing Up Baby', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Russell Metty, Howard Hawks, Roy Webb', 'Dudley Nichols, Hagar Wilde', 'Katharine Hepburn, Cary Grant, Charles Ruggles, Walter Catlett, Barry Fitzgerald, May Robson, Fritz Feld, Leona Roberts', 'NR', 'David Huxley is waiting to get a bone he needs for his museum collection. Through a series of strange circumstances, he meets Susan Vance, and the duo have a series of misadventures which include a leopard called Baby.', 'David Huxley is waiting to get a bone he needs for his museum collection. Through a series of strange circumstances, he meets Susan Vance, and the duo have a series of misadventures which include a leopard called Baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTNNOtemaYmtx3k2NpsLMRJKEwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900'),
  ('451283108275667488', 'Brink of Life', 1958, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Max Wilén, Gösta Ekman', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Eva Dahlbeck, Ingrid Thulin, Bibi Andersson, Barbro Hiort af Ornäs, Erland Josephson, Max von Sydow, Gunnar Sjöberg, Ann-Marie Gyllenspetz', null, 'This intimate chamber drama, set in a maternity ward, follows the emotional crises of three women as they grapple with motherhood.', 'This intimate chamber drama, set in a maternity ward, follows the emotional crises of three women as they grapple with motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/powLbhuyWu53PHe6NrHoDCGewUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60899'),
  ('411556930530662616', 'Brink!', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie, Family', 'Greg Beeman, Rodney Charters', 'Jeff Schechter', 'Erik von Detten, Sam Horrigan, Christina Vidal Mitchell, Robin Riker, Geoffrey Blake, Walter Jones, Patrick Levis, Joey Simmrin', 'G', 'Andy "Brink" Brinker and his in-line skating crew--Peter, Jordy, and Gabriella--who call themselves "Soul-Skaters" (which means they skate for the fun of it, and not for the money), clash with a group of sponsored skaters, Team X-Bladz--led by Val--with whom they attend high school in southern California. When Brink discovers his family is in financial trouble, he goes against the wishes of his parents and his friends and joins Team X-Bladz. Brink tries to lead a double life but will be able to pull it off?', 'Andy "Brink" Brinker and his in-line skating crew--Peter, Jordy, and Gabriella--who call themselves "Soul-Skaters" (which means they skate for the fun of it, and not for the money), clash with a group of sponsored skaters, Team X-Bladz--led by Val--with whom they attend high school in southern California. When Brink discovers his family is in financial trouble, he goes against the wishes of his parents and his friends and joins Team X-Bladz. Brink tries to lead a double life but will be able to pull it off?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hul7jmZJsBOjqKNZIEzxJPyemca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15043'),
  ('811504517917425286', 'Britain and the Blitz', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Ella Wright', null, 'Frieda Anderson, Ballard Berkeley, Tom Betts, Eric Brady, Winston Churchill, Adolf Hitler, King George VI of the United Kingdom', null, 'Documentary looking back at a Britain during the darkest days of WWII using stunning new archived footage and interviews with people who lived through it.', 'Documentary looking back at a Britain during the darkest days of WWII using stunning new archived footage and interviews with people who lived through it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yimg7ZM08WoNOPLKhtfLRvVC6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1462776'),
  ('1027130872336393717', 'Britannia Hospital', 1982, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Mike Fash, Lindsay Anderson', 'David Sherwin', 'Graham Crowden, Leonard Rossiter, Malcolm McDowell, Joan Plowright, Mark Hamill, Jill Bennett, Brian Pettifer, John Moffatt', 'R', 'Britannia Hospital, an esteemed English institution, is marking its gala anniversary with a visit by the Queen Mother herself. But when investigative reporter Mick Travis arrives to cover the celebration, he finds the hospital under siege by striking workers, ruthless unions, violent demonstrators, racist aristocrats, an African cannibal dictator, and sinister human experiments.', 'Britannia Hospital, an esteemed English institution, is marking its gala anniversary with a visit by the Queen Mother herself. But when investigative reporter Mick Travis arrives to cover the celebration, he finds the hospital under siege by striking workers, ruthless unions, violent demonstrators, racist aristocrats, an African cannibal dictator, and sinister human experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbqfoco8nzpaPEHSxQIBTgGpAed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26639'),
  ('884318601228785449', 'Britannic', 2000, 'Action, Drama, History, TV Movie, War', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Ian Hutchinson', 'Brett Thompson, Kim Owen Smith, Brian Trenchard-Smith', 'Amanda Ryan, Edward Atterton, Jacqueline Bisset, Ben Daniels, John Rhys-Davies, Bruce Payne, Alex Ferns, Archie Davies', 'NR', 'It was the sister ship of the infamous Titanic... and its final destiny was the same. Experience the true untold story of Britannic, a tumultuous, epic voyage of human passion, courage and betrayal aboard an ill-fated ocean liner bound for a shattering demise. With the world at war, an undercover British agent (Amanda Ryan), embarks the Britannic in search of a German spy believed to be on board to sabotage the ship. Posing as a governess, the undercover agent finds herself falling in love with the ship''s chaplain (Edward Atterton). In a stunning discovery, the lovers suddenly find themselves enemies of war. And when a massive explosion deals a deathblow to the ship, their battle becomes one for their own survival. With a dynamic, international cast and a story line that hosts a chilling tale of espionage, politics and romance, Britannic brings one of history''s most devastating events to riveting, new life.', 'It was the sister ship of the infamous Titanic... and its final destiny was the same. Experience the true untold story of Britannic, a tumultuous, epic voyage of human passion, courage and betrayal aboard an ill-fated ocean liner bound for a shattering demise. With the world at war, an undercover British agent (Amanda Ryan), embarks the Britannic in search of a German spy believed to be on board to sabotage the ship. Posing as a governess, the undercover agent finds herself falling in love with the ship''s chaplain (Edward Atterton). In a stunning discovery, the lovers suddenly find themselves enemies of war. And when a massive explosion deals a deathblow to the ship, their battle becomes one for their own survival. With a dynamic, international cast and a story line that hosts a chilling tale of espionage, politics and romance, Britannic brings one of history''s most devastating events to riveting, new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzjEdjrRNAe6gIYcQFm0lKAby6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59709'),
  ('340232003137267479', 'British Agent', 1934, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'Michael Curtiz, Ernest Haller', 'Laird Doyle', 'Leslie Howard, Kay Francis, William Gargan, Phillip Reed, Irving Pichel, Ivan F. Simpson, Halliwell Hobbes, J. Carrol Naish', 'NR', 'In the days leading up to the Russian Revolution, Stephen Locke, a minor British diplomat in St Petersburg, falls in love with a Russian spy.', 'In the days leading up to the Russian Revolution, Stephen Locke, a minor British diplomat in St Petersburg, falls in love with a Russian spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RpsrH4jOCOoqmOxO7yS3Id1mJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134618'),
  ('689266838782770346', 'British Intelligence', 1939, 'War, Drama', 'Terry O. Morse', 'Lee Katz', 'Boris Karloff, Margaret Lindsay, Bruce Lester, Leonard Mudie, Holmes Herbert, Austin Fairman, William Bailey, Louise Brien', 'NR', 'During WWI pretty German master spy Helene von Lorbeer is sent undercover to London to live with the family of a high-placed British official where she is to rendezvous with the butler Valdar, also a spy, and help him transmit secret war plans back to Germany.', 'During WWI pretty German master spy Helene von Lorbeer is sent undercover to London to live with the family of a high-placed British official where she is to rendezvous with the butler Valdar, also a spy, and help him transmit secret war plans back to Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bD2ET0q1eVjJnDDLQ3egApB71fL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51787'),
  ('857192291913709963', 'British Sounds', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Charles Stewart, Jean-Henri Roger', 'Jean-Henri Roger, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'NR', 'Jean-Luc Godard brings his firebrand political cinema to the UK, exploring the revolutionary signals in late ''60s British society. Constructed as a montage of various disconnected political acts (in line with Godard''s then appropriation of Soviet director Dziga Vertov''s agitprop techniques), it combines a diverse range of footage, from students discussing The Beatles to the production line at the MG factory in Oxfordshire, burnished with onscreen political sloganeering.', 'Jean-Luc Godard brings his firebrand political cinema to the UK, exploring the revolutionary signals in late ''60s British society. Constructed as a montage of various disconnected political acts (in line with Godard''s then appropriation of Soviet director Dziga Vertov''s agitprop techniques), it combines a diverse range of footage, from students discussing The Beatles to the production line at the MG factory in Oxfordshire, burnished with onscreen political sloganeering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFPT9FwpmZvZZGN4wcsnJJb0DeO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39239'),
  ('360823095530064640', 'Britney Spears: Live from Las Vegas', 2001, 'Music', 'Marty Callner, Kevin Tancharoen', null, 'Britney Spears, Jon Voight, Brian Friedman, Aminah Abdul-Jillil, Nanci Anderson, Andre Fuentes, Brooke Lipton, Leo Moctezuma', 'NR', 'Have you ever had a dream that felt so real, you couldn''t tell the difference between the real world and the dream world? On November 18, 2001, the world''s biggest star, Britney Spears, brought her "Dream Within a Dream" Tour to the MGM Grand Garden Arena in legendary Las Vegas. Watch this defining concert, witnessed by millions of fans, as it was broadcast live on HBO.', 'Have you ever had a dream that felt so real, you couldn''t tell the difference between the real world and the dream world? On November 18, 2001, the world''s biggest star, Britney Spears, brought her "Dream Within a Dream" Tour to the MGM Grand Garden Arena in legendary Las Vegas. Watch this defining concert, witnessed by millions of fans, as it was broadcast live on HBO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Scmotf9nkU6KEPk4hRrp45J7L0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34900'),
  ('1116660916281928090', 'Britney vs. Spears', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Megan Stacey, Shane Sigler, Erin Lee Carr', null, 'Britney Spears, Felicia Culotta, Erin Lee Carr, Jenny Eliscu, Adnan Ghalib, Tania Baron, Jamie Spears, Andrew Gallery', null, 'Journalist Jenny Eliscu and filmmaker Erin Lee Carr investigate Britney Spears'' fight for freedom by way of exclusive interviews and confidential evidence.', 'Journalist Jenny Eliscu and filmmaker Erin Lee Carr investigate Britney Spears'' fight for freedom by way of exclusive interviews and confidential evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sd43f1ZDz8H8TDhcIbyKuUuJmIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797594'),
  ('1104915253758280031', 'Britney: For the Record', 2008, 'Music, Documentary', 'Phil Griffin', null, 'Britney Spears, Lin-Manuel Miranda, Madonna, Russell Brand, Chris Brown, Paris Hilton, Rihanna, Nicole Scherzinger', 'NR', 'An introspective documentary which chronicles pop music queen Britney Spears'' return to the spotlight after her much-publicized professional and personal struggles. Honest, raw and revealing, the one-hour special shares some of Spears'' most intimate moments in the span of 60 days, and gives fans an inside look at Britney in the recording studio and on set filming the music videos for one of music''s most triumphant comebacks.', 'An introspective documentary which chronicles pop music queen Britney Spears'' return to the spotlight after her much-publicized professional and personal struggles. Honest, raw and revealing, the one-hour special shares some of Spears'' most intimate moments in the span of 60 days, and gives fans an inside look at Britney in the recording studio and on set filming the music videos for one of music''s most triumphant comebacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9D1dXNba5PViFBroDFMf07LyEuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51514'),
  ('987469328294302744', 'Brittany Runs a Marathon', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thomas Fatone, Kim Thompson, Paul Downs Colaizzo', 'Paul Downs Colaizzo', 'Jillian Bell, Michaela Watkins, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Lil Rel Howery, Micah Stock, Alice Lee, Patch Darragh, Peter Vack', 'R', 'Hilarious and outgoing, Brittany Forgler, is everybody’s best friend ― except her own. Her partying, underemployment and toxic relationships are catching up with her. She receives a startling wake-up call when a visit to the doctor reveals how unhealthy she is. Motivated to lose weight, but too broke for a gym and too proud to ask for help, Brit is at a loss, until her neighbor pushes her to run one sweaty block. Soon, she sets an almost unthinkable goal: the New York City Marathon.', 'Hilarious and outgoing, Brittany Forgler, is everybody’s best friend ― except her own. Her partying, underemployment and toxic relationships are catching up with her. She receives a startling wake-up call when a visit to the doctor reveals how unhealthy she is. Motivated to lose weight, but too broke for a gym and too proud to ask for help, Brit is at a loss, until her neighbor pushes her to run one sweaty block. Soon, she sets an almost unthinkable goal: the New York City Marathon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSWePCEtLpNdD7ykW6OuZqvVhyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529862'),
  ('817121500049553060', 'Bro Daddy', 2022, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran, Abinandhan Ramanujam', 'Sreejith N, Bibin Maliekal', 'Mohanlal, Prithviraj Sukumaran, Kalyani Priyadarshan, Meena, Lalu Alex, Kaniha, Soubin Shahir, Kavya Shetty', null, 'John Kattady and his wife Annamma think about marrying off their son Eesho to Anna, who is the daughter of their long-time family friend Kurien. Eesho and Anna don’t act too impressed with each other, despite their parents’ interest in the alliance. Little do the families know what is going on behind the curtains in their lives.', 'John Kattady and his wife Annamma think about marrying off their son Eesho to Anna, who is the daughter of their long-time family friend Kurien. Eesho and Anna don’t act too impressed with each other, despite their parents’ interest in the alliance. Little do the families know what is going on behind the curtains in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/io8nwO6t74YVnRHWBaAQQdzMftI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842275'),
  ('899303475353028965', 'Broad Peak', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Marek Palka, Leszek Dawid, Pat Howl', 'Łukasz Ludkowski', 'Ireneusz Czop, Maja Ostaszewska, Piotr Głowacki, Łukasz Simlat, Tomasz Sapryk, Dawid Ogrodnik, Maciej Raniszewski, Maciej Kulig', null, 'After climbing Broad Peak mountain, Maciej Berbeka learns his journey to the summit is incomplete. 25 years later, he sets out to finish what he started.', 'After climbing Broad Peak mountain, Maciej Berbeka learns his journey to the summit is incomplete. 25 years later, he sets out to finish what he started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7eiUpUb27Vpd3MBfLro9rkUo0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999127'),
  ('41273727089946564', 'Broadcast News', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James L. Brooks, Michael Ballhaus, Yudi Bennett', 'James L. Brooks', 'Holly Hunter, William Hurt, Albert Brooks, Robert Prosky, Lois Chiles, Joan Cusack, Peter Hackes, Christian Clemenson', 'R', 'A high-strung news producer finds herself in a love triangle between a talented but self-doubting reporter and a charming news anchor who embodies the growing trivialization of news that she is determined to fight against.', 'A high-strung news producer finds herself in a love triangle between a talented but self-doubting reporter and a charming news anchor who embodies the growing trivialization of news that she is determined to fight against.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQNR1Lc0qAF5xuBySpDn481KVjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12626'),
  ('134071909890426683', 'Broadcast Signal Intrusion', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Scott Thiele, Jacob Gentry, Anthony E. Cabral', 'Phil Drinkwater, Tim Woodall', 'Harry Shum Jr., Kelley Mack, Chris Sullivan, Michael B. Woods, Arif Yampolsky, Richard Cotovsky, Steve Pringle, Justin Welborn', null, 'In the late 90s, a video archivist unearths a series of sinister pirate broadcasts and becomes obsessed with uncovering the dark conspiracy behind them.', 'In the late 90s, a video archivist unearths a series of sinister pirate broadcasts and becomes obsessed with uncovering the dark conspiracy behind them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMv5Fgm718QB8anCBpJZIKj17hX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795518'),
  ('1092038661932983006', 'Broadcasting Christmas', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Sullivan, Theo Angell', 'Topher Payne', 'Melissa Joan Hart, Dean Cain, Cynthia Gibb, Jackée Harry, Richard Kline, Krista Braun, Todd Litzinger, Josiah Harvey', 'G', 'When the opportunity to co-host a talk show with the fabulous talk show diva Veronika presents itself two weeks before Christmas, Emily thinks this is her big break. To her surprise, she discovers she has stiff competition with Charlie, the local TV anchor who is her near equal on another station. With such interest and support for both reporters, a contest is created: for the two weeks leading up to Christmas, who can cover the best and most meaningful Christmas stories on the local news?', 'When the opportunity to co-host a talk show with the fabulous talk show diva Veronika presents itself two weeks before Christmas, Emily thinks this is her big break. To her surprise, she discovers she has stiff competition with Charlie, the local TV anchor who is her near equal on another station. With such interest and support for both reporters, a contest is created: for the two weeks leading up to Christmas, who can cover the best and most meaningful Christmas stories on the local news?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8VrxCL42EejLOWbzSfkLoLix5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421759'),
  ('820575898771262406', 'Broadway', 1929, 'Music, Crime', 'Pál Fejős, William J. Reiter, Hal Mohr', 'George Abbott', 'Glenn Tryon, Evelyn Brent, Merna Kennedy, Thomas E. Jackson, Otis Harlan, Robert Ellis, Marion Lord, Fritz Feld', null, 'A naive young dancer in a Broadway show innocently gets involved in backstage bootlegging and murder.', 'A naive young dancer in a Broadway show innocently gets involved in backstage bootlegging and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bRcXXQTMLDEMDAyG7FgTVrYILy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130717'),
  ('738279461748806790', 'Broadway Bill', 1934, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker', 'Robert Riskin', 'Warner Baxter, Myrna Loy, Walter Connolly, Helen Vinson, Douglass Dumbrille, Raymond Walburn, Lynne Overman, Clarence Muse', 'NR', 'Tycoon J.L. Higgins controls his whole family, but one of his sons-in-law, Dan Brooks, and his daughter Alice are fed up with that. Brooks quits his job as manager of J.L.''s paper box factory and devotes his life to his racing horse Broadway Bill, but his bankroll is thin and the luck is against him. He is arrested because of $150 he owes somebody for horse food, but suddenly a planned fraud by somebody else seems to offer him a chance...', 'Tycoon J.L. Higgins controls his whole family, but one of his sons-in-law, Dan Brooks, and his daughter Alice are fed up with that. Brooks quits his job as manager of J.L.''s paper box factory and devotes his life to his racing horse Broadway Bill, but his bankroll is thin and the luck is against him. He is arrested because of $150 he owes somebody for horse food, but suddenly a planned fraud by somebody else seems to offer him a chance...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDWQjYnnxNTsU99mpjr4CRPOry7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77198'),
  ('160863510895522109', 'Broadway by Light', 1958, 'Documentary', 'William Klein, William Klein', 'Chris Marker', null, 'NR', 'An experimental meditation on Times Square''s marquees and iconic advertising that captures the concurrently seedy and dazzling aspects of New York''s Great White Way.', 'An experimental meditation on Times Square''s marquees and iconic advertising that captures the concurrently seedy and dazzling aspects of New York''s Great White Way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pGR50cKGqnPCMHDt77HVwOQxvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128700'),
  ('390121367331855408', 'Broadway Damage', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Victor Mignatti', 'Victor Mignatti', 'Hugh Panaro, Michael Shawn Lucas, Mara Hobel, Aaron Williams, Alan Filderman, Gary Janetti, Celeste Lecesne, Tyagi Schwartz', null, 'A quirky, romantic comedy about the complexity and frustration of finding a true love in the gay community. Marc is a struggling actor who finds an apartment in NYC by searching the obituaries. He lives with his out-of-work, eccentric fag-hag Cynthia. His best friend, Robert, is secretly in love with Marc, while Marc falls head over heels for flighty studio musician David. Things heat up as Marc''s desire for David keeps him waiting by the phone, while Cynthia gets financially cut off from her rich parents and Robert struggles to express his feelings for Marc.', 'A quirky, romantic comedy about the complexity and frustration of finding a true love in the gay community. Marc is a struggling actor who finds an apartment in NYC by searching the obituaries. He lives with his out-of-work, eccentric fag-hag Cynthia. His best friend, Robert, is secretly in love with Marc, while Marc falls head over heels for flighty studio musician David. Things heat up as Marc''s desire for David keeps him waiting by the phone, while Cynthia gets financially cut off from her rich parents and Robert struggles to express his feelings for Marc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJ1NYKSDq3j3yA9gaXWg3onMaTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41638'),
  ('64131434997913136', 'Broadway Danny Rose', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Woody Allen, Gordon Willis, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Mia Farrow, Nick Apollo Forte, Sandy Baron, Corbett Monica, Jackie Gayle, Morty Gunty, Will Jordan', 'PG', 'A hapless talent manager named Danny Rose, by helping a client, gets dragged into a love triangle involving the mob. His story is told in flashback, an anecdote shared amongst a group of comedians over lunch at New York''s Carnegie Deli. Rose''s one-man talent agency represents countless incompetent entertainers, including a one-legged tap dancer, and one slightly talented one: washed-up lounge singer Lou Canova, whose career is on the rebound.', 'A hapless talent manager named Danny Rose, by helping a client, gets dragged into a love triangle involving the mob. His story is told in flashback, an anecdote shared amongst a group of comedians over lunch at New York''s Carnegie Deli. Rose''s one-man talent agency represents countless incompetent entertainers, including a one-legged tap dancer, and one slightly talented one: washed-up lounge singer Lou Canova, whose career is on the rebound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUgolImcg0PRiT33UNjK409aQoJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12762'),
  ('578150928675560047', 'Broadway Melody of 1936', 1935, 'Music, Comedy', 'Roy Del Ruth, Charles Rosher, W.S. Van Dyke', 'Jack McGowan, Sid Silvers', 'Jack Benny, Eleanor Powell, Robert Taylor, Una Merkel, Sid Silvers, Buddy Ebsen, June Knight, Vilma Ebsen', null, 'Lovely, gifted Irene Foster hopes that her childhood sweetheart-turned Broadway producer Robert Gordon will recognize her--and her talent. Gordon is too busy sparring with a dirt-dishing gossip columnist to notice, but his wisecracking, heart-of-gold secretary certainly does. She and Irene must use their wits to show him what he''s missing!', 'Lovely, gifted Irene Foster hopes that her childhood sweetheart-turned Broadway producer Robert Gordon will recognize her--and her talent. Gordon is too busy sparring with a dirt-dishing gossip columnist to notice, but his wisecracking, heart-of-gold secretary certainly does. She and Irene must use their wits to show him what he''s missing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ARXx0pReQ3AMnYKY4f292D77uB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43890'),
  ('717355036713693072', 'Broadway Melody of 1938', 1937, 'Music, Romance', 'Roy Del Ruth, William H. Daniels', 'Jack McGowan', 'Robert Taylor, Eleanor Powell, George Murphy, Binnie Barnes, Buddy Ebsen, Sophie Tucker, Judy Garland, Charles Igor Gorin', 'NR', 'Steve Raleight wants to produce a show on Broadway. He finds a backer, Herman Whipple and a leading lady, Sally Lee. But Caroline Whipple forces Steve to use a known star, not a newcomer. Sally purchases a horse, she used to train when her parents had a farm before the depression and with to ex-vaudevillians, Sonny Ledford and Peter Trott she trains it to win a race, providing the money Steve needs for his show.', 'Steve Raleight wants to produce a show on Broadway. He finds a backer, Herman Whipple and a leading lady, Sally Lee. But Caroline Whipple forces Steve to use a known star, not a newcomer. Sally purchases a horse, she used to train when her parents had a farm before the depression and with to ex-vaudevillians, Sonny Ledford and Peter Trott she trains it to win a race, providing the money Steve needs for his show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45PV63ncLTROIlyDTVFvVaaYPyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43857'),
  ('256703240027057745', 'Broadway Melody of 1940', 1940, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Norman Taurog, Oliver T. Marsh, John S. Detlie', 'George Oppenheimer, Leon Gordon', 'Fred Astaire, Eleanor Powell, George Murphy, Frank Morgan, Ian Hunter, Florence Rice, Lynne Carver, Ann Morriss', null, 'Johnny Brett and King Shaw are an unsuccessful dance team in New York. A producer discovers Brett as the new partner for Clare Bennett, but Brett, who thinks he is one of the people they lent money to, gives him the name of his partner.', 'Johnny Brett and King Shaw are an unsuccessful dance team in New York. A producer discovers Brett as the new partner for Clare Bennett, but Brett, who thinks he is one of the people they lent money to, gives him the name of his partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TiHFf4fh8B14G3ZI4lE8wuHvtQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43809'),
  ('163125085550725470', 'Brocéliande', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Doug Headline, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Doug Headline, Benoît Lestang', 'Elsa Kikoïne, Cylia Malki, Alice Taglioni, Mathieu Simonet, Alexis Loret, André Wilms, Vernon Dobtcheff, Cédric Chevalme', null, 'Chloé, a student specializing in Celtic History, participate in a dig in the forest of Broceliande while a series of murder occurs on the campus. Chloé must soon face the mythical monster behind the string of murder and use her knowledge to make it out of the forest alive ...', 'Chloé, a student specializing in Celtic History, participate in a dig in the forest of Broceliande while a series of murder occurs on the campus. Chloé must soon face the mythical monster behind the string of murder and use her knowledge to make it out of the forest alive ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecoNpiw1U1Eh1G4VuBHHkWmdE39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20019'),
  ('802766301443897406', 'Bróder', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gustavo Hadba, Adriano Kakazu, Alice Gomez', 'Newton Cannito, Laura Malin, Jeferson De', 'Caio Blat, Jonathan Haagensen, Sílvio Guindane, Aílton Graça, Zezé Motta, Cássia Kis, João Acaiabe, Gustavo Machado', null, 'Three childhood friends plan meeting for a day in order to reassert their friendships and fight for their differences. One of them is involved with crime, one is a famous football player and the other struggles to maintain a middle-class lifestyle.', 'Three childhood friends plan meeting for a day in order to reassert their friendships and fight for their differences. One of them is involved with crime, one is a famous football player and the other struggles to maintain a middle-class lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iekvJjtqxRFfnHQU5aluWSpG7uQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74228'),
  ('231479855769895563', 'Broil', 2020, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Wai Sun Cheng, Edward Drake', 'Piper Mars, Edward Drake', 'Avery Konrad, Jonathan Lipnicki, Timothy V. Murphy, Corey Large, Lochlyn Munro, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Alyson Bath', null, 'A listless grand-daughter, Chance Sinclair, is sentenced to live with her draconian grand-father, August after a violent incident at school and begins to question the source of her families immense wealth and power. When Chance''s scheming Mom, June hires a troubled chef Sydney to poison August, the family''s monstrous secrets are revealed over the course of one bloody night. Every soul is up for grabs as The Sinclair Family Games Night gets underway and Chance learns that being a part of this family is a blood-in, blood-out proposition.', 'A listless grand-daughter, Chance Sinclair, is sentenced to live with her draconian grand-father, August after a violent incident at school and begins to question the source of her families immense wealth and power. When Chance''s scheming Mom, June hires a troubled chef Sydney to poison August, the family''s monstrous secrets are revealed over the course of one bloody night. Every soul is up for grabs as The Sinclair Family Games Night gets underway and Chance learns that being a part of this family is a blood-in, blood-out proposition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5RXeLUSrAVUjCEfFloXzuxI8ZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669770'),
  ('921269789883560657', 'Broke', 2025, 'Western, Drama', 'Carlyle Eubank, Charlie Sarroff, Jeri Rafter', 'Carlyle Eubank', 'Wyatt Russell, Auden Thornton, Dennis Quaid, Mary McDonnell, Johnny Berchtold, Tom Skerritt, Austin Amelio, Alet Taylor', 'R', 'A bronc rider in denial about his fading rodeo career battles against brain injury and a sudden blizzard while reflecting on how it became so difficult to achieve his dreams.', 'A bronc rider in denial about his fading rodeo career battles against brain injury and a sudden blizzard while reflecting on how it became so difficult to achieve his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooCDeGxZ5to9CRKxkBEAIWtoRA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883954'),
  ('1102565047572782184', 'Brokeback Mountain', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo Prieto, Brad Moerke, Michael Hausman', 'Diana Ossana, Larry McMurtry', 'Heath Ledger, Jake Gyllenhaal, Michelle Williams, Anne Hathaway, Randy Quaid, Linda Cardellini, Anna Faris, David Harbour', 'R', 'In 1960s Wyoming, two men develop a strong emotional and sexual relationship that endures as a lifelong connection complicating their lives as they get married and start families of their own.', 'In 1960s Wyoming, two men develop a strong emotional and sexual relationship that endures as a lifelong connection complicating their lives as they get married and start families of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aByfQOQBNa4CMFwIgq3QrqY2ZHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142'),
  ('1077287936767509261', 'Brokedown Palace', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jonathan Kaplan, Liz Ryan, Phil Hardage', 'David Arata', 'Claire Danes, Kate Beckinsale, Bill Pullman, Jacqueline Kim, Lou Diamond Phillips, Daniel Lapaine, Tom Amandes, Aimee Graham', 'PG-13', 'Best friends Alice and Darlene take a trip to Thailand after graduating high school. In Thailand, they meet a captivating Australian man, who calls himself Nick Parks. Darlene is particularly smitten with Nick and convinces Alice to take Nick up on his offer to treat the two of them to what amounts to a day trip to Hong Kong. In the airport, the girls are seized by the police and shocked to discover that one of their bags contains heroin.', 'Best friends Alice and Darlene take a trip to Thailand after graduating high school. In Thailand, they meet a captivating Australian man, who calls himself Nick Parks. Darlene is particularly smitten with Nick and convinces Alice to take Nick up on his offer to treat the two of them to what amounts to a day trip to Hong Kong. In the airport, the girls are seized by the police and shocked to discover that one of their bags contains heroin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWxoggA0KCS5oMPDOjIDYZYzryE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17707'),
  ('767790916954576307', 'Broken', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Timothy S. Kane, Lauren Raquel Pusich, Charity Thomson', 'Drew Pillsbury', 'Heather Graham, Jeremy Sisto, Randall Batinkoff, Jake Busey, Michael A. Goorjian, Linda Hamilton, Tess Harper, Bianca Lawson', 'R', 'A waitress confronts all the wrong turns she has made in her short life and ultimately ends up facing the biggest wrong turn of all: her dangerous ex-boyfriend who''s determined to win back her love or die trying.', 'A waitress confronts all the wrong turns she has made in her short life and ultimately ends up facing the biggest wrong turn of all: her dangerous ex-boyfriend who''s determined to win back her love or die trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssT0amMqtlIZXermcOkvd5hLQ4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20786'),
  ('848118510155007527', 'Broken', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rob Hardy, Rufus Norris, Matthew Hanson', 'Mark O''Rowe', 'Tim Roth, Eloise Laurence, Cillian Murphy, Zana Marjanović, Robert Emms, Rory Kinnear, Rosalie Kosky, Bill Milner', 'R', 'Three suburban English families'' lives intertwine with tragic consequences.', 'Three suburban English families'' lives intertwine with tragic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNeDPyJdeV4Gzs3TcVthM8AJYHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109584'),
  ('274729696520201637', 'Broken', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Lee Jung-ho, Hong Seung-chul, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Lee Jung-ho', 'Jung Jae-young, Lee Sung-min, Seo Jun-young, Lee Soo-bin, Lee Ju-seung, Kim Hong-pa, Kim Dae-myung, Jeong Seok-yong', null, 'Following the brutal rape and murder of his 16-year-old daughter, Sang-hyeon stumbles into an ever-widening conspiracy of rage, revenge, and murder.', 'Following the brutal rape and murder of his 16-year-old daughter, Sang-hyeon stumbles into an ever-widening conspiracy of rage, revenge, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuVlb2bEeTJhwwWBWe2JmX0gCX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264273'),
  ('953949956410349519', 'Broken', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Fernando Lorenzale, Facundo Escudero Salinas', 'Facundo Escudero Salinas', 'Jazmín Stuart, Beatriz Spelzini, César Bordón, Marcos Woinsky, Gustavo Pardi, Paula Tabachnik, Juana Bosco, Amancay Espíndola', null, 'A policewoman returns with her young daughter to her hometown to care for her dying mother. The murder of a young girl will keep her there longer than expected. She will try to solve a case that no one seems to care about, risking everything on the path.', 'A policewoman returns with her young daughter to her hometown to care for her dying mother. The murder of a young girl will keep her there longer than expected. She will try to solve a case that no one seems to care about, risking everything on the path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgcB8prE7NbNCeUhZHFbdkDPhYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890338'),
  ('342892703656375717', 'Broken Arrow', 1950, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Alfred Newman, Delmer Daves, Ernest Palmer', 'Albert Maltz', 'James Stewart, Jeff Chandler, Debra Paget, Basil Ruysdael, Will Geer, Joyce Mackenzie, Arthur Hunnicutt, Robert Adler', null, 'Indian scout Tom Jeffords is sent out to stem the war between the American settlers and Apaches in the late 1870s Arizona. He learns that the Indians kill only to protect themselves, or out of retaliation for white atrocities.', 'Indian scout Tom Jeffords is sent out to stem the war between the American settlers and Apaches in the late 1870s Arizona. He learns that the Indians kill only to protect themselves, or out of retaliation for white atrocities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n061xgOTAvJ2l06latNDF4s13FV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37292'),
  ('611571950166760208', 'Broken Arrow', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Peter Levy, John Woo, Josh McLaglen', 'Graham Yost', 'John Travolta, Christian Slater, Samantha Mathis, Delroy Lindo, Frank Whaley, Bob Gunton, Howie Long, Jack Thompson', 'R', 'When rogue stealth-fighter pilot Vic Deakins deliberately drops off the radar while on maneuvers, the Air Force ends up with two stolen nuclear warheads -- and Deakins''s co-pilot, Riley Hale, is the military''s only hope for getting them back. Traversing the deserted canyons of Utah, Hale teams with park ranger Terry Carmichael to put Deakins back in his box.', 'When rogue stealth-fighter pilot Vic Deakins deliberately drops off the radar while on maneuvers, the Air Force ends up with two stolen nuclear warheads -- and Deakins''s co-pilot, Riley Hale, is the military''s only hope for getting them back. Traversing the deserted canyons of Utah, Hale teams with park ranger Terry Carmichael to put Deakins back in his box.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBPMwYYJFvdCBkXrwV75peo5Lz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9208'),
  ('762348927342941221', 'Broken Blade: Fortress of Lamentation', 2011, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Tetsuro Amino, Nobuyoshi Habara', null, 'Yuhko Kaida, Kana Hanazawa, Yuichi Nakamura', 'PG-13', 'Baldr and his men carries Delphine back to the kingdom after discovering Rygart. Borcuse orders the attack on the capital without waiting for the others to rejoin. Sigyn makes a weapon using Athenian''s golem parts. Narvi finds her surviving men and return to protect the capital. Cleo decides to go back and hugs Sigyn good bye. Borcuse''s army manage to break the Krisnan''s first defense line and the battle moves into the streets. Sigyn''s men manage to find Delphine and repairs it while its automatic cooling system is still operating. When the Delphine cools, Rygart leaps to defend the kingdom and fought Borcuse. Sigyn delivers the make shift weapon to Rygart and he initially unable to fight Borcuse because he is too fast but when Borcuse''s Golen''s leg cracks, Rygart damages it. Borcuse comes out of the cockpit and use his handgun to shoot at Rygart replaying Girghe''s last moment. Rygart kills him and Borcuse''s army lost. Zess upon hearing Cleo''s escape decides to find her.', 'Baldr and his men carries Delphine back to the kingdom after discovering Rygart. Borcuse orders the attack on the capital without waiting for the others to rejoin. Sigyn makes a weapon using Athenian''s golem parts. Narvi finds her surviving men and return to protect the capital. Cleo decides to go back and hugs Sigyn good bye. Borcuse''s army manage to break the Krisnan''s first defense line and the battle moves into the streets. Sigyn''s men manage to find Delphine and repairs it while its automatic cooling system is still operating. When the Delphine cools, Rygart leaps to defend the kingdom and fought Borcuse. Sigyn delivers the make shift weapon to Rygart and he initially unable to fight Borcuse because he is too fast but when Borcuse''s Golen''s leg cracks, Rygart damages it. Borcuse comes out of the cockpit and use his handgun to shoot at Rygart replaying Girghe''s last moment. Rygart kills him and Borcuse''s army lost. Zess upon hearing Cleo''s escape decides to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFDzVk0FAQu0K0xZWGUs88mk3bH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55438'),
  ('721667478631752169', 'Broken Blade: Scars from an Assassin''s Blade', 2010, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Tetsuro Amino, Nobuyoshi Habara', null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Chiwa Saito, Minoru Shiraishi, Kazuya Nakai, Takuma Terashima, Yuichi Nakamura, Tomoya Kawai, Kana Hanazawa', 'PG-13', 'The inhabitants of the continent of Cruzon are born with the ability to freely control quartz. Technology based on this power allows them to perform a great multitude of tasks such as shoot projectiles and pilot mobile suits (called Golems in this society). Rygart Arrow is an un-sorcerer, a rare individual who is unable to levitate even the smallest crystal. Living with his brother on a farm, he receives a letter from an old friend, Hodr, the current king. Close companion of the king and queen when they were students at Assam Military School, Arrow is informed that a war is about to occur. Hodr called him because an ancient type of Golem has been found in a mining shaft. No one has been able to move it and Queen Sigyn, an expert engineer, suspects that maybe an un-sorcerer might be the key to activate it.', 'The inhabitants of the continent of Cruzon are born with the ability to freely control quartz. Technology based on this power allows them to perform a great multitude of tasks such as shoot projectiles and pilot mobile suits (called Golems in this society). Rygart Arrow is an un-sorcerer, a rare individual who is unable to levitate even the smallest crystal. Living with his brother on a farm, he receives a letter from an old friend, Hodr, the current king. Close companion of the king and queen when they were students at Assam Military School, Arrow is informed that a war is about to occur. Hodr called him because an ancient type of Golem has been found in a mining shaft. No one has been able to move it and Queen Sigyn, an expert engineer, suspects that maybe an un-sorcerer might be the key to activate it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LF8SXWW0KOrdA84ryhmE8WA2by.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55431'),
  ('991552653468753274', 'Broken Blade: The Gap Between Life and Death', 2011, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Tetsuro Amino, Kazuaki Funakura, Nobuyoshi Habara', 'Masashi Sogo', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Kana Hanazawa, Yuhko Kaida, Soichiro Hoshi, Chiwa Saito, Masashi Sugawara, Kazuya Nakai, Kohsuke Toriumi', 'PG-13', 'Fifth Break Blade Movie. Girge is questioned by Narvi over his surprise attack against Borcuse forces and has him detained so he does not repeat his antics again. Later Loggin, Rygart and Nile learns about True''s death but Nile is unsure whether to tell the true to Narvi. While Rygart and Baldr talk about Girge''s past and Cleo learns more about Zess''s academy days with Sigyn, the Athenian Invasion army have finally regroup and despite losing many Golems, Nike''s ego badly bruised by Girge and the death of one of his officers, Borcuse is overjoyed at finding two worthy opponents to fight, particular Rygart and Girge. Rygart, after finding out that Borcuse is heading to his hometown where his little brother Regatz lives, disobeys Narvi''s order to head home and search for his brother. However, when he arrives, the villagers have been killed by Borcuse''s men. Borcuse is glad to see Rygart is here and has duel with him while his men are ordered to watched.', 'Fifth Break Blade Movie. Girge is questioned by Narvi over his surprise attack against Borcuse forces and has him detained so he does not repeat his antics again. Later Loggin, Rygart and Nile learns about True''s death but Nile is unsure whether to tell the true to Narvi. While Rygart and Baldr talk about Girge''s past and Cleo learns more about Zess''s academy days with Sigyn, the Athenian Invasion army have finally regroup and despite losing many Golems, Nike''s ego badly bruised by Girge and the death of one of his officers, Borcuse is overjoyed at finding two worthy opponents to fight, particular Rygart and Girge. Rygart, after finding out that Borcuse is heading to his hometown where his little brother Regatz lives, disobeys Narvi''s order to head home and search for his brother. However, when he arrives, the villagers have been killed by Borcuse''s men. Borcuse is glad to see Rygart is here and has duel with him while his men are ordered to watched.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kC4A9ayVCAEgAiZmn0x8RLsrQ3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55437'),
  ('695430111570820085', 'Broken Blade: The Land of Calamity', 2010, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Tetsuro Amino, Nobuyoshi Habara', null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Chiwa Saito, Yuichi Nakamura, Minoru Shiraishi, Kana Hanazawa, Marina Inoue, Soichiro Hoshi, Kohsuke Toriumi', 'PG-13', 'Fourth Break Blade Movie. As Zess and Erekt returns to Athens, Krisna mobilizes their army to face the Athenian Invaders. Cleo continues living with Sigyn where the latter warns her not to harm Rygart again. Meanwhile, Sigyn assembles a special Golem force led by Narvi with Rygart, her older brother Nile and Sniper Loggin under her command including Girge. Girge is General Baldr''s son and a talented Golem pilot who has been given Cleo''s Golem but he is a former criminal who killed his teammates without reason which Baldr warns Rygart to be careful with his son and kill him if he does anything suspicious. As General True and General Baldr''s forces head out, Rygart trains with his teammates to better use the Delphine while Hodr asks the Orlando Empire for help. Before leaving, Sigyn makes Rygart vow to come back safely. General True is ambushed by the Athenians led by Io and Nike', 'Fourth Break Blade Movie. As Zess and Erekt returns to Athens, Krisna mobilizes their army to face the Athenian Invaders. Cleo continues living with Sigyn where the latter warns her not to harm Rygart again. Meanwhile, Sigyn assembles a special Golem force led by Narvi with Rygart, her older brother Nile and Sniper Loggin under her command including Girge. Girge is General Baldr''s son and a talented Golem pilot who has been given Cleo''s Golem but he is a former criminal who killed his teammates without reason which Baldr warns Rygart to be careful with his son and kill him if he does anything suspicious. As General True and General Baldr''s forces head out, Rygart trains with his teammates to better use the Delphine while Hodr asks the Orlando Empire for help. Before leaving, Sigyn makes Rygart vow to come back safely. General True is ambushed by the Athenians led by Io and Nike', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqYWkvuUNTjqAIeLSvGtxa75uMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55435'),
  ('609925726231527049', 'Broken Blade: The Path of Separation', 2010, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Tetsuro Amino, Nobuyoshi Habara', null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Chiwa Saito, Yuhko Kaida, Masashi Sugawara, Kenji Takahashi, Nanaho Katsuragi, Hideyuki Umezu', 'PG-13', 'Second Break Blade movie. The narration begins by revealing Athens invaded the Krisna Kingdom for allowing the Orlando Empire to cross into their land to attack Athens during their power struggle over Assam but the true purpose of the invasion is to take over the Krisna Quartz mines as Athens is suffering a shortage of Quartz. In the Athens capital of Ilios, Secretary of War Loquis has received news that his brother Zess has successfully reach Binonten. Meanwhile, Rygart manages to get a ceasefire between the Athens invaders and Krisna defenders and speaks with Zess.', 'Second Break Blade movie. The narration begins by revealing Athens invaded the Krisna Kingdom for allowing the Orlando Empire to cross into their land to attack Athens during their power struggle over Assam but the true purpose of the invasion is to take over the Krisna Quartz mines as Athens is suffering a shortage of Quartz. In the Athens capital of Ilios, Secretary of War Loquis has received news that his brother Zess has successfully reach Binonten. Meanwhile, Rygart manages to get a ceasefire between the Athens invaders and Krisna defenders and speaks with Zess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9scWJkRwBKlFCLWU3juCUHtgvfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55430'),
  ('1141210494577308347', 'Broken Blade: The Time of Awakening', 2010, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Tetsuro Amino, Nobuyoshi Habara', null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Chiwa Saito, Kenichi Ogata, Masashi Sugawara, Yuhko Kaida, Minoru Shiraishi, Nanaho Katsuragi', 'PG-13', 'In the continent of Cruzon, an impending war between the Kingdom of Krisna and the nation of Athens is brimming. The people of this land are able to use quartz for whatever purpose they desire. Yet one person, Rygart Arrow, is not. He is an "un-sorcerer," a person unable to use quartz. But this characteristic will enable him to pilot an ancient Golem, one strong enough to put up a fight against the invading army of Athens.', 'In the continent of Cruzon, an impending war between the Kingdom of Krisna and the nation of Athens is brimming. The people of this land are able to use quartz for whatever purpose they desire. Yet one person, Rygart Arrow, is not. He is an "un-sorcerer," a person unable to use quartz. But this characteristic will enable him to pilot an ancient Golem, one strong enough to put up a fight against the invading army of Athens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7LcyVFAtDOMD8gcY1ZkuU8SixW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55426'),
  ('462312952220989771', 'Broken Blossoms or The Yellow Man and the Girl', 1919, 'Drama, Romance', 'Billy Bitzer, D.W. Griffith', 'D.W. Griffith', 'Lillian Gish, Richard Barthelmess, Donald Crisp, Arthur Howard, Edward Peil Sr., George Beranger, Norman Selby, Ernest Butterworth', 'NR', 'The love story of an abused English girl and a Chinese Buddhist in a time when London was a brutal and harsh place to live.', 'The love story of an abused English girl and a Chinese Buddhist in a time when London was a brutal and harsh place to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njwFIUL76zaRmPemnrZVmmTSCjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899'),
  ('779965396882177719', 'Broken Bonds', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'David Y. Chung, Benny Jenkins', 'Jhayla Mosley', 'Ciera Angelia, Bella Chadwick, Robyn Rose, Dale Dobson, Sarah Evalt', 'TV-MA', 'After witnessing a fatal shootout, three struggling waitresses hide a bag of illicit cash, forcing them into a perilous web of betrayal and survival.', 'After witnessing a fatal shootout, three struggling waitresses hide a bag of illicit cash, forcing them into a perilous web of betrayal and survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F7%2Fgracenote%2F79ce8dbec291a3c97692fd7eadef9044.jpg', 'plex:movie:broken-bonds-2026-1'),
  ('342825195645215119', 'Broken Bridges', 2006, 'Drama, Music', 'Steven Goldmann, Patrick Cady', 'Cherie Bennett, Jeff Gottesfeld', 'Brian F. Durkin, Jason Leith, Richard Tillman, Toby Keith, Leland L. Jones, Kelly Preston, Burt Reynolds, Lindsey Haun', 'PG-13', 'A fading country music star returns to his hometown, where he reunites with his childhood sweetheart and also meets his 16-year-old daughter for the first time.', 'A fading country music star returns to his hometown, where he reunites with his childhood sweetheart and also meets his 16-year-old daughter for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4vynL22x06Ip6nwZEh5ouO0mSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13842'),
  ('53259237596516285', 'Broken City', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Allen Hughes, Ben Seresin, Stephen P. Dunn', 'Brian Tucker', 'Mark Wahlberg, Russell Crowe, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Jeffrey Wright, Barry Pepper, Alona Tal, Natalie Martinez, Michael Beach', 'R', 'In a broken city rife with injustice, ex-cop Billy Taggart seeks redemption and revenge after being double-crossed and then framed by its most powerful figure, the mayor. Billy''s relentless pursuit of justice, matched only by his streetwise toughness, makes him an unstoppable force - and the mayor''s worst nightmare.', 'In a broken city rife with injustice, ex-cop Billy Taggart seeks redemption and revenge after being double-crossed and then framed by its most powerful figure, the mayor. Billy''s relentless pursuit of justice, matched only by his streetwise toughness, makes him an unstoppable force - and the mayor''s worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqa5FwNZC55zqSpdeGFtBDqw55y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98357'),
  ('634356439318723917', 'Broken Down Film', 1985, 'Romance, Animation, Comedy, Western, Action', 'Osamu Tezuka, Masaaki Fujita', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, null, 'A cowboy seeks to rescue, then woo, a damsel in distress. But he is constantly thwarted by the scratches, breaks, and other imperfections present in the film print itself.', 'A cowboy seeks to rescue, then woo, a damsel in distress. But he is constantly thwarted by the scratches, breaks, and other imperfections present in the film print itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hP0I7MQCGvHCOCyZH850eWFFann.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85791'),
  ('297555616934825707', 'Broken Embraces', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Rodrigo Prieto, Cecilio Caparrini', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Penélope Cruz, Lluís Homar, Blanca Portillo, José Luis Gómez, Rubén Ochandiano, Tamar Novas, Ángela Molina, Chus Lampreave', 'R', 'Harry Caine, a blind writer, reaches this moment in time when he has to heal his wounds from 14 years back. He was then still known by his real name, Mateo Blanco, and directing his last movie.', 'Harry Caine, a blind writer, reaches this moment in time when he has to heal his wounds from 14 years back. He was then still known by his real name, Mateo Blanco, and directing his last movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPTOKnc9bzPp1emH3TyuKOGIylQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8088'),
  ('713613597745028518', 'Broken English', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Zoe Cassavetes, Pete Zumba, Selina van den Brink', 'Zoe Cassavetes', 'Parker Posey, Drea De Matteo, Tim Guinee, Gena Rowlands, Melvil Poupaud, Justin Theroux, Peter Bogdanovich, Roy Thinnes', 'PG-13', 'Nora Wilder is freaking out. Everyone around her is either in a relationship, married, or has children, while she''s in her thirties, alone with job she''s outgrown and a mother who constantly reminds her of it all. Not to mention her best friend Audrey''s "perfect marriage". But after a series of disastrous dates, Nora unexpectedly meets Julien, a quirky Frenchman who opens her eyes to a lot more than love.', 'Nora Wilder is freaking out. Everyone around her is either in a relationship, married, or has children, while she''s in her thirties, alone with job she''s outgrown and a mother who constantly reminds her of it all. Not to mention her best friend Audrey''s "perfect marriage". But after a series of disastrous dates, Nora unexpectedly meets Julien, a quirky Frenchman who opens her eyes to a lot more than love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzc9bRdbYnbqgzSZ5obGVSHsVT6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13337'),
  ('638918749066267098', 'Broken English', 2026, 'Documentary, Biography, Music', 'Jane Pollard, Iain Forsyth, Daniel Landin, Derrick Peters, Erik Wilson', 'Jane Pollard, Iain Forsyth, Ian Martin', 'Marianne Faithfull, Tilda Swinton, George MacKay, Calvin Demba, Zawe Ashton', null, 'A survivor, provocateur and true original, Marianne has spent more than six decades defying expectations — releasing over thirty-five albums while constantly reinventing herself. Made with her full involvement, Broken English is an intimate and unflinching exploration of a fractured yet unbreakable life shaped by fame, creativity and relentless public scrutiny.', 'A survivor, provocateur and true original, Marianne has spent more than six decades defying expectations — releasing over thirty-five albums while constantly reinventing herself. Made with her full involvement, Broken English is an intimate and unflinching exploration of a fractured yet unbreakable life shaped by fame, creativity and relentless public scrutiny.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FdhT0Okekfq6Ncqh5ttFBGM6TimF.jpg', 'plex:movie:broken-english-2026'),
  ('698185355131920638', 'Broken Flowers', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Frederick Elmes, Jim Jarmusch, Todd Pfeiffer', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Bill Murray, Sharon Stone, Jessica Lange, Tilda Swinton, Frances Conroy, Alexis Dziena, Chloë Sevigny, Christopher McDonald', 'R', 'Introverted Don Johnston receives an anonymous letter from an ex-lover informing him that he has a son who may be looking for him. A freelance sleuth neighbor motivates Don to embark on a cross-country search for his past flames seeking answers.', 'Introverted Don Johnston receives an anonymous letter from an ex-lover informing him that he has a son who may be looking for him. A freelance sleuth neighbor motivates Don to embark on a cross-country search for his past flames seeking answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gd8JNjwgiM6ZgGm6NFAkovQWoYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308'),
  ('180276034007847106', 'Broken Glass Park', 2013, 'Drama', 'Bettina Blümner', 'Katharina Kress', 'Jasna Fritzi Bauer, Ulrich Noethen, Vladimir Burlakov, Max Hegewald, Yanina Lisovskaya, Cedric Koch, Lara Melina Siebertz, Maria Dragus', null, 'Teenage Sascha has two dreams: to write a novel about her mother and to take revenge on her step-father who brutally murdered her. When she meets the newspaper editor Volker, he invites her to come to his and his son''s place. A subtle love triangle begins which helps Sascha to find her personal way of growing up.', 'Teenage Sascha has two dreams: to write a novel about her mother and to take revenge on her step-father who brutally murdered her. When she meets the newspaper editor Volker, he invites her to come to his and his son''s place. A subtle love triangle begins which helps Sascha to find her personal way of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2z7MiXeKA9MnbAMiP1vKRQtTWdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228381'),
  ('299157054110382616', 'Broken Idol: The Undoing of Diomedes Díaz', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Jaime Barbosa, Jorge Durán', null, 'Diomedes Díaz', 'R', 'This documentary chronicles Diomedes Díaz''s rise as one of Colombia''s most iconic singers, and his downfall after being accused of killing a fan.', 'This documentary chronicles Diomedes Díaz''s rise as one of Colombia''s most iconic singers, and his downfall after being accused of killing a fan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zQXBbMbltvtEgmBELYjB0MWfU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950511'),
  ('524321654768639902', 'Broken Lance', 1954, 'Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Edward Dmytryk, Joseph MacDonald, Henry Weinberger', 'Richard Murphy', 'Spencer Tracy, Robert Wagner, Jean Peters, Richard Widmark, Katy Jurado, Hugh O''Brian, Eduard Franz, Earl Holliman', null, 'Tensions erupt within an Arizona cattle baron''s household when his three sons vie for control of the ranch.', 'Tensions erupt within an Arizona cattle baron''s household when his three sons vie for control of the ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOf7yWjTAhUE72u3PV6ij4Wy9lJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42328'),
  ('604593364895257887', 'Broken Lullaby', 1932, 'Drama', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Victor Milner', 'Ernest Vajda, Samson Raphaelson', 'Lionel Barrymore, Phillips Holmes, Nancy Carroll, Louise Carter, Lucien Littlefield, Tom Douglas, Zasu Pitts, Frank Sheridan', 'NR', 'A young French soldier in World War I is overcome with guilt when he kills a German soldier who, like himself, is a musically gifted conscript, each having attended the same musical conservatory in France. The fact that the incident occurred in war does not assuage his guilt. He travels to Germany to meet the man''s family.', 'A young French soldier in World War I is overcome with guilt when he kills a German soldier who, like himself, is a musically gifted conscript, each having attended the same musical conservatory in France. The fact that the incident occurred in war does not assuage his guilt. He travels to Germany to meet the man''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYZjUEPC0j96rNfGj0dHajLMw5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58192'),
  ('605053517697415428', 'Broken Mirrors', 1984, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Marleen Gorris, Hessel Haak, Frans Bromet', 'Marleen Gorris', 'Lineke Rijxman, Henriëtte Tol, Edda Barends, Coby Stunnenberg, Carla Hardy, Marijke Veugelers, Arline Renfurm, Anke Van''t Hof', null, 'Diane and Dora are two prostitutes who begin to rebel against their lot in life. Meanwhile, in another part of town, a murderer is at large.', 'Diane and Dora are two prostitutes who begin to rebel against their lot in life. Meanwhile, in another part of town, a murderer is at large.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctC7RhuntaaAAP6nvjT5q1dd2pi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214291'),
  ('1113416982874957137', 'Broken Oath', 1977, 'Action, Drama', 'Jeong Chang-hwa, Wu Shih, Wong Wing-Lung', 'Shih Kang', 'Angela Mao Ying, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Kuo Cheng-Yu, Guan Shan, Chao Hsiung, Fong Yau, Chang Pei-Shan', null, 'Lotus never had a chance. Her mother seethed with anger at being unjustly imprisoned for turning her attemped rapist into a cyclops. Mother repeatedly asked her good friend and fellow prisoner, Pickpocket, to urge Lotus to take revenge for her as an adult. Lotus is given to a monastery and grows up there, but twenty years of peace and love make no impression on Lotus, who skips classes to practice pole and sword skills. Joining forces with Pickpocket and Big Rat, Lotus gets her chance at revenge.', 'Lotus never had a chance. Her mother seethed with anger at being unjustly imprisoned for turning her attemped rapist into a cyclops. Mother repeatedly asked her good friend and fellow prisoner, Pickpocket, to urge Lotus to take revenge for her as an adult. Lotus is given to a monastery and grows up there, but twenty years of peace and love make no impression on Lotus, who skips classes to practice pole and sword skills. Joining forces with Pickpocket and Big Rat, Lotus gets her chance at revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mJ6PgHuyJJMSHXqkLQUoHJy9xg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67335'),
  ('1006004413533088820', 'Broken Rage', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy, Action', 'Takeshi Kitano, Takeshi Hamada, Kimiyoshi Adachi', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Tadanobu Asano, Nao Omori, Shido Nakamura, Hakuryu, Takashi Nishina, So Kaku, Gekidan Hitori', null, 'A seemingly unremarkable man called “Mouse” is caught by the police. In exchange for his freedom, he goes undercover, infiltrates a drug ring, and arranges a fake deal, but an unexpected turn of events occurs.', 'A seemingly unremarkable man called “Mouse” is caught by the police. In exchange for his freedom, he goes undercover, infiltrates a drug ring, and arranges a fake deal, but an unexpected turn of events occurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szLS0nMtdLUiDwojcc94fvF5py.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121914'),
  ('359876764117772457', 'Broken Silence', 2001, 'Drama', 'Montxo Armendáriz, Guillermo Navarro', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Lucía Jiménez, Juan Diego Botto, Mercedes Sampietro, Álvaro de Luna, María Botto, Rubén Ochandiano, María Vázquez', null, 'Winter, 1944. Lucía at 21 returns to her small village in the mountains. She again meets Manuel, a young iron-smith who helps "those in the mountain", the "maquis", the anti-Franco resistance. Lucía is attracted to Manual, because of his smile and the bravery of those men who continue fighting for their ideas, even at the cost of their own lives. When Manuel is pursued (by Franco''s Civil Guard) he flees to the mountain and Lucía discovers the reality of political repression, the silence, the horror and fear.', 'Winter, 1944. Lucía at 21 returns to her small village in the mountains. She again meets Manuel, a young iron-smith who helps "those in the mountain", the "maquis", the anti-Franco resistance. Lucía is attracted to Manual, because of his smile and the bravery of those men who continue fighting for their ideas, even at the cost of their own lives. When Manuel is pursued (by Franco''s Civil Guard) he flees to the mountain and Lucía discovers the reality of political repression, the silence, the horror and fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmSCRPzNklRXHCq0GEoYVSDjHzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115504'),
  ('902785321075243791', 'Broken Sky', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julián Hernández, Alejandro Cantú', null, 'Miguel Ángel Hoppe, Fernando Arroyo, Alejandro Rojo, Ignacio Pereda, Klaudia Aragon, Clarisa Rendón, Pilar Ruiz', null, 'Gerardo is deeply in love with longtime lover Jonas. When Jonas falls for a stranger he met at a local nightclub, heartbroken Gerardo soon seeks solace in the arms of Sergio. Despite other interests, Gerardo and Jonas can''t bring themselves to end it.', 'Gerardo is deeply in love with longtime lover Jonas. When Jonas falls for a stranger he met at a local nightclub, heartbroken Gerardo soon seeks solace in the arms of Sergio. Despite other interests, Gerardo and Jonas can''t bring themselves to end it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBvky76d5o578DLx3hkfWyVYsHJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22093'),
  ('638905445961131540', 'Broken Toys', 1935, 'Animation', 'Ben Sharpsteen, Roy Williams, Dick Williams', null, 'Tommy Bupp, Alyce Ardell, Jesús Topete, Sara Berner, Bud Duncan, Leone LeDoux, Martha Wentworth, Scott Whitaker', 'NR', 'A sailor doll, thrown into a toy dump, rallies the demoralized dolls that were already there.', 'A sailor doll, thrown into a toy dump, rallies the demoralized dolls that were already there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7r7Qym52bYZAoxCaRR9TVtHd5Ym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66826'),
  ('315770369975239581', 'Broken Vows', 1987, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama, Romance, Mystery', 'Jud Taylor', 'James Costigan', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Annette O''Toole, M. Emmet Walsh, Milo O''Shea, David Groh, Madeleine Sherwood, Jean De Baer, David Strathairn', null, 'When Father Joseph Hennessey visits the home of one of his parishioners to offer last rights,he becomes embroiled in a plot which ultimately shakes his faith to its very foundation. Intrigued by the dying man''s mention of "Nim," and fascinated by the man''s saintly demeanor, Father Joseph''s curiosity is redoubled when a beautiful young woman enters his church to question the young priest about the deceased man. Father Joseph and the woman, whom he discovers to be the "Nim" in question, embark upon an investigation into the circumstances surrounding the man''s death.', 'When Father Joseph Hennessey visits the home of one of his parishioners to offer last rights,he becomes embroiled in a plot which ultimately shakes his faith to its very foundation. Intrigued by the dying man''s mention of "Nim," and fascinated by the man''s saintly demeanor, Father Joseph''s curiosity is redoubled when a beautiful young woman enters his church to question the young priest about the deceased man. Father Joseph and the woman, whom he discovers to be the "Nim" in question, embark upon an investigation into the circumstances surrounding the man''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0UDbx25fxdmdLriA9Odtk7VhPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163626'),
  ('124241655630306276', 'Broken Vows', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Kees Van Oostrum, Bram Coppens', 'Sean Keller, Jim Agnew', 'Jaimie Alexander, Wes Bentley, Cam Gigandet, Alexandra Breckenridge, Emily Robinson, Astrid Coppens, René Ashton, Alex Ladove', 'R', 'On her bachelorette-party weekend with friends in New Orleans, Tara falls for the darkly-sexy bartender Patrick. Waking in his bed the next morning, Tara instantly regrets her unfaithfulness and flies back home to her fiancé. But her secret flame becomes a full-on fire when Patrick shows up at her house and begins stalking her every move. He spirals into madness and delusion, determined to have Tara no matter what the cost.', 'On her bachelorette-party weekend with friends in New Orleans, Tara falls for the darkly-sexy bartender Patrick. Waking in his bed the next morning, Tara instantly regrets her unfaithfulness and flies back home to her fiancé. But her secret flame becomes a full-on fire when Patrick shows up at her house and begins stalking her every move. He spirals into madness and delusion, determined to have Tara no matter what the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqxCm1xyd5f2wKeUOCjXy3Brhsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278925'),
  ('1067783401357187103', 'Broken Wings', 2002, 'Drama', 'Nir Bergman, Valentin Belonogov', 'Nir Bergman', 'Orly Zilberschatz, Maya Maron, Nitai Gvirtz, Daniel Magon, Eliana Magon, Vladimir Friedman, Dana Ivgy, Yarden Bar-Kochba', null, 'Daphne and her four children try to cope with the abrupt death of husband/father. As the family seems to fall apart, a sudden incident gives them a chance to heal their ''broken wings''.', 'Daphne and her four children try to cope with the abrupt death of husband/father. As the family seems to fall apart, a sudden incident gives them a chance to heal their ''broken wings''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/somDluLofBXeIu2y55mlG6Wc5JA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49689'),
  ('303119768059393577', 'Broker', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hong Kyung-pyo, Shinsuke Fujimoto, Lee Beom-seok', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Song Kang-ho, Gang Dong-won, Bae Doona, IU, Lee Joo-young, Lim Seung-soo, Park Ji-yong, Kim Sun-young', 'R', 'Sang-hyun is always struggling from debt, and Dong-soo works at a baby box facility. On a rainy night, they steal the baby Woo-sung, who was left in the baby box, to sell him at a good price. Meanwhile, detectives were watching, and they quietly track them down to capture the crucial evidence.', 'Sang-hyun is always struggling from debt, and Dong-soo works at a baby box facility. On a rainy night, they steal the baby Woo-sung, who was left in the baby box, to sell him at a good price. Meanwhile, detectives were watching, and they quietly track them down to capture the crucial evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x86xaUnxU31JYiwlO35corDEV1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736732'),
  ('295748381539758876', 'Bromance', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lucas Santa Ana, Pablo Herrera, Francisco Ortiz', 'Diego Mina, Lucas Santa Ana', 'Javier De Pietro, Agustín Pardella, Marcos Ribas, Luana Pascual, Alberto Masliah, Lucas Santa Ana, Iván Masliah', 'NR', 'When three friends go on a camping trip in a remote part of Argentina, sexual tensions quickly bubble to the surface. Once in virtual seclusion by the beach, Juli, also camping at the site, quickly recognises that that the boys seem to have a closer relationship than what she would consider ''normal''. The line between friendship and love fade further for two of the boys in particular as their desire becomes too much to bear. When what started as a simple getaway quickly becomes tinged with sex, romance, and conflict, everyone is forced to confront who they really are for the very first time.', 'When three friends go on a camping trip in a remote part of Argentina, sexual tensions quickly bubble to the surface. Once in virtual seclusion by the beach, Juli, also camping at the site, quickly recognises that that the boys seem to have a closer relationship than what she would consider ''normal''. The line between friendship and love fade further for two of the boys in particular as their desire becomes too much to bear. When what started as a simple getaway quickly becomes tinged with sex, romance, and conflict, everyone is forced to confront who they really are for the very first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n97zRq5ILhAFpgFSXMUsPsOkYQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444935'),
  ('848355816055181248', 'Bromates', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Court Crandall', 'Court Crandall, Chris Kemper', 'Josh Brener, Lil Rel Howery, Brendan Scannell, Asif Ali, Jessica Lowe, Nikki Tuazon, Taryn Manning, Snoop Dogg', 'R', 'Longtime best friends Sid and Jonesie are dumped by their respective girlfriends. Both without a living situation, they decide to become "bromates", bros who are roommates, which puts their relationship to the ultimate test.', 'Longtime best friends Sid and Jonesie are dumped by their respective girlfriends. Both without a living situation, they decide to become "bromates", bros who are roommates, which puts their relationship to the ultimate test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLOUXzd5C7r04rov55maE6e9yrX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860854'),
  ('699727522152365464', 'Bromato de armonio', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Marcos Mundstock, Jorge Maronna, Daniel Rabinovich', 'Roberto Fontanarrosa, Jorge Maronna, Marcos Mundstock', 'Jorge Maronna, Marcos Mundstock, Carlos López Puccio, Daniel Rabinovich, Carlos Núñez Cortés, Les Luthiers', null, 'Premiered on June 13, 1996 at the Astengo Theater, in Rosario, Argentina and last performance on December 3, 2002, at the Sports Pavilion, in León, Spain, ''Bromato De Armonio'' was a show made by the Argentinian comedy-musical group Les Luthiers. The show itself was showcased all around Latin America between 1996 and 2001. PROGRAM: 1. Para Elizabeth (sonata a la carta); 2. La Princesa Caprichosa (pequeña serenata para grandes instrumentos); 3. La Vida es Hermosa (disuacidio); 4. La Hija de Escipión (fragmento de ópera); 5. La Redención del Vampiro (hematopeya); 6. Educación Sexual Moderna (cántico enclausturado); 7. ¿Quién Mató a Tom McCoffee? (música en serie); 8. La Comisión (himnovaciones); 9. Perdónala (bolérolo) The ''Campanófono a martillo'' and the ''Cornetas de Asiento'' were premiered on this show. Recorded live at the Teatro Coliseo in Buenos Aires, Argentina, on June the 27th, 1998.', 'Premiered on June 13, 1996 at the Astengo Theater, in Rosario, Argentina and last performance on December 3, 2002, at the Sports Pavilion, in León, Spain, ''Bromato De Armonio'' was a show made by the Argentinian comedy-musical group Les Luthiers. The show itself was showcased all around Latin America between 1996 and 2001. PROGRAM: 1. Para Elizabeth (sonata a la carta); 2. La Princesa Caprichosa (pequeña serenata para grandes instrumentos); 3. La Vida es Hermosa (disuacidio); 4. La Hija de Escipión (fragmento de ópera); 5. La Redención del Vampiro (hematopeya); 6. Educación Sexual Moderna (cántico enclausturado); 7. ¿Quién Mató a Tom McCoffee? (música en serie); 8. La Comisión (himnovaciones); 9. Perdónala (bolérolo) The ''Campanófono a martillo'' and the ''Cornetas de Asiento'' were premiered on this show. Recorded live at the Teatro Coliseo in Buenos Aires, Argentina, on June the 27th, 1998.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcY6dHQ0Yo0cOR5kLbbh867mR1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67886'),
  ('32740052405393822', 'Bronco Billy', 1980, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Clint Eastwood, Stan Zabka, Fritz Manes', 'Dennis Hackin', 'Clint Eastwood, Sondra Locke, Geoffrey Lewis, Scatman Crothers, Bill McKinney, Sam Bottoms, Dan Vadis, Sierra Pecheur', 'PG', 'An idealistic, modern-day cowboy struggles to keep his Wild West show afloat in the face of hard luck and waning interest.', 'An idealistic, modern-day cowboy struggles to keep his Wild West show afloat in the face of hard luck and waning interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiWVmWUq4M9Hc2Ui4jPkAnX6oAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21866'),
  ('702959220009029886', 'Bronco Bullfrog', 1969, 'Drama', 'Barney Platts-Mills, Adam Barker-Mill, Tim Van Rellim', 'Barney Platts-Mills', 'Del Walker, Anne Gooding, Sam Shepherd, Roy Haywood, Freda Shepherd, Dick Philpott, Chris Shepherd, Stuart Stones', null, 'Del and his friends agree to take part in a robbery with a boy fresh from the borstal prison. When Del falls in love with Irene they decide to run away from their nagging parents - and the law.', 'Del and his friends agree to take part in a robbery with a boy fresh from the borstal prison. When Del falls in love with Irene they decide to run away from their nagging parents - and the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rorLRqDUv9hBQBduRgDXugj1DZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54006'),
  ('431930352475618539', 'Bronson', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Joe Withers, Larry Smith, Nicolas Winding Refn', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Brock Norman Brock', 'Tom Hardy, Matt King, James Lance, Kelly Adams, Katy Barker, Amanda Burton, Andrew Forbes, Jon House', 'R', 'A young man who was sentenced to 7 years in prison for robbing a post office ends up spending 30 years in solitary confinement. During this time, his own personality is supplanted by his alter ego, Charles Bronson.', 'A young man who was sentenced to 7 years in prison for robbing a post office ends up spending 30 years in solitary confinement. During this time, his own personality is supplanted by his alter ego, Charles Bronson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoWdemYy4qV5lUcLWXpeYhms0Xe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18533'),
  ('236773991700397635', 'Brooklyn', 2015, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'John Crowley, Christine Fitzgerald, Yves Bélanger', 'Nick Hornby', 'Saoirse Ronan, Domhnall Gleeson, Emory Cohen, Jim Broadbent, Julie Walters, Jessica Paré, Eve Macklin, Brid Brennan', 'PG-13', 'In 1950s Ireland and New York, young Eilis Lacey has to choose between two men and two countries.', 'In 1950s Ireland and New York, young Eilis Lacey has to choose between two men and two countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cs7W8j5lI7qzRW6tKSj9p1Q0Ze7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167073'),
  ('1116636101188973506', 'Brooklyn 45', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, History', 'Ted Geoghegan, Robert Patrick Stern, Michele B. McGraw', 'Ted Geoghegan', 'Anne Ramsay, Ezra Buzzington, Jeremy Holm, Larry Fessenden, Ron E. Rains, Kristina Klebe, Lucy Carapetyan', null, 'Five military veterans, best friends since childhood, gather together in a Brooklyn brownstone several months after the end of World War II, and the metaphoric ghosts of their past become all-too-literal.', 'Five military veterans, best friends since childhood, gather together in a Brooklyn brownstone several months after the end of World War II, and the metaphoric ghosts of their past become all-too-literal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dN8IIAvzIW3XX8aOvA9aQubK4hd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916433'),
  ('189331478933575937', 'Brooklyn Bridge', 1981, 'Documentary, History', 'Ken Burns, Ken Burns, John Colby', 'Amy Stechler', 'David McCullough, Paul Roebling, Julie Harris, Arthur Miller, Kurt Vonnegut, Richard Pini, Fred Sherry, Dustin Stevens', 'G', 'Today it''s a symbol of strength and vitality. 135 years ago, it was a source of controversy. This documentary examines the great problems and ingenious solutions that marked the construction of the Brooklyn Bridge. From conception to construction, it traces the bridge''s transformation from a spectacular feat of heroic engineering to an honored symbol in American culture.', 'Today it''s a symbol of strength and vitality. 135 years ago, it was a source of controversy. This documentary examines the great problems and ingenious solutions that marked the construction of the Brooklyn Bridge. From conception to construction, it traces the bridge''s transformation from a spectacular feat of heroic engineering to an honored symbol in American culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYx9GYyA34giTiJQL95TSxpLZ6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67079'),
  ('541344812522907948', 'Brooklyn Rules', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Michael Corrente, Richard Crudo', 'Terence Winter', 'Alec Baldwin, Mena Suvari, Freddie Prinze Jr., Jerry Ferrara, Scott Caan, Monica Keena, John Cenatiempo, Brian O''Neill', 'R', 'Brooklyn, 1985. With the mob world as a backdrop, three life-long friends struggle with questions of love, loss and loyalty.', 'Brooklyn, 1985. With the mob world as a backdrop, three life-long friends struggle with questions of love, loss and loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTmCII6EnK1h0nLPusWvQnp9QTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13072'),
  ('663880186144845873', 'Brooklyn''s Finest', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Antoine Fuqua, Patrick Murguia, Joe Napolitano', 'Michael C. Martin', 'Richard Gere, Don Cheadle, Ethan Hawke, Wesley Snipes, Vincent D''Onofrio, Ellen Barkin, Michael Kenneth Williams, Shannon Kane', 'R', 'Enforcing the law within the notoriously rough Brownsville section of the city and especially within the Van Dyke housing projects is the NYPD''s sixty-fifth precinct. Three police officers struggle with the sometimes fine line between right and wrong.', 'Enforcing the law within the notoriously rough Brownsville section of the city and especially within the Van Dyke housing projects is the NYPD''s sixty-fifth precinct. Three police officers struggle with the sometimes fine line between right and wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZyJJpMsc3bF8gduDaxo0zo1gwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26390'),
  ('459576764388568737', 'Broom-Stick Bunny', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', 'NR', 'On Halloween night, Bugs Bunny, masquerading as a witch, trick-or-treats at the creepy old mansion of Witch Hazel, who prides herself on being the ugliest witch of all.', 'On Halloween night, Bugs Bunny, masquerading as a witch, trick-or-treats at the creepy old mansion of Witch Hazel, who prides herself on being the ugliest witch of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbrUnGieeaF62J8IkAOOZNaWei1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83746'),
