  ('183836762636832198', 'Bros Before Hos', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Steffen Haars, Flip van der Kuil', 'Steffen Haars, Flip van der Kuil', 'Tim Haars, Daniël Arends, Sylvia Hoeks, Henry van Loon, Theo Maassen, Huub Smit, Jennifer Hoffman, Ton Kas', null, 'Because of a bad marriage of their parents, two brothers Jules and Max made a pact never to get into a relationship with a woman. Therefore, they live a party-life in which they sleep with a different girl every day. However this changes when Jules starts to date Anna and Max falls in love with her. Can their bromance overcome this love triangle.', 'Because of a bad marriage of their parents, two brothers Jules and Max made a pact never to get into a relationship with a woman. Therefore, they live a party-life in which they sleep with a different girl every day. However this changes when Jules starts to date Anna and Max falls in love with her. Can their bromance overcome this love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZGNVpzGEWYLpzE7J9FL8WOLlxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230211'),
  ('894699190815957829', 'Brother', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Sergey Astakhov, Anatoliy Kudryavtsev', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Sergei Bodrov Jr., Viktor Sukhorukov, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Svetlana Pismichenko, Mariya Zhukova, Sergey Murzin, Irina Rakshina, Igor Shibanov', null, 'Danila goes to his successful brother, Victor, in Petersburg to start a new life. Unknown to Danila, Victor is a contract killer, but is in hiding after asking for too much money to assassinate a Chechen mob boss. To avoid exposure, Victor convinces Danila to kill the boss instead.', 'Danila goes to his successful brother, Victor, in Petersburg to start a new life. Unknown to Danila, Victor is a contract killer, but is in hiding after asking for too much money to assassinate a Chechen mob boss. To avoid exposure, Victor convinces Danila to kill the boss instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxeVQdd227B367xQxvabkYTfz0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20992'),
  ('116152541761933848', 'Brother', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima, Rita Lisa Danao', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Omar Epps, Claude Maki, Susumu Terajima, Masaya Katō, Royale Watkins, Lombardo Boyar, Ryo Ishibashi', 'R', 'A Japanese Yakuza gangster''s deadly existence in his homeland gets him exiled to Los Angeles, where he is taken in by his little brother and his brother''s gang. Original Title: ブラザー', 'A Japanese Yakuza gangster''s deadly existence in his homeland gets him exiled to Los Angeles, where he is taken in by his little brother and his brother''s gang. Original Title: ブラザー', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSRJozSafFFuiFT9XnwsE1ricHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327'),
  ('224996185855618036', 'Brother', 2010, 'Drama', 'Marcel Rasquin', 'Marcel Rasquin, Rohan Jones', 'Fernando Moreno, Eliú Armas, Alí Rondon, Gonzalo Cubero, Marcela Girón, Beto Benitez, Gabriel Rojas, Jackson Gutierrez', null, 'Brothers Daniel and Julio fight to escape a violent and poor Caracas neighborhood by playing soccer. Daniel wishes to go professional while Julio supports the family with dirty money. The opportunity of a lifetime comes when a talent scout invites them to the local football club. However, after their mother is killed in a shootout, each brother is forced to decide what''s more important: family, revenge, or achieving their dreams.', 'Brothers Daniel and Julio fight to escape a violent and poor Caracas neighborhood by playing soccer. Daniel wishes to go professional while Julio supports the family with dirty money. The opportunity of a lifetime comes when a talent scout invites them to the local football club. However, after their mother is killed in a shootout, each brother is forced to decide what''s more important: family, revenge, or achieving their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nTTDblwirJMMhqeJu70pAmetuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51976'),
  ('385496487492771792', 'Brother', 2019, 'Drama', 'Julien Abraham, Julien Meurice, Victoire Gounod', 'Julien Abraham, Jimmy Laporal-Trésor, Almamy Kanoute', 'MHD, Darren Muselet, Aïssa Maïga, Jalil Lespert, Youssouf Gueye, Hiam Abbass, Lisette Malidor, Mark Grosy', null, 'Because he wanted to protect his little brother, Teddy, a young man without a history, is accused of the murder of his father and sent to a closed educational center, waiting for his trial for parricide. He then plunges into a brutal universe of which he does not know the rules.', 'Because he wanted to protect his little brother, Teddy, a young man without a history, is accused of the murder of his father and sent to a closed educational center, waiting for his trial for parricide. He then plunges into a brutal universe of which he does not know the rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMW0B2Hou4nXnZGCPkucRSgI3U0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570137'),
  ('814165135438871904', 'Brother', 2023, 'Drama', 'Clement Virgo, Guy Godfree, Claire Bonduro', 'Clement Virgo', 'Lamar Johnson, Aaron Pierre, Kiana Madeira, Marsha Stephanie Blake, Lovell Adams-Gray, Maurice Dean Wint, Taveeta Szymanowicz, Dwain Murphy', null, 'Sons of Caribbean immigrants, Francis and Michael face questions of masculinity, identity and family amid the pulsing beat of Toronto''s early hip-hop scene. A mystery unfolds when escalating tensions set off a series of events which changes the course of the brothers’ lives forever.', 'Sons of Caribbean immigrants, Francis and Michael face questions of masculinity, identity and family amid the pulsing beat of Toronto''s early hip-hop scene. A mystery unfolds when escalating tensions set off a series of events which changes the course of the brothers’ lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqd1CmwaXQkLXVLsO2cqiExplb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996569'),
  ('750357902126198454', 'Brother', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Sam Fichtner, Mikah Sharkey', 'Rebecca Roberts', 'Chad Rook, Rebecca Roberts, Kurtis Szarka, Ennis Esmer, Tanya Jade', 'PG-13', 'Sam returns to her childhood home after her brother''s mysterious death, joining family members with complex histories. As they seek answers, old tensions emerge and inexplicable events suggest a dark presence', 'Sam returns to her childhood home after her brother''s mysterious death, joining family members with complex histories. As they seek answers, old tensions emerge and inexplicable events suggest a dark presence', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FtO0HMjSGt94rcnskUKlK8vaquVx.jpg', 'plex:movie:brother-2026'),
  ('576130778576607006', 'Brother 2', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Sergey Astakhov, Valery Revich', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Sergei Bodrov Jr., Viktor Sukhorukov, Aleksandr Dyachenko, Kirill Pirogov, Gary Houston, Sergey Makovetskiy, Dmitriy Orlov, Konstantin Murzenko', null, 'Arriving in Moscow, Chechen War veteran Danila meets Konstantin, an old friend who tells him that his twin brother has been forced into signing a crooked contract with a US ice hockey team. Soon after this meeting, Danila discovers Konstantin dead and he sets out to avenge his death; a journey that leads him to Chicago and a whole new experience.', 'Arriving in Moscow, Chechen War veteran Danila meets Konstantin, an old friend who tells him that his twin brother has been forced into signing a crooked contract with a US ice hockey team. Soon after this meeting, Danila discovers Konstantin dead and he sets out to avenge his death; a journey that leads him to Chicago and a whole new experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5pffTC8XZsrGUYSU8e23dGmGNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20993'),
  ('1129283026091466412', 'Brother and Sister', 1953, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Shigeyoshi Mine, Fumiyoshi Saijô', 'Yōko Mizuki', 'Machiko Kyō, Masayuki Mori, Yoshiko Kuga, Yūji Hori, Eiji Funakoshi, Reizaburo Yamamoto, Kumeko Urabe, Mantarō Ushio', null, 'The eldest daughter of a rural family Mon returns home from Tokyo pregnant after an affair with a college student Kobata, which causes a scandal that will threaten the marriage prospects of the younger sister San, in her cash-strapped family. The ill-tempered eldest brother Inokichi decides to take on the role of disciplinarian, with harrowing results.', 'The eldest daughter of a rural family Mon returns home from Tokyo pregnant after an affair with a college student Kobata, which causes a scandal that will threaten the marriage prospects of the younger sister San, in her cash-strapped family. The ill-tempered eldest brother Inokichi decides to take on the role of disciplinarian, with harrowing results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdyolGaIhLI2NUEwCrKVj6haQLd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137504'),
  ('374454225171742638', 'Brother and Sister', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Burman', 'Sergio Dubcovsky, Daniel Burman', 'Antonio Gasalla, Graciela Borges, Elena Lucena, Rita Cortese, Osmar Núñez, Esteban Lamothe, Elvira Onetto, Wolfram Hecht', null, 'They are both alone. They need each other but, at the same time, they despise each other. Siblings Marcos and Susana are unable to heal the old wounds festering within them after the death of their mother. When Susana sells their mother''s flat, she deprives her brother of the home where he had cared for their mother his whole life. Marcos''s need to start living again surfaces when his sister forces him to leave Buenos Aires for Uruguay.', 'They are both alone. They need each other but, at the same time, they despise each other. Siblings Marcos and Susana are unable to heal the old wounds festering within them after the death of their mother. When Susana sells their mother''s flat, she deprives her brother of the home where he had cared for their mother his whole life. Marcos''s need to start living again surfaces when his sister forces him to leave Buenos Aires for Uruguay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXIKoLIVNij1bgeQFo5y68t7qP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43541'),
  ('25283435446171466', 'Brother and Sister', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jenny Lou Ziegel, Jan Krüger', 'Anke Stelling, Jan Krüger', 'Vladimir Burlakov, Julius Nitschkoff, Irina Potapenko, Hilmi Sözer, Franziska Wulf, Marie-Lou Sellem, Anne Müller', null, 'Neukölln, a trendy district in Berlin. Living space is scarce here. Without surety, proof of credit worthiness and salary there is no chance at all now. Thies knows this game; he works for a real estate management company and watches that the rules are upheld - until he meets Bruno and Sonja. He provides the dissimilar siblings with a flat free of charge on the quiet. And enters into an affair with the brother. Step by step he becomes more deeply immersed in the secret of the "siblings". A Berlin film about a loner who gets caught up. About a couple with unclear residency status. About a city everyone wants to live in.', 'Neukölln, a trendy district in Berlin. Living space is scarce here. Without surety, proof of credit worthiness and salary there is no chance at all now. Thies knows this game; he works for a real estate management company and watches that the rules are upheld - until he meets Bruno and Sonja. He provides the dissimilar siblings with a flat free of charge on the quiet. And enters into an affair with the brother. Step by step he becomes more deeply immersed in the secret of the "siblings". A Berlin film about a loner who gets caught up. About a couple with unclear residency status. About a city everyone wants to live in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGOCzcndCku11WQSD0UjSPoMgAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425193'),
  ('721350219336341152', 'Brother and Sister', 2022, 'Drama', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Marion Dehaene, Emilie Adroguer', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Julie Peyr', 'Melvil Poupaud, Marion Cotillard, Golshifteh Farahani, Cosmina Stratan, Max Baissette de Malglaive, Benjamin Siksou, Patrick Timsit, Joël Cudennec', null, 'Alice and Louis are brother and sister. She is an actress; he was a teacher and poet. For more than 20 years, Alice has hated her brother. In all this time they haven’t seen one another. The death of their parents brings the siblings face to face.', 'Alice and Louis are brother and sister. She is an actress; he was a teacher and poet. For more than 20 years, Alice has hated her brother. In all this time they haven’t seen one another. The death of their parents brings the siblings face to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UJfMqQSNjO33F19EhBIxngeOQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836202'),
  ('719321684639336105', 'Brother Bear', 2003, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Aaron Blaise, Robert Walker', 'Tab Murphy, Lorne Cameron, David Hoselton', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Jeremy Suarez, Jason Raize, Rick Moranis, Dave Thomas, D. B. Sweeney, Joan Copeland, Michael Clarke Duncan', 'G', 'When an impulsive boy named Kenai is magically transformed into a bear, he must literally walk in another''s footsteps until he learns some valuable life lessons. His courageous and often zany journey introduces him to a forest full of wildlife, including the lovable bear cub Koda, hilarious moose Rutt and Tuke, woolly mammoths and rambunctious rams.', 'When an impulsive boy named Kenai is magically transformed into a bear, he must literally walk in another''s footsteps until he learns some valuable life lessons. His courageous and often zany journey introduces him to a forest full of wildlife, including the lovable bear cub Koda, hilarious moose Rutt and Tuke, woolly mammoths and rambunctious rams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otptPbEY0vBostmo95xwiiumMJm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10009'),
  ('1080044667681944761', 'Brother Bear 2', 2006, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Ben Gluck', 'Roger S.H. Schulman', 'Patrick Dempsey, Mandy Moore, Jeremy Suarez, Rick Moranis, Dave Thomas, Andrea Martin, Catherine O''Hara, Wanda Sykes', 'G', 'Kenai finds his childhood human friend Nita and the two embark on a journey to burn the amulet he gave to her before he was a bear, much to Koda''s dismay.', 'Kenai finds his childhood human friend Nita and the two embark on a journey to burn the amulet he gave to her before he was a bear, much to Koda''s dismay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaA8q2zHHUgFWdJNxXyAdU71SzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10010'),
