  ('914640701304474904', 'Brother John', 1971, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'James Goldstone, Gerald Perry Finnerman', 'Ernest Kinoy', 'Sidney Poitier, Will Geer, Bradford Dillman, Beverly Todd, Ramon Bieri, Warren J. Kemmerling, Lincoln Kilpatrick, P. Jay Sidney', 'PG', 'An enigmatic man returns to his Alabama hometown as his sister is dying of cancer and incites the suspicion of notable town officials.', 'An enigmatic man returns to his Alabama hometown as his sister is dying of cancer and incites the suspicion of notable town officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAlIrWE9dBolu5Q25HI18bTFoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121923'),
  ('964153073922021636', 'Brother Nature', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Matt Villines, Oz Rodríguez, David Robert Jones', 'Cameron Fay, Mikey Day, Taran Killam', 'Taran Killam, Gillian Jacobs, Bobby Moynihan, Sarah Burns, Bill Pullman, Rita Wilson, Rachael Harris, David Wain', 'R', 'Roger, a straight-laced politician has big plans to propose to his dream girl at her family''s lake house. But everything goes awry when he meets his potential brother-in-law Todd: a full-time camp counselor with a heart of gold and a wild sense of fun, pining to be Roger''s best friend, and ultimately catapulting him into a series of unfortunate events. As Roger tries to take a stand amidst outrageous fishing excursions, propulsive water jetpacks and American history-themed musicals, he realizes that being a part of a new family may be more difficult than he''d thought.', 'Roger, a straight-laced politician has big plans to propose to his dream girl at her family''s lake house. But everything goes awry when he meets his potential brother-in-law Todd: a full-time camp counselor with a heart of gold and a wild sense of fun, pining to be Roger''s best friend, and ultimately catapulting him into a series of unfortunate events. As Roger tries to take a stand amidst outrageous fishing excursions, propulsive water jetpacks and American history-themed musicals, he realizes that being a part of a new family may be more difficult than he''d thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEaUqbtlOvg0bfnPaPh1Bd0MoAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292834'),
  ('342276616406649778', 'Brother of Sleep', 1995, 'Drama', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'Robert Schneider, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'André Eisermann, Dana Vávrová, Ben Becker, Jochen Nickel, Jürgen Schornagel, Paulus Manker, Michaela Rosen, Peter Franke', null, 'In the beginning of the 19th century, Johannes Elias Alder is born in a small village in the Austrian mountains. While growing up he is considered strange by the other villagers and discovers his love of music, especially rebuilding and playing the organ at the village church. After experiencing an "acoustic wonder", his eye color changes and he can hear even the most subtle sounds.', 'In the beginning of the 19th century, Johannes Elias Alder is born in a small village in the Austrian mountains. While growing up he is considered strange by the other villagers and discovers his love of music, especially rebuilding and playing the organ at the village church. After experiencing an "acoustic wonder", his eye color changes and he can hear even the most subtle sounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMnI1UauGsAQxoraCiTGEab6jHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890'),
  ('917811183269272723', 'Brother of the Year', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Niramon Ross, Witthaya Thongyooyong, Parama Malakul Na Ayudhaya', 'Adisorn Trisirikasem, Nontra Kumwong, Tossaphon Riantong', 'Sunny Suwanmethanon, Urassaya Sperbund, Nichkhun Horvejkul, Manasaporn Chanchalerm, Anchuleeon Buagaew, Wittaya Jetapai, Theethat Suk-im, Achiraya Nitibhon', null, 'Jane lives with her brother Chut with her being the only one doing everything around the house. But Chut will need to learn to take care of himself when Jane becomes involved romantically with a Japanese coworker.', 'Jane lives with her brother Chut with her being the only one doing everything around the house. But Chut will need to learn to take care of himself when Jane becomes involved romantically with a Japanese coworker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3A2Nqn7rFVr768Jx45kCvWj1dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512732'),
  ('342047873534790055', 'Brother Orchid', 1940, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Lloyd Bacon, Tony Gaudio', 'Jerry Wald, Richard Macaulay', 'Edward G. Robinson, Ann Sothern, Humphrey Bogart, Donald Crisp, Ralph Bellamy, Allen Jenkins, Charles D. Brown, Cecil Kellaway', 'NR', 'When retired racket boss John Sarto tries to reclaim his place and former friends try to kill him, he finds solace in a monastery and reinvents himself as a pious monk.', 'When retired racket boss John Sarto tries to reclaim his place and former friends try to kill him, he finds solace in a monastery and reinvents himself as a pious monk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qf2Qr4cBrjpu3ZqiKaa3pP6T7Rr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26635'),
  ('198471994670684471', 'Brother Sun, Sister Moon', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Franco Zeffirelli, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Lina Wertmüller, Kenneth Ross', 'Graham Faulkner, Judi Bowker, Leigh Lawson, Kenneth Cranham, Lee Montague, Valentina Cortese, Alec Guinness, Michael Feast', 'PG', 'In his delirium from his return from war, Francesco Bernardone goes back in his memories to the days when he lived for parties and carnal pleasures. He slowly recovers, but after the illness he is no longer the Francesco that everybody knew. Instead of spending hours in taverns, he meditates on the beauty of God''s creatures, soon renouncing his riches and his family with plans to rebuild an abandoned church and his life.', 'In his delirium from his return from war, Francesco Bernardone goes back in his memories to the days when he lived for parties and carnal pleasures. He slowly recovers, but after the illness he is no longer the Francesco that everybody knew. Instead of spending hours in taverns, he meditates on the beauty of God''s creatures, soon renouncing his riches and his family with plans to rebuild an abandoned church and his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbe9jnRQKyxtLr2krJR6RBRwzae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2587'),
  ('368539971310958027', 'Brother Unknown', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alison Chan, Axel Lomas, Mallory Low', 'Alina Patra', 'Payton Ash, Adam Foster Ballard, Jonny Blando, Angelina Marie Broyles, Lexi Castillo', null, 'After her grandmother''s death, Katie isolates herself-until she finds Mark, a charming half-brother who offers the family she''s been missing. But soon, Katie''s instincts tell her something is wrong.', 'After her grandmother''s death, Katie isolates herself-until she finds Mark, a charming half-brother who offers the family she''s been missing. But soon, Katie''s instincts tell her something is wrong.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FujhUXdY1B5fp8OgQBSJQo1jTQs6.jpg', 'plex:movie:brother-unknown'),
  ('302694959889635636', 'Brother''s Keeper', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Sinofsky, Joe Berlinger', null, 'Connie Chung, John Teeple, Delbert Ward, Roscoe Ward, Lyman Ward', null, 'This documentary by Joe Berlinger and Bruce Sinofsky details the murder trial of Delbert Ward. Delbert was a member of a family of four elderly brothers, working as semi-literate farmers and living together in isolation from the rest of society until William''s death.', 'This documentary by Joe Berlinger and Bruce Sinofsky details the murder trial of Delbert Ward. Delbert was a member of a family of four elderly brothers, working as semi-literate farmers and living together in isolation from the rest of society until William''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjumCYR6VPXGDKlYekGkx5jMdfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26755'),
  ('1005962348360358670', 'Brother''s Keeper', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ferit Karahan, Türksoy Gölebeyi', 'Gülistan Acet, Ferit Karahan', 'Samet Yıldız, Nurullah Alaca, Ekin Koç, Mahir İpek, Melih Selçuk, Cansu Fırıncı, Münir Can Cindoruk, Dilan Parlak', null, 'Yusuf and his best friend Memo are pupils at a boarding school for Kurdish boys, secluded in the mountains of Eastern Anatolia. When Memo falls mysteriously ill, Yusuf is forced to struggle through the bureaucratic obstacles put up by the school''s repressive authorities to try to help his friend. But by the time the adults in charge finally understand the seriousness of Memo''s condition and try to get him to the hospital, the school has been buried under a sudden, heavy snowfall. With no way out and now desperate to reach help, teachers and pupils engage in a blame game where grudges, feelings of guilt and hidden secrets emerge, as time ticks mercilessly on and threatens to run out.', 'Yusuf and his best friend Memo are pupils at a boarding school for Kurdish boys, secluded in the mountains of Eastern Anatolia. When Memo falls mysteriously ill, Yusuf is forced to struggle through the bureaucratic obstacles put up by the school''s repressive authorities to try to help his friend. But by the time the adults in charge finally understand the seriousness of Memo''s condition and try to get him to the hospital, the school has been buried under a sudden, heavy snowfall. With no way out and now desperate to reach help, teachers and pupils engage in a blame game where grudges, feelings of guilt and hidden secrets emerge, as time ticks mercilessly on and threatens to run out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTqV0pzQkbpTs8olGghxOy3gwUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776659'),
  ('844821627164715633', 'Brotherhood', 2009, 'Drama', 'Nicolo Donato', 'Rasmus Birch, Nicolo Donato', 'Nicolas Bro, David Dencik, Claus Flygare, Michael Grønnemose, Hanne Hedelund, Thure Lindhardt, Mads Rømer, Morten Holst', null, 'Former Danish servicemen Lars and Jimmy are thrown together while training in a neo-Nazi group. Moving from hostility through grudging admiration to friendship and finally passion, events take a darker turn when their illicit relationship is uncovered.', 'Former Danish servicemen Lars and Jimmy are thrown together while training in a neo-Nazi group. Moving from hostility through grudging admiration to friendship and finally passion, events take a darker turn when their illicit relationship is uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzVg3nYnPJTbDOdihNS9nuoaCKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25541'),
  ('346745773415568983', 'Brotherhood', 2010, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Will Canon, Michael Fimognari', 'Will Canon, Doug Simon', 'Jon Foster, Trevor Morgan, Arlen Escarpeta, Lou Taylor Pucci, Jesse Steccato, Luke Sexton, Jennifer Sipes, Evan Gamble', 'R', 'Adam Buckley finds himself in the middle of a convenience store robbery during his last night as a pledge for a college fraternity. When the initiation ritual goes horribly wrong, and every move proves disastrous, Adam is forced to confront a new challenge all together, and he has to take a stand.', 'Adam Buckley finds himself in the middle of a convenience store robbery during his last night as a pledge for a college fraternity. When the initiation ritual goes horribly wrong, and every move proves disastrous, Adam is forced to confront a new challenge all together, and he has to take a stand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2302IU1ouScHrOHMEaVczXtamIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51462'),
  ('325850176574026790', 'Brotherhood', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Noel Clarke, Aaron Reid', 'Noel Clarke', 'Noel Clarke, Arnold Oceng, Shanika Warren-Markland, Adjoa Andoh, Cornell John, Red Madrell, Fredi ''Kruga'' Nwaka, David Ajala', null, 'First there was Kidulthood then Adulthood now comes Noel Clarkes last installment brotherhood With Sam facing up to the new world he realizes it also comes with new problems and new challenges that he must face that he knows will require old friends to help him survive new dangers.', 'First there was Kidulthood then Adulthood now comes Noel Clarkes last installment brotherhood With Sam facing up to the new world he realizes it also comes with new problems and new challenges that he must face that he knows will require old friends to help him survive new dangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oMMBxqqThvmOoUDx1rYOPFHons.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402334'),
  ('353080924742006727', 'Brotherhood', 2020, 'Drama, Family', 'Meryam Joobeur, Vincent Gonneville', 'Meryam Joobeur', 'Mohamed Grayaâ, Salha Nasraoui, Kais Ayari, Mouldi Kriden, Jasmin Lazid, Walid Loued, Alaeddine Mandhouj, Chaker Mechergui', null, 'Mohamed is a hardened shepherd living in rural Tunisia with his wife and two sons. Mohamed is deeply shaken when his oldest son Malik returns home after a long journey with a mysterious new wife. Tension between father and son rises over three days until reaching a breaking point.', 'Mohamed is a hardened shepherd living in rural Tunisia with his wife and two sons. Mohamed is deeply shaken when his oldest son Malik returns home after a long journey with a mysterious new wife. Tension between father and son rises over three days until reaching a breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiQeUsihG4gWOh3uAHxzAZqSPrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545642'),
  ('1036114994659971040', 'Brotherhood of Blades', 2014, 'Romance, Action, Drama', 'Lu Yang, Han Qiming, Sang Lin', 'Lu Yang, Chen Shu', 'Chang Chen, Liu Shishi, Wang Qianyuan, Li Dongxue, Nie Yuan, King Shih-chieh, Ye Qing, Zhou Yiwei', 'NR', 'In the late Ming Dynasty, three sworn brothers who serve as the imperial secret police are dispatched to hunt down Wei Zhongxian, a eunuch politician who had been forced to resign from his influential post and exiled from Beijing. The brothers return successfully from their quest, only to find that their task was but the beginning of a strange conspiracy.', 'In the late Ming Dynasty, three sworn brothers who serve as the imperial secret police are dispatched to hunt down Wei Zhongxian, a eunuch politician who had been forced to resign from his influential post and exiled from Beijing. The brothers return successfully from their quest, only to find that their task was but the beginning of a strange conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2mXV6VXqpxxv5Zet9xc2rKVpJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291692'),
  ('682147263655098032', 'Brotherhood of Blades II: The Infernal Battlefield', 2017, 'Romance, Action, Drama, History', 'Lu Yang, Han Qiming, Sang Lin', 'Chen Shu, Lu Yang, Yu Yang', 'Chang Chen, Yang Mi, Zhang Yi, Lei Jiayin, Xin Zhilei, King Shih-chieh, Liu Duanduan, Li Yuan', 'NR', 'An imperial guard searches for the truth behind a conspiracy that framed him and his partners. The proof of his innocence lies with a wanted woman named Bei Zhai... but will she reveal what she knows? In this intense prequel to BROTHERHOOD OF BLADES, the only thing he can truly trust is his sword.', 'An imperial guard searches for the truth behind a conspiracy that framed him and his partners. The proof of his innocence lies with a wanted woman named Bei Zhai... but will she reveal what she knows? In this intense prequel to BROTHERHOOD OF BLADES, the only thing he can truly trust is his sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooC6al3vhhECG998ZivkAZUdgst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457837'),
  ('364224051204015793', 'Brotherhood of Blood', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Scheerer, Michael Roesch, River O''Mahoney Hagg', 'Peter Scheerer, Michael Roesch', 'Victoria Pratt, Jason Connery, Ken Foree, Sid Haig, William Snow, Wes Ramsey, Jeremy Kissner, Rachel Grant', 'R', 'Driven by vengeance, thirsty for blood... and damned to hell! Guarded by vampires and chained in a dark cellar by the mighty vampire King Pashek, crack vampire hunter Carrie Rieger''s time is running out.her relentless quest to crush the world''s undead scourge has brought her to the home of Pashek. But she is not here to hill him. Instead she wishes to join forces with her immortal enemies in an effort to rise up against an even more terrifying threat, one that would chill the soul of even the most blood-thirsty vampire; the mighty vampire demon Vlad Kossel.Thought to have been killed many hundreds of years ago, Kossel has now returned to wreak bloody vengeance on his kind before enslaving humanity. He will destroy everything in his path and there is only one hunter who can stop him...', 'Driven by vengeance, thirsty for blood... and damned to hell! Guarded by vampires and chained in a dark cellar by the mighty vampire King Pashek, crack vampire hunter Carrie Rieger''s time is running out.her relentless quest to crush the world''s undead scourge has brought her to the home of Pashek. But she is not here to hill him. Instead she wishes to join forces with her immortal enemies in an effort to rise up against an even more terrifying threat, one that would chill the soul of even the most blood-thirsty vampire; the mighty vampire demon Vlad Kossel.Thought to have been killed many hundreds of years ago, Kossel has now returned to wreak bloody vengeance on his kind before enslaving humanity. He will destroy everything in his path and there is only one hunter who can stop him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0eXT7qxXpVxw6zQbbrWyiCefoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12682'),
  ('679333358585325122', 'Brotherhood of Death', 1976, 'Action, Drama', 'Bill Berry, Fritz Roland', 'Bill Berry', 'Roy Jefferson, Le Tari, Haskell V. Anderson III, Mike Thomas, Michael Hodge, Ron David, Rick Ellis, Brian Donohue', 'R', 'A group of Black soldiers are home from the war and head to a small Southern town. The town is dominated by a group of Klansmen who keep the Black majority from voting or being treated like human beings. However, these newcomers convince the local population to register to vote so they can take back power and achieve justice. When hundreds show up to register, the Klan responds with violence. Eventually, though, the Black community has little choice other than fight back and the film ends with a small war between these combat vets and the Klan.', 'A group of Black soldiers are home from the war and head to a small Southern town. The town is dominated by a group of Klansmen who keep the Black majority from voting or being treated like human beings. However, these newcomers convince the local population to register to vote so they can take back power and achieve justice. When hundreds show up to register, the Klan responds with violence. Eventually, though, the Black community has little choice other than fight back and the film ends with a small war between these combat vets and the Klan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sc156Zlu477KMKZGUqF3gHZtLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87790'),
  ('1133068848730936272', 'Brotherhood of Tears', 2013, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Jean-Baptiste Andrea, Jean-Pierre Sauvaire', 'Jean-Baptiste Andrea, Gael Malry', 'Jérémie Renier, Audrey Fleurot, Mélusine Mayance, Bouli Lanners, Antoine Basler, Fabrice Michel, Denis Jousselin, Bruno Ricci', null, 'Gabriel Chevalier, 45 years old, is an ex-policeman. Unemployed, lonely and depressed,he lives like a ghost and hardly takes care of his only teenage child Juliette. One day, by pure chance, he finds a suspicious but extremely well paid job: his daily mission consists of delivering a briefcase exactly where he is told. The only rule being to never open it. These deliveries will bring him to meet weird people in strange places. Gradually, his cop instinct resurfaces...', 'Gabriel Chevalier, 45 years old, is an ex-policeman. Unemployed, lonely and depressed,he lives like a ghost and hardly takes care of his only teenage child Juliette. One day, by pure chance, he finds a suspicious but extremely well paid job: his daily mission consists of delivering a briefcase exactly where he is told. The only rule being to never open it. These deliveries will bring him to meet weird people in strange places. Gradually, his cop instinct resurfaces...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqKzfcD2CsTHNn6gfJRSV7IVFSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226788'),
  ('341473089896835013', 'Brotherhood of the Wolf', 2001, 'Adventure, Horror, Action, History', 'Christophe Gans, Dan Laustsen, John Stephenson', 'Stéphane Cabel, Christophe Gans', 'Samuel Le Bihan, Vincent Cassel, Émilie Dequenne, Monica Bellucci, Jérémie Renier, Mark Dacascos, Jean Yanne, Jean-François Stévenin', 'R', 'In 18th century France, the Chevalier de Fronsac and his Native American friend Mani are sent by the King to the Gevaudan province to investigate the killings of hundreds by a mysterious beast.', 'In 18th century France, the Chevalier de Fronsac and his Native American friend Mani are sent by the King to the Gevaudan province to investigate the killings of hundreds by a mysterious beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ahd4F7azhjsxgXYjVyFmVzJu9LB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6312'),
  ('609520302038082588', 'Brotherly Love', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jamal Hill, Matthew Joffe', 'Jamal Hill', 'Keke Palmer, Cory Hardrict, Eric D. Hill Jr., Quincy Brown, Nafessa Williams, Logan Browning, Bandit The Rapper, Teyana Taylor', null, 'West Philadelphia basketball star Sergio Taylor deals with the pressures of fame while his brother and sister have their own issues with ambition.', 'West Philadelphia basketball star Sergio Taylor deals with the pressures of fame while his brother and sister have their own issues with ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8Fg0EcHvNLjvASg0h1FbwvrIXe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295886'),
  ('1032876320692070170', 'Brothers', 2004, 'Drama, War', 'Susanne Bier, Morten Søborg, Joakim Höglund', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Susanne Bier', 'Connie Nielsen, Ulrich Thomsen, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Sarah Juel Werner, Rebecca Løgstrup, Solbjørg Højfeldt, Bent Mejding, Niels Olsen', null, 'A Danish officer, Michael, is sent away to the International Security Assistance Force operation in Afghanistan for three months. His first mission there is to find a young radar technician who had been separated from his squad some days earlier. While on the search, his helicopter is shot down and he is taken as a prisoner of war, but is reported dead to the family.', 'A Danish officer, Michael, is sent away to the International Security Assistance Force operation in Afghanistan for three months. His first mission there is to find a young radar technician who had been separated from his squad some days earlier. While on the search, his helicopter is shot down and he is taken as a prisoner of war, but is reported dead to the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faViDuoxyQ3qJsCbLclqBp4oK4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3875'),
  ('1012496797836865281', 'Brothers', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Jim Sheridan, Frederick Elmes, Michael Lohmann', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Susanne Bier', 'Tobey Maguire, Jake Gyllenhaal, Natalie Portman, Sam Shepard, Mare Winningham, Bailee Madison, Taylor Geare, Patrick John Flueger', 'R', 'When his helicopter goes down during his fourth tour of duty in Afghanistan, Marine Sam Cahill is presumed dead. Back home, brother Tommy steps in to look over Sam’s wife, Grace, and two children. Sam’s surprise homecoming triggers domestic mayhem.', 'When his helicopter goes down during his fourth tour of duty in Afghanistan, Marine Sam Cahill is presumed dead. Back home, brother Tommy steps in to look over Sam’s wife, Grace, and two children. Sam’s surprise homecoming triggers domestic mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skHqceAFYee0JZuYd9MVk2IQggi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7445'),
  ('187226901341751470', 'Brothers', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'Hemant Chaturvedi, Karan Malhotra, Panchami Ghavri', 'Ekta Pathak Malhotra', 'Akshay Kumar, Sidharth Malhotra, Jackie Shroff, Jacqueline Fernandez, Shefali Shah, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Ashutosh Rana, Kiran Kumar', null, 'David and Monty, estranged half-brothers, train in mixed martial arts to earn a livelihood. However, things change when the two are forced to compete against each other in the final tournament.', 'David and Monty, estranged half-brothers, train in mixed martial arts to earn a livelihood. However, things change when the two are forced to compete against each other in the final tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjZv4IbGdn84Bxqt3aBB6zlWZPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330037'),
  ('898833973196803108', 'Brothers', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Quyen Tran, Max Barbakow', 'Macon Blair', 'Josh Brolin, Peter Dinklage, Glenn Close, Brendan Fraser, Taylour Paige, M. Emmet Walsh, Jennifer Landon, Joshua Mikel', 'R', 'A reformed criminal''s attempt at going straight is derailed when he reunites with his sanity-testing twin brother on a road trip for the score of a lifetime. Dodging bullets, the law, and an overbearing mother along the way, they must heal their severed family bond before they end up killing each other.', 'A reformed criminal''s attempt at going straight is derailed when he reunites with his sanity-testing twin brother on a road trip for the score of a lifetime. Dodging bullets, the law, and an overbearing mother along the way, they must heal their severed family bond before they end up killing each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Akweo95FGyDpucYVT81h0SbX8Ky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616446'),
  ('239418548061933620', 'Brothers and Sisters of the Toda Family', 1941, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta', 'Tadao Ikeda, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Hideo Fujino, Fumiko Katsuragi, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Tatsuo Saitō, Kuniko Miyake, Shin Saburi, Yoshiko Tsubouchi, Toshiaki Konoe', null, 'After the death of her husband, an elderly woman and her youngest, unmarried daughter are forced to sell their house to cover his debts and decide to move in with one of the former''s children, each of whom is scarcely happy to accommodate.', 'After the death of her husband, an elderly woman and her youngest, unmarried daughter are forced to sell their house to cover his debts and decide to move in with one of the former''s children, each of whom is scarcely happy to accommodate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4WR3geAbWo5SWHVL05TaegqBcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94659'),
  ('1080826822084053407', 'Brothers by Blood', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Menno Mans, Jérémie Guez, Baudouin du Bois', 'Jérémie Guez', 'Matthias Schoenaerts, Joel Kinnaman, Maika Monroe, Paul Schneider, Ryan Phillippe, Nicholas Crovetti, Felix Scott, Antoni Corone', 'R', 'Peter and Michael, raised on the streets of Philadelphia, are the children of Irish mob members, forever linked by the crimes of their fathers. 30 years later, Michael now runs the criminal organization and lusts for more power, his dangerous antics frequently held in check by his cautious cousin Peter. Haunted by the death of his sister, whose passing destroyed both his parents, Peter is caught between the dreams of childhood and the realities of his life as an enforcer. His only reprieve is a local boxing gym, a sanctuary that is quickly threatened as Michael’s desire for control escalates.', 'Peter and Michael, raised on the streets of Philadelphia, are the children of Irish mob members, forever linked by the crimes of their fathers. 30 years later, Michael now runs the criminal organization and lusts for more power, his dangerous antics frequently held in check by his cautious cousin Peter. Haunted by the death of his sister, whose passing destroyed both his parents, Peter is caught between the dreams of childhood and the realities of his life as an enforcer. His only reprieve is a local boxing gym, a sanctuary that is quickly threatened as Michael’s desire for control escalates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKSs1Ce4wOJSwqlqFdi4BuQ9Q9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592656'),
  ('816615140093164485', 'Brothers Five', 1970, 'Action', 'Lo Wei, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Simon Chui Yee-Ngau', 'Lo Wei, Ni Kuang', 'Cheng Pei-Pei, Lo Lieh, Chang Yi, Elliot Ngok Wah, Chin Han, Kao Yuen, Tien Feng, Little Unicorn', 'NR', 'The 5 Kao brothers, separated since childhood, are unaware that the master Teng Lung Manor, Lung Chen-feng has killed their father. All five, however, seek to defeat the vicious gangsters at the Manor.', 'The 5 Kao brothers, separated since childhood, are unaware that the master Teng Lung Manor, Lung Chen-feng has killed their father. All five, however, seek to defeat the vicious gangsters at the Manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6I0wE5OWzL4giIlQd3bMaOXDVxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41541'),
  ('301638660441796973', 'Brothers in Arms', 1989, 'Thriller, Action', 'Robert Alazraki, Marc Angelo, Catherine Deserbais', 'Alexandre Arcady, Pierre Aknine, Saïd Amadis', 'Richard Berry, Patrick Bruel, Bruno Cremer, Claude Brasseur, Saïd Amadis, Corinne Dacla, Marthe Villalonga, Amidou', null, 'Simon, a Jewish police inspector, arrests Karim, a Muslim, in the bust of a drug smuggling cargo ship, only to realize that Karim is an undercover agent from the military intelligence, whose mission he was not aware of. The two men pursue the narc investigation, which will lead them to confront middle eastern terrorists together.', 'Simon, a Jewish police inspector, arrests Karim, a Muslim, in the bust of a drug smuggling cargo ship, only to realize that Karim is an undercover agent from the military intelligence, whose mission he was not aware of. The two men pursue the narc investigation, which will lead them to confront middle eastern terrorists together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjqSnanFpsuylqCPZdAukvbigT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66635'),
  ('383777127085112658', 'Brothers Investigation', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Murat Kaman, Koray Sahin', 'Mustafa Eray Kaman, Murat Kaman, Koray Sahin', 'Cem Gelinoğlu, Doğu Demirkol, Güven Kıraç, Angela Dixon, Amelie Leroy', null, 'Brothers Investigation (2026) released on March 20, 2026 starring Cem Gelinoğlu, Doğu Demirkol, Güven Kıraç and directed by Murat Kaman. Get notified when Brothers Investigation is available to stream!', 'Brothers Investigation (2026) released on March 20, 2026 starring Cem Gelinoğlu, Doğu Demirkol, Güven Kıraç and directed by Murat Kaman. Get notified when Brothers Investigation is available to stream!', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZjJkNTgxNjktMzU5NS00OThjLTk3MzctZGI5YTk2M2UxNjY3XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:brothers-investigation'),
  ('795876377003812721', 'Brothers of the Head', 2006, 'Music, Drama', 'Dan Channing-Williams, Anthony Wilcox, Gareth Cousins', 'Tony Grisoni', 'Harry Treadaway, Luke Treadaway, Bryan Dick, Sean Harris, Tania Emery, Diana Kent, Tom Bower, David Kennedy', null, 'In the 1970s a music promoter plucks Siamese twins from obscurity and grooms them into a freakish rock''n''roll act. A dark tale of sex, strangeness and rock music.', 'In the 1970s a music promoter plucks Siamese twins from obscurity and grooms them into a freakish rock''n''roll act. A dark tale of sex, strangeness and rock music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YnQYxb9IiC5n4jmXDsEERLRH7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16429'),
  ('295541223891734958', 'Brothers of the Night', 2016, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Patric Chiha, Klemens Hufnagl, Denise Teipel', 'Patric Chiha', 'Stefan, Yonko, Asen, Nikolay, Vassili, Alexander, Daniel, Emil', null, 'Soft boys by day, kings by night. The film follows a group of young Bulgarian Roma who come to Vienna looking for freedom and a quick buck. They sell their bodies as if that''s all they had. What comforts them, so far from home, is the feeling of being together. But the nights are long and unpredictable.', 'Soft boys by day, kings by night. The film follows a group of young Bulgarian Roma who come to Vienna looking for freedom and a quick buck. They sell their bodies as if that''s all they had. What comforts them, so far from home, is the feeling of being together. But the nights are long and unpredictable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIPk4R7E5GPOsrr0xZlGPVAk9k3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378510'),
  ('203178388652446005', 'Brothers of the Wind', 2015, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Niki Brechelmacher, Jorge Calvo, Doris Zechner', 'Joanne Reay', 'Manuel Camacho, Jean Reno, Tobias Moretti, Eva Kuen', null, 'The way of the eagle is to raise two chicks. The stronger is destined always to throw the weaker from the nest. Man also has his ways, often to hurt those closest to him. Lukas suffers at the hands of a father who has withdrawn since the loss of his wife. Killed whilst rescuing the infant Lukas, the boy now carries the burden of her death. Our eagle’s story begins in the nest. The first-born chick pushes his weaker brother to a certain death on the forest floor. But fate intervenes and the chick is found by Lukas. Naming him Abel, Lukas cares for the creature in secret, finding a love and companionship denied to him at home. But when the day comes to release Abel back into the wild, will Lukas find his own release into a new life?', 'The way of the eagle is to raise two chicks. The stronger is destined always to throw the weaker from the nest. Man also has his ways, often to hurt those closest to him. Lukas suffers at the hands of a father who has withdrawn since the loss of his wife. Killed whilst rescuing the infant Lukas, the boy now carries the burden of her death. Our eagle’s story begins in the nest. The first-born chick pushes his weaker brother to a certain death on the forest floor. But fate intervenes and the chick is found by Lukas. Naming him Abel, Lukas cares for the creature in secret, finding a love and companionship denied to him at home. But when the day comes to release Abel back into the wild, will Lukas find his own release into a new life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA3urgwFH0ctZAAS61ohM9iGOB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378373'),
  ('586469439279846064', 'Brothers Till We Die', 1977, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Umberto Lenzi, Federico Zanni, Alessandro Metz', 'Umberto Lenzi, Tomas Milian', 'Tomas Milian, Pino Colizzi, Isa Danieli, Mario Piave, Sal Borgese, Luciano Catenacci, Solvi Stübing, Guido Leontini', null, 'Vincenzo ''hunchback'' plans a robbery on a armored police van with his gang. Once the job is done, his gang try to kill him and absconds with the loot. Vincenzo hides in the sewers before looking up his friend Monezza who the police later interrogate for his involvement with vincenzo. Meanwhile, Vincenzo is getting revenge on his gang by killing them off one at the time in his various brutal ways.', 'Vincenzo ''hunchback'' plans a robbery on a armored police van with his gang. Once the job is done, his gang try to kill him and absconds with the loot. Vincenzo hides in the sewers before looking up his friend Monezza who the police later interrogate for his involvement with vincenzo. Meanwhile, Vincenzo is getting revenge on his gang by killing them off one at the time in his various brutal ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4etjoiAccZW4CmmE995cCGOkR9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52809'),
  ('400009986596677673', 'Brothers-In-Law', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Toño López', 'Araceli G. Cabreira', 'Xosé A. Touriñán, Miguel de Lira, Federico Pérez Rey, Eva Fernández, Iolanda Muiños, María Vázquez, Mela Casal, Paku Granxa', null, 'Brothers-in-law, Eduardo and Sabonis, married to sisters Cuca and Peque Ribeiro, have made a real mess of one of their business ventures and are in need of money, a lot of money. It will be Sabonis who, in one of his uncontrollable fits of rage, comes up with a plan to fix all their problems in one go: kidnap Modesto, brother-in-law to Alicia Zamora, the businesswoman who screwed them over. There’s just one problem: Alicia has no intention of paying even a penny to get her brother-in-law back. In the end, it will be Modesto himself who comes up with a new plan to help Eduardo and Sabonis get the money they need to save the family wine business. What they don’t know is that police officer Mati, the Ribeiro’s middle sister, is on to their little plan. Eduardo, Sabonis and Modesto have everything to lose, but as Sabonis would say, what could go wrong?', 'Brothers-in-law, Eduardo and Sabonis, married to sisters Cuca and Peque Ribeiro, have made a real mess of one of their business ventures and are in need of money, a lot of money. It will be Sabonis who, in one of his uncontrollable fits of rage, comes up with a plan to fix all their problems in one go: kidnap Modesto, brother-in-law to Alicia Zamora, the businesswoman who screwed them over. There’s just one problem: Alicia has no intention of paying even a penny to get her brother-in-law back. In the end, it will be Modesto himself who comes up with a new plan to help Eduardo and Sabonis get the money they need to save the family wine business. What they don’t know is that police officer Mati, the Ribeiro’s middle sister, is on to their little plan. Eduardo, Sabonis and Modesto have everything to lose, but as Sabonis would say, what could go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YBVuU8S3LdlAbf0gozq4qFOw6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793155'),
  ('592841989403877049', 'Brothers'' Nest', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Clayton Jacobson, Peter Falk', 'Shane Jacobson, Jaime Browne', 'Shane Jacobson, Clayton Jacobson, Kim Gyngell, Lynette Curran, Sarah Snook', null, 'With their Mother dying of cancer, intent on changing her will to benefit her new husband before she dies, two brothers go to extreme and deadly lengths to protect their inheritance from being signed away before it’s too late.', 'With their Mother dying of cancer, intent on changing her will to benefit her new husband before she dies, two brothers go to extreme and deadly lengths to protect their inheritance from being signed away before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2k7IdRHHuD2HZPZMWsZzRFUHoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503755'),
  ('1119088610254332279', 'Brown of Harvard', 1926, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Conway, Ira H. Morgan', 'A.P. Younger', 'William Haines, Jack Pickford, Mary Brian, Francis X. Bushman Jr., Mary Alden, David Torrence, Edward Connelly, Donald Reed', 'NR', 'Tom Brown shows up at Harvard, confident and a bit arrogant. He becomes a rival of Bob McAndrew, not only in football and rowing crew, but also for the affections of Mary Abbott, a professor''s daughter.', 'Tom Brown shows up at Harvard, confident and a bit arrogant. He becomes a rival of Bob McAndrew, not only in football and rowing crew, but also for the affections of Mary Abbott, a professor''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4p55sMwwDD8LBhHilcVqJa05ZrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117211'),
  ('177738313977130183', 'Brown Paper Bag', 2020, 'Drama', 'Detdrich McClure', 'Detdrich McClure', 'Rasheed Stephens, Tiara Parker, Michael Anthony Jr., Caesar James, Antonio D. Charity, Vivia E. Armstrong, Anthony M. Bertram, Suzan Brittan', null, 'The year is 1942, and Archie Glass Is trying to get into Hollywood. His chance comes as he is offered a job: Find a young white movie star before the press reports that she is missing and he will have a shot at his Hollywood dream. Thus begins a journey into a Los Angeles you have never seen before, the actors who play the maids, the busboys, the background actors in jungle films, all spring into the foreground in this dramatic noir about a man willing to do anything to make his dream come true. Archie searches the back alley of Hollywood and discovers more lies than truth. Ultimately he finds the woman he is looking for and the dark reality of being a black man in tinsel town.', 'The year is 1942, and Archie Glass Is trying to get into Hollywood. His chance comes as he is offered a job: Find a young white movie star before the press reports that she is missing and he will have a shot at his Hollywood dream. Thus begins a journey into a Los Angeles you have never seen before, the actors who play the maids, the busboys, the background actors in jungle films, all spring into the foreground in this dramatic noir about a man willing to do anything to make his dream come true. Archie searches the back alley of Hollywood and discovers more lies than truth. Ultimately he finds the woman he is looking for and the dark reality of being a black man in tinsel town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M69Ge5U2q7EWhyOwHYaqell1JR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673216'),
  ('626392751258650614', 'Brown Sugar', 2002, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Rick Famuyiwa, Jono Oliver, Rebecca Strickland', 'Michael Elliot, Rick Famuyiwa', 'Sanaa Lathan, Taye Diggs, Yasiin Bey, Nicole Ari Parker, Boris Kodjoe, Queen Latifah, Wendell Pierce, Erik Weiner', 'PG-13', 'Sidney and Dre can attribute their lifelong friendship and the launch of their careers to one single childhood instant... witnessing the birth of hip-hop on a New York street corner. Now some 15 years later, she is a revered music critic at a national magazine and he is a successful, though unfulfilled, hip-hop record company executive. Both come to realize that their true life passions will only be fulfilled by remembering what they learned that day on the corner.', 'Sidney and Dre can attribute their lifelong friendship and the launch of their careers to one single childhood instant... witnessing the birth of hip-hop on a New York street corner. Now some 15 years later, she is a revered music critic at a national magazine and he is a successful, though unfulfilled, hip-hop record company executive. Both come to realize that their true life passions will only be fulfilled by remembering what they learned that day on the corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9SnhQk29094VoLfyiYM4viyCrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37964'),
  ('840348349729010193', 'Brown''s Requiem', 1998, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jason Freeland, Seo Mutarevic, George Bamber', 'Jason Freeland', 'Michael Rooker, Tobin Bell, Selma Blair, Jack Conley, Kevin Corrigan, Brad Dourif, Harold Gould, Brion James', 'R', 'Fritz Brown is an ex-LAPD, recovering alcoholic who now splits his time repossessing cars for a used car lot and staffing his one-man private detective agency. When a filthy caddie named Freddy "Fat Dog" Baker wanders into Fritz''s office one day, flashing a wad of cash, Fritz is hired to follow Fat Dog''s kid sister Jane, who is holed up with a Beverly Hills sugar daddy named Sol Kupferman. Kupferman is a 70 year-old bag man for the mob, and Fat Dog claims that "Solly K" is up to something evil that may harm Jane. The trail leads Fritz to an encounter with his dark past in the person of Haywood Cathcart, current head of LAPD internal affairs and the person who kicked Fritz off the police force.', 'Fritz Brown is an ex-LAPD, recovering alcoholic who now splits his time repossessing cars for a used car lot and staffing his one-man private detective agency. When a filthy caddie named Freddy "Fat Dog" Baker wanders into Fritz''s office one day, flashing a wad of cash, Fritz is hired to follow Fat Dog''s kid sister Jane, who is holed up with a Beverly Hills sugar daddy named Sol Kupferman. Kupferman is a 70 year-old bag man for the mob, and Fat Dog claims that "Solly K" is up to something evil that may harm Jane. The trail leads Fritz to an encounter with his dark past in the person of Haywood Cathcart, current head of LAPD internal affairs and the person who kicked Fritz off the police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhshoH9MZM9cB9lfArRtZ0mf9Gv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64166'),
  ('58127730712882831', 'Brownian Movement', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nanouk Leopold, Frank van den Eeden', 'Nanouk Leopold', 'Sandra Hüller, Dragan Bakema, Sabine Timoteo, Ryan Brodie, Frieda Pittoors, Nicole Shirer, Ergün Şimşek, Kuno Bakker', 'R', 'A psychiatrist''s adulterous past continues to haunt her and her husband after they move to India.', 'A psychiatrist''s adulterous past continues to haunt her and her husband after they move to India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iImlVuS4iHLRx4Tl0OqvFeg1fkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70761'),
  ('173075163182920083', 'Brubaker', 1980, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Bruno Nuytten, Jon C. Andersen', 'W.D. Richter', 'Robert Redford, Yaphet Kotto, Jane Alexander, Murray Hamilton, David Keith, Morgan Freeman, Matt Clark, Tim McIntire', 'R', 'The new warden of a small prison farm in Arkansas tries to clean it up of corruption after initially posing as an inmate.', 'The new warden of a small prison farm in Arkansas tries to clean it up of corruption after initially posing as an inmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DhrSojl3J0Z4wZyM2CfNGnKQWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1623'),
  ('939157444852046178', 'Bruce Almighty', 2003, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tom Shadyac, Dean Semler, Dawn Swiderski', 'Mark O''Keefe, Steve Koren, Steve Oedekerk', 'Jim Carrey, Morgan Freeman, Jennifer Aniston, Philip Baker Hall, Catherine Bell, Lisa Ann Walter, Steve Carell, Nora Dunn', 'PG-13', 'Bruce Nolan toils as a "human interest" television reporter in Buffalo, NY, but despite his high ratings and the love of his beautiful girlfriend, Bruce remains unfulfilled. At the end of the worst day in his life, he angrily ridicules God — and the Almighty responds, endowing Bruce with all of His divine powers.', 'Bruce Nolan toils as a "human interest" television reporter in Buffalo, NY, but despite his high ratings and the love of his beautiful girlfriend, Bruce remains unfulfilled. At the end of the worst day in his life, he angrily ridicules God — and the Almighty responds, endowing Bruce with all of His divine powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XJKBKh9Km89EoUEitVTSnrlAkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310'),
  ('1103132524841074583', 'Bruce Lee and I', 1976, 'Action', 'John Law Ma, Leung Cho, Wu Fa-Shen', 'Shu Lan, Suen A-Foo', 'Betty Ting Pei, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Wong San, Chin Ti, Wang Sha, Sze-Ma Wah-Lung, James Nam Seok-Hoon, Tony Lou Chun-Ku', null, 'A movie on the life of the renowned Bruce Lee, especially his relationship with his mistress.', 'A movie on the life of the renowned Bruce Lee, especially his relationship with his mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXLxj3fyBV6Y5obzwOLTcQfW4Zw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153358'),
  ('186967827190328296', 'Bruce Lee Fights Back from the Grave', 1976, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Lee Doo-yong, Chang-bok Ahn, Walter Chin', 'Lee Doo-yong', 'Chong Jun, Deborah Dutch, Bae Su-chun, Anthony Bronson, Kim Mun-ju, Sho Kosugi, Hwang Jang-Lee, Phillip Rhee', 'R', 'A lightning bolt strikes the grave of Bruce Lee. However, that is as much as Bruce Lee has to do with it. Then a kung fu instructor starts a quest to avenge a friend''s death, and on the way has a romance with a girl with similar problems. He eventually finds the bad guys behind it all, and has several fights with them...', 'A lightning bolt strikes the grave of Bruce Lee. However, that is as much as Bruce Lee has to do with it. Then a kung fu instructor starts a quest to avenge a friend''s death, and on the way has a romance with a girl with similar problems. He eventually finds the bad guys behind it all, and has several fights with them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wLCC4wM94oLaThz0na1PzcDUiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54840'),
  ('1003788869305097763', 'Bruce Lee, My Brother', 2010, 'Action, Drama', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Raymond Yip Wai-Man, Yang Zhenyu', 'Lau Ho-Leung', 'Aarif Rahman, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Jennifer Tse Ting-Ting, Zhang Yishan, Michelle Ye Xuan, Angela Gong Mi, Alex Man Chi-Leung', null, 'An action-dramatic biopic of the eponymous martial arts legend as told by his younger brother, Robert Lee. It revolves around Bruce Lee''s life as a rebellious adolescent in Hong Kong before he sets off for the USA and conquers the world at the age of 18 with only $100 in his pocket.', 'An action-dramatic biopic of the eponymous martial arts legend as told by his younger brother, Robert Lee. It revolves around Bruce Lee''s life as a rebellious adolescent in Hong Kong before he sets off for the USA and conquers the world at the age of 18 with only $100 in his pocket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txXFfNeGguClbLIbbHRPjZTtVy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53807'),
  ('202470529887428015', 'Bruce Lee, the Legend', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Chow', 'Russell Cawthorne', 'James B. Nicholson, Bruce Lee, Linda Lee Cadwell, Raymond Chow, Robert Clouse, Nora Miao, Hugh O''Brian, Siu Hon-Sang', null, 'The Official Golden Harvest tribute to the Master of the Martial Arts Film, Bruce Lee.', 'The Official Golden Harvest tribute to the Master of the Martial Arts Film, Bruce Lee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdD3whXbdfHjlcDNt2oEy6jsxjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44645'),
  ('801663664391019035', 'Bruce Lee: A Warrior''s Journey', 2000, 'Documentary, Action', 'John Little, Wayne Hawkins', 'Bey Logan, John Little', 'Bruce Lee, Doug Copsey, Linda Lee Cadwell, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar, Taky Kimura, Ji Han-Jae, Kim Hak-kyu, Kim Byung-joo', null, 'Documentary on the legendary martial artist Bruce Lee, with a focus on the production of his unfinished film Game of Death. Using interviews and behind-the-scenes footage, Lee aficionado John Little paints a portrait of the world''s most famous action hero, concluding with a new cut of Game of Death''s action finale, reconstructed from Lee''s notes and recently-recovered footage.', 'Documentary on the legendary martial artist Bruce Lee, with a focus on the production of his unfinished film Game of Death. Using interviews and behind-the-scenes footage, Lee aficionado John Little paints a portrait of the world''s most famous action hero, concluding with a new cut of Game of Death''s action finale, reconstructed from Lee''s notes and recently-recovered footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSJhm6X4FOAmBSEfTe2OvqGuBN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37588'),
  ('416551048057980884', 'Bruce Lee: The Lost Interview', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Michael Rothery', null, 'Bruce Lee, Pierre Berton', null, 'A priceless gem from the fine folks at The Internet Archive: Bruce Lee’s only existing television interview, from 1971. Martial arts expert Bruce Lee became world-renowned for his performances in such Kung-fu classics as ENTER THE DRAGON. Now his only interview in English is available. Just after the release of his first film THE BIG BOSS, he spoke in Hong Kong with Canada''s premier journalist Pierre Berton. This is the closest one can get to this extraordinary master.', 'A priceless gem from the fine folks at The Internet Archive: Bruce Lee’s only existing television interview, from 1971. Martial arts expert Bruce Lee became world-renowned for his performances in such Kung-fu classics as ENTER THE DRAGON. Now his only interview in English is available. Just after the release of his first film THE BIG BOSS, he spoke in Hong Kong with Canada''s premier journalist Pierre Berton. This is the closest one can get to this extraordinary master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVIgNSuX3TQ4rTCAXFTvSyiCEMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115955'),
  ('918791586128217418', 'Bruce Lee: The Man and the Legend', 1973, 'Documentary', 'Wu Shih', 'Wu Shih', 'Mei Wang, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Carter Huang Chia-Ta, Shannon Lee, Raymond Chow, Robert Chan Law-Bat, Chow Gat, Kam Chun-Pak', null, 'This documentary tells the story of Bruce Lee and his unsuccessful efforts to start a acting career in the U.S., he returned to Hong Kong where he became an international star, and his death at age 32.', 'This documentary tells the story of Bruce Lee and his unsuccessful efforts to start a acting career in the U.S., he returned to Hong Kong where he became an international star, and his death at age 32.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkQAEdxAMl2C4Cn9cSI4Zfu4v6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154114'),
  ('474187429631388462', 'Bruce Lee: The Man, The Myth', 1976, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ng See-Yuen', 'Ng See-Yuen', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Little Unicorn, Chiu Chi-Ling, Fung Ging-Man, Alan Chui Chung-San, Sham Chin-Bo, Mars, Fung Hak-On', 'R', 'A highly fictionalized biography of the famous Bruce Lee, this movie traces his college life, his marriage to Linda Lee, his relationship with his master, and his untimely death.', 'A highly fictionalized biography of the famous Bruce Lee, this movie traces his college life, his marriage to Linda Lee, his relationship with his master, and his untimely death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aJU3lCindvOCP0nsJnNlskPx0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39245'),
  ('986839408038727409', 'Bruce Springsteen''s Letter to You', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Thom Zimny', 'Bruce Springsteen', 'Bruce Springsteen, Roy Bittan, Nils Lofgren, Patti Scialfa, Garry Tallent, Steven Van Zandt, Max Weinberg, Charles Giordano', 'PG', 'A tribute to The E Street Band, rock ''n'' roll, and the way music has shaped Bruce Springsteen''s life, this documentary captures Bruce reflecting on love and loss while recording with his full band for the first time since Born in the U.S.A.', 'A tribute to The E Street Band, rock ''n'' roll, and the way music has shaped Bruce Springsteen''s life, this documentary captures Bruce reflecting on love and loss while recording with his full band for the first time since Born in the U.S.A.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSvs9mobDPPVT3gCHc3KakCzNB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750160'),
  ('87074673932108822', 'Bruce Strikes Back', 1982, 'Action', 'Huang Kin-Lung, Joseph Kong Hung, André Koob', 'Joseph Kong Hung, Kin Lung Siu Cho', 'Huang Kin-Lung, Hwang Jang-Lee, Casanova Wong, Harold Sakata, Bolo Yeung, Dick Randall, Jean-Marie Pallardy, Chiu Chi-Ling', 'R', 'Reformed criminal and ace martial artist Liang Cheng decides to go straight and settle down with his girlfriend after being released from prison. The gang he used to be part of kidnap the fetching young daughter of an American ambassador. Liang Cheng goes trekking all over the world in search of the lady.', 'Reformed criminal and ace martial artist Liang Cheng decides to go straight and settle down with his girlfriend after being released from prison. The gang he used to be part of kidnap the fetching young daughter of an American ambassador. Liang Cheng goes trekking all over the world in search of the lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rU2uQueccP3YU18WiC6r3bbo0NV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51112'),
  ('732293135565575946', 'Bruce''s Deadly Fingers', 1976, 'Action', 'Joseph Kong Hung', 'Woo Wan-Ping', 'Huang Kin-Lung, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Lo Lieh, Nora Miao, Nick Cheung Lik, Yuan Man-Tzu, Chiang Tao, Tong Tin-Hei', 'R', 'After malicious gangsters capture Bruce Wong''s ex-girlfriend, a young martial artist attempts to rescue her along with the late master''s book containing lethal techniques for killing with one''s fingers.', 'After malicious gangsters capture Bruce Wong''s ex-girlfriend, a young martial artist attempts to rescue her along with the late master''s book containing lethal techniques for killing with one''s fingers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJF8yMqI14LndLwGpfWiOuoCsvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77059'),
  ('479324418051417127', 'Bruised', 2021, 'Drama', 'Gerard DiNardi, Ram Paul Silbey, Halle Berry', 'Michelle Rosenfarb', 'Halle Berry, Adan Canto, Sheila Atim, Danny Boyd Jr., Adriane Lenox, Shamier Anderson, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Valentina Shevchenko', 'R', 'Jackie Justice is a mixed martial arts fighter who leaves the sport in disgrace. Down on her luck and simmering with rage and regret years after the fight, she''s coaxed into a brutal underground fight by her manager and boyfriend Desi and grabs the attention of a fight league promoter who promises Jackie a life back in the Octagon. But the road to redemption becomes unexpectedly personal when Manny - the son she gave up as an infant - shows up at her doorstep. A triumphant story of a fighter who reclaims her power, in and out of the ring, when everyone has counted her out', 'Jackie Justice is a mixed martial arts fighter who leaves the sport in disgrace. Down on her luck and simmering with rage and regret years after the fight, she''s coaxed into a brutal underground fight by her manager and boyfriend Desi and grabs the attention of a fight league promoter who promises Jackie a life back in the Octagon. But the road to redemption becomes unexpectedly personal when Manny - the son she gave up as an infant - shows up at her doorstep. A triumphant story of a fighter who reclaims her power, in and out of the ring, when everyone has counted her out', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axibOQF9QnThrr8M37ufAYurP4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718633'),
  ('134037338600563122', 'Bruiser', 2000, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'George A. Romero, Adam Swica', 'George A. Romero', 'Jason Flemyng, Peter Stormare, Leslie Hope, Nina Garbiras, Andrew Tarbet, Tom Atkins, Jonathan Higgins, Jeff Monahan', 'R', 'After years of being browbeaten and walked on, a man wakes one day wearing an expressionless mask, fitted with a personality that enables him to take revenge.', 'After years of being browbeaten and walked on, a man wakes one day wearing an expressionless mask, fitted with a personality that enables him to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giOkOy6mqUU5OMhvWPgZFJexZ8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29512'),
  ('749876908553174749', 'Bruiser', 2022, 'Drama', 'Miles Warren, Justin Derry, Josh Montes', 'Miles Warren, Ben Medina', 'Jalyn Hall, Trevante Rhodes, Shamier Anderson, Shinelle Azoroh, Frank Oakley III, Jonah Bishop-Pirrone, Sarah Bock, Kiah Alexandria Clingman', 'NR', 'During summer break, 14-year-old Darious explores the boundaries of his manhood through tumultuous interactions with Malcolm his strict father and a burgeoning mentorship with mysterious drifter Porter.', 'During summer break, 14-year-old Darious explores the boundaries of his manhood through tumultuous interactions with Malcolm his strict father and a burgeoning mentorship with mysterious drifter Porter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1H9RpfmIwDM5norUpYdiOdRkVQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014566'),
  ('667712836405848962', 'Bruja', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Marcelo Páez Cubells, Pablo Desanzo', 'Matias Caruso', 'Érica Rivas, Leticia Brédice, Pablo Rago, Rita Cortese, Miranda de la Serna, Fabián Arenillas, Guillermo Arengo, Pablo Ini', null, 'A single mother is an expert in black magic, but has never used it to do evil, until a prostitution network kidnaps her daughter.', 'A single mother is an expert in black magic, but has never used it to do evil, until a prostitution network kidnaps her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYrNIF1Qe2xPcmcjZyzsCVRqMiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619366'),
  ('355989189598172095', 'Bruna Louise: Demolition', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Fabio Ock', 'Bruna Louise', 'Bruna Louise', null, 'After being in the dating game for a while, comedian Bruna Louise has mastered the art of terrible relationships — by turning them into hilarious jokes.', 'After being in the dating game for a while, comedian Bruna Louise has mastered the art of terrible relationships — by turning them into hilarious jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zASk0BRyhtlS8TYDKoduMB2Ein.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981159'),
  ('629110127076746709', 'Brunch for Beginners', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Yana Titova', 'Yana Titova', 'Valentina Karoleva, Orlin Pavlov, Aleksandra Sarchadzhieva, Stiliyan Stoyanov, Jaklin Docheva', null, 'In a series of absurd situations and culinary disasters, sincere laughter shines through bitter tears. And the big question remains: is striving for the perfect image worth it, or is the recipe for true happiness hidden somewhere else?', 'In a series of absurd situations and culinary disasters, sincere laughter shines through bitter tears. And the big question remains: is striving for the perfect image worth it, or is the recipe for true happiness hidden somewhere else?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6AR1SieSNOhuntUKsBINS4Dnm0d.jpg', 'plex:movie:brunch-for-beginners'),
  ('1130513269166925352', 'Brunet Will Call', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Stanisław Bareja, Michał Dudziewicz, Marek Nowakowski', 'Stanisław Bareja, Stanisław Tym', 'Krzysztof Kowalewski, Wojciech Pokora, Janina Traczykówna, Wiesław Gołas, Bohdan Łazuka, Ryszard Pietruski, Bożena Dykiel, Jan Kobuszewski', null, 'Modest editor, has shipped his wife and kids for the weekend, and is trying to relax in his house at the outskirts of Warsaw. His quiet evening is only disturbed by the accidental forecast made by a Gypsy woman, that at evening time he will murder a mysterious brunet.', 'Modest editor, has shipped his wife and kids for the weekend, and is trying to relax in his house at the outskirts of Warsaw. His quiet evening is only disturbed by the accidental forecast made by a Gypsy woman, that at evening time he will murder a mysterious brunet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elxvBSf3Vg5gvFxmQUgBCU2FNW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81223'),
  ('505907072806179134', 'Bruno', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shirley MacLaine, Jan Kiesser', 'David Ciminello', 'Alex D. Linz, Shirley MacLaine, Gary Sinise, Kathy Bates, Joey Lauren Adams, Jennifer Tilly, Monica Hewes, Christian Durango', null, 'The story of a unique young boy genius, Bruno, whose expression of his own individuality leads his family and community along an emotional journey.', 'The story of a unique young boy genius, Bruno, whose expression of his own individuality leads his family and community along an emotional journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gj9iMwlKZh3C4Q21q1qNu8idVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95136'),
  ('1107416019753117608', 'Brüno', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Larry Charles, Wolfgang Held, Anthony Hardwick', 'Anthony Hines, Dan Mazer, Jeff Schaffer', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Gustaf Hammarsten, Clifford Bañagale, Josh Meyers, Toby Holguin, Robert Huerta, Gilbert Rosales, Thomas Rosales Jr.', 'R', 'Flamboyantly gay Austrian television reporter Bruno stirs up trouble with unsuspecting guests and large crowds through brutally frank interviews and painfully hilarious public displays of homosexuality.', 'Flamboyantly gay Austrian television reporter Bruno stirs up trouble with unsuspecting guests and large crowds through brutally frank interviews and painfully hilarious public displays of homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcUc7TYtsb72dHVb51sYaGIvQsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18480'),
  ('901228826713074333', 'Bruno Motoneta', 2018, null, 'Florencia Gabelli, Daniela Giménez, Néstor Sánchez Sotelo', 'Néstor Petrucceli', 'Facundo Gambandé, Candelaria Molfese, Mirta Busnelli, Esteban Prol, Brian Buley, Claudio Rissi, Fabio Alberti, Divina Gloria', null, 'The film tells the story of Bruno, who drives his motor scooter through the streets of Buenos Aires, making deliveries to the premises of "Extraordinary Objects" of his uncles. His friends wait for him to start the weekend but an unexpected accident with a relative changes his plans. Bruno starts a weekend of adventures, which will involve a scientist, a girl with unusual beauty, a group of aliens who love human flesh and an eccentric modern artist.', 'The film tells the story of Bruno, who drives his motor scooter through the streets of Buenos Aires, making deliveries to the premises of "Extraordinary Objects" of his uncles. His friends wait for him to start the weekend but an unexpected accident with a relative changes his plans. Bruno starts a weekend of adventures, which will involve a scientist, a girl with unusual beauty, a group of aliens who love human flesh and an eccentric modern artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZpLOuW70XxMsXw0JETgwCdUjm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514234'),
  ('1009286589213391334', 'Bruno Reidal: Confession of a Murderer', 2022, 'Drama', 'Michaël Capron, Lucie Bouilleret, Vincent Le Port', 'Vincent Le Port', 'Dimitri Doré, Jean-Luc Vincent, Roman Villedieu, Alex Fanguin, Tino Vigier, Nelly Bruel, Ivan Chiodetti, Dominique Legrand', null, 'Raulhac, Cantal, France, September 1, 1905. In the forest surrounding his hometown, the young seminarian Bruno Reidal murders a child and then surrenders himself to the authorities.', 'Raulhac, Cantal, France, September 1, 1905. In the forest surrounding his hometown, the young seminarian Bruno Reidal murders a child and then surrenders himself to the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHIrhCnG3PdlasQvKtLVTC5G5gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583556'),
  ('379477164917956443', 'Brussels by Night', 1983, 'Drama', 'Marc Didden, Willy Stassen, Dominique Deruddere', 'Marc Didden', 'François Beukelaers, Ingrid De Vos, Amid Chakir, Michiel Mentens, Nellie Rosiers, Marleen Merckx, Jan Reusens, Fred Van Kuyk', null, 'This is the story of a man who travels to Brussels, and meets some people with whom he spends a few days. When they all go on a day trip to the "slanting plane" of Ronquieres, all sorts of bottled up frustrations flare up.', 'This is the story of a man who travels to Brussels, and meets some people with whom he spends a few days. When they all go on a day trip to the "slanting plane" of Ronquieres, all sorts of bottled up frustrations flare up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5T5sOl4VxmECDfGu60DaHPT5gz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140590'),
  ('990590004438973805', 'Brutal', 2007, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Ethan Wiley, Andrea Melton, Devin Reeve', 'Ethan Wiley', 'Crystal Stone, Eric Lange, Sarah Thompson, Jeffrey Combs, Don O. Knowlton, Whitney Anderson, Cyrus Alexander, Michael Berryman', null, 'In a small town, a serial killer mutilates the bodies of his victims and leaves a flower on the corpses. The sheriff and his wife/deputy investigate the murders while trying to keep from alarming the citizens. They team up with an autistic hound dog trainer to try to track the killer.', 'In a small town, a serial killer mutilates the bodies of his victims and leaves a flower on the corpses. The sheriff and his wife/deputy investigate the murders while trying to keep from alarming the citizens. They team up with an autistic hound dog trainer to try to track the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HwEeKAuw5a5ehwiyBelpKgUjAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28791'),
  ('9514056983769550', 'Brutal', 2017, 'Horror', 'Takashi Hirose', 'Takashi Hirose', 'Butch, Ayano, Takashi Nishina, Asami, Katrina Grey, Naho Nakashima, Nanako Ohata', null, 'A savage murderer is on the prowl in Japan. One by one, his victims fall but what is he searching for? The same thing a murderess is looking for. We are all looking for that special love of our lives and sometimes, we''re willing to kill everyone to find that special someone. This is the tale of two people finding each other in the most vicious way possible.', 'A savage murderer is on the prowl in Japan. One by one, his victims fall but what is he searching for? The same thing a murderess is looking for. We are all looking for that special love of our lives and sometimes, we''re willing to kill everyone to find that special someone. This is the tale of two people finding each other in the most vicious way possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rc0Mzo9vSjyJPxQiyLsNoR0LCUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488829'),
  ('775175787388638444', 'Brutal', 2018, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Julien Le Du', 'Julien Le Du', 'Julien Le Du, Ghislaine André, Anarith Vonkiiro, J.C. Nero, Christoffer Frank, Manu G.', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAl6Q47rrPYJvqVzFnKVbAZoOap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549550'),
  ('61509254347881152', 'Brutal Tales of Chivalry', 1965, 'Action, Crime', 'Kiyoshi Saeki, Ichirō Hoshijima, Yasuo Furuhata', 'Isao Matsumoto, Akira Murao, Eimei Yamamoto', 'Ken Takakura, Ryō Ikebe, Hiroki Matsukata, Tatsuo Umemiya, Yoshiko Mita, Shinjirō Ehara, Kenji Sugawara, Michitarō Mizushima', null, 'After World War II, their town was a pile of rubble. Gennosuke, the second generation boss of the Kamizu Group was upholding yakuza chivalry by keeping black-market and illegal items out of their open-air market. Taking advantage of the mess, Iwasa and his gang take hold of goods from the US military, black-market and controlled items in order to become the most powerful group in Enko area.', 'After World War II, their town was a pile of rubble. Gennosuke, the second generation boss of the Kamizu Group was upholding yakuza chivalry by keeping black-market and illegal items out of their open-air market. Taking advantage of the mess, Iwasa and his gang take hold of goods from the US military, black-market and controlled items in order to become the most powerful group in Enko area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/he8vP6BjE74YxybsoBO8bmpWe8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189999'),
  ('271909701444703633', 'Brutality in Stone', 1961, 'War, Documentary, History', 'Peter Schamoni, Alexander Kluge, Wolf Wirth', 'Alexander Kluge, Peter Schamoni', 'Hans Clarin, Christian Marschall', null, 'In his experimental short film "Brutalität in Stein" (Brutality in Stone), Alexander Kluge demonstrates how Nazi architecture used dimensions of inhuman and super-human scale to bolster the regime''s politics of the same kind. Shots of huge neo-classical architectural structures from the Nazi period are confronted with equally anti-human national-socialist language as a voice-over.', 'In his experimental short film "Brutalität in Stein" (Brutality in Stone), Alexander Kluge demonstrates how Nazi architecture used dimensions of inhuman and super-human scale to bolster the regime''s politics of the same kind. Shots of huge neo-classical architectural structures from the Nazi period are confronted with equally anti-human national-socialist language as a voice-over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q0uer80Pg9BTgl1pPd2bsC4MOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117975'),
  ('490000786391642743', 'Brute', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Marian Prokop, Maciej Dejczer, Artur Reinhart', 'Cezary Harasimowicz', 'Til Schweiger, Polly Walker, Ida Jabłońska, Bartek Pieniazek, Wojciech Brzezinski, Pete Postlethwaite, John Hurt, Anna Przybylska', null, 'Shipped off to a Romanian orphanage to finish his sentence, a British criminal finds romance but also discovers corruption inside the facility.', 'Shipped off to a Romanian orphanage to finish his sentence, a British criminal finds romance but also discovers corruption inside the facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmVlWfwl8ajQNvoBlL3zQM5l3nG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471'),
  ('840743302114422324', 'Brute 1976', 2024, 'Horror', 'Marcel Walz, Marcus Friedlander', 'Joe Knetter', 'Adriane McLean, Sarah French, Gigi Gustin, Dazelle Yvette, Adam Bucci, Mark Justice, Jed Rowen, Ben Kaplan', null, 'In 1976 a group of people in the desert for a photo shoot, stumble upon an abandoned town called Savage. But they are not alone. A family of masked psychopaths have claimed Savage as their own and are hell bent on living up to its name.', 'In 1976 a group of people in the desert for a photo shoot, stumble upon an abandoned town called Savage. But they are not alone. A family of masked psychopaths have claimed Savage as their own and are hell bent on living up to its name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrbYuJNMRPzdQ5RZ2FGKfQbD1Qz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221415'),
  ('243539702457840639', 'Brute Corps', 1971, 'Drama, Action', 'Jerry Jameson, Michael D. Margulies', 'Michael Kars, Abe Polsky', 'Paul Carr, Joseph Kaufmann, Jennifer Billingsley, Alex Rocco, Michael Pataki, Charles Macaulay, Roy Jenson, Felton Perry', 'R', 'A hippy couple travelling cross country run foul of a band of mercenaries.', 'A hippy couple travelling cross country run foul of a band of mercenaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s05V0eI0wBEJpB8AOtHyoOdn3CD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102178'),
  ('198591291700800756', 'Brute Force', 1947, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jules Dassin, William H. Daniels, Fred Frank', 'Richard Brooks', 'Burt Lancaster, Hume Cronyn, Charles Bickford, Yvonne De Carlo, Ann Blyth, Ella Raines, Anita Colby, Sam Levene', null, 'Timeworn Joe Collins and his fellow inmates live under the heavy thumb of the sadistic, power-tripping guard Captain Munsey. Only Collins'' dreams of escape keep him going, but how can he possibly bust out of Munsey''s chains?', 'Timeworn Joe Collins and his fellow inmates live under the heavy thumb of the sadistic, power-tripping guard Captain Munsey. Only Collins'' dreams of escape keep him going, but how can he possibly bust out of Munsey''s chains?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwiHQE9MQSI915fD5aBxkKDQy2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28297'),
