  ('609997549916805267', 'Brutus vs Cesar', 2020, 'Comedy, Adventure, History', 'Kheiron', 'Kheiron', 'Kheiron, Thierry Lhermitte, Gérard Darmon, Ramzy Bedia, Pierre Richard, Reem Kherici, Artus, Issa Doumbia', null, 'Faced with the tyranny of Caesar who acts as absolute master over Rome, Senators Rufus and Cassius form a plot to assassinate him.', 'Faced with the tyranny of Caesar who acts as absolute master over Rome, Senators Rufus and Cassius form a plot to assassinate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHKuTWTNtgFzu2AZtagj9kmJcnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613370'),
  ('75000923985217550', 'BTS THE COMEBACK LIVE | ARIRANG', 2026, 'Music', 'Hamish Hamilton, Cameron Whitelaw', 'Hamish Hamilton', 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'BTS is back. The iconic group returns to the stage for a live reunion concert to perform legendary hits and unveil brand-new tracks.', 'BTS is back. The iconic group returns to the stage for a live reunion concert to perform legendary hits and unveil brand-new tracks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tztql23n2UCoM76KyCSKoZxVUL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1628123'),
  ('61652482497250299', 'BTS World Tour: Love Yourself in Seoul', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', 'Son Sung-deuk', null, 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'Shot at the Olympic Stadium in Seoul during the BTS World Tour ‘Love Yourself’ to celebrate the seven members of the global boyband and their unprecedented international phenomenon.', 'Shot at the Olympic Stadium in Seoul during the BTS World Tour ‘Love Yourself’ to celebrate the seven members of the global boyband and their unprecedented international phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1u0rtWPgYfAWmqveXOsQDvMRODD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568300'),
  ('163104345180116518', 'BTS: Permission to Dance on Stage - LA', 2022, 'Music, Documentary', 'Park Jun-soo, Sam Wrench, Brett Turnbull', 'Tori Rose', 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'Purple colors the city of Los Angeles, as BTS brings their "Permission to Dance" concert to SoFi Stadium for the first time in two years. In a stadium radiating anticipation and cheer, splendid performances from "On" to "Permission to Dance" glorify the stage that now comes to life on screen. Be united once again by the power of music.', 'Purple colors the city of Los Angeles, as BTS brings their "Permission to Dance" concert to SoFi Stadium for the first time in two years. In a stadium radiating anticipation and cheer, splendid performances from "On" to "Permission to Dance" glorify the stage that now comes to life on screen. Be united once again by the power of music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pNGRpOOQpZtqMLncEcQDv86OkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022102'),
  ('590656593421544995', 'BTS: THE RETURN', 2026, 'Documentary, Music', 'Bao Nguyen', null, 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'They''re back! BTS gathers in LA to record their album "Arirang" in this documentary offering unprecedented access to the band as they enter a new era.', 'They''re back! BTS gathers in LA to record their album "Arirang" in this documentary offering unprecedented access to the band as they enter a new era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CNUWleZWN9EGMZjvaSTcxmAAGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1628116'),
  ('106959880047201901', 'BTS: Yet to Come in Cinemas', 2023, 'Music, Documentary', 'Oh Yoon-dong', null, 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', 'NR', 'Join RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V and Jung Kook in this special cinematic cut, re-edited and remixed for the big screen. Watch new close-up angles and a whole new view of the entire concert, BTS Yet To Come in Busan. Featuring hit songs from across the group''s career, including "Dynamite," "Butter" and “IDOL," plus the first concert performance of "Run BTS" from the group’s latest album Proof.', 'Join RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V and Jung Kook in this special cinematic cut, re-edited and remixed for the big screen. Watch new close-up angles and a whole new view of the entire concert, BTS Yet To Come in Busan. Featuring hit songs from across the group''s career, including "Dynamite," "Butter" and “IDOL," plus the first concert performance of "Run BTS" from the group’s latest album Proof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWb45OsBHSO2t1j068bqDsPOGG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063453'),
  ('1142541373213825368', 'Bu İşte Bir Yalnızlık Var', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ketche', null, 'Özgü Namal, Engin Altan Düzyatan, Emin Gürsoy, Gaye Gürsel, Ümit Erdim, Devrim Özder Akın, Merve Ateş, Müge Boz', null, 'A retired guitarist avoids suffering his mid-life crisis by spending time with her daughter and teaching kids how to play the guitar. Yet it''s only until he makes a new girlfriend that he finally comes up with a solution to his crisis.', 'A retired guitarist avoids suffering his mid-life crisis by spending time with her daughter and teaching kids how to play the guitar. Yet it''s only until he makes a new girlfriend that he finally comes up with a solution to his crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rL7fm3A3m43piaGrQk4RYvMQqEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269596'),
  ('710118168797538309', 'Bu Son Olsun', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Orçun Benli', 'Şükrü Üçpınar, Orçun Benli', 'Engin Altan Düzyatan, Mustafa Uzunyılmaz, Ferit Kaya, Orhan Eşkin, Hazal Kaya, Volga Sorgu, Ufuk Bayraktar, Deniz Uğur', null, 'Yaşar, Apo, Kovboy Ali, Cevat, and Ertuğrul''s only goal in life is to fill their stomachs and never be separated from their greatest passion, wine, even for a single day. These five people, who live day to day, know how to take advantage of the stormy political atmosphere of the time to achieve their goals. These five homeless individuals living on the streets find themselves facing a curfew on the morning of September 12, 1980. However, the only "home" they can go to is the streets themselves. As a result of a series of comedic misunderstandings, they find themselves imprisoned alongside political prisoners in the same jail.', 'Yaşar, Apo, Kovboy Ali, Cevat, and Ertuğrul''s only goal in life is to fill their stomachs and never be separated from their greatest passion, wine, even for a single day. These five people, who live day to day, know how to take advantage of the stormy political atmosphere of the time to achieve their goals. These five homeless individuals living on the streets find themselves facing a curfew on the morning of September 12, 1980. However, the only "home" they can go to is the streets themselves. As a result of a series of comedic misunderstandings, they find themselves imprisoned alongside political prisoners in the same jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AtxwJPxJuuJQUgavceVXFIkPMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112084'),
  ('472843362029346673', 'BU・SU', 1987, 'Drama', 'Jun Ichikawa, Tatsuhiko Kobayashi', 'Makiko Uchidate', 'Yasuko Tomita, Mitsuko Oka, Michiyo Yasuda, Kazue Itō, Masahiro Takashima, Issey Ogata, Yasuyo Shirashima, Shigeru Muroi', null, 'Mugiko, an 18-year-old attempts to escape her unhappiness with village life by going to Tokyo to live and work in the geisha house run by her aunt. The daughter of a once great geisha, Mugiko is entitled by blood to train in the geishas ancient art of classical Japanese song and dance.', 'Mugiko, an 18-year-old attempts to escape her unhappiness with village life by going to Tokyo to live and work in the geisha house run by her aunt. The daughter of a once great geisha, Mugiko is entitled by blood to train in the geishas ancient art of classical Japanese song and dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfIoo9GIbhgHpmF7B2UpQLh0jIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204529'),
  ('110744468594921651', 'Buba', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arne Feldhusen, Yoshi Heimrath', 'Sebastian Colley, Isaiah Michalski', 'Bjarne Mädel, Georg Friedrich, Anita Vulesica, Maren Kroymann, Soma Pysall, Michael Schertenleib, Jasmin Shakeri, Michael Ostrowski', 'R', 'When a small-town con artist joins the local mafia with his manipulative brother, his obsession with balancing his karma gets hilariously brutal.', 'When a small-town con artist joins the local mafia with his manipulative brother, his obsession with balancing his karma gets hilariously brutal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOznYqIAxPT1JnHy3Qy0M9HhdxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997703'),
  ('174808063227113062', 'Bubba Ho-tep', 2002, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Adam Janeiro, Don Coscarelli, Robin Burrell', 'Don Coscarelli', 'Bruce Campbell, Ossie Davis, Ella Joyce, Heidi Marnhout, Bob Ivy, Edith Jefferson, Larry Pennell, Reggie Bannister', 'R', 'The "true" story of what really became of Elvis Presley. We find Elvis as an elderly resident in an East Texas rest home, who switched identities with an Elvis impersonator years before his "death," then missed his chance to switch back. He must team up with JFK and fight an ancient Egyptian mummy for the souls of their fellow residents.', 'The "true" story of what really became of Elvis Presley. We find Elvis as an elderly resident in an East Texas rest home, who switched identities with an Elvis impersonator years before his "death," then missed his chance to switch back. He must team up with JFK and fight an ancient Egyptian mummy for the souls of their fellow residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKQBit5ZV7GEOTiMBSYC6xBn86K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9707'),
  ('91991873177105289', 'Bubble', 2006, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Trey Batchelor', 'Coleman Hough', 'Debbie Doebereiner, Omar Cowan, Dustin James Ashley, Phyllis Workman, Laurie L. Wee, Daniel R. Christian, Misty Wilkins, Madison Wilkins', 'R', 'Set against the backdrop of a decaying Midwestern town, a murder becomes the focal point of three people who work in a doll factory.', 'Set against the backdrop of a decaying Midwestern town, a murder becomes the focal point of three people who work in a doll factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w56oo9nREcF54sNXVYuE9QxZFjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14788'),
  ('432105303570834416', 'Bubble', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Kenji Takahashi, Kazuhiro Yamada, Takashi Katagiri', 'Renji Oki, Naoko Sato, Gen Urobuchi', 'Jun Shison, Riria., Alice Hirose, Mamoru Miyano, Yuki Kaji, Tasuku Hatanaka, Sayaka Senbongi, Ryota Osaka', 'PG', 'In an abandoned Tokyo overrun by bubbles and gravitational abnormalities, one gifted young man has a fateful meeting with a mysterious girl.', 'In an abandoned Tokyo overrun by bubbles and gravitational abnormalities, one gifted young man has a fateful meeting with a mysterious girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjgwIZyEgtgy9nIdz6C5uJNel2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912598'),
  ('1143543608809084244', 'Bubble Bath', 1980, 'Animation, Music, Comedy, Drama', 'György Kovásznai, Sándor Juhász, Árpád Lossonczy', 'György Kovásznai', 'Albert Antalffy, Katalin Bontovics, Katalin Dobos, Anna Papp, Kornél Gelley, Venczel Vera, Lenke Lorán, Arany Szögi', null, 'Zsolt Mohai, an eccentric shop window decorator in his 40s, drops by Anna Parádi on his wedding day, asking her to phone his bride Klára Horváth and call off the event. Drama, discussions and musical numbers ensue over topics like romance, loyalty, ambition, and settling for a family life in a modern day city.', 'Zsolt Mohai, an eccentric shop window decorator in his 40s, drops by Anna Parádi on his wedding day, asking her to phone his bride Klára Horváth and call off the event. Drama, discussions and musical numbers ensue over topics like romance, loyalty, ambition, and settling for a family life in a modern day city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg4hmHIRbhYlhj1fYS8652ZBVP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250906'),
  ('324899166945683050', 'Bubble Bee', 1949, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto is playing with a ball in the park when he mistakes a bubble gum machine for it. He tries briefly to get a gumball from the machine when a bee flies into the machine and carries a gumball off to his hive. Pluto goes after the hive and knocks it down; it''s full of gumballs, which he eagerly scoops up and begins chewing. The bee returns and is understandably upset; he tracks down Pluto, but Pluto manages to defend himself with gum bubbles for quite a while. The bee manages to wrap the gum from one bubble around Pluto''s legs, hobbling him. Finally, the bee flies into Pluto''s mouth; Pluto blows a giant bubble around the bee, and when it explodes, they both fly into the air and land in a flower patch; the bee finally manages to sting Pluto (and, being a cartoon bee, lives through it).', 'Pluto is playing with a ball in the park when he mistakes a bubble gum machine for it. He tries briefly to get a gumball from the machine when a bee flies into the machine and carries a gumball off to his hive. Pluto goes after the hive and knocks it down; it''s full of gumballs, which he eagerly scoops up and begins chewing. The bee returns and is understandably upset; he tracks down Pluto, but Pluto manages to defend himself with gum bubbles for quite a while. The bee manages to wrap the gum from one bubble around Pluto''s legs, hobbling him. Finally, the bee flies into Pluto''s mouth; Pluto blows a giant bubble around the bee, and when it explodes, they both fly into the air and land in a flower patch; the bee finally manages to sting Pluto (and, being a cartoon bee, lives through it).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp3lnM4fGdu3ZiUZH9JPBusQnxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70002'),
  ('676890960787795459', 'Bubble Boy', 2001, 'Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'Blair Hayes, Jerzy Zieliński, Michael Amundson', 'Cinco Paul, Ken Daurio', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Swoosie Kurtz, Marley Shelton, Danny Trejo, John Carroll Lynch, Verne Troyer, Dave Sheridan, Brian George', 'PG-13', 'Jimmy is a young man who was born without an immune system and has lived his life within a plastic bubble in his bedroom... who pines for the sweet caresses of girl-next-door Chloe. But when Chloe decides to marry her high school boyfriend, Jimmy – bubble suit and all – treks cross-country to stop her.', 'Jimmy is a young man who was born without an immune system and has lived his life within a plastic bubble in his bedroom... who pines for the sweet caresses of girl-next-door Chloe. But when Chloe decides to marry her high school boyfriend, Jimmy – bubble suit and all – treks cross-country to stop her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFwvUSc8g0HHvDOBQ2rvC9LWVSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9683'),
  ('150428633155630984', 'Bubu', 1971, 'Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Mauro Bolognini, Giovanni Testori, Mario Di Nardo', 'Massimo Ranieri, Ottavia Piccolo, Antonio Falsi, Gigi Proietti, Anna Fadda, Gianna Serra, Niké Arrighi', null, 'Bubu leaves his job in a bakery, forces his girl-friend into prostitution, and from then on lives out of the money she makes. The young couple find their place in the world of prostitutes and pimps, but the lack of perspective in their life - which is permanently haunted by the possibility of an incurable and fatal venereal infection - and the humiliations the girl endures strain their relationship and lead to conflicts.', 'Bubu leaves his job in a bakery, forces his girl-friend into prostitution, and from then on lives out of the money she makes. The young couple find their place in the world of prostitutes and pimps, but the lack of perspective in their life - which is permanently haunted by the possibility of an incurable and fatal venereal infection - and the humiliations the girl endures strain their relationship and lead to conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqVp6B7VYHxdGssqU8EhJHJeBie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122750'),
  ('604172172679912437', 'Buccaneer Bunny', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Yosemite Sam as a pirate makes the mistake of trying to bury his treasure chest in Bugs'' hole, and pays with the loss of his ship.', 'Yosemite Sam as a pirate makes the mistake of trying to bury his treasure chest in Bugs'' hole, and pays with the loss of his ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXkUTTcRjWyqvvXTuqwxCaBUbQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83747'),
