  ('829924196591587374', 'Bucharest Identity Card', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Virgil Calotescu', 'Francisc Munteanu', 'Mircea Diaconu, Catrinel Dumitrescu, Ștefan Mihăilescu-Brăila, Octavian Cotescu, Draga Olteanu Matei, Diana Lupescu, Geo Saizescu, Constantin Diplan', null, 'A provincial young girl, a farming engineer, does not want to return to the countryside on graduating, but stay in the capital. But she needs a Bucharest identity card to do this. Her solution is to "buy" a husband...', 'A provincial young girl, a farming engineer, does not want to return to the countryside on graduating, but stay in the capital. But she needs a Bucharest identity card to do this. Her solution is to "buy" a husband...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSDWfQjFz3u0m5wBwiAmN9XcBo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42281'),
