  ('715731451390579158', 'Bud Abbott and Lou Costello Meet the Killer, Boris Karloff', 1949, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Charles Barton, Charles Van Enger, Milton Schwarzwald', 'Oscar Brodney', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Boris Karloff, Lenore Aubert, Gar Moore, Donna Martell, Alan Mowbray, James Flavin', null, 'Lost Caverns Hotel bellhop Freddie Phillips is suspected of murder. Swami Talpur tries to hypnotize Freddie into confessing, but Freddie is too stupid for the plot to work. Inspector Wellman uses Freddie to get the killer (and it isn''t the Swami).', 'Lost Caverns Hotel bellhop Freddie Phillips is suspected of murder. Swami Talpur tries to hypnotize Freddie into confessing, but Freddie is too stupid for the plot to work. Inspector Wellman uses Freddie to get the killer (and it isn''t the Swami).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9hf4Yyfltjj1V4OYF8sB0CHU7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33477'),
