  ('1042247473618807940', 'Budapeste', 2009, 'Drama', 'Walter Carvalho, Lula Carvalho', 'Rita Buzzar', 'Leonardo Medeiros, Gabriella Hámori, Giovanna Antonelli, Paolla Oliveira, Débora Nascimento, Ivo Canelas, Antonie Kamerling, Nicolau Breyner', null, 'José Costa is a Brazilian ghost writer. Returning from a ghost writers convention his airplane is rerouted to Budapest. His life is also rerouted when he meets Krista and with her help, learns "the only language in the world which, according to the tongue-wagers, the devil respects.', 'José Costa is a Brazilian ghost writer. Returning from a ghost writers convention his airplane is rerouted to Budapest. His life is also rerouted when he meets Krista and with her help, learns "the only language in the world which, according to the tongue-wagers, the devil respects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZLulrPvexxbM101r0UkcenahnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34071'),
  ('1097344628291234734', 'Buddenbrooks', 2008, 'Drama, History', 'Heinrich Breloer, Gernot Roll', 'Horst Königstein, Heinrich Breloer', 'Armin Mueller-Stahl, Jessica Schwarz, August Diehl, Mark Waschke, Iris Berben, Léa Bosco, Raban Bieling, Justus von Dohnányi', null, 'Mid-19th-century, Baltic Sea port city of Lubeck, Germany. Follows the fourth generation of the Buddenbrook mercantile family as Tony and Thomas reach the age of marriage. Fatefully impeded every step of the way, the Buddenbrooks struggle as economic hardship and personal defeats weigh down family relations.', 'Mid-19th-century, Baltic Sea port city of Lubeck, Germany. Follows the fourth generation of the Buddenbrook mercantile family as Tony and Thomas reach the age of marriage. Fatefully impeded every step of the way, the Buddenbrooks struggle as economic hardship and personal defeats weigh down family relations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1boBJGtCZ4wH82sz5LBYgmo3tnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2333'),
  ('778081680487129641', 'Buddha 2: The Endless Journey', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Toshiaki Komura', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Sayuri Yoshinaga, Kenichi Matsuyama, Yoko Maki, 観世清和, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Shin''ya Ohwada, Tetsuo, Hiromasa Taguchi', null, '2500 years ago, in India, Siddhartha was born as a prince of the Shakya clan, but he gives up his position as a prince to see the world. He meets a strange boy named Assaji, who can predict the future, a monk with only one eye and Depa. Siddhartha continues traveling. Siddhartha is overwhelmed by the sufferings he witnesses around him. Meanwhile, Prince Ruri of Kosara begins his attack on the Shakya clan. Second Buddha movie from Tezuka Productions.', '2500 years ago, in India, Siddhartha was born as a prince of the Shakya clan, but he gives up his position as a prince to see the world. He meets a strange boy named Assaji, who can predict the future, a monk with only one eye and Depa. Siddhartha continues traveling. Siddhartha is overwhelmed by the sufferings he witnesses around him. Meanwhile, Prince Ruri of Kosara begins his attack on the Shakya clan. Second Buddha movie from Tezuka Productions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gG6c8TA6VsH5iDqAey8YNcwhQPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239526'),
  ('484038368917969151', 'Buddha Collapsed Out of Shame', 2007, 'Drama, War', 'Hana Makhmalbaf', 'Marzieh Makmalbaf', 'Habbas Alijome, Abdolali Huseinali, Nikbakht Noruz', null, 'A young girl zealously wants to go to school and learn to read and write. Almost everywhere she is met with hostility or indifference. The only young boy who takes her to his school is thrown out by the teacher, because helping her prevented him from arriving in time. On her way home she and other girls are taken as prisoners by boys playing as Taliban fighters. They tear her school book to pieces and threaten to stone their female captives.', 'A young girl zealously wants to go to school and learn to read and write. Almost everywhere she is met with hostility or indifference. The only young boy who takes her to his school is thrown out by the teacher, because helping her prevented him from arriving in time. On her way home she and other girls are taken as prisoners by boys playing as Taliban fighters. They tear her school book to pieces and threaten to stone their female captives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFXFC2Sh7yalggvA4jVXVv2Uewe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61820'),
  ('258767132902279949', 'Buddha in a Traffic Jam', 2016, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Vivek Agnihotri', 'Vivek Agnihotri', 'Anupam Kher, Arunoday Singh, Mahie Gill, Pallavi Joshi, Gopal Singh, Aanchal Dwivedi', null, 'Vikram is a happy-go-lucky management student from a top Business School of India. He becomes an overnight sensation after a successful internet campaign against the radical fundamentalism of moral policing in India. This prompts his university teacher - Professor Ranjan Batki, to throw him a challenge for yet another internet campaign that would help raise money via a non-profit Pottery Club for poor people living in Maoists areas of India. Little does Vikram know that he is about to become a part of a plot that would risk his life and the nation. He gets entangled between two corrupt facets of India - Socialism and Capitalism, both of which are deeply rooted in India. It''s a story inspired from true life incidents of Underbelly India.', 'Vikram is a happy-go-lucky management student from a top Business School of India. He becomes an overnight sensation after a successful internet campaign against the radical fundamentalism of moral policing in India. This prompts his university teacher - Professor Ranjan Batki, to throw him a challenge for yet another internet campaign that would help raise money via a non-profit Pottery Club for poor people living in Maoists areas of India. Little does Vikram know that he is about to become a part of a plot that would risk his life and the nation. He gets entangled between two corrupt facets of India - Socialism and Capitalism, both of which are deeply rooted in India. It''s a story inspired from true life incidents of Underbelly India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAia8POGJHaSLL9RCdo99ZNClKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394034'),
  ('1060142146355006452', 'Buddha Mountain', 2011, 'Drama', 'Li Yu, Zeng Jian, Tu Duu-chih', 'Li Yu, Fang Li', 'Sylvia Chang, Fan Bingbing, Chen Bolin, Fei Long, Jin Jing, Fang Li, Liu Jie, Bao Zhenjiang', null, 'In Chengdu, China, a retired female opera singer named Master Chang takes in a trio of young tenants into her boarding home. The tenants include a rock singer and a college student who has run away from home.', 'In Chengdu, China, a retired female opera singer named Master Chang takes in a trio of young tenants into her boarding home. The tenants include a rock singer and a college student who has run away from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2CcakhYdSTyZSHV8IcxjSeQEuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63064'),
  ('409982675991501395', 'Buddha: The Great Departure', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, History', 'Kouzou Morishita, Hideaki Maniwa, Kenji Takahashi', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Sayuri Yoshinaga, Masato Sakai, 観世清和, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Ai Orikasa, Junko Takeuchi, Tessyo Genda, Keiji Fujiwara', null, 'Prince Siddhartha is heir to the Shakya kingdom, which is constantly at war with the more powerful Kosala kingdom. His father tries to raise as him as a warrior leader and to shield him from the miseries of the world. Meeting the young outcast girl Migaila, Siddhartha experiences love for the first time but also witnesses the suffering that afflicts humankind. Meanwhile, in Kosala, Chapra rises through the military, despite his lowly origins, to become a hero and general of the army. A final showdown between the two kingdoms forces Siddhartha to re-evaluate the path he is following.', 'Prince Siddhartha is heir to the Shakya kingdom, which is constantly at war with the more powerful Kosala kingdom. His father tries to raise as him as a warrior leader and to shield him from the miseries of the world. Meeting the young outcast girl Migaila, Siddhartha experiences love for the first time but also witnesses the suffering that afflicts humankind. Meanwhile, in Kosala, Chapra rises through the military, despite his lowly origins, to become a hero and general of the army. A final showdown between the two kingdoms forces Siddhartha to re-evaluate the path he is following.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hPrb9XuZSwmY6MVtWjUvczPQtG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115969'),
  ('1076895531298306984', 'Buddha''s Palm', 1982, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Taylor Wong Tai-Loi, Wong Chit, Poon Man-Kit', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Szeto On, Taylor Wong Tai-Loi', 'Derek Yee, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Candice Yu On-On, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Lo Lieh, Sek Kin, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Ching Miao', null, 'An old blind martial master living in a cave teaches a young swordsman the secret of the Buddha''s Palm, a legendary martial arts technique, which propels him into a whole new world of evil knights, hidden temples, dragon dogs, and magical objects.', 'An old blind martial master living in a cave teaches a young swordsman the secret of the Buddha''s Palm, a legendary martial arts technique, which propels him into a whole new world of evil knights, hidden temples, dragon dogs, and magical objects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSyr5qCcmrMIsoxBgfSETTwgQoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20188'),
  ('149411689453463862', 'Buddies', 1985, 'Drama', 'Arthur J. Bressan, Jr., Carl Teitelbaum', 'Arthur J. Bressan, Jr.', 'Geoff Edholm, David Schachter, Libby Saines, David Rose, Billy Lux, Joyce Korn, Susan Schneider, Tracy Vivat', 'NR', 'David, a naive graduate student, has volunteered to work as a ''buddy'' for people dying of AIDS. Assigned to the intensely political Robert, a lifelong activist whose friends and family have abandoned him following his diagnosis, the two men, each with notably different world views, soon discover common bonds, as David''s inner activist awakens and Robert''s need for emotional release is fulfilled.', 'David, a naive graduate student, has volunteered to work as a ''buddy'' for people dying of AIDS. Assigned to the intensely political Robert, a lifelong activist whose friends and family have abandoned him following his diagnosis, the two men, each with notably different world views, soon discover common bonds, as David''s inner activist awakens and Robert''s need for emotional release is fulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk0bhsQumoeCfsFK08pufMYkIKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259433'),
  ('586504677810298442', 'Buddies', 1989, 'Drama', 'Yasuo Furuhata, Daisaku Kimura', 'Tsutomu Nakamura', 'Ken Takakura, Sumiko Fuji, Eiji Bandō, Yasuko Tomita, Nobuko Miyamoto, Claude Maki, Norihei Miki, Koichi Ueda', null, 'Based on a celebrated book by Kuniko Mukoda, this film directed by Yasuo Furuhata tells of a close friendship undone by love.', 'Based on a celebrated book by Kuniko Mukoda, this film directed by Yasuo Furuhata tells of a close friendship undone by love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tx0k9Woz42GDR1qu3C5wWa9KSPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131870'),
  ('902329206816402914', 'Buddies', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, Adventure', 'Marcelo Galvão', 'Marcelo Galvão', 'Ariel Goldenberg, Breno Viola, Rita Pokk, Lima Duarte, Rui Unas, Leonardo Miggiorin, Marco Luque, Juliana Didone', null, 'A road movie that shows the simple things in life in a poetic light through the eyes of three young people with Down syndrome, who love movies and work at the video library of the institution where they have always lived in. One day, inspired by the movie "Thelma & Louise", they decide to run away using the gardener''s old car to have a freedom experience. They travel to uncommon places in search for three simple wishes: Stalone wants to see the sea, Aninha looks for a husband and Marcio needs to fly. During this search, they embark on several adventures as if life was just a children''s play', 'A road movie that shows the simple things in life in a poetic light through the eyes of three young people with Down syndrome, who love movies and work at the video library of the institution where they have always lived in. One day, inspired by the movie "Thelma & Louise", they decide to run away using the gardener''s old car to have a freedom experience. They travel to uncommon places in search for three simple wishes: Stalone wants to see the sea, Aninha looks for a husband and Marcio needs to fly. During this search, they embark on several adventures as if life was just a children''s play', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXpDufZOS9Ut3wxXOYGotwpsHzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167983'),
  ('353262635244419835', 'Buddies and the Heir', 2026, 'Family', 'Marcelo Galvão, Taty Behar', 'Marcelo Galvão', 'Ariel Goldenberg, João Vitor de Paiva, Rita Pokk, Breno Viola, Zenor Ribas', null, 'When the owner of a hotel in Uruguay dies, Stallone (a man with Down syndrome) decides that he is the rightful heir, ignoring Thin (an autistic), the deceased''s adopted son. Stallone gathers friends from his former boarding school and together they set off on a perilous journey on a cargo plane. Suddenly, their paths cross with smugglers hunting for jewels.', 'When the owner of a hotel in Uruguay dies, Stallone (a man with Down syndrome) decides that he is the rightful heir, ignoring Thin (an autistic), the deceased''s adopted son. Stallone gathers friends from his former boarding school and together they set off on a perilous journey on a cargo plane. Suddenly, their paths cross with smugglers hunting for jewels.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmXLAj3Oy6Dt1ADbuDx7C8xdzblf.jpg', 'plex:movie:buddies-and-the-heir'),
  ('230722048863753391', 'Buddies In India', 2017, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Wang Baoqiang', null, 'Wang Baoqiang, Liu Yan, White-K, Yue Yunpeng, Vikramjeet Virk, Liu Haoran, Shruti Sodhi, Zhang Jinlai', 'NR', 'Following his father’s deathbed confession about the location of his last will and testament, Tang Sen (Bai Ke) packs up and heads to India with his friend Wu Kong (Wang Baoqiang) in search of it. Along the way, the merry duo becomes a motley crew, enlisting a loyal but quirky fighter (Yue Yunpeng) and a cagey but beautiful woman (Liu Yan), all while experiencing the mysteries of a magical land that both helps and hinders them in their quest.', 'Following his father’s deathbed confession about the location of his last will and testament, Tang Sen (Bai Ke) packs up and heads to India with his friend Wu Kong (Wang Baoqiang) in search of it. Along the way, the merry duo becomes a motley crew, enlisting a loyal but quirky fighter (Yue Yunpeng) and a cagey but beautiful woman (Liu Yan), all while experiencing the mysteries of a magical land that both helps and hinders them in their quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBGCousbcT89AAiPZOO68sSIS2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435863'),
  ('942425290204696490', 'Buddies Thicker Than Water', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gene Deitch', null, null, null, 'On a snowy night in the city, Jerry is comfortably asleep in his hole inside a penthouse, while Tom tries to keep from freezing to death in the alley below.', 'On a snowy night in the city, Jerry is comfortably asleep in his hole inside a penthouse, while Tom tries to keep from freezing to death in the alley below.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frbfLks1JQeZUA88rLEF8iDmxMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223029'),
  ('179834246240145656', 'Buddy', 1997, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Caroline Thompson, Steve Mason', 'Caroline Thompson, William Joyce', 'Rene Russo, Robbie Coltrane, Alan Cumming, Irma P. Hall, Paul Reubens, John Aylward, Mimi Kennedy, Philip Baker Hall', 'PG', 'An eccentric socialite raises a gorilla as her son.', 'An eccentric socialite raises a gorilla as her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88l3mMtQcHE5JW8gJmQJm9fmpAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15170'),
  ('384956050542017328', 'Buddy', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Morten Tyldum, John Andreas Andersen', 'Lars Gudmestad', 'Nicolai Cleve Broch, Aksel Hennie, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Pia Tjelta, Janne Formoe, Henrik Giæver, Kim Haugen, Håvard Bakke', null, 'Kristoffer lives in Oslo with his friends Geir and Stig Inge. He works as a billboard installer, and in his spare time he makes a video diary with Geir and Stig, containing stunts of a Jackass-nature. When Kristoffer''s girlfriend, Elisabeth, leaves him, his life seems to fall to pieces. Until his videos are featured on Norway''s most popular talk show and Kristoffer becomes famous.', 'Kristoffer lives in Oslo with his friends Geir and Stig Inge. He works as a billboard installer, and in his spare time he makes a video diary with Geir and Stig, containing stunts of a Jackass-nature. When Kristoffer''s girlfriend, Elisabeth, leaves him, his life seems to fall to pieces. Until his videos are featured on Norway''s most popular talk show and Kristoffer becomes famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W3M9AbhEsrZ6FigFSU3GR9WEEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15177'),
  ('14018324874416050', 'Buddy', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Michael Herbig, Torsten Breuer', 'Michael Herbig', 'Alexander Fehling, Michael Herbig, Mina Tander, Daniel Zillmann, Piet Puddu, Christian Berkel, Peter Jordan, Horst Sachtleben', null, 'Inexperienced guardian angel, Buddy arrives to assist Eddie with getting his life back on track, but instead only causes more chaos.', 'Inexperienced guardian angel, Buddy arrives to assist Eddie with getting his life back on track, but instead only causes more chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWGfl0DHyUvCdXLdQmC3n5bZsPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246894'),
