  ('291971664884987966', 'Buddy Buddy', 1981, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Billy Wilder, Deborah A. Dell''Amico, Gary Daigler', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Jack Lemmon, Walter Matthau, Paula Prentiss, Klaus Kinski, Dana Elcar, Miles Chapin, Michael Ensign, Joan Shawlee', 'R', 'During a high-profile Mafia testimony case in Riverside County, a hired killer checks into a hotel room near the courthouse, while his depressed neighbor contemplates suicide over marital problems.', 'During a high-profile Mafia testimony case in Riverside County, a hired killer checks into a hotel room near the courthouse, while his depressed neighbor contemplates suicide over marital problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oZcpghGYhLgw60JbJU3btDCHMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36133'),
  ('40624785998733385', 'Buddy Games', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Seth Yanklewitz, Luke Bryant, Josh Duhamel', 'Josh Duhamel, Jude Weng, Bob Schwartz', 'Josh Duhamel, Dan Bakkedahl, Nick Swardson, Dax Shepard, James Roday Rodriguez, Kevin Dillon, Olivia Munn, Linda Darlow', 'R', 'After six lifelong friends have a five-year falling out, “The Bobfather”, reunites his pals for the Buddy Games, an insane competition of absurd physical and mental challenges with the chance to win a $150,000 pot. Now all bets are off, as the determined dudes'' fight, claw, and party for the big bucks.', 'After six lifelong friends have a five-year falling out, “The Bobfather”, reunites his pals for the Buddy Games, an insane competition of absurd physical and mental challenges with the chance to win a $150,000 pot. Now all bets are off, as the determined dudes'' fight, claw, and party for the big bucks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNCZh6YGg6r0GMyrctI14R0lHGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472815'),
  ('7014923760776635', 'Buddy Games: Spring Awakening', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Adam McCarthy, Shawn Seifert, Josh Duhamel', 'Gabe McKinley, Rachael Thoele', 'Dan Bakkedahl, Kevin Dillon, Josh Duhamel, James Roday Rodriguez, Nick Swardson, Lochlyn Munro, Ginnifer Goodwin, Jensen Ackles', 'R', 'Faced with their biggest challenge yet, the gang sets out to honor a lost friend only to find themselves in the middle of where it all began – Spring Break – where they learn their old school ways of partying hardly compete with today''s generation.', 'Faced with their biggest challenge yet, the gang sets out to honor a lost friend only to find themselves in the middle of where it all began – Spring Break – where they learn their old school ways of partying hardly compete with today''s generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Xye26gsr6MHWRzqolqz7y2u93g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017507'),
  ('521443048768792291', 'Buddy Goes West', 1981, 'Action, Western, Comedy', 'Michele Lupo, Salvatore Basile, Ricky Sacco', 'Sergio Donati', 'Bud Spencer, Joe Bugner, Piero Trombetta, Carlo Reali, Sara Franchetti, Renato Scarpa, Riccardo Pizzuti, Andrea Heuer', 'PG', 'Trinity series star Bud Spencer returns to the Wild West in director Michele Lupo''s comic tale of an outlaw drifter, Buddy, who is mistaken for a doctor after his Indian companion inadvertently steals a bag of surgical instruments. When a band of murderous outlaws attempts to overrun the small town Buddy is passing through, the presumed medico shows that his true talent is cracking skulls. Music is composed by Ennio Morricone.', 'Trinity series star Bud Spencer returns to the Wild West in director Michele Lupo''s comic tale of an outlaw drifter, Buddy, who is mistaken for a doctor after his Indian companion inadvertently steals a bag of surgical instruments. When a band of murderous outlaws attempts to overrun the small town Buddy is passing through, the presumed medico shows that his true talent is cracking skulls. Music is composed by Ennio Morricone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fslVCyATK3Tzt7axYPRHQ9yCXhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46445'),
  ('347747921757808187', 'Buddy''s Beer Garden', 1933, 'Animation', 'Earl Duvall, Friz Freleng, Tom Palmer', null, 'Bernard B. Brown, Jeane Cowan, The Guardsmen', null, 'Buddy''s musical antics as a waiter at a German beer garden are truly delightful! Cookie appears as a cigarette girl and scarf-dancer, and a drag-decked lounge-singing Buddy brings down the house.', 'Buddy''s musical antics as a waiter at a German beer garden are truly delightful! Cookie appears as a cigarette girl and scarf-dancer, and a drag-decked lounge-singing Buddy brings down the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bS79HzDeSyGBVdhUefOQO0eL2Ol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161956'),
  ('554446603573284939', 'Buddy''s Day Out', 1933, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Tom Palmer', null, 'Bernard B. Brown, Jane Withers', null, 'This cartoon has some amusing sight gags like a car going back through a fence and crashing into various animals before landing in Cookie''s yard or a train that seems on its way into crashing into a car with Elmer and Happy inside when Buddy and Cookie use a ladder to derail the locomotive in another direction.', 'This cartoon has some amusing sight gags like a car going back through a fence and crashing into various animals before landing in Cookie''s yard or a train that seems on its way into crashing into a car with Elmer and Happy inside when Buddy and Cookie use a ladder to derail the locomotive in another direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBwz4c4AN8YwYjjryL5DPWR3U7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161945'),
  ('1103220954435517164', 'Buddy''s Mom', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kong Ja-kwan', 'Kong Ja-kwan', 'Kim Young-sam, Ah Ri, Kim Hae-jin, Park Cho-hyeon, Kim Jae-rok, Lee Jeong-gil, Kim Dae-beom', null, '20-year-old Kyeong-soo is a man who''s full of assumptions. He learned about sex from Internet porn, but nothing about the real thing. He''s only had crushes and has never even kissed before. He got embarrassed when he confessed his feelings to Ji-yeon, his crush. He comforted himself from the shame with Japanese girls in his room with his right hand. One day, he has a fight with his father and remembers his friend Baek-hyeon had invited him over to Gangwon-do. There he falls in love with his friends'' mother.', '20-year-old Kyeong-soo is a man who''s full of assumptions. He learned about sex from Internet porn, but nothing about the real thing. He''s only had crushes and has never even kissed before. He got embarrassed when he confessed his feelings to Ji-yeon, his crush. He comforted himself from the shame with Japanese girls in his room with his right hand. One day, he has a fight with his father and remembers his friend Baek-hyeon had invited him over to Gangwon-do. There he falls in love with his friends'' mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JDVEZN0v3e9xMzZbZ92fC7HaQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387848'),
  ('604682285224107371', 'Budhia Singh: Born to Run', 2016, 'Drama', 'Soumendra Padhi', 'Soumendra Padhi', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Mayur Mahendra Patole, Tillotama Shome, Gajraj Rao, Shruti Marathe', null, 'Budhia Singh – Born To Run is an Indian biographical sports film directed by Soumendra Padhi. It is based on Budhia Singh, who ran 48 marathons — one of which was from Bhubaneshwar to Puri, when he was a five-year-old.', 'Budhia Singh – Born To Run is an Indian biographical sports film directed by Soumendra Padhi. It is based on Budhia Singh, who ran 48 marathons — one of which was from Bhubaneshwar to Puri, when he was a five-year-old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kvr2gx6j3XjueQfkYsGPqvGSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403858'),
  ('874721183401875803', 'Buen Camino', 2025, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Gennaro Nunziante, Massimiliano Kuveiller, Michele Bonifazi', 'Checco Zalone, Gennaro Nunziante', 'Checco Zalone, Beatriz Arjona, Letizia Arnò, Martina Colombari, Hossein Taheri, Alfonso Santagata, Mariana Rodríguez, Cecilia Gragnani', null, 'Checco''s life is a comfortable and luxurious one, and it couldn''t be otherwise, considering he''s the only son of Eugenio Zalone, a wealthy sofa manufacturer. Stranded by the pool in his luxurious villas, with an unspecified number of Filipinos serving him, a very young Mexican model as a girlfriend, and vacationing on his yacht with friends who share his passion for not wanting to work; it seems like a truly enviable life, considering he lacks nothing, absolutely nothing. Actually, no. Something is missing. It''s his underage daughter, Cristal, named after the famous French sparkling wine, who has suddenly disappeared without a trace. Urgently summoned to Rome by his ex-wife, Linda, he finds himself facing the responsibilities of fatherhood for the first time, trying to find the girl—a very complicated task, considering he knows absolutely nothing about Cristal and her life.', 'Checco''s life is a comfortable and luxurious one, and it couldn''t be otherwise, considering he''s the only son of Eugenio Zalone, a wealthy sofa manufacturer. Stranded by the pool in his luxurious villas, with an unspecified number of Filipinos serving him, a very young Mexican model as a girlfriend, and vacationing on his yacht with friends who share his passion for not wanting to work; it seems like a truly enviable life, considering he lacks nothing, absolutely nothing. Actually, no. Something is missing. It''s his underage daughter, Cristal, named after the famous French sparkling wine, who has suddenly disappeared without a trace. Urgently summoned to Rome by his ex-wife, Linda, he finds himself facing the responsibilities of fatherhood for the first time, trying to find the girl—a very complicated task, considering he knows absolutely nothing about Cristal and her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Yn8kGIieRTQ3EgrN6DeXLeQxb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1472638'),
  ('207415303552491357', 'Buena Vista Social Club', 1999, 'Documentary, Music', 'Wim Wenders, Jörg Widmer, Robby Müller', 'Wim Wenders', 'Compay Segundo, Eliades Ochoa, Ry Cooder, Joachim Cooder, Ibrahim Ferrer, Omara Portuondo, Rubén González, Orlando ''Cachaíto'' López', 'G', 'In this fascinating Oscar-nominated documentary, American guitarist Ry Cooder brings together a group of legendary Cuban folk musicians (some in their 90s) to record a Grammy-winning CD in their native city of Havana. The result is a spectacular compilation of concert footage from the group''s gigs in Amsterdam and New York City''s famed Carnegie Hall, with director Wim Wenders capturing not only the music -- but also the musicians'' life stories.', 'In this fascinating Oscar-nominated documentary, American guitarist Ry Cooder brings together a group of legendary Cuban folk musicians (some in their 90s) to record a Grammy-winning CD in their native city of Havana. The result is a spectacular compilation of concert footage from the group''s gigs in Amsterdam and New York City''s famed Carnegie Hall, with director Wim Wenders capturing not only the music -- but also the musicians'' life stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b203Z3qwCRMLOY00XZh4qNQCwM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11779'),
  ('468613443547276397', 'Buenos Aires 100 km', 2005, 'Drama', 'Pablo José Meza', 'Pablo José Meza', 'Juan Ignacio Pérez Roca, Emiliano Fernández, Alan Ardel, Hernán Wainstein, Noemí Frenkel, Daniel Valenzuela, Sandra Ballesteros, Juan Pablo Bazzini', null, 'A remote village 100 kilometers from the city of Buenos Aires. Stephen, Matías, Alejo, Damián and Guido were born 13 years ago in this small town. They have always been friends and together they share the monotonous summer afternoons sitting on the stoop of a women''s hairdresser. Anxious, restless, impatient for a change, they go through the most confusing period of experiment -- the transition from childhood to adolescence.', 'A remote village 100 kilometers from the city of Buenos Aires. Stephen, Matías, Alejo, Damián and Guido were born 13 years ago in this small town. They have always been friends and together they share the monotonous summer afternoons sitting on the stoop of a women''s hairdresser. Anxious, restless, impatient for a change, they go through the most confusing period of experiment -- the transition from childhood to adolescence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMX0k5TzA19YuOXKqld5CD5Z1aC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71576'),
  ('309084978379610288', 'Buenos Aires viceversa', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alejandro Agresti, Ramiro Aisenson, Alejandro Puente', 'Alejandro Agresti', 'Vera Fogwill, Nicolás Pauls, Fernán Mirás, Mirta Busnelli, Carlos Roffé, Mario Paolucci, Laura Melillo, Harry Havilio', null, 'This is Buenos Aires, its characters, its history, its reality. A complex movie for a complex city, depicted in the character''s language, and in their relationship with the present and the past', 'This is Buenos Aires, its characters, its history, its reality. A complex movie for a complex city, depicted in the character''s language, and in their relationship with the present and the past', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HICXpf8TLDQLH9ycQTaBsKVANz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328341'),
  ('480204303167475939', 'Buenos Aires Zero Degree: The Making of ''Happy Together''', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Kwan Pung-Leung, Christopher Doyle, Amos Lee', null, 'Wong Kar-Wai, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Leslie Cheung, Chang Chen, Shirley Kwan Suk-Yi', null, 'A making of documentary for Happy Together. Includes interviews, on-set footage, cut scenes and footage of crew members revisiting the locations where Happy Together was filmed.', 'A making of documentary for Happy Together. Includes interviews, on-set footage, cut scenes and footage of crew members revisiting the locations where Happy Together was filmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrznU0Q83RmSaMO74ZWKaRYyETQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152954'),
  ('939024070260933361', 'Buenos días, condesita', 1967, 'Comedy, Music', 'Luis César Amadori, Alejandro Ulloa, Juan Ignacio Galván', 'Jesús María de Arozamena, Luis César Amadori', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Vicente Parra, Gracita Morales, Francisco Cano, Aurora Redondo, Ana María Custodio, Carlos Casaravilla, Antonio Riquelme', null, 'A young woman, who sells music recordings in the flea market in Madrid, passes herself off as a friend''s girlfriend so that he doesn''t lose his inheritance.', 'A young woman, who sells music recordings in the flea market in Madrid, passes herself off as a friend''s girlfriend so that he doesn''t lose his inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPDkWlaGqcNF6doJNbCUpHqJQMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252536'),
  ('169301710842679389', 'Buffalo ''66', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Vincent Gallo, Lance Acord, Adam Greenhaus', 'Vincent Gallo, Alison Bagnall', 'Vincent Gallo, Christina Ricci, Ben Gazzara, Anjelica Huston, Mickey Rourke, Rosanna Arquette, Jan-Michael Vincent, Kevin Corrigan', 'R', 'Billy is released after five years in prison. In the next moment, he kidnaps teenage student Layla and visits his parents with her, pretending she is his girlfriend and they will soon marry.', 'Billy is released after five years in prison. In the next moment, he kidnaps teenage student Layla and visits his parents with her, pretending she is his girlfriend and they will soon marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxzXFzbSGNA52NHQCMqQiwzMIQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9464'),
  ('563901158105762187', 'Buffalo Bill', 1944, 'Drama, Action, Western', 'William A. Wellman, Leon Shamroy', 'Æneas MacKenzie, Clements Ripley, Cecile Kramer', 'Joel McCrea, Maureen O''Hara, Linda Darnell, Thomas Mitchell, Edgar Buchanan, Anthony Quinn, Moroni Olsen, Frank Fenton', null, 'Scout William F. Cody marries a U.S. senator''s daughter, fights the Cheyenne and leads a Wild West show.', 'Scout William F. Cody marries a U.S. senator''s daughter, fights the Cheyenne and leads a Wild West show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z75hMKwY21djoRbpJ5ECWYib4Ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43499'),
  ('990238926857023933', 'Buffalo Bill and the Indians, or Sitting Bull''s History Lesson', 1976, 'Western, Comedy', 'Robert Altman, Paul Lohmann', 'Robert Altman, Alan Rudolph', 'Paul Newman, Joel Grey, Kevin McCarthy, Harvey Keitel, Allan F. Nicholls, Geraldine Chaplin, John Considine, Robert DoQui', 'PG', 'Buffalo Bill plans to put on his own Wild West sideshow, and Chief Sitting Bull has agreed to appear in it. However, Sitting Bull has his own hidden agenda, involving the President and General Custer.', 'Buffalo Bill plans to put on his own Wild West sideshow, and Chief Sitting Bull has agreed to appear in it. However, Sitting Bull has his own hidden agenda, involving the President and General Custer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyQZAJogUOECWM46v4N6wGDHd20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42233'),
  ('696071181258975406', 'Buffalo Boys', 2018, 'Drama, Action', 'Mike Wiluan, John Radel, Bunpote Hemsokana', 'Moira Lang, Rayya Makarim, Mike Wiluan', 'Yoshi Sudarso, Ario Bayu, Pevita Pearce, Tio Pakusadewo, Reinout Bussemaker, Mikha Tambayong, Happy Salma, Alex Abbad', null, 'Betrayed by the Dutch colonial forces, Arana manages to escape along with his nephews Jamar and Suwo, the newborn sons of Hamza, one of the last Indonesian sultans fighting against foreign tyranny. In 1860, after wandering for years on the plains of the American Wild West, Arana and the two brothers return to Indonesia to avenge their dead loved ones and punish the evil man who caused their misfortune.', 'Betrayed by the Dutch colonial forces, Arana manages to escape along with his nephews Jamar and Suwo, the newborn sons of Hamza, one of the last Indonesian sultans fighting against foreign tyranny. In 1860, after wandering for years on the plains of the American Wild West, Arana and the two brothers return to Indonesia to avenge their dead loved ones and punish the evil man who caused their misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1Bn2zlIDJSnM5aOljbOPTM6Kf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493488'),
  ('868626386481166605', 'Buffalo Dreams', 2005, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama', 'David Jackson, Denis Maloney', 'Marjorie Schwartz Nielsen', 'Reiley McClendon, Simon Baker, George Newbern, Jane Sibbett, Graham Greene, Tessa Vonn, Geraldine Keams, Chris Hunter', null, 'Josh Townsend finds himself living in New Mexico after his father''s new job requires the family to move from their home in Utah. While acclimating to his new surroundings, Josh becomes involved with a group of teens attempting to preserve the buffalo and Navajo traditions. Along the way he makes friends and learns important lessons about life in this Disney Channel Original movie.', 'Josh Townsend finds himself living in New Mexico after his father''s new job requires the family to move from their home in Utah. While acclimating to his new surroundings, Josh becomes involved with a group of teens attempting to preserve the buffalo and Navajo traditions. Along the way he makes friends and learns important lessons about life in this Disney Channel Original movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qN0TXN19X1W824gI56aKvwrWM0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161594'),
  ('706390259386019559', 'Buffalo Girls', 1995, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Rod Hardy', 'Larry McMurtry, Cynthia Whitcomb', 'Anjelica Huston, Melanie Griffith, Reba McEntire, Gabriel Byrne, Sam Elliott, Peter Coyote, Jack Palance, Liev Schreiber', null, 'The bold escapades of tough-talking Calamity Jane Canary and her illustrious cohorts. It''s the waning days of the Wild West and Jane, the rough ''n'' rugged cowgirl, is searching not only for her long-lost daughter, but the Wild West she once knew. Jane traverses plains, mountains and continents until she finally discovers the answer to her problems: Dora, the vivacious, gold-hearted madam who''s been her one true friend all along.', 'The bold escapades of tough-talking Calamity Jane Canary and her illustrious cohorts. It''s the waning days of the Wild West and Jane, the rough ''n'' rugged cowgirl, is searching not only for her long-lost daughter, but the Wild West she once knew. Jane traverses plains, mountains and continents until she finally discovers the answer to her problems: Dora, the vivacious, gold-hearted madam who''s been her one true friend all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBXii9UxWMFDG90t3B8w96Ecrhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108001'),
  ('278587750026081053', 'Buffalo Kids', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Juan Jesús García Galocha, Pedro Solís', 'Jordi Gasull, Javier López Barreira', 'Mia Pérez Ullod, Jaume Solà, Javier Cassi Gimeno, Federico Bote Bubaila, Isabel Valls, Ricky Coello, Óscar Barberán, Alfonso Vallés', 'PG', 'In 1886, orphaned Irish siblings Mary and Tom arrive in New York City via ocean liner, and quickly find themselves on a wild, cross-country journey aboard a transcontinental ''Orphan Train'', where they meet an extraordinary new friend who will change their lives forever.', 'In 1886, orphaned Irish siblings Mary and Tom arrive in New York City via ocean liner, and quickly find themselves on a wild, cross-country journey aboard a transcontinental ''Orphan Train'', where they meet an extraordinary new friend who will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83WCsJ19Yvg91WTOmDON5akwSI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154304'),
  ('413102168608899284', 'Buffalo Soldiers', 1997, 'Drama, History, TV Movie, Western', 'Charles Haid, William Wages', null, 'Danny Glover, Mykelti Williamson, Glynn Turman, Carl Lumbly, Lamont Bentley, Tom Bower, Timothy Busfield, Matt Ross', 'G', 'They''ve ridden dusty miles without end and fought fierce battles. Yet when these brave African-American cavalrymen enter a scraggly frontier town, they must walk through it instead of ride. The town dishonors them but the soldiers'' Native-American foes do not. Apache leader Victoria and other warriors give the horsemen a name of honor and strength: "Buffalo Soldiers". The troopers'' daring hunt for Victorio frames this stirring tribute to the former slaves and other African-Americans of the 9th and 10th U.S. Calvary Regiments. Danny Glover, Mykelti Williamson, Glynn Turman, Carl Lumbly and Michael Warren star in an adventure bringing to light that largely unknown story and the unique moral dilemma the men faced. Atten-hut! "Buffalo Soldiers are riding" through town.', 'They''ve ridden dusty miles without end and fought fierce battles. Yet when these brave African-American cavalrymen enter a scraggly frontier town, they must walk through it instead of ride. The town dishonors them but the soldiers'' Native-American foes do not. Apache leader Victoria and other warriors give the horsemen a name of honor and strength: "Buffalo Soldiers". The troopers'' daring hunt for Victorio frames this stirring tribute to the former slaves and other African-Americans of the 9th and 10th U.S. Calvary Regiments. Danny Glover, Mykelti Williamson, Glynn Turman, Carl Lumbly and Michael Warren star in an adventure bringing to light that largely unknown story and the unique moral dilemma the men faced. Atten-hut! "Buffalo Soldiers are riding" through town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80Vc40rPcUGDl5pBzFPGGxMAlka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212257'),
  ('670645668092574325', 'Buffalo Soldiers', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, War, Crime, Thriller', 'Oliver Stapleton, Gregor Jordan, Frank Walsh', 'Eric Weiss, Gregor Jordan, Nora Maccoby', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Ed Harris, Scott Glenn, Anna Paquin, Elizabeth McGovern, Michael Peña, Leon, Gabriel Mann', 'R', 'A criminal subculture operates among U.S. soldiers stationed in West Germany just before the fall of the Berlin wall.', 'A criminal subculture operates among U.S. soldiers stationed in West Germany just before the fall of the Berlin wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNl4T8xxC0xDeX8JFJVCBzH4Kg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9104'),
  ('115739578124568139', 'Buffaloed', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tanya Wexler, Guy Godfree', 'Brian Sacca', 'Zoey Deutch, Judy Greer, Jermaine Fowler, Jai Courtney, Noah Reid, Lusia Strus, Lorrie Odom, Raymond Ablack', 'NR', 'Set in the underworld of debt-collecting, homegrown hustler Peg Dahl will do anything to escape Buffalo, NY.', 'Set in the underworld of debt-collecting, homegrown hustler Peg Dahl will do anything to escape Buffalo, NY.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ecianrsS9xYzqoAtVIW8tMcbIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547012'),
  ('307700392960153818', 'Buffet Froid', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bertrand Blier, Jean Penzer', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Gérard Depardieu, Bernard Blier, Jean Carmet, Michel Serrault, Geneviève Page, Jean Benguigui, Marco Perrin, Carole Bouquet', null, 'Alphonse Tram is unwittingly involved in several murders despite having no memory of committing the crimes. His confusion lead him to confess to his neighbour, Inspector Morvandieu. Alphonse and Morvandieu become the axis around which murders occur.', 'Alphonse Tram is unwittingly involved in several murders despite having no memory of committing the crimes. His confusion lead him to confess to his neighbour, Inspector Morvandieu. Alphonse and Morvandieu become the axis around which murders occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6Yzrhn9bSwJprYTYl0xIC4NNPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38438'),
  ('225617284213383883', 'Buffet Titanic', 1979, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Emir Kusturica, Vilko Filač', 'Emir Kusturica', 'Boro Stjepanović, Bogdan Diklić, Nada Đurevska, Zaim Muzaferija, Ante Vican, Zijah Sokolović, Fadil Karup, Bahra Šapović', null, 'Based on a short story of Ivo Andrić, famous Yugoslav Nobel Prize winner, this film is set in Sarajevo during WW2. Mento is a humble, poor Jew who runs a caffe. Stjepan is a man of unknown background, with no social or psychological dimension, who joined Nazis to leave any sort of trace behind himself.', 'Based on a short story of Ivo Andrić, famous Yugoslav Nobel Prize winner, this film is set in Sarajevo during WW2. Mento is a humble, poor Jew who runs a caffe. Stjepan is a man of unknown background, with no social or psychological dimension, who joined Nazis to leave any sort of trace behind himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cZeygM1T2g9aVdiewfa3qXMp3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49129'),
  ('110659567163694555', 'Buffy the Vampire Slayer', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'James Hayman, Fran Rubel Kuzui, Trey Batchelor', 'Joss Whedon', 'Kristy Swanson, Donald Sutherland, Paul Reubens, Rutger Hauer, Luke Perry, Hilary Swank, Michele Abrams, David Arquette', 'PG-13', 'Blonde, bouncy Buffy is your typical high school cheerleader. But all that changes when a strange man informs her she''s been chosen by fate to kill vampires.', 'Blonde, bouncy Buffy is your typical high school cheerleader. But all that changes when a strange man informs her she''s been chosen by fate to kill vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcF3S4UdFpuoZEWovMDq5AXazNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10206'),
  ('542405803063526266', 'Bufo & Spallanzani', 2001, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Breno Silveira, Flávio R. Tambellini, Ciça Castro Neves', 'Patrícia Melo, Flávio R. Tambellini, Rubem Fonseca', 'José Mayer, Tony Ramos, Isabel Guéron, Gracindo Júnior, Zezé Polessa, Matheus Nachtergaele, Juca de Oliveira, Otávio Augusto', null, 'Ivan Canabrava is a writer, turned insurance ivestigator who investigates mysterious deaths involving Bufo Marinus. Bufo Marinus is a frog poison causing catalepsy in humans, simulating death, enabling grand insurance fraud and other crimes. Ten years later, now as a successful writer, similar characters possibly using Bufo Marinus reappear and create an intricate plot full of surprises.', 'Ivan Canabrava is a writer, turned insurance ivestigator who investigates mysterious deaths involving Bufo Marinus. Bufo Marinus is a frog poison causing catalepsy in humans, simulating death, enabling grand insurance fraud and other crimes. Ten years later, now as a successful writer, similar characters possibly using Bufo Marinus reappear and create an intricate plot full of surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jS6zTtOS34Kwbsry4l3Bn9QzKVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96153'),
  ('405385765422534954', 'Bug', 1975, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jeannot Szwarc, Michel Hugo', 'Thomas Page, William Castle', 'Bradford Dillman, Joanna Miles, Richard Gilliland, Jamie Smith-Jackson, Alan Fudge, Jesse Vint, James Greene, Patty McCormack', 'PG', 'An earthquake releases a strain of mutant cockroaches with the ability to start fires, which proceed to cause destructive chaos in a small town. The studies carried out by scientist James Parmiter, however, reveal an intent with much more far-reaching consequences.', 'An earthquake releases a strain of mutant cockroaches with the ability to start fires, which proceed to cause destructive chaos in a small town. The studies carried out by scientist James Parmiter, however, reveal an intent with much more far-reaching consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcGZcDb62IdfIKVsVIezKQy9l15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62697'),
  ('707254854569526483', 'Bug', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Scott Kevan, Phil Hay, Matt Manfredi', 'Matt Manfredi', 'John Carroll Lynch, Alexandra Wescourt, Sarah Paulson, Brian Cox, Alexis Cruz, Grant Heslov, Jamie Kennedy, Michael Hitchcock', null, 'A small boy squashing an insect sets in motion a series of events, large and small, that include a lost restaurant reservation, a drunken fender-bender, disruption of basic cable television service, and more than one relationship falling apart. One person''s disaster becomes another''s boon, and vice versa--because a man loses his job, a young girl becomes the lead ballerina in the school play, which in turn causes the death of a pet pig. These characters weave around Los Angeles and each other as seemingly mundane events fall into place, putting them on a collision course with a common fate and one heroic act of competence.', 'A small boy squashing an insect sets in motion a series of events, large and small, that include a lost restaurant reservation, a drunken fender-bender, disruption of basic cable television service, and more than one relationship falling apart. One person''s disaster becomes another''s boon, and vice versa--because a man loses his job, a young girl becomes the lead ballerina in the school play, which in turn causes the death of a pet pig. These characters weave around Los Angeles and each other as seemingly mundane events fall into place, putting them on a collision course with a common fate and one heroic act of competence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b87SvFpDBcOkhIH2LEtRg7Zj8cT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32241'),
  ('245038949102438975', 'Bug', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'William Friedkin, Michael Grady, Steve Lonano', 'Tracy Letts', 'Ashley Judd, Michael Shannon, Harry Connick Jr., Lynn Collins, Brían F. O''Byrne, Neil Bergeron, Bob Neill', 'R', 'In Oklahoma, Agnes, a lonely waitress living in an isolated and dilapidated roadside motel, meets Peter, a quiet and mysterious man with whom she establishes a peculiar relationship.', 'In Oklahoma, Agnes, a lonely waitress living in an isolated and dilapidated roadside motel, meets Peter, a quiet and mysterious man with whom she establishes a peculiar relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjTmmAngldFoyDhHxNM8fHblk3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12526'),
  ('1081232816596263982', 'Bug Bites: An Ant''s Life', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Michael Schelp', 'Michael Schelp', 'Claudine Ohayon, Corinne Orr, Jean Richards, Larry Robinson', 'PG', 'Thang, Rose and Didi help the young Queen Jo build a new ant hill while avoiding the sinister geckos and keeping Sal Caterpillar out of trouble.', 'Thang, Rose and Didi help the young Queen Jo build a new ant hill while avoiding the sinister geckos and keeping Sal Caterpillar out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvunEfSilJhc2B5cExPyGyJR7vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122956'),
  ('1068575608256276347', 'Bug Buster', 1998, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Lorenzo Doumani', 'Malick Khoury', 'Randy Quaid, Brenda Epperson, Katherine Heigl, James Doohan, George Takei, Meredith Salenger, Ty O''Neal, David Lipper', 'PG-13', 'After the mayor uses a potentially dangerous substance to protect the local plantation, the lakeside town of Mountview, in California, is attacked by a lethal species of large cockroach. After some of the town''s inhabitants are killed, the mayor enlists the help of eccentric pest exterminator General George S. Merlin in order to prevent further harm to the local dwellers.', 'After the mayor uses a potentially dangerous substance to protect the local plantation, the lakeside town of Mountview, in California, is attacked by a lethal species of large cockroach. After some of the town''s inhabitants are killed, the mayor enlists the help of eccentric pest exterminator General George S. Merlin in order to prevent further harm to the local dwellers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bTOOlKQT2jySiiPiPuQYSIPyf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57196'),
