  ('506123379305843485', 'Bugambilia', 1945, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Fernández, Zacarías Gómez Urquiza, Gabriel Figueroa', null, 'Dolores del Río, Pedro Armendáriz, Julio Villarreal, Alberto Galán, Paco Fuentes, Arturo Soto Rangel, Elba Álvarez, Conchita Sáenz', null, 'In mid-nineteenth century Guanajuato, the beauty and charm of the young heiress Amalia conquers the lowly foreman Ricardo with fatal results. Prevented from consummating their love, Ricardo is going to Guanajuato where again later become the rich owner of a mine. On his return, fate has prepared a tragic encounter with Amalia.', 'In mid-nineteenth century Guanajuato, the beauty and charm of the young heiress Amalia conquers the lowly foreman Ricardo with fatal results. Prevented from consummating their love, Ricardo is going to Guanajuato where again later become the rich owner of a mine. On his return, fate has prepared a tragic encounter with Amalia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEMEtxfHp0jFge9HNe6VceI6GxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150037'),
  ('611859421828585854', 'Bugcrush', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Carter Smith, Darren Lew', 'Carter Smith', 'Josh Caras, Donald Cumming, Eléonore Hendricks, David Tennent, Alex Toumayan, Billy Price, Harlan Baker', null, 'A teenager''s infatuation with the new bad boy at school leads him onto a dark path.', 'A teenager''s infatuation with the new bad boy at school leads him onto a dark path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jZcASME7ef9dMCRf8vfeI0VDob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26882'),
