  ('1002934662962002329', 'Bugles in the Afternoon', 1952, 'Western', 'Wilfrid M. Cline, Roy Rowland, William Kissell', 'Harry Brown, Daniel Mainwaring', 'Ray Milland, Helena Carter, Hugh Marlowe, Forrest Tucker, Barton MacLane, George Reeves, James Millican, Gertrude Michael', 'NR', 'Old enemies stationed together at an Army post vie for the same woman.', 'Old enemies stationed together at an Army post vie for the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugzyabmb4oojUuQNhbZhuFd5h0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59041'),
  ('1033350342454746712', 'Bugonia', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Comedy', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Robbie Ryan, Edoardo Petti', 'Jang Joon-hwan', 'Emma Stone, Jesse Plemons, Aidan Delbis, Stavros Halkias, Alicia Silverstone, J. Carmen Galindez Barrera, Marc T. Lewis, Vanessa Eng', 'R', 'Two conspiracy obsessed young men kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major company, convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth.', 'Two conspiracy obsessed young men kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major company, convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxgsAQDAAxA92mFGYCZllgWkH9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701387'),
  ('942100035888684405', 'Bugs', 2003, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joseph Conti, Ian Patrick McAllister, Richard Wincenty', 'Robinson Young, Patrick J. Doody, Chris Valenziano', 'Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Angie Everhart, R. H. Thompson, Karl Pruner, Duane Murray, Romano Orzari, Stephanie Moore, Maestro', null, 'A cop on the track of a criminal finds himself in the midst of an unfinished subway tunnel, when his flashlight reveals a startling discovery: a three meter long scorpion-like Bug. With one slice of its massive tail the bug fells the man and devours him. FBI agent Matt Pollack is brought in to investigate, and when forensics reveal the source of the problem, he turns to his friend and entomologist Emily Foster for help.', 'A cop on the track of a criminal finds himself in the midst of an unfinished subway tunnel, when his flashlight reveals a startling discovery: a three meter long scorpion-like Bug. With one slice of its massive tail the bug fells the man and devours him. FBI agent Matt Pollack is brought in to investigate, and when forensics reveal the source of the problem, he turns to his friend and entomologist Emily Foster for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7s0PlEfbAVP8lJzqiBZ2YdifMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76656'),
  ('829570141897439006', 'Bugs', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yan Jia', 'Yan Jia', 'Xia Zitong, Zhang Zilin, Wang Chuanjun, Sphinx Ting, Cao Yunjin, Rui Xiu, Li Yu', null, 'In the near future, due to a huge demand for protein, scientists have developed a synthetic alternative that has rapidly spread around the world. Jams is a brilliant but fanatic geneticist and has managed to raise super bugs that can provide high-quality protein at a low cost. However, the reproduction of the bugs goes out of control, and they break out of the tubes, devour scientists, and turn into giant monsters. These monster bugs are hankering after flesh and blood and swarm into the sea, waiting to rage a holocaust.', 'In the near future, due to a huge demand for protein, scientists have developed a synthetic alternative that has rapidly spread around the world. Jams is a brilliant but fanatic geneticist and has managed to raise super bugs that can provide high-quality protein at a low cost. However, the reproduction of the bugs goes out of control, and they break out of the tubes, devour scientists, and turn into giant monsters. These monster bugs are hankering after flesh and blood and swarm into the sea, waiting to rage a holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqT1UGQgwWbWMUGkoyaLYRtH4lB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311170'),
  ('452478713855551275', 'Bugs and Thugs', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'When Bugs calls a cab, he doesn''t know it''s the getaway car for a couple of bankrobbers (however, he does know the capital of Nevada).', 'When Bugs calls a cab, he doesn''t know it''s the getaway car for a couple of bankrobbers (however, he does know the capital of Nevada).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuvKh2gAmX7DK5WbtkA0ruIThhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147915'),
  ('140333012905029628', 'Bugs Bunny and the Three Bears', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Stan Freberg', 'NR', 'The bears tempt Goldilocks with carrot soup, the scent of which brings Bugs on the scene. Bugs romances Mama Bear, and she becomes infatuated with him.', 'The bears tempt Goldilocks with carrot soup, the scent of which brings Bugs on the scene. Bugs romances Mama Bear, and she becomes infatuated with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNwo9dQxnUM2mttdrFlllJhZfPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147871'),
  ('120925515066811562', 'Bugs Bunny Gets the Boid', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett, Treg Brown', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Kent Rogers', 'NR', 'Mama Buzzard wants her children to learn to bring back meat for dinner. One buzzardling is shy and has to be kicked out of the nest. He''s told to at least bring back a rabbit.', 'Mama Buzzard wants her children to learn to bring back meat for dinner. One buzzardling is shy and has to be kicked out of the nest. He''s told to at least bring back a rabbit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alHaHKFlcldxE30txcuqGfEVqdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53974'),
