  ('1148441160834507922', 'Bugs Bunny Rides Again', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Friz Freleng', 'Tedd Pierce, Michael Maltese', 'Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce', 'NR', 'In the Western town of Rising Gorge, Bugs faces off against Yosemite Sam, "the roughest, toughest, he-man stuffest hombre who''s ever crossed the Rio Grande."', 'In the Western town of Rising Gorge, Bugs faces off against Yosemite Sam, "the roughest, toughest, he-man stuffest hombre who''s ever crossed the Rio Grande."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEawOHGO3IEytnlnvZfT4zp0iT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117419'),
  ('1059561665633612674', 'Bugs Bunny Superstar', 1976, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Larry Jackson, Gary Graver', 'Larry Jackson', 'Orson Welles, Robert Clampett, Tex Avery, Friz Freleng, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Animator Robert Clampett presents a history of "Termite Terrace," the little shack on the Warner Brothers studio lot which in the 1930''s and 1940''s housed the animation unit which gave birth to Porky Pig, Daffy Duck and Bugs Bunny. Includes color and black-and-white home-movie-type footage shot at the time showing such animation greats as Clampett, Tex Avery and Chuck Jones. Also featured are nine complete Warner cartoons.', 'Animator Robert Clampett presents a history of "Termite Terrace," the little shack on the Warner Brothers studio lot which in the 1930''s and 1940''s housed the animation unit which gave birth to Porky Pig, Daffy Duck and Bugs Bunny. Includes color and black-and-white home-movie-type footage shot at the time showing such animation greats as Clampett, Tex Avery and Chuck Jones. Also featured are nine complete Warner cartoons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Zx9S0EwVglnbP6u6Bb7X44p9Ty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147742'),
  ('690998533026178369', 'Bugs Bunny''s 3rd Movie: 1001 Rabbit Tales', 1982, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Music', 'Chuck Jones, Friz Freleng, Robert McKimson', 'John W. Dunn, Friz Freleng, David Detiege', 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Arthur Q. Bryan, June Foray, Shepard Menken, Lennie Weinrib, William Roberts', 'G', 'If Bugs Bunny were to direct his signature inquiry--"What''s up, doc?"--toward the modern-day Warner Bros. creative team, he wouldn''t be far off. For 1001 Rabbit Tales, they''ve doctored up a batch of classic cartoons featuring the carrot muncher and his bumbling comrades and bundled them, near seamlessly, into a feature-length film. Here''s the premise: Bugs and Daffy, both book salesmen, are competing to sell the most copies of a kids'' book. Instead of burrowing a beeline to his sales territory (he should have made a left at Albuquerque), Bugs ends up in the castle of Yosemite Sam, here a harem-leading honcho. Sam''s pain-in-the-spurs son, Prince Abalaba, needs somebody to read him stories; Bugs, who''d sooner take the job than suffer the alternative, that involving being boiled in oil, signs on.', 'If Bugs Bunny were to direct his signature inquiry--"What''s up, doc?"--toward the modern-day Warner Bros. creative team, he wouldn''t be far off. For 1001 Rabbit Tales, they''ve doctored up a batch of classic cartoons featuring the carrot muncher and his bumbling comrades and bundled them, near seamlessly, into a feature-length film. Here''s the premise: Bugs and Daffy, both book salesmen, are competing to sell the most copies of a kids'' book. Instead of burrowing a beeline to his sales territory (he should have made a left at Albuquerque), Bugs ends up in the castle of Yosemite Sam, here a harem-leading honcho. Sam''s pain-in-the-spurs son, Prince Abalaba, needs somebody to read him stories; Bugs, who''d sooner take the job than suffer the alternative, that involving being boiled in oil, signs on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDXqtMTh88qCY0afA6JSXTxYHn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26730'),
  ('17655435687455260', 'Bugs Bunny''s Bustin'' Out All Over', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Chuck Jones, Phil Monroe', 'Chuck Jones', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Three all-new cartoons from animation legend Chuck Jones showcase Bugs Bunny and some of Jones'' most famous characters. Springtime has arrived and stirred the birds, the bees and Bugs Bunny -- the time when an infant Elmer Fudd chased a youthful Bugs with his popgun, waiting for the start of "wabbit season"; when Bugs was held captive by Marvin Martian (in "Spaced Out Bunny"); and when, after 30 years of chases, Wile E. Coyote finally caught the Road Runner (in "Soup or Sonic").', 'Three all-new cartoons from animation legend Chuck Jones showcase Bugs Bunny and some of Jones'' most famous characters. Springtime has arrived and stirred the birds, the bees and Bugs Bunny -- the time when an infant Elmer Fudd chased a youthful Bugs with his popgun, waiting for the start of "wabbit season"; when Bugs was held captive by Marvin Martian (in "Spaced Out Bunny"); and when, after 30 years of chases, Wile E. Coyote finally caught the Road Runner (in "Soup or Sonic").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7iFfpRvqDuaLWkRdDrSNePqeBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276970'),
  ('985755932142877605', 'Bugs Bunny''s Christmas Carol', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Yosemite Sam is miserly Ebenezer Scrooge in this spoof of Charles Dickens'' classic tale. Porky Pig, as Scrooge''s clerk, Bob Cratchit, is fired on Christmas eve for the unpardonable act of using coal to keep warm. When Scrooge evicts Cratchit and his family from their modest dwelling, heroic Bugs Bunny decides to dress like a ghost and teach the hot-tempered miser a lesson on the meaning of Christmas.', 'Yosemite Sam is miserly Ebenezer Scrooge in this spoof of Charles Dickens'' classic tale. Porky Pig, as Scrooge''s clerk, Bob Cratchit, is fired on Christmas eve for the unpardonable act of using coal to keep warm. When Scrooge evicts Cratchit and his family from their modest dwelling, heroic Bugs Bunny decides to dress like a ghost and teach the hot-tempered miser a lesson on the meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXEzEWzSLqr6wbUE6BSYJI2gNKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197766'),
  ('913835769324775449', 'Bugs Bunny''s Easter Funnies', 1977, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Gerry Chiniquy, Friz Freleng, Robert McKimson', 'Friz Freleng', 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Easter-themed showcase of classic Warner Bros. cartoons, hosted by Bugs Bunny and Granny.', 'Easter-themed showcase of classic Warner Bros. cartoons, hosted by Bugs Bunny and Granny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lFXBFRVafpQ8nZ1Yg9fC4T7uzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50406'),
  ('642658721602752284', 'Bugs Bunny''s Howl-oween Special', 1977, 'Animation, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Bugs Bunny and his friends face Witch Hazel and other scary characters on All Hallows Eve.', 'Bugs Bunny and his friends face Witch Hazel and other scary characters on All Hallows Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXYXyHfawoUlVOC1aWy8yqZN145.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62911'),
  ('305219885909669330', 'Bugs Bunny''s Looney Christmas Tales', 1979, 'Animation, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Friz Freleng', 'John W. Dunn, Tony Benedict, Chuck Jones', 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', 'G', 'A TV movie special that compiles of a few Looney Tunes episodes centered around an episode of a Christmas Carol, with the part of Scrooge played by Yosemite Sam.', 'A TV movie special that compiles of a few Looney Tunes episodes centered around an episode of a Christmas Carol, with the part of Scrooge played by Yosemite Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrnrXPlBQxci62gysPjNSlYeG5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26540'),
  ('133738752635849499', 'Bugs Bunny''s Lunar Tunes', 1991, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Nancy Beiman, Friz Freleng, Chuck Jones', 'Ronnie Scheib, Greg Ford', 'Jeff Bergman, Joe Alaskey, Katy Dierlam, June Foray, Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs has to defend the Earth''s right to exist in an intergalactic court.', 'Bugs has to defend the Earth''s right to exist in an intergalactic court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Wa3BrbU6jvIFZLlVy4dIebRDzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154023'),
  ('905478566284469090', 'Bugs Bunny''s Mad World of Television', 1982, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Friz Freleng, David Detiege, Chuck Jones', 'John W. Dunn, Hal Geer, Mike Joens', 'Mel Blanc, Kathleen Helppie-Shipley, Ken Sansom', null, 'The president of QTTV is thrown out the window since the shows under his reign got nothing but bad ratings. So the executives decide that it is time to find a new president who understands entertainment. That''s when they turn to Bugs Bunny. The network calls Bugs Bunny and asks him to be the new president. They also ask him how he came to be and that''s when the special shows scenes from What''s Up Doc?. Eventually, Bugs accepts the job.', 'The president of QTTV is thrown out the window since the shows under his reign got nothing but bad ratings. So the executives decide that it is time to find a new president who understands entertainment. That''s when they turn to Bugs Bunny. The network calls Bugs Bunny and asks him to be the new president. They also ask him how he came to be and that''s when the special shows scenes from What''s Up Doc?. Eventually, Bugs accepts the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3vzVwBdFhgNAoKjPsnHWdYKBd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455861'),
  ('593933268750590853', 'Bugs Bunny''s Thanksgiving Diet', 1979, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng, Robert McKimson, David Detiege', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Bugs Bunny''s Thanksgiving Diet is a 1979 Looney Tunes Thanksgiving television special. It premiered on CBS on November 15th, 1979.', 'Bugs Bunny''s Thanksgiving Diet is a 1979 Looney Tunes Thanksgiving television special. It premiered on CBS on November 15th, 1979.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaSkHW8t7Hh3kCPIu6sZXtU5bz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455863'),
  ('433957549687170228', 'Bugs in Love', 1932, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, 'NR', 'Insects have made a playground/carnival out of castoffs, featuring "ice skating" on mirrors. Two love bugs head off to a more private area. But their fun is interrupted when a crow comes by. He bottles up the male bug and chases the female into her home. The male bug escapes in the nick of time, and another bug notices the battle and rallies the rest of the bugs to attack, which they do, using false teeth, an eggbeater, a mousetrap, castor oil, and other things.', 'Insects have made a playground/carnival out of castoffs, featuring "ice skating" on mirrors. Two love bugs head off to a more private area. But their fun is interrupted when a crow comes by. He bottles up the male bug and chases the female into her home. The male bug escapes in the nick of time, and another bug notices the battle and rallies the rest of the bugs to attack, which they do, using false teeth, an eggbeater, a mousetrap, castor oil, and other things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUP02fb8N395eyXrmKSmBrknB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66829'),
  ('587532452047214885', 'Bugs'' Bonnets', 1956, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan, Robert C. Bruce', null, 'A passing truck spills a variety of hats, causing Elmer and Bugs to change personalities in rapid succession to fit the headgear they wind up wearing.', 'A passing truck spills a variety of hats, causing Elmer and Bugs to change personalities in rapid succession to fit the headgear they wind up wearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hX0S7QG3RPvaUT1W2GvbYD3BGm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101507'),
  ('42624176373874771', 'Bugsy', 1991, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Barry Levinson, Allen Daviau', 'James Toback', 'Warren Beatty, Annette Bening, Harvey Keitel, Ben Kingsley, Elliott Gould, Joe Mantegna, Bebe Neuwirth, Bill Graham', 'R', 'New York gangster Ben ''Bugsy'' Siegel takes a brief business trip to Los Angeles. A sharp-dressing womanizer with a foul temper, Siegel doesn''t hesitate to kill or maim anyone crossing him. In L.A. the life, the movies, and most of all strong-willed Virginia Hill detain him while his family wait back home. Then a trip to a run-down gambling joint at a spot in the desert known as Las Vegas gives him his big idea.', 'New York gangster Ben ''Bugsy'' Siegel takes a brief business trip to Los Angeles. A sharp-dressing womanizer with a foul temper, Siegel doesn''t hesitate to kill or maim anyone crossing him. In L.A. the life, the movies, and most of all strong-willed Virginia Hill detain him while his family wait back home. Then a trip to a run-down gambling joint at a spot in the desert known as Las Vegas gives him his big idea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSGncpMByW8zx2aOSXdZB0e70yA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10337'),
  ('454069680120655812', 'Bugsy and Mugsy', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Friz Freleng', 'Warren Foster', 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny finds that gangsters Rocky and Mugsy have chosen his new abode, a condemned building, as their hideout. Bugs manipulates them into attacking each other to prove that crime doesn''t pay.', 'Bugs Bunny finds that gangsters Rocky and Mugsy have chosen his new abode, a condemned building, as their hideout. Bugs manipulates them into attacking each other to prove that crime doesn''t pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NFhbslObabA5RzrRHN1dMInptx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198973'),
  ('431455702382578979', 'Bugsy Malone', 1976, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Music, Family', 'Alan Parker, Michael Seresin, Peter Biziou', 'Alan Parker', 'Scott Baio, Jodie Foster, Florrie Dugger, John Cassisi, Martin Lev, Paul Murphy, Sheridan Earl Russell, Albin ''Humpty'' Jenkins', 'G', 'New York, 1929, a war rages between two rival gangsters, Fat Sam and Dandy Dan. Dan is in possession of a new and deadly weapon, the dreaded "splurge gun". As the custard pies fly, Bugsy Malone, an all-round nice guy, falls for Blousey Brown, a singer at Fat Sam''s speakeasy. His designs on her are disrupted by the seductive songstress Tallulah who wants Bugsy for herself.', 'New York, 1929, a war rages between two rival gangsters, Fat Sam and Dandy Dan. Dan is in possession of a new and deadly weapon, the dreaded "splurge gun". As the custard pies fly, Bugsy Malone, an all-round nice guy, falls for Blousey Brown, a singer at Fat Sam''s speakeasy. His designs on her are disrupted by the seductive songstress Tallulah who wants Bugsy for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9BPl3jkNCFgsYe5poKrirUqrf8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8446'),
  ('172936915542305601', 'Building a Building', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey''s a shovel operator and laborer at a construction site; Minnie is delivering box lunches; Pete is the foreman. Mickey pays more attention to Minnie than to his work, and keeps having accidents (mostly involving the blueprints Pete is holding). Pete steals Mickey''s lunch, so Minnie offers him one on the house. While he''s eating, Pete kidnaps Minnie; Mickey fights him, but the tide turns when Minnie dumps a load of hot rivets into Pete''s pants...', 'Mickey''s a shovel operator and laborer at a construction site; Minnie is delivering box lunches; Pete is the foreman. Mickey pays more attention to Minnie than to his work, and keeps having accidents (mostly involving the blueprints Pete is holding). Pete steals Mickey''s lunch, so Minnie offers him one on the house. While he''s eating, Pete kidnaps Minnie; Mickey fights him, but the tide turns when Minnie dumps a load of hot rivets into Pete''s pants...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gt7g1N4iFxyQBc1rzt5L4t7J1BF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161836'),
  ('388082231579660082', 'Bukang Bibig', 2002, 'Drama', 'Cesar S.B. Abella, Boyet Rima', 'Efren C. Piñon', 'Yda Manzano, Francis Enriquez, Jeffrey Gonzales, Sydney Segovia, Aya Medel, Marilou Ver, Tess Orias, Kim Mendoza', null, 'Myrna, a waitress in the province, falls in love with Ariel from Manila, brother of running city mayor Segundo.. Will this love last?', 'Myrna, a waitress in the province, falls in love with Ariel from Manila, brother of running city mayor Segundo.. Will this love last?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6Au7DpGqwLcMLhdoU4v1J3eYJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474616'),
  ('585754260419101729', 'Bukowski: Born Into This', 2003, 'Documentary', 'John Dullaghan', null, 'Charles Bukowski, Harry Dean Stanton, Sean Penn, Bono, Linda Bukowski, Pam Miller, Taylor Hackford, Barbet Schroeder', 'R', 'Director John Dullaghan’s biographical documentary about infamous poet Charles Bukowski, Bukowski: Born Into This, is as much a touching portrait of the author as it is an exposé of his sordid lifestyle. Interspersed between ample vintage footage of Bukowski’s poetry readings are interviews with the poet’s fans including such legendary figures such as Lawrence Ferlinghetti, Joyce Fante (wife of John), Bono, and Harry Dean Stanton. Filmed in grainy black and white by Bukowski’s friend, Taylor Hackford, due to lack of funding, the old films edited into this movie paint Bukowski’s life of boozing and brawling romantically, securing Bukowski’s legendary status.', 'Director John Dullaghan’s biographical documentary about infamous poet Charles Bukowski, Bukowski: Born Into This, is as much a touching portrait of the author as it is an exposé of his sordid lifestyle. Interspersed between ample vintage footage of Bukowski’s poetry readings are interviews with the poet’s fans including such legendary figures such as Lawrence Ferlinghetti, Joyce Fante (wife of John), Bono, and Harry Dean Stanton. Filmed in grainy black and white by Bukowski’s friend, Taylor Hackford, due to lack of funding, the old films edited into this movie paint Bukowski’s life of boozing and brawling romantically, securing Bukowski’s legendary status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84jdtVpKSgyGpBy9fdeQZWXiqeI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16765'),
  ('319447085899262976', 'Bukraken!', 2023, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'David Díaz', 'Shathu Entayla, David Díaz', 'Elyre Ross, Rubén Trujillo Yranzo, Dani Ultares, Ferran Arís, Carla Vigara, Shathu Entayla, Paula Coiz, Nuria Ferrer', null, 'In 2016, journalism student Susana Rojas disappeared without a trace while making a documentary for her end-of-career work. After several years, her project is finally uncovered.', 'In 2016, journalism student Susana Rojas disappeared without a trace while making a documentary for her end-of-career work. After several years, her project is finally uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnRNJYmaEJoG07XA0TzBnn88bCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127781'),
  ('127838249236072554', 'Bula', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Bobby Bonifacio, Alex Espartero, Jackie Lyn Barcebal', 'Bobby Bonifacio, Juvy Galamiton', 'Ayanna Misola, Gab Lagman, Robb Guinto, Ana Abad Santos, Mon Confiado, Alvaro Oteyza, Andrea Fren, Nic Galvez', null, 'A woman working in a laundry shop uses her clients'' clothes to satisfy her sexual fantasies. When she meets a hot police officer, she wants to have him no matter what it takes.', 'A woman working in a laundry shop uses her clients'' clothes to satisfy her sexual fantasies. When she meets a hot police officer, she wants to have him no matter what it takes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGLUh7cjJe7xUPzG9SOgGiyArgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014840'),
  ('1092319156466922724', 'Bulbbul', 2020, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Anvita Dutt, Siddharth Diwan', 'Anvita Dutt', 'Triptii Dimri, Avinash Tiwary, Rahul Bose, Parambrata Chatterjee, Paoli Dam, Ruchi Mahajan, Varun Buddhadev, Veera Kapur Ee', null, 'A child bride grows up to be an enigmatic woman presiding over her household, harboring a painful past as supernatural murders of men plague her village.', 'A child bride grows up to be an enigmatic woman presiding over her household, harboring a painful past as supernatural murders of men plague her village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XYEqHqvcf6vxFhNyeKZz5xbUfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714338'),
  ('176734770788163263', 'Bulgarian Lovers', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Néstor Calvo', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Antonio Hens', 'Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Dritan Biba, Pepón Nieto, Roger Pera, Anita Sinkovic, Fernando Albizu, Roman Luknár, Simón Andreu', 'R', 'Graying Spaniard Daniel has a healthy budget for indulging in the finer things in life. Daniel''s favorite luxury is playing sponsor to younger men amid the lights and sights of Madrid''s gay club scene. After Daniel shares a night with handsome Bulgarian emigre Kyril, he finds himself consumed with an insatiable lust for the charismatic foreigner. But, as their relationship takes shape, Daniel''s latest conquest reveals his own manipulative tendencies.', 'Graying Spaniard Daniel has a healthy budget for indulging in the finer things in life. Daniel''s favorite luxury is playing sponsor to younger men amid the lights and sights of Madrid''s gay club scene. After Daniel shares a night with handsome Bulgarian emigre Kyril, he finds himself consumed with an insatiable lust for the charismatic foreigner. But, as their relationship takes shape, Daniel''s latest conquest reveals his own manipulative tendencies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttiVEQJ6t611Uu1gGoIr78GLmMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59418'),
  ('88058283214690541', 'Bulk', 2026, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Ben Wheatley, Nick Gillespie', 'Ben Wheatley', 'Sam Riley, Alexandra Maria Lara, Noah Taylor, Mark Monero, Bill Nighy', null, 'When an over zealous scientist pushes his experiments with string theory too far, his brane explodes. That''s "brane", not "brain", meaning someone has to sort out the mess he has created. Corey Harlan is sent in – kicking and screaming – to find the heart of the brane and its creator.', 'When an over zealous scientist pushes his experiments with string theory too far, his brane explodes. That''s "brane", not "brain", meaning someone has to sort out the mess he has created. Corey Harlan is sent in – kicking and screaming – to find the heart of the brane and its creator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLFhAIzvKKUoclaiKSgDHK7c2d7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1478289'),
  ('177669827282564747', 'Bull', 2020, 'Drama', 'Annie Silverstein, Shabier Kirchner', 'Annie Silverstein, Johnny McAllister', 'Rob Morgan, Amber Havard, Sarah Albright, Steven Boyd, Troy Hogan, Yolonda Ross', 'R', 'In a near-abandoned subdivision west of Houston, a wayward teen runs headlong into her equally willful and unforgiving neighbor, an aging bullfighter who''s seen his best days in the arena; it''s a collision that will change them both.', 'In a near-abandoned subdivision west of Houston, a wayward teen runs headlong into her equally willful and unforgiving neighbor, an aging bullfighter who''s seen his best days in the arena; it''s a collision that will change them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLyntMhWx9ywJOmw78YOX3lt7ye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595940'),
  ('180749491915389305', 'Bull', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Paul Andrew Williams, Jonay Sevillano Regalado, Gareth Lewis', 'Paul Andrew Williams', 'Neil Maskell, David Hayman, Tamzin Outhwaite, Elizabeth Counsell, Kellie Shirley, Jay Simpson, Chris Coghill, Jake Davies', 'R', 'Ten years after he was last seen, a vicious mob enforcer returns home to find his son and methodically track down the gang that double-crossed him. His quest for revenge soon leads to a savage showdown between his wife and her mob boss father.', 'Ten years after he was last seen, a vicious mob enforcer returns home to find his son and methodically track down the gang that double-crossed him. His quest for revenge soon leads to a savage showdown between his wife and her mob boss father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oapxWncDc5ztrge3ycpvaZIMcf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821792'),
  ('542633470570709578', 'Bull Durham', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ron Shelton, Bobby Byrne, Ric Kidney', 'Ron Shelton', 'Kevin Costner, Susan Sarandon, Tim Robbins, Trey Wilson, Robert Wuhl, William O''Leary, David Neidorf, Danny Gans', 'R', 'Veteran catcher Crash Davis is brought to the minor league Durham Bulls to help their up and coming pitching prospect, "Nuke" Laloosh. Their relationship gets off to a rocky start and is further complicated when baseball groupie Annie Savoy sets her sights on the two men.', 'Veteran catcher Crash Davis is brought to the minor league Durham Bulls to help their up and coming pitching prospect, "Nuke" Laloosh. Their relationship gets off to a rocky start and is further complicated when baseball groupie Annie Savoy sets her sights on the two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3T9bO6p74NcTxWOhdUA6fASQ5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287'),
  ('122665165010405510', 'Bull Shark', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brett Bentman, Jeff Hamm', 'Brett Bentman', 'Thom Hallum, Billy Blair, Lindsey Marie Wilson, Derrick Redford, Colleen Elizabeth Miller, Colin Heintz, Tiffany McDonald, Richard Ray', 'NR', 'A hungry shark begins feeding on some unsuspecting lake goers in a small Texas town.', 'A hungry shark begins feeding on some unsuspecting lake goers in a small Texas town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGE4ImqYjJZQi3xFu4I2OLm8m0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938596'),
  ('44833055419663010', 'Bullah', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Shoaib Khan', 'Shoaib Khan', 'Shaan Shahid, Naeema Butt, Saleem Sheikh', null, 'In Punjab''s spiritual heart, Bullah fights injustice using his father''s philosophy. With undercover agent Sophia, he battles mafia lord Bakshi and enforcer Shahu while sheltering displaced souls a journey of loss, resilience and awakening.', 'In Punjab''s spiritual heart, Bullah fights injustice using his father''s philosophy. With undercover agent Sophia, he battles mafia lord Bakshi and enforcer Shahu while sheltering displaced souls a journey of loss, resilience and awakening.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8vfz3XusdSM7RrnvV1FioKqCwkA.jpg', 'plex:movie:bullah-2026'),
  ('460098518401337528', 'Bulldog Drummond', 1929, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'F. Richard Jones, Leslie Pearce, Gregg Toland', 'Wallace Smith', 'Ronald Colman, Claud Allister, Lawrence Grant, Montagu Love, Wilson Benge, Joan Bennett, Lilyan Tashman, Charles Sellon', 'NR', 'Bulldog Drummond is a British WWI veteran who longs for some excitement after he returns to the humdrum existence of civilian life. He gets what he''s looking for when a girl requests his help in freeing her uncle from a nursing home. She believes the home is just a front and that her uncle is really being held captive while the culprits try to extort his fortune from him.', 'Bulldog Drummond is a British WWI veteran who longs for some excitement after he returns to the humdrum existence of civilian life. He gets what he''s looking for when a girl requests his help in freeing her uncle from a nursing home. She believes the home is just a front and that her uncle is really being held captive while the culprits try to extort his fortune from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pN3nEDQBfQRjrtgOwJ3WBBm23F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81829'),
  ('154188536714999148', 'Bulldog Drummond at Bay', 1937, 'Action, Thriller', 'Norman Lee, Walter J. Harvey, Richard Mishiku', 'Patrick Kirwan, James Parrish', 'John Lodge, Dorothy Mackaill, Victor Jory, Claud Allister, Richard Bird, Hugh Miller, Leslie Perrins, Brian Buchel', 'NR', 'Drummond goes up against foreign agents who are trying to steal plans for a top-secret aircraft.', 'Drummond goes up against foreign agents who are trying to steal plans for a top-secret aircraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEYmM4UW2AmN71toprcDQAw5ohp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140418'),
  ('376237714780824235', 'Bulldog Drummond Comes Back', 1937, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Louis King, William C. Mellor, Boris Morros', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'John Barrymore, John Howard, Louise Campbell, Reginald Denny, E. E. Clive, J. Carrol Naish, Helen Freeman, Zeffie Tilbury', 'NR', 'Drummond''s girlfriend is kidnapped by his enemies and he along with his friend Nielsen, an inspector from Scotland Yard, follow the trail and try to rescue her from the kidnappers.', 'Drummond''s girlfriend is kidnapped by his enemies and he along with his friend Nielsen, an inspector from Scotland Yard, follow the trail and try to rescue her from the kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gskamdfXUHaF6N6fDD9KnDqMRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38433'),
  ('761229502618408264', 'Bulldog Drummond Escapes', 1937, 'Adventure, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'James P. Hogan, Victor Milner, Russell Mathews', 'Herman C. McNeile', 'Ray Milland, Guy Standing, Heather Angel, Reginald Denny, Porter Hall, Fay Holden, E. E. Clive, Walter Kingsford', 'NR', 'Drummond manages to save a woman from jumping in front of his car but she runs away with his car. He traces her and she asks him to help her out of a dangerous situation.', 'Drummond manages to save a woman from jumping in front of his car but she runs away with his car. He traces her and she asks him to help her out of a dangerous situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEo6jswgrTCeTAQP9FGCLXFk1uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38437'),
  ('948583476502346695', 'Bulldog Drummond in Africa', 1938, 'Action, Adventure', 'Louis King, William C. Mellor, Mel Epstein', 'Garnett Weston', 'John Howard, Heather Angel, H.B. Warner, J. Carrol Naish, Reginald Denny, E. E. Clive, Anthony Quinn, Michael Brooke', 'NR', 'Drummond has to leave for Morocco on his wedding day with his fiancee and trusted friends to rescue his friend Nielsen who is kidnapped by an international criminal.', 'Drummond has to leave for Morocco on his wedding day with his fiancee and trusted friends to rescue his friend Nielsen who is kidnapped by an international criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LxZSOXtOdMY6LZ0B8PCONRbsPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125873'),
  ('967710766695291651', 'Bulldog Drummond Strikes Back', 1934, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Roy Del Ruth, J. Peverell Marley, William J. Scully', 'Henry Lehrman, Nunnally Johnson', 'Ronald Colman, Loretta Young, Warner Oland, Charles Butterworth, Una Merkel, C. Aubrey Smith, Arthur Hohl, Kathleen Burke', 'NR', 'Bulldog Drummond finds himself immersed in another adventure when he stumbles upon a corpse in the mysterious London mansion of Prince Achmed. Enlisting the help of his old friend Algy and the beautiful Lola, Drummond uncovers a scheme to ship illegal cargo into the country. He must rely on his cunning to survive when the prince offers a reward for his capture.', 'Bulldog Drummond finds himself immersed in another adventure when he stumbles upon a corpse in the mysterious London mansion of Prince Achmed. Enlisting the help of his old friend Algy and the beautiful Lola, Drummond uncovers a scheme to ship illegal cargo into the country. He must rely on his cunning to survive when the prince offers a reward for his capture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPp8feJejNXt2UlbiwevFZYQSha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167057'),
  ('1118377961923813367', 'Bulldog Drummond''s Bride', 1939, 'Action, Thriller', 'James P. Hogan, Harry Fischbeck, Roland Asher', 'Stuart Palmer, Garnett Weston', 'John Howard, Heather Angel, H.B. Warner, Reginald Denny, E. E. Clive, Elizabeth Patterson, Eduardo Ciannelli, Gerald Hamer', 'NR', 'Hugh “Bulldog” Drummond is on the precipice of matrimony to his beloved Phyllis -- but a bank robbery and a daring escape is going to get in their way before they reach the altar.', 'Hugh “Bulldog” Drummond is on the precipice of matrimony to his beloved Phyllis -- but a bank robbery and a daring escape is going to get in their way before they reach the altar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLBOP7jO3hgGaJ6pbRlvNoYcoLy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140470'),
  ('25056642717938410', 'Bulldog Drummond''s Peril', 1938, 'Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'James P. Hogan, Richard Harlan, Harry Fischbeck', 'Stuart Palmer', 'John Barrymore, John Howard, Louise Campbell, Reginald Denny, E. E. Clive, Porter Hall, Elizabeth Patterson, Nydia Westman', null, 'Drummond''s wedding with Phyllis is interrupted when the inspector guarding their gifts is killed. He tries to trace the killers and uncovers the mystery of diamond counterfeiters.', 'Drummond''s wedding with Phyllis is interrupted when the inspector guarding their gifts is killed. He tries to trace the killers and uncovers the mystery of diamond counterfeiters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNsrCbDAwskuzFtj0734NLHhM7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115384'),
  ('724820165908198340', 'Bulldog Drummond''s Revenge', 1937, 'Mystery, Adventure', 'Louis King, Harry Fischbeck, Boris Morros', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'John Barrymore, John Howard, Louise Campbell, Reginald Denny, E. E. Clive, Frank Puglia, Nydia Westman, Robert Gleckler', null, 'Captain Drummond is travelling to Switzerland to marry his girlfriend. However, when a cargo containing dangerous explosives goes missing from its place, Drummond is forced to delay his plans.', 'Captain Drummond is travelling to Switzerland to marry his girlfriend. However, when a cargo containing dangerous explosives goes missing from its place, Drummond is forced to delay his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MApfgh43g93IDWD8o1SkfqyPJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140472'),
