  ('139262165433892971', 'Bullet', 1996, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Julien Temple, Crescenzo G.P. Notarile, Steve Apicella', 'Mickey Rourke, Bruce Rubenstein', 'Mickey Rourke, Tupac Shakur, Adrien Brody, Ted Levine, Matthew Powers, Donnie Wahlberg, Suzanne Shepherd, Jerry Grayson', 'R', 'A tough, Jewish ex-con just released from prison crosses a powerful drug dealer and former prison rival in his return to a life of crime.', 'A tough, Jewish ex-con just released from prison crosses a powerful drug dealer and former prison rival in his return to a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plsSRQwRfF2FIvoLmVsjo1ELqbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14469'),
  ('1069738717691071021', 'Bullet', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Nick Lyon, Carmen Cabana, Joe Bohn', 'Matthew Joynes, Ron Peer, Nick Lyon', 'Danny Trejo, Seri DeYoung, Torsten Voges, Jonathan Banks, Kyle Villalovos, Eve Mauro, Eric St. John, Gerald Webb', 'R', 'Danny Trejo plays ''Bullet'' a tough cop who takes the law into his own hands when his grandson is kidnapped.', 'Danny Trejo plays ''Bullet'' a tough cop who takes the law into his own hands when his grandson is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSYnKLSl11aoZqJQIK9zoV63l3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169298'),
  ('311493424383285379', 'Bullet Ballet', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinichi Kawahara, Hisakatsu Kuroki', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Kirina Mano, Tatsuya Nakamura, Takahiro Murase, Kyoka Suzuki, Hisashi Igawa, Tomorowo Taguchi, Kim Soo-jin', null, 'After his girlfriend commits suicide, a man becomes embroiled in gang warfare attempting to obtain a gun in hopes to kill himself.', 'After his girlfriend commits suicide, a man becomes embroiled in gang warfare attempting to obtain a gun in hopes to kill himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3bQVcIvajOJLamwejJOUTZHK7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25951'),
  ('109204744324775242', 'Bullet Boy', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Saul Dibb, Marcel Zyskind', 'Saul Dibb, Catherine Johnson', 'Ashley Walters, Luke Fraser, Clare Perkins, Curtis Walker, Sharea Samuels, Jaime Winstone', null, 'Ricky is just out of a young offenders institute, heading home to Hackney and determined to go straight. Instead, he heads straight for trouble when he becomes involved in a street confrontation, siding with his best friend Wisdom against a local rude boy. The trouble escalates into a series of tit-for-tat incidents that threaten to spiral out of control. Ricky''s 12-year-old brother Curtis, hero-worships Ricky, though he appears smart enough to know he doesn''t want to follow his example. Yet, despite the stern warnings from his mother and support from her friends in the community, might Ricky''s bad boy allure be too attractive for Curtis to resist?', 'Ricky is just out of a young offenders institute, heading home to Hackney and determined to go straight. Instead, he heads straight for trouble when he becomes involved in a street confrontation, siding with his best friend Wisdom against a local rude boy. The trouble escalates into a series of tit-for-tat incidents that threaten to spiral out of control. Ricky''s 12-year-old brother Curtis, hero-worships Ricky, though he appears smart enough to know he doesn''t want to follow his example. Yet, despite the stern warnings from his mother and support from her friends in the community, might Ricky''s bad boy allure be too attractive for Curtis to resist?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZk17BnjqJTbXWu7xCimOJtjGuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32566'),
  ('178847030150159998', 'Bullet for a Badman', 1964, 'Western', 'R.G. Springsteen, Phil Bowles, Carl Beringer', 'Mary Willingham, Willard W. Willingham', 'Audie Murphy, Darren McGavin, Ruta Lee, Beverley Owen, Skip Homeier, George Tobias, Alan Hale Jr., Berkeley Harris', 'PG', 'Former Texas Rangers Sam Ward and Logan Keliher become enemies when Sam turns bank robber and Logan marries Sam''s ex-wife.', 'Former Texas Rangers Sam Ward and Logan Keliher become enemies when Sam turns bank robber and Logan marries Sam''s ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8awyIvj4U8Vw29uubOrwKZwLsWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128437'),
