  ('206908730755119272', 'Bullet in the Head', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, War', 'John Woo, Chai Kittikum Som, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah', 'John Woo', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Simon Yam, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Yolinda Yan Chor-Sin, Lam Chung, Nina Paw Hei-Ching', 'NR', 'Three childhood friends from the slums of Hong Kong flee to war-time Saigon after accidentally murdering a gang leader, but their troubles only escalate.', 'Three childhood friends from the slums of Hong Kong flee to war-time Saigon after accidentally murdering a gang leader, but their troubles only escalate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsLcRua8Jt5RtD8l8NAq1voXDfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11909'),
  ('53410349356432483', 'Bullet in the Head', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jaime Rosales, Bárbara Díez, Óscar Durán', 'Jaime Rosales', 'Ion Arretxe, Iñigo Royo, Jaione Otxoa, Ana Vila, Asun Arretxe, Nerea Cobreros, José Ángel Lopetegui, Mikel Tello', null, 'Ion is a seemingly normal guy whose life goes by without a hitch. A phone call; a meeting with a friend; small, unimportant everyday situations. One day he gets into a car with two other people. They cross the border between Spain and France. The next morning, their lives will change forever.', 'Ion is a seemingly normal guy whose life goes by without a hitch. A phone call; a meeting with a friend; small, unimportant everyday situations. One day he gets into a car with two other people. They cross the border between Spain and France. The next morning, their lives will change forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJkwT22KVCAal0XPKxRtCIkZRdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28137'),
  ('384841539646009802', 'Bullet Proof', 2022, 'Action, Crime', 'James Clayton', 'Cooper Bibaud, Danny Mac', 'Vinnie Jones, Lina Lecompte, James Clayton, Janvier Katabarwa, Danny Mac, Glenn Ennis, Philip Granger, Lori Triolo', 'R', 'The Thief pulls off the robbery of a lifetime when he robs the psychotic drug lord, Temple. The plan goes off without a hitch until the Thief discovers a stowaway in his getaway car - Temple''s pregnant wife, Mia.', 'The Thief pulls off the robbery of a lifetime when he robs the psychotic drug lord, Temple. The plan goes off without a hitch until the Thief discovers a stowaway in his getaway car - Temple''s pregnant wife, Mia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cj6YmTAU7Jvn3w6d2NfjQzpX7Pw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993145'),
  ('464286093622494690', 'Bullet to Beijing', 1995, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'George Mihalka, Terry Cole, Peter Benison', null, 'Michael Caine, Jason Connery, Mia Sara, Michael Gambon, Michael Sarrazin, Lev Prygunov, Patrick Allen, Sue Lloyd', null, 'When long-time British agent Harry Palmer loses his job because the Cold War is over, he''s promptly approached by a Russian bossman, Alex. In St. Petersburg Alex tells Harry of his plan for Russia''s future, which is threatened because a deadly biochemical weapon called the Red Death has been stolen from him. He''ll pay Harry handsomely to retrieve it. An ex-spy friend tips Harry off that it''s being sent to Beijing by train, aboard which we begin to learn whose side everyone''s really on.', 'When long-time British agent Harry Palmer loses his job because the Cold War is over, he''s promptly approached by a Russian bossman, Alex. In St. Petersburg Alex tells Harry of his plan for Russia''s future, which is threatened because a deadly biochemical weapon called the Red Death has been stolen from him. He''ll pay Harry handsomely to retrieve it. An ex-spy friend tips Harry off that it''s being sent to Beijing by train, aboard which we begin to learn whose side everyone''s really on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVVXIWcxcSNlv5cNOOayHzmR2Q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37237'),
  ('680537918702616974', 'Bullet to the Head', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Walter Hill, Lloyd Ahern II, Robert LaBonge', 'Alessandro Camon', 'Sylvester Stallone, Sung Kang, Sarah Shahi, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Jason Momoa, Christian Slater, Jon Seda, Weronika Rosati', 'R', 'After watching their respective partners die, a cop and a hitman form an alliance in order to bring down their common enemy.', 'After watching their respective partners die, a cop and a hitman form an alliance in order to bring down their common enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arJfxShfuZPhqfBZZU6DkPZfnjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70074'),
  ('779298357828657075', 'Bullet Train', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Chris Farmer, Rahma Farahat, Jonathan Sela', 'Zak Olkewicz', 'Brad Pitt, Joey King, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Brian Tyree Henry, Andrew Koji, Hiroyuki Sanada, Michael Shannon, Sandra Bullock', 'R', 'Unlucky assassin Ladybug is determined to do his job peacefully after one too many gigs gone off the rails. Fate, however, may have other plans, as Ladybug''s latest mission puts him on a collision course with lethal adversaries from around the globe—all with connected, yet conflicting, objectives—on the world''s fastest train.', 'Unlucky assassin Ladybug is determined to do his job peacefully after one too many gigs gone off the rails. Fate, however, may have other plans, as Ladybug''s latest mission puts him on a collision course with lethal adversaries from around the globe—all with connected, yet conflicting, objectives—on the world''s fastest train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8szC8OgrejDQjjMKSVXyaAjw3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718930'),
  ('779441836921641115', 'Bullet Train Down', 2022, 'Action', 'Marcus Friedlander, Brian Nowak', 'Alex Heerman', 'Tom Sizemore, Rashod Freelove, Ryan Youngwoong Kim, Xander Bailey, Lesley Grant, Carolina Vargas, Caleb Lowell, Dylan J. Harris', null, 'On its maiden run, the world''s fastest bullet train is rigged with a bomb that will explode if it dips below 200 mph.', 'On its maiden run, the world''s fastest bullet train is rigged with a bomb that will explode if it dips below 200 mph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqAd0zsic4XIkWFRV7mn09dK1jP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006540'),
  ('780416031657027351', 'Bullet Train Explosion', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Shinji Higuchi, Hamada Kenichi, Keizo Suzuki', 'Kazuhiro Nakagawa, Norichika Oba', 'Tsuyoshi Kusanagi, Machiko Ono, Jun Kaname, Non, Kanata Hosoda, Daisuke Kuroda, Satoru Matsuo, Suzuka Ohgo', 'PG-13', 'When panic erupts on a Tokyo-bound bullet train that will explode if it slows below 100 kph, authorities race against time to save everyone on board.', 'When panic erupts on a Tokyo-bound bullet train that will explode if it slows below 100 kph, authorities race against time to save everyone on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmzxlDBwgvRbpPJzNQwizyn9UEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276073'),
  ('341588441487990743', 'Bulletproof', 1988, 'Action, Thriller', 'Steve Carver, Francis Grumman', 'T.L. Lankford, B.J. Goldman', 'Gary Busey, Darlanne Fluegel, Henry Silva, Thalmus Rasulala, L.Q. Jones, René Enríquez, Mills Watson, James Andronica', 'R', 'A group of dangerous terrorists succeeds to get hold of a tank of the army and all its crew.', 'A group of dangerous terrorists succeeds to get hold of a tank of the army and all its crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWptnYgquQnu7MoCc80xCeCGPz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87533'),
  ('385854592420571013', 'Bulletproof', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, Steven Bernstein, Tim A. Davison', 'Lewis Colick, Joe Gayton', 'Damon Wayans, Adam Sandler, James Caan, Jeep Swenson, James Farentino, Kristen Wilson, Larry McCoy, Allen Covert', 'R', 'An undercover police officer named Rock Keats befriends a drug dealer and car thief named Archie Moses in a bid to catch the villainous drug lord Frank Coltan. But the only problem is that Keats is a cop, his real name is Jack Carter, and he is working undercover with the LAPD to bust Moses and Colton at a sting operation the LAPD has set up.', 'An undercover police officer named Rock Keats befriends a drug dealer and car thief named Archie Moses in a bid to catch the villainous drug lord Frank Coltan. But the only problem is that Keats is a cop, his real name is Jack Carter, and he is working undercover with the LAPD to bust Moses and Colton at a sting operation the LAPD has set up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iI7G9YXxodrqkQPKis1y3EKP8wJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10723'),
  ('373461909464232199', 'Bulletproof 2', 2020, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Don Michael Paul', 'Rich Wilkes', 'Faizon Love, Kirk Fox, Tony Todd, Cassie Clare, Jade Hubner, Tuks Tad Lungu, Noa Milan, Jenna Saras', 'NR', 'Special Agent Jack Carter reluctantly assumes the identity of criminal Archie Moses to take down a powerful South African crime family. But when the real Moses is put in danger, he and Carter must work together to foil the scheme for good.', 'Special Agent Jack Carter reluctantly assumes the identity of criminal Archie Moses to take down a powerful South African crime family. But when the real Moses is put in danger, he and Carter must work together to foil the scheme for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGILkFnRrpdiNtDaHeekGZSn5o5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591237'),
  ('126792898745891856', 'Bulletproof Monk', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Paul Hunter, Stefan Czapsky', 'Cyrus Voris, Ethan Reiff', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Seann William Scott, Jaime King, Karel Roden, Victoria Smurfit, Mako, K.C. Collins, Rob Archer', 'PG-13', 'A mysterious and immortal Tibetan kung fu master, who has spent the last 60 years traveling around the world protecting the ancient Scroll of the Ultimate, mentors a selfish street kid in the ancient intricacies of kung fu.', 'A mysterious and immortal Tibetan kung fu master, who has spent the last 60 years traveling around the world protecting the ancient Scroll of the Ultimate, mentors a selfish street kid in the ancient intricacies of kung fu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3n8HM3fNi9eTk2pj1eblP52iWJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11817'),
  ('6989313325238024', 'Bullets and Katanas', 2023, 'Comedy, Action', 'Nacho Serapio, Andrea Venegas Vallejo, Víctor Hugo Antón', 'Nacho Serapio', 'José A. Marín, Nacho Serapio, Víctor Hugo Antón, David "Prnze" Nichol, Iris Marín, Emilio Linder, Alejandro Reyes, Gressly Arellano', null, 'How would you react if you were a Martial Arts expert, had a Katana in your hands, and your daughter had just been kidnapped. Under this premise, Sensei Marín launches a race against time with Nacho, his best friend.', 'How would you react if you were a Martial Arts expert, had a Katana in your hands, and your daughter had just been kidnapped. Under this premise, Sensei Marín launches a race against time with Nacho, his best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAQxlli6yUg0mGqLxaFhr8oX4H7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1150906'),
  ('147769799686652512', 'Bullets of Justice', 2020, 'Action, Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction, War', 'Valeri Milev', 'Valeri Milev, Timur Turisbekov', 'Timur Turisbekov, Doroteya Toleva, Danny Trejo, Yana Marinova, Neli Andonova, Askar Turisbekov, Semir Alkadi, Ester Chardaklieva', 'R', 'During World War III, the American government initiates a secret project codenamed ‘Army Bacon’ in order to create super soldiers by inbreeding humans with pigs. 25 years later the hybrid Muzzles have occupied the top of the food chain, eating and farming humanity. Ex-bounty hunter Rob Justice works for the last line of human resistance - a group of survivors hiding in a nuclear bunker deep underground - and his mission is to search and destroy Muzzle Central.', 'During World War III, the American government initiates a secret project codenamed ‘Army Bacon’ in order to create super soldiers by inbreeding humans with pigs. 25 years later the hybrid Muzzles have occupied the top of the food chain, eating and farming humanity. Ex-bounty hunter Rob Justice works for the last line of human resistance - a group of survivors hiding in a nuclear bunker deep underground - and his mission is to search and destroy Muzzle Central.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpM6EL6GnsVmtKA6bUDYiRoB3oP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613722'),
  ('215959950925400514', 'Bullets or Ballots', 1936, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Keighley, Hal Mohr', 'Seton I. Miller', 'Edward G. Robinson, Joan Blondell, Barton MacLane, Humphrey Bogart, Frank McHugh, Joe King, Dick Purcell, George E. Stone', null, 'After Police Captain Dan McLaren becomes police commissioner, former detective Johnny Blake publicly punches him, convincing rackets boss Al Kruger that Blake is sincere in his effort to join the mob. "Bugs" Fenner, meanwhile, is certain that Blake is a police agent.', 'After Police Captain Dan McLaren becomes police commissioner, former detective Johnny Blake publicly punches him, convincing rackets boss Al Kruger that Blake is sincere in his effort to join the mob. "Bugs" Fenner, meanwhile, is certain that Blake is a police agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZhmP4AzkHPdfK0E8tpTSdZnGi1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27974'),
  ('43673730377380895', 'Bullets Over Broadway', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Woody Allen, Carlo Di Palma, Richard Patrick', 'Douglas McGrath, Woody Allen', 'John Cusack, Chazz Palminteri, Dianne Wiest, Jennifer Tilly, Mary-Louise Parker, Tracey Ullman, Jim Broadbent, Joe Viterelli', 'R', 'After young playwright, David Shayne obtains funding for his play from gangster Nick Valenti, Nick''s girlfriend Olive miraculously lands the role of a psychiatrist—but not only is she a bimbo who could never pass for a psychiatrist—she''s a dreadful actress. David puts up with the leading man who is a compulsive eater, the grand dame who wants her part jazzed up, and Olive''s interfering hitman/bodyguard—but, eventually he must decide whether art or life is more important.', 'After young playwright, David Shayne obtains funding for his play from gangster Nick Valenti, Nick''s girlfriend Olive miraculously lands the role of a psychiatrist—but not only is she a bimbo who could never pass for a psychiatrist—she''s a dreadful actress. David puts up with the leading man who is a compulsive eater, the grand dame who wants her part jazzed up, and Olive''s interfering hitman/bodyguard—but, eventually he must decide whether art or life is more important.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mY9D1oCLeDKNMdUO8EV7MoCZ3up.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11382'),
  ('802046806899885246', 'Bullets Over Summer', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Wilson Yip, Adam Chan Chung-Tai, Lam Wah-Chuen', 'Ben Cheung Man, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Wilson Yip', 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Louis Koo, Michelle Saram, Stephanie Lam Mei-Ching, Helena Law Lan, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, David Lee Wai-Sheung, Lo Meng', null, 'Plainclothes policemen Brian and Mike use an elderly woman''s apartment for surveillance, hoping to catch a fugitive gangster. They develop a warm relationship with their hostess, whom they call "granny." Meanwhile, each man develops a romantic relationship: Brian with a strange wandering teenage girl, and Mike with a pregnant woman at the dry cleaning shop. When the gangster returns to his flat, Brian and Mike are forced into an explosive confrontation.', 'Plainclothes policemen Brian and Mike use an elderly woman''s apartment for surveillance, hoping to catch a fugitive gangster. They develop a warm relationship with their hostess, whom they call "granny." Meanwhile, each man develops a romantic relationship: Brian with a strange wandering teenage girl, and Mike with a pregnant woman at the dry cleaning shop. When the gangster returns to his flat, Brian and Mike are forced into an explosive confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50kphvvy0zkMjK1G2visnbPi4TV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68623'),
  ('1002300211549983627', 'Bullett Raja', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Tigmanshu Dhulia, P. S. Vinod', null, 'Saif Ali Khan, Sonakshi Sinha, Jimmy Shergill, Vidyut Jammwal, Gulshan Grover, Raj Babbar, Chunky Panday', null, 'A common man who transforms into a gangster revolts against the very system he once obediently followed by declaring war on the police, the government, and the industrialists.', 'A common man who transforms into a gangster revolts against the very system he once obediently followed by declaring war on the police, the government, and the industrialists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IkcVLgAdDvbycaOkb0t6PCIYbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220495'),
  ('671928050379412631', 'Bullfighter and the Lady', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Budd Boetticher, Andrew V. McLaglen, Jack Draper', 'James Edward Grant', 'Robert Stack, Joy Page, Gilbert Roland, Virginia Grey, John Hubbard, Katy Jurado, Antonio Gómez, Ismael Pérez ''Poncianito''', 'NR', 'An American takes up bullfighting to impress the ladies but learns to respect the sport.', 'An American takes up bullfighting to impress the ladies but learns to respect the sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmPuPvdFbBfeIn51DO7j7YyIZ5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77650'),
  ('472692962413648347', 'Bullhead', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michaël R. Roskam, Nicolas Karakatsanis', 'Michaël R. Roskam', 'Matthias Schoenaerts, Jeroen Perceval, Jeanne Dandoy, Barbara Sarafian, Tibo Vandenborre, Frank Lammers, Sam Louwyck, Erico Salamone', 'R', 'A young cattle farmer is approached by an unscrupulous veterinarian to make a shady deal with a notorious beef trader.', 'A young cattle farmer is approached by an unscrupulous veterinarian to make a shady deal with a notorious beef trader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9XzaLtFAJIozDH4MQwxaR2aDvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63310'),
  ('62405532468115169', 'Bullies', 1986, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Paul Lynch, René Verzier', 'John Sheppard, Bryan McCann', 'Jonathan Crombie, Olivia D''Abo, Janet-Laine Green, Stephen Hunter, Dehl Berti, Bernie Coulson, Adrien Dorval, William Nunn', 'R', 'When the peaceful Morris family move to a small town and buy the town grocery store, they run afoul of the Cullen family. The Cullen''s have been bullying the town''s folk for years, and now they are harassing the Morris family every chance they get. Matt meanwhile meets and starts seeing a lot of Becky who also likes him. Unfortunately her last name is Cullen, and when the rest of the family finds out about their relationship, they decide to get even, and their harassment is elevated to vicious assault.', 'When the peaceful Morris family move to a small town and buy the town grocery store, they run afoul of the Cullen family. The Cullen''s have been bullying the town''s folk for years, and now they are harassing the Morris family every chance they get. Matt meanwhile meets and starts seeing a lot of Becky who also likes him. Unfortunately her last name is Cullen, and when the rest of the family finds out about their relationship, they decide to get even, and their harassment is elevated to vicious assault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6CgRys63jZlOmW8s1MoO5KC1jn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71181'),
  ('727078144377046080', 'Bullitt', 1968, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'William A. Fraker, Peter Yates, Tim Zinnemann', 'Alan Trustman, Harry Kleiner', 'Steve McQueen, Robert Vaughn, Jacqueline Bisset, Don Gordon, Robert Duvall, Simon Oakland, Norman Fell, Georg Stanford Brown', 'PG', 'Senator Walter Chalmers is aiming to take down mob boss Pete Ross with the help of testimony from the criminal''s hothead brother Johnny, who is in protective custody in San Francisco under the watch of police lieutenant Frank Bullitt. When a pair of mob hitmen enter the scene, Bullitt follows their trail through a maze of complications and double-crosses. This thriller includes one of the most famous car chases ever filmed.', 'Senator Walter Chalmers is aiming to take down mob boss Pete Ross with the help of testimony from the criminal''s hothead brother Johnny, who is in protective custody in San Francisco under the watch of police lieutenant Frank Bullitt. When a pair of mob hitmen enter the scene, Bullitt follows their trail through a maze of complications and double-crosses. This thriller includes one of the most famous car chases ever filmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ffzF1WmeXtH420fSUoCrecFvDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916'),
  ('670716749527306147', 'Bullseye!', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Michael Winner, Alan Jones, Cliff Lanning', 'Maurice Gran, Laurence Marks', 'Michael Caine, Roger Moore, Sally Kirkland, Lee Patterson, Mark Burns, Derren Nesbitt, Deborah Leng, Christopher Adamson', null, 'Spies force two British con men to pose as look-alike scientists peddling cheap-energy fusion.', 'Spies force two British con men to pose as look-alike scientists peddling cheap-energy fusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ihf9zzomI0qLi2fw6ntt3NSG1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60577'),
  ('225780756215255105', 'Bullshot', 1983, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Dick Clement, Alex Thomson', 'Alan Shearman, Ronald E. House, Diz White', 'Alan Shearman, Diz White, Ronald E. House, Frances Tomelty, Mel Smith, Michael Aldridge, Christopher Good, Billy Connolly', 'PG', 'The dashing Captain Hugh "Bullshot" Crummond - WWI ace fighter pilot, Olympic athlete, racing driver, part-time sleuth and all round spiffing chap - must save the world from the dastardly Count Otto van Bruno, his wartime adversary. And, of course, win the heart of a jolly nice young lady.', 'The dashing Captain Hugh "Bullshot" Crummond - WWI ace fighter pilot, Olympic athlete, racing driver, part-time sleuth and all round spiffing chap - must save the world from the dastardly Count Otto van Bruno, his wartime adversary. And, of course, win the heart of a jolly nice young lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ns73xVx0Mwbsw9kuIV1H0josk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62346'),
  ('441895724187671821', 'Bullwhip', 1958, 'Western', 'Harmon Jones', 'Adele Buffington', 'Guy Madison, Rhonda Fleming, James Griffith, Don Beddoe, Peter Adams, Dan Sheridan, Hank Worden, Burt Nelson', 'NR', 'In order to avoid the hangman''s noose, a cowboy agrees to marry a beautiful but fiery redhead.', 'In order to avoid the hangman''s noose, a cowboy agrees to marry a beautiful but fiery redhead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGYVsGSPxqXxsipqAyS6sR7Ihiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141669'),
  ('214224584895062637', 'Bully', 2001, 'Crime, Drama', 'Larry Clark, Steve Gainer', 'David McKenna, Roger Pullis', 'Brad Renfro, Rachel Miner, Nick Stahl, Bijou Phillips, Michael Pitt, Kelli Garner, Daniel Franzese, Leo Fitzpatrick', 'NR', 'A group of teenagers in South Florida enact a murder plot against their mutual bully, Bobby, who has emotionally, physically, and sexually abused them for years.', 'A group of teenagers in South Florida enact a murder plot against their mutual bully, Bobby, who has emotionally, physically, and sexually abused them for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMJ2WHBbK4Jr3eDuF1e7O6lbC8m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9517'),
  ('272855482000861161', 'Bully', 2011, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Lee Hirsch', 'Cynthia Lowen, Lee Hirsch', 'Kirk Smalley', 'PG-13', 'This year, over 5 million American kids will be bullied at school, online, on the bus, at home, through their cell phones and on the streets of their towns, making it the most common form of violence young people in this country experience. The Bully Project is the first feature documentary film to show how we''ve all been affected by bullying, whether we''ve been victims, perpetrators or stood silent witness. The world we inhabit as adults begins on the playground. The Bully Project opens on the first day of school. For the more than 5 million kids who''ll be bullied this year in the United States, it''s a day filled with more anxiety and foreboding than excitement. As the sun rises and school busses across the country overflow with backpacks, brass instruments and the rambunctious sounds of raging hormones, this is a ride into the unknown.', 'This year, over 5 million American kids will be bullied at school, online, on the bus, at home, through their cell phones and on the streets of their towns, making it the most common form of violence young people in this country experience. The Bully Project is the first feature documentary film to show how we''ve all been affected by bullying, whether we''ve been victims, perpetrators or stood silent witness. The world we inhabit as adults begins on the playground. The Bully Project opens on the first day of school. For the more than 5 million kids who''ll be bullied this year in the United States, it''s a day filled with more anxiety and foreboding than excitement. As the sun rises and school busses across the country overflow with backpacks, brass instruments and the rambunctious sounds of raging hormones, this is a ride into the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFYEYUEvXsWzf5cDH64YjibMzpp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84404'),
  ('301460652482562638', 'Bully for Bugs', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny, once again making that "wrong turn at Albuquerque", burrows into a bullring where a magnificent bull is making short work of a toreador. The bull bucks Bugs out of the arena, prompting the bunny to declare "Of course you realize, this means war!" The deft Bugs'' arsenal comes plenty packed, as he uses anvils, well-placed face slaps and the bull''s horns as a slingshot. The bull fights back, using his horns as a shotgun barrel. The bull''s comeback is short-lived; just after Bugs makes out his will, he lures the bull out of the arena, just in time to set up a rube-like device that leads to the bull''s defeat.', 'Bugs Bunny, once again making that "wrong turn at Albuquerque", burrows into a bullring where a magnificent bull is making short work of a toreador. The bull bucks Bugs out of the arena, prompting the bunny to declare "Of course you realize, this means war!" The deft Bugs'' arsenal comes plenty packed, as he uses anvils, well-placed face slaps and the bull''s horns as a slingshot. The bull fights back, using his horns as a shotgun barrel. The bull''s comeback is short-lived; just after Bugs makes out his will, he lures the bull out of the arena, just in time to set up a rube-like device that leads to the bull''s defeat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4W34wG6uAVEkK2jLbVyGl2fTCxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34933'),
  ('791311923716897462', 'Bully for Pink', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hawley Pratt', 'John W. Dunn', null, null, 'The Pink Panther decides to become a matador and to this purpose confiscates a magician''s cape. The panther enters a bullfight ring with the magical cape, and the bull is thwarted not by the panther''s bullfighting prowess but by the cape''s trickery.', 'The Pink Panther decides to become a matador and to this purpose confiscates a magician''s cape. The panther enters a bullfight ring with the magical cape, and the bull is thwarted not by the panther''s bullfighting prowess but by the cape''s trickery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bd8SloBFr8OWd6rHiHPLBu1x5Kl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296270'),
  ('761115016621277057', 'Bullying', 2009, 'Drama', 'Josetxo San Mateo', 'Ángel García Roldán', 'Albert Carbó, Joan Carles Suau, Carlos Fuentes, Laura Conejero, Yohana Cobo, Montse Mostaza', null, 'Jordi is a teenager who recently lost his father and who , next to his mother, decides to move to another city to start a new life. At first everything seems fine , but the fate in store for him will be a terrible surprise since when Jordi pass through the new school gate, cross without knowing the dark frontier of a new hell.', 'Jordi is a teenager who recently lost his father and who , next to his mother, decides to move to another city to start a new life. At first everything seems fine , but the fate in store for him will be a terrible surprise since when Jordi pass through the new school gate, cross without knowing the dark frontier of a new hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVPxzNRHTrwtZjYeLTkWV75bMyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73911'),
  ('491278061130230792', 'Bullyparade: The Movie', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Michael Herbig', null, 'Michael Herbig, Christian Tramitz, Rick Kavanian, Jasmin Gassmann, Jeanne Goursaud, Laura Berlin, Jane Chirwa, Sky du Mont', null, 'A multi-episode movie based on the skit TV show "bullyparade".', 'A multi-episode movie based on the skit TV show "bullyparade".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Vzh8y6tnb0xrxpES7I5F7FJ7nK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393575'),
  ('826510884353196210', 'Bulworth', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime, Thriller, Romance', 'Warren Beatty, Vittorio Storaro, Frank Capra III', 'Jeremy Pikser, Warren Beatty', 'Warren Beatty, Halle Berry, Kimberly Deauna Adams, Vinny Argiro, Sean Astin, Kirk Baltz, Ernie Lee Banks, Amiri Baraka', 'R', 'A suicidally disillusioned liberal politician puts a contract out on himself and takes the opportunity to be bluntly honest with his voters by affecting the rhythms and speech of hip-hop music and culture.', 'A suicidally disillusioned liberal politician puts a contract out on himself and takes the opportunity to be bluntly honest with his voters by affecting the rhythms and speech of hip-hop music and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gR9jZ7W2d28aSa2Yimz797VNXRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9452'),
  ('658871515087178491', 'Bumbarash', 1972, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Abram Naroditskiy, Mykola Rasheiev, Boris Myasnikov', 'Yevgeni Mitko, Abram Naroditskiy', 'Valeriy Zolotukhin, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Roman Tkachuk, Aleksandr Khochinsky, Lev Durov, Yuri Smirnov, Natalya Dmitriyeva, Nikolay Dupak', null, 'Private Bumbarash, considered lost in the First World War, suddenly returned to his native village, where no one recognizes, because the money for the memorial service a long time ago employed for other purposes. In a country already in full raging civil war in the tiny village of power is changing every half: red, white, anarchists, gangsters, again red and white for them again, and so on to infinity ... Amid all this chaos Bumbarash tries to arrange his life and personal happiness.', 'Private Bumbarash, considered lost in the First World War, suddenly returned to his native village, where no one recognizes, because the money for the memorial service a long time ago employed for other purposes. In a country already in full raging civil war in the tiny village of power is changing every half: red, white, anarchists, gangsters, again red and white for them again, and so on to infinity ... Amid all this chaos Bumbarash tries to arrange his life and personal happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbpl0DPn9Gaj1OepoNY6APSR6Q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109940'),
  ('327454102901315927', 'Bumblebee', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Mike Gunther, Rob Tokarz, Brian Relyea', 'Christina Hodson', 'Dylan O''Brien, Hailee Steinfeld, John Cena, Jorge Lendeborg Jr., John Ortiz, Stephen Schneider, Jason Ian Drucker, Pamela Adlon', 'PG-13', 'On the run in the year 1987, Bumblebee finds refuge in a junkyard in a small Californian beach town. Charlie, on the cusp of turning 18 and trying to find her place in the world, discovers Bumblebee, battle-scarred and broken. When Charlie revives him, she quickly learns this is no ordinary yellow VW bug.', 'On the run in the year 1987, Bumblebee finds refuge in a junkyard in a small Californian beach town. Charlie, on the cusp of turning 18 and trying to find her place in the world, discovers Bumblebee, battle-scarred and broken. When Charlie revives him, she quickly learns this is no ordinary yellow VW bug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fw02ONlDhrYjTSZV8XO6hhU3ds3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424783'),
  ('985383030545964343', 'Bumm Bumm Bole', 2010, 'Drama', 'Priyadarshan, Alagappan N', 'Manisha Korde', 'Darsheel Safary, Ziyah Vastani, Atul Kulkarni, Rituparna Sengupta, Rii Sen, Adam Reid, Amitha, Charu', null, 'Two siblings decide to share a pair of shoes till their father can afford to buy another. But things look bleak when their father is unable to find a job and is also suspected of criminal offences.', 'Two siblings decide to share a pair of shoes till their father can afford to buy another. But things look bleak when their father is unable to find a job and is also suspected of criminal offences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swVBv5JcuzWKunrxphKGPQOY1Vh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37729'),
  ('352437047179916436', 'Bummer 2', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pyotr Buslov, Aleksandr Simonov, Zaur Bolotaev', 'Pyotr Buslov, Kim Belov', 'Andrey Merzlikin, Vladimir Vdovichenkov, Svetlana Ustinova, Nikolay Olyalin, Aleksandr Golubev, Aleksandr Tsurkan, Feliks Antipov, Yuri Kolokolnikov', null, 'The film takes place a few years after the events shown in Bummer. Kostyan "Kot", who lost all his friends, the woman he loved and was nearly killed in the first installment of the film tries to begin a new, peaceful life. But is it possible to do? Has Russia changed and do "bratki" on black "bummers" no longer control business? Can he escape his past?', 'The film takes place a few years after the events shown in Bummer. Kostyan "Kot", who lost all his friends, the woman he loved and was nearly killed in the first installment of the film tries to begin a new, peaceful life. But is it possible to do? Has Russia changed and do "bratki" on black "bummers" no longer control business? Can he escape his past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7t6XzBKoAmgPeoBVE1GDeymNv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61139'),
  ('875348774923887774', 'Bump in the Night', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Karen Arthur, Tom Neuwirth', null, 'Meredith Baxter, Christopher Reeve, Wings Hauser, Richard Bradford, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Shirley Knight, Terrence Mann, Richard Joseph Paul', 'NR', 'Martha "Red" Tierney used to be a hot-shot reporter, but that was before alcohol took over her life. One morning Martha''s son, Jonathan, leaves for school, stopping first to meet his father for breakfast. But Jonathan never meets his dad. Instead, he is picked up by Lawrence, a pedophile who has been watching him. Now Martha must overcome her alcoholism and her bitterness towards her ex-husband and use her old investigative skills to find her son before it''s too late.', 'Martha "Red" Tierney used to be a hot-shot reporter, but that was before alcohol took over her life. One morning Martha''s son, Jonathan, leaves for school, stopping first to meet his father for breakfast. But Jonathan never meets his dad. Instead, he is picked up by Lawrence, a pedophile who has been watching him. Now Martha must overcome her alcoholism and her bitterness towards her ex-husband and use her old investigative skills to find her son before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBJBLce2WxvSdZOwGBGJjUo40mb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349456'),
  ('1129064332227661168', 'Bumpkin Soup', 1985, 'Music, Comedy', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Toshihiko Uryu', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Kunitoshi Manda', 'Yoriko Doguchi, Jūzō Itami, Kenso Kato, Usagi Asō, Sôzô Teruoka, Yuichi Kishino, Hiroshi Katsuno, Kubota Shoko', null, 'Country girl Akiko visits a Tokyo college in search of her hometown sweetheart. In the course of finding him, she runs into various odd inhabitants of the college campus–blasé intellectuals, horny co-eds, a psych professor in search of the theory of shame, and of course her beloved Yoshioka, who has become an elusive campus nobody.', 'Country girl Akiko visits a Tokyo college in search of her hometown sweetheart. In the course of finding him, she runs into various odd inhabitants of the college campus–blasé intellectuals, horny co-eds, a psych professor in search of the theory of shame, and of course her beloved Yoshioka, who has become an elusive campus nobody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fq56YBNKzLiLXGKO9RT3DpEltBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64536'),
  ('268391128944956292', 'Bumpy', 1981, 'Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Henn Eller, Helle Karis, Ago Ruus', 'Helgi Oidermaa, Helle Karis, Olav Ehala', 'Egert Soll, Anna-Liisa Kurve, Ülari Kirsipuu, Mari Jüssi, Ingrid Maasik, Tanel Kapper, Mihkel Raud, Heiki Moorlat', null, 'Brother and sister Kusti and Iti get lost in a forest while picking strawberries and are captured by an evil forest hag. They are made to work for her. The hag has a son called Bumpy whom Iti befriends. When they get a chance to escape, they decide to take Bumpy with them.', 'Brother and sister Kusti and Iti get lost in a forest while picking strawberries and are captured by an evil forest hag. They are made to work for her. The hag has a son called Bumpy whom Iti befriends. When they get a chance to escape, they decide to take Bumpy with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sy70KhZqUXvuMZ1zpowhV1JLoFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260026'),
  ('798444438920954074', 'Bun Hay Mean : le Chinois marrant', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Bun-hay Mean', null, 'Between stand up comedy, skits and hilarious improv, Bun Hay Mean reveals why the Chinese Man is the future of humankind. The show "Chinois Marrant" ("Funny Chinese Guy") is a must-watch concept!', 'Between stand up comedy, skits and hilarious improv, Bun Hay Mean reveals why the Chinese Man is the future of humankind. The show "Chinois Marrant" ("Funny Chinese Guy") is a must-watch concept!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeulpmJY5khCYw4lUNYEWm30CSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612078'),
  ('225594557174117916', 'Bunch of Five', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Erik Poppe, John Christian Rosenlund', 'Erik Poppe, Hans Petter Blad', 'Maikel Andressen Abou-Zelof, Jalal Zahedjekta, Sharjil Arshed, Mickael Marman, Seth Raknes, Kiyana Faravardeh, Irina Eidsvold Tøien, Damir Dado Pudar', null, 'Jonas and Emir are members of a criminal gang of 14-15 year-olds in Oslo. Emir has slight brain-damage after being beaten by his father as a 5-year-old, and Jonas'' biggest problem is stopping Emir from hitting people on the head. One day, they are offered a job by a gang of drug-dealers: Deliver a packet of heroin to one guy and beat up another. This is the start of a chain of events that sends their lives spiraling out of control.', 'Jonas and Emir are members of a criminal gang of 14-15 year-olds in Oslo. Emir has slight brain-damage after being beaten by his father as a 5-year-old, and Jonas'' biggest problem is stopping Emir from hitting people on the head. One day, they are offered a job by a gang of drug-dealers: Deliver a packet of heroin to one guy and beat up another. This is the start of a chain of events that sends their lives spiraling out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIa3uVmGysTYsKvKrMENnZ8eqd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62819'),
  ('940772896524938092', 'Bunch of Kunst - A Film About Sleaford Mods', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Christine Franz', 'Christine Franz', 'Jason Williamson, Andrew Fearn, Steve Underwood, Claire Herron Williamson, Iggy Pop, Geoff Travis, Neil Barnes, Steve ''Ignorant'' Williams', null, 'Documentary following British punk duo Sleaford Mods on their two year journey from Nottingham bedroom recording sessions to chart success', 'Documentary following British punk duo Sleaford Mods on their two year journey from Nottingham bedroom recording sessions to chart success', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWsHnLjUUmDLJ6G08QLFiaDyxSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454035'),
  ('850091369725262704', 'Bundle of Joy', 1956, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, William E. Snyder', 'Robert Carson, Norman Krasna', 'Eddie Fisher, Debbie Reynolds, Adolphe Menjou, Tommy Noonan, Nita Talbot, Una Merkel, Melville Cooper, Bill Goodwin', 'NR', 'Kitschy musical remake of "Bachelor Mother". Debbie Reynolds plays an over-eager clerk in a large department store and Eddie Fisher plays the boss'' son. After getting fired from her job, she finds an adorable baby on the steps of the foundling home and the folks inside mistake her for the mother. Fisher, well-meaning, but obtuse, tries to help her out with the baby, and the buds of romance begin to appear. Meanwhile old Merlin, the owner of the store, thinks he just might be a grandfather...', 'Kitschy musical remake of "Bachelor Mother". Debbie Reynolds plays an over-eager clerk in a large department store and Eddie Fisher plays the boss'' son. After getting fired from her job, she finds an adorable baby on the steps of the foundling home and the folks inside mistake her for the mother. Fisher, well-meaning, but obtuse, tries to help her out with the baby, and the buds of romance begin to appear. Meanwhile old Merlin, the owner of the store, thinks he just might be a grandfather...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/985HGOBUWNPwKmSGxHgFNTrySQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43257'),
  ('981921211722866280', 'Bungalow', 2002, 'Drama', 'Ulrich Köhler, Patrick Orth, Ute Freund', 'Henrike Goetz, Ulrich Köhler', 'Lennie Burmeister, Trine Dyrholm, Devid Striesow, Nicole Gläser, Jörg Malchow, Maria Hagewald, Frank Breitenreiter, Steffen Münster', 'NR', 'A young German soldier named Paul goes AWOL and returns to his childhood home in the countryside. Over a few summer days, Paul evades the responsibilities of everyday life and falls in love with his brother’s girlfriend, disrupting the lives of everyone in his circle.', 'A young German soldier named Paul goes AWOL and returns to his childhood home in the countryside. Over a few summer days, Paul evades the responsibilities of everyday life and falls in love with his brother’s girlfriend, disrupting the lives of everyone in his circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbHQehNiUqkeNJchoriC9L0OU1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40640'),
  ('1015036096987556523', 'Bungee Jumping of Their Own', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kim Dae-seung, Lee Ji-won, Won Myeong-jun', 'Ko Eun-nim', 'Lee Byung-hun, Lee Eun-ju, Yeo Hyun-soo, Hong Soo-hyun, Namkoong Min, Lee Jae-yong, Im Jae-geun, Lee Beom-soo', null, 'A likeable, married high school teacher spirals out of control when a student in his class begins unintentionally reminding him of his doomed first love, which ended 17 years earlier.', 'A likeable, married high school teacher spirals out of control when a student in his class begins unintentionally reminding him of his doomed first love, which ended 17 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJTDjWhcy67lRfFwRXJkcyvHEMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83013'),
  ('218551306034689516', 'Bungo Stray Dogs the Movie: BEAST', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Fantasy', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Shu G. Momose', 'Kafka Asagiri', 'Shouhei Hashimoto, Yuki Torigoe, Rui Tabuchi, Masashi Taniguchi, Ayaka Konno, Teruma, Nagae Ryoki, Kosuke Kuwano', null, 'Set in an alternative world of Bungo Stray Dogs, this "what-if" story imagines if Atsushi Nakajima was in the Port Mafia and Ryūnosuke Akutagawa was in the Armed Detective Agency, instead of vice-versa. The story follows Ryūnosuke Akutagawa, who vows revenge on a man dressed in black in order to rescue his sister. However, as he is about to starve to death, a man from the Armed Detective Agency appears.', 'Set in an alternative world of Bungo Stray Dogs, this "what-if" story imagines if Atsushi Nakajima was in the Port Mafia and Ryūnosuke Akutagawa was in the Armed Detective Agency, instead of vice-versa. The story follows Ryūnosuke Akutagawa, who vows revenge on a man dressed in black in order to rescue his sister. However, as he is about to starve to death, a man from the Armed Detective Agency appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyWsNdKNcermjFvH8MOK7U4jUSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973737'),
  ('786551114361383698', 'Bungo Stray Dogs: Dead Apple', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'Satoshi Hattori, Nahoko Iiyama, Yumi Shimojo', 'Kafka Asagiri', 'Kensho Ono, Mamoru Miyano, Kisho Taniyama, Yuto Uemura, Akira Ishida, Sora Amamiya, Rikiya Koyama, Sumire Morohoshi', 'PG-13', 'A large scale catastrophe is occurring across the planet. Ability users are discovered after the appearance of a mysterious fog, apparently having committed suicide, so the Armed Detective Agency sets out to investigate these mysterious deaths. The case seems to involve an unknown ability user referred to as "Collector," a man who could be the mastermind behind the incident. Trust and courage are put to the test in order to save the city of Yokohama and ability users across the world from the grip of Collector where the Armed Detective Agency forms an unlikely partnership with the dangerous Port Mafia.', 'A large scale catastrophe is occurring across the planet. Ability users are discovered after the appearance of a mysterious fog, apparently having committed suicide, so the Armed Detective Agency sets out to investigate these mysterious deaths. The case seems to involve an unknown ability user referred to as "Collector," a man who could be the mastermind behind the incident. Trust and courage are put to the test in order to save the city of Yokohama and ability users across the world from the grip of Collector where the Armed Detective Agency forms an unlikely partnership with the dangerous Port Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ueB7Kxq2GObp5aDw6rsdzVefzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483455'),
  ('409218132393662781', 'Bunker', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, War', 'Adrian Langley, Anthony E. Cabral', 'Michael Huntsman', 'Roger Clark, Luke Baines, Sean Cullen, Julian Feder, Kayla Jenee Radomski, Eddie Ramos, Kevin Tanski, Patrick Moltane', null, 'Trapped in a bunker during World War I, a group of soldiers are faced with an ungodly presence that slowly turns them against each other.', 'Trapped in a bunker during World War I, a group of soldiers are faced with an ungodly presence that slowly turns them against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOA7chFPVzSyPp2DaRg8hqA1BHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032666'),
  ('69473773110193211', 'Bunker Hill Bunny', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Friz Freleng', 'Tedd Pierce', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sam Von Schamm The Hessian and Bugs Bunny fight it out in the little known American Revolutionary War Battle of Bagel Heights.', 'Sam Von Schamm The Hessian and Bugs Bunny fight it out in the little known American Revolutionary War Battle of Bagel Heights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie4XmGir7WWV5quqWnSzvcJv5G1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145813'),
  ('452605733126130693', 'Bunker of the Dead', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Comedy', 'Matthias Olof Eich', 'Bernd Strack', 'Sarita Bradley, Patrick Jahns, Aciel Martinez Pol, Esther Maaß, Andreas Pape, Esther Maaß, Christopher Lee Meadows, Carlos Lobo', null, 'After Using the instructions found in an old Jewish diary, Markus and Thomas hope to gain access to a WW II underground military base formerly codenamed: Cerusit. It was used by the Nazis as a secret research institute and is shrouded in rumors to this day about the lost gold of the Third Reich. The entrance to the cave system, however, lies right within the restricted area of a U.S. military base.. the first of many problems Markus and Thomas will have to face.', 'After Using the instructions found in an old Jewish diary, Markus and Thomas hope to gain access to a WW II underground military base formerly codenamed: Cerusit. It was used by the Nazis as a secret research institute and is shrouded in rumors to this day about the lost gold of the Third Reich. The entrance to the cave system, however, lies right within the restricted area of a U.S. military base.. the first of many problems Markus and Thomas will have to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1LVK2OhhqTxPEJ31OunxAVA7zh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381214'),
  ('407636991211921672', 'Bunker Palace Hotel', 1989, 'Science Fiction', 'Enki Bilal', 'Enki Bilal, Pierre Christin', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Carole Bouquet, Maria Schneider, Roger Dumas, Yann Collette, Philippe Morier-Genoud, Hans Meyer, Benoît Régent', null, 'In an imaginary dictature of a futuristic world, rebellion has broken out. The men in power scramble to the Bunker Palace Hotel, a bunker built long ago for just this kind of contingency. But a rebel spy sneaks in, and although her nature is very quickly suspected, she is left to observe the raving of the decadent power class, who keeps wondering what happened to their leader, who has failed to show up.', 'In an imaginary dictature of a futuristic world, rebellion has broken out. The men in power scramble to the Bunker Palace Hotel, a bunker built long ago for just this kind of contingency. But a rebel spy sneaks in, and although her nature is very quickly suspected, she is left to observe the raving of the decadent power class, who keeps wondering what happened to their leader, who has failed to show up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMPgo5p28nbS7AK6xOXxXPx7zVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37839'),
  ('168151825523332289', 'Bunks', 2013, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Horror', 'Tibor Takács, Michael Marshall', 'Mike Kiss, Tim Burns, Jennifer Pertsch', 'Dylan Schmid, Aidan Shipley, Emilia McCarthy, Atticus Mitchell, Nicholas Bode, Leigh Truant, Kristen Harris, Samantha Kendrick', null, 'When two trouble-making brothers scam their way into an idyllic summer camp, they find themselves leading a rag tag cabin of boys into breaking every rule in the book.', 'When two trouble-making brothers scam their way into an idyllic summer camp, they find themselves leading a rag tag cabin of boys into breaking every rule in the book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjjM5UtH95Er9mkLqayn0XuBmbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280892'),
  ('649836287104618300', 'Bunny', 1998, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Chris Wedge', 'Chris Wedge', 'Elsa Keka, Isabella Linney, Chris Wedge', null, 'Bunny, an elderly rabbit who uses a walker, is in her kitchen one night baking a cake. A photograph from her wedding day is on her wall. A pesky and persistent moth bangs about the kitchen. She shoos it outside, turns off the porch light, and returns to her baking. The moth finds its way back into the kitchen, she bats it with a wooden spoon, and it falls into the mix. She stirs it up, pours the batter into a pan, and pops it into the oven. But the moth isn''t done: it has a different mission, turning the oven into a portal, and inviting Bunny on a voyage of reunion.', 'Bunny, an elderly rabbit who uses a walker, is in her kitchen one night baking a cake. A photograph from her wedding day is on her wall. A pesky and persistent moth bangs about the kitchen. She shoos it outside, turns off the porch light, and returns to her baking. The moth finds its way back into the kitchen, she bats it with a wooden spoon, and it falls into the mix. She stirs it up, pours the batter into a pan, and pops it into the oven. But the moth isn''t done: it has a different mission, turning the oven into a portal, and inviting Bunny on a voyage of reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CApdJg7tPwLMp2EJy7JudHWMYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48610'),
  ('909155834440714640', 'Bunny', 2025, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Jackson Hunt, Ben Jacobson, Dayna Schutz', 'Ben Jacobson, Mo Stark, Stefan Marolachakis', 'Mo Stark, Ben Jacobson, Henry Czerny, Michael Abbott Jr., Ajay Naidu, Liz Caribel Sierra, Liza Colby, Anthony Drazan', null, 'Two best friends rally the neighbors in their tenement building to help them hide a dead body over the best/worst night of their lives.', 'Two best friends rally the neighbors in their tenement building to help them hide a dead body over the best/worst night of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFPGHCC7yJrtoL6C3jlcXhutq3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422004'),
