  ('872585731915836333', 'Bunny the Killer Thing', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Joonas Makkonen, Tero Saikkonen', 'Joonas Makkonen', 'Hiski Hämäläinen, Enni Ojutkangas, Veera W. Vilo, Jari Manninen, Katja Jaskari, Roope Olenius, Olli Saarenpää, Vincent Tsang', null, 'A group of seven young friends travel to a cabin in the dark woods of Finland for the weekend, where they have the misfortune of encountering a creature that''s half-human, half-rabbit. In addition to satisfying its killer instinct, the ferocious creature also needs to satiate another pressing appetite.', 'A group of seven young friends travel to a cabin in the dark woods of Finland for the weekend, where they have the misfortune of encountering a creature that''s half-human, half-rabbit. In addition to satisfying its killer instinct, the ferocious creature also needs to satiate another pressing appetite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jf60iokom85QDGkIjc18bB6yA3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343701'),
