  ('513461915681198871', 'Bunnyman', 2011, 'Horror', 'Carl Lindbergh, John Grove', 'Carl Lindbergh', 'Cheryl Texiera, Matthew Albrecht, Alaina Gianci, Veronica Wylie, Scott Kuza, Karen Brown Cronin, Andrew Chavez, Joseph Darden', 'R', 'Bunnyman is the story of a group of friends on their way back from a spontaneous weekend trip to Las Vegas, and while driving through the remote regions of southern California they suddenly find themselves in a sickening game of cat and mouse with a five ton dumptruck and, when looking for help, stumble upon a nightmarish family who takes pleasure in dismembering and eating as many of the kids as possible.', 'Bunnyman is the story of a group of friends on their way back from a spontaneous weekend trip to Las Vegas, and while driving through the remote regions of southern California they suddenly find themselves in a sickening game of cat and mouse with a five ton dumptruck and, when looking for help, stumble upon a nightmarish family who takes pleasure in dismembering and eating as many of the kids as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiRhMkZggipHrEU4xLpg6r5uOV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71326'),
  ('345394017971928406', 'Bunnyman Vengeance', 2017, 'Horror', 'Carl Lindbergh', 'Carl Lindbergh', 'Olivia Stiefel, Debby Gerber, Toby Marks, Boriana Williams, Diana Prince, Bradley Bundlie, Jake Ryan Scott, Marshal Hilton', null, 'The man known as Bunnyman returns home to find his family running a haunted house attraction. The family welcomes him home, but soon realizes you cannot domesticate a wild animal. Death and mayhem ensue as the family turn on one another to fulfill their bloodlust.', 'The man known as Bunnyman returns home to find his family running a haunted house attraction. The family welcomes him home, but soon realizes you cannot domesticate a wild animal. Death and mayhem ensue as the family turn on one another to fulfill their bloodlust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5L7ourlyitMAVzJH4hfBG5qVkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482325'),
  ('288622061367312068', 'Bunraku', 2010, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Guy Moshe, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Michael E. Goldman', 'Guy Moshe', 'Josh Hartnett, Demi Moore, Woody Harrelson, Ron Perlman, GACKT, Shun Sugata, Jordi Mollà, Emily Kaiho', 'R', 'In a world with no guns, a mysterious drifter, a bartender and a young samurai plot revenge against a ruthless leader and his army of thugs, headed by nine diverse and deadly assassins.', 'In a world with no guns, a mysterious drifter, a bartender and a young samurai plot revenge against a ruthless leader and his army of thugs, headed by nine diverse and deadly assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VG9XFig4djqZEEot3PGGWeIpkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30618'),
  ('211626087209533710', 'Bunshinsaba', 2012, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Ahn Byeong-ki', 'Ahn Byeong-ki', 'Mei Ting, Ma Shuliang, Wu Chao, Zhu Jiangdi, Guo Jingfei, Gao Xinyu', null, 'A writer discovers that her husband is released from prison and is after her and her son soon she takes a hideout in an old house where mysterious events begin to happen.', 'A writer discovers that her husband is released from prison and is after her and her son soon she takes a hideout in an old house where mysterious events begin to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t22IExWPDkty7MeD1giM1TPnv2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287174'),
  ('303705752809372392', 'Bunshinsaba: Ouija Board', 2004, 'Horror', 'Ahn Byeong-ki, Kim Dong-cheon', 'Ahn Byeong-ki', 'Kim Gyu-ri, Lee Se-eun, Lee Yu-ri, Choi Seong-min, Choi Jung-yoon, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Lee Ji-hyeon', null, 'Yu-jin and her blind mother move to a small village from Seoul. On her first day at the new school, Yu-jin gets picked on by her classmates. Along with other victims of hatred, Yu-jin puts a curse on the four girls tormenting them through a Ouija Board. On her second day at school, one of the spellbound bursts into flames and dies just as she sits down where Yu-jin used the board. Next day, another victim burns to death, and now the school is enclosed by horror.', 'Yu-jin and her blind mother move to a small village from Seoul. On her first day at the new school, Yu-jin gets picked on by her classmates. Along with other victims of hatred, Yu-jin puts a curse on the four girls tormenting them through a Ouija Board. On her second day at school, one of the spellbound bursts into flames and dies just as she sits down where Yu-jin used the board. Next day, another victim burns to death, and now the school is enclosed by horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24DnruFa2Jr5j9ay6J7XiI8GOvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32173'),
  ('957195596470596592', 'Bunty Aur Babli', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Avik Mukhopadhyay, Shaad Ali, Arjun Mathur', 'Jaideep Sahni', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Rani Mukerji, Amitabh Bachchan, Raj Babbar, Rameshwari Talluri, Puneet Issar, Kiran Juneja, Pratima Kazmi', null, 'Bunty and Babli are two young people who randomly meet each other after running away from their homes to chase their dream. After facing hurdles in their path they decide to take up conning and soon become the best con artists in the country. However, their success is threatened as a relentless cop is on their trail.', 'Bunty and Babli are two young people who randomly meet each other after running away from their homes to chase their dream. After facing hurdles in their path they decide to take up conning and soon become the best con artists in the country. However, their success is threatened as a relentless cop is on their trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32OxUzs9ETQ3QvLFFYaDuuAtq3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11763'),
  ('531356329221890020', 'Bunty Aur Babli 2', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Gavemic U Ary, Shanoo Sharma, Varun V. Sharma', 'Varun V. Sharma', 'Saif Ali Khan, Rani Mukerji, Siddhant Chaturvedi, Sharvari, Pankaj Tripathi, Agrim Mittal, Rajiv Gupta, Brijendra Kala', null, 'Bunty and Babli are forced out of retirement as a new pair of cons emerge, doing robberies in their name with their trademark sigil across India.', 'Bunty and Babli are forced out of retirement as a new pair of cons emerge, doing robberies in their name with their trademark sigil across India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jsd1LOE2nuhJ7FT0m4jph5OIkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666390'),
  ('1058106542080348589', 'Bunuel and King Solomon''s Table', 2001, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Carlos Saura, Elena Arnao, Josep Oriach', 'Carlos Saura, Agustín Sánchez Vidal', 'El Gran Wyoming, Pere Arquillué, Ernesto Alterio, Adrià Collado, Valeria Marini, Amira Casar, Jean-Claude Carrière, Juan Luis Galiardo', null, 'The old Spanish filmmaker Luis Buñuel (1900-83) imagines a movie plot, set in Toledo in the future 2002, about the fantastic adventure of three actors, who play him and his friends, the painter Salvador Dalí (1904-89) and the poet Federico García Lorca (1898-1936), and their search for King Solomon''s table, a mythical artifact capable of revealing the past, present and future.', 'The old Spanish filmmaker Luis Buñuel (1900-83) imagines a movie plot, set in Toledo in the future 2002, about the fantastic adventure of three actors, who play him and his friends, the painter Salvador Dalí (1904-89) and the poet Federico García Lorca (1898-1936), and their search for King Solomon''s table, a mythical artifact capable of revealing the past, present and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4H5r5ANSJNg1VrbhmkwFmEVDquj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30651'),
  ('849940641918901769', 'Buñuel in the Labyrinth of the Turtles', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Salvador Simó, Manuel Galiana', 'Eligio R. Montero, Salvador Simó', 'Jorge Usón, Fernando Ramos, Luis Enrique de Tomás, Cyril Corral, Javier Balas, Gabriel Latorre, Pepa Gracia, Fermín Núñez', 'PG-13', 'Paris, 1930. Luis Buñuel is penniless after the scandal surrounding the release of his last movie. Sculptor Ramón Acín, a good friend, buys a lottery ticket and promises Buñuel that he will pay for his next movie if he wins the prize.', 'Paris, 1930. Luis Buñuel is penniless after the scandal surrounding the release of his last movie. Sculptor Ramón Acín, a good friend, buys a lottery ticket and promises Buñuel that he will pay for his next movie if he wins the prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHYRYgEcpjD6tXRxMr5xisjJCU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510318'),
  ('657861329850818632', 'Buona giornata', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Paolino Blandano, Carlo Tafani', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Diego Abatantuono, Lino Banfi, Vincenzo Salemme, Christian De Sica, Maurizio Mattioli, Tosca D''Aquino, Teresa Mannino, Paolo Conticini', null, 'A common day in the actual Italy, narrated by the different stories of seven different people, it''s the starting point for an overview to the 21st century''s italian society, among corrupt politicians, unfaithful husbands, hardcore soccer fans and dishonest businessmen.', 'A common day in the actual Italy, narrated by the different stories of seven different people, it''s the starting point for an overview to the 21st century''s italian society, among corrupt politicians, unfaithful husbands, hardcore soccer fans and dishonest businessmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stryeFI6GpYc0YByEyVpLra0b5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121286'),
  ('1031536055402843685', 'Buona Sera, Mrs. Campbell', 1968, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Melvin Frank, Gábor Pogány', 'Denis Norden, Sheldon Keller, Melvin Frank', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Shelley Winters, Phil Silvers, Peter Lawford, Telly Savalas, Lee Grant, Janet Margolin, Marian McCargo', 'PG', 'After the end of WWII, an Italian woman receives child support payments from three former US soldiers who all believe themselves to be the father of her daughter, Gia.', 'After the end of WWII, an Italian woman receives child support payments from three former US soldiers who all believe themselves to be the father of her daughter, Gia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wccUNceVo65LmtDaIXqXhKNghM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32831'),
  ('325847949424213207', 'Buoyancy', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rodd Rathjen, Greg Cobain, Sreyra In', 'Rodd Rathjen', 'Sarm Heng, Thanawut Ketsaro, Rous Mony, Saichia Wongwirot, Yothin Udomsanti, Chan Visal, Chheung Vakhim, Terb Sophon', null, 'An innocent Cambodian boy is sold to a Thai broker and enslaved on a fishing trawler. As fellow slaves are tortured and murdered around him, he starts to wonder if his only hope of freedom is to become as violent as his captors.', 'An innocent Cambodian boy is sold to a Thai broker and enslaved on a fishing trawler. As fellow slaves are tortured and murdered around him, he starts to wonder if his only hope of freedom is to become as violent as his captors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8auHBNeQHijubR3q6BgvBGzpdrI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528089'),
  ('307597077400784328', 'Burden', 2018, 'Drama', 'Andrew Heckler, Jeremy Rouse, Rich Delia', 'Andrew Heckler', 'Garrett Hedlund, Andrea Riseborough, Forest Whitaker, Tom Wilkinson, Usher, Tess Harper, Anna Colwell, Austin Hébert', 'R', 'Ku Klux Klansman Mike Burden opens the Redneck Shop and KKK museum in historic Laurens, SC. He subsequently falls in love with a single mother and, under her influence, quits the Klan and is taken in by an African American Reverend.', 'Ku Klux Klansman Mike Burden opens the Redneck Shop and KKK museum in historic Laurens, SC. He subsequently falls in love with a single mother and, under her influence, quits the Klan and is taken in by an African American Reverend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23tMG9TdzcABOpnTlgfIGZtQ6DN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424201'),
  ('579110428065061965', 'Burden of Dreams', 1982, 'Documentary', 'Les Blank, Les Blank, Maureen Gosling', 'Michael Goodwin', 'Candace Laughlin, Werner Herzog, Klaus Kinski, Claudia Cardinale, Alfredo de Río Tambo, Ángela Reina, Carmen Correa, Elia de Río Ene', null, 'The Amazon rain forest, 1979. The crew of Fitzcarraldo (1982), a film directed by German director Werner Herzog, soon finds itself with problems related to casting, tribal struggles and accidents, among many other setbacks; but nothing compared to dragging a huge steamboat up a mountain, while Herzog embraces the path of a certain madness to make his vision come true.', 'The Amazon rain forest, 1979. The crew of Fitzcarraldo (1982), a film directed by German director Werner Herzog, soon finds itself with problems related to casting, tribal struggles and accidents, among many other setbacks; but nothing compared to dragging a huge steamboat up a mountain, while Herzog embraces the path of a certain madness to make his vision come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJuD9yZ7Mn9QCVqKO9WarNNYo4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42124'),
  ('902908576740360076', 'Bureau 749', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Lu Chuan, Victor Van De Velde', 'Lu Chuan', 'Karry Wang, Miao Miao, Ryan Zheng, Ren Min, Xin Baiqing, Jerry Lee, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Yang Haoyu', null, 'A traumatized young man with physical abnormalities is forced to join a mysterious bureau to confront a disaster spreading across the earth caused by an unknown creature. He embarks on an adventure uncovering mysteries about his life.', 'A traumatized young man with physical abnormalities is forced to join a mysterious bureau to confront a disaster spreading across the earth caused by an unknown creature. He embarks on an adventure uncovering mysteries about his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flykCMw22y6yv8vKnBjmsW3pneo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033462'),
  ('925452162234171603', 'Bureau of Missing Persons', 1933, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Roy Del Ruth, Maxwell Arnow, Barney McGill', 'Robert Presnell Sr.', 'Bette Davis, Lewis Stone, Pat O''Brien, Glenda Farrell, Allen Jenkins, Ruth Donnelly, Hugh Herbert, Alan Dinehart', 'NR', 'Butch Saunders has been transferred to Missing Persons because he was too brutal in other police work...', 'Butch Saunders has been transferred to Missing Persons because he was too brutal in other police work...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grDoaGUj3Ue9N3NdwHnpHJLfm9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52227'),
  ('847095609679266320', 'Burga', 2023, 'Horror', 'Alfredo Contreras, Jorge Mantecón Miguel, Daniel Ruiz Pernía', 'Alfredo Contreras', 'Mercè Llorens, Manuel Galiana, Fernando Esteso, Miguel Molina, Abdelatif Hwidar', null, 'Elena wakes up in a mental hospital room with no memory of anything. They tell her that she suffers from amnesia and that she suffers from paranoid schizophrenia. However, nothing is what it seems, and Elena will have to find a way to escape from there while fighting to keep her sanity and not confuse hallucinations with reality.', 'Elena wakes up in a mental hospital room with no memory of anything. They tell her that she suffers from amnesia and that she suffers from paranoid schizophrenia. However, nothing is what it seems, and Elena will have to find a way to escape from there while fighting to keep her sanity and not confuse hallucinations with reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUFZGYWlDU1SqfvV3ph3xrct013.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1031516'),
  ('538322657786723244', 'Burglar', 1987, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Hugh Wilson, William A. Fraker', 'Matthew Weisman, Jeph Loeb, Hugh Wilson', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Bobcat Goldthwait, G.W. Bailey, Lesley Ann Warren, John Goodman, Vyto Ruginis, James Handy, Anne DeSalvo', 'R', 'Bernice "Bernie" Rhodenbarr is a burglar by trade, and she runs a bookstore as well. Her friend Carl Hefler is a dog groomer. After a successful burglary, it''s discovered that a dead body was in the house she burgled. As she''s the only one who can be placed at the scene of the crime, she has to use her criminal skills to clear her name of the murder AND avoid getting charged with the burglary.', 'Bernice "Bernie" Rhodenbarr is a burglar by trade, and she runs a bookstore as well. Her friend Carl Hefler is a dog groomer. After a successful burglary, it''s discovered that a dead body was in the house she burgled. As she''s the only one who can be placed at the scene of the crime, she has to use her criminal skills to clear her name of the murder AND avoid getting charged with the burglary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3cRLXAdjsWQbXsiACosuTwrwmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38921'),
  ('348477633133880324', 'Burglary at Night', 1904, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gaston Velle', null, null, null, 'A man hides his valuables under his mattress before going to sleep, blissfully unaware of the two burglars on his roof.', 'A man hides his valuables under his mattress before going to sleep, blissfully unaware of the two burglars on his roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZNfsE5Kpy9dIli5srsWwCGvcQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196144'),
  ('124916336993522216', 'Burial', 2022, 'Thriller, War, Horror', 'Ben Parker, Rein Kotov, Nick Justin', 'Ben Parker', 'Charlotte Vega, Barry Ward, Dan Renton Skinner, Bill Milner, Niall Murphy, Kristo Viiding, Bashka Forrest, David Alexander', null, 'Set in the last days of World War II, a small band of Russian soldiers led by intelligence officer Brana Vasilyeva, who is tasked with trafficking the remains of Hitler back to Stalin in Russia. En route, the unit is attacked by German ‘Werewolf’ partisans and picked off one-by-one. Brana leads her surviving comrades in a last stand to ensure their ‘cargo’ doesn’t fall into the hands of those who would see it buried in order to hide the truth forever.', 'Set in the last days of World War II, a small band of Russian soldiers led by intelligence officer Brana Vasilyeva, who is tasked with trafficking the remains of Hitler back to Stalin in Russia. En route, the unit is attacked by German ‘Werewolf’ partisans and picked off one-by-one. Brana leads her surviving comrades in a last stand to ensure their ‘cargo’ doesn’t fall into the hands of those who would see it buried in order to hide the truth forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4D22vnat4DUm9a9TFPZ0abDEsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715370'),
  ('211171072120931366', 'Burial Ground', 1981, 'Horror', 'Andrea Bianchi, Gianfranco Mattioli', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Karin Well, Gianluigi Chirizzi, Mariangela Giordano, Antonella Antinori, Simone Mattioli, Pietro Barzocchini, Roberto Caporali, Claudio Zucchet', 'NR', 'A cursed country estate is besieged by horny houseguests, undead Etruscans, and the unusual relationship between a mother and her young son.', 'A cursed country estate is besieged by horny houseguests, undead Etruscans, and the unusual relationship between a mother and her young son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dhaGjDyqRyXjhK1Qs1m0e1QMRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24919'),
  ('714361966616025727', 'Burial of the Rats', 1995, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Dan Golden, Vladimir Klimov, Yusup Daniyalov', 'Tara McCann, Somtow Sucharitkul, Adrien Hein', 'Adrienne Barbeau, Maria Ford, Kevin Alber, Olga Kabo, Eduard Plaxin, Vladimir Kuleshov, Leonid Timtsunik, Maya Menglet', null, 'In 19th Century France, a young Bram Stoker is captured by a man-hating, all-female cult of thong bikini wearers. Aided by flesh-eating rats, the warrior women raid the lairs of evil men and punish them. Our hero must decide between his wish to escape the dangerous cult and his love for one of its members.', 'In 19th Century France, a young Bram Stoker is captured by a man-hating, all-female cult of thong bikini wearers. Aided by flesh-eating rats, the warrior women raid the lairs of evil men and punish them. Our hero must decide between his wish to escape the dangerous cult and his love for one of its members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pKdPiH7dOJ1jgYYQLhicB1Hgv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27482'),
  ('929912466822238738', 'Burial Path', 1978, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'The film begins with the image of a dead bird. The mind moves to forget, as well as to remember: this film graphs the process of forgetfulness against all oddities of remembered bird-shape.', 'The film begins with the image of a dead bird. The mind moves to forget, as well as to remember: this film graphs the process of forgetfulness against all oddities of remembered bird-shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92b28xVsLgxRqZ50IGsw4b2A7w6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144992'),
  ('611653790597146248', 'Buried', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Rodrigo Cortés, Susana García Díez, Eduard Grau', 'Chris Sparling', 'Ryan Reynolds, José Luis García Pérez, Robert Paterson, Stephen Tobolowsky, Samantha Mathis, Ivana Miño, Warner Loughlin, Erik Palladino', 'R', 'As an American civilian truck driver working in Iraq, Paul Conroy''s convoy is attacked by a group of Iraqi insurgents. Some time later, Paul awakes in a coffin with only a lighter, a cell phone, and his ever-growing anxiety. Faced with a dwindling oxygen supply and a dying battery, he must fight panic, despair, and delirium as he races against time to escape the claustrophobic death trap.', 'As an American civilian truck driver working in Iraq, Paul Conroy''s convoy is attacked by a group of Iraqi insurgents. Some time later, Paul awakes in a coffin with only a lighter, a cell phone, and his ever-growing anxiety. Faced with a dwindling oxygen supply and a dying battery, he must fight panic, despair, and delirium as he races against time to escape the claustrophobic death trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQP2sZngXzjh3NDIWzo9OVK5YVh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26388'),
  ('1074898138533077623', 'Buried Alive', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gérard Kikoïne, Gérard Loubeau', 'Jake Chesi, Stuart Lee', 'Robert Vaughn, Donald Pleasence, Karen Lorre, John Carradine, Ginger Lynn, Nia Long, William Butler, Janine Denison', null, 'A young woman goes to teach at the Ravenscroft Institute, a spooky old girls'' school overrun by ants and staffed by some unusual types. Spurred on by a series of horrific hallucinations, she begins to investigate the mysterious disappearances of several students.', 'A young woman goes to teach at the Ravenscroft Institute, a spooky old girls'' school overrun by ants and staffed by some unusual types. Spurred on by a series of horrific hallucinations, she begins to investigate the mysterious disappearances of several students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHanO22Os21g6ivNpCpK19dCbyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30711'),
  ('1125184097111219939', 'Buried Alive', 1990, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror, TV Movie', 'Frank Darabont, Jacques Haitkin, Randall Newsome', null, 'Tim Matheson, Jennifer Jason Leigh, William Atherton, Hoyt Axton, Jay Gerber, Wayne Grace, Donald Hotton, Brian Libby', 'R', 'A married woman and her lover plot to kill her husband to make off with the insurance money. However, their attempt to murder him using poisonous fish toxins backfires in surprising ways.', 'A married woman and her lover plot to kill her husband to make off with the insurance money. However, their attempt to murder him using poisonous fish toxins backfires in surprising ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75X5BCuZIsfZYxWZfhi02v4MudO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37865'),
  ('113315842009761818', 'Buried Alive', 2007, 'Horror', 'Robert Kurtzman, Phil Robinson', 'Art Monterastelli', 'Leah Rachel, Erin Reese, Ivan Padilla, Tobin Bell, Terence Jay, Lindsey Scott, Steve Sandvoss', 'NR', 'A college prank at an abandoned house accidentally awakens a frightening spirit.', 'A college prank at an abandoned house accidentally awakens a frightening spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGjRzBdlSwUnv2zoxpChWyttIBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18217'),
  ('496407648448207004', 'Buried Alive II', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jacques Haitkin, Tim Matheson, Chris Stoia', 'Walter Klenhard', 'Ally Sheedy, Stephen Caffrey, Tracey Needham, Tim Matheson, Brian Libby, Shawnette Baity, Clifton Daniel, Ron Dortch', null, 'A woman inherits a fortune, causing her husband and his lover to plot her demise by poisoning her. The only trouble is it only places her in a deep coma that resembles death. When an accident occurs in the embalmer''s office he doesn''t complete the embalming process, causing her to be buried alive. Awakening from the grave, she claws her way out and seeks revenge against the two who caused her supposed demise', 'A woman inherits a fortune, causing her husband and his lover to plot her demise by poisoning her. The only trouble is it only places her in a deep coma that resembles death. When an accident occurs in the embalmer''s office he doesn''t complete the embalming process, causing her to be buried alive. Awakening from the grave, she claws her way out and seeks revenge against the two who caused her supposed demise', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztg12ZJK2Vi8tHl9vsNxFJ1hc4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73336'),
  ('1123648501979329238', 'Buried in Barstow', 2022, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'Howard Deutch, Robert Brinkmann', 'Thompson Evans', 'Angie Harmon, Kristoffer Polaha, Lauren Richards, George Paez, Timothy Granaderos, Gabriel ''G-Rod'' Rodriguez, Bruce McGill, Ben Cain', 'PG-13', 'Hazel King is a single mother determined to shield her daughter from the life she once had as a hit woman while defending and protecting those who can''t protect themselves. Her dark past comes back to haunt her, despite her desire for a quiet life in Barstow.', 'Hazel King is a single mother determined to shield her daughter from the life she once had as a hit woman while defending and protecting those who can''t protect themselves. Her dark past comes back to haunt her, despite her desire for a quiet life in Barstow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jROLolTGKmAAeiPndRO0DpiUWNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942576'),
