  ('620252462703803422', 'Burke & Hare', 1972, 'Horror, Comedy, History', 'Don Picton, Ray Corbett, Vernon Sewell', 'Ernle Bradford', 'Harry Andrews, Glynn Edwards, Yootha Joyce, Françoise Pascal, Yutte Stensgaard, Robin Hawdon, Alan Tucker, Dee Shenderey', 'R', 'Two men go into business supplying medical colleges with cadavers by robbing graves.', 'Two men go into business supplying medical colleges with cadavers by robbing graves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNPB0L6sxkxPP5liyxh7jd2S3HF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60095'),
  ('661269719115098026', 'Burke & Hare', 2010, 'Comedy, Thriller, History, Horror', 'John Landis, John Mathieson, Bill Crutcher', 'Piers Ashworth, Nick Moorcroft', 'Simon Pegg, Andy Serkis, Isla Fisher, Georgia King, Tom Wilkinson, Tim Curry, Christopher Lee, Jessica Hynes', 'R', 'Two 19th-century opportunists become serial killers so that they can maintain their profitable business supplying cadavers to an anatomist.', 'Two 19th-century opportunists become serial killers so that they can maintain their profitable business supplying cadavers to an anatomist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VY3gKHPc9dRq8FshSXWbXtgD9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50204'),
  ('28570674779372666', 'Burlesk King', 1999, 'Drama', 'Mel Chionglo', 'Ricardo Lee', 'Rodel Velayo, Leonardo Litton, Elizabeth Oropesa, Raymond Bagatsing, Cherry Pie Picache, Gino Ilustre, Nini Jacinto, Joel Lamangan', null, 'Harry leaves Olongapo, the former site of American bases, with his best friend James. They end up in Manila where they soon find work as macho dancers in a gay bar run by Mama Odette. Harry has a troubled past -- his American father used to pimp him and his mother, Betty. When his father accidentally killed his mother, Harry struck out on his own. He made a vow to kill his father.', 'Harry leaves Olongapo, the former site of American bases, with his best friend James. They end up in Manila where they soon find work as macho dancers in a gay bar run by Mama Odette. Harry has a troubled past -- his American father used to pimp him and his mother, Betty. When his father accidentally killed his mother, Harry struck out on his own. He made a vow to kill his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sTwethehW84AGTXvMvHwIBCTyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183958'),
  ('735042452618965174', 'Burlesque', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Steve Antin, Bojan Bazelli', 'Steve Antin', 'Cher, Christina Aguilera, Cam Gigandet, Kristen Bell, Stanley Tucci, Eric Dane, Peter Gallagher, Julianne Hough', 'PG-13', 'Ali leaves behind a troubled life and follows her dreams to Los Angeles, where she lands a job as a cocktail waitress at the Burlesque Lounge, a once-majestic theater that houses an inspired musical revue. Vowing to perform there, she makes the leap from bar to stage, helping restore the club''s former glory.', 'Ali leaves behind a troubled life and follows her dreams to Los Angeles, where she lands a job as a cocktail waitress at the Burlesque Lounge, a once-majestic theater that houses an inspired musical revue. Vowing to perform there, she makes the leap from bar to stage, helping restore the club''s former glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3U9zBIibERQZqYKM3N1a4MYgBsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42297'),
  ('634003242907182975', 'Burma VJ: Reporting from a Closed Country', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Anders Østergaard', 'Anders Østergaard, Jan Krogsgaard', 'George W. Bush, Ko Muang, Aung San Suu Kyi', null, 'Going beyond the occasional news clip from Burma, the acclaimed filmmaker, Anders Østergaard, brings us close to the video journalists who deliver the footage. Though risking torture and life in jail, courageous young citizens of Burma live the essence of journalism as they insist on keeping up the flow of news from their closed country.', 'Going beyond the occasional news clip from Burma, the acclaimed filmmaker, Anders Østergaard, brings us close to the video journalists who deliver the footage. Though risking torture and life in jail, courageous young citizens of Burma live the essence of journalism as they insist on keeping up the flow of news from their closed country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAld4WLIUOP2rxt79UlDqhS9HlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26763'),
  ('758606636071837830', 'Burn', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Mike Gan, Jon Keng, Terri Martin', 'Mike Gan', 'Tilda Cobham-Hervey, Josh Hutcherson, Suki Waterhouse, Shiloh Fernandez, Harry Shum Jr., James Devoti, Robert Figueroa, John D. Hickman', 'R', 'Lonely, unstable gas station attendant Melinda is tired of being overshadowed by her more confident, outgoing co-worker Sheila. When the gas station is held up at gunpoint by Billy, a desperate man in need of quick cash, Melinda finds an opportunity to make a connection with the robber, regardless of who gets hurt.', 'Lonely, unstable gas station attendant Melinda is tired of being overshadowed by her more confident, outgoing co-worker Sheila. When the gas station is held up at gunpoint by Billy, a desperate man in need of quick cash, Melinda finds an opportunity to make a connection with the robber, regardless of who gets hurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifSMo5x7SDXpettRt8TWY9EOquM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508138'),
  ('799631716740312557', 'Burn After Reading', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'George Clooney, Frances McDormand, Brad Pitt, John Malkovich, Tilda Swinton, Richard Jenkins, Elizabeth Marvel, David Rasche', 'R', 'When a disc containing memoirs of a former CIA analyst falls into the hands of gym employees, Linda and Chad, they see a chance to make enough money for Linda to have life-changing cosmetic surgery. Predictably, events whirl out of control for the duo, and those in their orbit.', 'When a disc containing memoirs of a former CIA analyst falls into the hands of gym employees, Linda and Chad, they see a chance to make enough money for Linda to have life-changing cosmetic surgery. Predictably, events whirl out of control for the duo, and those in their orbit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdwSkQu3XirmX18MNj8CqFWsCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4944'),
  ('865247410477047381', 'Burn Burn Burn', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chanya Button, Carlos De Carvalho', 'Charlie Covell', 'Laura Carmichael, Chloe Pirrie, Jack Farthing, Joe Dempsie, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Alison Steadman, Sally Phillips, Alice Lowe', null, 'Following the death of their friend, two girls in their late twenties embark on a road trip to spread his ashes. Seph and Alex take turns driving. Dan is in the glove compartment, in tupperware, decreasing in volume as the trip progresses.', 'Following the death of their friend, two girls in their late twenties embark on a road trip to spread his ashes. Seph and Alex take turns driving. Dan is in the glove compartment, in tupperware, decreasing in volume as the trip progresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xIHyPahVGh7WJ1n1T5OvH0reE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359870'),
  ('802751726506846371', 'Burn It All', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Brady Hall, Brady Hall', 'Brady Hall', 'Elizabeth Cotter, Emily Gateley, Ryan Postell, Greg Michaels, John Branch, Elena Flory-Barnes, Nick Sage Palmieri, Adrian Renon', null, 'With a history of men dominating her fate, a broken woman returns to her hometown to bury her mother only to find a violent organ smuggling ring already has the body and wants no witnesses, but by trying to extinguish her they spark an inferno.', 'With a history of men dominating her fate, a broken woman returns to her hometown to bury her mother only to find a violent organ smuggling ring already has the body and wants no witnesses, but by trying to extinguish her they spark an inferno.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rP7RrA3I00OzKNzMKYtJgv4znsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788388'),
  ('585188767678351424', 'Burn Notice: The Fall of Sam Axe', 2011, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jeffrey Donovan', 'Matt Nix', 'Bruce Campbell, Kiele Sanchez, Chandra West, John Diehl, RonReaco Lee, Ilza Rosario, Jeffrey Donovan, Pedro Pascal', 'PG', 'Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we''ve come to know on Burn Notice. On what will turn out to be Sam''s last military mission, he is sent to the jungles of Colombia to investigate claims of a vicious terrorist organization known only as the "Espada Ardiente" (Flaming Sword). His mission: to determine whether U.S. military aid is necessary to deal with the threat. But when he arrives, things are more complicated than he''d imagined. He receives word that the rebels have targeted a small civilian clinic deep in the jungle. Sam must now save the clinic''s doctors and patients from certain death. However, nothing is as it seems and the Espada Ardiente may not be the biggest threat Sam Axe faces.', 'Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we''ve come to know on Burn Notice. On what will turn out to be Sam''s last military mission, he is sent to the jungles of Colombia to investigate claims of a vicious terrorist organization known only as the "Espada Ardiente" (Flaming Sword). His mission: to determine whether U.S. military aid is necessary to deal with the threat. But when he arrives, things are more complicated than he''d imagined. He receives word that the rebels have targeted a small civilian clinic deep in the jungle. Sam must now save the clinic''s doctors and patients from certain death. However, nothing is as it seems and the Espada Ardiente may not be the biggest threat Sam Axe faces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgQuP4qrsjw4kNgR3sYQeaCNllm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61537'),
  ('1145574383507026404', 'Burn Out', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Yann Gozlan, Antoine Roch', 'Simon Moutaïrou', 'François Civil, Olivier Rabourdin, Manon Azem, Samuel Jouy, Narcisse Mame, Sam Louwyck, Luc Schwarz, Naël Rabia', null, 'Tony, a promising young motorcycle racer, is forced to do perilous drug runs to save the mother of his child from a dangerous mobster.', 'Tony, a promising young motorcycle racer, is forced to do perilous drug runs to save the mother of his child from a dangerous mobster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LeFOvzjZuIC7cQiXDeSIy1ym7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460059'),
  ('233407981179551490', 'Burn the Bridges', 2007, 'Drama', 'Francisco Franco Alba, Erika Licea', 'María Renée Prudencio, Francisco Franco Alba', 'Ángel Onésimo Nevares, Irene Azuela, Claudette Maillé, Bernardo Benítez, Ramón Valdés Urtiz, Aida López, Juan Carlos Barreto, Jéssica Segura', null, 'A story of two teens, brother and sister, who live with their dying mother in a rundown mansion in Zacatecas, sustain by a dangerously dependent relationship.', 'A story of two teens, brother and sister, who live with their dying mother in a rundown mansion in Zacatecas, sustain by a dangerously dependent relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5onAWf8P7AC1ZEBbsR4T3S8NqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39905'),
  ('658360311744467649', 'Burn the Stage: The Movie', 2018, 'Music, Documentary', 'Park Jun-soo', null, 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', 'PG', 'Burn the Stage: the Movie is the first movie from BTS, going behind-the-scenes of the BTS WINGS TOUR to reveal the full story of the band’s meteoric rise to fame. This unmissable film provides an intimate look at what happens when the most successful global boy band of all time breaks down barriers and invades the mainstream music scene. Exclusive tour footage and brand-new one-on-one interviews with BTS members give fans an unprecedented glimpse into their lives and an opportunity for everyone to celebrate together worldwide.', 'Burn the Stage: the Movie is the first movie from BTS, going behind-the-scenes of the BTS WINGS TOUR to reveal the full story of the band’s meteoric rise to fame. This unmissable film provides an intimate look at what happens when the most successful global boy band of all time breaks down barriers and invades the mainstream music scene. Exclusive tour footage and brand-new one-on-one interviews with BTS members give fans an unprecedented glimpse into their lives and an opportunity for everyone to celebrate together worldwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJKy1yvnKh8UjcuYeG3Rt35xHFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553512'),
  ('214348851862778238', 'BURN THE WITCH #0.8', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Tatsuro Kawano, Natsuki Yamada, Tomoya Nakaza', 'Tite Kubo', 'Asami Tano, Yuina Yamada, Shimba Tsuchiya, Hiroaki Hirata, Rie Hikisaka, Subaru Kimura', null, 'Noel and Ninny are doing an everyday job for Wing Bind when the chief calls. Since the Sabres are not available, the two need to take care of a Dark Dragon that is causing trouble in Front London. But that is just where the problems begin.', 'Noel and Ninny are doing an everyday job for Wing Bind when the chief calls. Since the Sabres are not available, the two need to take care of a Dark Dragon that is causing trouble in Front London. But that is just where the problems begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNhpIb3IPEiEItt4xZpY1sRI5Dk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1179822'),
  ('26174554446279488', 'Burn Up', 1991, 'Animation', 'Kazuhiro Konshi, Yasunori Ide, Kunihiro Abe', 'Jun Kanzaki', 'Kumiko Nishihara, Yumiko Shibata, Norio Wakamoto, Shozo Iizuka, Hirokazu Hiramatsu', null, 'To the unsuspecting eye Maki, Reimi and Yuka may not look like ace crime fighters, which might explain why they''re stuck on traffic patrol instead of more "exciting" police duties. All that changes when Yuka gets herself kidnapped by a white slave organization run by a politically connected businessman who''s got the rest of the police cowed. Now it''s up to Maki and Reimi to don skin-tight battle armor, liberate a tank, and make sure that a certain slaver learns that when you play with fire, you''re going to get your ass burned!', 'To the unsuspecting eye Maki, Reimi and Yuka may not look like ace crime fighters, which might explain why they''re stuck on traffic patrol instead of more "exciting" police duties. All that changes when Yuka gets herself kidnapped by a white slave organization run by a politically connected businessman who''s got the rest of the police cowed. Now it''s up to Maki and Reimi to don skin-tight battle armor, liberate a tank, and make sure that a certain slaver learns that when you play with fire, you''re going to get your ass burned!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4v0rgZK5DtoE2UZ4dpwAcmTMQPO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55615'),
  ('208476311204738847', 'Burn!', 1969, 'History, Drama, War', 'Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Marcello Gatti, Gillo Pontecorvo', 'Giorgio Arlorio, Franco Solinas', 'Marlon Brando, Evaristo Márquez, Renato Salvatori, Dana Ghia, Valeria Ferran Wanani, Giampiero Albertini, Norman Hill, Thomas Lyons', null, 'The professional mercenary Sir William Walker instigates a slave revolt on the Caribbean island of Queimada in order to help improve the British sugar trade. Years later he is sent again to deal with the same rebels that he built up because they have seized too much power that now threatens British sugar interests.', 'The professional mercenary Sir William Walker instigates a slave revolt on the Caribbean island of Queimada in order to help improve the British sugar trade. Years later he is sent again to deal with the same rebels that he built up because they have seized too much power that now threatens British sugar interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgqPc7NR3CU07fkMjfsxUw4dcff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42617'),
  ('908389232176925126', 'BURN·E', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Angus MacLane', null, 'Angus MacLane, Tessa Swigart, Ben Burtt, Jeff Garlin, Elissa Knight', 'G', 'What lengths will a robot undergo to do his job? BURN·E is a dedicated hard working robot who finds himself locked out of his ship. BURN·E quickly learns that completing a simple task can often be a very difficult endeavor.', 'What lengths will a robot undergo to do his job? BURN·E is a dedicated hard working robot who finds himself locked out of his ship. BURN·E quickly learns that completing a simple task can often be a very difficult endeavor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wOReJq1vArLBSejND2Jbw0KeKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13413'),
  ('730984650585671460', 'Burning', 2014, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hallvard Bræin, Ragnhild Lund, Katinka Lotherington', 'Hallvard Bræin', 'Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Ida Husøy, Sven Nordin, Otto Jespersen, Jenny Skavlan, Henrik Mestad, Trond Halbo, Oskar Sandven Lundevold', null, 'For all who remember Cannonball Run. Here is a modern twist on the subject. The longest, wildest and funniest car race, ever. From Oslo to the North Cape. The only rule is getting there first!', 'For all who remember Cannonball Run. Here is a modern twist on the subject. The longest, wildest and funniest car race, ever. From Oslo to the North Cape. The only rule is getting there first!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEjOaUbG3AtNlfnS1UIWa13WtlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284279'),
  ('686442036719362455', 'Burning', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Park Si-hwan, Hong Kyung-pyo, Kim Chang-ho', 'Lee Chang-dong, Oh Jung-mi', 'Yoo Ah-in, Steven Yeun, Jeon Jong-seo, Kim Soo-kyung, Choe Seung-ho, Moon Sung-keun, Min Bok-gi, Ban Hye-ra', 'NR', 'Deliveryman Jong-su is out on a job when he runs into Hae-mi, a girl who once lived in his neighborhood. She asks if he''d mind looking after her cat while she''s away on a trip to Africa. On her return, she introduces to Jong-su an enigmatic young man named Ben, who she met during her trip. One day Ben tells Jong-su about his most unusual hobby.', 'Deliveryman Jong-su is out on a job when he runs into Hae-mi, a girl who once lived in his neighborhood. She asks if he''d mind looking after her cat while she''s away on a trip to Africa. On her return, she introduces to Jong-su an enigmatic young man named Ben, who she met during her trip. One day Ben tells Jong-su about his most unusual hobby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXiF80o74fE9gf3Utf9moAI7ar0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491584'),
  ('1004233444326075569', 'Burning 2', 2016, 'Comedy, Action', 'Hallvard Bræin, Askild Vik Edvardsen', 'Anne Elvedal, Linn-Jeanethe Kyed', 'Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Ida Husøy, Jonas Hoff Oftebro, Sven Nordin, Otto Jespersen, Vegar Hoel, Henrik Mestad, Stig Frode Henriksen', null, 'After two years in prison for participating in an illegal street race, Roy says no to a new illegal winter race from Bergen to Murmansk. But then he hears that his daughter will participate with a boyfriend.', 'After two years in prison for participating in an illegal street race, Roy says no to a new illegal winter race from Bergen to Murmansk. But then he hears that his daughter will participate with a boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg2StwcvrrwsI1k6AorpNMVDvq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417503'),
  ('489672081247196004', 'Burning at Both Ends', 2021, 'Drama, War', 'Landon Johnson, Matthew G. Hill, Spencer Hutchins', 'Landon Johnson, Matthew G. Hill', 'Cary Elwes, Jason Patric, Judd Hirsch, Sebastian Roché, Greer Grammer, Gilles Marini, Mira Furlan, Don Harvey', null, 'The movie follows a group of resistance radio broadcasters in Nazi-occupied France as they evade capture alongside a Jewish family.', 'The movie follows a group of resistance radio broadcasters in Nazi-occupied France as they evade capture alongside a Jewish family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQmWh7WJvtYH125kxUUoQbRZk2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529580'),
  ('572843545500042511', 'Burning Betrayal', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Diego Freitas, Victor Alencar, Helena Prado', 'Camila Raffanti', 'Giovanna Lancellotti, Leandro Lima, Camilla de Lucas, Bruno Montaleone, Micael Borges, Louise D''Tuani, Drayson Menezzes, Thadeu Matos', 'R', 'Babi discovers a betrayal by her long-term partner and decides to embark on a new adventure in life. On this journey, she meets judge Marco and they begin to live a story permeated by a lot of sexual tension.', 'Babi discovers a betrayal by her long-term partner and decides to embark on a new adventure in life. On this journey, she meets judge Marco and they begin to live a story permeated by a lot of sexual tension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MxgXI3VO7QCNnP0mPBjxLIemNM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1173558'),
  ('840966646387769261', 'Burning Blue', 2014, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'D.M.W. Greer', 'D.M.W. Greer, Helene Kvale', 'Trent Ford, Tammy Blanchard, Morgan Spector, Rob Mayes, William Lee Scott, Cotter Smith, Michael Cumpsty, Michael Sirow', 'R', 'Two Navy fighter pilots find themselves in the midst of a forbidden relationship throwing their lives and careers into disarray.', 'Two Navy fighter pilots find themselves in the midst of a forbidden relationship throwing their lives and careers into disarray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUpBD2EHyDpCLPATj8LFghiDCTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256196'),
  ('155857051551451895', 'Burning Bright', 2010, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Carlos Brooks, Michael McDonough', 'Christine Coyle Johnson, Julie Prendiville Roux', 'Briana Evigan, Garret Dillahunt, Charlie Tahan, Peggy Sheffield, Mary Rachel Quinn, Tom Nowicki, Meat Loaf, Andy Ussach', 'PG-13', 'After her lousy stepfather steals her savings to buy a vicious tiger, Kelly loses all hope of going to college. But Kelly''s situation worsens when a hurricane leaves her and her autistic brother boarded up in their house with the man-eating beast. This edge-of-your-seat thriller follows the gutsy heroine and her younger sibling as they struggle to outwit the ravenous predator and find a way to survive.', 'After her lousy stepfather steals her savings to buy a vicious tiger, Kelly loses all hope of going to college. But Kelly''s situation worsens when a hurricane leaves her and her autistic brother boarded up in their house with the man-eating beast. This edge-of-your-seat thriller follows the gutsy heroine and her younger sibling as they struggle to outwit the ravenous predator and find a way to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRzCoP6quj8SuLjklN3k1nkhqP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39957'),
  ('739008811273925800', 'Burning Days', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Irem Naz Demir, Damla Kırkalı, Manolya Maya', 'Emin Alper', 'Selahattin Paşalı, Ekin Koç, Selin Yeninci, Erol Babaoğlu, Erdem Şenocak, Sinan Demirer, Nizam Namidar, Ali Seçkiner Alıcı', null, 'With the mayoral election approaching, the newly-appointed state prosecutor of a small town suffering from a water supply crisis gradually descends into trouble after a young local woman is raped.', 'With the mayoral election approaching, the newly-appointed state prosecutor of a small town suffering from a water supply crisis gradually descends into trouble after a young local woman is raped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GH0Sv9zQwky0GrBQdHGej7kyau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682152'),
  ('738894823732196689', 'Burning Fuse', 1957, 'Crime', 'Henri Decoin', 'Henri Decoin, Albert Simonin, Jacques Robert', 'Raymond Pellegrin, Charles Vanel, Peter van Eyck, Lino Ventura, Françoise Fabian, Jacqueline Maillan, Lyla Rocco, Mathilde Casadesus', null, 'Lola, the wife of arms dealer Pedro Wassewich, is attracted to Ludovic, a young painter who turns out to be the emissary of a notorious gangster. He claims to have been sent by the latter to pick up a shipment. In fact, it''s the police who, behind the scenes, orchestrate the operation to catch Wassewich red-handed.', 'Lola, the wife of arms dealer Pedro Wassewich, is attracted to Ludovic, a young painter who turns out to be the emissary of a notorious gangster. He claims to have been sent by the latter to pick up a shipment. In fact, it''s the police who, behind the scenes, orchestrate the operation to catch Wassewich red-handed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwq0xE6AJlYjOTkwAvFtFHTT8dG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98306'),
  ('303062307593529969', 'Burning Ghost', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Stéphane Batut, Céline Bozon', 'Stéphane Batut, Christine Dory, Frédéric Videau', 'Thimotée Robart, Judith Chemla, Saadia Bentaïeb, Djolof Mbengue, Marie-José Kilolo Maputu, Cecilia Mangini, Bernard Mazzinghi, Frédéric Bonpart', null, 'Juste wanders the streets of Paris looking for people only he can see. He collects their last memory before helping them into the afterlife. One day Agathe, a young woman, recognizes him. She belongs to his previous life. She is alive and he is a ghost. How will they manage to love each other and seize this second chance?', 'Juste wanders the streets of Paris looking for people only he can see. He collects their last memory before helping them into the afterlife. One day Agathe, a young woman, recognizes him. She belongs to his previous life. She is alive and he is a ghost. How will they manage to love each other and seize this second chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bqjQDHMqBDrQkW2ZE2xh6npGEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597693'),
  ('183110134973018042', 'Burning Hearts', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pippo Mezzapesa, Michele D''Attanasio', 'Davide Serino, Antonella Gaeta, Pippo Mezzapesa', 'Elodie, Francesco Patanè, Francesco Di Leva, Lidia Vitale, Giovanni Trombetta, Letizia Pia Cartolaro, Giovanni Anzaldo, Gianni Lillo', null, 'Puglia. Burnt by the sun and by hatred, the promontory of Gargano is contested by criminals who seem to come from a remote past governed by the law of the jungle. An archaic land reminiscent of the Far West, in which blood is washed away with blood. An old feud between two rival families is rekindled by a forbidden love: the one between Andrea, reluctant heir of the Malatesta, and Marilena, beautiful wife of the boss of the Camporeale clan. A fatal passion that sets the two clans at war again. But Marilena, banished by the Camporeale and prisoner of the Malatesta, disputed and abused, will oppose a fate already written with a mother’s strength.', 'Puglia. Burnt by the sun and by hatred, the promontory of Gargano is contested by criminals who seem to come from a remote past governed by the law of the jungle. An archaic land reminiscent of the Far West, in which blood is washed away with blood. An old feud between two rival families is rekindled by a forbidden love: the one between Andrea, reluctant heir of the Malatesta, and Marilena, beautiful wife of the boss of the Camporeale clan. A fatal passion that sets the two clans at war again. But Marilena, banished by the Camporeale and prisoner of the Malatesta, disputed and abused, will oppose a fate already written with a mother’s strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Z8JtsK0le3R75DBZoVT839iXVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870724'),
  ('513519317547701125', 'Burning Love', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ate de Jong, Paul van den Bos', 'Rob Houwer, Ate de Jong', 'Monique van de Ven, Peter Jan Rens, Ellen Vogel, Huub van der Lubbe, Eliza Naber, Hetty Blok, Maya van den Broecke, Berend Boudewijn', null, 'A young painter takes up French lessons with an elder lady to ensure he’ll get a grant for a French arts institute. That way he meets Anna, a beautiful married woman nursing the lady’s old father, and falls in love with her.', 'A young painter takes up French lessons with an elder lady to ensure he’ll get a grant for a French arts institute. That way he meets Anna, a beautiful married woman nursing the lady’s old father, and falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTflXU3i7HQkzAM77nKl5qhocNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96496'),
  ('376941922393134578', 'Burning Love', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Caviglia', null, 'Davide Giordano, Anna Ferruzzo, Bianca Nappi, Omero Antonutti, Vinicio Marchioni, Margherita Buy, Carolina Crescentini, Francesco Pannofino', null, 'July 2006. Leonardo Zuliani has vanished. The news from Trastevere in Rome turns into a real national emergency, while a huge throng of followers gathers around the young activist’s house. His mother is beside herself with grief and the entire neighbourhood is paralysed. He’s on every TV channel and the authorities all express their solidarity with the family. Many can’t believe it’s true; they prefer to think it’s just one of his stunts. A genius in conveying his ideas, successful cartoonist, visionary fashion designer, cult author, human rights activist: but who is Leonardo deep down? With the help of leading experts and celebrities, the film traces his life, at last casting light on a key figure of our times', 'July 2006. Leonardo Zuliani has vanished. The news from Trastevere in Rome turns into a real national emergency, while a huge throng of followers gathers around the young activist’s house. His mother is beside herself with grief and the entire neighbourhood is paralysed. He’s on every TV channel and the authorities all express their solidarity with the family. Many can’t believe it’s true; they prefer to think it’s just one of his stunts. A genius in conveying his ideas, successful cartoonist, visionary fashion designer, cult author, human rights activist: but who is Leonardo deep down? With the help of leading experts and celebrities, the film traces his life, at last casting light on a key figure of our times', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m49vrt61oyJT3ys8LRu9pq9OSMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359256'),
  ('31321265773871990', 'Burning Man', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jonathan Teplitzky, Garry Phillips', 'Jonathan Teplitzky', 'Matthew Goode, Bojana Novaković, Essie Davis, Jack Heanly, Kerry Fox, Rachel Griffiths, Kate Beahan, Gia Carides', null, 'Tom is a British chef in a Bondi restaurant who seems to have decided there are no longer any rules he needs to obey. Whatever Tom is up to, his actions seem to be tolerated by those around him. As Tom descends into darkness, fragments of a different story begin to emerge. All the women in his world are trying in their own, very different ways to help put him back together.', 'Tom is a British chef in a Bondi restaurant who seems to have decided there are no longer any rules he needs to obey. Whatever Tom is up to, his actions seem to be tolerated by those around him. As Tom descends into darkness, fragments of a different story begin to emerge. All the women in his world are trying in their own, very different ways to help put him back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77MMrALY5KyJdHHNO3sClrVB9dz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73565'),
  ('384669357569819755', 'Burning Palms', 2010, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Christopher Landon, Seamus Tierney, Jeffrey F. January', 'Christopher Landon', 'Zoe Saldaña, Rosamund Pike, Lake Bell, Paz Vega, Shannen Doherty, Nick Stahl, Emily Meade, Robert Hoffman', 'R', 'A subversive tale that interlaces five stories set in Los Angeles, where no taboo is left unexplored as each character careens toward a dark and often comic fate', 'A subversive tale that interlaces five stories set in Los Angeles, where no taboo is left unexplored as each character careens toward a dark and often comic fate', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uNS6wOGGUgaUNtXMz32usyAmhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45013'),
  ('896257544506511701', 'Burning Paradise', 1994, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Chris Lee Kin-Sang, Gao Ziyi', 'Nam Yin, Wong Wan-Choi', 'Willie Chi Tin-Sang, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, John Ching Tung, Maggie Lam Chuen, Yang Sheng, Yuen Gam-Fai, Wong Kam-Kong, Wu Xiqian', null, 'An exotic, legendary battle between the forces of good and evil comes to life as the celebrated disciples of the Shaolin Temple -- monks who practice a lethal and spiritual form of martial arts -- fight the evil followers of China''s Manchu rulers.', 'An exotic, legendary battle between the forces of good and evil comes to life as the celebrated disciples of the Shaolin Temple -- monks who practice a lethal and spiritual form of martial arts -- fight the evil followers of China''s Manchu rulers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28g9NcnkG2eeCqakvgwZlo9iEay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58457'),
  ('843924230207862676', 'Burning Patience', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Rodrigo Sepúlveda, Maura Morales Bergmann', 'Guillermo Calderón', 'Andrew Bargsted, Vivianne Dietz, Claudio Arredondo, Paola Giannini, Amalia Kassai, Rodolfo Pulgar, Pablo Macaya, Trinidad González', 'PG-13', 'Mario is a young fisherman who dreams of becoming a poet. He gets a job as the postman to Pablo Neruda when the legendary writer moves there after being exiled from Chile.', 'Mario is a young fisherman who dreams of becoming a poet. He gets a job as the postman to Pablo Neruda when the legendary writer moves there after being exiled from Chile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCL4YZBsyobwDQZeLdJ0iGOrXvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025805'),
  ('841668433653592954', 'Burning Sands', 2017, 'Drama', 'Gerard McMurray, Isiah Donté Lee', 'Christine Berg, Gerard McMurray', 'Trevor Jackson, Alfre Woodard, Steve Harris, Tosin Cole, DeRon Horton, Trevante Rhodes, Serayah, Imani Hakim', null, 'Deep into Hell Week, a favored pledgee is torn between honoring his code of silence or standing up against the intensifying violence of underground hazing.', 'Deep into Hell Week, a favored pledgee is torn between honoring his code of silence or standing up against the intensifying violence of underground hazing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTOithYdgE4jAdSIuH1nAaxkmzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426265'),
  ('523040110426208515', 'Burning Secret', 1988, 'Drama', 'Ernest Day, Andrew Birkin', 'Andrew Birkin', 'David Eberts, Faye Dunaway, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Ian Richardson, John Nettleton, Martin Obernigg, Václav Štekl, Vladimír Pospíšil', 'PG', 'While recuperating in a sanatorium in the mountains, a young boy becomes very close friends with an older baron. But the baron is only using the boy to get to know his mother, the wife of an older diplomat. When the boy realises the baron’s intentions, he becomes jealous, moody and depressed.', 'While recuperating in a sanatorium in the mountains, a young boy becomes very close friends with an older baron. But the baron is only using the boy to get to know his mother, the wife of an older diplomat. When the boy realises the baron’s intentions, he becomes jealous, moody and depressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXaPHojwG9muS7teOEjYgzxYEHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172149'),
  ('114313674721636222', 'Burning Up Inside', 1979, 'Drama, Horror, Crime', 'Jesús Franco, Alain Hardy', 'Jesús Franco', 'Susan Hemingway, Brigitte Lahaie, Jean Ferrere, Aida Vargas, Mel Rodrigo, Filo Lemoine, Didier Aubriot, Martine Fléty', null, 'The virgin daughter of an important business man is kidnapped in a nightclub by a couple working as sex slave traders aboard a ship. She, along with other abducted women, are given a drug that freezes their bodies into human statues.', 'The virgin daughter of an important business man is kidnapped in a nightclub by a couple working as sex slave traders aboard a ship. She, along with other abducted women, are given a drug that freezes their bodies into human statues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJU5hTyii7goNzpTJfsNI7WcU0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353854'),
  ('337815159613947633', 'Burnt', 2015, 'Drama', 'Richard Styles, Harriet Worth, John Wells', 'Steven Knight', 'Bradley Cooper, Sienna Miller, Omar Sy, Daniel Brühl, Riccardo Scamarcio, Sam Keeley, Alicia Vikander, Matthew Rhys', 'R', 'Adam Jones is a Chef who destroyed his career with drugs and diva behavior. He cleans up and returns to London, determined to redeem himself by spearheading a top restaurant that can gain three Michelin stars.', 'Adam Jones is a Chef who destroyed his career with drugs and diva behavior. He cleans up and returns to London, determined to redeem himself by spearheading a top restaurant that can gain three Michelin stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGJLABjIb6F86vwY5w576JYHQxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295964'),
  ('1092634805404158805', 'Burnt by the Sun', 1994, 'Drama', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Vilen Kalyuta, Tamara Odintsova', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Rustam Ibragimbekov', 'Oleg Menshikov, Nikita Mikhalkov, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Nadezhda Mikhalkova, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Vladimir Ilin, Alla Kazanskaya', 'R', 'Russia, 1936: revolutionary hero Colonel Kotov is spending an idyllic summer in his dacha with his young wife and six-year-old daughter Nadia and other assorted family and friends. Things change dramatically with the unheralded arrival of Cousin Dmitri from Moscow, who charms the women and little Nadia with his games and pianistic bravura. But Kotov isn''t fooled: this is the time of Stalin''s repression, with telephone calls in the middle of the night spelling doom - and he knows that Dmitri isn''t paying a social call...', 'Russia, 1936: revolutionary hero Colonel Kotov is spending an idyllic summer in his dacha with his young wife and six-year-old daughter Nadia and other assorted family and friends. Things change dramatically with the unheralded arrival of Cousin Dmitri from Moscow, who charms the women and little Nadia with his games and pianistic bravura. But Kotov isn''t fooled: this is the time of Stalin''s repression, with telephone calls in the middle of the night spelling doom - and he knows that Dmitri isn''t paying a social call...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcpvnPSuRrynrgY7menuyZe7X4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50797'),
  ('305424683652677976', 'Burnt by the Sun 2: Exodus', 2010, 'Drama, War', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Marfa Lomakina, Raisa Zaslav', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Aleksandr Novototskiy-Vlasov, Vladimir Moiseenko', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Oleg Menshikov, Nadezhda Mikhalkova, Sergey Makovetskiy, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Artur Smolyaninov, Andrey Merzlikin, Maksim Sukhanov', null, 'Epic film about WWII, a sequel to Utomlyonnye solntsem (1994). Evil Stalin is terrorizing people of Russia while the Nazis are advancing. Russian officer Kotov, who miraculously survived the death sentence in Stalin''s Purge, is now fighting in the front-lines. His daughter, Nadia, who survived a rape attempt by Nazi soldiers, is now a nurse risking her own life to save others. In the war-torn nation even former enemies are fighting together to defend their land. People stand up united for the sake of victory. Written by Steve Shelokhonov', 'Epic film about WWII, a sequel to Utomlyonnye solntsem (1994). Evil Stalin is terrorizing people of Russia while the Nazis are advancing. Russian officer Kotov, who miraculously survived the death sentence in Stalin''s Purge, is now fighting in the front-lines. His daughter, Nadia, who survived a rape attempt by Nazi soldiers, is now a nurse risking her own life to save others. In the war-torn nation even former enemies are fighting together to defend their land. People stand up united for the sake of victory. Written by Steve Shelokhonov', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvDDahBQMM1ueTSb3zx6PJxyO3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38318'),
  ('594844885126142591', 'Burnt Money', 2000, 'Romance, Crime', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Noemí Nemirovsky, Alfredo Mayo', 'Marcelo Figueras, Ricardo Piglia', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Eduardo Noriega, Pablo Echarri, Leticia Brédice, Ricardo Bartis, Dolores Fonzi, Carlos Roffé, Daniel Valenzuela', 'R', 'Set in Argentina in 1965, the story follows the tumultuous relationship between two men who became lovers and ultimately ruthless bank robbers in a notoriously famous footnote in the annals of crime history. After a large-scale hold-up that turns bloody, the two men must flee. It is not long before the police are surrounding the building they are in and they must confront their demons to survive.', 'Set in Argentina in 1965, the story follows the tumultuous relationship between two men who became lovers and ultimately ruthless bank robbers in a notoriously famous footnote in the annals of crime history. After a large-scale hold-up that turns bloody, the two men must flee. It is not long before the police are surrounding the building they are in and they must confront their demons to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LzjfTXKSdSwyqWzp2X5TjkvJ64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27092'),
  ('977212888703519651', 'Burnt Offerings', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Dan Curtis, Jacques R. Marquette, Howard Grace', 'William F. Nolan, Dan Curtis', 'Karen Black, Oliver Reed, Burgess Meredith, Bette Davis, Eileen Heckart, Lee Montgomery, Dub Taylor, Joseph Riley', 'PG', 'A family moves into a large old mansion in the countryside which seems to have a mysterious and sinister power over its new residents.', 'A family moves into a large old mansion in the countryside which seems to have a mysterious and sinister power over its new residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ipG69lXOjGMX7F7qxJQzUoiUsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13549'),
  ('674554479822065644', 'Burnt Out', 2006, 'Drama', 'Fabienne Godet, Crystel Fournier', 'Franck Vassal, Fabienne Godet', 'Olivier Gourmet, Dominique Blanc, Julie Depardieu, Marion Cotillard, Jean-Michel Portal, Blandine Lenoir, François Levantal', null, 'François Durrieux, a man in his forties, married to Clémence and father of Benjamin, has been employed for years by the firm DSBO. In order not to lose his job, he always submits to his boss''s demands whether it means working after office hours, canceling planned holidays or harming his family life. However, when one night, Simon Lacaze, his best friend and colleague, commits suicide just after being fired ignominiously, François rebels...', 'François Durrieux, a man in his forties, married to Clémence and father of Benjamin, has been employed for years by the firm DSBO. In order not to lose his job, he always submits to his boss''s demands whether it means working after office hours, canceling planned holidays or harming his family life. However, when one night, Simon Lacaze, his best friend and colleague, commits suicide just after being fired ignominiously, François rebels...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4fVJuPN9WmW4j5EZBhMXs8gqZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70930'),
  ('829144357216841927', 'Burraco fatale', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Sebastiano Celeste, Giuliana Gamba, Blasco Giurato', 'Francesco Ranieri Martinotti, Giuliana Gamba', 'Claudia Gerini, Paola Minaccioni, Caterina Guzzanti, Angela Finocchiaro, Loretta Goggi, Mohamed Zouaoui, Michela Quattrociocche, Morena Gentile', null, 'Irma, Eugenia, Miranda and Rina are four different women, each with their own character, their own weaknesses and their own eccentricities, but linked by a deep and lasting knowledge over time, united and marked by their essential card games. When they decide to participate in a national buraco tournament and get out of their everyday life, they will suddenly find themselves with their cards exposed. Life always offers a second chance and love can go back to upsetting at any age. After all, it is the game of burraco that has taught him that a game must be played completely, to the end, and that no result is ever taken for granted.', 'Irma, Eugenia, Miranda and Rina are four different women, each with their own character, their own weaknesses and their own eccentricities, but linked by a deep and lasting knowledge over time, united and marked by their essential card games. When they decide to participate in a national buraco tournament and get out of their everyday life, they will suddenly find themselves with their cards exposed. Life always offers a second chance and love can go back to upsetting at any age. After all, it is the game of burraco that has taught him that a game must be played completely, to the end, and that no result is ever taken for granted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66YEopBtmrD7bUUeyXRTUMbGosr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:705715'),
  ('859831062976102118', 'Burroughs: The Movie', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Mike Southon, Tom DiCillo, Larry Shlu', null, 'William S. Burroughs, Mortimer Burroughs, Lucien Carr, Jackie Curtis, Allen Ginsberg, John Giorno, James Grauerholz, Brion Gysin', 'NR', 'An exploration of Burroughs’ life story, as told by Burroughs himself along with many of his contemporaries, including Allen Ginsberg, Brion Gysin, Francis Bacon, Herbert Huncke, Patti Smith, Terry Southern, and William Burroughs Jr.', 'An exploration of Burroughs’ life story, as told by Burroughs himself along with many of his contemporaries, including Allen Ginsberg, Brion Gysin, Francis Bacon, Herbert Huncke, Patti Smith, Terry Southern, and William Burroughs Jr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cne9vTm9GhNLmtQ1tzI8WNcSIPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339790'),
  ('362349746455710575', 'Burrow', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Madeline Sharafian, Andrew Jimenez', 'Madeline Sharafian', null, 'G', 'A young rabbit embarks on a journey to dig the burrow of her dreams, despite not having a clue what she''s doing. Rather than reveal to her neighbors her imperfections, she digs herself deeper and deeper into trouble. After hitting (bed)rock bottom, she learns there is no shame in asking for help.', 'A young rabbit embarks on a journey to dig the burrow of her dreams, despite not having a clue what she''s doing. Rather than reveal to her neighbors her imperfections, she digs herself deeper and deeper into trouble. After hitting (bed)rock bottom, she learns there is no shame in asking for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkQcHvMc7gVG6OWVotVLDeRkrRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747059'),
  ('925064786772432988', 'Burrowing', 2009, 'Drama', 'Henrik Hellström, Fredrik Wenzel, Fredrik Wenzel', 'Henrik Hellström, Fredrik Wenzel', 'Sebastian Eklund, Jörgen Svensson, Hannes Sandahl, Marek Kostrzewski, Bodil Wessberg, Silas Francéen', null, 'An eleven-year-old boy observes his neighborhood as its surface orderliness rots away.', 'An eleven-year-old boy observes his neighborhood as its surface orderliness rots away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P3VrGW8SaparsL63BC8JJrqj9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30846'),
  ('239946152820730084', 'Burst City', 1982, 'Action, Music, Science Fiction', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Gakuryu Ishii, Hiromi Nishizawa', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Mitsuhiko Akita', 'Takanori Jinnai, Shigeru Izumiya, Kou Machida, Shigeru Muroi, Hitomi Tsurukawa, Shinya Ohe, Hiromi Hiraguchi, Mayumi Ohbayashi', null, 'Set in a barren, futuristic Tokyo of highways and wastelands, a rowdy group of punk bands and their fans gather to protest slow, boring, Japanese living.', 'Set in a barren, futuristic Tokyo of highways and wastelands, a rowdy group of punk bands and their fans gather to protest slow, boring, Japanese living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZ21OljXwIo0IjXXtObeK1F7856.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40110'),
  ('541139259774144616', 'Bury Me an Angel', 1971, 'Action, Drama', 'Barbara Peeters, Sven Walnum', 'Barbara Peeters', 'Dixie Peabody, Terry Mace, Clyde Ventura, Joanne Moore Jordan, Marie Denn, Dennis Peabody, Stephen Whittaker, Gary Littlejohn', 'R', 'After learning that her brother has been murdered, biker Dag sets out on the road with two close friends to find the killer. As they travel, they encounter various people and conflicts, and Dag’s emotional struggle becomes increasingly apparent, leading to a final violent confrontation with her brother’s murderer.', 'After learning that her brother has been murdered, biker Dag sets out on the road with two close friends to find the killer. As they travel, they encounter various people and conflicts, and Dag’s emotional struggle becomes increasingly apparent, leading to a final violent confrontation with her brother’s murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffsQfCsRf390zmd9XL2p5utevoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109101'),
  ('925886822854206149', 'Bury Me Behind the Baseboard', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sergey Snezhkin, Vladislav Gurtchin, Igor Terekhov', 'Sergey Snezhkin', 'Svetlana Kryuchkova, Aleksey Petrenko, Mariya Shukshina, Konstantin Vorobyov, Aleksandr Drobitko, Samvel Muzhikyan, Valeriy Kukhareshin, Denis Kirillov', null, 'A small child is trapped in a tug-of-war battle between his frivolous, but loving mother and an emotionally abusive neurotic grandmother, who wants to "shelter" her beloved grandson at all cost.', 'A small child is trapped in a tug-of-war battle between his frivolous, but loving mother and an emotionally abusive neurotic grandmother, who wants to "shelter" her beloved grandson at all cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAEevhb654WbpRWwsVohKEeQjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19875'),
  ('561224959079275956', 'Bury Me Dead', 1947, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Bernard Vorhaus, John Alton', 'Dwight V. Babcock', 'Cathy O''Donnell, June Lockhart, Hugh Beaumont, Mark Daniels, Greg McClure, Milton Parsons, Virginia Farmer, Sonia Darrin', 'NR', 'A woman watches her own funeral, then sets out with her lawyer to learn who was in the casket.', 'A woman watches her own funeral, then sets out with her lawyer to learn who was in the casket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpHUMnEROUYxM4uiU4AEsYa5A6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37085'),
  ('59614607598425916', 'Bury Me High', 1991, 'Action, Adventure', 'Tsui Siu-Ming, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Cho Wing', 'Tsui Siu-Ming, Cheung Wa-Biu, Sit Ga-Wa', 'Chin Ka-Lok, Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung, Yuen Wah, Tsui Siu-Ming, Corey Yuen, Kenneth Tsang, Paul Chun Pui', null, 'In a mountainous region in an Asian backwater banana republic, it is said that the descendents of all those buried in its earth will be blessed with fantastic fortune and good health. However, if a special ceremony is not performed on the grounds, then the luck will only last for 24 years. A trio of Chinese Americans decide to venture into these mountains hoping to change their luck; Anna Wong (Moon Lee) is an executive facing a corporate meltdown, Wisely (Chin Ka-Lok) is dying of brain cancer, and UCLA Prof. Chang (Tsui Siu-Ming) is an expert in feng shui. Tin can potentate General Nguen (Yuen Wah) also has designs on the grounds -- hoping to turn his third world, fourth rate country into a superpower. Along the way, the three heroes fall in with a group of local rebels, including the high-kicking Nguen Van Vong (Sibelle Hu).', 'In a mountainous region in an Asian backwater banana republic, it is said that the descendents of all those buried in its earth will be blessed with fantastic fortune and good health. However, if a special ceremony is not performed on the grounds, then the luck will only last for 24 years. A trio of Chinese Americans decide to venture into these mountains hoping to change their luck; Anna Wong (Moon Lee) is an executive facing a corporate meltdown, Wisely (Chin Ka-Lok) is dying of brain cancer, and UCLA Prof. Chang (Tsui Siu-Ming) is an expert in feng shui. Tin can potentate General Nguen (Yuen Wah) also has designs on the grounds -- hoping to turn his third world, fourth rate country into a superpower. Along the way, the three heroes fall in with a group of local rebels, including the high-kicking Nguen Van Vong (Sibelle Hu).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAws8T2cCeAqevgzNDLpHWAXcV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172745'),
  ('492404319938648100', 'Bury My Heart at Wounded Knee', 2007, 'Western, Drama, History, TV Movie, War', 'Yves Simoneau, David Franco, Brian DeMetz', 'Daniel Giat, Dee Brown', 'Anna Paquin, Chevez Ezaneh, August Schellenberg, Duane Howard, Aidan Quinn, Colm Feore, Fred Thompson, Nathan Lee Chasing Horse', 'NR', 'Beginning just after the bloody Sioux victory over General Custer at Little Big Horn, the story is told through two unique perspectives: Charles Eastman, a young, white-educated Sioux doctor held up as living proof of the alleged success of assimilation, and Sitting Bull the proud Lakota chief whose tribe won the American Indians’ last major victory at Little Big Horn.', 'Beginning just after the bloody Sioux victory over General Custer at Little Big Horn, the story is told through two unique perspectives: Charles Eastman, a young, white-educated Sioux doctor held up as living proof of the alleged success of assimilation, and Sitting Bull the proud Lakota chief whose tribe won the American Indians’ last major victory at Little Big Horn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8FeAVNxe17rQUqaBhKy5F0wpBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13470'),
  ('382769481151489921', 'Burying the Ex', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Joe Dante, Jonathan Hall', 'Alan Trezza', 'Anton Yelchin, Ashley Greene, Alexandra Daddario, Oliver Cooper, Dick Miller, Mark Alan, Ozioma Akagha, Archie Hahn', 'R', 'Before horror enthusiast Max can break things off with his girlfriend Evelyn she dies in a bus accident. In time, Max meets another woman only to have Evelyn resurface as a zombie ready to resume their relationship.', 'Before horror enthusiast Max can break things off with his girlfriend Evelyn she dies in a bus accident. In time, Max meets another woman only to have Evelyn resurface as a zombie ready to resume their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVE5JElUQVLL95GZCiQhLSTTA6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255798'),
  ('794422342259672727', 'Bus 174', 2002, 'Documentary, Crime', 'José Padilha, Marcelo ''Guru'' Duarte, César Moraes', 'José Padilha', 'Yvonne Bezerra de Mello, Sandro do Nascimento, Rodrigo Pimentel, Luiz Eduardo Soares', 'R', 'Documentary depicts what happened in Rio de Janeiro on June 12th 2000, when bus 174 was taken by an armed young man, threatening to shoot all the passengers. Transmitted live on all Brazilian TV networks, this shocking and tragic-ending event became one of violence''s most shocking portraits, and one of the scariest examples of police incompetence and abuse in recent years.', 'Documentary depicts what happened in Rio de Janeiro on June 12th 2000, when bus 174 was taken by an armed young man, threatening to shoot all the passengers. Transmitted live on all Brazilian TV networks, this shocking and tragic-ending event became one of violence''s most shocking portraits, and one of the scariest examples of police incompetence and abuse in recent years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30v64yPfBbNSmnYHShExuWlXUJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8439'),
  ('801873429071357353', 'Bus 44', 2001, 'Drama', 'Wang Weiyuan, Dayyan Eng, Sam Koa', 'Dayyan Eng', 'Gong Beibi, Wu Chao, Li Yixiang, Zhou Kui, Qing Sun, Jianxin Zhang', null, 'On the outskirts of a small town, a bus driver and her passengers encounter highway robbers.', 'On the outskirts of a small town, a bus driver and her passengers encounter highway robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzSC84uylsnafAH4ChE3WIsPm0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53978'),
  ('39970368244982019', 'Bus Palladium', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Thompson, Rémy Chevrin', 'Thierry Klifa, Christopher Thompson', 'Marc-André Grondin, Arthur Dupont, Jules Pelissier, Abraham Belaga, Elisa Sednaoui, François Civil, Géraldine Pailhas, Naomi Greene', null, 'A comedy that follows the break-up of a French rock group.', 'A comedy that follows the break-up of a French rock group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wd2XCgMwsaIZZRtuV1s3hwSuIEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45061'),
  ('516840453935421002', 'Bus Stop', 1956, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joshua Logan, Milton Krasner, Ben Kadish', 'George Axelrod', 'Marilyn Monroe, Don Murray, Arthur O''Connell, Betty Field, Eileen Heckart, Robert Bray, Hope Lange, Hans Conried', null, 'Cowboys Beauregard Decker and Virgil Blessing attend a rodeo in Phoenix, where Decker falls in love with beautiful cafe singer Cherie. He wants to take Cherie back to his native Montana and marry her, but she dreams of traveling to Hollywood and becoming famous. When she resists his advances, Decker forces Cherie onto the bus back to Montana with him, but, when the bus makes an unscheduled stop due to bad weather, the tables are turned.', 'Cowboys Beauregard Decker and Virgil Blessing attend a rodeo in Phoenix, where Decker falls in love with beautiful cafe singer Cherie. He wants to take Cherie back to his native Montana and marry her, but she dreams of traveling to Hollywood and becoming famous. When she resists his advances, Decker forces Cherie onto the bus back to Montana with him, but, when the bus makes an unscheduled stop due to bad weather, the tables are turned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXZiz5zIyynjQMJMBbXijS4434z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24010'),
  ('412762717163692117', 'Busco novia', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Vega Vidal', 'Percy Chávez Alzamora, Renato Cisneros', 'César Ritter, Magdyel Ugaz, Vadhir Derbez, Fiorella Pennano, Gustavo Bueno, Grapa Paola', null, 'Renzo Collazos has been a recognized journalist for the political section of the newspaper El Comercio for a year. One morning, the website editor asks him to manage a blog dedicated to youth and write weekly about his pale social-sentimental-sexual life. Collazos accepts, convinced that he has nothing important to tell: he has no partner; he still lives with his mother; in his spare time he reads, writes poetry, masturbates, and is fed up with the fact that his closest friends have married (because he also wanted to marry). Unexpectedly, the Wanted Girlfriend blog becomes a success as Renzo writes about his cynical love dilemmas, from the marriage of his ex-girlfriend to the failed night raids on Friday and Saturday, and he gains popularity. That fame makes him a more selfish, more vain, more stupid guy who ends up sabotaging his relationships. He finds a girlfriend, but she decides to end things and his world falls apart again. Realizing what he has become, he decides to change.', 'Renzo Collazos has been a recognized journalist for the political section of the newspaper El Comercio for a year. One morning, the website editor asks him to manage a blog dedicated to youth and write weekly about his pale social-sentimental-sexual life. Collazos accepts, convinced that he has nothing important to tell: he has no partner; he still lives with his mother; in his spare time he reads, writes poetry, masturbates, and is fed up with the fact that his closest friends have married (because he also wanted to marry). Unexpectedly, the Wanted Girlfriend blog becomes a success as Renzo writes about his cynical love dilemmas, from the marriage of his ex-girlfriend to the failed night raids on Friday and Saturday, and he gains popularity. That fame makes him a more selfish, more vain, more stupid guy who ends up sabotaging his relationships. He finds a girlfriend, but she decides to end things and his world falls apart again. Realizing what he has become, he decides to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXGCldSSeZBZHfow0jSTXGJdVh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:904668'),
  ('395295780970197882', 'Bush Christmas', 1947, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Ralph Smart, George Heath', 'Ralph Smart', 'Chips Rafferty, John Fernside, Helen Grieve, Nicky Yardley, Stan Tolhurst, Pat Penny, Thelma Grigg, Morris Unicomb', 'NR', 'In Australia, five children pursue horse thieves through the mountains.', 'In Australia, five children pursue horse thieves through the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ajDWUx1b91MejF3tKP4zCiBVPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89551'),
  ('1010390028173995622', 'Bush Mama', 1979, 'Drama', 'Haile Gerima, Roderick Young, Charles Burnett', 'Haile Gerima', 'Barbara O. Jones, Johnny Weathers, Cora Lee Day, Simmi Ella Nelson, Bettie J. Wilson, Bob Ogburn Jr., Susan Williams, Ben Collins', null, 'The story of Dorothy and her husband T.C. He is a discharged Vietnam veteran who thought he would return home to a "hero''s welcome." Instead he is falsely arrested and imprisoned for a crime he didn''t commit. Her life revolves around the welfare office and a community facing poverty and unemployment. As a result of the film''s events, both the main characters become radicalized and Dorothy eventually turns to violence.', 'The story of Dorothy and her husband T.C. He is a discharged Vietnam veteran who thought he would return home to a "hero''s welcome." Instead he is falsely arrested and imprisoned for a crime he didn''t commit. Her life revolves around the welfare office and a community facing poverty and unemployment. As a result of the film''s events, both the main characters become radicalized and Dorothy eventually turns to violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlP9d9Rqqgija0ZYpmOVh2ye20F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95771'),
  ('153036002924291981', 'Bushido', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Kazuya Shiraishi, Jun Fukumoto, Hiromichi Matsuo', 'Masato Katō', 'Tsuyoshi Kusanagi, Kaya Kiyohara, Jun Kunimura, Taishi Nakagawa, Eita Okuno, Takuma Otoo, Masachika Ichimura, Takumi Saitoh', null, 'Kakunoshin, renowned for his skills with a sword and in the game of go, embodies the samurai code. Falsely accused of a theft, he is forced to become a lowly ronin. Years later, when a case of missing gold pulls him into a new web of intrigue, Kakunoshin uncovers the truth behind his downfall. With the real culprit exposed, the go board flips, and a hellstorm of righteous vengeance follows.', 'Kakunoshin, renowned for his skills with a sword and in the game of go, embodies the samurai code. Falsely accused of a theft, he is forced to become a lowly ronin. Years later, when a case of missing gold pulls him into a new web of intrigue, Kakunoshin uncovers the truth behind his downfall. With the real culprit exposed, the go board flips, and a hellstorm of righteous vengeance follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RabgolHlvyUTQH5nuUBGJR0Yk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1264349'),
  ('320043043727065434', 'Bushido Man', 2013, 'Action', 'Takanori Tsujimoto, Kensuke Sonomura, Tetsuya Kudô', 'Takanori Tsujimoto', 'Mitsuki Koga, Yoshiyuki Yamaguchi, Masanori Mimoto, Kentarō Shimazu, Kazuki Tsujimoto, Kensuke Sonomura, Masaki Suzumura, Naohiro Kawamoto', null, 'Toramaru, lord of integrated martial arts Mugen-ga-ryu, ends his training journey and visits his master, Gensai. "You have to duel with every martial arts master and win, in order to obtain their esoteric books of martial secrets." Receiving such an order from Gensai, Toramaru makes a pilgrimage around Japan and spends a year fighting. Through his fights with genuine masters in every martial arts such as kung-fu, stick fighting, sword fighting, and nunchaku, this film passionately tells what "Budo" is and what Bushido is. Full of fierce and diverse action! The original fighting movie is finally born here!', 'Toramaru, lord of integrated martial arts Mugen-ga-ryu, ends his training journey and visits his master, Gensai. "You have to duel with every martial arts master and win, in order to obtain their esoteric books of martial secrets." Receiving such an order from Gensai, Toramaru makes a pilgrimage around Japan and spends a year fighting. Through his fights with genuine masters in every martial arts such as kung-fu, stick fighting, sword fighting, and nunchaku, this film passionately tells what "Budo" is and what Bushido is. Full of fierce and diverse action! The original fighting movie is finally born here!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/citxlRRoqWPE53kYiTpiqg9tYWk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227974'),
  ('745673726639834116', 'Bushido: The Cruel Code of the Samurai', 1963, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Tadashi Imai, Makoto Tsudoi, Kōsaku Yamashita', 'Naoyuki Suzuki, Yoshikata Yoda', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Ineko Arima, Satomi Oka, Kyôko Kishida, Misako Watanabe, Yoshiko Mita, Yoshi Katō, Kei Satō', null, 'After a salary-man''s fiancée attempts suicide, he recounts his gruesome family history which saw generations of his ancestors suffer and sacrifice themselves for the sake of their cruel lords.', 'After a salary-man''s fiancée attempts suicide, he recounts his gruesome family history which saw generations of his ancestors suffer and sacrifice themselves for the sake of their cruel lords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJETr2k8SM46f8G5AmUWdbCukox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90299'),
  ('1058330056432185957', 'Bushwhacked', 1995, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy, Action', 'Greg Beeman, Theo van de Sande', 'Jeffrey Price, Peter S. Seaman', 'Daniel Stern, Jon Polito, Brad Sullivan, Ann Dowd, Anthony Heald, Tom Wood, Blake Bashoff, Corey Carrier', 'PG', 'A inept courier realises he has been used by criminals to deliver money. On the run from both the criminals and police, he poses as a Scout leader and leads a scout group on a hike through the mountains.', 'A inept courier realises he has been used by criminals to deliver money. On the run from both the criminals and police, he poses as a Scout leader and leads a scout group on a hike through the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3H0POtvl0Tt4Meesvp7HX6JxAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26258'),
  ('202164191243262354', 'Bushwick', 2017, 'Thriller, Action', 'Jonathan Milott, Cary Murnion, Lyle Vincent', 'Nick Damici, Graham Reznick', 'Dave Bautista, Brittany Snow, Angelic Zambrana, Jeremie Harris, Myra Lucretia Taylor, Alex Breaux, Arturo Castro, Quincy Chad', null, 'When an unknown military force invades Bushwick, a Brooklyn neighborhood, young student Lucy and war veteran Stupe must rely on each other to escape and survive.', 'When an unknown military force invades Bushwick, a Brooklyn neighborhood, young student Lucy and war veteran Stupe must rely on each other to escape and survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fGjmzxdiKWsrlY3syrm2aXeTq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430354'),
  ('359527610882092154', 'Bushy Hare', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs encounters marsupials and an aborigine in Australia''s outback.', 'Bugs encounters marsupials and an aborigine in Australia''s outback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nn0UpCOgo09uxDIHvzJK1QtPoAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236109'),
  ('467063459892109909', 'Business Is Business', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Verhoeven, Ad Roest, Jan de Bont', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Ronnie Bierman, Sylvia de Leur, Piet Römer, Jules Hamel, Bernard Droog, Eric van Ingen, Wim Kouwenhoven, Ton Lensink', null, 'Dutch prostitutes Greta and Nel cruise the Amsterdam red light district, seeking clients to involve in their elaborately staged fetish fantasies, be it disciplinarian headmistresses, surgeons cutting open a willing patient, or even dressing up as chickens, the duo show their expertise in role-playing again and again and again. In reality, Nel is trapped in an abusive marriage and Greta is forever in the middle of their confrontations but her life takes a positive upturn when she becomes involved with a client.', 'Dutch prostitutes Greta and Nel cruise the Amsterdam red light district, seeking clients to involve in their elaborately staged fetish fantasies, be it disciplinarian headmistresses, surgeons cutting open a willing patient, or even dressing up as chickens, the duo show their expertise in role-playing again and again and again. In reality, Nel is trapped in an abusive marriage and Greta is forever in the middle of their confrontations but her life takes a positive upturn when she becomes involved with a client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qDnAYnKg0nRRtOAIDrsMQXkeFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98050'),
  ('1012601448131822017', 'Businessman', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Puri Jagannadh', 'Puri Jagannadh', 'Mahesh Babu, Kajal Aggarwal, Prakash Raj, Sayaji Shinde, Nassar, Dharmavarupu Subramanyam, Mahesh Balraj, Ayesha Shiva', null, 'Just as the cops have declared the end of Mafia in Mumbai, a man named Surya arrives in the city with the intentions of conquering it.', 'Just as the cops have declared the end of Mafia in Mumbai, a man named Surya arrives in the city with the intentions of conquering it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLF5o53irg0ZVV4ecLptkLgiTXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83889'),
  ('529964367454165202', 'Busman''s Honeymoon', 1940, 'Mystery, Comedy, Romance', 'Freddie Young, Arthur B. Woods', 'Monckton Hoffe, Angus MacPhail, Harold Goldman', 'Robert Montgomery, Constance Cummings, Leslie Banks, Seymour Hicks, Robert Newton, Googie Withers, Frank Pettingell, Joan Kemp-Welch', null, 'When Lord Peter Wimsey marries Harriet Vane, a crime author, they both promise to give up crime for good. As a wedding present, Peter purchases the old house where Harriet grew up, but when they try to move in the previous owner is nowhere to be found, until they start to clean the house and find his body in the cellar...', 'When Lord Peter Wimsey marries Harriet Vane, a crime author, they both promise to give up crime for good. As a wedding present, Peter purchases the old house where Harriet grew up, but when they try to move in the previous owner is nowhere to be found, until they start to clean the house and find his body in the cellar...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp2UdO5iirf7JOIED982zEAT8EH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133016'),
  ('203526708275511571', 'Busted', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Corey Feldman, Irv Goodnoff', 'Marie Evans James, Ronald Jacobs', 'Corey Feldman, Corey Haim, Dominick Brascia, Elliott Gould, Julie Strain, Michael Maguire, Philip Angelotti, Monique Parent', 'R', 'In the town of Amity, the cops take crime off of the streets and put it into the police station where it belongs.', 'In the town of Amity, the cops take crime off of the streets and put it into the police station where it belongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaqInEN7eSIsAKVHYCVGJ2XR9ce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66186'),
  ('1076475313586040797', 'Busted Water Pipes', 2026, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Zhou Difei, Xing-Mai Deng', 'Zhou Difei, Jiao Yufeng, Chong Zheng', 'Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Allen, Zhou You, Yan Peilun, Yang Haoyu', 'Not Rated', 'Yu Dahai''s honest police team is forced to fabricate cases to keep their jobs. However, the police station''s water pipe bursts, and they unexpectedly encounter Luo Siji, Luo Hao, and Niu Dalun, a gang of tomb raiders disguised as plumbers.', 'Yu Dahai''s honest police team is forced to fabricate cases to keep their jobs. However, the police station''s water pipe bursts, and they unexpectedly encounter Luo Siji, Luo Hao, and Niu Dalun, a gang of tomb raiders disguised as plumbers.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkDsSmwtX8N0wmxRRdxjgYHenFNe.jpg', 'plex:movie:busted-water-pipes'),
  ('1064874626943287113', 'Buster', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'David Green, Tony Imi, Michael Zimbrich', 'Colin Shindler', 'Phil Collins, Julie Walters, Larry Lamb, Ralph Brown, Christopher Ellison, Sheila Hancock, Martin Jarvis, Anthony Quayle', null, 'Buster is a small time crook who pulls a big time job. When he finds that the police will not let the case drop, he goes into hiding and can''t contact his wife and child. He arranges to meet them in Mexico where he thinks they can begin again, but finds that he must choose between his family and freedom.', 'Buster is a small time crook who pulls a big time job. When he finds that the police will not let the case drop, he goes into hiding and can''t contact his wife and child. He arranges to meet them in Mexico where he thinks they can begin again, but finds that he must choose between his family and freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNiyCIkbO0SdiKejdgXFaMqW1UE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24782'),
  ('677789266582698062', 'Buster & Chauncey''s Silent Night', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Buzz Potamkin', 'George Taweel, Rob Loos', 'Phil Hartman, Jim Cummings, Lea Michele, Tom Arnold, Marie Osmond, Townsend Coleman, Gregg Edelman, Judith Blazer', null, 'Buster and Chauncey - the world''s greatest Mouse-icians - have arrived in Oberndorf for their shot at the big time: performing for the queen at the annual Christmas Pageant! But on Christmas Eve, Burghermeister Huffenmeir finds all the preparations for the festivities destroyed and the treasure of Oberndorf missing. When he accuses Buster and Chauncey''s friend Christina - an orphan in search of her long lost family - it seems certain that Christmas will be ruined. Now it''s up to the Moustroes of Mistletoe to help Christina reveal the real culprits, return the treasure and show the town of Oberndorf the true meaning of Christmas.', 'Buster and Chauncey - the world''s greatest Mouse-icians - have arrived in Oberndorf for their shot at the big time: performing for the queen at the annual Christmas Pageant! But on Christmas Eve, Burghermeister Huffenmeir finds all the preparations for the festivities destroyed and the treasure of Oberndorf missing. When he accuses Buster and Chauncey''s friend Christina - an orphan in search of her long lost family - it seems certain that Christmas will be ruined. Now it''s up to the Moustroes of Mistletoe to help Christina reveal the real culprits, return the treasure and show the town of Oberndorf the true meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUmuMLnXmsY91KH7G6lbDkP4DsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26312'),
  ('831549276990157278', 'Buster and Billie', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Mario Tosi, Lynn Guthrie, Terry Morse Jr.', 'Ron Turbeville', 'Jan-Michael Vincent, Pamela Sue Martin, Clifton James, Robert Englund, Joan Goodfellow, Jessie Lee Fulton, J.B. Joiner, Dell C. Payne', 'R', 'Dimwitted but sweet high school girl of easy virtue and the most popular boy in the school share an improbable romance.', 'Dimwitted but sweet high school girl of easy virtue and the most popular boy in the school share an improbable romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9nT0WZURfuVXpVdb8tO305XzLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84450'),
  ('1131112333325095552', 'Buster Keaton Rides Again', 1965, 'Documentary', 'John Spotton, John Spotton', 'Donald Brittain', 'Buster Keaton, Eleanor Keaton, Gerald Potterton, Michael Kane', null, 'In the fall of 1964, just over a year before his death, Buster Keaton traveled to Canada to make The Railrodder, a short subject that now enjoys a small cult following. Documenting this mobile production in fascinating and unexpected detail, Buster Keaton Rides Again offers a rare glimpse of the comedy legend’s temperament, philosophies, hobbies, marriage (his third), and the occasionally combative creative process behind the scenes. An intimate look at one of cinema’s most enduring legends.', 'In the fall of 1964, just over a year before his death, Buster Keaton traveled to Canada to make The Railrodder, a short subject that now enjoys a small cult following. Documenting this mobile production in fascinating and unexpected detail, Buster Keaton Rides Again offers a rare glimpse of the comedy legend’s temperament, philosophies, hobbies, marriage (his third), and the occasionally combative creative process behind the scenes. An intimate look at one of cinema’s most enduring legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aq7SNXmk0rVMSRXvdthxxYCWNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123498'),
  ('958516218057371784', 'Buster Keaton: The Genius Destroyed by Hollywood', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Baptiste Péretié', 'Valérie Frêne, Jean-Baptiste Péretié', 'Buster Keaton', null, 'In 1926, Buster Keaton was at the peak of his glory and wealth. By 1933, he had reached rock bottom. How, in the space of a few years, did this uncontested genius of silent films, go from the status of being a widely-worshipped star to an alcoholic and solitary fallen idol? With a spotlight on the 7 years during which his life changed, using extracts of Keaton’s films as magnifying mirrors, the documentary recounts the dramatic life of this creative genius and the Hollywood studios.', 'In 1926, Buster Keaton was at the peak of his glory and wealth. By 1933, he had reached rock bottom. How, in the space of a few years, did this uncontested genius of silent films, go from the status of being a widely-worshipped star to an alcoholic and solitary fallen idol? With a spotlight on the 7 years during which his life changed, using extracts of Keaton’s films as magnifying mirrors, the documentary recounts the dramatic life of this creative genius and the Hollywood studios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypigsVrQMLdcLBoinjjtNYZfXb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451943'),
  ('722763546236510744', 'Buster''s Mal Heart', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Sarah Adina Smith, Shaheen Seth', 'Sarah Adina Smith', 'Rami Malek, DJ Qualls, Kate Lyn Sheil, Toby Huss, Lin Shaye, Mark Kelly, Brooke Bundy, Teresa Yenque', null, 'An eccentric mountain man on the run from the local sheriff recalls the mysterious events that brought him to his present fugitive state.', 'An eccentric mountain man on the run from the local sheriff recalls the mysterious events that brought him to his present fugitive state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9uR2tAeokwBvQm6e9Y5zSB5KoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367147'),
  ('493976131375913787', 'Busters verden', 1984, 'Family', 'Bille August', 'Bjarne Reuter', 'Mads Bugge Andersen, Katarina Stenbeck, Peter Schrøder, Katja Miehe-Renard, Signe Dahl Madsen, Jannie Faurschou, Berthe Qvistgaard, Buster Larsen', null, 'The television series was based on a play by Danish author Bjarne Reuter. In 1984 Reuter published his collection Tre skuespil ("Three Plays"); a collection containing also En dag i Hector Hansens liv ("A Day in the Life of Hector Hansen") and Kom der lys i neonrøret, gutter? ("Was There Light in the Neon Tube, Boys?") – in addition to Busters Verden.', 'The television series was based on a play by Danish author Bjarne Reuter. In 1984 Reuter published his collection Tre skuespil ("Three Plays"); a collection containing also En dag i Hector Hansens liv ("A Day in the Life of Hector Hansen") and Kom der lys i neonrøret, gutter? ("Was There Light in the Neon Tube, Boys?") – in addition to Busters Verden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFOBwBNTXN7BTcNmMbGDXzZYtIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21273'),
  ('647077779335702798', 'Bustin'' Loose', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Oz Scott, Clifford C. Coleman, David Holden', 'Roger L. Simon', 'Richard Pryor, Cicely Tyson, Angel Ramirez Jr., Jimmy Hughes, Edwin DeLeon, Edwin Kinter, Tami Luchow, Janet Wong', 'R', 'After ex-con Joe Braxton violates his probation, he is given a second chance. All he has to do is drive a group of special kids across the country.', 'After ex-con Joe Braxton violates his probation, he is given a second chance. All he has to do is drive a group of special kids across the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOs3shYBvRjXG0XSdyKfh47iyYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31361'),
