  ('11020500414087395', 'But Forever In My Mind', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesca De Filippi, Francesco Vedovati, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Silvio Muccino, Adele Tulli, Gabriele Muccino', 'Silvio Muccino, Giuseppe Sanfelice, Giulia Louise Steigerwalt, Giulia Carmignani, Caterina Silva, Simone Pagani, Luca De Filippo, Anna Galiena', 'NR', 'Teenage problems intertwine during the occupation of a high school in Rome. Silvio—much like his peers desperate to lose his virginity—wants to make his move on the girl he likes, despite her being already his friend''s girlfriend and not knowing that her best friend harbors feelings for him—while clashing also with his parents, onetime Sixties radicals who look down on the kids'' aimless political commitment.', 'Teenage problems intertwine during the occupation of a high school in Rome. Silvio—much like his peers desperate to lose his virginity—wants to make his move on the girl he likes, despite her being already his friend''s girlfriend and not knowing that her best friend harbors feelings for him—while clashing also with his parents, onetime Sixties radicals who look down on the kids'' aimless political commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCGBSSTNxGzZtYfUMbjDR27Tcfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53915'),
  ('546679135460785173', 'But I''m a Cheerleader', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jamie Babbit, Van Hayden, Jules Labarthe', 'Brian Peterson', 'Natasha Lyonne, Clea DuVall, Cathy Moriarty, RuPaul, Melanie Lynskey, Katharine Towne, Katrina Phillips, Joel Michaely', 'R', 'Megan is an all-American girl. A cheerleader. She has a boyfriend. But Megan doesn''t like kissing her boyfriend very much. And she''s pretty touchy with her cheerleader friends. Her conservative parents worry that she must be a lesbian and send her off to "sexual redirection" school, where she must, with other lesbians and gays learn how to be straight.', 'Megan is an all-American girl. A cheerleader. She has a boyfriend. But Megan doesn''t like kissing her boyfriend very much. And she''s pretty touchy with her cheerleader friends. Her conservative parents worry that she must be a lesbian and send her off to "sexual redirection" school, where she must, with other lesbians and gays learn how to be straight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGEwlAuzTZoZjvsqgT2MRKHnGi8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20770'),
  ('1016647726369939002', 'But I''m Still the King', 1988, 'Drama, Music', 'René Cardona Jr.', null, 'Leonardo Daniel, Jorge Ortiz de Pinedo, Sonia Infante, Lourdes Munguía, Edith González, Lina Santos, Norma Herrera, Norma Lazareno', null, 'Fictionalized biography of singer/songwriter Jose Alfredo Jimenez.', 'Fictionalized biography of singer/songwriter Jose Alfredo Jimenez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSRUELzkBx8Cj7ZJGTZZWXQuWLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366036'),
  ('125130886943436409', 'But Muzeyyen That''s the Deepest Desire', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Çiğdem Vitrinel, Vedat Özdemir', 'Ceyda Aşar, Çiğdem Vitrinel', 'Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Sezin Akbaşoğulları, Erdinç Gülener, Ege Aydan, Hare Sürel, Derya Alabora, Pelin Doğru, Görkem Mertsöz', null, 'Arif, who is trying to write his first book, believes that life contains many unanswerable questions, especially about women and relationships. But when Müzeyyen appears unexpectedly, everything he has ever known or tried to learn is suddenly turned upside down.', 'Arif, who is trying to write his first book, believes that life contains many unanswerable questions, especially about women and relationships. But when Müzeyyen appears unexpectedly, everything he has ever known or tried to learn is suddenly turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgkGkH7aCUL4UrbrxpCqZLAuEQv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310993'),
  ('1144160429286669338', 'But What If This Is Love?', 1961, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yuli Raizman, Aleksandr Kharitonov, Ekaterina Stashevskaya-Naroditckaya', 'Iosif Olshansky, Yuli Raizman, Nina Rudneva', 'Zhanna Prokhorenko, Igor Pushkaryov, Aleksandra Nazarova, Andrey Mironov, Yevgeni Zharikov, Viktor Khokhryakov, Mariya Andrianova, Sofya Pavlova', null, 'High school students Ksenya and Boris are in love but all the world is against them.', 'High school students Ksenya and Boris are in love but all the world is against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d50ZMuM1NMPRJGz1KRDwAmcSvvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63568'),
  ('243859569242314413', 'Butch and Sundance: The Early Days', 1979, 'Western, Comedy', 'Richard Lester, László Kovács, Jack Frost Sanders', 'Allan Burns', 'William Katt, Tom Berenger, Jeff Corey, John Schuck, Michael C. Gwynne, Peter Weller, Brian Dennehy, Christopher Lloyd', 'PG', 'Before the adventures that made them legends, they were charming mastermind Robert Leroy Parker, alias Butch Cassidy, and crack-shot outlaw Harry Alonzo Longabaugh, soon to be known as The Sundance Kid. This is the ''prequel'' of how they met, their first clumsy robberies, the heroic dangers that abound them together, the secret that nearly tore them apart, and the impossible train heist that made them notorious for life. Saddle up and ride with the showdowns, shootouts, bad guys and good times in the days before the fame when fun was the name of the game.', 'Before the adventures that made them legends, they were charming mastermind Robert Leroy Parker, alias Butch Cassidy, and crack-shot outlaw Harry Alonzo Longabaugh, soon to be known as The Sundance Kid. This is the ''prequel'' of how they met, their first clumsy robberies, the heroic dangers that abound them together, the secret that nearly tore them apart, and the impossible train heist that made them notorious for life. Saddle up and ride with the showdowns, shootouts, bad guys and good times in the days before the fame when fun was the name of the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW0rCUcp2MdFbZ0SUrsNtikHc82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37598'),
  ('797588561549940928', 'Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid', 1969, 'Adventure, Western, Crime, Drama, History', 'George Roy Hill, Conrad Hall, Steven Bernhardt', 'William Goldman', 'Paul Newman, Robert Redford, Katharine Ross, Strother Martin, Henry Jones, Jeff Corey, George Furth, Cloris Leachman', 'PG', 'As the west rapidly becomes civilized, a pair of outlaws in 1890s Wyoming find themselves pursued by a posse and decide to flee to South America in hopes of evading the law.', 'As the west rapidly becomes civilized, a pair of outlaws in 1890s Wyoming find themselves pursued by a posse and decide to flee to South America in hopes of evading the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFmmykF1Ym3OGzENo50nZQaD1dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642'),
  ('533886837809713078', 'Butcher Boys', 2013, 'Horror, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Duane Graves, Justin Meeks', 'Kim Henkel', 'Ali Faulkner, Edwin Neal, Marilyn Burns, Derek Lee Nixon, Johnny Walter, Sonny Carl Davis, John Dugan, Phillip Wolf', 'R', 'A gut-wrenching, non-stop roller coaster ride through the hellish underbelly of inner-city America. A birthday celebration at an upscale restaurant sets in motion events that bring Sissy, her brother, Mikey, and friends, Kenny and Barbie, face to face with the macabre world of the Boneboys. Inspired by Jonathan Swift''s cannibalistic tale A Modest Proposal, the Boneboys are international predators who deal in human flesh - dead or alive. Their hunting grounds are the cities of the world.', 'A gut-wrenching, non-stop roller coaster ride through the hellish underbelly of inner-city America. A birthday celebration at an upscale restaurant sets in motion events that bring Sissy, her brother, Mikey, and friends, Kenny and Barbie, face to face with the macabre world of the Boneboys. Inspired by Jonathan Swift''s cannibalistic tale A Modest Proposal, the Boneboys are international predators who deal in human flesh - dead or alive. Their hunting grounds are the cities of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uD91BX9GSfkdUauxKuxMy2wUsm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145668'),
  ('1100529380236567385', 'Butcher, Baker, Nightmare Maker', 1981, 'Thriller, Horror', 'William Asher, Jan de Bont, James Charleston', 'Alan Jay Glueckman, Steve Briemer, Boon Collins', 'Jimmy McNichol, Susan Tyrrell, Bo Svenson, Julia Duffy, Marcia Lewis, Steve Eastin, Britt Leach, Caskey Swaim', 'R', 'Rejected by her lover, the only man left in Cheryl''s life is the orphaned nephew she has raised as her own son. She''ll stop at nothing to keep Billy with her. When her plans misfire, she is swept up into an insane frenzy that means death to anyone who comes between her and her obsession. But the investigating detective is convinced that Billy is the real killer - and determined to prove it. Madness and fanaticism work together to drag all concerned into a terrifying vortex of blood-letting that adds a nightmarish twist to the classic Oedipus story.', 'Rejected by her lover, the only man left in Cheryl''s life is the orphaned nephew she has raised as her own son. She''ll stop at nothing to keep Billy with her. When her plans misfire, she is swept up into an insane frenzy that means death to anyone who comes between her and her obsession. But the investigating detective is convinced that Billy is the real killer - and determined to prove it. Madness and fanaticism work together to drag all concerned into a terrifying vortex of blood-letting that adds a nightmarish twist to the classic Oedipus story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1EpGJRGSxsM8HKOSFpSJYbbZOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67740'),
  ('252422538092060391', 'Butcher''s Crossing', 2023, 'Western, Drama', 'Gabe Polsky, Brooks Kephart, Clenét Verdi-Rose', 'Gabe Polsky, Liam Satre-Meloy', 'Nicolas Cage, Fred Hechinger, Jeremy Bobb, Paul Raci, Xander Berkeley, Rachel Keller, Amber Rose Mason, Zuzu Weingart', 'R', 'In the 1870s, a young Harvard dropout seeks his destiny out West by tying his fate to a team of buffalo hunters led by a man named Miller. Together, they embark on a harrowing journey risking life and sanity.', 'In the 1870s, a young Harvard dropout seeks his destiny out West by tying his fate to a team of buffalo hunters led by a man named Miller. Together, they embark on a harrowing journey risking life and sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KdkRsYuzYPlJMLrV39gdjY3WkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843846'),
  ('715834823654648786', 'Butchers', 2020, 'Horror', 'Adrian Langley', 'Adrian Langley, Daniel Weissenberger', 'Simon Phillips, Michael Swatton, Julie Mainville, Anne-Carolyne Binette, James Hicks, Nick Allan, Blake Canning, Samantha De Benedet', null, 'A family of sadistic butchers lives deep inside the backcountry. From the dead of winter to the dog days of summer, anyone who crosses their path is dead meat.', 'A family of sadistic butchers lives deep inside the backcountry. From the dead of winter to the dog days of summer, anyone who crosses their path is dead meat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4jWlViz5VhDZdyWG786pMBQuY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720026'),
  ('286888079815199717', 'Butchers Book Two: Raghorn', 2024, 'Horror', 'Adrian Langley, Adrian Langley', 'Adrian Langley', 'Nick Biskupek, Michael Swatton, Sam Huntsman, Hollie Kennedy, Corgand Janeway-Svendsen, Miguel Cortez, Mark Templin, Dave Coleman', null, 'Book one followed a family of sadistic butchers, living in the backcountry, who see anyone that crosses their path as dead meat. In “Butchers Book Two: Raghorn,” the story continues when an accident leaves the captors in the hands of brutal cannibals who plan to hack them up for meat.', 'Book one followed a family of sadistic butchers, living in the backcountry, who see anyone that crosses their path as dead meat. In “Butchers Book Two: Raghorn,” the story continues when an accident leaves the captors in the hands of brutal cannibals who plan to hack them up for meat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSLYBuDTHpTAJI9vcm2brMu4J9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244039'),
