  ('723413495019522857', 'Butley', 1974, 'Drama', 'Harold Pinter, Gerry Fisher, Ted Sturgis', 'Simon Gray', 'Alan Bates, Jessica Tandy, Michael Byrne, Georgina Hale, Simon Rouse, Susan Engel, Richard O''Callaghan, Oliver Maguire', null, 'Butley is set in Queen Mary’s College, London and focuses on two English instructors, Ben Butley, a middle-aged former T. S. Eliot expert whose life is now in a shambles, and his protégé, Joey, a homosexual. With both Joey and his wife leaving, Butley faces a life alone, fighting back with wit, obscenity and booze.', 'Butley is set in Queen Mary’s College, London and focuses on two English instructors, Ben Butley, a middle-aged former T. S. Eliot expert whose life is now in a shambles, and his protégé, Joey, a homosexual. With both Joey and his wife leaving, Butley faces a life alone, fighting back with wit, obscenity and booze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBL1OAtZUtWtYFtchOyCSQiFj8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118121'),
  ('291437963774328820', 'Butt Boy', 2020, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Tyler Cornack, William Morean', 'Tyler Cornack, Ryan Koch', 'Tyler Rice, Tyler Cornack, Shelby Dash, Brad Potts, Austin Lewis, Tyler Dryden, Kai Henderson, Wilky Lau', null, 'Detective Fox loves work and alcohol. After he goes to AA, his sponsor, Chip, becomes a suspect in his investigation for a missing kid. Fox believes people are disappearing up Chip’s butt.', 'Detective Fox loves work and alcohol. After he goes to AA, his sponsor, Chip, becomes a suspect in his investigation for a missing kid. Fox believes people are disappearing up Chip’s butt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CFazTqK7A05D1Cjtc7TPKR0naw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624774'),
