  ('124467115186094723', 'Butterflies Are Free', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Milton Katselas, David Hawks, Ned Kopp', 'Leonard Gershe', 'Goldie Hawn, Edward Albert, Eileen Heckart, Paul Michael Glaser, Michael Warren, Charlene Jones, Jessica Rains, Paul Ryan', null, 'Striving to be independent, the blind but determined Don Baker moves away from his overprotective mother. After settling into his new San Francisco digs, Don meets kooky neighbor Jill Tanner. Don''s quick wit and good looks disarm the free-spirited Jill, and before long they''re more than just friends. Will Mrs. Baker''s incessant meddling destroy Don and Jill''s budding relationship?', 'Striving to be independent, the blind but determined Don Baker moves away from his overprotective mother. After settling into his new San Francisco digs, Don meets kooky neighbor Jill Tanner. Don''s quick wit and good looks disarm the free-spirited Jill, and before long they''re more than just friends. Will Mrs. Baker''s incessant meddling destroy Don and Jill''s budding relationship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCBy94qp7D6tGspX3M0ZbkGPQ1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55106'),
  ('191737891148011733', 'Butterfly', 1972, 'Animation', 'Andrey Khrzhanovsky, Elena Petrova', 'Roza Husnitdinova', null, null, 'The film is devoted to the theme of careful attitude to the nature. It tells us how one of butterflies which are caught by the boy, grows till the huge sizes and the hunter appears in the net. Having tested bondage, the boy lets out the captives.', 'The film is devoted to the theme of careful attitude to the nature. It tells us how one of butterflies which are caught by the boy, grows till the huge sizes and the hunter appears in the net. Having tested bondage, the boy lets out the captives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7j7oSj6Q5qb8A5EWKRYPvoOskO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269569'),
  ('89165459693355700', 'Butterfly', 1982, 'Crime, Drama', 'Matt Cimber', 'Matt Cimber, John F. Goff', 'Stacy Keach, Pia Zadora, Orson Welles, Lois Nettleton, Edward Albert, James Franciscus, Stuart Whitman, June Lockhart', 'R', 'Jess Tyler lives a quiet life next to an abandoned mining factory by himself in the desert. His life is turned upside down when a sexually provocative young woman comes to visit him and tells him she''s his daughter. Jess finds it hard to adapt to his newfound parenting role, as a mutual attraction grows between them.', 'Jess Tyler lives a quiet life next to an abandoned mining factory by himself in the desert. His life is turned upside down when a sexually provocative young woman comes to visit him and tells him she''s his daughter. Jess finds it hard to adapt to his newfound parenting role, as a mutual attraction grows between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzcjcO4dX1laL6zP2Poq5gcwM3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34697'),
  ('650209260423456915', 'Butterfly', 1999, 'Drama', 'José Luis Cuerda, José Ramón Otegui, Pedro Loro', 'Rafael Azcona, José Luis Cuerda', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Manuel Lozano, Uxía Blanco, Gonzalo Uriarte, Alexis de los Santos, Jesús Castejón, Guillermo Toledo, Elena Bagutta', 'R', 'The film centres on Moncho and his coming-of-age experience in Galicia in 1936. Moncho develops a close relationship with his teacher Don Gregorio who introduces the boy to different things in the world. While the story centres on Moncho''s ordinary coming-of-age experiences, tensions related to the looming Spanish Civil War periodically interrupt Moncho''s personal growth and daily life.', 'The film centres on Moncho and his coming-of-age experience in Galicia in 1936. Moncho develops a close relationship with his teacher Don Gregorio who introduces the boy to different things in the world. While the story centres on Moncho''s ordinary coming-of-age experiences, tensions related to the looming Spanish Civil War periodically interrupt Moncho''s personal growth and daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSyRibFKtZL0tvjh6tCxTb6o74s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31023'),
  ('519053886352497956', 'Butterfly', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gorretti Mak Yan-Yan, Charlie Lam Chi-Kin', 'Gorretti Mak Yan-Yan', 'Josie Ho, Tian Yuan, Eric Kot Man-Fai, Isabel Chan Yat-Ning, Stephanie Che Yuen-Yuen, Joman Chiang, Kenneth Tsang, Lau Hung-Dau', null, 'Flavia is a thirtysomething married teacher. She has suppressed the memory of her adolescent lesbian fling with Jin and is stuck in a stifling marriage. A chance encounter in a supermarket with the playful and seductive singer Yip reawakens dormant feelings and she begins to think back on her teenage affair with Jin.', 'Flavia is a thirtysomething married teacher. She has suppressed the memory of her adolescent lesbian fling with Jin and is stuck in a stifling marriage. A chance encounter in a supermarket with the playful and seductive singer Yip reawakens dormant feelings and she begins to think back on her teenage affair with Jin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIUa7LFUD660gKUKsohAXimtj1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19935'),
  ('214532735132204640', 'Butterfly', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Marco Berger, Tomás Pérez Silva, Aníbal Girbal', 'Marco Berger', 'Ailín Salas, Javier De Pietro, Julián Infantino, Malena Villa, Justo Calabria, María Laura Cali, Jorge Díez, Pilar Fridman', null, 'A butterfly, a creature symbolising rebirth and a new beginning, epitomises Romina’s and Germán’s world, a world that consists of two parallel realities. In one of them they grow up as siblings who desire each other and try to give shape to their love without sexual fulfilment; in the other they are a young man and woman who form an awkward friendship instead of succumbing to their feelings for each other. Germán finds himself in a discordant relationship with Mariela. Mariela’s brother is interested in Bruno. Bruno is with Romina, but wants to be with Germán. Playfully alternating between these two realities, the lovers find themselves drawn into ever new couplings in order to explore their intuitive feelings – cautiously, but at the same time prepared to lose everything.', 'A butterfly, a creature symbolising rebirth and a new beginning, epitomises Romina’s and Germán’s world, a world that consists of two parallel realities. In one of them they grow up as siblings who desire each other and try to give shape to their love without sexual fulfilment; in the other they are a young man and woman who form an awkward friendship instead of succumbing to their feelings for each other. Germán finds himself in a discordant relationship with Mariela. Mariela’s brother is interested in Bruno. Bruno is with Romina, but wants to be with Germán. Playfully alternating between these two realities, the lovers find themselves drawn into ever new couplings in order to explore their intuitive feelings – cautiously, but at the same time prepared to lose everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LHb6Y1fttu4VGIB0GiXyD4xLFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324578'),
  ('349141038241562404', 'Butterfly', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Florence Miailhe, Guillaume Hoenig', 'Florence Miailhe', 'Fayçal Zafi, Jessica Jaouiche, Yassine Mestaoui, Alexandre Liebe, Johannes Oliver Hamm, Hocine Ben, Olivier Peissel, Foued Kemeche', null, 'A Jewish North African middle-aged man''s swim in the sea triggers memories of his earlier life as an Olympic swimmer before and after World War II.', 'A Jewish North African middle-aged man''s swim in the sea triggers memories of his earlier life as an Olympic swimmer before and after World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wM3enj6TmmxmxGpsfARMyUnbpdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233361'),
  ('953524636982120349', 'Butterfly and Sword', 1993, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Michael Mak Tong-Kit, Chen Jung-Shu', 'John Chong', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Michelle Yeoh, Joey Wong, Jimmy Lin Chih-Ying, Donnie Yen, Tou Tsung-hua, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Elsie Yeh', null, 'A loyalist attempts to keep the King''s empire from being overthrown by a revolutionary group.', 'A loyalist attempts to keep the King''s empire from being overthrown by a revolutionary group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1s86wKq0FTWJ5xQtYW8b7n7g79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40166'),
  ('473721041382769761', 'Butterfly Kiss', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Michael Winterbottom, Seamus McGarvey', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Amanda Plummer, Saskia Reeves, Kathy Jamieson, Des McAleer, Lisa Riley, Freda Dowie, Paula Tilbrook, Fine Time Fontayne', null, 'Deeply mentally unbalanced drifter Eunice roams grim northern Britain committing psychosexual serial murders of both men and women while ostensibly searching for an unknown woman named Judith. She spares the life of lonely but kind-hearted gas station cashier Miriam, who abandons her dismal life to follow her damaged new lover. While attempting to hide the evidence of her multiple crimes, Miriam tries to understand Eunice''s bizarre quest.', 'Deeply mentally unbalanced drifter Eunice roams grim northern Britain committing psychosexual serial murders of both men and women while ostensibly searching for an unknown woman named Judith. She spares the life of lonely but kind-hearted gas station cashier Miriam, who abandons her dismal life to follow her damaged new lover. While attempting to hide the evidence of her multiple crimes, Miriam tries to understand Eunice''s bizarre quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmQ2rKLSsofdXok2y9Xp5gfUqaB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48260'),
  ('201049659900324426', 'Butterfly Kisses', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Erik Kristopher Myers, Robin Nicolai, Rachel Roth', 'Erik Kristopher Myers', 'Seth Adam Kallick, Rachel Armiger, Reed Delisle, Matt Lake, Eileen Del Valle, Janise Whelan, Michael Whelan, David Sterritt', 'NR', 'A filmmaker discovers a box of video tapes depicting two students'' disturbing film project featuring a local horror legend, The Peeping Tom. As he sets out to prove this story is real and release it as a work of his own, he loses himself and the film crew following him into his project.', 'A filmmaker discovers a box of video tapes depicting two students'' disturbing film project featuring a local horror legend, The Peeping Tom. As he sets out to prove this story is real and release it as a work of his own, he loses himself and the film crew following him into his project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XxXYgak0oUhYx8fc0xv6n7dvJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480733'),
  ('601404488923542484', 'Butterfly of Love', 2004, null, 'Nicolas Provost', null, null, null, 'By subjecting fragments from the film ''Rashomon'' by Akira Kurosawa to the mirror effect, Provost creates a hallucinating scene of a woman''s reverse chrysalis into an imploding butterfly. Papillon d''amour produces skewed reflections upon love, its lyrical monstrosities and wounded act of dissappearance.', 'By subjecting fragments from the film ''Rashomon'' by Akira Kurosawa to the mirror effect, Provost creates a hallucinating scene of a woman''s reverse chrysalis into an imploding butterfly. Papillon d''amour produces skewed reflections upon love, its lyrical monstrosities and wounded act of dissappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgfZKCxFBGXIexiYMsSJeWVIse0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239001'),
  ('674768239670707648', 'Butterfly on a Wheel', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Mike Barker, Ashley Rowe', 'William Morrissey', 'Pierce Brosnan, Maria Bello, Gerard Butler, Emma Karwandy, Claudette Mink, Desiree Zurowski, Nicholas Lea, Peter Keleghan', 'R', 'A sociopathic kidnapper methodically pushes a desperate pair of parents to their absolute breaking point.', 'A sociopathic kidnapper methodically pushes a desperate pair of parents to their absolute breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcjjYcMaaSKD2C8xn0hy6o6yj2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13250'),
  ('667618109810416498', 'Butterfly on the Shoulder', 1978, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jacques Deray, Jean Boffety, Jean Charvein', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Tonino Guerra', 'Lino Ventura, Claudine Auger, Paul Crauchet, Jean Bouise, Nicole Garcia, Roland Bertin, Xavier Depraz, Dominique Lavanant', null, 'On a stopover in Barcelona, Fériaud Roland discovers a corpse in the hotel room next door. He wakes up in a strange clinic without remembering who brought him there. The doctor insists he hallucinated, but it''s not long before he obtains evidence that it wasn''t a dream.', 'On a stopover in Barcelona, Fériaud Roland discovers a corpse in the hotel room next door. He wakes up in a strange clinic without remembering who brought him there. The doctor insists he hallucinated, but it''s not long before he obtains evidence that it wasn''t a dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH2N7DNAmfUnBi67CvXLLVn7EWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74809'),
  ('87884474313853923', 'Butterfly Tale', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Sophie Roy', 'Heidi Foss, Lienne Sawatsky', 'Tatiana Maslany, Andrey Batt, Ludivine Reding, Catherine Renaud, Antoine Desrochers, Catherine Brunet, Sophie Cadieux, Julie Le Breton', null, 'A pair of rival butterflies form an unlikely friendship.', 'A pair of rival butterflies form an unlikely friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRhZfZq25AoOGyqhqzT60lI8DI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061728'),
  ('817605171120475312', 'Butterfly Wings', 1991, 'Drama', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Ricardo Steinberg, Aitor Mantxola', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Eduardo Bajo Ulloa', 'Sílvia Munt, Tito Valverde, Susana García Díez, Laura Vaquero, Txema Blasco, Alberto Martín Aranaga, Rafael Martín, Olivia Sánchez', null, 'Ami is a 6 year old girl, extremely sensitive. Her mother, Carmen, lives with the obsession of giving a son to her husband, Gabriel. When finally she gets pregnant, the relation between mother and daughter becomes a tragic one, driving the family to an inevitable nightmare.', 'Ami is a 6 year old girl, extremely sensitive. Her mother, Carmen, lives with the obsession of giving a son to her husband, Gabriel. When finally she gets pregnant, the relation between mother and daughter becomes a tragic one, driving the family to an inevitable nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhOJX3idPDlZ3oQSBSLKO5NHeju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88064'),
  ('552097370310690769', 'Buttoners', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Petr Zelenka, Martina Koulová, Miro Gábor', 'Petr Zelenka', 'Pavel Zajíček, František Černý, Michaela Pavlátová, Jan Čechtický, Pavel Lagner, Zuzana Bydžovská, Jakub Mejdřický, Petr Zelenka', null, 'It is a film consisting of six short stories, which mostly tell in a black humorous, ironic, often bitterly bitter form about an ancient curse, human infidelity, strange deviations, an unexpected miracle and hypocritical forgiveness. They have their own pointed structure, specific atmosphere and way of processing, and yet they pass on motives to each other that communicate with each other and observe the same things from different angles.', 'It is a film consisting of six short stories, which mostly tell in a black humorous, ironic, often bitterly bitter form about an ancient curse, human infidelity, strange deviations, an unexpected miracle and hypocritical forgiveness. They have their own pointed structure, specific atmosphere and way of processing, and yet they pass on motives to each other that communicate with each other and observe the same things from different angles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JrmqCxVu16OONXKsEj6Vxiyvwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65896'),
  ('943069569753023706', 'Buy & Cell', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Robert Boris, Daniele Nannuzzi', 'Ken Krauss, Merrin Holt', 'Robert Carradine, Randall ''Tex'' Cobb, Malcolm McDowell, Roddy Piper, Tony Plana, Fred Travalena, Ben Vereen, Michael Winslow', 'R', 'Herbie Altman is framed for Stock fraud by his boss when the SEC starts investigating his company. Sent to prison, he helps a fellow inmate successfully invest his money. Soon all the inmates want his help. To manage all the money, he forms CON INC. and runs it from the prison under the noses of the warden and the guards. But when the IRS and SEC begin to investigate this successful company, it looks like he may be in trouble again', 'Herbie Altman is framed for Stock fraud by his boss when the SEC starts investigating his company. Sent to prison, he helps a fellow inmate successfully invest his money. Soon all the inmates want his help. To manage all the money, he forms CON INC. and runs it from the prison under the noses of the warden and the guards. But when the IRS and SEC begin to investigate this successful company, it looks like he may be in trouble again', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NRyLWV3vVMLlSIzW4bzxeyrJjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122244'),
