  ('338973353366858858', 'Buzzard', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Joel Potrykus, Adam J. Minnick', 'Joel Potrykus', 'Joshua Burge, Joel Potrykus, Teri Ann Nelson, Joe Anderson, Alan Longstreet, Rico Bruce Wade, Katie Call, Chris Kotcher', 'NR', 'Paranoia forces small-time scam artist Marty to flee his hometown and hide out in a dangerous Detroit. With nothing but a pocket full of bogus checks, his Power Glove, and a bad temper, the horror metal slacker lashes out.', 'Paranoia forces small-time scam artist Marty to flee his hometown and hide out in a dangerous Detroit. With nothing but a pocket full of bogus checks, his Power Glove, and a bad temper, the horror metal slacker lashes out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziImW5nB2AENKBjSo5oEZBUGYOw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253303'),
  ('38543288952867067', 'Bwana', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Imanol Uribe, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Francisco Pino, Imanol Uribe, Joan Potau', 'Andrés Pajares, María Barranco, Emilio Buale, Alejandro Martínez, Andrea Granero, Miguel del Arco, Patricia López Schlichting, Paul Berrondo', null, 'Antonio, a taxi driver, his wife, and two chidren arrive one fine afternoon at a solitary beach, looking for sea-shells. However, they will find more than expected: namely, Ombasi and Yambo, two illegal African immigrants, apparently thrown back to the ocean from where they came, in search of a better life in Spain. The sun sets, and the evening, night and morning which follow see other bizarre characters entering the scene, before the Africans'' and the other characters'' fates are finally decided.', 'Antonio, a taxi driver, his wife, and two chidren arrive one fine afternoon at a solitary beach, looking for sea-shells. However, they will find more than expected: namely, Ombasi and Yambo, two illegal African immigrants, apparently thrown back to the ocean from where they came, in search of a better life in Spain. The sun sets, and the evening, night and morning which follow see other bizarre characters entering the scene, before the Africans'' and the other characters'' fates are finally decided.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7b0At9PkCmkKtO6YD8L1qQfmgSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102754'),
  ('1073577241878839477', 'Bwana Devil', 1952, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Arch Oboler', 'Arch Oboler', 'Robert Stack, Barbara Britton, Nigel Bruce, Ramsay Hill, Paul McVey, Hope Miller, John Dodsworth, Patrick O''Moore', 'NR', 'British railway workers in Kenya are becoming the favorite snack of two man-eating lions. Head engineer Bob Hayward becomes obsessed with trying to kill the beasts before they maul everyone on his crew.', 'British railway workers in Kenya are becoming the favorite snack of two man-eating lions. Head engineer Bob Hayward becomes obsessed with trying to kill the beasts before they maul everyone on his crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHjj8lWg5onfmcl8cxc0gfptwAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43966'),
