  ('894408933586024833', 'By Dawn''s Early Light', 1990, 'TV Movie, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Jack Sholder, Alexander Gruszynski', null, 'Powers Boothe, Rebecca De Mornay, James Earl Jones, Martin Landau, Darren McGavin, Rip Torn, Jeffrey DeMunn, Peter MacNicol', 'PG', 'A nuclear warhead launched by Soviet insurgents protesting the waning Cold War destroys the Ukrainian city of Donetsk. The destruction sets off a race between American and Soviet politicians to prevent a nuclear holocaust. While the U.S. president feverishly works to keep the military and political machine from going into overdrive, various subordinates panic. When the president is believed to be killed in a helicopter crash, zealous advisers take over.', 'A nuclear warhead launched by Soviet insurgents protesting the waning Cold War destroys the Ukrainian city of Donetsk. The destruction sets off a race between American and Soviet politicians to prevent a nuclear holocaust. While the U.S. president feverishly works to keep the military and political machine from going into overdrive, various subordinates panic. When the president is believed to be killed in a helicopter crash, zealous advisers take over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhNcI8fpXVj3fjCYV2OfyHdBUN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20674'),
  ('360586213680723793', 'By Day and by Night', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Alejandro Molina', 'Roberto Garza, Alejandro Molina', 'Gala Montes, Manuel Balbi, Sandra Echeverría, Fernando Becerril, Ari Brickman, Juan Carlos Colombo, Edgar Vivar', null, 'A Mexican science fiction film where the over-population problem has been solved by programming people to operate in either day or night, and not both.', 'A Mexican science fiction film where the over-population problem has been solved by programming people to operate in either day or night, and not both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWKk7rqSXCXD0QBfQLJqG7vpOuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86566'),
  ('716289882596460509', 'By My Side Again', 1999, 'Drama', 'Gracia Querejeta', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón, Elías Querejeta, Gracia Querejeta', 'Mercedes Sampietro, Julieta Serrano, Marta Belaustegui, Jorge Perugorría, Adriana Ozores, Pilar López de Ayala, Nicolás Fernández Luna, María Rodríguez', null, 'When three estranged sisters, Gloria, Ana and Lidia, meet up again on the death of their mother, Adela, they find themselves obeying her somewhat eccentric last wishes. Though their mother has spent the last 30 years without uttering a single word, she has left very clear written instructions of what she wants done after her death.', 'When three estranged sisters, Gloria, Ana and Lidia, meet up again on the death of their mother, Adela, they find themselves obeying her somewhat eccentric last wishes. Though their mother has spent the last 30 years without uttering a single word, she has left very clear written instructions of what she wants done after her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9lX3xwb5br8JrkgBhu7O7G6Qec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160462'),
  ('73460724431840603', 'By Night with Torch and Spear', 1942, null, 'Joseph Cornell', null, null, null, 'Smoke, sparks and steam dance together in Cornell''s found-footage collage. Backwards title cards (or an alien language, if you like) punctuate this mishmash of the industrial and the ancient.', 'Smoke, sparks and steam dance together in Cornell''s found-footage collage. Backwards title cards (or an alien language, if you like) punctuate this mishmash of the industrial and the ancient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WUfRtq2DJTBOHXJVeagEQneRYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146987'),
