  ('40479794129329868', 'By Rule of Crow''s Thumb', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama, Comedy', 'Tadafumi Ito, 桑島憲司, Masakazu Oka', 'Shusuke Michio', 'Hiroshi Abe, Satomi Ishihara, Shôji Murakami, Non, Yu Koyanagi, Shingo Tsurumi, Bengal, Shigeyuki Totsugi', null, 'Constantly on the run from a vicious loan shark, two small-time con artists, Take and Tetsu, plan their biggest and most complex con yet in order to get revenge and retire from a life of crime. However, things get complicated when they cross paths with Mahiro, a young woman that Take inadvertently orphaned during a job gone awry years ago. Seeing Mahiro down on her luck, Take tries to relieve his guilt by taking her on as a partner, while hiding his true identity. But as his plan unfolds, Take discovers that he isn''t the only one with a secret.', 'Constantly on the run from a vicious loan shark, two small-time con artists, Take and Tetsu, plan their biggest and most complex con yet in order to get revenge and retire from a life of crime. However, things get complicated when they cross paths with Mahiro, a young woman that Take inadvertently orphaned during a job gone awry years ago. Seeing Mahiro down on her luck, Take tries to relieve his guilt by taking her on as a partner, while hiding his true identity. But as his plan unfolds, Take discovers that he isn''t the only one with a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTbG5rO9uGMUU1pKh2fYOp6zGVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219049'),
