  ('330769073695777783', 'By the Sword', 1991, 'Drama', 'Jeremy Kagan', 'James Donadio, John McDonald', 'F. Murray Abraham, Eric Roberts, Mia Sara, Christopher Rydell, Elaine Kagan, Brett Cullen, Doug Wert', null, 'An elderly man named Max comes to the famous fencing coach Villar and asks to take him on as a coach. But the coach does not like his weapon technique, and he only takes Max as a cleaner.', 'An elderly man named Max comes to the famous fencing coach Villar and asks to take him on as a coach. But the coach does not like his weapon technique, and he only takes Max as a cleaner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9fTMN9qPJgKXM0xDVa0RX2cvrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42570'),
  ('797396635304022734', 'By the Time It Gets Dark', 2016, 'Drama', 'Anocha Suwichakornpong', 'Anocha Suwichakornpong', 'Visra Vichit-Vadakan, Arak Amornsupasiri, Atchara Suwan, Intira Jaroenpura, Soraya Nakasuwan, Rassami Paoluengtong, Penpak Sirikul, Apinya Sakuljaroensuk', null, 'Film-maker Ann has an upcoming project about the 1976 massacre of Thai students. She interviews Taew, a survivor, at a mountain retreat only to have her perspective change as the project progresses.', 'Film-maker Ann has an upcoming project about the 1976 massacre of Thai students. She interviews Taew, a survivor, at a mountain retreat only to have her perspective change as the project progresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GYa94Ie3EU05OpsDqwy3hJTFID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408265'),
  ('690627757672809209', 'Bye Bye', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Amélie Bonnin, David Cailley, Vincent Levéry', 'Dimitri Lucas, Amélie Bonnin', 'Bastien Bouillon, Juliette Armanet, François Rollin, Lorella Cravotta, Mélodie Lauret, Joseph Kamel, Aurélie Désert, Cécile Podevin', null, 'After graduating from high school, Julien left his hometown to build a bigger life in the capital, leaving his memories behind. And then one day, he had to come back, and that day his memories jumped out at him from between two packets of Pépito cookies.', 'After graduating from high school, Julien left his hometown to build a bigger life in the capital, leaving his memories behind. And then one day, he had to come back, and that day his memories jumped out at him from between two packets of Pépito cookies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Tdd9YyQLRO85agooiawOc8Eqju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845112'),
  ('545349149560021363', 'Bye Bye Barry', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Paul Monusky, Angela Torma, Micaela Powers', null, 'Barry Sanders, Eminem, Jeff Daniels, Bill Belichick, Kevin Glover, Jemele Hill, Calvin Johnson Jr., Herman Moore', 'R', 'When NFL superstar Barry Sanders vanished at the height of his career, he left the NFL world in shock. He was still in his prime, chasing the all-time NFL rushing record when he boarded a flight to England and never stepped foot on the field again. Now, 24 years later, Barry retraces his steps through the streets of London to finally confront the mystery.', 'When NFL superstar Barry Sanders vanished at the height of his career, he left the NFL world in shock. He was still in his prime, chasing the all-time NFL rushing record when he boarded a flight to England and never stepped foot on the field again. Now, 24 years later, Barry retraces his steps through the streets of London to finally confront the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAS05MBhwnkNZi2ksMK6oZhWU6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180248'),
  ('604048989153249422', 'Bye Bye Birdie', 1963, 'Comedy, Music', 'George Sidney, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Lee Adams', 'Janet Leigh, Dick Van Dyke, Ann-Margret, Maureen Stapleton, Bobby Rydell, Jesse Pearson, Paul Lynde, Mary LaRoche', 'G', 'A singer goes to a small town for a performance before he is drafted.', 'A singer goes to a small town for a performance before he is drafted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3m2kU5aFj6V6cNYOd9a22Iia7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25167'),
  ('574682766336474101', 'Bye Bye Birdie', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, TV Movie', 'Irwin Fisch, Glen MacPherson, Gene Saks', 'Michael Stewart', 'Jason Alexander, Vanessa Williams, Chynna Phillips, Tyne Daly, Marc Kudisch, George Wendt, Sally Mayes, Jason Gaffney', null, 'In 1995, ABC presented a telemovie version of the Broadway musical Bye Bye Birdie produced by RHI Entertainment. It starred Seinfeld''s Jason Alexander and Vanessa Williams of Desperate Housewives. While this version remained mostly faithful to the original musical (Michael Stewart remains the only credited author of this version), several songs were added and re-arranged, and dialogue was slightly rewritten to smoothly facilitate the musical changes. The musical revolves around an Elvis Presley-type rocker who''s about to join the Army. To mark the occasion, his manager''s secretary arranges for him to kiss a random fan goodbye on The Ed Sullivan Show. Bye Bye Birdie earned four Tony awards in 1961, including Best Musical and Best Actor in a Musical for its original star, Dick Van Dyke. In addition to Alexander and Williams, ABC''s production starred Tyne Daly, George Wendt, Chynna Phillips and Mark Kudisch.', 'In 1995, ABC presented a telemovie version of the Broadway musical Bye Bye Birdie produced by RHI Entertainment. It starred Seinfeld''s Jason Alexander and Vanessa Williams of Desperate Housewives. While this version remained mostly faithful to the original musical (Michael Stewart remains the only credited author of this version), several songs were added and re-arranged, and dialogue was slightly rewritten to smoothly facilitate the musical changes. The musical revolves around an Elvis Presley-type rocker who''s about to join the Army. To mark the occasion, his manager''s secretary arranges for him to kiss a random fan goodbye on The Ed Sullivan Show. Bye Bye Birdie earned four Tony awards in 1961, including Best Musical and Best Actor in a Musical for its original star, Dick Van Dyke. In addition to Alexander and Williams, ABC''s production starred Tyne Daly, George Wendt, Chynna Phillips and Mark Kudisch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHa9K7WQLYrsdp3f2yyuQdBpFoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36852'),
  ('449383093377022367', 'Bye Bye Blondie', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hélène Louvart, Virginie Despentes', 'Virginie Despentes', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Béatrice Dalle, Soko, Clara Ponsot, Pascal Greggory, Stomy Bugsy, Sasha Andres, Mélanie Martinez', null, 'A love story of two women who meet up in their late forties and attempt to retrieve the romance they had in their youth.', 'A love story of two women who meet up in their late forties and attempt to retrieve the romance they had in their youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEngNN6o8klbFzW61ghgJPS7msd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134781'),
  ('547496751618484695', 'Bye Bye Blue Bird', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katrin Ottarsdóttir, Jørgen Johansson', 'Katrin Ottarsdóttir', 'Hildigunn Eyðfinsdóttir, Sigri Mitra Gaïni, Johan Dalsgaard, Elin K. Mouritsen, Birita Mohr, Peter Hesse Overgaard, Nora Bærentsen, Egi Dam', null, 'Two friends, Rannvá and Barba, return to Faroe Islands after seven years abroad. The girls arouse both curiosity and outrage with their bizarre city appearance and emancipated behaviour. They embark on a road trip with one of the locals, Rúni, who - as it turns out - also carries a dark secret. The trio goes on a journey not just through the beautiful landscape of the Faroes but into the land of the past.', 'Two friends, Rannvá and Barba, return to Faroe Islands after seven years abroad. The girls arouse both curiosity and outrage with their bizarre city appearance and emancipated behaviour. They embark on a road trip with one of the locals, Rúni, who - as it turns out - also carries a dark secret. The trio goes on a journey not just through the beautiful landscape of the Faroes but into the land of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5l071sCi6cKXWWzLEs3pV6zkj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146184'),
  ('923525876781415068', 'Bye Bye Braverman', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Alan Hopkins, Boris Kaufman', 'Herbert Sargent', 'George Segal, Jack Warden, Joseph Wiseman, Sorrell Booke, Jessica Walter, Phyllis Newman, Zohra Lampert, Godfrey Cambridge', null, 'One day, Morroe Rieff learns that his friend and fellow writer, Leslie Braverman, has died. After meeting Leslie''s widow, Inez, who is more flirtatious than grieving, Morroe joins up with three other writer friends, Barnet, Felix, and Holly to attend funeral services. However, the quartet faces numerous obstacles that could keep them from paying their respects.', 'One day, Morroe Rieff learns that his friend and fellow writer, Leslie Braverman, has died. After meeting Leslie''s widow, Inez, who is more flirtatious than grieving, Morroe joins up with three other writer friends, Barnet, Felix, and Holly to attend funeral services. However, the quartet faces numerous obstacles that could keep them from paying their respects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXj7VPwKuEa6OdlTq98jYaZoUVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82460'),
  ('324697069654437838', 'Bye Bye Brazil', 1980, 'Drama', 'Carlos Diegues, Paulo Chada, Bruno Wainer', 'Leopoldo Serran, Carlos Diegues', 'José Wilker, Betty Faria, Fábio Júnior, Zaira Zambelli, Príncipe Nabor, Emmanuel Cavalcanti, José Márcio Passos, Carlos Kroeber', 'R', 'The Caravana Rolidei rolls into town with the Gypsy Lord at the mike: he does magic tricks, the erotic Salomé dances, and the mute Swallow performs feats of strength. A young accordion player is completely enamored of Salomé, and he begs to come along. The Gypsy Lord shrugs, and the accordionist and his pregnant wife, Dasdô, join the troupe.', 'The Caravana Rolidei rolls into town with the Gypsy Lord at the mike: he does magic tricks, the erotic Salomé dances, and the mute Swallow performs feats of strength. A young accordion player is completely enamored of Salomé, and he begs to come along. The Gypsy Lord shrugs, and the accordionist and his pregnant wife, Dasdô, join the troupe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRzzduxIr4FKKZGTg3dtjwNi2YT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42167'),
  ('460076249501058229', 'Bye Bye Germany', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Sam Garbarski, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Sam Garbarski, Michel Bergmann', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Antje Traue, Tim Seyfi, Mark Ivanir, Anatole Taubman, Hans Löw, Pál Mácsai, Václav Jakoubek', null, 'David Berman and his friends, all Holocaust survivors, have only one purpose: to go to America as soon as possible. For this they need money. Close to his aim, David is not only deprived of his savings but also overtaken by his shady past.', 'David Berman and his friends, all Holocaust survivors, have only one purpose: to go to America as soon as possible. For this they need money. Close to his aim, David is not only deprived of his savings but also overtaken by his shady past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucLCeiL3pdIusT5lbNpVBPMTAAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434166'),
  ('486463177741749385', 'Bye Bye Love', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sam Weisman, Kenneth Zunder, Greg Papalia', 'Gary David Goldberg, Brad Hall', 'Matthew Modine, Randy Quaid, Paul Reiser, Janeane Garofalo, Amy Brenneman, Eliza Dushku, Ed Flanders, Maria Pitillo', 'PG-13', 'With varying degrees of success, recently divorced friends Dave, Vic and Donny are trying to move on with their lives. Vic feels vilified by his ex-wife''s parents, while Donny has a shaky bond with his teen daughter, Emma. Dave, meanwhile, has an enviable problem -- he has more dates than he can handle. As they confront their post-marital challenges, the men take solace in one another''s plights.', 'With varying degrees of success, recently divorced friends Dave, Vic and Donny are trying to move on with their lives. Vic feels vilified by his ex-wife''s parents, while Donny has a shaky bond with his teen daughter, Emma. Dave, meanwhile, has an enviable problem -- he has more dates than he can handle. As they confront their post-marital challenges, the men take solace in one another''s plights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMAvEXDLLhIKJzCSiMUgn1ypsO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30528'),
  ('242584791394742399', 'Bye Bye Monkey', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marco Ferreri, Luciano Tovoli', 'Gérard Brach, Marco Ferreri, Rafael Azcona', 'Gérard Depardieu, Marcello Mastroianni, James Coco, Abigail Clayton, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Stefania Casini, Francesca De Sapio, Mimsy Farmer', null, 'In metahistorical New York city electrotechnician Lafayette deals with a megalomaniac director of a wax museum of ancient Rome, an italian lonely anarchist, a group of feminist actresses - including Angelica who falls in love with him - and a small adopted chimpanzee.', 'In metahistorical New York city electrotechnician Lafayette deals with a megalomaniac director of a wax museum of ancient Rome, an italian lonely anarchist, a group of feminist actresses - including Angelica who falls in love with him - and a small adopted chimpanzee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw1PrkRwMe9XZUksQpdB81ExP1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42200'),
  ('385532590551484962', 'Bye Bye Morons', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Albert Dupontel, Alexis Kavyrchine', 'Albert Dupontel', 'Virginie Efira, Albert Dupontel, Nicolas Marié, Jackie Berroyer, Philippe Uchan, Bastien Ughetto, Marilou Aussilloux, Michel Vuillermoz', null, 'When 43-year-old hairdresser Suze Trappet finds out that she''s seriously ill, she decides to go looking for a child she was forced to abandon when she was only 15. On her madcap bureaucratic quest she crosses paths with JB, a 50-year-old man in the middle of a burnout, and Mr. Blin, a blind archivist prone to overenthusiasm. The unlikely trio set off on a hilarious and poignant helterskelter journey across the city in search of Suze''s long-lost child.', 'When 43-year-old hairdresser Suze Trappet finds out that she''s seriously ill, she decides to go looking for a child she was forced to abandon when she was only 15. On her madcap bureaucratic quest she crosses paths with JB, a 50-year-old man in the middle of a burnout, and Mr. Blin, a blind archivist prone to overenthusiasm. The unlikely trio set off on a hilarious and poignant helterskelter journey across the city in search of Suze''s long-lost child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEzAKYpwdfFprRV39B7GxJoz9LV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651881'),
  ('217436170289733924', 'Bye Bye Tiberias', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Lina Soualem, Frida Marzouk, Paul Gauthier', 'Lina Soualem, Nadine Naous, Gladys Joujou', 'Hiam Abbass, Lina Soualem, Um Ali Tabari, Nemat Tabari Abbas, Said Abbas, Omaya Younes, Johayna Hussein Abbas, Buthayna Abbas Hajo', null, 'In her early twenties, Hiam Abbass left her native Palestinian village to follow her dream of becoming an actress in Europe, leaving behind her mother, grandmother, and seven sisters. Thirty years later, her filmmaker daughter Lina returns with her to the village and questions for the first time her mother’s bold choices, her chosen exile and the way the women in their family influenced both their lives.', 'In her early twenties, Hiam Abbass left her native Palestinian village to follow her dream of becoming an actress in Europe, leaving behind her mother, grandmother, and seven sisters. Thirty years later, her filmmaker daughter Lina returns with her to the village and questions for the first time her mother’s bold choices, her chosen exile and the way the women in their family influenced both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHm0kf7NdBlHDX4dj72UqudLJm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156646'),
  ('654014460434130811', 'Bye-Bye', 1995, 'Drama', 'Karim Dridi', 'Karim Dridi', 'Sami Bouajila, Nozha Khouadra, Philippe Ambrosini, Ouassini Embarek, Frédéric Andrau', null, 'In Paris, Ismaél, a young Tunisian, cares for two brothers, Nouredine, a cripple, and streetwise Mouloud, 14. In haste, Ismaél and Mouloud go to Marseilles where an uncle lives. Nouredine has died in a fire, and Ismaél feels guilt on top of grief. Ismaél becomes friends with Jacky, a white man whose father and brother hate immigrants. Mouloud hangs out with cousin Rhida who breaks Islamic rules and deals hash. Ismaél decides Mouloud must return to Tunisia, but the boy runs off, becoming an acolyte to Rhida''s supplier. Ismaél and Jacky''s Arab girlfriend start an affair, friends betray friends, and the racism gets ugly. Can Ismaél rescue himself and Mouloud or will life in France crush them?', 'In Paris, Ismaél, a young Tunisian, cares for two brothers, Nouredine, a cripple, and streetwise Mouloud, 14. In haste, Ismaél and Mouloud go to Marseilles where an uncle lives. Nouredine has died in a fire, and Ismaél feels guilt on top of grief. Ismaél becomes friends with Jacky, a white man whose father and brother hate immigrants. Mouloud hangs out with cousin Rhida who breaks Islamic rules and deals hash. Ismaél decides Mouloud must return to Tunisia, but the boy runs off, becoming an acolyte to Rhida''s supplier. Ismaél and Jacky''s Arab girlfriend start an affair, friends betray friends, and the racism gets ugly. Can Ismaél rescue himself and Mouloud or will life in France crush them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJB8GT95PXKZ2MBrOIOx2xrhbSm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114089'),
  ('44819511004311299', 'Bye, Bye Bluebeard', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Arthur Davis', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky has a series of altercations with a mischievous mouse and a vicious serial killer.', 'Porky has a series of altercations with a mischievous mouse and a vicious serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0NDj0N0kZMmhbxsWFFdhXbtWqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126268'),
  ('726377877753387400', 'Byelorussian Station', 1971, 'Drama', 'Andrey Smirnov, Pavel Lebeshev, Yan Pototsky', 'Vadim Trunin', 'Aleksey Glazyrin, Evgeni Leonov, Anatoliy Papanov, Vsevolod Safonov, Nina Urgant, Raisa Kurkina, Lyubov Sokolova, Margarita Terekhova', null, '"Belorussian Station" is a Soviet drama directed by Andrei Smirnov, completed in 1969 and released in 1971 after censorship delays due to its critical portrayal of post-war Soviet society and veterans'' challenges. The film revolves around four former soldiers who reunite 25 years after World War II. They come together to mourn the death of a friend and reflect on their shared past and their personal struggles. "Belorussian Station" poignantly explores themes of friendship, memory, and the enduring impact of war on ordinary people''s lives, eventually gaining significant acclaim for its heartfelt narrative and strong performances.', '"Belorussian Station" is a Soviet drama directed by Andrei Smirnov, completed in 1969 and released in 1971 after censorship delays due to its critical portrayal of post-war Soviet society and veterans'' challenges. The film revolves around four former soldiers who reunite 25 years after World War II. They come together to mourn the death of a friend and reflect on their shared past and their personal struggles. "Belorussian Station" poignantly explores themes of friendship, memory, and the enduring impact of war on ordinary people''s lives, eventually gaining significant acclaim for its heartfelt narrative and strong performances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36O2YFv179ynFFgZ161odbLDgwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107705'),
  ('255274933398606623', 'Bygones Be Bygones', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Hakan Algül', 'Ata Demirer', 'Ata Demirer, Tuvana Türkay, Ülkü Duru, Salih Kalyon, Renan Bilek, Seda Güven, Toprak Sergen, Ali Yoğurtçuoğlu', null, 'A mother''s plan to find her bachelor son a match derails when a new prospect turns up and sinister schemes unfold.', 'A mother''s plan to find her bachelor son a match derails when a new prospect turns up and sinister schemes unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikyl1liJU6G1Y31oegsnVkIKFlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433138'),
  ('233520880182305113', 'Byl jednou jeden polda', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Jaroslav Soukup, Dagmar Frantová, Vladimír Holomek', 'Miroslav Vaic, Jaroslav Vokřál, Jaroslav Soukup', 'Ladislav Potměšil, Miroslav Moravec, Rudolf Hrušínský, Jana Synková, Jaroslav Sypal, Ivan Gübel, Marcel Ochránek, Radim Kalvoda', null, 'The film, which opens with students arriving at a police academy, is a crazy comedy that is more a series of zany episodes and jokes than a coherent story. They are linked by a simple plot in which the commander of the police academy, Major Maisner, searches among his recruits for an alleged FBI spy and, after a not-so-subtle practical joke, gets into a dispute with his subordinate, a dispute that ends in a genuine bank robbery.', 'The film, which opens with students arriving at a police academy, is a crazy comedy that is more a series of zany episodes and jokes than a coherent story. They are linked by a simple plot in which the commander of the police academy, Major Maisner, searches among his recruits for an alleged FBI spy and, after a not-so-subtle practical joke, gets into a dispute with his subordinate, a dispute that ends in a genuine bank robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IP0UQbC1Ib3aG2lVgbxLcZ7o6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195169'),
  ('304237687629838657', 'Byleth: The Demon of Incest', 1972, 'Drama, Horror', 'Leopoldo Savona', 'Leopoldo Savona', 'Mark Damon, Claudia Gravy, Aldo Bufi Landi, Franco Jamonte, Alessandro Perrella, Fernando Cerulli, Silvana Pompili, Marzia Damon', null, 'A young man becomes obsessed with Byleth, the demon of incest, and it leads to an unhealthy infatuation with his sister.', 'A young man becomes obsessed with Byleth, the demon of incest, and it leads to an unhealthy infatuation with his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhXmRakzWSIMNHQnMHkYRZKLiuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104970'),
  ('455928837078587834', 'Bypass', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Patxo Tellería, Aitor Mazo', 'Patxo Tellería', 'Gorka Otxoa, Sara Cózar, Bárbara Goenaga, Aitor Mazo, Itziar Atienza, Mikel Losada, Unax Ugalde', null, 'An economist Basque (Gorka Ochoa) based in Barcelona becomes embroiled in a difficult emotional dilemma between his girlfriend (Bárbara Goenaga), who is pregnant, and a childhood friend (Sara Cozar), heart condition, which is declared by compassion convinced that he would die. The problem arises when the patient makes a miraculous recovery and he is forced to pretend he loves her.', 'An economist Basque (Gorka Ochoa) based in Barcelona becomes embroiled in a difficult emotional dilemma between his girlfriend (Bárbara Goenaga), who is pregnant, and a childhood friend (Sara Cozar), heart condition, which is declared by compassion convinced that he would die. The problem arises when the patient makes a miraculous recovery and he is forced to pretend he loves her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92QeK3jz8eRMBPKvHE6PxVd6YBy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135900'),
  ('491060893212412461', 'Byron: Ballad for a Daemon', 1992, 'Drama', 'Nikos Koundouros', 'Nikos Koundouros, Fotis Konstadinidis', 'Manos Vakousis, Vasilis Laggos, Akis Sakellariou, Manolis Sormainis, Aleksandr Kirillov, Igor Yasulovich', null, 'Poet Lord Byron decides to fight with the Greek revolutionaries in Missolonghi against the Turks but instead the glorious battle wrestles with fever and his own demons.', 'Poet Lord Byron decides to fight with the Greek revolutionaries in Missolonghi against the Turks but instead the glorious battle wrestles with fever and his own demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mfkv9FQkmX1AECUykLdpv3pALq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399823'),
  ('1120126110283741579', 'Byzance', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Maurice Pialat, Willy Kurant', 'Stefan Zweig', 'André Reybaz', null, 'Byzance uses a text by Stefan Zweig to describe the Ottoman conquest of the city in 1453. Before he turned to feature filmmaking in 1968 with Naked Childhood, Pialat worked on a series of short films, many of them financed by French television. Byzance is one of Pialat’s six Turkish shorts.', 'Byzance uses a text by Stefan Zweig to describe the Ottoman conquest of the city in 1453. Before he turned to feature filmmaking in 1968 with Naked Childhood, Pialat worked on a series of short films, many of them financed by French television. Byzance is one of Pialat’s six Turkish shorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0qDDNYwT6x6GuY11emImN9Bhhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162346'),
  ('649559381941990575', 'Byzantium', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Neil Jordan, Louise Mathews, Sean Bobbitt', 'Moira Buffini', 'Gemma Arterton, Saoirse Ronan, Sam Riley, Jonny Lee Miller, Caleb Landry Jones, Daniel Mays, Kate Ashfield, Maria Doyle Kennedy', 'R', 'Residents of a coastal town learn, with deadly consequences, the secret shared by the two mysterious women who have sought refuge at a local boarding house, the Byzantium.', 'Residents of a coastal town learn, with deadly consequences, the secret shared by the two mysterious women who have sought refuge at a local boarding house, the Byzantium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFkfRnXz6Rk9tAKgUznJH1FURQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102780'),
  ('944725405741836644', 'C Kkompany', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Sachin Yardi', null, 'Tusshar Kapoor, Anupam Kher, Rajpal Yadav, Mithun Chakraborty, Raima Sen, Ekta Kapoor, Mahesh Bhatt, Karan Johar', null, 'Akshay Kumar is a crime reporter, Mr. Joshi is a retired accountant trying to deal with his ungrateful son and Lambodar are friends. These three share their respective plight with one another and find solace in each others company. On one occasion, they play a harmless prank to tackle their problems. One thing leads to another, and before they realize, the incident becomes news. But things don’t stop there. They put their new founded fame to good use, and this in turn triggers off a series of incidents, which propel them to such heights that the three become the talk of the nation. Things get beyond their control, and the three are left with no choice but to be mute spectators to their newly acquired fame, especially since no one knows their identity.', 'Akshay Kumar is a crime reporter, Mr. Joshi is a retired accountant trying to deal with his ungrateful son and Lambodar are friends. These three share their respective plight with one another and find solace in each others company. On one occasion, they play a harmless prank to tackle their problems. One thing leads to another, and before they realize, the incident becomes news. But things don’t stop there. They put their new founded fame to good use, and this in turn triggers off a series of incidents, which propel them to such heights that the three become the talk of the nation. Things get beyond their control, and the three are left with no choice but to be mute spectators to their newly acquired fame, especially since no one knows their identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndEFSdqZjjIVZVZiWAYf3ZK86S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20295'),
  ('486252081632212136', 'C U Soon', 2020, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Mahesh Narayanan, Sajimon Prabhakar, Sabin Uralikandy', 'Mahesh Narayanan', 'Roshan Mathew, Darshana Rajendran, Fahadh Faasil, Maala Parvathi, Saiju Kurup, Kottayam Ramesh, Vaishnavi Venugopal, Naveen Nazim', null, 'Jimmy meets Anu on an online dating website and decides to marry her. Jimmy''s mother entrusts his cousin Kevin to get details about Anu. Now it''s Kevin''s turn to search for his cousin''s fiancee who vanished without a trace, only to discover dark, shocking truths about her.', 'Jimmy meets Anu on an online dating website and decides to marry her. Jimmy''s mother entrusts his cousin Kevin to get details about Anu. Now it''s Kevin''s turn to search for his cousin''s fiancee who vanished without a trace, only to discover dark, shocking truths about her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/or5qouMAtv86TMeSgHpMGMWG4IN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735120'),
