  ('313478239028731613', 'C.H.O.M.P.S.', 1979, 'Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Don Chaffey, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Duane Poole, Dick Robbins, Joseph Barbera', 'Wesley Eure, Valerie Bertinelli, Conrad Bain, Red Buttons, Jim Backus, Chuck McCann, Larry Bishop, Hermione Baddeley', 'PG', 'A young man invents a robot dog that has super strength, x-ray vision and can detect crimes being committed. A greedy businessman tries to steal the boy''s invention from him.', 'A young man invents a robot dog that has super strength, x-ray vision and can detect crimes being committed. A greedy businessman tries to steal the boy''s invention from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSdGZa4vNSAb3xmvevXNgCRPxEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77593'),
  ('751373177390334735', 'C.H.U.D.', 1984, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Douglas Cheek, Peter Stein, Sonja Roth', 'Parnell Hall', 'John Heard, Daniel Stern, Christopher Curry, Kim Greist, Laure Mattos, Brenda Currin, Justin Hall, Michael O''Hare', 'R', 'A rash of bizarre murders in New York City seems to point to a group of grotesquely deformed vagrants living in the sewers. A courageous policeman, a photojournalist and his girlfriend, and a nutty bum, who seems to know a lot about the creatures, band together to try and determine what the creatures are and how to stop them.', 'A rash of bizarre murders in New York City seems to point to a group of grotesquely deformed vagrants living in the sewers. A courageous policeman, a photojournalist and his girlfriend, and a nutty bum, who seems to know a lot about the creatures, band together to try and determine what the creatures are and how to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BVw5RIDBTZwdMAR1VKpAkwrMjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23730'),
