  ('66138358062008858', 'C.I.A. Code Name: Alexa', 1992, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joseph Merhi, Richard Pepin, Ken Blakey', 'Ken Lamplugh, John Weidner', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Kathleen Kinmont, O. J. Simpson, Alex Cord, Pamela Dixon, Jeff Griggs, Michael Bailey Smith, Stephen Quadros', 'R', 'A CIA operative kills a terrorist during a prison break. When a group of terrorists attempts to recover a microchip implanted in the man''s body, one of them is captured and convinced by the CIA to work for them as an informer.', 'A CIA operative kills a terrorist during a prison break. When a group of terrorists attempts to recover a microchip implanted in the man''s body, one of them is captured and convinced by the CIA to work for them as an informer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykGYtRnwEZzbXSBThS8WQRbiSgN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218671'),
  ('489242250480591304', 'C.I.A. II: Target Alexa', 1993, 'Thriller, Action', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Ken Blakey, Richard Pepin', 'Michael January', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Kathleen Kinmont, John Savage, John Saint Ryan, Lori Fetrick, Branscombe Richmond, Pamela Dixon, Al Sapienza', 'R', 'When a top secret nuclear guidance system is stolen by an ex-CIA operative looking to sell the deadly device to the top bidder, it''s up to a determined CIA agent and the international terrorist who he has vowed to capture to team up and stop the madman from destabilizing the world in the feature directorial debut of action icon Lorenzo Lamas. CIA Agent Mark Graver (Lamas) was living a quiet life when word came down that a government facility had been breached and a valuable device stolen. Now forced to team with former terrorist Alexa (Kathleen Kinmont) to retrieve the guidance system from international terrorist Franz Kluge (John Savage).', 'When a top secret nuclear guidance system is stolen by an ex-CIA operative looking to sell the deadly device to the top bidder, it''s up to a determined CIA agent and the international terrorist who he has vowed to capture to team up and stop the madman from destabilizing the world in the feature directorial debut of action icon Lorenzo Lamas. CIA Agent Mark Graver (Lamas) was living a quiet life when word came down that a government facility had been breached and a valuable device stolen. Now forced to team with former terrorist Alexa (Kathleen Kinmont) to retrieve the guidance system from international terrorist Franz Kluge (John Savage).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jh1yzITWhhyWK2gNPv9XgaiQqa7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143901'),
  ('446613144017350102', 'C.I.D.', 1956, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Raj Khosla', 'Inder Raj Anand', 'Dev Anand, Shakila, Waheeda Rehman, K.N. Singh, Johnny Walker, Kumkum, Mehmood, Jagdish Raj', null, 'A newspaper editor gets murdered when he was about to expose the underworld links of a rich man. A C.I.D inspector gets assigned to investigate the murder.', 'A newspaper editor gets murdered when he was about to expose the underworld links of a rich man. A C.I.D inspector gets assigned to investigate the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnVupPBGSyQtNDdiIZgrkLxKscN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71284'),
  ('872985242430124716', 'C.I.D. Moosa', 2003, 'Comedy, Action', 'Saloo George, Johny Antony', 'Siby K Thomas, Uday Krishna', 'Dileep, Bhavana, Jagathy Sreekumar, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Harisree Ashokan, Cochin Haneefa, Oduvil Unnikrishnan, Murali', null, 'Moosa, a private detective, faces many challenges while solving various cases. His only rival is his own brother-in-law, Peethambaran, who is a police officer.', 'Moosa, a private detective, faces many challenges while solving various cases. His only rival is his own brother-in-law, Peethambaran, who is a police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evsWMsxq8xZbCDFWwjN6ZX8e3Fw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329991'),
  ('218447674225207946', 'C.i.S.: Chaoten im Sondereinsatz', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Erik Haffner, Stephan Schuh, Ronny Bregulla', 'Berthold Probst, Oliver Welter, Yannick Posse', 'Sasha, Martina Hill, Alexander Schubert, Aleksandar Jovanović, Dieter Thomas Heck, Michael Ammer, Erdoğan Atalay, Tom Beck', null, 'Lukas Maler is a butcher. Albeit more out of necessity than out of passion: As the “Karajan with the scalpel”, his vocation was always forensic medicine. When he accidently destroyed all evidence against the “24-hour-killer”, his career as a coroner was done for. And not far from it was his marriage with his great love Diana, whom he could not offer anything anymore as a broken man. But Lukas gets a second chance when once again a serial killer terrifies the city because the murders resemble those of the “24-hour-killer”. Diana – who has ascended to head of the forensic institute in the meantime – knows that only the best one can solve the case. But he is not available. And so, she gets the second-best one: the most over-qualified butcher in town…', 'Lukas Maler is a butcher. Albeit more out of necessity than out of passion: As the “Karajan with the scalpel”, his vocation was always forensic medicine. When he accidently destroyed all evidence against the “24-hour-killer”, his career as a coroner was done for. And not far from it was his marriage with his great love Diana, whom he could not offer anything anymore as a broken man. But Lukas gets a second chance when once again a serial killer terrifies the city because the murders resemble those of the “24-hour-killer”. Diana – who has ascended to head of the forensic institute in the meantime – knows that only the best one can solve the case. But he is not available. And so, she gets the second-best one: the most over-qualified butcher in town…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH9eA5qnjEyVS7o0JYYEdtZBcOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39097'),
  ('236337259886179038', 'C.O.G.', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kyle Patrick Alvarez, Jas Shelton', 'Kyle Patrick Alvarez', 'Jonathan Groff, Denis O''Hare, Corey Stoll, Dean Stockwell, Dale Dickey, Casey Wilson, Troian Bellisario, Danny Belrose', 'R', 'A gay cocky young man travels to Oregon to work on an apple farm. Out of his element, he finds his lifestyle and notions being picked apart by everyone who crosses his path.', 'A gay cocky young man travels to Oregon to work on an apple farm. Out of his element, he finds his lifestyle and notions being picked apart by everyone who crosses his path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa0iJ5XAPZzxsZWo0fEoMjrujaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156713'),
  ('449316804527419498', 'C.R.A.Z.Y.', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Marc Vallée, Pierre Mignot, Marc Larose', 'Jean-Marc Vallée, François Boulay', 'Marc-André Grondin, Danielle Proulx, Michel Côté, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Alex Gravel, Maxime Tremblay, Natacha Thompson, Francis Ducharme', 'NR', 'A young French Canadian, one of five boys in a conservative family in the 1960s and 1970s, struggles to reconcile his emerging identity with his father''s values.', 'A young French Canadian, one of five boys in a conservative family in the 1960s and 1970s, struggles to reconcile his emerging identity with his father''s values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoFk3zmjnfSQC7LkE0aqkzZlOPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11421'),
