  ('205852621452348048', 'C''est la vie', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Yves Vandermereen', 'Jean-Pierre Améris', 'Jacques Dutronc, Sandrine Bonnaire, Emmanuelle Riva, Jacques Spiesser, Annie Grégorio, Marilyne Canto, Patrick Lizana, Julia Vaidis-Bogard', null, 'Dimitri joins La Maison, a place where people are welcomed for whom medicine can not do anything anymore. There he meets Suzanne, a volunteer who is dedicated to supporting people at the end of their lives.', 'Dimitri joins La Maison, a place where people are welcomed for whom medicine can not do anything anymore. There he meets Suzanne, a volunteer who is dedicated to supporting people at the end of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lL8djpTjfUoOKeFyiJnZiMwxL87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79048'),
  ('669837324936616285', 'C''est La Vie', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Diane Kurys, Fabio Conversi, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Alain Le Henry', 'Nathalie Baye, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Zabou Breitman, Richard Berry, Vincent Lindon, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Julie Bataille, Didier Bénureau', null, 'A story is about young teenage girl, with sister and brothers, a pleasant uncle and aunt, an annoying nanny, a young boy interested in kissing her, a close relationship with the imaginary addressee of her daily diary and her parents'' disintegrating marriage - all this in a rented house in a summer resort.', 'A story is about young teenage girl, with sister and brothers, a pleasant uncle and aunt, an annoying nanny, a young boy interested in kissing her, a close relationship with the imaginary addressee of her daily diary and her parents'' disintegrating marriage - all this in a rented house in a summer resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjxFVDmOWFbHDmIP93waiFYBBbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77672'),
  ('446598983211626014', 'C''est La Vie Mon Cheri', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Derek Yee', 'Derek Yee', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Paul Chun Pui, Petrina Fung Bo-Bo, Carina Lau, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Sylvia Chang, Jacob Cheung Chi-Leung', null, 'Unable to make it as a commercial success because he staunchly refuses to sell out, a struggling Hong Kong musician rediscovers his love of music and regains an interest in his life''s meaning through his relationship with a dying girl.', 'Unable to make it as a commercial success because he staunchly refuses to sell out, a struggling Hong Kong musician rediscovers his love of music and regains an interest in his life''s meaning through his relationship with a dying girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7o8tncDaFVWX0U07IzZWbc2ebaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107682'),
  ('102356488125497516', 'C''est la vie!', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache, David Chizallet', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Gilles Lellouche, Jean-Paul Rouve, Vincent Macaigne, Alban Ivanov, Eye Haïdara, Suzanne Clément, Hélène Vincent', null, 'Max is a battle-weary veteran of the wedding-planning racket. His latest — and last — gig is a hell of a fête, involving stuffy period costumes for the caterers, a vain, hyper- sensitive singer who thinks he''s a Gallic James Brown, and a morose, micromanaging groom determined to make Max''s night as miserable as possible. But what makes the affair too bitter to endure is that Max''s colleague and ostensible girlfriend, Joisette, seems to have written him off, coolly going about her professional duties while openly flirting with a much younger server. It''s going to be a very long night… especially once the groom''s aerial serenade gets underway.', 'Max is a battle-weary veteran of the wedding-planning racket. His latest — and last — gig is a hell of a fête, involving stuffy period costumes for the caterers, a vain, hyper- sensitive singer who thinks he''s a Gallic James Brown, and a morose, micromanaging groom determined to make Max''s night as miserable as possible. But what makes the affair too bitter to endure is that Max''s colleague and ostensible girlfriend, Joisette, seems to have written him off, coolly going about her professional duties while openly flirting with a much younger server. It''s going to be a very long night… especially once the groom''s aerial serenade gets underway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9hIxAKPdXo9Fgwca6vT4USOXK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432068'),
  ('20900519670560007', 'C''est magnifique !', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thierry Pouget, Clovis Cornillac', 'Tristan Schulmann, Lilou Fogli, Clovis Cornillac', 'Clovis Cornillac, Alice Pol, Manon Lemoine, Myriam Boyer, Gilles Privat, Alexandra Roth, Lilou Fogli, Laurent Bateau', null, 'When Pierre learns that his parents are not his parents, he wants to find out who he is and where he comes from. Raised in nature, Pierre has never been confronted with society. He does not know the codes. He will team up with Anna who will help him in his quest and cross a whole gallery of characters as funny as tender. But during his investigation, Pierre will lose his colors – like a photo that fades.', 'When Pierre learns that his parents are not his parents, he wants to find out who he is and where he comes from. Raised in nature, Pierre has never been confronted with society. He does not know the codes. He will team up with Anna who will help him in his quest and cross a whole gallery of characters as funny as tender. But during his investigation, Pierre will lose his colors – like a photo that fades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXncN0io58NdvgOoxB6n42Uh7oP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783570'),
