  ('635164460770138366', 'C''mon C''mon', 2021, 'Drama', 'Randin Brown, Jason Chandler, Rachel Iovine', 'Mike Mills', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Gaby Hoffmann, Woody Norman, Scoot McNairy, Molly Webster, Jaboukie Young-White, Deborah Strang, Sunni Patterson', 'R', 'Johnny and his young nephew forge a tenuous but transformational relationship when they embark on a cross-country trip to see life away from Los Angeles.', 'Johnny and his young nephew forge a tenuous but transformational relationship when they embark on a cross-country trip to see life away from Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oOyJsdcJnnE7cl9bZdUQvBjKNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632617'),
  ('1116510998954143558', 'C(r)ook', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Pepe Danquart', 'Mike Majzen, Pepe Danquart, Martin Daniel', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Henry Hübchen, Corinna Harfouch, Karlheinz Hackl, Josef Hader, Vincent Klink, Nadeshda Brennicke, Roland Düringer', null, 'A killer for the Russian Mafia in Vienna wants to retire and write a book about his passion - cooking. The mafia godfather suspects treason.', 'A killer for the Russian Mafia in Vienna wants to retire and write a book about his passion - cooking. The mafia godfather suspects treason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebH7UcxveEudlhzlmfRBu2Tneq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8995'),
  ('1081526716244166355', 'Ça n''arrive qu''à moi', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Francis Perrin, Didier Tarot', 'Gilles Jacob, Didier Jacob, Francis Perrin', 'Francis Perrin, Véronique Genest, Bernard Blier, François Perrot, Roland Blanche, Christiane Minazzoli, Tony Librizzi, Eloïse Beaune', null, 'A particularly unlucky man meets a beautiful young woman, daughter of a rich businessman. This one, pursued by blackmailers, is going to take him along in her galleys.', 'A particularly unlucky man meets a beautiful young woman, daughter of a rich businessman. This one, pursued by blackmailers, is going to take him along in her galleys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBYYyAxyEPdoKwihhhYB0hvFzmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251968'),
  ('514552304212989473', 'Ça reste entre nous', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Martin Lamotte', 'Carole Brenner, Jean-Carol Larrivé', 'Catherine Frot, Séverine Ferrer, Sam Karmann, Carole Brenner, Fanny Cottençon, Stéphane Freiss, Isabelle Nanty, Zabou Breitman', null, 'Martin Lamotte made his directorial debut with this French comedy. Building contractor Patrick is unaware that Helene, his wife for 15 years, intends to celebrate their wedding anniversary with a surprise party. She''s invited friends and relatives to spend the weekend at their blue house. Elsewhere down the road, at an identical blue house, Patrick and his other love, Elizabeth, the mother of his two-year-old daughter, are planning an engagement party for the son of their neighbor. Neither woman knows about the other, and this sticky situation requires Patrick to rush back and forth from one blue house to another throughout the evening. The story is told in flashback by Patrick -- from his hospital bed.', 'Martin Lamotte made his directorial debut with this French comedy. Building contractor Patrick is unaware that Helene, his wife for 15 years, intends to celebrate their wedding anniversary with a surprise party. She''s invited friends and relatives to spend the weekend at their blue house. Elsewhere down the road, at an identical blue house, Patrick and his other love, Elizabeth, the mother of his two-year-old daughter, are planning an engagement party for the son of their neighbor. Neither woman knows about the other, and this sticky situation requires Patrick to rush back and forth from one blue house to another throughout the evening. The story is told in flashback by Patrick -- from his hospital bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s6v4rzPuH8nLBGnOIV4CEvmc6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166606'),
  ('14526727012303295', 'Ça se soigne ?', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Chouchan', null, 'Thierry Lhermitte, Julie Ferrier, Michel Vuillermoz, Isabelle Gélinas, Stéphane Freiss, François-Xavier Demaison, Elisabeth Quin, Gérard Jugnot', null, 'Tom has everything going for him! He is a renowned and celebrated conductor, sought after all over the world, and his talent is a source of national pride. He is rich, intelligent, and cultured. He has a dream wife with a promising future in aerospace. He has just moved into a magnificent apartment. In short, he is thriving, and everything is going perfectly for him. But a simple traffic light triggers his downfall! He spirals into depression, consults the top specialists, raises countless questions, experiences periods of recovery and bursts of excitement, only to plunge back into a bottomless pit, pushing away everyone trying to bring him back to reason. When "Tom the genius" collapses under the weight of his illness, it marks the beginning of a nightmare for all his friends. Worse—it’s a tsunami!', 'Tom has everything going for him! He is a renowned and celebrated conductor, sought after all over the world, and his talent is a source of national pride. He is rich, intelligent, and cultured. He has a dream wife with a promising future in aerospace. He has just moved into a magnificent apartment. In short, he is thriving, and everything is going perfectly for him. But a simple traffic light triggers his downfall! He spirals into depression, consults the top specialists, raises countless questions, experiences periods of recovery and bursts of excitement, only to plunge back into a bottomless pit, pushing away everyone trying to bring him back to reason. When "Tom the genius" collapses under the weight of his illness, it marks the beginning of a nightmare for all his friends. Worse—it’s a tsunami!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTE6YEPqZ9l3deB08lKUQBLgN4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15625'),
  ('871227430216493083', 'Ca$h', 2008, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Éric Besnard, Gilles Henry', 'Éric Besnard', 'Jean Dujardin, Jean Reno, Valeria Golino, Alice Taglioni, François Berléand, Caroline Proust, Mehdi Nebbou, Cyril Couton', null, 'A man meets up with two "good guys" to recover what is unlawfully his, taking them on his whirlwind ride, doing things they never would have imagined, just to survive.', 'A man meets up with two "good guys" to recover what is unlawfully his, taking them on his whirlwind ride, doing things they never would have imagined, just to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Lwmsz1qQ0fNBLf5KBBrlzsozee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13652'),
  ('326181834321472133', 'Ca$h', 2010, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy, Mystery', 'Stephen Milburn Anderson, John R. Leonetti, Robert Primes', 'Stephen Milburn Anderson', 'Sean Bean, Chris Hemsworth, Victoria Profeta, Mike Starr, Michael Mantell, Glenn Plummer, Antony Thekkek, Paul Sanchez', 'R', 'A stroke of good luck turns lethal for Sam Phelan and his wife Leslie when they are faced with a life-changing decision that brings strange and sinister Pyke Kubic to their doorstep. As Pyke leads Sam and Leslie on a tumultuous adventure through the streets of Chicago, each are pulled deeper and deeper into a desperate spiral of deception and violence – all in the name of money.', 'A stroke of good luck turns lethal for Sam Phelan and his wife Leslie when they are faced with a life-changing decision that brings strange and sinister Pyke Kubic to their doorstep. As Pyke leads Sam and Leslie on a tumultuous adventure through the streets of Chicago, each are pulled deeper and deeper into a desperate spiral of deception and violence – all in the name of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5B7nG6xREL6lNnS34ZoAvXbB9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27004'),
  ('1143255872823218870', 'Cab Calloway''s Hi-De-Ho', 1934, 'Comedy, Music', 'Fred Waller, William O. Steiner', null, 'Cab Calloway, Sidney Easton, Fredi Washington, Ethel Moses', null, 'This jazz musical short has a comedy plot about marital infidelity. Bandleader Cab Calloway plays a ladies man who dates the wife (Fredi Washington) of a train porter who is frequently absent from home. Calloway and his Orchestra perform "Zaz-zuh-zaz" and "The Lady with the Fan" at the Cotton Club in Harlem.', 'This jazz musical short has a comedy plot about marital infidelity. Bandleader Cab Calloway plays a ladies man who dates the wife (Fredi Washington) of a train porter who is frequently absent from home. Calloway and his Orchestra perform "Zaz-zuh-zaz" and "The Lady with the Fan" at the Cotton Club in Harlem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e92hogfbJ2wMrJtWhxapaC6Zmn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183475'),
  ('641703280877239686', 'Caballos salvajes', 1995, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Gabriel Arbós, Silvana Gandolfo', 'Aída Bortnik, Marcelo Piñeyro', 'Héctor Alterio, Cecilia Dopazo, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Fernán Mirás, Cipe Lincovsky, Federico Luppi, Daniel Kuzniecka, Antonio Grimau', null, 'Jose is an elderly rebel who, after being refused a withdrawal at a bank, returns with a gun and threatens to shoot himself if he doesn''t get his cash. Pedro, a young teller, is disillusioned with his life and sees Jose''s stunt as a way out when he pretends to be taken hostage, leaving the bank with the old man and a hefty amount of money. The unlikely duo become friends, picking up tough-girl Ana along the way, while avoiding the police.', 'Jose is an elderly rebel who, after being refused a withdrawal at a bank, returns with a gun and threatens to shoot himself if he doesn''t get his cash. Pedro, a young teller, is disillusioned with his life and sees Jose''s stunt as a way out when he pretends to be taken hostage, leaving the bank with the old man and a hefty amount of money. The unlikely duo become friends, picking up tough-girl Ana along the way, while avoiding the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csuAGgHpqry6xnSp3tI4z76VMU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32208'),
  ('441469996281865293', 'Cabaret', 1972, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Bob Fosse, Geoffrey Unsworth, Renate Neuchl', 'Jay Presson Allen', 'Liza Minnelli, Michael York, Helmut Griem, Joel Grey, Fritz Wepper, Marisa Berenson, Elisabeth Neumann-Viertel, Helen Vita', 'PG', 'Inside the Kit Kat Club of 1931 Berlin, starry-eyed singer Sally Bowles and an impish emcee sound the clarion call to decadent fun, while outside a certain political party grows into a brutal force.', 'Inside the Kit Kat Club of 1931 Berlin, starry-eyed singer Sally Bowles and an impish emcee sound the clarion call to decadent fun, while outside a certain political party grows into a brutal force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMhOeJ2TvuY46iYGmsowhgRXfnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10784'),
  ('141341745846802454', 'Cabaret', 1993, 'Romance, Music, Drama, War, History', 'Sam Mendes', 'Fred Ebb, Joe Masteroff', 'Alan Cumming, Jane Horrocks, Sara Kestelman, Adam Godley, George Raistrick, Charlotte Medcalf, Michael Gardiner, Loveday Smith', null, 'Filmed live during the 1993 revival, Sam Mendes'' directorial debut takes place at the Donmar Warehouse in London''s West End. Jane Horrocks stars as Sally Bowles, Adam Godley as Cliff, and Alan Cumming as the eccentric Emcee. Inside the Kit Kat Club in 1931 Berlin, starry-eyed singer Sally and the lewd Emcee sound the clarion call to decadence, while outside, the Nazi party grows into a brutal force.', 'Filmed live during the 1993 revival, Sam Mendes'' directorial debut takes place at the Donmar Warehouse in London''s West End. Jane Horrocks stars as Sally Bowles, Adam Godley as Cliff, and Alan Cumming as the eccentric Emcee. Inside the Kit Kat Club in 1931 Berlin, starry-eyed singer Sally and the lewd Emcee sound the clarion call to decadence, while outside, the Nazi party grows into a brutal force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwmPpekLC8WWpS0Chcy2i8Y10Ha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215768'),
  ('790526653832461313', 'Cabaret Balkan', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Goran Paskaljević, Milan Spasić', 'Filip David, Dejan Dukovski, Goran Paskaljević', 'Nikola Ristanovski, Nebojša Glogovac, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Marko Urošević, Bogdan Diklić, Josif Tatić, Predrag Tasovac, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić', 'R', '20 peoples paths crisscross one night in violent mid-''90s Belgrade.', '20 peoples paths crisscross one night in violent mid-''90s Belgrade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YZY9mEje6dsdoGgBybdI8ftlmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47144'),
  ('281888120622956432', 'Cabeza de Vaca', 1991, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Nicolás Echevarría, Guillermo Navarro', 'Nicolás Echevarría, Guillermo Sheridan', 'Juan Diego, Roberto Sosa, Carlos Castanon, Gerardo Villarreal, Roberto Cobo, José Flores, Farnesio de Bernal, Josefina Echánove', 'R', 'In 1528, a Spanish expedition flounders off the coast of Florida with 600 lives lost. One survivor, Alvar Nunez Cabeza de Vaca, roams across the American continent searching for his Spanish comrades. Instead, he discovers the Iguase, an ancient Indian tribe. Over the next eight years, Cabeza de Vaca learns their mystical and mysterious culture, becoming a healer and a leader. But soon this New World collides with the Old World as Spanish conquistadors seek to enslave the Indians, and Cabeza de Vaca must confront his own people and his past.', 'In 1528, a Spanish expedition flounders off the coast of Florida with 600 lives lost. One survivor, Alvar Nunez Cabeza de Vaca, roams across the American continent searching for his Spanish comrades. Instead, he discovers the Iguase, an ancient Indian tribe. Over the next eight years, Cabeza de Vaca learns their mystical and mysterious culture, becoming a healer and a leader. But soon this New World collides with the Old World as Spanish conquistadors seek to enslave the Indians, and Cabeza de Vaca must confront his own people and his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8X3HtTRSoUdj6gEVQLadM5Wqvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41785'),
  ('825975368207047402', 'Cabin Boy', 1994, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Romance', 'Adam Resnick, Thomas A. Irvine, Seth Cirker', 'Adam Resnick', 'Chris Elliott, Ritch Brinkley, James Gammon, Brian Doyle-Murray, Brion James, Melora Walters, I.M. Hobson, Alex Nevil', 'PG-13', 'A foul-mouthed finishing school graduate mistakenly winds up on an ill-fated fishing boat, and faces the wrath of a crew that considers him bad luck.', 'A foul-mouthed finishing school graduate mistakenly winds up on an ill-fated fishing boat, and faces the wrath of a crew that considers him bad luck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy2BzE3siqU67VQCQ2k4xideNNM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26391'),
  ('1043208604951185974', 'Cabin by the Lake', 2000, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Leong Po-Chih, Philip Linzey, Nico Sachse', 'David Stephens', 'Judd Nelson, Hedy Burress, Susan Gibney, Bernie Coulson, Colleen Wheeler, Daniella Evangelista, Michael Weatherly, Jennifer Carmichael', null, 'A screenwriter does research for his new script by actually kidnapping and drowning young girls. He then places them in his "garden" of other dead girls coming back daily to check on them. One girl narrowly escapes and the other bodies are found leading to an ingenious plot to try and capture the killer.', 'A screenwriter does research for his new script by actually kidnapping and drowning young girls. He then places them in his "garden" of other dead girls coming back daily to check on them. One girl narrowly escapes and the other bodies are found leading to an ingenious plot to try and capture the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dttOEOJ76BHhUR4858e2RBcYdNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30780'),
  ('145704053532899993', 'Cabin Fever', 2003, 'Horror', 'Scott Kevan, Eli Roth, Susan McGuire', 'Eli Roth, Randy Pearlstein', 'Rider Strong, Jordan Ladd, Cerina Vincent, Giuseppe Andrews, James DeBello, Eli Roth, Julie Childress, Jessica Elder', 'R', 'A group of five college graduates rent a cabin in the woods and begin to fall victim to a horrifying flesh-eating virus, which attracts the unwanted attention of the homicidal locals.', 'A group of five college graduates rent a cabin in the woods and begin to fall victim to a horrifying flesh-eating virus, which attracts the unwanted attention of the homicidal locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaUkSL7PbeeKfdFKOh9TYR9M1ds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11547'),
  ('926217884954685589', 'Cabin Fever', 2016, 'Horror', 'Travis Zariwny, Gavin Kelly, James Currier', 'Eli Roth, Randy Pearlstein', 'Teresa Decher, Samuel Davis, Nadine Crocker, Dustin Ingram, Richard G. Boron, Gage Golightly, Tim Zajaros, Matthew Daddario', 'R', 'While staying at a remote cabin for a week-long vacation, a group of five college friends succumb to an infectious, flesh-eating disease.', 'While staying at a remote cabin for a week-long vacation, a group of five college friends succumb to an infectious, flesh-eating disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJQLWoizC5zBjVk9dr2Qo1K1TCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298584'),
  ('1147231189235375452', 'Cabin Fever 2: Spring Fever', 2009, 'Horror', 'Ti West, Eliot Rockett, Andrea Redder', 'Joshua Malkin', 'Rider Strong, Noah Segan, Alexi Wasser, Lindsey Axelsson, Gabrielle Tuite, Andrea Powell, Stephanie Drapeau, Giuseppe Andrews', 'R', 'A high school prom faces a deadly threat: a flesh-eating virus that spreads via a popular brand of bottled water.', 'A high school prom faces a deadly threat: a flesh-eating virus that spreads via a popular brand of bottled water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RmQpuArPv71IuDLn8CP710fNgk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28739'),
  ('409418930291404129', 'Cabin Fever: Patient Zero', 2014, 'Horror', 'Kaare Andrews, Norm Li, Francisco Adolfo Valdez', 'Jake Wade Wall', 'Jillian Murray, Mitch Ryan, Lydia Hearst, Claudette Lalí, Sean Astin, Solly Duran, Currie Graham, Ryan Donowho', 'NR', 'A group of friends head to a deserted Caribbean island for a surprise overnight bachelor party only to discover that the island isn''t deserted. It''s actually the home to a secret medical facility. Not only that, there''s something wrong with the water surrounding the island...', 'A group of friends head to a deserted Caribbean island for a surprise overnight bachelor party only to discover that the island isn''t deserted. It''s actually the home to a secret medical facility. Not only that, there''s something wrong with the water surrounding the island...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5A4wV8k9Kv2OY3XjI9WDA5qsAkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157424'),
  ('501027709353651892', 'Cabin Girl', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jon D. Wagner', 'Leslie Beaumont, Rory James Wood', 'Rose Lane Sanfilippo, Austin Scott, Jess Weixler, Lee Tergesen, Michael Rispoli, Phuong Kubacki, Ali Fumiko Whitney, Garrett Kruithof', null, 'When a van-life influencer moves into an isolated cabin, she discovers the home has a dark history and becomes haunted by a troubled spirit.', 'When a van-life influencer moves into an isolated cabin, she discovers the home has a dark history and becomes haunted by a troubled spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hca3PedvFt1I9wRaoIPehdZCkgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146249'),
  ('700014554005384947', 'Cabin in the Sky', 1943, 'Music, Fantasy', 'Vincente Minnelli, Sidney Wagner, Douglas Shearer', 'Marc Connelly', 'Ethel Waters, Eddie ''Rochester'' Anderson, Lena Horne, Louis Armstrong, Rex Ingram, Kenneth Spencer, John ''Bubbles'' Sublett, Oscar Polk', null, 'When compulsive gambler Little Joe Jackson dies in a drunken fight, he awakens in purgatory, where he learns that he will be sent back to Earth for six months to prove that he deserves to be in heaven. He awakens, remembering nothing and struggles to do right by his devout wife, Petunia, while an angel known as the General and the devil''s son, Lucifer Jr., fight for his soul.', 'When compulsive gambler Little Joe Jackson dies in a drunken fight, he awakens in purgatory, where he learns that he will be sent back to Earth for six months to prove that he deserves to be in heaven. He awakens, remembering nothing and struggles to do right by his devout wife, Petunia, while an angel known as the General and the devil''s son, Lucifer Jr., fight for his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MSTz2fS8P7ufuCXIHBFpjqW9tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59964'),
  ('575452127886164915', 'Cabiria', 1914, 'Drama, History', 'Giovanni Pastrone, Segundo de Chomón, Natale Chiusano', 'Giovanni Pastrone, Gabriele D''Annunzio', 'Carolina Catena, Lidia Quaranta, Gina Marangoni, Dante Testa, Umberto Mozzato, Bartolomeo Pagano, Raffaele di Napoli, Emilio Vardannes', null, 'Young Cabiria is kidnapped by pirates and sold as a slave in Carthage. Just as she''s to be sacrificed to Moloch, Cabiria is rescued by Fulvius Axilla, a good-hearted Roman spy, and his powerful slave, Maciste. The trio are broken up as Cabiria is entrusted to a woman of noble birth. With Cabiria''s fate unknown, Maciste punished for his heroism, and Fulvius sent away to fight for Rome, is there any hope of our heroes reuniting?', 'Young Cabiria is kidnapped by pirates and sold as a slave in Carthage. Just as she''s to be sacrificed to Moloch, Cabiria is rescued by Fulvius Axilla, a good-hearted Roman spy, and his powerful slave, Maciste. The trio are broken up as Cabiria is entrusted to a woman of noble birth. With Cabiria''s fate unknown, Maciste punished for his heroism, and Fulvius sent away to fight for Rome, is there any hope of our heroes reuniting?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZhgcHHapkzYmB0OhQcRfZ7LdLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5153'),
  ('638616672997684435', 'Caboblanco', 1980, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'J. Lee Thompson, Terence D. Buchinsky, Jesús Marín', 'Morton S. Fine, Milton S. Gelman', 'Charles Bronson, Jason Robards, Dominique Sanda, Fernando Rey, Simon MacCorkindale, Camilla Sparv, Gilbert Roland, Denny Miller', null, 'Giff Hoyt, a cafe owner in Cabo Blanco, Peru after World War II is caught between refuge-seeking Nazis and their enemies. After the murder of a sea explorer is passed off as accidental death by the corrupt local police, Giff becomes suspicious. The police chief also intimidates a new arrival Marie, and Giff intervenes to help her. Giff suspects Beckdorff, a Nazi refugee living in the area. Beckdorff, it emerges, is seeking to uncover sunken treasure.', 'Giff Hoyt, a cafe owner in Cabo Blanco, Peru after World War II is caught between refuge-seeking Nazis and their enemies. After the murder of a sea explorer is passed off as accidental death by the corrupt local police, Giff becomes suspicious. The police chief also intimidates a new arrival Marie, and Giff intervenes to help her. Giff suspects Beckdorff, a Nazi refugee living in the area. Beckdorff, it emerges, is seeking to uncover sunken treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hlsR7NmgNzqvwOKGIw0YjQz8HY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11767'),
  ('1086986872401507808', 'Cabrini', 2024, 'History, Drama', 'Alejandro Monteverde, Gorka Gómez Andreu', 'Rod Barr', 'Cristiana Dell''Anna, David Morse, Giancarlo Giannini, John Lithgow, Romana Maggiora Vergano, Federico Ielapi, Virginia Bocelli, Rolando Villazón', 'PG-13', 'Italian immigrant Francesca Cabrini arrives in 1889 New York City and is greeted by disease, crime, and impoverished children. Cabrini sets off on a daring mission to convince the hostile mayor to secure housing and healthcare for society''s most vulnerable. With broken English and poor health, Cabrini uses her entrepreneurial mind to build an empire of hope unlike anything the world had ever seen.', 'Italian immigrant Francesca Cabrini arrives in 1889 New York City and is greeted by disease, crime, and impoverished children. Cabrini sets off on a daring mission to convince the hostile mayor to secure housing and healthcare for society''s most vulnerable. With broken English and poor health, Cabrini uses her entrepreneurial mind to build an empire of hope unlike anything the world had ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uR7iQKPynetIxnbbWalF6OXbNcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975056'),
  ('998346218133210469', 'Caccia al tesoro', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Matteo Parenti, Giorgio Melidoni, Enrico Lucidi', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Carlo Buccirosso, Christiane Filangieri, Serena Rossi, Max Tortora, Gennaro Guazzo, Pippo Lorusso, Francesco Di Leva', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiq0tpsU7aXez3nV8pqWG6LdYHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468199'),
  ('495896316166060577', 'Cachada: The Opportunity', 2019, 'Drama', 'Marlén Viñayo', 'Marlén Viñayo', 'Evelyn Chileno, Ruth H. Vega, Magdalena Henríquez, Wendy Henríquez, Egly Larreynaga, Magaly Lemus', null, 'Five Salvadoran saleswomen want to take their cruel life stories to the stage. During the rehearsal process of their play, they’ll discover themselves as victims and victimizers in a cycle of violence that has plagued their families for generations.', 'Five Salvadoran saleswomen want to take their cruel life stories to the stage. During the rehearsal process of their play, they’ll discover themselves as victims and victimizers in a cycle of violence that has plagued their families for generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/380RbkcXOsWep9Vm9IgDcz6zNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576722'),
  ('367605098672043517', 'Caché', 2005, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Haneke, Christian Berger, Katharina Biró', 'Michael Haneke', 'Daniel Auteuil, Juliette Binoche, Annie Girardot, Bernard Le Coq, Daniel Duval, Maurice Bénichou, Walid Afkir, Lester Makedonsky', 'R', 'George, host of a television show focusing on literature, receives videos shot on the sly that feature his family, along with disturbing drawings that are difficult to interpret. He has no idea who has made and sent him the videos. Progressively, the contents of the videos become more personal, indicating that the sender has known George for a long time.', 'George, host of a television show focusing on literature, receives videos shot on the sly that feature his family, along with disturbing drawings that are difficult to interpret. He has no idea who has made and sent him the videos. Progressively, the contents of the videos become more personal, indicating that the sender has known George for a long time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTzjRi0Uhy0tt3Rjw8SARZZJHlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445'),
