  ('768346754742193521', 'Cafe Funiculi Funicula', 2018, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Ayuko Tsukahara, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Kasumi Arimura, Kentaro Ito, Haru, Kento Hayashi, Motoki Fukami, Yutaka Matsushige, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Yoh Yoshida', null, 'Kazu works at "Funiculi Funicula" cafe. There is a mysterious rumour that if a customer takes a specific seat at the cafe, that customer can travel back to a time of their choice.', 'Kazu works at "Funiculi Funicula" cafe. There is a mysterious rumour that if a customer takes a specific seat at the cafe, that customer can travel back to a time of their choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEmD12sYEWfPTkZgNUOyoLYe3z5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526384'),
