  ('149748245294572404', 'Cafe Society', 1997, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Raymond De Felitta, Michael Mayers', 'Raymond De Felitta', 'Frank Whaley, Peter Gallagher, Lara Flynn Boyle, John Spencer, Anna Thomson, Christopher Murney, Paul Guilfoyle, Richard B. Shull', null, 'New York 1952. Mickey Jelke inherits a big sum of money and spends his nights in Manhattan, painting the city red. Night after night, he can be found in one Broadway bar or the other, in the company of disreputable persons like pimps and prostitutes. One day,a shady cop, aided by Mickey''s own girlfriend, Patricia, decides to accuse him of running a prostitution network. A scandal breaks out.', 'New York 1952. Mickey Jelke inherits a big sum of money and spends his nights in Manhattan, painting the city red. Night after night, he can be found in one Broadway bar or the other, in the company of disreputable persons like pimps and prostitutes. One day,a shady cop, aided by Mickey''s own girlfriend, Patricia, decides to accuse him of running a prostitution network. A scandal breaks out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94W02LaPPwokNIYqGsMlROWUeqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214104'),
  ('124959867981785436', 'Café Society', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Brad Robinson, Danielle Rigby, Katya Blumenberg', 'Woody Allen', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Kristen Stewart, Steve Carell, Blake Lively, Parker Posey, Corey Stoll, Jeannie Berlin, Ken Stott', 'PG-13', 'The story of a young man who arrives in Hollywood during the 1930s hoping to work in the film industry, falls in love, and finds himself swept up in the vibrant café society that defined the spirit of the age.', 'The story of a young man who arrives in Hollywood during the 1930s hoping to work in the film industry, falls in love, and finds himself swept up in the vibrant café society that defined the spirit of the age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9fohCRpQ7m8OTyi82fxa3B86te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339397'),
  ('1053469690656505728', 'Café solo... o con ellas', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Teo Delgado, Álvaro Díaz Lorenzo', 'Álvaro Díaz Lorenzo', 'Alejo Sauras, Asier Etxeandia, Diego París, Javier Godino, Lucía Jiménez, Elena Ballesteros, Terele Pávez, Inma Cuesta', null, 'Javi, Hugo, Dani and Pedro are four friends in their late twenties trying to make a life for themselves. The cafe is where the buddies meet through the ups and downs of fast-paced lives full of basketball games, late-night partying and schemes to get what they want most: a little love and a girl who loves them.', 'Javi, Hugo, Dani and Pedro are four friends in their late twenties trying to make a life for themselves. The cafe is where the buddies meet through the ups and downs of fast-paced lives full of basketball games, late-night partying and schemes to get what they want most: a little love and a girl who loves them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTLgBR6iWtvhk3fQAMh0yCUfO2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38995'),
  ('794127526038200611', 'Café. Waiting. Love', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Ching-Lin Chiang', null, 'Vivian Sung, Bruce He, Vivian Chow, Megan Lai, Marcus Chang, Pauline Lan, Lee Luo, Cheng Chih-wei', null, 'College freshman Si-ying gets a part-time job at “Cafe. Waiting. Love” coffee shop, where she befriends Abusi, a tomboyish barista who can make any coffee the customers request, the beautiful and mysterious cafe owner, and Zeyu, the boy who always sits in the same spot in the cafe who seems to be very popular with girls and on whom Si-ying develops an instant crush.', 'College freshman Si-ying gets a part-time job at “Cafe. Waiting. Love” coffee shop, where she befriends Abusi, a tomboyish barista who can make any coffee the customers request, the beautiful and mysterious cafe owner, and Zeyu, the boy who always sits in the same spot in the cafe who seems to be very popular with girls and on whom Si-ying develops an instant crush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNQqkpBT2LfZFvsdlF5rGTldfwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287703'),
  ('317858160532594369', 'Caffè', 2016, 'Drama', 'Vladan Radović, Cristiano Bortone, Daniela Baldasarre', 'Matthew Thompson, Cristiano Bortone, Annalaura Ciervo', 'Dario Aita, Miriam Dalmazio, Ennio Fantastichini, Lu Fangsheng, Tan Zhuo, Yimo Li, Zhang Qiuge, Michael Schermi', null, 'For the sommeliers, coffee has three flavors: bitter, sour and a bit of fragrant towards the end. Through the common element of this so evocative product, this movie tells three stories set in three very different parts of the world. In Belgium, during some riots, a precious coffeepot gets stolen from Hamed''s shop. He''ll decide, once discovers the identity of the thief, to take vengeance alone. In Italy, Renzo, a young Latte Art expert, is involved in a robbery in a coffee shop, but things don''t go as planned. In China, Ren Fei, a brilliant manager, finds out that his factory risks destroying a valley in the Yunnan, the beautiful region on the border with Laos.', 'For the sommeliers, coffee has three flavors: bitter, sour and a bit of fragrant towards the end. Through the common element of this so evocative product, this movie tells three stories set in three very different parts of the world. In Belgium, during some riots, a precious coffeepot gets stolen from Hamed''s shop. He''ll decide, once discovers the identity of the thief, to take vengeance alone. In Italy, Renzo, a young Latte Art expert, is involved in a robbery in a coffee shop, but things don''t go as planned. In China, Ren Fei, a brilliant manager, finds out that his factory risks destroying a valley in the Yunnan, the beautiful region on the border with Laos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmOiTzt0hZvRkcLBDMKx6G2lP5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420329'),
  ('533141770133150983', 'Caffeine', 2006, 'Comedy', 'John Cosgrove, Shawn Maurer', 'Dean Craig', 'Marsha Thomason, Breckin Meyer, Mena Suvari, Katherine Heigl, Callum Blue, Mark Pellegrino, Roz Witt, Andrew-Lee Potts', 'R', 'A fanciful battle of the sexes ensues when the relationships of the staff and patrons of a quirky London café are unexpectedly turned upside down by sudden revelations of terribly embarrassing secrets having to do with their sexual misadventures. The food is not that good, but you can be yourselves and show yourselves for what you are: maniacs, perverts, gays, cheaters, violent old women, cross-dressers, whining singers, broken hearts... Come in, there is room!', 'A fanciful battle of the sexes ensues when the relationships of the staff and patrons of a quirky London café are unexpectedly turned upside down by sudden revelations of terribly embarrassing secrets having to do with their sexual misadventures. The food is not that good, but you can be yourselves and show yourselves for what you are: maniacs, perverts, gays, cheaters, violent old women, cross-dressers, whining singers, broken hearts... Come in, there is room!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XOO0EkctFIxgUuy7YlJCV4kbnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18654'),
  ('568463022378480498', 'Cage', 1989, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Lang Elliott, Jacques Haitkin', 'Hugh Kelley', 'Lou Ferrigno, Reb Brown, Michael Dante, Mike Moroff, Marilyn Tokuda, Al Leong, James Shigeta, Branscombe Richmond', 'R', 'A GI in Vietnam saves his buddy''s life, but in the process is shot in the head. The injury results in brain damage to the point where he basically has a child''s brain in a (very large) man''s body. When they get out of the army the two open up a bar together, but some local gangsters make things tough for them after they refuse to take part in brutal "cage" matches where fighters battle to the point of serious injury and/or death.', 'A GI in Vietnam saves his buddy''s life, but in the process is shot in the head. The injury results in brain damage to the point where he basically has a child''s brain in a (very large) man''s body. When they get out of the army the two open up a bar together, but some local gangsters make things tough for them after they refuse to take part in brutal "cage" matches where fighters battle to the point of serious injury and/or death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctMRcOXBPywf647uP3M8SkNPj4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51463'),
  ('310790267230273622', 'Cage Dive', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gerald Rascionato, Andrew Bambach, Gerald Rascionato', 'Gerald Rascionato', 'Joel Hogan, Josh Potthoff, Megan Peta Hill, Pete Valley, Mark Fell, Christopher Callen, Tara Wraith, Teagan Berger', 'R', 'Three friends from California are filming an audition tape for an extreme reality game show. They document their journey to Australia where they will be doing their most dangerous activity: Shark Cage Diving. A catastrophic turn of events leaves them in baited water full of Great White Sharks, turning their recording into a blood chilling diary of survival...And death.', 'Three friends from California are filming an audition tape for an extreme reality game show. They document their journey to Australia where they will be doing their most dangerous activity: Shark Cage Diving. A catastrophic turn of events leaves them in baited water full of Great White Sharks, turning their recording into a blood chilling diary of survival...And death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uUO9eDxHeDREIX77BaQiI88ajp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420707'),
  ('241098577333751197', 'Cage of Gold', 1950, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Basil Dearden, Douglas Slocombe, Harry Kratz', 'Jack Whittingham', 'Jean Simmons, David Farrar, James Donald, Herbert Lom, Bernard Lee, Harcourt Williams, Maria Mauban, Grégoire Aslan', null, 'The love that Judy, a young painter, feels for Alan, a promising doctor to whom she is engaged, falters when Bill, an old friend, suddenly appears.', 'The love that Judy, a young painter, feels for Alan, a promising doctor to whom she is engaged, falters when Bill, an old friend, suddenly appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhNLcPJOa2ck4jZ6Kse77WRqGOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155331'),
  ('839848558250367654', 'Caged', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Cromwell, Carl E. Guthrie, Frank Mattison', 'Virginia Kellogg, Bernard C. Schoenfeld', 'Eleanor Parker, Agnes Moorehead, Ellen Corby, Hope Emerson, Betty Garde, Jan Sterling, Lee Patrick, Olive Deering', null, 'A single mistake puts a 19-year old girl behind bars, where she experiences the terrors and torments of women in prison.', 'A single mistake puts a 19-year old girl behind bars, where she experiences the terrors and torments of women in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvGyjfwGOQkB91XbzLJHmItiBIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29381'),
  ('426786300239089421', 'Caged', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Yann Gozlan, Renaud Chassaing, Vincent Mathias', 'Yann Gozlan, Guillaume Lemans', 'Zoé Félix, Arié Elmaleh, Ivan Franěk, Igor Skreblin, Philippe Krhajac, Margaux Guenier, Goran Kostić, Typhaine Hilaire', null, 'Somewhere in Eastern Europe. Carole is a young nurse with a humanitarian aid group that has reached the end of its mission. But just then, the young woman and her two colleagues are kidnapped by strangers for mysterious reasons. Held captive, cared for and kept alive in an oppressive and sinister setting, the three prisoners soon discover with horror what their kidnappers truly have in store for them.', 'Somewhere in Eastern Europe. Carole is a young nurse with a humanitarian aid group that has reached the end of its mission. But just then, the young woman and her two colleagues are kidnapped by strangers for mysterious reasons. Held captive, cared for and kept alive in an oppressive and sinister setting, the three prisoners soon discover with horror what their kidnappers truly have in store for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxo4ITKoGX8uY3hgs1VhSEW7aQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57018'),
  ('679603080073999054', 'Caged', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Aaron Fjellman', 'Aaron Fjellman, James ''Doc'' Mason', 'Edi Gathegi, Melora Hardin, Angela Sarafyan, Tony Amendola, Robert R. Shafer, James Jagger, Chris Blasman, Andy Mackenzie', 'NR', 'An African American male is imprisoned and placed in solitary confinement after being found guilty of murdering his wife, as he''s haunted by internal demons and his dead wife, and pushed to the breaking point by an abusive female guard.', 'An African American male is imprisoned and placed in solitary confinement after being found guilty of murdering his wife, as he''s haunted by internal demons and his dead wife, and pushed to the breaking point by an abusive female guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NUM43rtQSt0chumXGJPvnYb01I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777620'),
  ('724528360185641272', 'Caged Birds', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Oliver Rihs, Felix von Muralt', 'Oliver Rihs, Norbert Maass, Dave Tucker', 'Joel Basman, Marie Leuenberger, Jella Haase, Anatole Taubman, Bibiana Beglau, Pascal Ulli, Beat Marti, Milton Welsh', null, 'Barbara Hug is a young radical lawyer fighting Switzerland''s antiquated prison system in the 1980s. Walter Stürm is in and often escaping out of jail becoming known as the Jailbreak King. When the two meet an unlikely alliance is formed.', 'Barbara Hug is a young radical lawyer fighting Switzerland''s antiquated prison system in the 1980s. Walter Stürm is in and often escaping out of jail becoming known as the Jailbreak King. When the two meet an unlikely alliance is formed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daKLwWEOVWrwlcTn312zw469zMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747440'),
  ('386313931790318194', 'Caged Fury', 1990, 'Action', 'Bill Milling, Kenneth H. Wiatrak', 'Bill Milling', 'Roxanna Michaels, Erik Estrada, Elena Sahagun, Richard Barathy, Gregory Scott Cummins, April Dawn Dollarhide, Paul L. Smith, James Hong', null, 'Kat arrives in Los Angeles to audition for movies. However, after meeting a sleazy producer, she and her new friend find themselves in a women''s prison run by sadistic guards and a lesbian warden.', 'Kat arrives in Los Angeles to audition for movies. However, after meeting a sleazy producer, she and her new friend find themselves in a women''s prison run by sadistic guards and a lesbian warden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkDD3t7z5mIOOb7WLDMieF9nVnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91612'),
  ('639977792732363198', 'Caged Heat', 1974, 'Action, Drama', 'Jonathan Demme, Richard Fernau, Tak Fujimoto', 'Jonathan Demme', 'Juanita Brown, Roberta Collins, Erica Gavin, Ella Reid, Cheryl Smith, Barbara Steele, Warren Miller, Crystin Sinclaire', 'R', 'A young woman is convicted on drug offenses and sent to a women''s penitentiary run by a repressed and oppressive female warden. When the prison''s sadistic doctor begins conducting illegal "therapeutic" experiments on the inmates, the ladies plot their revenge.', 'A young woman is convicted on drug offenses and sent to a women''s penitentiary run by a repressed and oppressive female warden. When the prison''s sadistic doctor begins conducting illegal "therapeutic" experiments on the inmates, the ladies plot their revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPLvEqdADWH5MmzKz31dNndHbF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39775'),
  ('794671882999804374', 'Caged Heat 3000', 1995, 'Science Fiction', 'Aaron Osborne, Sheila Lightfoot, Jackie C. Lee', 'Emile Dupont', 'Lisa Boyle, Kena Land, Zaneta Polard, Don Yanan, Debra Beatty, Mark Sikes, Robert J. Ferrelli, Debra Rogers', null, 'It''s the year 3000 AD. The world''s most dangerous women are banished to a remote asteroid 45 million light years from earth. Kira Murphy doesn''t belong; wrongfully accused of a crime she did not commit, she''s thrown in this interplanetary prison and left to her own defenses. But Kira''s a fighter, and soon she finds herself in the middle of a female gang war; where everyone wants a piece of the action... and a piece of her! "Caged Heat 3000" takes the Women-in-Prison genre to a whole new level... and a whole new galaxy!', 'It''s the year 3000 AD. The world''s most dangerous women are banished to a remote asteroid 45 million light years from earth. Kira Murphy doesn''t belong; wrongfully accused of a crime she did not commit, she''s thrown in this interplanetary prison and left to her own defenses. But Kira''s a fighter, and soon she finds herself in the middle of a female gang war; where everyone wants a piece of the action... and a piece of her! "Caged Heat 3000" takes the Women-in-Prison genre to a whole new level... and a whole new galaxy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/un9pLM0KuqZBxmWKVvRjR6wmhgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222848'),
  ('1002238221133723387', 'Caged Wings', 2023, 'Drama', 'Mario Casas', 'Mario Casas, Déborah François', 'Óscar Casas, Candela González, Farid Bechara, Francisco Boira, Marta Bayarri, Adolfo Parra, Yerlin Ureña Gil, Ángeles Moreno', 'R', 'Dan, a budding street artist, supports himself with smash-and-grab heists. But his father''s return from jail reignites his demons and pushes him to flee.', 'Dan, a budding street artist, supports himself with smash-and-grab heists. But his father''s return from jail reignites his demons and pushes him to flee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNjnJMvN1XO5DRFAWz7Wp1BZtjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119355'),
  ('739207098553226844', 'Caged Women', 1980, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Erwin C. Dietrich, Peter Baumgartner', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Karine Gambier, Brigitte Lahaie, Nadine Pascal, France Lomay, Eric Falk, Will Stoer, Claudia Fielers, Nadine de Rangot', null, 'A bunch of delinquent women are shipped to an island prison run by the sadistic warden Carla. Forced into situations of sexual perversion and violence and torture, the prisoners band together to try to overthrow Carla and escape the island.', 'A bunch of delinquent women are shipped to an island prison run by the sadistic warden Carla. Forced into situations of sexual perversion and violence and torture, the prisoners band together to try to overthrow Carla and escape the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dniW5AJ2plixkJ4hn30msMVlwi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91865'),
  ('637656096541568113', 'Caged Women', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Leandro Lucchetti, Renato Doria', 'Leandro Lucchetti', 'Pilar Orive, Isabel Libossart, Elena Wiedermann, Christian Lorenz, Gaetano Russo, Aldo Sambrell, Catia Castello Branco, Rita Prospero', null, 'Former Miss Spanish Basque Country, Pilar Orive, stars as American Janet Cooper who is drugged and shipped to a remote women''s prison managed by a sleazy warden and a Nazi-type lesbian guard. 90 minute of graphic sexual abuse ensue', 'Former Miss Spanish Basque Country, Pilar Orive, stars as American Janet Cooper who is drugged and shipped to a remote women''s prison managed by a sleazy warden and a Nazi-type lesbian guard. 90 minute of graphic sexual abuse ensue', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7BWdn158MqbbJgAM1sSWolAOmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116994'),
  ('1086719452503785420', 'Cagefighter: Worlds Collide', 2020, 'Action', 'Jesse Quinones, Teresa Puglia, Jason Bohn', 'Jesse Quinones', 'Alexander Montagnani, Jonathan Good, Elijah Baker, Georgia Bradner, Jason Reso, Luke Rockhold, Chuck Liddell, Gina Gershon', 'R', 'Reiss is the greatest champion to ever fight in a LEGENDS cage. But when promoter Max Black pits him against wrestling superstar Randy Stone, Reiss finds himself in the toughest fight of his life.', 'Reiss is the greatest champion to ever fight in a LEGENDS cage. But when promoter Max Black pits him against wrestling superstar Randy Stone, Reiss finds himself in the toughest fight of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96OFYM1mP6UJ0NOXDM2zL3APsnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697039'),
  ('1030193280865332108', 'Cages', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Olivier Masset-Depasse', null, 'Anne Coesens, Sagamore Stévenin, Micheline Goethals, Adel Bencherif, Nasser Zerkoune, Michel Angely', null, 'Eve is an emergency medical technician who falls in love with Damien (Sagamore Stévenin), a handsome and caring man who runs a neighborhood bar in the Belgian countryside. When Damien and Eve become a couple, she joins him in looking after the bar and becomes friendly with the regular customers, but things take an unexpected turn when Eve is in a serious auto accident. While Eve walks away with no serious physical injuries, she''s emotionally ravaged by the experience, and develops a severe speech impediment. Eve''s new stutter makes it hard for her to communicate with Damien and she becomes the butt of jokes from the customers. Eve is increasingly isolated and Damien takes up with another woman until Eve retaliates by trapping him in their home and forces him to re-establish the building blocks of their relationship, starting with their sexual communication. Meanwhile, Eve''s struggle to speak is contrasted with one of the tavern''s annual events, an animal calling contest.', 'Eve is an emergency medical technician who falls in love with Damien (Sagamore Stévenin), a handsome and caring man who runs a neighborhood bar in the Belgian countryside. When Damien and Eve become a couple, she joins him in looking after the bar and becomes friendly with the regular customers, but things take an unexpected turn when Eve is in a serious auto accident. While Eve walks away with no serious physical injuries, she''s emotionally ravaged by the experience, and develops a severe speech impediment. Eve''s new stutter makes it hard for her to communicate with Damien and she becomes the butt of jokes from the customers. Eve is increasingly isolated and Damien takes up with another woman until Eve retaliates by trapping him in their home and forces him to re-establish the building blocks of their relationship, starting with their sexual communication. Meanwhile, Eve''s struggle to speak is contrasted with one of the tavern''s annual events, an animal calling contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQSXmuVCiaZIDhuOmr5EwyiVIwX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69285'),
  ('979560175321940676', 'Cahill: United States Marshal', 1973, 'Drama, Western', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Joseph F. Biroc, Fred R. Simpson', 'Rita M. Fink, Harry Julian Fink', 'John Wayne, George Kennedy, Gary Grimes, Neville Brand, Clay O''Brien, Marie Windsor, Morgan Paull, Dan Vadis', 'PG', 'J.D. Cahill is the toughest U.S. Marshal they''ve got, just the sound of his name makes bad guys stop in their tracks, so when his two young boy''s want to get his attention they decide to rob a bank. They end up getting more than they bargained for.', 'J.D. Cahill is the toughest U.S. Marshal they''ve got, just the sound of his name makes bad guys stop in their tracks, so when his two young boy''s want to get his attention they decide to rob a bank. They end up getting more than they bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR3yIiQNL4EdYZJHNE8spFpV21b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30708'),
  ('686700276838764624', 'Cain and Abel', 1982, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Lino Brocka, Jon Garcia-Ariño, Conrado Baltazar', 'Ricardo Lee', 'Christopher de Leon, Phillip Salvador, Carmi Martin, Mona Lisa, Cecille Castillo, Baby Delgado, Ruel Vernal, Michael Sandico', null, 'A modern-day version of the biblical legend of Cain and Abel, the strong-willed matriarch Señora Pina favors her younger son, Ellis, over the older Lorenzo, whom she blames for her husband''s death.', 'A modern-day version of the biblical legend of Cain and Abel, the strong-willed matriarch Señora Pina favors her younger son, Ellis, over the older Lorenzo, whom she blames for her husband''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX3Q00sUe8ahxMimj5j3Hum6TZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157703'),
  ('557236407457430338', 'Cain and Mabel', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lloyd Bacon, George Barnes, Richard Maybery', 'Laird Doyle', 'Marion Davies, Clark Gable, Allen Jenkins, Roscoe Karns, Walter Catlett, Robert Paige, Hobart Cavanaugh, Ruth Donnelly', 'NR', 'A chorus girl and a heavyweight boxer are paired romantically as a publicity stunt.', 'A chorus girl and a heavyweight boxer are paired romantically as a publicity stunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s09LD5T664zWoo1zJo12Uwp4bm2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184741'),
  ('379064483700932616', 'Cain''s Cutthroats', 1970, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Ken Osborne, Ralph Waldo', 'Wilton Denmark', 'John Carradine, Scott Brady, Robert Dix, Don Epperson, Darwin Joston, Adair Jameson, Bruce Kimball, Russ McCubbin', 'R', 'Following the Civil War, Confederate Captain Justice Cain has retired to a quiet life with his young son and black wife. However, the men of his old outfit, known as Cain''s Cutthroats, have turned to lives of murder, torture and robbery. They attempt to convince Cain to ride with them once more. He refuses, and the Cutthroats murder his family. Swearing vengeance, Cain teams up with a colorful preacher/bounty hunter, and hunts down his family''s killers one at a time.', 'Following the Civil War, Confederate Captain Justice Cain has retired to a quiet life with his young son and black wife. However, the men of his old outfit, known as Cain''s Cutthroats, have turned to lives of murder, torture and robbery. They attempt to convince Cain to ride with them once more. He refuses, and the Cutthroats murder his family. Swearing vengeance, Cain teams up with a colorful preacher/bounty hunter, and hunts down his family''s killers one at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1oxXV9m50wOZM8fAwpqzcndsNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89555'),
  ('910798899609866867', 'Cairo 30', 1966, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Salah Abu Seif, Mohamed Abdelaziz, Wahid Farid', 'Lotfy El Kholy, Ali El Zorkani, Wafeya Khairy', 'Soad Hosny, Hamdy Ahmed, Abdel Aziz Mekwi, Abdel Moneim Ibrahim, Ahmed Tawfiq, Ahmed Mazhar, Tawfiq Al-Deqen, Shafiq Nour ElDein', null, 'Mahgoub is a villager who moves to Cairo in search of a better life. When he enlists friend Salem''s help to find him a job, Salem not only gets him a job at the ministry where he works but he finds him a bride as well. But the bride is the mistress of Qasem Bek, who will be visiting her once a week.', 'Mahgoub is a villager who moves to Cairo in search of a better life. When he enlists friend Salem''s help to find him a job, Salem not only gets him a job at the ministry where he works but he finds him a bride as well. But the bride is the mistress of Qasem Bek, who will be visiting her once a week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGc1Zwq9enOzsm6XyeGeBXg14MX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273265'),
  ('116889597139587471', 'Cairo 6,7,8', 2010, 'Drama', 'Mohamed Diab, Ahmed Gabr', 'Mohamed Diab', 'Nelly Karim, Bassem Samra, Bushra, Maged El Kedwany, Nahed El Sebai, Ahmed Al Fishawy, Sawsan Badr, Omar El Saeed', null, 'Three women seek justice due to the difficult daily situation which sexual harassment causes in the streets of Cairo, Egypt.', 'Three women seek justice due to the difficult daily situation which sexual harassment causes in the streets of Cairo, Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5V3Lgw0BJ8bTL750GSRj4ILDYj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85441'),
  ('820795858705606322', 'Cairo Conspiracy', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Zeynep Burcu Keçecioglu, Tugba Usta, Olivier Jacquet', 'Tarik Saleh', 'Tawfeek Barhom, Fares Fares, Mohammad Bakri, Makram J. Khoury, Mehdi Dehbi, Younes Medhat, Yunus Albayrak, Sherwan Haji', null, 'A fisherman''s son is offered the ultimate privilege to study at the Al-Azhar University in Cairo, the epicenter of power of Sunni Islam. Shortly after his arrival, the university’s highest ranking religious leader, the Grand Imam, dies and the young student becomes a pawn in a ruthless power struggle between Egypt''s religious and political elite.', 'A fisherman''s son is offered the ultimate privilege to study at the Al-Azhar University in Cairo, the epicenter of power of Sunni Islam. Shortly after his arrival, the university’s highest ranking religious leader, the Grand Imam, dies and the young student becomes a pawn in a ruthless power struggle between Egypt''s religious and political elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDRAA4UJWgQnSFxhJuefnwO74v5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788977'),
  ('553388165786349989', 'Cairo Station', 1958, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Youssef Chahine, Mostafa Gamal Eldein, Alevise Orfanelli', 'Abdel Hai Adib', 'Farid Shawqy, Hind Rostom, Youssef Chahine, Hassan El Baroudy, Abdel Aziz Khalil, Ahmed Abaza, Essmat Mahmoud, Hussain Ismael', null, 'Qinawi, a physically challenged peddler who makes his living selling newspapers in the central Cairo train station, is obsessed with Hanuma, an attractive young woman who sells drinks. While she jokes with him about a possible relationship, she is actually in love with Abu Siri, a strong and respected porter at the station who is struggling to unionize his fellow workers to combat their boss'' exploitative and abusive treatment.', 'Qinawi, a physically challenged peddler who makes his living selling newspapers in the central Cairo train station, is obsessed with Hanuma, an attractive young woman who sells drinks. While she jokes with him about a possible relationship, she is actually in love with Abu Siri, a strong and respected porter at the station who is struggling to unionize his fellow workers to combat their boss'' exploitative and abusive treatment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm8ET6PSfPT6pozgvjR7htaZFjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47324'),
  ('7758686223997832', 'Cairo Time', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ruba Nadda, Luc Montpellier', 'Ruba Nadda', 'Patricia Clarkson, Alexander Siddig, Elena Anaya, Amina Annabi, Tom McCamus, Mona Hala, Fadia Nadda, Mohamed Abdel Fatah', 'PG', 'In Cairo on her own as she waits for her husband, Juliette finds herself caught in a whirlwind romance with his friend Tareq, a retired cop. As Tareq escorts Juliette around the city, they find themselves in the middle of a brief affair that catches them both unawares.', 'In Cairo on her own as she waits for her husband, Juliette finds herself caught in a whirlwind romance with his friend Tareq, a retired cop. As Tareq escorts Juliette around the city, they find themselves in the middle of a brief affair that catches them both unawares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10zKAyONGXQbtojOWeiZ176o8IQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31189'),
