  ('303190233004342739', 'Caju, Meu Amigo', 2026, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Bruno Carboni, Mariana Frantz, Renata Rezende', 'Okna Produções', 'Vitória Strada, Liane Venturella, Bruno Fernandes, Gabriela Poester, João Carlos Castanha', null, 'United by their love for the same dog, two women scarred by a flood turn a silent rivalry into a journey of connection, loss, and rebuilding.', 'United by their love for the same dog, two women scarred by a flood turn a silent rivalry into a journey of connection, loss, and rebuilding.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FeuYHIYx8d6sNI2FMePFXYzp0sA7.jpg', 'plex:movie:caju-meu-amigo'),
  ('58169455838903134', 'Çakal', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Erhan Kozan', 'Sertan Telli', 'İsmail Hacıoğlu, Uğur Polat, Erkan Can, Çetin Altay, Naci Taşdöğen, Cüneyt Türel, Damla Sönmez, Turgay Tanülkü', null, 'Akın''s life, who lived with a father he didn''t like and a sick mother, changed after he lost his mother. He plans to start a new life with the money he steals from the carpentry workshop where he works. When his girlfriend Deniz dismisses this dream as ridiculous and leaves him, he accepts an offer from his friend İdris. This offer involves working as a foot soldier for a mafia group.', 'Akın''s life, who lived with a father he didn''t like and a sick mother, changed after he lost his mother. He plans to start a new life with the money he steals from the carpentry workshop where he works. When his girlfriend Deniz dismisses this dream as ridiculous and leaves him, he accepts an offer from his friend İdris. This offer involves working as a foot soldier for a mafia group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bysb83IEZDmiD5CDzpq51RRJ0W9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63929'),
  ('192154886631875716', 'Cake', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nisha Ganatra', 'Tassie Cameron', 'Heather Graham, David Sutcliffe, Taye Diggs, Sarah Chalke, Cheryl Hines, Keram Malicki-Sánchez, Sabrina Grdevich, Bruce Gray', 'R', 'A travel writer improves her love life when she becomes an editor for her father''s wedding magazine.', 'A travel writer improves her love life when she becomes an editor for her father''s wedding magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFsEI7Ou2GGdYaPrl1VbJnhfGdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24123'),
