  ('457501033661969504', 'Cal', 1984, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Pat O''Connor, Jerzy Zieliński', null, 'John Lynch, Helen Mirren, Donal McCann, Ray McAnally, John Kavanagh, Stevan Rimkus, Catherine Gibson, Louis Rolston', 'R', 'Cal, a young man on the fringes of the IRA, falls in love with Marcella, a Catholic woman whose husband, a Protestant policeman, was killed one year earlier by the IRA.', 'Cal, a young man on the fringes of the IRA, falls in love with Marcella, a Catholic woman whose husband, a Protestant policeman, was killed one year earlier by the IRA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpyM3J9HeQQ8JSO3RxhoxLEA6kN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42084'),
  ('43016653286171713', 'Cala, My Dog!', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lu Xuechang, Zhang Xigui, Qian Ru', 'Lu Xuechang', 'Ge You, Ding Jiali, Xia Yu, Li Bin, Li Qinqin, Li Bin, Feng Xiaogang, Li Jiaxuan', null, 'The humdrum existence of a Beijing factory worker and his family is disrupted when their beloved dog is confiscated by the police for being unlicensed. The worker has but 24 hours to raise the sizable sum required to pay the license fee.', 'The humdrum existence of a Beijing factory worker and his family is disrupted when their beloved dog is confiscated by the police for being unlicensed. The worker has but 24 hours to raise the sizable sum required to pay the license fee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBDSw7PnpuSyGH6ai76cY4jxMa2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257572'),
  ('881989645125027674', 'Calamari Union', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Marjaana Mykkänen', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Timo Eränkö, Kari Heiskanen, Asmo Hurula, Sakke Järvenpää, Sakari Kuosmanen, Dave Lindholm, Mikko Mattila, Pate Mustajärvi', null, 'A group of men all called Frank—except for one named Pekka—have had enough of life in their working-class neighborhood, so they set off for a better existence in the magical seaside district of Eira. But the way is long, and the group face many hurdles including stray dogs and defunct streetlights.', 'A group of men all called Frank—except for one named Pekka—have had enough of life in their working-class neighborhood, so they set off for a better existence in the magical seaside district of Eira. But the way is long, and the group face many hurdles including stray dogs and defunct streetlights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rS3Rl17upvBEnaUE67lCPowDEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59388'),
  ('62029673440393208', 'Calamity', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Věra Chytilová, Ivan Šlapeta, Zdeněk Pazdírek', 'Josef Šilhavý, Věra Chytilová', 'Bolek Polívka, Dagmar Bláhová, Jana Synková, Marie Pavlíková, Klára Emingerová, Jaroslava Kretschmerová, Zdeněk Svěrák, Václav Švorc', null, 'Funny banter about love, sex, social status, and other ideals, while a new railway employee is trained and sent on his first run as driver.', 'Funny banter about love, sex, social status, and other ideals, while a new railway employee is trained and sent on his first run as driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ActIglBGgeqO8KSiEwo63C8Dl4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65692'),
  ('149178247500261298', 'Calamity', 2020, 'Comedy, Animation, Family, Adventure, Western', 'Rémi Chayé', 'Rémi Chayé, Sandra Tosello, Fabrice de Costil', 'Salomé Boulven, Alexandra Lamy, Alexis Tomassian, Jochen Hägele, Léonard Louf, Santiago Barban, Damien Witecka, Philippe Vincent', null, '1863, a convoy in the American West, Martha Jane needs to learn how to take care of horses to drive the family wagon. Except she ends up wearing pants and cutting her hair. The scandal that its stark character provokes will force to face all the dangers in a gigantic and wild world where everything is possible.', '1863, a convoy in the American West, Martha Jane needs to learn how to take care of horses to drive the family wagon. Except she ends up wearing pants and cutting her hair. The scandal that its stark character provokes will force to face all the dangers in a gigantic and wild world where everything is possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trAkC9cpGWB6Vr5Lmrs47Ts8zif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587311'),
  ('693042992040055171', 'Calamity Jane', 1953, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Western', 'David Butler, Wilfrid M. Cline, Philip Quinn', 'James O''Hanlon', 'Doris Day, Howard Keel, Allyn Ann McLerie, Philip Carey, Dick Wesson, Paul Harvey, Chubby Johnson, Gale Robbins', 'NR', 'Sharpshooter Calamity Jane takes it upon herself to recruit a famous actress and bring her back to the local saloon, but jealousy soon gets in the way.', 'Sharpshooter Calamity Jane takes it upon herself to recruit a famous actress and bring her back to the local saloon, but jealousy soon gets in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYeTi8t6Gtbck861Pm9XtE3BdpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14117'),
  ('725626656238486802', 'Calamity of a Zombie Girl', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Horror', 'Hideaki Iwami, Junichi Takaoka, Akira Noguchi', 'Kenichi Kanemaki', 'Saori Hayami, Yui Ogura, Tomokazu Sugita, Ryoko Shiraishi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Mao Ichimichi, Yurika Kubo', null, 'When a zombie named Euphrosyne awakens after a century-long slumber, she finds herself coming face-to-face with a group of five university students – a stand-off that leads to a bloody battle for all concerned, revolving around a secret stone hidden in the depths of the campus’ archives.', 'When a zombie named Euphrosyne awakens after a century-long slumber, she finds herself coming face-to-face with a group of five university students – a stand-off that leads to a bloody battle for all concerned, revolving around a secret stone hidden in the depths of the campus’ archives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTjjbYnvNlGsJ6dexAxYwnpKpQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534515'),
  ('538920371903533865', 'Calamity of Snakes', 1982, 'Horror', 'William Chang Kee, Robert Tai, Hu Rong', 'Li Kang-Nian, Tsai Kuo-Jung', 'Hsiang Yun-Peng, Lo Pi-Ling, Wei Ping-Ao, Kao Yuen, Ou-Yang Sha-Fei, Chou Chung-Lien, Lo Toi-Lan, Wu Yen', null, 'During the construction of luxury apartment buildings a huge nest of thousands of snakes is discovered. Francis Chang (the boss) refuses to delay the construction and orders to kill all the animals. He is repeated warned by his wife, who had some nightmares concerning him and the snakes. They do not manage to kill all snakes and so they take revenge on the construction workers and Francis Chang. Soon thousands of killer snakes under the lead of a giant Boa invades the building an kill all the new inhabitants. Even a snake master can''t stop them.', 'During the construction of luxury apartment buildings a huge nest of thousands of snakes is discovered. Francis Chang (the boss) refuses to delay the construction and orders to kill all the animals. He is repeated warned by his wife, who had some nightmares concerning him and the snakes. They do not manage to kill all snakes and so they take revenge on the construction workers and Francis Chang. Soon thousands of killer snakes under the lead of a giant Boa invades the building an kill all the new inhabitants. Even a snake master can''t stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AITsGxxYXM5DmrPRUSJJPPqyFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39878'),
  ('524539991880936636', 'Calculator', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'Dmitry Grachev, Ivan Gudkov', 'Andrey Kutuza', 'Evgeny Mironov, Vinnie Jones, Anna Chipovskaya, Nikita Panfilov, Kirill Kozakov, Ivan Verkhovykh, Vladas Bagdonas, Irene Muscara', null, 'Ten prisoners condemned to exile on a hostile planet XT-59 must pave the way through swamp to reach the Islands of Happiness, the only safe area on the planet, before the harsh climate or the underground horrors kill them all.', 'Ten prisoners condemned to exile on a hostile planet XT-59 must pave the way through swamp to reach the Islands of Happiness, the only safe area on the planet, before the harsh climate or the underground horrors kill them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XJOJqYQDKfg0LTFJ8noGLKCh59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316269'),
  ('666325317415125932', 'Calcutta', 1946, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Farrow, John F. Seitz', 'Seton I. Miller', 'Alan Ladd, Gail Russell, William Bendix, June Duprez, Lowell Gilmore, Edith King, Paul Singh, Gavin Muir', 'NR', 'Neale and Pedro fly cargo between Chungking and Calcutta. When their buddy Bill is murdered they investigate. Neale meets Bill''s fiancée Virginia and becomes suspicious of a deeper plot while also falling for her charms.', 'Neale and Pedro fly cargo between Chungking and Calcutta. When their buddy Bill is murdered they investigate. Neale meets Bill''s fiancée Virginia and becomes suspicious of a deeper plot while also falling for her charms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18tx0Q2l0p3y6RM7HAAze6bsTyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26666'),
  ('203202814255614099', 'Calcutta', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Louis Malle, Étienne Becker', 'Louis Malle', 'Louis Malle', null, 'When he was cutting "Phantom India," Louis Malle found that the footage shot in Calcutta was so diverse, intense, and unforgettable that it deserved its own film. The result, released theatrically, is at times shocking—a chaotic portrait of a city engulfed in social and political turmoil.', 'When he was cutting "Phantom India," Louis Malle found that the footage shot in Calcutta was so diverse, intense, and unforgettable that it deserved its own film. The result, released theatrically, is at times shocking—a chaotic portrait of a city engulfed in social and political turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IlHcSh4DbGntTKMEi3OiQ8dFtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112630'),
  ('408797041131092618', 'Calendar', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Atom Egoyan, Norayr Kasper', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Arsinée Khanjian, Ashot Adamyan, Atom Egoyan, Michelle Bellerose, Natalia Jasen, Susan Hamann, Sveta Kohli, Viva Tsvetnova', null, 'A photographer and his wife travel across Armenia photographing churches for a calendar project. Travelling with them is a local man acting as their driver and guide. As the project nears completion, the distance between husband and wife grows.', 'A photographer and his wife travel across Armenia photographing churches for a calendar project. Travelling with them is a local man acting as their driver and guide. As the project nears completion, the distance between husband and wife grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ct08n4H8WcvdfiKDI9AQ3GOyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83599'),
  ('515147284555644782', 'Calendar Girl', 1947, 'Romance', 'Allan Dwan', 'Mary Loos, Richard Sale, Lee Loeb', 'Jane Frazee, William Marshall, Gail Patrick, Kenny Baker, Victor McLaglen, Irene Rich, James Ellison, Janet Martin', 'NR', 'Around the turn of the century, two young men, Johnnie Bennett, a composer and Steve Adams, an artist, go to New York City to make their fortune. They both fall in love with the same girl, Patricia O''Neill. The artist paints a picture of her which outrages her father''s sensibilities; but, as a result of the picture, she wins a chance to star in a Broadway play. She soon learns that the artist is just a trifler; and she turns to the composer, who loves her sincerely', 'Around the turn of the century, two young men, Johnnie Bennett, a composer and Steve Adams, an artist, go to New York City to make their fortune. They both fall in love with the same girl, Patricia O''Neill. The artist paints a picture of her which outrages her father''s sensibilities; but, as a result of the picture, she wins a chance to star in a Broadway play. She soon learns that the artist is just a trifler; and she turns to the composer, who loves her sincerely', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37kMxmBtAedNs4J8r3aVSyZl7lz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117241'),
  ('159518195328903284', 'Calendar Girl', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Priestley Jr., John Whitesell', 'Paul W. Shapiro', 'Gabriel Olds, Jason Priestley, Jerry O''Connell, Joe Pantoliano, Steve Railsback, Stephen Tobolowsky, Stéphanie Anderson, Chubby Checker', 'PG-13', 'Three young men go on an end of the summer trip to Hollywood, California. Their quest: to fulfill the fantasy of meeting Marilyn Monroe.', 'Three young men go on an end of the summer trip to Hollywood, California. Their quest: to fulfill the fantasy of meeting Marilyn Monroe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljSqZTl5oophHsH1Qtyv7AF2BW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117553'),
  ('828732908490819108', 'Calendar Girl', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', null, null, 'Han Ga-yeong, Lee So-hee-II, Min Hyeok, Kwon Yeong-ho, Joo Yeon-seo, Park Ha-yan, Ok Joo-ri', null, 'In my imagination, she came to me. Jong-moo is happy the calendar model Na-yeong is there smiling for him although they can''t be together. One day, the girl of his dreams moves right next door to him and Jong-moo''s boring life turns into excitement. Jong-moo learns about how she suffers behind the fanciness and he puts everything he has on the line to comfort her. Na-yeong is caught between his innocence and her work. Meanwhile, Jong-moo''s friend Yong-jin dreams of a hot night with his cute girlfriend Ji-hee but every time he tries he stands on the verge of death and in the end Ji-hee confesses something to him... The two couple put their lives on the line for love.', 'In my imagination, she came to me. Jong-moo is happy the calendar model Na-yeong is there smiling for him although they can''t be together. One day, the girl of his dreams moves right next door to him and Jong-moo''s boring life turns into excitement. Jong-moo learns about how she suffers behind the fanciness and he puts everything he has on the line to comfort her. Na-yeong is caught between his innocence and her work. Meanwhile, Jong-moo''s friend Yong-jin dreams of a hot night with his cute girlfriend Ji-hee but every time he tries he stands on the verge of death and in the end Ji-hee confesses something to him... The two couple put their lives on the line for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nh0p19vCPiuueRCgOaiMFIjNdSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392144'),
  ('793855045775047039', 'Calendar Girl Murders', 1984, 'Crime, Mystery, TV Movie, Horror', 'William A. Graham, Robert Steadman', null, 'Tom Skerritt, Sharon Stone, Barbara Bosson, Robert Beltran, Pat Corley, Robert Morse, Alan Thicke, Silvana Gallardo', 'NR', 'During the launch party of a nude calendar, one of the models is thrown to her death by a black gloved killer. When the killer begins to strike again, going in the order of the calendar itself, a hard nosed cop realizes that he needs to solve the mystery, or risk all of the models ending up in the morgue!', 'During the launch party of a nude calendar, one of the models is thrown to her death by a black gloved killer. When the killer begins to strike again, going in the order of the calendar itself, a hard nosed cop realizes that he needs to solve the mystery, or risk all of the models ending up in the morgue!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k38XxckhivAEftg8t8jIlZrrp2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159324'),
  ('585107407186513166', 'Calendar Girls', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nigel Cole, Ashley Rowe, Guy Barker', 'Tim Firth, Juliette Towhidi', 'Helen Mirren, Julie Walters, John Alderton, Linda Bassett, Annette Crosbie, Philip Glenister, Ciarán Hinds, Celia Imrie', 'PG-13', 'Members of a Yorkshire branch of the Women''s Institute cause controversy when they pose nude for a charity calendar.', 'Members of a Yorkshire branch of the Women''s Institute cause controversy when they pose nude for a charity calendar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yy2cPwrnUquMCmShrf8TbYu6emd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8696'),
  ('241482967067294937', 'Calendar Girls', 2015, 'Drama', 'Hari K. Vedantam, Madhur Bhandarkar', 'Anil Pandey, Madhur Bhandarkar', 'Akanksha Puri, Avani Modi, Kyra Dutt, Ruhi Singh, Satarupa Pyne, Shishir Sharma, Suchitra Pillai, Rohit Roy', null, 'The film focuses on five girls who hail from different regions of India, and who have been selected to pose for the country''s most prestigious annual calendar which is a joint effort between business tycoon Rishabh Kukreja and his photographer friend Timmy Sen.', 'The film focuses on five girls who hail from different regions of India, and who have been selected to pose for the country''s most prestigious annual calendar which is a joint effort between business tycoon Rishabh Kukreja and his photographer friend Timmy Sen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dbjSXOxom79XMaYGqvF6X0vQ4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353952'),
  ('902477072027337843', 'Çalgı Çengi', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Selçuk Aydemir', 'Selçuk Aydemir', 'Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir, Erdal Tosun, Tuna Orhan, Cahit Gök, Aykut Köseler, Şinasi Yurtsever, Ceyhun Güneş', null, 'Salih and Gürkan, two cousins from Ankara, are struggling musicians that are trying to make a living by performing at private events such as bachelorette parties. Nihat, a low profile event manager, finds a gig for the duo which leads them to encounter with unexpected guests in their "dressing room".', 'Salih and Gürkan, two cousins from Ankara, are struggling musicians that are trying to make a living by performing at private events such as bachelorette parties. Nihat, a low profile event manager, finds a gig for the duo which leads them to encounter with unexpected guests in their "dressing room".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVrhfoULPOvHbCHG01aWq7FBVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64468'),
