  ('137615939502097037', 'Caliber 9', 1972, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Fernando Di Leo, Franco Lo Cascio, Franco Villa', 'Fernando Di Leo', 'Gastone Moschin, Barbara Bouchet, Mario Adorf, Frank Wolff, Luigi Pistilli, Ivo Garrani, Lionel Stander, Philippe Leroy', null, 'Just out of prison, ex-con Ugo Piazza meets his former employer, a psychopathic gangster Rocco who enjoys sick violence and torture. Both the gangsters and the police believe Ugo has hidden $300,000 that should have gone to an American drug syndicate boss.', 'Just out of prison, ex-con Ugo Piazza meets his former employer, a psychopathic gangster Rocco who enjoys sick violence and torture. Both the gangsters and the police believe Ugo has hidden $300,000 that should have gone to an American drug syndicate boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tV5xhT0luyD1Xiebx4HXbv3sV0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40022'),
  ('359687015746651630', 'Caliber 9', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Toni D''Angelo, Rocco Marra', 'Gianluca Curti, Luca Poldelmengo, Marco Martani', 'Marco Bocci, Kseniya Rappoport, Alessio Boni, Antonio Zavatteri, Éric Godon, Jessica Cressy, Barbara Bouchet, Michele Placido', null, 'Milan, Nowadays: Fernando, son of Ugo Piazza, is a brilliant criminal defense lawyer whose mother, Nelly, has done everything in her power to raise him different from his father, a deplorable gangster.', 'Milan, Nowadays: Fernando, son of Ugo Piazza, is a brilliant criminal defense lawyer whose mother, Nelly, has done everything in her power to raise him different from his father, a deplorable gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75WLuYJnF7mXQnv6AEBK7i8ceBl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660598'),
  ('814816976746577236', 'Calibre', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Matt Palmer, Márk Győri', 'Matt Palmer', 'Jack Lowden, Martin McCann, Tony Curran, Ian Pirie, Kitty Lovett, Cal MacAninch, Cameron Jack, Kate Bracken', null, 'Two lifelong friends head up to an isolated Scottish Highlands village for a weekend hunting trip that descends into a never-ending nightmare as they attempt to cover up a horrific hunting accident.', 'Two lifelong friends head up to an isolated Scottish Highlands village for a weekend hunting trip that descends into a never-ending nightmare as they attempt to cover up a horrific hunting accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCVOQzV7Z556WnJFNeX7y8BFhyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474051'),
  ('174435397993939713', 'Califano', 2024, 'TV Movie, Drama, Music', 'Alessandro Angelini, Nicola Saraval', null, 'Leo Gassmann, Giampiero De Concilio, Valeria Bono, Andrea Ceravolo, Angelica Cinquantini, Angelo Donato Colombo, Jacopo Dragonetti, Andrea Dugoni', null, 'Twenty years in the life of "Il Califfo" Franco Califano, from the Rome of the Dolce Vita to the 1984 concert at the Teatro Parioli, through great musical successes, loves, falls, and comebacks.', 'Twenty years in the life of "Il Califfo" Franco Califano, from the Rome of the Dolce Vita to the 1984 concert at the Teatro Parioli, through great musical successes, loves, falls, and comebacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbQxcbcLpQoinkGMusLYcZQoosH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241864'),
  ('265361659378558620', 'California', 1947, 'Western', 'John Farrow, Michael D. Moore, Herbert Coleman', 'Frank Butler, Theodore Strauss', 'Ray Milland, Barbara Stanwyck, Barry Fitzgerald, George Coulouris, Albert Dekker, Anthony Quinn, Frank Faylen, Gavin Muir', 'NR', '"Wicked" Lily Bishop joins a wagon train to California, led by Michael Fabian and Johnny Trumbo, but news of the Gold Rush scatters the train. When Johnny and Michael finally arrive, Lily is rich from her saloon and storekeeper (former slaver) Pharaoh Coffin is bleeding the miners dry. But worse troubles are ahead: California is inching toward statehood, and certain people want to make it their private empire.', '"Wicked" Lily Bishop joins a wagon train to California, led by Michael Fabian and Johnny Trumbo, but news of the Gold Rush scatters the train. When Johnny and Michael finally arrive, Lily is rich from her saloon and storekeeper (former slaver) Pharaoh Coffin is bleeding the miners dry. But worse troubles are ahead: California is inching toward statehood, and certain people want to make it their private empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uzCAnXTkzw1UTAR3bTXh7Wf831.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111459'),
  ('280898728903320778', 'California', 1977, 'Western', 'Michele Lupo, Mauro Sacripanti, Ricardo Huertas', 'Roberto Leoni, Mino Roli, Nico Ducci', 'Giuliano Gemma, William Berger, Miguel Bosé, Raimund Harmstorf, Chris Avram, Paola Dominguín, Claudio Undari, Malisa Longo', null, 'At the end of the Civil War, a Union soldier is released from prison and travels with a fellow prisoner to Missouri where his travelling companion is shot and hung for horse stealing. California decides to take the dead companion''s belongings to his family''s ranch, where he falls in love with his friend''s sister. But then the "ghosts" of the war return in an unexpected way haunting him again.', 'At the end of the Civil War, a Union soldier is released from prison and travels with a fellow prisoner to Missouri where his travelling companion is shot and hung for horse stealing. California decides to take the dead companion''s belongings to his family''s ranch, where he falls in love with his friend''s sister. But then the "ghosts" of the war return in an unexpected way haunting him again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w60nCYHjL0SJ4qvV32ITxpbQrMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61581'),
  ('294865267706935688', 'California', 2015, 'Drama', 'Marina Person, Flora Dias, Daniel Chaia', 'Francisco Guarnieri, Mariana Veríssimo, Marina Person', 'Aren Gallo, Caio Horowicz, Caio Blat, Giovanni Gallo, Letícia Fagnani, Livia Gijon, Virginia Cavendish, Paulo Miklos', null, 'The year is 1984. Estela is going through the turbulent phase of adolescence. Sex, lovers, friendships; everything seems very complicated. Her uncle Carlos is her hero, and visiting him in California is her biggest dream. But everything collapses when he returns thin, weak and ill. Between crises and discoveries, Estela will face a reality that will forever change her way of seeing the world.​', 'The year is 1984. Estela is going through the turbulent phase of adolescence. Sex, lovers, friendships; everything seems very complicated. Her uncle Carlos is her hero, and visiting him in California is her biggest dream. But everything collapses when he returns thin, weak and ill. Between crises and discoveries, Estela will face a reality that will forever change her way of seeing the world.​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTonUzjWK6mhXYYrf5xsmSGccrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362876'),
  ('120674428787119474', 'California Dreamin''', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cristian Nemescu, Aniela Galiceanu, Razvan Secara', 'Tudor Voican, Cristian Nemescu', 'Armand Assante, Răzvan Vasilescu, Jamie Elman, Maria Dinulescu, Ion Sapdaru, Alexandru Mărgineanu, Andi Vasluianu, Gabriel Spahiu', null, '1999. Kosovo War. In a small Romanian village, the chief of the railway station, who also happens to be a local gangster, stops a NATO train transporting military equipment. Their arrival in this small village dramatically changes its landscape.', '1999. Kosovo War. In a small Romanian village, the chief of the railway station, who also happens to be a local gangster, stops a NATO train transporting military equipment. Their arrival in this small village dramatically changes its landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPvlAyp6ZKoHWyHF4jYzMANHjjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24220'),
  ('403037520394589556', 'California Dreaming', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'William S. Beasley, Mike Moder, John D. Hancock', 'Ned Wynn', 'Dennis Christopher, Glynnis O''Connor, Seymour Cassel, Dorothy Tristan, John Calvin, Todd Susman, Tanya Roberts, Alice Playten', 'R', 'Young T.T. comes from Chicago to spend the summer in California. He slowly becomes "California-ized," while learning about love and life in the Golden State.', 'Young T.T. comes from Chicago to spend the summer in California. He slowly becomes "California-ized," while learning about love and life in the Golden State.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r87D2LNJmTBOMS71KbKcKnUDwhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85511'),
  ('497900785686322438', 'California Schemin''', 2026, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'James McAvoy, James Rhodes', 'Archie Thomson', 'Séamus McLean Ross, Samuel Bottomley, James McAvoy, Lucy Halliday, Amber Anderson, Sonny Poon Tip, Rebekah Murrell, Jennifer Winn', null, 'In the late 1990s, Gavin Bain and Billy Boyd had their musical ambitions consistently ridiculed for having the ''wrong'' accents, so they went for broke and reinvented themselves as Californian rappers. The duo re-recorded their own tracks with fake accents and turned up in London claiming to be an established duo on the Cali scene as well as childhood friends with Eminem. They quickly bagged themselves a record deal, a hefty sum in advances, and an appearance on MTV... until it all came crashing down.', 'In the late 1990s, Gavin Bain and Billy Boyd had their musical ambitions consistently ridiculed for having the ''wrong'' accents, so they went for broke and reinvented themselves as Californian rappers. The duo re-recorded their own tracks with fake accents and turned up in London claiming to be an established duo on the Cali scene as well as childhood friends with Eminem. They quickly bagged themselves a record deal, a hefty sum in advances, and an appearance on MTV... until it all came crashing down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tYRbCPZVQD1AjZ6YGMRx71lbDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193550'),
  ('1057384635614283569', 'California Split', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Altman, Paul Lohmann, Alan Rudolph', 'Joseph Walsh', 'George Segal, Elliott Gould, Ann Prentiss, Gwen Welles, Edward Walsh, Joseph Walsh, Bert Remsen, Barbara London', 'R', 'Carefree single guy Charlie Waters rooms with two lovely prostitutes, Barbara Miller and Susan Peters, and lives to gamble. Along with his glum betting buddy, Bill Denny, Charlie sets out on a gambling streak in search of the ever-elusive big payday. While Charlie and Bill have some lucky moments, they also have to contend with serious setbacks that threaten to derail their hedonistic betting binge.', 'Carefree single guy Charlie Waters rooms with two lovely prostitutes, Barbara Miller and Susan Peters, and lives to gamble. Along with his glum betting buddy, Bill Denny, Charlie sets out on a gambling streak in search of the ever-elusive big payday. While Charlie and Bill have some lucky moments, they also have to contend with serious setbacks that threaten to derail their hedonistic betting binge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sohTpACV6S7Af07XKkRUUvLNf4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32044'),
  ('84451990615583330', 'California Suite', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, David M. Walsh', 'Neil Simon', 'Jane Fonda, Alan Alda, Maggie Smith, Michael Caine, Walter Matthau, Elaine May, Herb Edelman, Denise Galik', 'PG', 'The misadventures of four groups of guests at the Beverly Hills Hotel.', 'The misadventures of four groups of guests at the Beverly Hills Hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IlgL7m1ByY3RIghbXNGGNvYfEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26686'),
  ('449032564338833936', 'Californy ''Er Bust', 1945, 'Animation, Western, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A narrator tells the story of how the Western pioneers (all being Goofy lookalikes) are travelling in covered wagons across the frontier. They run into some Indians (who are also Goofy lookalikes) and battle breaks out between them. Suddenly a tornado comes by and sweeps up the covered wagons, dropping them into various states such as "Wash", "Organ", and "Californy."', 'A narrator tells the story of how the Western pioneers (all being Goofy lookalikes) are travelling in covered wagons across the frontier. They run into some Indians (who are also Goofy lookalikes) and battle breaks out between them. Suddenly a tornado comes by and sweeps up the covered wagons, dropping them into various states such as "Wash", "Organ", and "Californy."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaTKJmVWi5PHvIp726gYtLS5laY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66831'),
  ('127292484608695070', 'Caligula and Messalina', 1981, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Bruno Mattei, Jean-Jacques Renon, Antonio Passalia', 'Antonio Passalia', 'Gino Turini, Betty Roland, Vladimir Brajovic, Françoise Blanchard, Raul Cabrera, Vincent Lo Monaco, Fanny Magier, Laurence Lovall', null, 'When the deranged emperor Caligula falls for an insatiable gladiatrix, their reign launches a mind-bending bacchanal of torture, sodomy, incest, castration, and aroused livestock.', 'When the deranged emperor Caligula falls for an insatiable gladiatrix, their reign launches a mind-bending bacchanal of torture, sodomy, incest, castration, and aroused livestock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywzH1Raa5yuiizsqEZzqH8fgY1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40084'),
  ('434841863664059388', 'Caligula''s Spawn - Part 1', 2009, 'History', 'Lloyd A. Simandl, Antonin Pesek', 'Lloyd A. Simandl', 'Rena Riffel, Lena Drásova, John Comer, Sabine Mallory, Dominika Jandlová, Marie Veckova, Melisa Mendini, Vendula Bednarova', null, 'The beautiful and dangerous lesbian slave trader Druscilla practices all the customs of Ancient Rome - everything in Excess. But even excess can have its limits and the punishments can be very severe if she crosses the line and risks falling out of favor.', 'The beautiful and dangerous lesbian slave trader Druscilla practices all the customs of Ancient Rome - everything in Excess. But even excess can have its limits and the punishments can be very severe if she crosses the line and risks falling out of favor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdaq2VtKwdXNroO2SGzmhZmtU0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248654'),
  ('609905202612683785', 'Call Boy', 2018, 'Drama', 'Daisuke Miura, Tsuyoshi Sugino, Toshiya Kominami', 'Daisuke Miura', 'Tori Matsuzaka, Sei Matobu, Ami Tomite, Yuki Sakurai, Kenta Izuka, Yu Koyanagi, Erika Mabuchi, Kokone Sasaki', 'NR', 'Ryo Morinaka is a university student and works part-time at a bar. He is bored with his daily life and exists in a state of torpor. One day, his friend Shinya Tajima brings the owner of a host bar over to the place where Ryo Morinaka works. Shizuka Mido is the owner of the host bar. Soon, Ryo Morinaka begins to work for Shizuka Mido at the members only host bar. He feels embarrassment initially, but he fulfills the desires of women and develops a sense of purpose.', 'Ryo Morinaka is a university student and works part-time at a bar. He is bored with his daily life and exists in a state of torpor. One day, his friend Shinya Tajima brings the owner of a host bar over to the place where Ryo Morinaka works. Shizuka Mido is the owner of the host bar. Soon, Ryo Morinaka begins to work for Shizuka Mido at the members only host bar. He feels embarrassment initially, but he fulfills the desires of women and develops a sense of purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fVRb3uoRDjbA9X95C88FOJ0rlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499191'),
  ('901947081700260536', 'Call Center Accepts Everything', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mr. Na', null, 'Yoon Yool, Lee Chae-dam, Ji Hee, Min Do-yoon, Kenny', null, 'Female employees of the call center work as customer counselors for a company that sells adult products. Under the company''s policy of unconditionally satisfying customers, the hardships of employees who always have to endure the customer''s power abuse continue. Manager Jang and new employee Yoo-ri, who have long endured and worked under team leader Kang, who wields female employees with his own power, appear in front of Joo-ri. Yoo0ri, who was in charge of Gyejinsang, one of the company''s blacklists, as soon as she came. And Joo-ri, who made an unexpected friend with foreign customer Kenny.', 'Female employees of the call center work as customer counselors for a company that sells adult products. Under the company''s policy of unconditionally satisfying customers, the hardships of employees who always have to endure the customer''s power abuse continue. Manager Jang and new employee Yoo-ri, who have long endured and worked under team leader Kang, who wields female employees with his own power, appear in front of Joo-ri. Yoo0ri, who was in charge of Gyejinsang, one of the company''s blacklists, as soon as she came. And Joo-ri, who made an unexpected friend with foreign customer Kenny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9nRwyMGEWLyMOBtRgjkETloEfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938092'),
  ('1111993355681893919', 'Call Centers', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Julien Baillargeon', null, 'Booder, Bruno Hausler, Lionnel Astier, Jackie Berroyer, Anouk Feral, Nicolas Ullmann, Douceline Derréal', null, 'A few weeks before the elections, the bankruptcy filing of the call center would be a mess and would seriously hurt the parachuting of Segondas, the boss of the bank. Equipped with his BlackBerry and his laptop, Matthieu expects an easy mission. Now, the parachuting of Mathieu in the world of "phoning", customer service is not going as planned.', 'A few weeks before the elections, the bankruptcy filing of the call center would be a mess and would seriously hurt the parachuting of Segondas, the boss of the bank. Equipped with his BlackBerry and his laptop, Matthieu expects an easy mission. Now, the parachuting of Mathieu in the world of "phoning", customer service is not going as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCuWVpUx7SsSjTFoTQaZ4DYYnwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70514'),
  ('361286365772021187', 'Call for Dreams', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ran Slavin', 'Ran Slavin', 'Yehezkel Lazarov, Oleg Levin, Olga Kurkulina', null, 'In a rain swept Tokyo, Eko complicates her life by publishing a ''Call For Dreams'' ad in a newspaper. As strangers leave descriptions of dreams on her answering machine, a parallel police investigation of a murder in Tel Aviv unfolds.', 'In a rain swept Tokyo, Eko complicates her life by publishing a ''Call For Dreams'' ad in a newspaper. As strangers leave descriptions of dreams on her answering machine, a parallel police investigation of a murder in Tel Aviv unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3kU6M0OXr74FDvv2CQo2yFOXe3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518335'),
  ('73450462603993522', 'Call For Love', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Zhang Jianya, Zhi Lei', 'Liu Yiwei, Shu Huan', 'Xu Zheng, Ning Jing, Michelle Bai, Annie Shizuka Inoh, Yongli Che, Song Jia, Fan Bingbing, Jiang Hongbo', null, 'After being married for seven years, Xu Lang, a white collar office manager, has started to get tired of the same routine in his marriage. After asking his wife for a divorce, he is given a magical cell phone by an angel. The cell phone allows him to have romantic encounters with different women. After various dates and courtships with 12 beautiful women, he still cannot meet the right one. He attempts to mend things over with his wife, only to find that his ex-wife has met another man and found happiness. The movie ends with Xu meeting his old love interest from 15 years ago, suggesting a new relationship between them.', 'After being married for seven years, Xu Lang, a white collar office manager, has started to get tired of the same routine in his marriage. After asking his wife for a divorce, he is given a magical cell phone by an angel. The cell phone allows him to have romantic encounters with different women. After various dates and courtships with 12 beautiful women, he still cannot meet the right one. He attempts to mend things over with his wife, only to find that his ex-wife has met another man and found happiness. The movie ends with Xu meeting his old love interest from 15 years ago, suggesting a new relationship between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oS9XOvkSDpXXSO1ogUCSr7tZqr3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37844'),
  ('610096201369206967', 'Call Girl', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'António-Pedro Vasconcelos, José António Loureiro', 'Tiago R. Santos, António-Pedro Vasconcelos', 'Joaquim de Almeida, Soraia Chaves, Ivo Canelas, Nicolau Breyner, José Raposo, José Eduardo, Maria João Abreu, Custódia Gallego', null, 'A powerful entrepreneur wants to build an exclusive resort hotel in Villanova, but he discovers the location he has in mind is protected by local land-use regulations. He hires Maria, a beautiful and elegant prostitute, to seduce the mayor, leaving him open to blackmail if he won''t give the entrepreneur what he wants. Maria has no trouble twisting Meireles around her finger, but police detectives Madeira and Neves get wind of the plan and set out to expose the plot...', 'A powerful entrepreneur wants to build an exclusive resort hotel in Villanova, but he discovers the location he has in mind is protected by local land-use regulations. He hires Maria, a beautiful and elegant prostitute, to seduce the mayor, leaving him open to blackmail if he won''t give the entrepreneur what he wants. Maria has no trouble twisting Meireles around her finger, but police detectives Madeira and Neves get wind of the plan and set out to expose the plot...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4zKW6OFl2CLqHZ7xkw8aTw390w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13959'),
  ('334033912319413910', 'Call Girl', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mikael Marcimain, Hoyte van Hoytema, Louise Drake af Hagelsrum', 'Marietta von Hausswolff von Baumgarten', 'Sofia Karemyr, Josefin Asplund, Ruth Vega Fernandez, Pernilla August, Simon J. Berger, Sven Nordin, David Dencik, Magnus Krepper', null, 'Stockholm, late 1970s. Within a stone’s throw of government buildings and juvenile homes lies the seductive world of sex clubs, discotheques and private residences. Call Girl tells the story of how young Iris is recruited from the bottom of society into a ruthless world where power can get you anything.', 'Stockholm, late 1970s. Within a stone’s throw of government buildings and juvenile homes lies the seductive world of sex clubs, discotheques and private residences. Call Girl tells the story of how young Iris is recruited from the bottom of society into a ruthless world where power can get you anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl8u7Ti9Nopwwg4YcawAjFTltRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127872'),
  ('102372654279860673', 'Call Her Savage', 1932, 'Drama', 'John Francis Dillon, Lee Garmes, Jack Boland', 'Edwin J. Burke', 'Clara Bow, Gilbert Roland, Thelma Todd, Monroe Owsley, Estelle Taylor, Weldon Heyburn, Willard Robertson, Anthony Jowitt', 'NR', 'A high-spirited and short-tempered Texan woman storms her way through life until her luck runs out, forcing her to learn the error of her ways.', 'A high-spirited and short-tempered Texan woman storms her way through life until her luck runs out, forcing her to learn the error of her ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/817TDYCmdxN0TVuiGoXHiHwnRLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86457'),
  ('915507654850038331', 'Call Jane', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Greta Zozula, Phyllis Nagy', 'Hayley Schore, Roshan Sethi', 'Elizabeth Banks, Sigourney Weaver, Chris Messina, Wunmi Mosaku, Kate Mara, Cory Michael Smith, Grace Edwards, John Magaro', 'R', 'A married woman with an unwanted pregnancy lives in a time in America where she can''t get a legal abortion and works with a group of suburban women to find help.', 'A married woman with an unwanted pregnancy lives in a time in America where she can''t get a legal abortion and works with a group of suburban women to find help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3oV6065tgYpukAjLxSbWcfqdg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579496'),
  ('310769267902105027', 'Call Me', 1988, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Sollace Mitchell, Zoltán David, Gina Randazzo', 'Karyn Kay', 'Patricia Charbonneau, Stephen McHattie, Boyd Gaines, Sam Freed, Steve Buscemi, Patti D''Arbanville, John Seitz, David Strathairn', 'R', 'After agreeing to meet an obscene caller at a bar, a young New York reporter witnesses a murder and becomes an unwilling player in a dangerous game of cat-and-mouse.', 'After agreeing to meet an obscene caller at a bar, a young New York reporter witnesses a murder and becomes an unwilling player in a dangerous game of cat-and-mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXG5ZDn02moIruBi3nbK2EzppMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41950'),
  ('16190213063663330', 'Call Me by Your Name', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Luca Guadagnino, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Briseide Siciliano', 'James Ivory', 'Armie Hammer, Timothée Chalamet, Michael Stuhlbarg, Amira Casar, Esther Garrel, Victoire du Bois, Vanda Capriolo, Antonio Rimoldi', 'R', 'In the summer of 1983, a 17-year-old Elio spends his days in his family''s villa in Italy. One day Oliver, a graduate student, arrives to assist Elio''s father, a professor of Greco-Roman culture. Soon, Elio and Oliver discover a summer that will alter their lives forever.', 'In the summer of 1983, a 17-year-old Elio spends his days in his family''s villa in Italy. One day Oliver, a graduate student, arrives to assist Elio''s father, a professor of Greco-Roman culture. Soon, Elio and Oliver discover a summer that will alter their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZ4gBdfkhP9tvLH1DO4m4HYtiyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398818'),
  ('1063959439264191495', 'Call Me Chihiro', 2023, 'Drama', 'Rikiya Imaizumi, Hiroshi Iwanaga, Yasuhiro Ohtsuka', 'Kaori Sawai, Rikiya Imaizumi', 'Kasumi Arimura, Hana Toyoshima, Ryuya Wakaba, Yui Sakuma, Van, Lily Franky, Jun Fubuki, Mitsuru Hirata', 'PG-13', 'An unapologetic former sex worker starts working at a bento stand in a small seaside town, bringing comfort to the lonely souls who come her way.', 'An unapologetic former sex worker starts working at a bento stand in a small seaside town, bringing comfort to the lonely souls who come her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51PoruM9YZ4meE0SzDZaNjciKBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024621'),
  ('1015144755578696082', 'Call Me Claus', 2001, 'TV Movie, Family', 'Peter Werner, Neil Roach', 'Sara Bernstein, Gregory Bernstein, Brian Bird', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Nigel Hawthorne, Victor Garber, Taylor Negron, Frankie Faison, Kip King, Brian Stokes Mitchell, Ali Wentworth', 'NR', 'When Lucy Cullins, a successful but cranky producer at a home shopping network hires an actor named Nick to play Santa Claus on the network, she gets more than she bargained for.', 'When Lucy Cullins, a successful but cranky producer at a home shopping network hires an actor named Nick to play Santa Claus on the network, she gets more than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crP1L0S7F5RwrfZ6t25dJSsbzNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17007'),
  ('323268927877961647', 'Call Me Elisabeth', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Stéphane Fontaine', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Guillaume Laurant', 'Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Stéphane Freiss, Maria de Medeiros, Yolande Moreau, Benjamin Ramon, Lauriane Sire, Daniel Znyk, Patrick Pierron', null, 'A 10-year-old girl lives in post WWII rural France with her parents, who are about to divorce. Her older sister leaves home to finish school, and the young girl is left with a mysterious, almost silent housekeeper. Being afraid of the dark, and of other "phenomenoms" including a haunted château nearby, she curiously accepts a stranger she finds in her mansion''s barn. This fact contradicts her fearful nature, but fulfills her loneliness. The stranger has run away from a nearby psychiatric clinic, where her father was treating the stranger. She hides the stranger, protects him, and he becomes her best friend. Is this girl searching for true companionship, coming of age, or is she asserting her independence for the first time in her short life?', 'A 10-year-old girl lives in post WWII rural France with her parents, who are about to divorce. Her older sister leaves home to finish school, and the young girl is left with a mysterious, almost silent housekeeper. Being afraid of the dark, and of other "phenomenoms" including a haunted château nearby, she curiously accepts a stranger she finds in her mansion''s barn. This fact contradicts her fearful nature, but fulfills her loneliness. The stranger has run away from a nearby psychiatric clinic, where her father was treating the stranger. She hides the stranger, protects him, and he becomes her best friend. Is this girl searching for true companionship, coming of age, or is she asserting her independence for the first time in her short life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txfrCF7s9eZevXShOsVLma9MXhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54064'),
  ('157628461514509856', 'Call Me Francis', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ivan Casalgrandi, Claudio Collepiccolo, Daniele Luchetti', 'Piero Balzoni, Paolo Marchesini, Luisa Cotta Ramosino', 'Rodrigo de la Serna, Sergio Hernández, Àlex Brendemühl, Maximilian Dirr, Mercedes Morán, Andrés Gil, Claudio De Davide, Pompeyo Audivert', null, 'Biopic about Jorge Maria Bergoglio before he became Pope Francis I.', 'Biopic about Jorge Maria Bergoglio before he became Pope Francis I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOFLjnUmxBhjtaKBhEB681TCHoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370980'),
  ('826526761108236370', 'Call Me Helen', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gregor Schnitzler', null, 'Heino Ferch, Jannik Schümann, Winnie Böwe, Judith Rosmair, Beatrice Richter, Rafael Gareisen, Kyra Sophia Kahre, Timur Bartels', null, 'Is. This. My. Son? No matter how often Tobias Wilke poses this question, there''s always only one answer: Yes! Tobias, can''t believe his eyes when he comes to the airport to pick up his 17-year-old son Finn – and learns that Finn is now calling herself Helen and wearing girls'' clothes. Finn/Helen reveals that she''s always was a girl, and that she used her year abroad in San Francisco to pass the "everyday life" test. This is required by law for everyone preparing for the sex reassignment surgery they will undergo upon reaching majority. Reactions from Helen''s friends, acquaintances and schoolmates cover the entire gamut from derision to solidarity. Especially Helen''s father, a well-known chef, finds it difficult to accept a situation he cannot understand. But Helen nearly always finds the right words - and humor - to counterbalance the ignorance and jeers of those around her. It is the beginning of a long, winding road towards the sexual identity she is convinced is hers.', 'Is. This. My. Son? No matter how often Tobias Wilke poses this question, there''s always only one answer: Yes! Tobias, can''t believe his eyes when he comes to the airport to pick up his 17-year-old son Finn – and learns that Finn is now calling herself Helen and wearing girls'' clothes. Finn/Helen reveals that she''s always was a girl, and that she used her year abroad in San Francisco to pass the "everyday life" test. This is required by law for everyone preparing for the sex reassignment surgery they will undergo upon reaching majority. Reactions from Helen''s friends, acquaintances and schoolmates cover the entire gamut from derision to solidarity. Especially Helen''s father, a well-known chef, finds it difficult to accept a situation he cannot understand. But Helen nearly always finds the right words - and humor - to counterbalance the ignorance and jeers of those around her. It is the beginning of a long, winding road towards the sexual identity she is convinced is hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4i8rW3JGyo7pNU5nCUCJx3gPXXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337607'),
  ('307021175050563305', 'Call Me Lucky', 2015, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Bradley Stonesifer', null, 'Barry Crimmins, David Cross, Patton Oswalt, Tom Kenny, Margaret Cho, Steven Wright, Lenny Clarke, Kevin Meaney', null, 'An inspiring, triumphant and wickedly funny portrait of one of comedy’s most enigmatic and important figures, CALL ME LUCKY tells the story of Barry Crimmins, a beer-swilling, politically outspoken and whip-smart comic whose efforts in the 70s and 80s fostered the talents of the next generation of standup comedians. But beneath Crimmins’ gruff, hard-drinking, curmudgeonly persona lay an undercurrent of rage stemming from his long-suppressed and horrific abuse as a child – a rage that eventually found its way out of the comedy clubs and television shows and into the political arena.', 'An inspiring, triumphant and wickedly funny portrait of one of comedy’s most enigmatic and important figures, CALL ME LUCKY tells the story of Barry Crimmins, a beer-swilling, politically outspoken and whip-smart comic whose efforts in the 70s and 80s fostered the talents of the next generation of standup comedians. But beneath Crimmins’ gruff, hard-drinking, curmudgeonly persona lay an undercurrent of rage stemming from his long-suppressed and horrific abuse as a child – a rage that eventually found its way out of the comedy clubs and television shows and into the political arena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eewB9ORnDZsxPoJiTKCcZMocm1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316761'),
  ('234488408308484046', 'Call Me Madam', 1953, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Walter Lang, Leon Shamroy, Hal Klein', 'Arthur Sheekman', 'Ethel Merman, Donald O''Connor, Vera-Ellen, George Sanders, Billy De Wolfe, Helmut Dantine, Walter Slezak, Steven Geray', 'G', 'Washington hostess Sally Adams becomes a Truman-era US ambassador to a European grand duchy.', 'Washington hostess Sally Adams becomes a Truman-era US ambassador to a European grand duchy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNemnYu57J8oesfYmjeSD6CVdQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46011'),
  ('486843236307594616', 'Call Me Mike', 1979, 'Crime, Mystery, Comedy', 'Alfredo Gurrola', 'Jorge Patiño, Reyes Bercini', 'Alejandro Parodi, Sasha Montenegro, Víctor Alcocer, Carlos Cardán, Bruno Rey, Humberto Elizondo, José Nájera, Roberto Dumont', null, 'After being unjustly accused of corruption and seriously injured in prison, Miguel''s personality will merge with the characters he reads in his police novels.', 'After being unjustly accused of corruption and seriously injured in prison, Miguel''s personality will merge with the characters he reads in his police novels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fk4KquIVLJIilFoDj3XWovZ2us2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176891'),
  ('742411242875178327', 'Call Me Mrs. Miracle', 2010, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Michael M. Scott, Adam Sliwinski, Catherine Kretz', 'Nancey Silvers', 'Doris Roberts, Jewel Staite, Lauren Holly, Eric Johnson, Quinn Lord, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Mary Black, Tom Butler', 'PG', 'Mrs Merkle (or Mrs. Miracle as she is know by some) finds herself in a toy department of a department store that is having all kinds of financial problems, but leave it to this kind lady as she will get the Christmas spirit flowing very freely at this store.', 'Mrs Merkle (or Mrs. Miracle as she is know by some) finds herself in a toy department of a department store that is having all kinds of financial problems, but leave it to this kind lady as she will get the Christmas spirit flowing very freely at this store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwVwpK2xIUzRfgrlSHiwIfIdHie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78059'),
  ('991565323329280153', 'Call Me Tonight', 1986, 'Animation, Romance, Comedy, Horror', 'Tatsuya Okamoto, Kumiko Takahashi', 'Tatsuya Okamoto', 'Sakiko Tamagawa, Katsumi Toriumi, Chie Koujiro, Toshihiko Seki, Rumiko Ukai', null, 'Rumi, a phone sex operator making ends meet, falls for her most challenging client yet: Ryo, a young man who transforms into a monstrous beast when he''s aroused. But Rumi’s not the only one with her eye on the cursed caller.', 'Rumi, a phone sex operator making ends meet, falls for her most challenging client yet: Ryo, a young man who transforms into a monstrous beast when he''s aroused. But Rumi’s not the only one with her eye on the cursed caller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M9zTrSMJ7zrXYmVfVYezt2Yiwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166614'),
  ('899944802047690254', 'Call Northside 777', 1948, 'Crime, Drama', 'Henry Hathaway, Joseph MacDonald, Joseph E. Rickards', 'Jerome Cady, Jay Dratler', 'James Stewart, Richard Conte, Lee J. Cobb, Helen Walker, Betty Garde, Kasia Orzazewski, Joanne De Bergh, Howard Smith', 'NR', 'In 1932, a cop is killed and Frank Wiecek sentenced to life. Eleven years later, a newspaper ad by Frank''s mother leads Chicago reporter P.J. O''Neal to look into the case. For some time, O''Neal continues to believe Frank guilty. But when he starts to change his mind, he meets increased resistance from authorities unwilling to be proved wrong.', 'In 1932, a cop is killed and Frank Wiecek sentenced to life. Eleven years later, a newspaper ad by Frank''s mother leads Chicago reporter P.J. O''Neal to look into the case. For some time, O''Neal continues to believe Frank guilty. But when he starts to change his mind, he meets increased resistance from authorities unwilling to be proved wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejXHWJRTYfvPFGQnwOZevqoNU6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26038'),
  ('970805599785356369', 'Call of Heroes', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Pakie Chan, Ho Ka-Fai', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Louis Koo, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Wu Jing, Maggie Jiang, Yuan Quan, Liu Kai-Chi, Philip Keung Ho-Man', null, 'During the warlords era in China, a village located in rural area called Pucheng fell into dangerous situation when its government allocated all its military force to the front line, the cruel commandant Cao from the enemy troops arrived the village and killed the innocent, the guardians of Pucheng were desperate to fight against Cao for justice and to protect their homeland.', 'During the warlords era in China, a village located in rural area called Pucheng fell into dangerous situation when its government allocated all its military force to the front line, the cruel commandant Cao from the enemy troops arrived the village and killed the innocent, the guardians of Pucheng were desperate to fight against Cao for justice and to protect their homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frNzgqcLNno44PhcNREjM7AEXWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413198'),
  ('996240733337125918', 'Call of the Blonde Goddess', 1977, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Jesús Franco', 'Erwin C. Dietrich, Jesús Franco', 'Vicky Adams, Ada Tauler, Karine Gambier, Jack Taylor, Vítor Mendes, Ly Frey, Aida Gouveia, Sandra Daenliker', null, 'Susan arrives in Haiti to live with her husband Jack, who lives with a lesbian housekeeper and Olga, a nymphomaniac platinum blonde, introduced to her as Jack''s sister. Susan begins to have nightmares about voodoo ceremonies and murder.', 'Susan arrives in Haiti to live with her husband Jack, who lives with a lesbian housekeeper and Olga, a nymphomaniac platinum blonde, introduced to her as Jack''s sister. Susan begins to have nightmares about voodoo ceremonies and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgskL0VpR4ezc2Q7TE2Yfxy4fBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73475'),
  ('95175112003548219', 'Call of the Cuckoo', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman, Floyd Jackman', null, 'Max Davidson, Lillian Elliott, Spec O''Donnell, Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Charley Chase, Frank Brownlee', 'NR', 'Mishaps befall a new home owner located next door to an insane asylum.', 'Mishaps befall a new home owner located next door to an insane asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmn0lH1IUErBWOC3e9MQpAcvU3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50863'),
  ('1029969939641196555', 'Call of the Wild', 1935, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, Western', 'William A. Wellman, Charles Rosher', 'Leonard Praskins, Gene Fowler', 'Clark Gable, Loretta Young, Jack Oakie, Reginald Owen, Frank Conroy, Katherine DeMille, Sidney Toler, James Burke', 'NR', 'Jack Thornton has trouble winning enough at cards for the stake he needs to get to the Alaska gold fields. His luck changes when he pays $250 for Buck, a sled dog that is part wolf to keep him from being shot by an arrogant Englishman also headed for the Yukon. En route to the Yukon with Shorty Houlihan -- who spent time in jail for opening someone else''s letter with a map of where gold is to be found -- Jack rescues a woman whose husband was the addressee of that letter. Buck helps Jack win a $1,000 bet to get the supplies he needs. And when Jack and Claire Blake pet Buck one night, fingers touch.', 'Jack Thornton has trouble winning enough at cards for the stake he needs to get to the Alaska gold fields. His luck changes when he pays $250 for Buck, a sled dog that is part wolf to keep him from being shot by an arrogant Englishman also headed for the Yukon. En route to the Yukon with Shorty Houlihan -- who spent time in jail for opening someone else''s letter with a map of where gold is to be found -- Jack rescues a woman whose husband was the addressee of that letter. Buck helps Jack win a $1,000 bet to get the supplies he needs. And when Jack and Claire Blake pet Buck one night, fingers touch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhlz8WV0BhlgkPVy4AAceFmlpAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119819'),
  ('988938316680572070', 'Call of the Wild', 2009, 'Adventure', 'Richard Gabai, Scott Peck', 'Leland Douglas', 'Christopher Lloyd, Ariel Gade, Kameron Knox, Timothy Bottoms, Devon Graye, Aimee Teegarden, Veronica Cartwright, Wes Studi', 'PG', 'Self-centered and status-conscious, ten year old Ryann Hale journeys to Montana to visit her down-to-earth grandpa, Bill Hale. Ryann bonds with a wolf-dog, Buck, and schemes to save him from a cruel dogsledder.', 'Self-centered and status-conscious, ten year old Ryann Hale journeys to Montana to visit her down-to-earth grandpa, Bill Hale. Ryann bonds with a wolf-dog, Buck, and schemes to save him from a cruel dogsledder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hGtJNKsvRmadTWpZgoK29g3Bkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27906'),
  ('787947473171132223', 'Call Of The Wild', 1993, 'Family, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Michael Toshiyuki Uno, Alan Smithee, David Geddes', null, 'Rick Schroder, Gordon Tootoosis, Duncan Fraser, Richard Newman, Brent Stait, Mia Sara, Eric McCormack, Kerry Sandomirsky', null, 'A young boy heads off to the Yukon after hearing tales about the Gold Rush, and he forms an unwavering friendship with a heroic Alsatian dog called Buck.', 'A young boy heads off to the Yukon after hearing tales about the Gold Rush, and he forms an unwavering friendship with a heroic Alsatian dog called Buck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4HDzplBOItwZ49qQXw6hoEcyF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220768'),
  ('547563917442179922', 'Call of Water', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ludovic Zuili, Damien Grégoire, Tom Dallem', 'Mauricio Carrasco, Élise Otzenberger, Maud Ameline', 'Cécile de France, Arthur Igual, Darius Zarrabian, Navid Zarrabian, Antoine Chappey, Victor Estivant, Elise Atlan, Xiao Han', null, 'Sarah, in her forties, is on the verge of exhaustion. Her children, ages 9 and 5, take up all her time and her husband is constantly on business trips. After disappearing on the beach for a few minutes, Simon becomes strange. He spends hours in his bathroom and seeks contact with water at the slightest opportunity. Sarah''s life will change when her son confesses the truth...', 'Sarah, in her forties, is on the verge of exhaustion. Her children, ages 9 and 5, take up all her time and her husband is constantly on business trips. After disappearing on the beach for a few minutes, Simon becomes strange. He spends hours in his bathroom and seeks contact with water at the slightest opportunity. Sarah''s life will change when her son confesses the truth...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OlqCaJ8KECISjCzYXeg7pR6uEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156104'),
  ('365069901290672411', 'CALL TV', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Norberto Ramos del Val, César Montegrifo', 'Ricardo López Toledo, Pablo Vázquez', 'María Hervás, Ismael Martínez, Álvaro Lafora, Ana del Arco, Javier Albalá, Emilio Buale, Aroa Gimeno, Edgar Calot', null, 'Lucía starts tonight as a Call TV hostess on the worst night of her life.', 'Lucía starts tonight as a Call TV hostess on the worst night of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlpSrBmeT625JnyND9RojM2PPUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492823'),
  ('237523853989408179', 'Calladita', 2020, 'Drama', 'Miguel Faus, Edurne larumbe, Alejandro Gil', 'Miguel Faus', 'Paula Grimaldo, Guillermo Campra, Ares Aixalà, Joan Sureda, Jordi Recasens, Pol Hermoso, Victor Rebull, Alejo de Soler', null, 'In a summer mansion in the Costa Brava, a young domestic worker has to serve two rich kids while they enjoy their summer. Amongst cocktails, drugs and dishwashers, she will look for her own way of having fun.', 'In a summer mansion in the Costa Brava, a young domestic worker has to serve two rich kids while they enjoy their summer. Amongst cocktails, drugs and dishwashers, she will look for her own way of having fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39akXzZnrt8qtqrsaOZXZsMBGZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759001'),
  ('1014621827841691774', 'Calladita', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Miguel Faus, Antonio Galisteo, Víctor Antolí', 'Miguel Faus', 'Paula Grimaldo, Ariadna Gil, Luis Bermejo, Pol Hermoso, Violeta Rodríguez, Nany Tovar, Victor Rebull, Eduard Torres', null, 'Ana has just arrived from Colombia and is the maid of a luxurious mansion on the Costa Brava, where a family of wealthy art dealers spends their summers. The young woman works tirelessly and without a contract, under the promise of decent conditions at the end of the summer, if she remains obedient and discreet.', 'Ana has just arrived from Colombia and is the maid of a luxurious mansion on the Costa Brava, where a family of wealthy art dealers spends their summers. The young woman works tirelessly and without a contract, under the promise of decent conditions at the end of the summer, if she remains obedient and discreet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZXKAjNQ9zxGCp7LNddqGoQgzPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1188853'),
  ('405769338686871143', 'Callan', 1974, 'Thriller', 'Don Sharp, Ernest Steward', null, 'Edward Woodward, Eric Porter, Carl Möhner, Catherine Schell, Peter Egan, Russell Hunter, Kenneth Griffith, Michael Da Costa', null, 'David Callan, secret agent, is called back to the service after his retirement, to handle the assassination of a german businessman, but Callan refuses to co-operate until he finds out why this man is marked for death.', 'David Callan, secret agent, is called back to the service after his retirement, to handle the assassination of a german businessman, but Callan refuses to co-operate until he finds out why this man is marked for death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hB5zvq9WBRISwYUA4HKQ5l8iZ5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59159'),
