  ('1143780766813492015', 'Calling Dr. Death', 1943, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Virgil Miller, Reginald Le Borg, Bernard B. Brown', 'Edward Dein', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Patricia Morison, J. Carrol Naish, David Bruce, Ramsay Ames, Fay Helm, Holmes Herbert, Alec Craig', null, 'Losing his memories of the last few days, neurologist Dr. Steele is told that his wife has been brutally murdered. Steele, aware of his conniving wife''s infidelity, believes he may have been the killer and enlists the aid of his pretty nurse Stella to hypnotize him into recovering his lost memories.', 'Losing his memories of the last few days, neurologist Dr. Steele is told that his wife has been brutally murdered. Steele, aware of his conniving wife''s infidelity, believes he may have been the killer and enlists the aid of his pretty nurse Stella to hypnotize him into recovering his lost memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glvmG9QQ6KQAcHIBy7AkTwDRxqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38273'),
  ('908047510201709912', 'Calling Homicide', 1956, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Edward Bernds, Harry Neumann', 'Edward Bernds', 'Bill Elliott, Don Haggerty, Kathleen Case, Myron Healey, Jeanne Cooper, Thomas Browne Henry, Lyle Talbot, Almira Sessions', 'NR', 'Cop Andy Doyle investigates a car-bombing murder and the killing of a sleazy modeling agency owner. Are they connected?', 'Cop Andy Doyle investigates a car-bombing murder and the killing of a sleazy modeling agency owner. Are they connected?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB8o4y39NAmLfJuFqWRkGUslzBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46042'),
  ('767154775555045023', 'Calling Philo Vance', 1940, 'Crime, Mystery', 'L. William O''Connell, William Clemens', 'Tom Reed', 'James Stephenson, Margot Stevenson, Henry O''Neill, Edward Brophy, Sheila Bromley, Ralph Forbes, Donald Douglas, Martin Kosleck', null, 'Philo is in Vienna working for the US Government to see if Archer Coe is selling aircraft designs to foreign powers. He grabs the plans with Archer''s signature, but is captured by police before he can escape. Deported he comes back to America and plans to confront Archer, but Archer is found dead in his locked bedroom with a gun in his hand. While it looks like a suicide, Vance knows better and the coroner finds that Archer has been shot, hit with a blunt instrument and stabbed - making suicide unlikely. But Vance is on the case and is looking to see if government secrets have been sold and who has murdered Coe. This is a remake of "The Kennel Murder Case" using aircraft designs and espionage instead of Chinese porcelain and dog shows.', 'Philo is in Vienna working for the US Government to see if Archer Coe is selling aircraft designs to foreign powers. He grabs the plans with Archer''s signature, but is captured by police before he can escape. Deported he comes back to America and plans to confront Archer, but Archer is found dead in his locked bedroom with a gun in his hand. While it looks like a suicide, Vance knows better and the coroner finds that Archer has been shot, hit with a blunt instrument and stabbed - making suicide unlikely. But Vance is on the case and is looking to see if government secrets have been sold and who has murdered Coe. This is a remake of "The Kennel Murder Case" using aircraft designs and espionage instead of Chinese porcelain and dog shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UYyOI9Zvcj90XSf6MargEUh39m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179987'),
  ('445967648228663893', 'Calm at Sea', 2012, 'War, Drama, History', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Valentin Rodriguez, Lubomir Bakchev', 'Volker Schlöndorff', 'Léo-Paul Salmain, Ulrich Matthes, Jean-Marc Roulot, Marc Barbé, Jacob Matschenz, Harald Schrott, Christopher Buchholz, Arielle Dombasle', null, 'October 1941. Eighteen months into France’s occupation by German troops, young Communist members of the Resistance shoot dead an officer of the German Army. In retaliation, Hitler demands the deaths of 150 Frenchmen, as ''retribution''. The targets are to be mostly young men believed to share the assassins’ political convictions. Most of these men are taken from an internment camp for opponents of the occupation; a 35-year-old French rural administrator is ordered to select the victims. Although the parish priest appeals to their conscience and moral sensibilities, both the German military and their French helpers slavishly follow their orders.', 'October 1941. Eighteen months into France’s occupation by German troops, young Communist members of the Resistance shoot dead an officer of the German Army. In retaliation, Hitler demands the deaths of 150 Frenchmen, as ''retribution''. The targets are to be mostly young men believed to share the assassins’ political convictions. Most of these men are taken from an internment camp for opponents of the occupation; a 35-year-old French rural administrator is ordered to select the victims. Although the parish priest appeals to their conscience and moral sensibilities, both the German military and their French helpers slavishly follow their orders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZQ785bMkmjnGHH1kvhauQYeKHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141950'),
  ('748331080423164723', 'Calm with Horses', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mike Hayes, Conor Flannery, Benjamin Crowe', 'Joseph Murtagh', 'Cosmo Jarvis, Barry Keoghan, Niamh Algar, Ned Dennehy, Kiljan Moroney, Brid Brennan, Liam Carney, Simone Kirby', 'R', 'In darkest rural Ireland, ex-boxer Douglas ''Arm'' Armstrong has become the feared enforcer for the drug-dealing Devers family, whilst also trying to be a good father to his autistic five-year-old son, Jack. Torn between these two families, Arm''s loyalties are truly tested when he is asked to kill for the first time.', 'In darkest rural Ireland, ex-boxer Douglas ''Arm'' Armstrong has become the feared enforcer for the drug-dealing Devers family, whilst also trying to be a good father to his autistic five-year-old son, Jack. Torn between these two families, Arm''s loyalties are truly tested when he is asked to kill for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svqlPJDCaKGSRFDk8a3zp19xjwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574396'),
  ('1017342713460896358', 'Caltiki, the Immortal Monster', 1959, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Mario Bava, Riccardo Freda, Mario Bava', 'Filippo Sanjust, Riccardo Freda', 'John Merivale, Didi Sullivan, Gérard Herter, Daniela Rocca, Vittorio André, Daniele Vargas, Nerio Bernardi, Giacomo Rossi Stuart', 'NR', 'Academic researchers are chased by a nuclear-hot specimen of ancient Mayan blob.', 'Academic researchers are chased by a nuclear-hot specimen of ancient Mayan blob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jS8eyq1MfK84GrkM708UkBE29hm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28063'),
