  ('221333735524195435', 'Calypso Cat', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gene Deitch, Václav Bedřich', null, null, null, 'While chasing Jerry around a dock, Tom sees and instantly falls in love with a female cat. The female cat appears to return Tom''s interest, so Tom sneaks aboard the ship the female cat and her owner have just boarded. Jerry follows Tom onto the boat and proceeds to interfere with Tom''s subsequent flirtations.', 'While chasing Jerry around a dock, Tom sees and instantly falls in love with a female cat. The female cat appears to return Tom''s interest, so Tom sneaks aboard the ship the female cat and her owner have just boarded. Jerry follows Tom onto the boat and proceeds to interfere with Tom''s subsequent flirtations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xf3xG9QINBs189qBx0YqlE5xVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223022'),
  ('21660670879271385', 'Cam', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Katelin Arizmendi, Daniel Goldhaber, Frederick Gourgue', 'Isa Mazzei', 'Madeline Brewer, Patch Darragh, Melora Walters, Devin Druid, Imani Hakim, Michael Dempsey, Flora Diaz, Samantha Robinson', null, 'A young camgirl discovers that she’s inexplicably been replaced on her site with an exact replica of herself.', 'A young camgirl discovers that she’s inexplicably been replaced on her site with an exact replica of herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7m3sSQhnoT2uuxUsxF4mQX6opr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521935'),
