  ('722583059715802381', 'Camera', 2000, 'Comedy', 'David Cronenberg, André Pienaar', 'David Cronenberg', 'Leslie Carlson, Marc Donato, Kyle Kass, Daniel Magder, Harrison Kane, Stephanie Sams, Katie Lai, Natasha La Force', null, 'While a veteran actor laments the state of film and film acting, a group of young children sneak a Panavision camera into the apartment where the actor resides and decide to make a film with it.', 'While a veteran actor laments the state of film and film acting, a group of young children sneak a Panavision camera into the apartment where the actor resides and decide to make a film with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeQFid2pEldA9gBrTHUpe5s4Ow0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100607'),
  ('665397058199248900', 'Camera Buff', 1979, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Michal Maryniarczyk, Jacek Petrycki', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Małgorzata Ząbkowska, Ewa Pokas, Stefan Czyżewski, Jerzy Nowak, Tadeusz Bradecki, Marek Litewka, Bogusław Sobczuk', null, 'Filip buys an 8mm movie camera when his first child is born. Because it''s the first camera in town, he''s named official photographer by the local Party boss. His horizons widen when he is sent to regional film festivals with his first works but his focus on movie making also leads to domestic strife and philosophical dilemmas.', 'Filip buys an 8mm movie camera when his first child is born. Because it''s the first camera in town, he''s named official photographer by the local Party boss. His horizons widen when he is sent to regional film festivals with his first works but his focus on movie making also leads to domestic strife and philosophical dilemmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4n9LXUanIKdlKTCfRqrhwQbtVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42164'),
  ('799780571000770246', 'Camera Cafe: The Movie', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Enrique Silguero, Carmela Martínez Oliart, Ernesto Sevilla', 'Joaquín Reyes, Ernesto Sevilla, Miguel Esteban', 'Arturo Valls, Carlos Chamarro, Manuel Galiana, Marta Belenguer, Javier Botet, Carolina Cerezuela, Esperanza Elipe, Ingrid García Jonsson', null, 'Jesús Quesada, an incompetent executive, is appointed as the new director of a company in decline whose survival will now depend on both the ingenuity and ambition of his former colleagues.', 'Jesús Quesada, an incompetent executive, is appointed as the new director of a company in decline whose survival will now depend on both the ingenuity and ambition of his former colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlHZV96gSY5UOmqPDlsFZ4ABWHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762823'),
  ('294810161169483388', 'Cameraperson', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Kirsten Johnson, Kirsten Johnson', 'Doris Baizley, Lisa Freedman', 'Kirsten Johnson, Jacques Derrida, Michael Moore, Richard Johnson', 'NR', 'As a visually radical memoir, CAMERAPERSON draws on the remarkable footage that filmmaker Kirsten Johnson has shot and reframes it in ways that illuminate moments and situations that have personally affected her. What emerges is an elegant meditation on the relationship between truth and the camera frame, as Johnson transforms scenes that have been presented on Festival screens as one kind of truth into another kind of story—one about personal journey, craft, and direct human connection.', 'As a visually radical memoir, CAMERAPERSON draws on the remarkable footage that filmmaker Kirsten Johnson has shot and reframes it in ways that illuminate moments and situations that have personally affected her. What emerges is an elegant meditation on the relationship between truth and the camera frame, as Johnson transforms scenes that have been presented on Festival screens as one kind of truth into another kind of story—one about personal journey, craft, and direct human connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1Od99QxnzCB9vKu9uxkZQlPZQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376534'),
  ('182172317712670484', 'Camerieri', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Leone Pompucci, Massimo Pau, Donatella Botti', 'Paolo Rossi, Filippo Pichi, Leone Pompucci', 'Paolo Villaggio, Diego Abatantuono, Marco Messeri, Antonello Fassari, Antonio Catania, Enrico Salimbeni, Regina Bianchi, Ludovica Modugno', null, 'Four waiters and a cook working at a seaside restaurant hate one another but still keep working together for lack of better opportunities.', 'Four waiters and a cook working at a seaside restaurant hate one another but still keep working together for lack of better opportunities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihe1T33JgVUwswlJqe1XUrikZ7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77226'),
  ('191263346742990503', 'Cameron''s Closet', 1988, 'Horror', 'Armand Mastroianni, Russell Carpenter', 'Gary Brandner', 'Cotter Smith, Mel Harris, Scott Curtis, Chuck McCann, Leigh McCloskey, Kim Lankford, Gary Hudson, Tab Hunter', 'R', 'A father who experiments with his son''s psychokinetic powers is unaware that these experiments have released a demon from hell which lives in his son''s closet, preparing to take over the young boy''s soul.', 'A father who experiments with his son''s psychokinetic powers is unaware that these experiments have released a demon from hell which lives in his son''s closet, preparing to take over the young boy''s soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpkwVBiH9yp7fwijY9iAMZZUQbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59735'),
  ('401180387349110202', 'Camila', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'María Luisa Bemberg, Antonio Barrio, Alberto Lecchi', 'María Luisa Bemberg, Beda Docampo Feijóo, Juan Bautista Stagnaro', 'Susú Pecoraro, Imanol Arias, Héctor Alterio, Elena Tasisto, Carlos Muñoz Arosa, Héctor Pellegrini, Juan Leyrado, Cecilio Madanes', 'R', 'In 1847 Buenos Aires, a young noblewoman and a young Jesuit fall in love, much to the disapproval of her family and the Church.', 'In 1847 Buenos Aires, a young noblewoman and a young Jesuit fall in love, much to the disapproval of her family and the Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0tSZtLgvzYjc3PHiF3p8ilcorU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42085'),
  ('81120644413096851', 'Camila Comes Out Tonight', 2022, 'Drama', 'Inés María Barrionuevo, Constanza Sandoval', 'Andrés Aloi, Inés María Barrionuevo', 'Nina Dziembrowski, Maite Lucía Valero, Adriana Ferrer, Carolina Rojas, Diego Sánchez, Federico Sack, Laura Daniela Visconti, Anna Fantoni Hayward', null, 'When her grandmother becomes seriously ill, Camila is forced to move to Buenos Aires, leaving behind a liberal public high school for a scholastic, traditional private institution. Suddenly a senior without any friends, and with her single mother caught up in family affairs; Camila''s fierce yet immature temperament is put to the test as she deals with the jarring change of scenery, and the alluring set of possibilities and experiences that lie in wait in the big city.', 'When her grandmother becomes seriously ill, Camila is forced to move to Buenos Aires, leaving behind a liberal public high school for a scholastic, traditional private institution. Suddenly a senior without any friends, and with her single mother caught up in family affairs; Camila''s fierce yet immature temperament is put to the test as she deals with the jarring change of scenery, and the alluring set of possibilities and experiences that lie in wait in the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUb3LM35HDAHLrD6FId6kGSP0EO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812089'),
  ('1031997153049285276', 'Camila Jam', 2007, 'Drama', 'Murilo Salles, Hsu Chien', 'Melanie Dimantas, Murilo Salles, Elena Soarez', 'Leandra Leal, Juliano Cazarré, Alex Disdier, Munir Kanaan, David Katz, Rosanne Mulholland, Ricardo Garcia, Gustavo Machado', null, 'Camila is in her mid-twenties and her life has been thrown into chaos ever since her boyfriend threw her out of their apartment during a bitter argument. Camila''s ambition is to become a writer, and she posts regularly on her blog, entitled "Camila Jam." However, Camila wants to take her work into a different direction, and she throws herself head first into life in search of inspiration. As Camila struggles with alcohol, unsettled emotions and relationships with abusive men, it becomes increasingly obvious that her skills as a writer aren''t all she needs to sort out if she wants to truly understand her life and her career.', 'Camila is in her mid-twenties and her life has been thrown into chaos ever since her boyfriend threw her out of their apartment during a bitter argument. Camila''s ambition is to become a writer, and she posts regularly on her blog, entitled "Camila Jam." However, Camila wants to take her work into a different direction, and she throws herself head first into life in search of inspiration. As Camila struggles with alcohol, unsettled emotions and relationships with abusive men, it becomes increasingly obvious that her skills as a writer aren''t all she needs to sort out if she wants to truly understand her life and her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6icieefHVmDlhuiQKvxiZqA3Mw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72701'),
  ('843352218985004862', 'Camilla', 1994, 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Deepa Mehta, Guy Dufaux', 'Paul Quarrington', 'Jessica Tandy, Bridget Fonda, Elias Koteas, Maury Chaykin, Graham Greene, Hume Cronyn, Ranjit Chowdhry, George Harris', null, 'Freda Lopez, an aspiring musician, travels with her husband to the beautiful beaches of Georgia where she befriends Camilla, an odd and exotic elderly woman who plays the violin. When the two embark on a journey together, Camilla reclaims a lost love and makes peace with herself and her son, while Freda discovers inner resources she never knew she had.', 'Freda Lopez, an aspiring musician, travels with her husband to the beautiful beaches of Georgia where she befriends Camilla, an odd and exotic elderly woman who plays the violin. When the two embark on a journey together, Camilla reclaims a lost love and makes peace with herself and her son, while Freda discovers inner resources she never knew she had.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4NLcrpkZxG966IKcTmOuZfY7uV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79783'),
  ('957156611677690705', 'Camille', 1921, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ray C. Smallwood, Rudolph J. Bergquist', 'June Mathis, Alexandre Dumas fils', 'Alla Nazimova, Rudolph Valentino, Rex Cherryman, Arthur Hoyt, Zeffie Tilbury, Patsy Ruth Miller, Elinor Oliver, William Orlamond', 'NR', 'Camille is a courtesan in Paris. She falls deeply in love with a young man of promise, Armand Duval. When Armand''s father begs her not to ruin his hope of a career and position by marrying Armand, she acquiesces and leaves her lover. However, when poverty and terminal illness overwhelm her, Camille discovers that Armand has not lost his love for her.', 'Camille is a courtesan in Paris. She falls deeply in love with a young man of promise, Armand Duval. When Armand''s father begs her not to ruin his hope of a career and position by marrying Armand, she acquiesces and leaves her lover. However, when poverty and terminal illness overwhelm her, Camille discovers that Armand has not lost his love for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17rCD5J12IBhhymAc7AvskUNA20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139176'),
  ('349733167998102406', 'Camille', 1936, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'George Cukor, William H. Daniels, Edwin B. Willis', 'Frances Marion, James Hilton, Zoë Akins', 'Greta Garbo, Robert Taylor, Lionel Barrymore, Elizabeth Allan, Jessie Ralph, Henry Daniell, Lenore Ulric, Laura Hope Crews', 'NR', 'Life in 1847 Paris is as spirited as champagne and as unforgiving as the gray morning after. In gambling dens and lavish soirees, men of means exert their wills and women turned courtesans exult in pleasure. One such woman is Marguerite Gautier, who begins a sumptuous romance with Armand Duval.', 'Life in 1847 Paris is as spirited as champagne and as unforgiving as the gray morning after. In gambling dens and lavish soirees, men of means exert their wills and women turned courtesans exult in pleasure. One such woman is Marguerite Gautier, who begins a sumptuous romance with Armand Duval.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78p9egiU16QpJNvmSVa4Vnr0JUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43874'),
  ('478021473700235295', 'Camille', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Desmond Davis, Jean Tournier', 'Blanche Hanalis', 'Greta Scacchi, Colin Firth, John Gielgud, Billie Whitelaw, Patrick Ryecart, Denholm Elliott, Ben Kingsley, Lila Kaye', null, 'Camille is a courtesan in Paris. She falls deeply in love with a young man of promise, Armand Duval. When Armand''s father begs her not to ruin his hope of a career and position by marrying Armand, she acquiesces and leaves her lover. However, when poverty and terminal illness overwhelm her, Camille discovers that Armand has not lost his love for her.', 'Camille is a courtesan in Paris. She falls deeply in love with a young man of promise, Armand Duval. When Armand''s father begs her not to ruin his hope of a career and position by marrying Armand, she acquiesces and leaves her lover. However, when poverty and terminal illness overwhelm her, Camille discovers that Armand has not lost his love for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VtRYBIaEG83PkTL9EpFY19bnBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167033'),
  ('226883268834586002', 'Camille', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gregory Mackenzie, Sharone Meir', 'Nick Pustay', 'Sienna Miller, James Franco, David Carradine, Scott Glenn, Ed Lauter, Mark Wilson, Patricia Yeatman, Steve Markoff', null, 'A twisted honeymoon adventure about a young couple on their way to Niagara Falls.', 'A twisted honeymoon adventure about a young couple on their way to Niagara Falls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rRHC7aOlDiijXJHyy4hkwLdJck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22419'),
  ('1124538570502719660', 'Camille', 2019, 'Drama, War', 'Boris Lojkine, Elin Kirschfink, Antonin Schopfer', 'Bojina Panayotova, Boris Lojkine', 'Nina Meurisse, Fiacre Bindala, Bruno Todeschini, Grégoire Colin, Ousnabee Zounoua, Geoffrey Bateman, Roch Leibovici, Antonin Schopfer', null, 'Camille, a young idealistic photojournalist, goes to the Central African Republic to cover the civil war that is brewing up. What she sees there will change her destiny forever.', 'Camille, a young idealistic photojournalist, goes to the Central African Republic to cover the civil war that is brewing up. What she sees there will change her destiny forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3whGckLM4PGsTSCHL2Xc2TOt1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582912'),
  ('834926745112913649', 'Camille 2000', 1969, 'Drama, Romance', 'Radley Metzger, Ennio Guarnieri, Francesco Cinieri', 'Michael DeForrest', 'Danièle Gaubert, Nino Castelnuovo, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Roberto Bisacco, Massimo Serato, Silvana Venturelli, Zachary Adams, Dominique Badou', 'NR', 'Marguerite, a beautiful woman of affairs, falls for the young and promising Armand, but sacrifices her love for him for the sake of his future and reputation.', 'Marguerite, a beautiful woman of affairs, falls for the young and promising Armand, but sacrifices her love for him for the sake of his future and reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQdIVngtrn56qmqxhotrVGiY3Hi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36446'),
  ('92019055559259246', 'Camille Claudel', 1988, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Bruno Nuytten, Pierre Lhomme', 'Bruno Nuytten, Marilyn Goldin', 'Isabelle Adjani, Gérard Depardieu, Laurent Grévill, Alain Cuny, Roch Leibovici, Madeleine Robinson, Philippe Clévenot, Katrine Boorman', 'R', 'The life of Camille Claudel, a French sculptor who becomes the apprentice of Auguste Rodin and later his lover. Her passion for her art and Rodin drive her further away from reason and rationality.', 'The life of Camille Claudel, a French sculptor who becomes the apprentice of Auguste Rodin and later his lover. Her passion for her art and Rodin drive her further away from reason and rationality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZWvwcum4mMjqJsWcIaLOhYE3gq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11709'),
  ('475139556188077535', 'Camille Claudel 1915', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Bruno Dumont, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Bruno Dumont', 'Juliette Binoche, Jean-Luc Vincent, Robert Leroy, Armelle Leroy-Rolland, Emmanuel Kauffman, Marion Keller, Sandra Rivera, Eric Jacoulet', null, 'Winter, 1915. Confined by her family to an asylum in the South of France - where she will never sculpt again - the chronicle of Camille Claudel''s reclusive life, as she waits for a visit from her brother, Paul Claudel.', 'Winter, 1915. Confined by her family to an asylum in the South of France - where she will never sculpt again - the chronicle of Camille Claudel''s reclusive life, as she waits for a visit from her brother, Paul Claudel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHU5CiEk4QoCrvxJV8uOLxi3y5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110428'),
  ('1062124544199318266', 'Camille Rewinds', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Noémie Lvovsky, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Pierre-Olivier Mattei, Maud Ameline, Florence Seyvos', 'Noémie Lvovsky, Samir Guesmi, Judith Chemla, India Hair, Julia Faure, Yolande Moreau, Michel Vuillermoz, Denis Podalydès', null, 'Camille was only sixteen and still in high school when she fell in love with Eric, another student. They later married and a child and were happy for a while. But now twenty-five years have passed and Eric leaves her for a younger woman. Bitter and desperate Camille drinks so much liquor at a New Year Eve''s party that she falls into an ethylic coma and she finds herself... propelled into her own past! Camille is sixteen again when she wakes up this morning, her parents are not dead anymore and she must go to school, where she will meet her schoolmates and, of course, Eric. Is she going to fall for him again and... be miserable twenty-five years later? Or will she avoid him with the result never having her beloved daughter? Who ever said that time traveling was fun?', 'Camille was only sixteen and still in high school when she fell in love with Eric, another student. They later married and a child and were happy for a while. But now twenty-five years have passed and Eric leaves her for a younger woman. Bitter and desperate Camille drinks so much liquor at a New Year Eve''s party that she falls into an ethylic coma and she finds herself... propelled into her own past! Camille is sixteen again when she wakes up this morning, her parents are not dead anymore and she must go to school, where she will meet her schoolmates and, of course, Eric. Is she going to fall for him again and... be miserable twenty-five years later? Or will she avoid him with the result never having her beloved daughter? Who ever said that time traveling was fun?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDYSELYsjhI7maKW3X71X3qB5BN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135281'),
  ('643228967814551989', 'Camino', 2008, 'Drama', 'Javier Fesser', 'Javier Fesser', 'Nerea Camacho, Mariano Venancio, Carme Elias, Manuela Vellés, Lola Casamayor, Ana Gracia, Pepe Ocio, Jordi Dauder', null, 'A religious organization interferes with the life of a terminally ill girl.', 'A religious organization interferes with the life of a terminally ill girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTE5F8m7itOL6iw90WISna0Vc43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17893'),
  ('281873457234094056', 'Camino', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Josh C. Waller, Noah Greenberg, Heather I. Denton', 'Daniel Noah', 'Zoë Bell, Nacho Vigalondo, Francisco Barreiro, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Sheila Vand, Dominic Rains, Nancy Gomez, Jason Canela', null, 'A photojournalist gets more than she bargained for when she snaps a photo of a shadowy religious figure in the jungles of Colombia, triggering a flight – and fight – for her life.', 'A photojournalist gets more than she bargained for when she snaps a photo of a shadowy religious figure in the jungles of Colombia, triggering a flight – and fight – for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DOzp5Rx8roC9YvvDgmoZAGeiGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359025'),
  ('490120739668204273', 'Camino de la suerte', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jorge Alonso', 'Jorge Alonso', 'Tito Valverde, María Jesús Sirvent, Amada Santos, Rosario Pardo, Marta García, Juan Carlos Sánchez', null, 'After the death of his wife after a long illness, Joaquín (Tito Valverde) decides to leave the city and take refuge in the small town where he was born. Seventy-five years old and with loneliness as his new and only companion in life, he can only wait for his turn. Poli, his best friend in the village, refuses to let him fall into his own abandonment: he has made a list of single women in the village to meet them and see if something comes up. Joaquín takes him for a madman and rejects his proposal completely. But Poli does not give up and ambushes him to learn that love has no wrinkles.', 'After the death of his wife after a long illness, Joaquín (Tito Valverde) decides to leave the city and take refuge in the small town where he was born. Seventy-five years old and with loneliness as his new and only companion in life, he can only wait for his turn. Poli, his best friend in the village, refuses to let him fall into his own abandonment: he has made a list of single women in the village to meet them and see if something comes up. Joaquín takes him for a madman and rejects his proposal completely. But Poli does not give up and ambushes him to learn that love has no wrinkles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7S1UAhDK81UELm2PwJowtK5ssZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181512'),
  ('398602246524752025', 'Camino del Rocío', 1966, 'Drama, Music', 'Rafael Gil', null, 'Francisco Rabal, Carmen Sevilla, Arturo Fernández, Guillermo Marín, Conchita Goyanes, María Luisa Ponte, Sancho Gracia, Robert Royal', null, 'Esperanza and Maria Jesús are two orphans because their father, Don Fernando, dies. He shared his buissines with Martina Echave, an old lover, who hated him because she has always wanted to marry him. Esperanza and Maria Jesús fall almost into ruin for Matinas'' handling. They had to take refuge with their aunt. Esperanza is Martinas'' soon''s girlfriend against her will, and they have a stormy relationship because José Antonio is also in love with her.', 'Esperanza and Maria Jesús are two orphans because their father, Don Fernando, dies. He shared his buissines with Martina Echave, an old lover, who hated him because she has always wanted to marry him. Esperanza and Maria Jesús fall almost into ruin for Matinas'' handling. They had to take refuge with their aunt. Esperanza is Martinas'' soon''s girlfriend against her will, and they have a stormy relationship because José Antonio is also in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bv44ta8rLnF6zcKVrlEpoWNUn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103886'),
  ('101105199842431650', 'Camion', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rafaël Ouellet, Geneviève Perron', 'Rafaël Ouellet', 'Julien Poulin, Patrice Dubois, Maude Giguère, Jacob Tierney, Stéphane Breton, Noémie Godin-Vigneau, Cindy Sampson, Viviane Audet', null, 'Truck driving is all sixty-year-old widower Germain has ever known. When he is involved in a head-on collision that leaves a woman dead, his quiet life is suddenly thrown into a tailspin.', 'Truck driving is all sixty-year-old widower Germain has ever known. When he is involved in a head-on collision that leaves a woman dead, his quiet life is suddenly thrown into a tailspin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AzKejd7lyc0O1YskeLgS3ute1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127874'),
  ('892752792690555889', 'Camorra (A Story of Streets, Women and Crime)', 1986, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lina Wertmüller, Giuseppe Lanci, Alessandro Valori', 'Elvio Porta, Lina Wertmüller', 'Ángela Molina, Harvey Keitel, Isa Danieli, Paolo Bonacelli, Elvio Porta, Vittorio Squillante, Muzzi Loffredo, Mario Scarpetta', 'R', 'After Annunziata (Angela Molina) opens up a hostel with her friend Antonio (Daniel Ezralow), she is saved from being raped by a Camorra boss as the gangster is suddenly killed. The killer escapes before Annunziata is able to see who it was. Following this murder are several others, and always with the same “signature” — a syringe in one of the testicles of the victims. As the gangsters continue to be killed off, the identity of the killer – or killers – slowly becomes obvious.', 'After Annunziata (Angela Molina) opens up a hostel with her friend Antonio (Daniel Ezralow), she is saved from being raped by a Camorra boss as the gangster is suddenly killed. The killer escapes before Annunziata is able to see who it was. Following this murder are several others, and always with the same “signature” — a syringe in one of the testicles of the victims. As the gangsters continue to be killed off, the identity of the killer – or killers – slowly becomes obvious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE5Z3uJd12lEBBiQuypN3HuGL3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97755'),
  ('453702309291686597', 'Camouflage', 1977, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Edward Kłosiński, Witold Holtz', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Piotr Garlicki, Zbigniew Zapasiewicz, Christine Paul-Podlasky, Mariusz Dmochowski, Wojciech Alaborski, Mieczysław Banasik, Krystyna Bigelmajer, Jadwiga Colonna-Walewska', null, 'A moral conflict between a young assistant and an associate professor arises during a university linguistics camp.', 'A moral conflict between a young assistant and an associate professor arises during a university linguistics camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgIojJb5DbLZWCkgbhKsFKAXg0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139467'),
  ('547391798017901817', 'Camouflage', 2001, 'Action, Comedy', 'James Keach, Pete Whyte, Carwyn Jones', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Tom Epperson', 'Leslie Nielsen, Lochlyn Munro, Vanessa Angel, William Forsythe, Patrick Warburton, Tom Aldredge, Frank Collison, Suzanne Krull', 'R', 'Marty Mackenzie is an unsuccessful stage actor who takes an interest in private investigating. He takes a job working with Jack Potter, a crusty private eye. They both take a case in Beaver Ridge, a seedy small town where a murder is being planned against a rich gravel pit owner. Marty realizes that private investigating is not as it seemed to be.', 'Marty Mackenzie is an unsuccessful stage actor who takes an interest in private investigating. He takes a job working with Jack Potter, a crusty private eye. They both take a case in Beaver Ridge, a seedy small town where a murder is being planned against a rich gravel pit owner. Marty realizes that private investigating is not as it seemed to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngubWu6cemohJlPKKEvBRtsRzed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56085'),
  ('359503774677316246', 'Camp', 2003, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Todd Graff, Kip Bogdahn', 'Todd Graff', 'Daniel Letterle, Joanna Chilcoat, Robin de Jesús, Tiffany Taylor, Alana Allen, Anna Kendrick, Sasha Allen, Steven Cutts', 'PG-13', 'Misfits in their lives back home, a group of young people live it up at musical-theater camp. While the sports counselor is completely ignored, the kids'' spend all their time in rehearsal for a grueling schedule that involves a new show every two weeks. Several personal stories come to the fore.', 'Misfits in their lives back home, a group of young people live it up at musical-theater camp. While the sports counselor is completely ignored, the kids'' spend all their time in rehearsal for a grueling schedule that involves a new show every two weeks. Several personal stories come to the fore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aOOZisCXvI26i7wgMqBaWQxTY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33339'),
  ('960658008726782829', 'Camp Belvidere', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Astrid Ovalles, Oriana Oppice', 'Astrid Ovalles', 'Astrid Ovalles, Molly Way, Stacee Mandeville, Spencer Rhys Hughes', null, 'Camp Belvidere is a lesbian romance set in the 1950s about the coming of age of Camp Leader Rose and her forbidden encounter with Nurse Gin. It depicts the journey and evolution of a friendship into a romance between two women when their rapport would have been unlikely.', 'Camp Belvidere is a lesbian romance set in the 1950s about the coming of age of Camp Leader Rose and her forbidden encounter with Nurse Gin. It depicts the journey and evolution of a friendship into a romance between two women when their rapport would have been unlikely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f14T6KRs234UtPxDqQKNS9CYMRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325592'),
  ('95671330892349596', 'Camp Blood', 2000, 'Horror', 'Brad Sykes, Jeff Leroy', 'Brad Sykes', 'Jennifer Ritchkoff, Michael Taylor, Ron Ford, Tim Young, Betheny Zolt, Vinnie Bilancio, Joseph Haggerty, Courtney Taylor', null, 'Ten years ago a series of brutal murders rocked peaceful, isolated Camp Blackwood. The killer was never caught and the camp, renamed "Camp Blood" by the locals, was never reopened.Ignorant of the camp''s terrible history, two young couples visit Camp Blood. And they soon realise they are not alone. Someone is watching. Someone is waiting. The murders are far from over... they have only just begun.What began as a pleasant hiking trip turns into a savage struggle for survival. Will anyone make it out of Camp Blood alive?', 'Ten years ago a series of brutal murders rocked peaceful, isolated Camp Blackwood. The killer was never caught and the camp, renamed "Camp Blood" by the locals, was never reopened.Ignorant of the camp''s terrible history, two young couples visit Camp Blood. And they soon realise they are not alone. Someone is watching. Someone is waiting. The murders are far from over... they have only just begun.What began as a pleasant hiking trip turns into a savage struggle for survival. Will anyone make it out of Camp Blood alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGYGjhYfYnPtfZyr38PqicovLta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27734'),
  ('163315691165001298', 'Camp Blood 2', 2000, 'Horror', 'Brad Sykes, Jeff Leroy', 'Brad Sykes', 'Jennifer Ritchkoff, Garrett Clancy, Brannon Gould, Natascha Corrigan, Patrick Thomas, Missy Rae Hansen, Ken X, Lisa Marie Bolick', null, 'Smarmy opportunist filmmaker Worthy Milligan convinces traumatized sole survivor Tricia to work as a technical advisor on a film he''s making about the horrific events that occurred at Camp Blood. The cast and crew return to the remote woodland area to shoot the picture. Of course, the murderous machete-wielding Clown also shows up to commit more brutal killings.', 'Smarmy opportunist filmmaker Worthy Milligan convinces traumatized sole survivor Tricia to work as a technical advisor on a film he''s making about the horrific events that occurred at Camp Blood. The cast and crew return to the remote woodland area to shoot the picture. Of course, the murderous machete-wielding Clown also shows up to commit more brutal killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hADfrhUKfLTnlFMDBHQJzfvYwHi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27736'),
  ('770769528825180675', 'Camp Confidential: America''s Secret Nazis', 2021, 'Documentary, Animation, History', 'Daniel Sivan, Mor Loushy', null, 'Arno Mayer, Peter Wiess, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Adolf Hitler', 'PG-13', 'Camp Confidential: America''s Secret Nazis, is a documentary short featuring animation that focuses on the story of a top secret POW camp that was classified for over 5 decades. In the midst of WWII, a group of young Jewish refugees are assigned to guard a top secret POW camp near Washington D.C. The Jewish soldiers soon discover that their prisoners are no other than Hitler''s top scientists - What starts out as an intelligence mission to gather information from the Nazis, soon gets a shocking twist when the Jewish soldiers are tasked with a very different mission altogether. A mission that would question their moral values - exposing a dark secret from America''s past.', 'Camp Confidential: America''s Secret Nazis, is a documentary short featuring animation that focuses on the story of a top secret POW camp that was classified for over 5 decades. In the midst of WWII, a group of young Jewish refugees are assigned to guard a top secret POW camp near Washington D.C. The Jewish soldiers soon discover that their prisoners are no other than Hitler''s top scientists - What starts out as an intelligence mission to gather information from the Nazis, soon gets a shocking twist when the Jewish soldiers are tasked with a very different mission altogether. A mission that would question their moral values - exposing a dark secret from America''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ4JUvORj4SRflrhE6qy8e6qHGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888910'),
  ('425309634710833985', 'Camp Crasher', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martino Zaidelis, Lucio Bonelli', 'Andrés Gelós, Andres Pascaner, Martino Zaidelis', 'Natalia Oreiro, Milo Zeus Lis, Pablo Rago, Dalia Gutmann, Sofía Morandi, Sebastián Arzeno, Paula Baldini, Mora Starosta', 'PG-13', 'In a bid to save her son''s end-of-school camping trip, a single mom steps in as the bus driver while trying to show him she really can be a cool mom.', 'In a bid to save her son''s end-of-school camping trip, a single mom steps in as the bus driver while trying to show him she really can be a cool mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsLTwYtpi7CtkA8ONH3CuYnjAXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191611'),
  ('168270230882339111', 'Camp Cucamonga', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Roger Duchowny, Peter Smokler', 'Bennett Tramer', 'John Ratzenberger, Chad Allen, Jennifer Aniston, Candace Cameron Bure, Richard Herd, Dorothy Lyman, Danica McKellar, Breckin Meyer', 'PG', 'Standard camp shenanigans and romance amongst the counselors and the campers at a lake front summer camp.', 'Standard camp shenanigans and romance amongst the counselors and the campers at a lake front summer camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhPLBTZgWwDIMW0vj3tybRdgnwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49497'),
  ('415828784721294110', 'Camp de Thiaroye', 1988, 'War, Drama', 'Ousmane Sembène, Thierno Faty Sow, Smaïl Lakhdar-Hamina', 'Ousmane Sembène, Thierno Faty Sow', 'Sidiki Bakaba, Hamed Camara, Philippe Chamelat, Moussa Cissoko, Marthe Mercadier, Ismaila Cissé, Ababacar Sy Cissé, Eloi Coly', null, 'A Senegalese platoon of soldiers from the French Free Army are returned from combat in France and held for a temporary time in a military encampment with barbed wire fences and guard towers in the desert. Among their numbers are Sergeant Diatta, the charismatic leader of the troop who was educated in Paris and has a French wife and child, and Pays, a Senegalese soldier left in a state of shock from the war and concentration camps and who can only speak in guttural screams and grunts.', 'A Senegalese platoon of soldiers from the French Free Army are returned from combat in France and held for a temporary time in a military encampment with barbed wire fences and guard towers in the desert. Among their numbers are Sergeant Diatta, the charismatic leader of the troop who was educated in Paris and has a French wife and child, and Pays, a Senegalese soldier left in a state of shock from the war and concentration camps and who can only speak in guttural screams and grunts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKfFcrlQCTKaB6KU5VuJVt0yBc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103203'),
  ('1027567360180944145', 'Camp Dog', 1950, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', null, 'Two coyotes (father and son) smell food. They arrive in a campsite just in time to see the owner (presumably Mickey) heading downriver in a boat. The food is secured up in a tree, and Pluto, though sleeping, is standing guard. The father sets to work on getting the food down, but junior keeps dragging Pluto out for his dinner. Dad knows that Pluto is nothing but trouble, and keeps putting him back in the tent. They eventually get the food down, between run-ins with Pluto, and are preparing to feast when Pluto runs them off and the owner returns. Pluto realizes that, without the coyotes, he''s going to get blamed, and goes off to join his former foes', 'Two coyotes (father and son) smell food. They arrive in a campsite just in time to see the owner (presumably Mickey) heading downriver in a boat. The food is secured up in a tree, and Pluto, though sleeping, is standing guard. The father sets to work on getting the food down, but junior keeps dragging Pluto out for his dinner. Dad knows that Pluto is nothing but trouble, and keeps putting him back in the tent. They eventually get the food down, between run-ins with Pluto, and are preparing to feast when Pluto runs them off and the owner returns. Pluto realizes that, without the coyotes, he''s going to get blamed, and goes off to join his former foes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2d3c1V5GdaJD6htY0Kc2ZqjSxvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164931'),
  ('737285816948393903', 'Camp Fear', 1991, 'Horror, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Thomas Edward Keith, Gary Graver, Jack Beckett', 'Thomas Edward Keith', 'Vincent Van Patten, Betsy Russell, Peggy McIntaggart, Mike Diamant, Jim Elk, George Buck Flower, David Homb, Jim Kratt', 'R', 'Some sorority sisters opt for camping in the woods with a handsome professor instead of going to Palm Springs for spring break. However, the orgy is interrupted when some druids appear and decide they need to sacrifice the sisters to prevent the apocalypse at the start of the new millennium.', 'Some sorority sisters opt for camping in the woods with a handsome professor instead of going to Palm Springs for spring break. However, the orgy is interrupted when some druids appear and decide they need to sacrifice the sisters to prevent the apocalypse at the start of the new millennium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EGKaYrNBsiUkHcGSSpnD9pfiEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27654'),
  ('425344156523957007', 'Camp Hell', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'George VanBuskirk', 'George VanBuskirk', 'Will Denton, Bruce Davison, Christopher Denham, Connor Paolo, Valentina de Angelis, Spencer Treat Clark, Dana Delany, Andrew McCarthy', 'R', 'At the end of every summer, the children of a Christian community from a suburb of New Jersey attend Camp Hope. They travel deep into the woods far from any distractions the world provides. Here, the children are taught the ways of the Lord, the perils of the flesh, and the horror of the Devil. A charismatic priest leads them in their training. But, he unknowingly has brought something with him, something evil. What was supposed to be a safe place, a spiritual retreat has now turned into a nightmare that not even faith can end.', 'At the end of every summer, the children of a Christian community from a suburb of New Jersey attend Camp Hope. They travel deep into the woods far from any distractions the world provides. Here, the children are taught the ways of the Lord, the perils of the flesh, and the horror of the Devil. A charismatic priest leads them in their training. But, he unknowingly has brought something with him, something evil. What was supposed to be a safe place, a spiritual retreat has now turned into a nightmare that not even faith can end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouZMwWVcU4X3H6WSjNAsx96ogR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45778'),
  ('890842482386205201', 'Camp Nowhere', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jonathan Prince, Sandi Sissel', 'Eliot Wald, Andrew Kurtzman', 'Jonathan Jackson, Andrew Keegan, Marnette Patterson, Melody Kay, Christopher Lloyd, M. Emmet Walsh, Wendy Makkena, Kate Mulgrew', 'PG', 'Morris "Mud" Himmel has a problem. His parents desperately want to send him away to summer camp. He hates going to summer camp, and would do anything to get out of it. Talking to his friends, he realizes that they are all facing the same sentence: a boring summer camp. Together with his friends, he hatches a plan to trick all the parents into sending them to a camp of their own design.', 'Morris "Mud" Himmel has a problem. His parents desperately want to send him away to summer camp. He hates going to summer camp, and would do anything to get out of it. Talking to his friends, he realizes that they are all facing the same sentence: a boring summer camp. Together with his friends, he hatches a plan to trick all the parents into sending them to a camp of their own design.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DmempuEgWyHCu5lMVyICTRgZUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17745'),
  ('1019389791001354117', 'Camp Pikachu', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Eikichi Takahashi, Sayuri Ichiishi', 'Yukiyoshi Ôhashi', 'Ikue Otani, Satomi Korogi, Yumi Touma, Rikako Aikawa, Keiji Fujiwara, Megumi Hayashibara, Inuko Inuyama, Katsuyuki Konishi', 'NR', 'Riding home atop a train, the Pichu Brothers suddenly find themselves knocked off and flying through the air! They hit a Wynaut on their way down, bringing all three of them to the forest where Pikachu, Totodile, and some more friends are playing in a waterfall and building a campfire. When it starts to rain, the group takes shelter in a water mill—but the water mill starts moving! The next morning, the whole group decides to work together to make sure the Pichu Brothers make their train. Will the two be able to make it home safe?', 'Riding home atop a train, the Pichu Brothers suddenly find themselves knocked off and flying through the air! They hit a Wynaut on their way down, bringing all three of them to the forest where Pikachu, Totodile, and some more friends are playing in a waterfall and building a campfire. When it starts to rain, the group takes shelter in a water mill—but the water mill starts moving! The next morning, the whole group decides to work together to make sure the Pichu Brothers make their train. Will the two be able to make it home safe?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jBC6aXXrv73omHwrDoxMKOvWpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211814'),
  ('49010483991438227', 'Camp Pleasant Lake', 2024, 'Horror', 'Thomas Walton', 'Thomas Walton', 'Kelly Lynn Reiter, Jonathan Lipnicki, Leila Almas Rose, James Di Giacomo, Lacey Burdine, William Delesk, Bonnie Aarons, Michael Paré', 'R', 'A couple breathes life into a new camp on an old campsite, connecting them to a chilling past that unravels a 20-year-old mystery involving a missing young girl. As eerie events unfold, they must confront forces tied to a brutal crime.', 'A couple breathes life into a new camp on an old campsite, connecting them to a chilling past that unravels a 20-year-old mystery involving a missing young girl. As eerie events unfold, they must confront forces tied to a brutal crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vO4ok0SkjbTfLCICxx0uMzOBoEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196646'),
  ('1078180776982646489', 'Camp Rock', 2008, 'Music, Comedy, Drama, Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Matthew Diamond, Dean Cundey, Sean Watson', 'Karin Gist, Regina Y. Hicks, Paul Brown', 'Demi Lovato, Joe Jonas, Meaghan Jette Martin, Maria Canals-Barrera, Alyson Stoner, Julie Brown, Daniel Fathers, Anna Maria Perez De Taglé', 'G', 'When Mitchie gets a chance to attend Camp Rock, her life takes an unpredictable twist, and she learns just how important it is to be true to yourself.', 'When Mitchie gets a chance to attend Camp Rock, her life takes an unpredictable twist, and she learns just how important it is to be true to yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IXMqZnwccogptThay3togKIFWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13655'),
  ('83840344272688123', 'Camp Rock 2: The Final Jam', 2010, 'Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Paul Hoen, Andrew Shea, Sarah Campbell', 'Dan Berendsen, Regina Y. Hicks, Karin Gist', 'Demi Lovato, Joe Jonas, Nick Jonas, Kevin Jonas, Daniel Fathers, Daniel Kash, Maria Canals-Barrera, Chloe Bridges', 'PG', 'Mitchie can''t wait to go back to Camp Rock and spend the summer making new music with her friends and superstar Shane Gray. But the slick new camp across the lake, Camp Star, has drummed up some serious competition – featuring newcomers Luke and Dana. In a sensational battle of the bands, with Camp Rock''s future at stake, will Camp Star''s flashy production and over-the-top antics win out, or will Camp Rockers prove that music, teamwork, and spirit are what truly matter?', 'Mitchie can''t wait to go back to Camp Rock and spend the summer making new music with her friends and superstar Shane Gray. But the slick new camp across the lake, Camp Star, has drummed up some serious competition – featuring newcomers Luke and Dana. In a sensational battle of the bands, with Camp Rock''s future at stake, will Camp Star''s flashy production and over-the-top antics win out, or will Camp Rockers prove that music, teamwork, and spirit are what truly matter?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RSdWqC259zR72Jjo6ANAM4ndhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44244'),
  ('325124936886014432', 'Camp Takota', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Chris Riedell, Nick Riedell, Sarah M. Gonzalez', 'Michael Goldfine, Lydia Genner, Mamrie Hart', 'Grace Helbig, Hannah Hart, Mamrie Hart, Olivia Alexander, Chester See, Chris Riedell, Ellen Karsten, Rachel Quaintance', null, 'With her personal and professional life in shambles, Elise ends up having to take a job as a counselor at her old summer camp. There, she reunites with two estranged friends who attended camp and never left. When the future of the camp is put in jeopardy, the three friends must band together to save it, changing the course of their lives forever.', 'With her personal and professional life in shambles, Elise ends up having to take a job as a counselor at her old summer camp. There, she reunites with two estranged friends who attended camp and never left. When the future of the camp is put in jeopardy, the three friends must band together to save it, changing the course of their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDYjufoRoksf486uQM0oIjuSMA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251227'),
  ('1025607447792962240', 'Camp X-Ray', 2014, 'Drama', 'James Laxton, Peter Sattler, Tom Obed', 'Peter Sattler', 'Kristen Stewart, Payman Maadi, Lane Garrison, J. J. Soria, Ser''Darius Blain, Cory Michael Smith, Julia Duffy, John Carroll Lynch', 'R', 'A young woman joins the military to be part of something bigger than herself and her small-town roots. Instead, she ends up as a new guard at Guantanamo Bay, where her mission is far from black and white. Surrounded by hostile jihadists and aggressive squadmates, she strikes up an unusual friendship with one of the detainees.', 'A young woman joins the military to be part of something bigger than herself and her small-town roots. Instead, she ends up as a new guard at Guantanamo Bay, where her mission is far from black and white. Surrounded by hostile jihadists and aggressive squadmates, she strikes up an unusual friendship with one of the detainees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqNzRiaEsfv567Ji9njJofblRBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244506'),
  ('960507143527427469', 'Campamento Flipy', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Rafa Parbus, Iván Gómez, Emilio Pérez', 'Alfredo Díaz, Flipy, Antonio Trashorras', 'Flipy, Carlos Areces, Pablo Carbonell, Ernesto Sevilla, Raúl Cimas, Marta Belmonte, Omar Muñoz, Rosario Pardo', null, 'A boy named Flipy goes to summer camp so that he can be with with his dream girl, Violeta.', 'A boy named Flipy goes to summer camp so that he can be with with his dream girl, Violeta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ctLAIwRmOZ6d24JM97c4scxxNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223820'),
  ('359300293866670516', 'Campbell''s Kingdom', 1957, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward', 'Robin Estridge', 'Dirk Bogarde, Barbara Murray, Michael Craig, Stanley Baker, James Robertson Justice, George Murcell, Robert Brown, Mary Merrall', 'NR', 'Given only six months to live, Englishman Bruce Campbell goes to Canada to claim "Campbell''s Kingdom", the land he inherited from his grandfather. In order to clear his grandfather''s name and prove there is oil on the land, Campbell must face up to a ruthless contractor and work against the clock to find oil before "Campbell''s Kingdom" is flooded by a new power dam.', 'Given only six months to live, Englishman Bruce Campbell goes to Canada to claim "Campbell''s Kingdom", the land he inherited from his grandfather. In order to clear his grandfather''s name and prove there is oil on the land, Campbell must face up to a ruthless contractor and work against the clock to find oil before "Campbell''s Kingdom" is flooded by a new power dam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2T3R7wL410lhMi1L66yB34Wo1WA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75683'),
  ('52610963607208615', 'Campfire Tales', 1991, 'Thriller, Horror', 'William Cooke, Paul Talbot', 'William Cooke, Paul Talbot', 'Gunnar Hansen, Michael R. Smith, Lawrence E. Campbell, Robin Roberts, Tres Holton, Courtney Ballard, Lora Podell, H. Ray York', 'NR', 'A grizzled derelict tells a quartet of horror tales to a trio of young campers.', 'A grizzled derelict tells a quartet of horror tales to a trio of young campers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RXD0v5lNxb7FvSJQKECuN5Vgbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123313'),
  ('265371885764520762', 'Campfire Tales', 1997, 'Horror', 'Matt Cooper, Martin Kunert, David Semel', 'Martin Kunert, Eric Manes, Matt Cooper', 'James Marsden, Jay R. Ferguson, Christine Taylor, Christopher Masterson, Kim Murphy, Ron Livingston, Jennifer MacDonald, Hawthorne James', 'R', 'Anthology of famous, scary urban legends done with a modern twist.', 'Anthology of famous, scary urban legends done with a modern twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcYwgCJioHteh7g0RaZ9Y8sEhvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16315'),
  ('929507776332168789', 'Camping', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente', 'Fabien Onteniente, Philippe Guillard, Franck Dubosc', 'Franck Dubosc, Gérard Lanvin, Mathilde Seigner, Antoine Duléry, Claude Brasseur, Mylène Demongeot, Abbes Zahmani, Ari Vatanen', null, 'Plastic surgeon Michel Saint-Josse is on his way to Spain where he hopes to spend a stress-free holiday in a luxury hotel with his teenage daughter Vanessa. When his car breaks down near a camping, Michel accepts the offer of help from an extrovert gigolo camper named Patrick Chirac. Whilst their car is being repaired, Michel and Vanessa agree to stay in Patrick’s well proportioned tent, not knowing that, thanks to a series of mishaps, it will be their home for several days...', 'Plastic surgeon Michel Saint-Josse is on his way to Spain where he hopes to spend a stress-free holiday in a luxury hotel with his teenage daughter Vanessa. When his car breaks down near a camping, Michel accepts the offer of help from an extrovert gigolo camper named Patrick Chirac. Whilst their car is being repaired, Michel and Vanessa agree to stay in Patrick’s well proportioned tent, not knowing that, thanks to a series of mishaps, it will be their home for several days...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7flI2OwTuWKQdZiWRZ6tw6ijvEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13043'),
  ('275252140945523412', 'Camping 2', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente, Jérôme Robert', null, 'Franck Dubosc, Richard Anconina, Mathilde Seigner, Antoine Duléry, Claude Brasseur, Mylène Demongeot, Christine Citti, Alysson Paradis', null, 'Jean-Pierre Savelli is a forty-something employee of an insurance company in Clermont-Ferrand who finds himself facing a mid-life crisis. When his fiancée Valérie decides to put their relationship on hold, he changes his holiday plans and heads for the Flots Bleus camping site near Arcachon. Jean-Pierre had been hoping for peace and calm. Instead he meets Patrick Chirac and his entourage of inveterate holidaymakers...', 'Jean-Pierre Savelli is a forty-something employee of an insurance company in Clermont-Ferrand who finds himself facing a mid-life crisis. When his fiancée Valérie decides to put their relationship on hold, he changes his holiday plans and heads for the Flots Bleus camping site near Arcachon. Jean-Pierre had been hoping for peace and calm. Instead he meets Patrick Chirac and his entourage of inveterate holidaymakers...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlJdgFdRNVJ37RpTrl97zBT7P7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38277'),
  ('932029275504797612', 'Camping 3', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente, Pierre Gantelmi D''Ille', 'Fabien Onteniente, Franck Dubosc', 'Franck Dubosc, Claude Brasseur, Mylène Demongeot, Antoine Duléry, Gérard Jugnot, Michèle Laroque, Leslie Medina, Louka Meliava', null, 'Like every summer, our friends, the Pics, Jacky and Laurette, Gatineau, recently divorced from Sopie, and Patrick Chirac, ever true to form, get together at the Blue Waves camping grounds. This year, Patrick has decided to try car sharing. Believing that he''ll travel through France alone with Vanessa, he finds himself accompanied by three young Dijon inhabitants: smooth-talking Robert, good-looking Benji and loudmouth José. Of course, after car sharing Patrick is forced to try out bed sharing...', 'Like every summer, our friends, the Pics, Jacky and Laurette, Gatineau, recently divorced from Sopie, and Patrick Chirac, ever true to form, get together at the Blue Waves camping grounds. This year, Patrick has decided to try car sharing. Believing that he''ll travel through France alone with Vanessa, he finds himself accompanied by three young Dijon inhabitants: smooth-talking Robert, good-looking Benji and loudmouth José. Of course, after car sharing Patrick is forced to try out bed sharing...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGeXZ5r8OU70ndcU4IQvDr5CsaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375804'),
  ('97486631599165842', 'Camping à la ferme', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Sinapi, Pierre Aïm', 'Azouz Begag, Jean-Pierre Sinapi, Daniel Tonachella', 'Roschdy Zem, Jean-Noël Cridlig-Veneziano, Rafik Ben Mebarek, Hassan Ouled-Bouarif, Julie Gayet, Michel Yves, Aghmane Ibersiene, Marc Mamadou', null, 'Six jeunes en difficulté de la banlieue parisienne débarquent au fin fond de la campagne française, escortés par leur éducateur. Ils doivent montrer leur bonne volonté en effectuant des travaux d''intérêts généraux décidés par la pétillante juge d''application des peines, qui veut ainsi leur donner une dernière chance. Entre le portable vissé à l''oreille de l''un, le pit-bull de l''autre ou encore les prières musulmanes du troisième, ces adolescents vont bouleverser la vie paisible du petit village.', 'Six jeunes en difficulté de la banlieue parisienne débarquent au fin fond de la campagne française, escortés par leur éducateur. Ils doivent montrer leur bonne volonté en effectuant des travaux d''intérêts généraux décidés par la pétillante juge d''application des peines, qui veut ainsi leur donner une dernière chance. Entre le portable vissé à l''oreille de l''un, le pit-bull de l''autre ou encore les prières musulmanes du troisième, ces adolescents vont bouleverser la vie paisible du petit village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rA1MpQuflaX25AJtOV8mrb4qBjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39190'),
  ('581712913653546327', 'Camping Out', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Marcellite Garner, Melvin J. Gibby, Alyce Ardell', 'NR', 'The gang is sitting around their campsite when a mosquito spoils their fun. And then he gets hundreds of his friends and they really cause trouble. Horace squirts some with molasses, which helps a bit. Everyone retreats to the tent, where they still get stung but can fight back a bit, eventually trapping all the mosquitoes in a pair of bloomers and sending them on their way.', 'The gang is sitting around their campsite when a mosquito spoils their fun. And then he gets hundreds of his friends and they really cause trouble. Horace squirts some with molasses, which helps a bit. Everyone retreats to the tent, where they still get stung but can fight back a bit, eventually trapping all the mosquitoes in a pair of bloomers and sending them on their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eTfa5KtyBv65UYTbWP57I3lQiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174274'),
  ('455046489388174863', 'Camping Village Wife', 2020, null, null, null, 'Yoon Yool, Min Do-yoon', null, 'After a long time, newlywed couple Ju Hee and Han Gi will travel to a remote place, where they will reunite with Ga Young, a woman of the past who Han Gi had completely forgotten about. It''s a vague memory of the past, unlike Han Gi that lets it go and enjoys a vacation with his wife, Ga Young''s temptation grows day by day. As this maddening obsession continues, on the empty campground or better said a human farm, Han Gi couple is suffocating for clothing, food and shelter and Han Gi was tamed by Ga Young and turned into a physical slave.', 'After a long time, newlywed couple Ju Hee and Han Gi will travel to a remote place, where they will reunite with Ga Young, a woman of the past who Han Gi had completely forgotten about. It''s a vague memory of the past, unlike Han Gi that lets it go and enjoys a vacation with his wife, Ga Young''s temptation grows day by day. As this maddening obsession continues, on the empty campground or better said a human farm, Han Gi couple is suffocating for clothing, food and shelter and Han Gi was tamed by Ga Young and turned into a physical slave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7f2fv8cV62BR7SqHus47qI9skfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:918769'),
  ('896514133432159755', 'Campo Grande', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Sandra Kogut', 'Felipe Sholl, Sandra Kogut', 'Carla Ribas, Ygor Manoel, Rayane do Amaral, Julia Bernat, Márcio Vito, Mary Sheila, Dorothy Kogut, Noah Kogut Levin', null, 'A wealthy middle-aged woman unexpectedly finds herself caring for two impoverished young siblings, in this subtle, touching and sincere study of class disparity from Brazilian filmmaker Sandra Kogut.', 'A wealthy middle-aged woman unexpectedly finds herself caring for two impoverished young siblings, in this subtle, touching and sincere study of class disparity from Brazilian filmmaker Sandra Kogut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKMp5I3FtmmcAhjr7kofIiFWUqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356202'),
  ('424163606532708900', 'Campus Confidential', 2005, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Amy Vincent, Michael Applebaum, Melanie Mayron', 'Matt Roshkow, David Kukoff', 'Keri Lynn Pratt, Christy Carlson Romano, Katey Sagal, Teddy Dunn, Thomas Dekker, Drew Seeley, Gavyn Michaels, Brandon Baker', null, 'School... there is the popular crowd. Teachers favor some students over others. Because of this, Violet decides to start a school paper, which exposes many embarrassing secrets of popular kids who think they run the campus.', 'School... there is the popular crowd. Teachers favor some students over others. Because of this, Violet decides to start a school paper, which exposes many embarrassing secrets of popular kids who think they run the campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqyK1j0gjrtbYlUO8c2CDCZ2snd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77026'),
  ('38641198979874678', 'Campus Confidential', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Donnie Lai, Ming Wang, Kwok Man-Ki', 'Carol Li', 'Ivy Chen, Chen Bolin, Shu-yao Kuo, Paul Chiang, Chang Pen-Yu, Jean Wang Ching-Ying, Ariel Ann, Ada Pan', null, 'The campus geek rescues the most attractive campus girl from a dried lake after she falls in. Legend has it if two people meet at the lake when it''s dry, they are destined to fall in love.', 'The campus geek rescues the most attractive campus girl from a dried lake after she falls in. Legend has it if two people meet at the lake when it''s dry, they are destined to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY3rH4SfW5shutMCz01NvTTF4IS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268066'),
  ('563813275036504594', 'Campus Pussycats', 1973, 'Drama', 'Ernst Hofbauer, Klaus Werner', 'Günther Hunold', 'Puppa Armbruster, Gerd Arnau, Ini Assmann, Reiner Brönneke, Ulrike Butz, Shirley Corrigan, Britt Corvin, Sven Dolan', null, 'After two students are caught doing “extra-curricular” activities in an abandoned school classroom, they plead their case to the student council. To the headmaster’s surprise, the teen lovers expose what’s really going on in their school behind closed doors....', 'After two students are caught doing “extra-curricular” activities in an abandoned school classroom, they plead their case to the student council. To the headmaster’s surprise, the teen lovers expose what’s really going on in their school behind closed doors....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR9BbfSbFHRHPSx3Vdf2Uzagloi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40971'),
  ('569790961632659205', 'Campus Swingers', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Klaus Werner, Peter Schöler, Ernst Hofbauer', 'Kurt Seelmann, Günther Hunold', 'Puppa Armbruster, Marina Blümel, Christina Lindberg, Ulrike Butz, Walter Feuchtenberg, Claudia Fielers, Rainer Fischer, Monica Fleischer', null, 'A fake documentary about the sex lives of teenage girls.', 'A fake documentary about the sex lives of teenage girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lK8r4h7s35y7VDSpIWMV0GK6FNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36886'),
  ('145362758263330652', 'Campus Teasers', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Walter Boos, Werner Kurz', 'Günther Hunold', 'Eva Berthold, Alexandra Bogojevic, Astrid Boner, Reiner Brönneke, Siggi Buchner, Marianne Dupont, Walter Feuchtenberg, Heinz Gerstl', null, 'Seven more first-hand accounts of sexual awakening amongst school girls in the early Seventies.', 'Seven more first-hand accounts of sexual awakening amongst school girls in the early Seventies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sDhsbGIXsMOGQUmFoPljuGAAN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70634'),
  ('679191882656287699', 'camrip', 2022, null, 'Thohoyandou Toh', 'Thohoyandou Toh', 'Thohoyandou Toh', null, 'A video essay about camrip created by a Macau''s indie-film maker called Thohoyandou Toh (aka Toh Lap-Yu). When the director helped run the private torrent servers for movies in the early years, he saved some camrips for commercial blockbusters. The camrip is a kind of video file that is ignored and despised by people. In Toh''s first video essay, he tried to explore the various meanings of the camrip in the operation of film propaganda, capital circulation, network circulation, and version comparison.', 'A video essay about camrip created by a Macau''s indie-film maker called Thohoyandou Toh (aka Toh Lap-Yu). When the director helped run the private torrent servers for movies in the early years, he saved some camrips for commercial blockbusters. The camrip is a kind of video file that is ignored and despised by people. In Toh''s first video essay, he tried to explore the various meanings of the camrip in the operation of film propaganda, capital circulation, network circulation, and version comparison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXu8mPdZ8VY30jJMPIYvWbxdodG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1055432'),
  ('592413423536781525', 'Camus', 2010, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Laurent Jaoui', 'Quentin Raspail, Olivier Todd, Laurent Jaoui', 'Stéphane Freiss, Anouk Grinberg, Agathe Dronne, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Florie Auclerc-Vialens, Juliette Pioli, Augustin Lepinay, Chantal Mutel', null, 'A romantic, a scoundrel, a private man .... The touching and absurd story of the philosopher Albert Camus as seen through the eyes of the many women in his life.', 'A romantic, a scoundrel, a private man .... The touching and absurd story of the philosopher Albert Camus as seen through the eyes of the many women in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Up7pC3aeRbD9VMv8hVCkE56cGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264577'),
  ('324590223768731393', 'Can', 2012, 'Drama', 'Raşit Çelikezer', null, 'Selen Uçer, Serdar Orçin, Berkan Demirbağ, Erkan Avcı, Erdal Cindoruk, Cengiz Bozkurt, İdil Yener, Zeynep Yalçın', null, 'Loving Istanbul couple Ayşe and Cemal need only a child to complete their life together, but they cannot conceive. To salvage Cemal’s pride, they resort to illegal means to procure a baby. This wild grab at a more perfect life proves their undoing, leading the couple to spiral toward separate futures. The couple''s estrangement is intertwined with the film’s parallel narrative, in which a distant and neglectful single mom is raising her little boy, Can.', 'Loving Istanbul couple Ayşe and Cemal need only a child to complete their life together, but they cannot conceive. To salvage Cemal’s pride, they resort to illegal means to procure a baby. This wild grab at a more perfect life proves their undoing, leading the couple to spiral toward separate futures. The couple''s estrangement is intertwined with the film’s parallel narrative, in which a distant and neglectful single mom is raising her little boy, Can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAiSsBLIXZWNx8i5rDzknbWftzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84182'),
