  ('147959472873936915', 'Can Tunis', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Paco Toledo, José González Morandi', 'Antonio Ojeda, José González Morandi, Paco Toledo', null, null, 'Year 2002. In a neighborhood of Barcelona, residents demonstrate against the expropriation of their homes. Since the 80s, this neighborhood in ruins is the main drug market in the city. Juan lives there with his father, eight brothers and about twenty nephews. Surrounded by addicts, Juan output grows hoping his mother from prison. The neighborhood will be demolished, and the family will have to find another home.', 'Year 2002. In a neighborhood of Barcelona, residents demonstrate against the expropriation of their homes. Since the 80s, this neighborhood in ruins is the main drug market in the city. Juan lives there with his father, eight brothers and about twenty nephews. Surrounded by addicts, Juan output grows hoping his mother from prison. The neighborhood will be demolished, and the family will have to find another home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS3XWhDTZTBXDPiq5hpJQljeQTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129005'),
  ('823838194421618047', 'Can We Still Be Friends?', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chad Angelic Cabigon, Prime Cruz, Tey Clamor', 'Jenilee Chuansu', 'Gerald Anderson, Arci Muñoz, Bryan Santos, Brian Sy, Juan Miguel Severo, Erika Padilla, Ria Atayde, Emmanuelle Vera', null, 'Digs a no fuss, no frills kind of guy and idealistic achiever Sam who are friends turned lovers turned exes. Their relationship as a couple lasted for almost eight years until they both decided on an amicable breakup.', 'Digs a no fuss, no frills kind of guy and idealistic achiever Sam who are friends turned lovers turned exes. Their relationship as a couple lasted for almost eight years until they both decided on an amicable breakup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUlMsLiL1iUvqE8YYwog0KPz6sV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461438'),
