  ('1065023449623919257', 'Can You Keep a Secret?', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Autumn Eakin, Elise Durán, David Ketterer', 'Peter Hutchings', 'Alexandra Daddario, Tyler Hoechlin, Sunita Mani, David Ebert, Kate Easton, Robert King, James Lipsius, Laverne Cox', null, 'Emma Corrigan, a girl with a few secrets, thinks she’s about to die on a turbulent plane ride. She spills them all to the handsome stranger sitting next to her. At least, she thought he was a stranger. But then, her company’s young and elusive CEO, arrives at the office. It’s him. And he knows every single humiliating detail about her.', 'Emma Corrigan, a girl with a few secrets, thinks she’s about to die on a turbulent plane ride. She spills them all to the handsome stranger sitting next to her. At least, she thought he was a stranger. But then, her company’s young and elusive CEO, arrives at the office. It’s him. And he knows every single humiliating detail about her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNWk5HZfVBHpARcV1z9cwUAbtpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537739'),
  ('644758249030436948', 'Can You Keep It Up for a Week?', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Jim Atkinson', null, 'Jeremy Bulloch, Neil Hallett, Jill Damas, Joy Harrington, Maria Coyne, Lynne Ross, Valerie Phillips, Frances Bennett', null, 'Accident-prone Gil wants a steady job but is dismissed by every company that recruits him due to his unfortunate habit of ending up in sexually embarrassing situations. His girlfriend Annette says that she will marry him only if he can stay employed for at least a week. Hired by Mr Grimwood''s cleaning company "Here To Service You", Gil is unwittingly drawn into a series of bawdy misadventures: sharing a bath with a married woman and getting caught by her husband; having a threesome with a hospital patient and a woman doctor, followed by a foursome with Annette, Grimwood and a woman psychologist; awkward encounters with a gay man and a lesbian; and getting caught by Annette playing strip poker with a group of women. Incredibly, Gil remains in his job and Annette marries him, but before the couple can have their wedding night Gil collapses on the bed and passes out from exhaustion.', 'Accident-prone Gil wants a steady job but is dismissed by every company that recruits him due to his unfortunate habit of ending up in sexually embarrassing situations. His girlfriend Annette says that she will marry him only if he can stay employed for at least a week. Hired by Mr Grimwood''s cleaning company "Here To Service You", Gil is unwittingly drawn into a series of bawdy misadventures: sharing a bath with a married woman and getting caught by her husband; having a threesome with a hospital patient and a woman doctor, followed by a foursome with Annette, Grimwood and a woman psychologist; awkward encounters with a gay man and a lesbian; and getting caught by Annette playing strip poker with a group of women. Incredibly, Gil remains in his job and Annette marries him, but before the couple can have their wedding night Gil collapses on the bed and passes out from exhaustion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZMXmMhR5bqlKa2mJLAh3CJcb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162104'),
  ('997548889860794689', 'Can-Can', 1960, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Joseph E. Rickards, Walter Lang, William H. Daniels', 'Dorothy Kingsley, Charles Lederer', 'Frank Sinatra, Shirley MacLaine, Maurice Chevalier, Louis Jourdan, Juliet Prowse, Marcel Dalio, Leon Belasco, Nestor Paiva', 'NR', 'A Parisian nightclub owner known for her performances of the can-can attracts the ire of a self-righteous judge. He hatches a plot to photograph her in the act but ends up falling for her — much to the chagrin of her lawyer boyfriend.', 'A Parisian nightclub owner known for her performances of the can-can attracts the ire of a self-righteous judge. He hatches a plot to photograph her in the act but ends up falling for her — much to the chagrin of her lawyer boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlYe13PUACR5QEvCwnHxnjiV78F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33726'),
  ('108909822187847320', 'Can''t Buy Me Love', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jerram A. Swartz, Warren Glen Chidester, Steve Rash', 'Michael Swerdlick', 'Patrick Dempsey, Amanda Peterson, Courtney Gains, Tina Caspary, Seth Green, Sharon Farrell, Dennis Dugan, Darcy DeMoss', 'PG-13', 'Nerdy high schooler Ronald Miller rescues cheerleader Cindy Mancini from parental punishment after she accidentally destroys her mother''s designer clothes. Ronald agrees to pay for the $1,000 outfit on one condition: that she will act as though they''re a couple for an entire month. As the days pass, however, Cindy grows fond of Ronald, making him popular. But when Ronald''s former best friend gets left behind, he realizes that social success isn''t everything.', 'Nerdy high schooler Ronald Miller rescues cheerleader Cindy Mancini from parental punishment after she accidentally destroys her mother''s designer clothes. Ronald agrees to pay for the $1,000 outfit on one condition: that she will act as though they''re a couple for an entire month. As the days pass, however, Cindy grows fond of Ronald, making him popular. But when Ronald''s former best friend gets left behind, he realizes that social success isn''t everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qK3yiqo84U3twOOKOx81c407Hpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12919'),
  ('819776498015605289', 'Can''t Buy My Love', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Farhad Mann, James W. Wrenn', 'Cara J. Russell', 'Adelaide Kane, Benjamin Hollingsworth, James Remar, Jean Louisa Kelly, Rodrigo Rojas, Andrea Bordeaux, Lamon Archey, Alesha Renee', 'G', 'Lilly, a hard working EMT, is only focused on her job and getting into medical school. So when wealthy slacker Jeff enters her life it throws her off course. At first, Lilly wants nothing to do with Jeff or his sense of entitlement and lack of direction. As she spends more time with him, she starts to realize that you can’t always judge a book by its cover.', 'Lilly, a hard working EMT, is only focused on her job and getting into medical school. So when wealthy slacker Jeff enters her life it throws her off course. At first, Lilly wants nothing to do with Jeff or his sense of entitlement and lack of direction. As she spends more time with him, she starts to realize that you can’t always judge a book by its cover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS5sUhDvNp7EJXuYLvI8SKQ0eWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445126'),
