  ('658331301907552917', 'Canavar Gibi', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Özgür Bakar', 'Alper Kıvılcım, Özgür Bakar, Suat Özkan', 'Şevket Çoruh, Ruhi Sarı, Bülent Çolak, Ayçin İnci, Uğur Serhan, Hüseyin Elmalıpınar, Nazlı Tosunoğlu, Tolga Yüce', null, 'Gurbuz, a crook in Istanbul''s Balat district attempts to defraud a mob leader nicknamed Yellow Kenan and his men and gets killed. But he’s going to be resurrected like Frankenstein, one of the most popular horror figures in horror movies.', 'Gurbuz, a crook in Istanbul''s Balat district attempts to defraud a mob leader nicknamed Yellow Kenan and his men and gets killed. But he’s going to be resurrected like Frankenstein, one of the most popular horror figures in horror movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnWbwMxNuNIi5NWLO55DY23lhJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528305'),
