  ('1048921131977887540', 'Cándida', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillermo Fesser', 'Guillermo Fesser', 'Cándida Villar, Fernando Ransanz, Raúl Peña, Víctor Monigote, Pedro Ruy-Blas, María Elena Fesser, Maxi Márquez, Jorge Bosch', null, 'Cándida is an lowly maid in Madrid, where she scrapes to get by and help her two useless sons, a junkie and a basket case. As her family situation goes from bad to worse, her travails inspire other people', 'Cándida is an lowly maid in Madrid, where she scrapes to get by and help her two useless sons, a junkie and a basket case. As her family situation goes from bad to worse, her travails inspire other people', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MU5VhW9pufkXTRH5995ZGWXbAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44007'),
  ('474474869282830656', 'Candide or The Optimism in the 20th Century', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Norbert Carbonnaux, Robert Lefebvre, Georges Pellegrin', null, 'Jean-Pierre Cassel, Daliah Lavi, Pierre Brasseur, Louis de Funès, Michel Simon, Jean Poiret, Michel Serrault, Jean Tissier', null, 'Charming and innocent, Candide is vigorously chased away by the Baron, for his close encounters with the pretty Cunégonde. World War II breaks out, and when he is drafted and taken prisoner, he is forced to take German nationality and ends up guarding the camp where he was imprisoned. He crossed into Switzerland, but as he had no bank account, he was incarcerated for eight days for trespassing. Hunted by the Gestapo, he kills two men to free Cunégonde, who has finally been found. They both flee to Argentina, and their world tour begins. In Paris, Moscow, New York, Borneo and Alexandria. They try to follow Dr. Pangloss'' optimistic rule of life. Tossed about, separated, they find themselves grown old and wiser, thinking only of cultivating their garden on the shores of the Mediterranean.', 'Charming and innocent, Candide is vigorously chased away by the Baron, for his close encounters with the pretty Cunégonde. World War II breaks out, and when he is drafted and taken prisoner, he is forced to take German nationality and ends up guarding the camp where he was imprisoned. He crossed into Switzerland, but as he had no bank account, he was incarcerated for eight days for trespassing. Hunted by the Gestapo, he kills two men to free Cunégonde, who has finally been found. They both flee to Argentina, and their world tour begins. In Paris, Moscow, New York, Borneo and Alexandria. They try to follow Dr. Pangloss'' optimistic rule of life. Tossed about, separated, they find themselves grown old and wiser, thinking only of cultivating their garden on the shores of the Mediterranean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1goGkJWvLud0XkTHRVrgz8tx0gt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140681'),
  ('324993163575875506', 'Candle in the Tomb: The Worm Valley', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Dai Yilin', 'Zhang Muye', 'Luo Liqun, Zhang Weiwei, Hu Xue''er, Song Jiateng, Ti Aimin, He Qiwei, Shang Na, Dai Yilin', null, 'Adapted from the 3rd volume in the novel series "Candle in the Tomb" by Zhang Mu Ye. Hu Bayi, Wang Kaixuan, and Shiely Yang, infected with a curse, embark on a journey to King Xian''s tomb to retrieve the Haochen Bead and break the curse. They face ancient organs, ghostly visions, explosive bugs, and a massive salamander.', 'Adapted from the 3rd volume in the novel series "Candle in the Tomb" by Zhang Mu Ye. Hu Bayi, Wang Kaixuan, and Shiely Yang, infected with a curse, embark on a journey to King Xian''s tomb to retrieve the Haochen Bead and break the curse. They face ancient organs, ghostly visions, explosive bugs, and a massive salamander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Hk1qxAvZi9H9cfBb4iHkoGjapH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181039'),
  ('1082199443956872540', 'Candlelight in Algeria', 1944, 'Drama, War', 'George King, Otto Heller', 'Katherine Strueby, Brock Williams', 'James Mason, Carla Lehmann, Raymond Lovell, Enid Stamp-Taylor, Walter Rilla, Pamela Stirling, Lea Seidl, Sybille Binder', 'NR', 'Candlelight in Algeria is a 1944 British war film directed by George King and starring James Mason, Carla Lehmann and Raymond Lovell. This drama follows the exploits of Eisenhower''s top aide, Mark Clark, and other important Allies as they journey to an important meeting held on Algeria''s coast. The precise location of this vital secret gathering is upon a piece of film which must not fall into enemy hands', 'Candlelight in Algeria is a 1944 British war film directed by George King and starring James Mason, Carla Lehmann and Raymond Lovell. This drama follows the exploits of Eisenhower''s top aide, Mark Clark, and other important Allies as they journey to an important meeting held on Algeria''s coast. The precise location of this vital secret gathering is upon a piece of film which must not fall into enemy hands', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xquwW2DTM6XSOAeu2Bd4NL61fYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204711'),
  ('348256291614080319', 'Candles on Bay Street', 2006, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'John Erman, Tony Imi', null, 'Alicia Silverstone, Eion Bailey, Polly Bergen, Matthew Knight, James Rebhorn, Annabeth Gish, Jonathan Potts, Martha Irving', null, 'DeeDee returns to her hometown with her 11 year old son, Trooper, 13 years after she ran off with her boyfriend. Her childhood best friend, Sam, is now married and he and his wife, Lydia, are the town''s veterinarians. Lydia is a little wary about DeeDee after Sam tells her that they were best friends growing up and DeeDee was his first crush. But DeeDee and Trooper find their way into many hearts of the townspeople with their sweet helpfulness and friendships. DeeDee sets up a candle making business in town square and invites many of the ladies of the town to weekly candle making parties, and through these parties she and Lydia become good friends. One evening after dinner with Lydia and Sam, DeeDee tells Sam she''s very sick and she doesn''t have much longer to live and she needs his help to find a good family in town to adopt Trooper. Sam later tells Lydia everything and they decide to adopt Trooper themselves if/when something happens to DeeDee.', 'DeeDee returns to her hometown with her 11 year old son, Trooper, 13 years after she ran off with her boyfriend. Her childhood best friend, Sam, is now married and he and his wife, Lydia, are the town''s veterinarians. Lydia is a little wary about DeeDee after Sam tells her that they were best friends growing up and DeeDee was his first crush. But DeeDee and Trooper find their way into many hearts of the townspeople with their sweet helpfulness and friendships. DeeDee sets up a candle making business in town square and invites many of the ladies of the town to weekly candle making parties, and through these parties she and Lydia become good friends. One evening after dinner with Lydia and Sam, DeeDee tells Sam she''s very sick and she doesn''t have much longer to live and she needs his help to find a good family in town to adopt Trooper. Sam later tells Lydia everything and they decide to adopt Trooper themselves if/when something happens to DeeDee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hVLkIo03gG1FERwcdTQcIJH7Am.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52311'),
  ('438131986829705768', 'Candleshoe', 1977, 'Family', 'Norman Tokar, Paul Beeson, Anthony Squire', 'David Swift, Rosemary Anne Sisson', 'David Niven, Helen Hayes, Jodie Foster, Leo McKern, Veronica Quilligan, Ian Sharrock, Sarah Tamakuni, David Samuels', 'G', 'When ex-con artist Harry claims that a secret treasure is hidden inside Candleshoe, an English estate, he creates an elaborate plan to find and steal the prize. By convincing a girl named Casey to impersonate the estate owner''s long-lost granddaughter, Harry hopes to uncover the treasure''s location. But when Casey has a change of heart, she must follow the clues and find the treasure, in order to save Candleshoe and stop Harry before it is too late.', 'When ex-con artist Harry claims that a secret treasure is hidden inside Candleshoe, an English estate, he creates an elaborate plan to find and steal the prize. By convincing a girl named Casey to impersonate the estate owner''s long-lost granddaughter, Harry hopes to uncover the treasure''s location. But when Casey has a change of heart, she must follow the clues and find the treasure, in order to save Candleshoe and stop Harry before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Rq9u5fnS6PzWz9dgPQmBhgDvRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14612'),
  ('622934398059313799', 'Candlewick', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Ceccherini, Mauro Marchetti', 'Massimo Ceccherini, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Massimo Ceccherini, Claudia Gerini, Alessandro Paci, Flavio Bucci, Carlo Monni, Tinto Brass, Alessia Barela, Paolo Rossi', null, 'Red-haired, sex-obsessed manchild Lucio lazes all day long with his friend Pino until he falls for the beautiful head of the local loony bin.', 'Red-haired, sex-obsessed manchild Lucio lazes all day long with his friend Pino until he falls for the beautiful head of the local loony bin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9x2gzTyxTe0nQXTMmhkSHER3CAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82482'),
  ('512228262377420789', 'Candy', 1968, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Christian Marquand, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Buck Henry', 'Ewa Aulin, Charles Aznavour, Marlon Brando, Richard Burton, James Coburn, John Huston, Walter Matthau, Ringo Starr', 'R', 'A high school girl encounters a variety of kookie characters and humorous sexual situations while searching for the meaning of life.', 'A high school girl encounters a variety of kookie characters and humorous sexual situations while searching for the meaning of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym2TGzBpEh8I5EzP6ur9DIRuegG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46498'),
  ('818338878958064294', 'Candy', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Neil Armfield, Garry Phillips, Chris Webb', 'Neil Armfield, Luke Davies', 'Abbie Cornish, Heath Ledger, Geoffrey Rush, Tom Budge, Roberto Meza-Mont, Tony Martin, Noni Hazlehurst, Holly Austin', 'R', 'A poet falls in love with an art student, who gravitates to his bohemian lifestyle — and his love of heroin. Hooked as much on one another as they are on the drug, their relationship alternates between states of oblivion, self-destruction, and despair.', 'A poet falls in love with an art student, who gravitates to his bohemian lifestyle — and his love of heroin. Hooked as much on one another as they are on the drug, their relationship alternates between states of oblivion, self-destruction, and despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DvrEg2p3Hrdr1uGe0t7kRraWjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4441'),
  ('775208810573231137', 'Candy Candy: The Movie', 1992, 'Drama, Romance, Animation', 'Hiroshi Shidara', 'Keiko Nagita', 'Masaya Onosaka, Minori Matsushima, Ryo Horikawa, Yumi Touma, Hikaru Midorikawa, Eiko Yamada, Ryusei Nakao', null, 'A young girl named Candice White who was left on the doorstep of the "Pony Home", an orphanage, when she was just a baby. The sisters took her first name from a doll she had in her basket, with the name "Candy" on it, and her last name from the snowstorm she was rescued from. Life is quiet and happy.. or.. as quiet as life can be with Candy around. She has a penchant for getting into trouble, climbing trees and tussling with the best of them. However, tragedy begins to strike.', 'A young girl named Candice White who was left on the doorstep of the "Pony Home", an orphanage, when she was just a baby. The sisters took her first name from a doll she had in her basket, with the name "Candy" on it, and her last name from the snowstorm she was rescued from. Life is quiet and happy.. or.. as quiet as life can be with Candy around. She has a penchant for getting into trouble, climbing trees and tussling with the best of them. However, tragedy begins to strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nF2bHv2zr1dCzVFegwSD9AWmqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130140'),
  ('734884211562856276', 'Candy Cane Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Adrian Langley', 'Emily Golden', 'Beverley Mitchell, Mark Ghanimé, Mark Day, Derek Johns, Bénédicte Bélizaire, Brett Geddes, Trudy Weiss, Heather Tod Mitchell', null, 'Since childhood, Candy Cane Lane has been Phoebe''s favorite Christmas tradition. This Christmas, however, the neighborhood decides to skip the decoration, crushing Phoebe''s spirits. As Phoebe''s searching for a new tradition to lift her holiday spirits, she realizes that it''s not the traditions we cherish, but the people we spend them with. As Phoebe is preparing for her new tradition, she stumbles upon the final thing her Christmas was missing: love!', 'Since childhood, Candy Cane Lane has been Phoebe''s favorite Christmas tradition. This Christmas, however, the neighborhood decides to skip the decoration, crushing Phoebe''s spirits. As Phoebe''s searching for a new tradition to lift her holiday spirits, she realizes that it''s not the traditions we cherish, but the people we spend them with. As Phoebe is preparing for her new tradition, she stumbles upon the final thing her Christmas was missing: love!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iMaytQnEkxJOSWDBxinDl13S6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724425'),
  ('31117665561119104', 'Candy Cane Lane', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Newton Thomas Sigel, Reginald Hudlin, Erin Cochran', 'Kelly Younger', 'Eddie Murphy, Tracee Ellis Ross, Jillian Bell, Genneya Walton, Thaddeus J. Mixson, Madison Thomas, Nick Offerman, Chris Redd', 'PG', 'A man, determined to win the neighborhood''s annual Christmas decorating contest, makes a pact with an elf to help him win. However, the elf casts a spell bringing the twelve days of Christmas to life, bringing chaos to the small, unsuspecting town.', 'A man, determined to win the neighborhood''s annual Christmas decorating contest, makes a pact with an elf to help him win. However, the elf casts a spell bringing the twelve days of Christmas to life, bringing chaos to the small, unsuspecting town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of6Ds591FJTKoBHYjDFzH6jlTyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022964'),
