  ('629823988459000364', 'Candy Jar', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ben Shelton, Topher Osborn', 'Chad Klitzman', 'Sami Gayle, Jacob Latimore, Christina Hendricks, Uzo Aduba, Helen Hunt, Tom Bergeron, Tracey Bonner, Paul Tigue', 'PG-13', 'Dueling high school debate champs who are at odds on just about everything forge ahead with ambitious plans to get into the colleges of their dreams.', 'Dueling high school debate champs who are at odds on just about everything forge ahead with ambitious plans to get into the colleges of their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9PG1LG0zLnl6QQxw4WoRJEroXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507143'),
  ('991158003039945919', 'Candy Land', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Swab, Will Stone', 'John Swab', 'Eden Brolin, Olivia Luccardi, William Baldwin, Owen Campbell, Brad Carter, Virginia Rand, Guinevere Turner, Sam Quartin', null, 'Remy, a seemingly naive and devout young woman, finds herself cast out from her religious cult. With no place to turn, she immerses herself into the underground world of truck stop sex workers. Under the watchful eye of their matriarch and an enigmatic local lawman, Remy navigates between her strained belief system and the code to find her true calling in life.', 'Remy, a seemingly naive and devout young woman, finds herself cast out from her religious cult. With no place to turn, she immerses herself into the underground world of truck stop sex workers. Under the watchful eye of their matriarch and an enigmatic local lawman, Remy navigates between her strained belief system and the code to find her true calling in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3upBKM4ZFZ1fEEnWrnTZMuyPrzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826753'),
  ('971763920040849105', 'Candy Mountain', 1988, 'Music, Drama', 'Robert Frank, Rudy Wurlitzer, Pio Corradi', 'Rudy Wurlitzer', 'Kevin J. O''Connor, Bulle Ogier, Harris Yulin, Tom Waits, Joe Strummer, Laurie Metcalf, Dr. John, Leon Redbone', null, 'A mediocre musician goes on the road in search of the world''s greatest guitar maker.', 'A mediocre musician goes on the road in search of the world''s greatest guitar maker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWUtfdadSvmR58i0BaQ1YlYpQcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65604'),
  ('1063116093532368647', 'Candy Rain', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yu Jing-pin, Chen Hung-i', 'Lin Yan-ru, A.D. Lin, Chen Hung-i', 'Josephine A. Blankstein, Yang-kun Chen, Belle Hsin, Sandrine Pinna, Waa Wei, Niki Wu, Alexia Kao, Mo Tzu-yi', null, 'Four separate vignettes about lesbian relationships and dating, ending with a summation about relationships.', 'Four separate vignettes about lesbian relationships and dating, ending with a summation about relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vawhFSUCDFHdqjEGKYYRJGtUFue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163761'),
  ('701304905913282402', 'Candy Stripe Nurses', 1974, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Alan Holleb', 'Alan Holleb', 'Candice Rialson, Robin Mattson, María Rojo, Roger Cruz, Rod Haase, Richard Gates, Don Keefer, Kendrew Lascelles', 'R', 'Young, sexy nurses and their hospital adventures: free-loving Sandy tries to cure a rock star of his sexual problems, uptight Dianne has an affair with a druggie star college basketball player all while trying to expose another doctor''s malpractice, and juvenile delinquent Marisa has an affair with an accused man, in turn also trying to prove his innocence.', 'Young, sexy nurses and their hospital adventures: free-loving Sandy tries to cure a rock star of his sexual problems, uptight Dianne has an affair with a druggie star college basketball player all while trying to expose another doctor''s malpractice, and juvenile delinquent Marisa has an affair with an accused man, in turn also trying to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUfkUrpbrWWrVlKA4TFDX2KDpiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85968'),
  ('474774012789080399', 'Candy Stripers', 2006, 'Horror', 'Kate Robbins, Geoffrey Schaaf', 'Jill Garson, Kate Robbins', 'Deanna Brooks, Brianna Berman, Sarah McGuire, Brian Lloyd, Serria Tawan, Eliza Swenson, Scott Aaronson, Tori White', 'R', 'After a car crash, Tammy and injured basketball players are hospitalized. When a nurse kisses dying Tammy, an alien infection spreads through the hospital staff and patients. The facility is quarantined as infected people seek sugar.', 'After a car crash, Tammy and injured basketball players are hospitalized. When a nurse kisses dying Tammy, an alien infection spreads through the hospital staff and patients. The facility is quarantined as infected people seek sugar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RtNbXjAm6MAPaGz0JtlzPrwOU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53335'),
  ('928421106529789312', 'Candyman', 1992, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Bernard Rose, Maria C. Connors', 'Bernard Rose', 'Virginia Madsen, Tony Todd, Xander Berkeley, Kasi Lemmons, Vanessa Williams, DeJuan Guy, Michael Culkin, Stanley DeSantis', 'R', 'The Candyman, a murderous soul with a hook for a hand, is accidentally summoned to reality by a skeptic grad student researching the monster''s myth.', 'The Candyman, a murderous soul with a hook for a hand, is accidentally summoned to reality by a skeptic grad student researching the monster''s myth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQtgkgDZE7egMq532sOt83DnT83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9529'),
  ('43864643182819486', 'Candyman', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Guleserian, Nia DaCosta', 'Bernard Rose', 'Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Teyonah Parris, Colman Domingo, Nathan Stewart-Jarrett, Kyle Kaminsky, Vanessa Williams, Brian King, Miriam Moss', 'R', 'A Chicago artist''s sanity starts to unravel, unleashing a terrifying wave of violence when he begins to explore the macabre history of the Candyman.', 'A Chicago artist''s sanity starts to unravel, unleashing a terrifying wave of violence when he begins to explore the macabre history of the Candyman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeV15PpR8jFJA9TF9JPXIoqEgp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565028'),
  ('221693490444786902', 'Candyman: Day of the Dead', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Turi Meyer, Michael G. Wojciechowski, Juan Mas', 'Alfredo Septién, Turi Meyer', 'Tony Todd, Donna D''Errico, Alexia Robinson, Mike Moroff, Mark Adair-Rios, Jsu Garcia, Wade Williams, Ernie Hudson Jr.', 'R', 'As the Day of the Dead celebration approaches the barrio of East Los Angeles, Caroline is challenged to control the horrifying legend of her ancestor, the "Candyman".', 'As the Day of the Dead celebration approaches the barrio of East Los Angeles, Caroline is challenged to control the horrifying legend of her ancestor, the "Candyman".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBhkCLtcgfccZhPU1RlyzmKVTH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12485'),
  ('807222045663842157', 'Candyman: Farewell to the Flesh', 1995, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bill Condon, Tobias A. Schliessler, Jeff Shiffman', 'Rand Ravich, Mark Kruger', 'Tony Todd, Kelly Rowan, William O''Leary, Bill Nunn, David Gianopoulos, Matt Clark, Timothy Carhart, Veronica Cartwright', 'R', 'Annie, a young schoolteacher struggling to solve the brutal murder of her father, unwittingly summons the "Candyman" to New Orleans, where she learns the secret of his power, and discovers the link that connects them.', 'Annie, a young schoolteacher struggling to solve the brutal murder of her father, unwittingly summons the "Candyman" to New Orleans, where she learns the secret of his power, and discovers the link that connects them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2scgM9dFaHEppWb3tS99gCAh8KX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10824'),
  ('609478925667601742', 'Cane River', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Horace B. Jenkins', 'Horace B. Jenkins', 'Tommye Myrick, Richard Romain, Barbara Tasker, Ilunga Adell, Lloyd La Cour, Carol Sutton, Stephen Severin, Noray Francis', null, 'A budding, forbidden romance lays bare the tensions between two black communities, both descended from slaves but of disparate opportunity—the light-skinned, property-owning Creoles and the darker-skinned, more disenfranchised families of the area.', 'A budding, forbidden romance lays bare the tensions between two black communities, both descended from slaves but of disparate opportunity—the light-skinned, property-owning Creoles and the darker-skinned, more disenfranchised families of the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW8M74YOQT2TOhESX7wnZMWm1RY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495199'),
  ('1047845797032720993', 'Cane Toads: An Unnatural History', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Mark Lewis, Jim Frazier, Wayne Taylor', 'Mark Lewis', 'Tip Byrne, Glen Ingram, H.W. Kerr', 'PG', 'A documentary detailing the spread of Hawaiian sugar-cane toads through Australia in a botched effort to introduce them as counter pests.', 'A documentary detailing the spread of Hawaiian sugar-cane toads through Australia in a botched effort to introduce them as counter pests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mae0ZYiHNvUtHZiJ7u2brWYG3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82284'),
  ('733281111868084179', 'Canela', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jordi Mariscal, Héctor Ortega', 'Marilú Acosta', 'Isabel Yudice, Ana Martín, Clementina Guadarrama, Mónica Dionne, Carlos Cobos, Gabriela Canudas, Guillermo Larrea, Johanna Murillo', null, 'Maria is a girl who loves to cook and lives with his grandmother, Doña Tere, in Mexico City''s downtown. Doña Tere has a traditional Mexican restaurant called "El Molcajete". After the death of her daughter, Doña Tere abandoned his passion for cooking and stopped working in "El Molcajete", now operating under the direction of chef Rosi. Maria does everything possible to bring her grandmother back to the restaurant, while chef Rosi cooks dishes according to new trends in fusion cuisine which highlights the light food, but Maria and Doña Tere won''t accept the traditional flavors and cooking secrets to be forgotten. The cuisine battle between Tere and chef Rosi is an epic fight not only between long-stablished mexican food and light food, but also a struggle of family bonds, friendship, cooking secrets, flavour’s passion and more than two hundred ingredients that are needed in order to prepare Mole, a traditional mexican sauce.', 'Maria is a girl who loves to cook and lives with his grandmother, Doña Tere, in Mexico City''s downtown. Doña Tere has a traditional Mexican restaurant called "El Molcajete". After the death of her daughter, Doña Tere abandoned his passion for cooking and stopped working in "El Molcajete", now operating under the direction of chef Rosi. Maria does everything possible to bring her grandmother back to the restaurant, while chef Rosi cooks dishes according to new trends in fusion cuisine which highlights the light food, but Maria and Doña Tere won''t accept the traditional flavors and cooking secrets to be forgotten. The cuisine battle between Tere and chef Rosi is an epic fight not only between long-stablished mexican food and light food, but also a struggle of family bonds, friendship, cooking secrets, flavour’s passion and more than two hundred ingredients that are needed in order to prepare Mole, a traditional mexican sauce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8O0pH0tHadtAFknOYnUEfygCsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212740'),
  ('1058216871509878409', 'Caniba', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Véréna Paravel, Lucien Castaing-Taylor, Véréna Paravel', null, 'Issei Sagawa, Jun Sagawa, Yōko Satomi', null, 'Caniba is a fresco about flesh and desire. It reflects on the discomfiting significance of cannibalism in human existence through the prism of one Japanese man, Issei Sagawa, and his mysterious relationship with his brother, Jun Sagawa.', 'Caniba is a fresco about flesh and desire. It reflects on the discomfiting significance of cannibalism in human existence through the prism of one Japanese man, Issei Sagawa, and his mysterious relationship with his brother, Jun Sagawa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6IjD2eAEw0IOot4JPrq2IlUl4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471998'),
  ('1098638611941208166', 'Canine Caddy', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi, Don A. Duckwall', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney', 'NR', 'Mickey''s going golfing, and Pluto is his caddy. Besides the usual caddy duties, Pluto runs to the ball and points to it. But when the ball lands in a gopher hole, Pluto''s got another task: chase the gopher. They eventually chase each other through a number of holes in a knoll where Mickey is trying to putt out, causing the knoll to collapse.', 'Mickey''s going golfing, and Pluto is his caddy. Besides the usual caddy duties, Pluto runs to the ball and points to it. But when the ball lands in a gopher hole, Pluto''s got another task: chase the gopher. They eventually chase each other through a number of holes in a knoll where Mickey is trying to putt out, causing the knoll to collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wz9tPx5jOXpVNnT2UPZwXE5Swp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68490'),
  ('313367102024006481', 'Canine Casanova', 1945, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Pluto spots Dinah the dachshund and is smitten, but she ignores him. He uses a giant bone to steal a kiss, and hides behind a mirror, but still no luck. Then Dinah is nabbed by the dogcatcher, and Pluto goes in to free her. Their thrilling escape finally gets Pluto another kiss.', 'Pluto spots Dinah the dachshund and is smitten, but she ignores him. He uses a giant bone to steal a kiss, and hides behind a mirror, but still no luck. Then Dinah is nabbed by the dogcatcher, and Pluto goes in to free her. Their thrilling escape finally gets Pluto another kiss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycnilsA17myk615IHLlGpmai84E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68491'),
  ('36709480315732367', 'Canine Patrol', 1945, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, null, 'NR', 'Pluto is patrolling a beach for the Coast Guard when a baby turtle hatches. The turtle keeps trying to sneak into the restricted zone to swim, and Pluto keeps trying to stop him. But when Pluto stumbles into some quicksand, he suddenly needs help from his foe.', 'Pluto is patrolling a beach for the Coast Guard when a baby turtle hatches. The turtle keeps trying to sneak into the restricted zone to swim, and Pluto keeps trying to stop him. But when Pluto stumbles into some quicksand, he suddenly needs help from his foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7f0UKIy3BQs1OJgnlm5FcDm40YF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68492'),
  ('935814257836753241', 'Cañitas', 2007, 'Horror', 'Julio César Estrada', 'Gabriel González Meléndez, Xavier Robles', 'Armando Hernández, Mariana Ávila, Francesca Guillén, Juan Pablo Medina, Alejandro Lago, Alexis Isaac García, Felipe Colombo, Elia Domensain', null, 'Based on the novel by Carlos Trejo, supposedly based on true events, the film retells the story of a group of friends that played the Ouija one night together and started to die one by one in mysterious ways. The only survivor was the real-life author, Carlos Trejo.', 'Based on the novel by Carlos Trejo, supposedly based on true events, the film retells the story of a group of friends that played the Ouija one night together and started to die one by one in mysterious ways. The only survivor was the real-life author, Carlos Trejo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKoLb38EnsPWAvi3CWrNkEiS90Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212960'),
  ('30644605192797200', 'Cannabis', 1970, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pierre Koralnik, Willy Kurant', 'Frantz-André Burguet', 'Serge Gainsbourg, Jane Birkin, Paul Nicholas, Gabriele Ferzetti, Paul Albert Krumm, Yvette Lebon, Curd Jürgens, Laurence Badie', 'R', 'Serge Morgan is a killer working for the American Mafia. After performing a contract in New York for his employers, he takes the plane back to Paris and, during the flight, he gets to know Jane, the rich daughter of an ambassador. Once in Orly Airport he gets seriously wounded by the men of French drug kingpin Henri Emery. He manages to escape them though and takes refuge at Jane''s. Passion sets in between the killer and the young lady. As of then, sex will be intertwined with blood and death. For better or worse...', 'Serge Morgan is a killer working for the American Mafia. After performing a contract in New York for his employers, he takes the plane back to Paris and, during the flight, he gets to know Jane, the rich daughter of an ambassador. Once in Orly Airport he gets seriously wounded by the men of French drug kingpin Henri Emery. He manages to escape them though and takes refuge at Jane''s. Passion sets in between the killer and the young lady. As of then, sex will be intertwined with blood and death. For better or worse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3p92Bp3OZhnHiAnfNGdU7dBu5Tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45873'),
  ('424027139754890735', 'Canned Feud', 1951, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Marian Richman', 'NR', 'Sylvester Cat finds that his people have gone on vacation and left him alone in a locked house with a large stash of canned food in a cupboard. Sylvester needs a can opener, or he''ll starve. And a pesky mouse has the only can opener in the house and torments Sylvester into trying more and more desperate measures to obtain it.', 'Sylvester Cat finds that his people have gone on vacation and left him alone in a locked house with a large stash of canned food in a cupboard. Sylvester needs a can opener, or he''ll starve. And a pesky mouse has the only can opener in the house and torments Sylvester into trying more and more desperate measures to obtain it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5i125sPgJa6VDNmfehGChF7Pwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145948'),
  ('775753665769358178', 'Canned Laughter', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Geoffrey Sax', 'Rowan Atkinson', 'Rowan Atkinson, Sue Holderness, Joan Scott, John J. Carney, Harry Shacklock, George Belbin, George Romanov, Michael Staniforth', null, 'Robert Box asks his colleague Lorraine out for a date. They go to a restaurant where Dave Perry tries to break it as a stand-up comedian.', 'Robert Box asks his colleague Lorraine out for a date. They go to a restaurant where Dave Perry tries to break it as a stand-up comedian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75ZMXWNqtY7J8aW9TTfbyglk0MK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266244'),
  ('902672534297392136', 'Cannery Rodent', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, null, null, 'Tom chases Jerry into a fish cannery; they get sealed into cans. Tom breaks out, but falls off a pier as the cans roll under him. A shark chases him out of the water; Tom drops an anchor on the shark. Meanwhile, Jerry has been hopping in his can; Tom opens it, and puts his finger in, which Jerry bites. Jerry tricks Tom into falling off the end of another pier, and right into the shark''s path again. The shark manages to get Tom into a very precarious position, barely holding the jaws apart. Jerry takes pity, and dumps a shaker full of pepper into the shark, which ends up on the processing line and stuffed into a huge can. Tom is unrepentant, so Jerry tricks him with a fake shark fin.', 'Tom chases Jerry into a fish cannery; they get sealed into cans. Tom breaks out, but falls off a pier as the cans roll under him. A shark chases him out of the water; Tom drops an anchor on the shark. Meanwhile, Jerry has been hopping in his can; Tom opens it, and puts his finger in, which Jerry bites. Jerry tricks Tom into falling off the end of another pier, and right into the shark''s path again. The shark manages to get Tom into a very precarious position, barely holding the jaws apart. Jerry takes pity, and dumps a shaker full of pepper into the shark, which ends up on the processing line and stuffed into a huge can. Tom is unrepentant, so Jerry tricks him with a fake shark fin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPSvZ5E1F02ceP8aBI6F28tRtwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219577'),
  ('383723991735196398', 'Cannery Row', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'David S. Ward, Sven Nykvist, Jerry Sobul', 'David S. Ward', 'Nick Nolte, Debra Winger, Audra Lindley, Frank McRae, M. Emmet Walsh, Tom Mahoney, John Malloy, James Keane', 'PG', 'Doc, who has just moved to Cannery Row, realizes that the only entertainment is the brothel. There he meets the spunky Suzy and they fall in love, giving them both a renewed chance at life.', 'Doc, who has just moved to Cannery Row, realizes that the only entertainment is the brothel. There he meets the spunky Suzy and they fall in love, giving them both a renewed chance at life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4U0NCom1slWMgGL9dCKsQdq82fP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25297'),
  ('395337097762625020', 'Cannery Woe', 1961, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tom Holland', null, 'Speedy Gonzales helps provide cheese for the mayor''s reelection campaign (and two hungry friends) by swiping it from the store guarded by Sylvester.', 'Speedy Gonzales helps provide cheese for the mayor''s reelection campaign (and two hungry friends) by swiping it from the store guarded by Sylvester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZw1ePadR6iRDvz3voWYlyua1iA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174786'),
  ('90594353606930964', 'Cannes Man', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Documentary', 'Richard Martini, Denise Brassard, Dean Lent', 'Irwin M. Rappaport, Deric Haddad, Susan Shapiro', 'Seymour Cassel, Francesco Quinn, Rebecca Broussard, Luana Anders, Lloyd Kaufman, James Brolin, John Malkovich, Ann Cusack', 'R', 'Film producer Sy Lerner makes a bet with a fellow film executive that he can turn any nobody into a star at the Cannes Film Festival. A New York cab driver who is visiting the festival is chosen as the test subject to settle the bet and Sy uses his skills of hype and manipulation to try and turn the cab driver named Frank into the talk of the town. Many celebrities make cameos throughout the film.', 'Film producer Sy Lerner makes a bet with a fellow film executive that he can turn any nobody into a star at the Cannes Film Festival. A New York cab driver who is visiting the festival is chosen as the test subject to settle the bet and Sy uses his skills of hype and manipulation to try and turn the cab driver named Frank into the talk of the town. Many celebrities make cameos throughout the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gke9YUIfBHfFLEnMbbNjlHTPT8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42775'),
  ('190974969376295967', 'Cannibal', 2010, 'Horror, Romance, Thriller', 'Benjamin Viré, Raphaël Kolacz', 'Benjamin Viré, Benjamin Viré', 'Nicolas Gob, Helena Coppejans, Jean Collard, Éric Godon, Pierre Nisse, Jonathan Demurger, Miguel Molina, Philippe Nahon', 'PG-13', 'A lonely man finds a beautiful young woman unconscious and covered in blood while walking through the woods. He starts to fall for her but learns of a terrifying secret.', 'A lonely man finds a beautiful young woman unconscious and covered in blood while walking through the woods. He starts to fall for her but learns of a terrifying secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWEwfm9RKFYrLcinExQvvqRL2DL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86569'),
