  ('251300522785881693', 'Cannibal Campout', 1988, 'Horror', 'Jon McBride, Tom Fisher', 'Jon McBride', 'Jon McBride, Amy Chludzinksi, Christopher A. Granger, Gene Robbins, Carrie Lindell, Richard Marcus, Joseph Salheb, Ray Angelic', null, 'Four teenagers on an outing in the woods are attacked by a trio of mutant cannibals.', 'Four teenagers on an outing in the woods are attacked by a trio of mutant cannibals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UicAd8gvi5xldmnIlA8luJ4Skl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89698'),
  ('25484466577633121', 'Cannibal Capers', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, 'NR', 'A group of cannibals gather together for a tribal dance. In the middle of their gala, they are interrupted by a ferocious lion!', 'A group of cannibals gather together for a tribal dance. In the middle of their gala, they are interrupted by a ferocious lion!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gihLuJBGYlvakZBCzA6Gm6SqmJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52945'),
  ('168257341180655906', 'Cannibal Diner', 2012, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Frank W. Montag, Marcel Kuhlmann', 'Mario von Czapiewski', 'Alexandra Lesch, Kristiana Rohder, Lara Baum, Alexandra Jordan, Mike Zick, Dominik Schneider, Celina Klemenz, Indira Madison', 'NR', 'A group of models find themselves trapped in a factory inhabited by a cannibalistic degenerated family.', 'A group of models find themselves trapped in a factory inhabited by a cannibalistic degenerated family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rexiwJibPm7UctU01njUKuTADJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213224'),
  ('849891014595667073', 'Cannibal Ferox', 1981, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Umberto Lenzi, Riccardo Petrazzi, Carlo Maria Cordio', 'Umberto Lenzi', 'Giovanni Lombardo Radice, Lorraine De Selle, Danilo Mattei, Zora Kerova, Walter Lucchini, Fiamma Maglione, Robert Kerman, John Bartha', 'NR', 'Three friends out to disprove cannibalism meet two men on the run who tortured and enslaved a cannibal tribe to find emeralds, and now the tribe is out for revenge.', 'Three friends out to disprove cannibalism meet two men on the run who tortured and enslaved a cannibal tribe to find emeralds, and now the tribe is out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogvtVVsPSuzXKiQY1FCCKwIfBec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8691'),
  ('374790961988450631', 'Cannibal Girls', 1973, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Ivan Reitman, Robert Saad', 'Robert Sandler', 'Eugene Levy, Andrea Martin, Ronald Ulrich, Randall Carpenter, Bonnie Neilson, Mira Pawluk, Bob McHeady, Alan Gordon', 'R', 'A young couple spend the night in a restaurant, only to find out that it is haunted by three dead women who hunger for human flesh.', 'A young couple spend the night in a restaurant, only to find out that it is haunted by three dead women who hunger for human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsKWMYCgrhUcL8xKKkatHl7Ep19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58411'),
  ('955261634686805668', 'Cannibal Hookers', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Donald Farmer, Glenn Kral', 'Donald Farmer', 'Amy Waddell, Annette Munro, Sheila Best, Diana de la Cruz, Gary J. Levinson, Tommy Carrano, Donald Trimborn, Matt Borlenghi', null, 'Two girls pose as hookers for a sorority initiation, then turn into zombies and eat their neighbors.', 'Two girls pose as hookers for a sorority initiation, then turn into zombies and eat their neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVHm9IApVwUHynnEt9MYCSjdaRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28337'),
  ('774559323529415165', 'Cannibal Terror', 1980, 'Horror', 'Alain Deruelle, Emilio Foriscot, Julio Pérez Tabernero', 'Julio Pérez Tabernero, H.L. Rostaine, Jesús Franco', 'Antonio Mayans, Silvia Solar, Pamela Stanford, Olivier Mathot, Stan Hamilton, Bertrand Altmann, Gérard Lemaire, Antoine Fontaine', null, 'After botching a kidnapping, two criminals hide with their victim in a friends house in the jungle. After one of them rapes the friend''s wife, they''re left to be eaten by a nearby cannibal tribe.', 'After botching a kidnapping, two criminals hide with their victim in a friends house in the jungle. After one of them rapes the friend''s wife, they''re left to be eaten by a nearby cannibal tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAS5dCoL6sjaKwg4sdRJjrmEOLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84372'),
  ('836101312041940070', 'Cannibal Troll', 2021, 'Horror', 'Jack Peter Mundy, Scott Chambers, Becca Hirani', 'Scott Chambers', 'Georgina Jane, Zuza Tehanu, Barbara Dabson, Faith Kiggundu, Nicole Nabi, Marcus Brooks-Henderson, Megan Purvis, Kate Sandison', null, 'A group of friends on a camping trip, for the bride to be'' s hen do, find themselves hunted down by a man eating cannibal troll in the woodland. They are hunted, captured and locked up in the Trolls torture chamber being forced to undergo a variety of challenges in order to escape their fate.', 'A group of friends on a camping trip, for the bride to be'' s hen do, find themselves hunted down by a man eating cannibal troll in the woodland. They are hunted, captured and locked up in the Trolls torture chamber being forced to undergo a variety of challenges in order to escape their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1VO6eYoldYkHppaEbp3hYW701N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801557'),
  ('943212435854941589', 'Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death', 1989, 'Horror, Comedy, Adventure, Romance, Action', 'J.F. Lawton, Robert Knouse, Mike Snyder', 'J.F. Lawton', 'Shannon Tweed, Bill Maher, Karen M. Waldron, Adrienne Barbeau, Brett Stimely, Barry Primus, Jim McKrell, Pat Crawford Brown', 'PG-13', 'The U.S. government, eager to protect the nation''s avacado supplies, recruits feminist professor Margo Hunt to make contact with the Piranha Women, an all-female tribe who believe men are only good as a source of food. Accompanying Dr. Hunt on her trip are Jim, a guide of questionable competence, and Bunny, a student of unquestionable incompetence.', 'The U.S. government, eager to protect the nation''s avacado supplies, recruits feminist professor Margo Hunt to make contact with the Piranha Women, an all-female tribe who believe men are only good as a source of food. Accompanying Dr. Hunt on her trip are Jim, a guide of questionable competence, and Bunny, a student of unquestionable incompetence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98qUwoXF4sGb0pCxkK8S4fLdrSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26369'),
  ('522859824059883725', 'Cannibal World', 2004, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Bruno Mattei, Tullio Antiga', 'Giovanni Paolucci, Bruno Mattei', 'Helena Wagner, Claudio Morales, Cindy Jelić Matić, Jimmy Moss, Mike Monty, Antoine Reboul, Kevin Maxwell, Brad Santana', null, 'The network where the famous anchorwoman Grace Forsyte works, is collapsing and she would do everything to regain the favour of the audience, therefore she convinces her professional team to go to the Amazon jungle for a sensational scoop about the cannibals', 'The network where the famous anchorwoman Grace Forsyte works, is collapsing and she would do everything to regain the favour of the audience, therefore she convinces her professional team to go to the Amazon jungle for a sensational scoop about the cannibals', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGMCsKnq5iC6Xj2vgeqyRpsjNsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88983'),
  ('514536309286215670', 'Cannibal! The Musical', 1996, 'Comedy, Western, Thriller', 'Trey Parker, Robert Muratore, Chris Graves', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone', 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Dian Bachar, Ian Hardin, Jon Hegel, Masao Maki, Robert Muratore, Toddy Walters', 'R', 'Heading through Colorado Territory in search of gold and women, Alferd Packer and his group of bemused companions find themselves lost, starving and musically inspired by the obstacles they confront along the way, including a die-hard Confederate cyclops, a trio of surly trappers, a tribe of Japanese-speaking "Indians," and ultimately, each other.', 'Heading through Colorado Territory in search of gold and women, Alferd Packer and his group of bemused companions find themselves lost, starving and musically inspired by the obstacles they confront along the way, including a die-hard Confederate cyclops, a trio of surly trappers, a tribe of Japanese-speaking "Indians," and ultimately, each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mX5UM9Fhp9tfQ6VXXO9cUWKPCRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13063'),
  ('186771756118207223', 'Cannon for Cordoba', 1970, 'Action, Adventure, Western', 'Paul Wendkos, Antonio Macasoli, José María Ochoa', 'Stephen Kandel', 'George Peppard, Giovanna Ralli, Raf Vallone, Pete Duel, Don Gordon, Nico Minardos, Gabriele Tinti, John Larch', null, 'In 1912, during the Mexican Revolution, the border between Texas and Mexico is on flames due to savage raids by Mexican bandits who call themselves freedom fighters, so the US government entrusts to General Pershing the capture of General Héctor Córdoba, the most notorious among them.', 'In 1912, during the Mexican Revolution, the border between Texas and Mexico is on flames due to savage raids by Mexican bandits who call themselves freedom fighters, so the US government entrusts to General Pershing the capture of General Héctor Córdoba, the most notorious among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4QvLDgS663bRbaHGQNK1BRd331.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96265'),
  ('608035764142775033', 'Cannonball', 1976, 'Action, Comedy', 'Paul Bartel, Tak Fujimoto, Michael Shadler', 'Paul Bartel, Don Simpson', 'David Carradine, Bill McKinney, Veronica Hamel, Gerrit Graham, Robert Carradine, Belinda Balaski, Judy Canova, Archie Hahn', 'R', 'Coy "Cannonball" Buckman and his blazing red Pontiac enter the Trans-America Grand Prix, an underground road race spanning the continent in which there are no rules, no speed limits and no heed for the law. En route, Buckman jockeys with an international ensemble of racers for a $100,000 purse. But there are none more important than Cade Redman, his direct competition for a guaranteed spot on the elite Modern Motors racing team.', 'Coy "Cannonball" Buckman and his blazing red Pontiac enter the Trans-America Grand Prix, an underground road race spanning the continent in which there are no rules, no speed limits and no heed for the law. En route, Buckman jockeys with an international ensemble of racers for a $100,000 purse. But there are none more important than Cade Redman, his direct competition for a guaranteed spot on the elite Modern Motors racing team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u85Yi7wJRKS7lgLjQdpQqOxJNO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21241'),
  ('968137209309065746', 'Cannonball Run II', 1984, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hal Needham, Nick McLean, Jerry Ketcham', 'Hal Needham, Albert S. Ruddy, Harvey Miller', 'Burt Reynolds, Dom DeLuise, Dean Martin, Sammy Davis Jr., Jamie Farr, Marilu Henner, Telly Savalas, Shirley MacLaine', 'PG', 'When a wealthy sheikh puts up $1 million in prize money for a cross-country car race, there is one person crazy enough to hit the road hard with wheels spinning fast. Legendary driver J.J. McClure enters the competition along with his friend Victor and together they set off across the American landscape in a madcap action-adventure destined to test their wits and automobile skills.', 'When a wealthy sheikh puts up $1 million in prize money for a cross-country car race, there is one person crazy enough to hit the road hard with wheels spinning fast. Legendary driver J.J. McClure enters the competition along with his friend Victor and together they set off across the American landscape in a madcap action-adventure destined to test their wits and automobile skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdXjbUcdESA5CKCyez6A29c2vq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11950'),
  ('482249834911776085', 'Cannot Live Without You', 2009, 'Drama', 'Chou Yi-wen, Leon Dai', 'Leon Dai', 'Akira Chen, Chao Yu-Hsuan, Lin Chih-ju, Lo Sze-chi, Ma Tin-Ni', null, 'A down and out man and his daughter live in an illegal hovel. The two live a happy peaceful life until the authorities intervene when the child reaches school age.', 'A down and out man and his daughter live in an illegal hovel. The two live a happy peaceful life until the authorities intervene when the child reaches school age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soWD4EVuJGXDWyY7xVC1mJhkdOZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98868'),
  ('261104699776029670', 'Canoa: A Shameful Memory', 1976, 'History, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Felipe Cazals, Álex Phillips Jr., Manuel Ortega', 'Tomás Pérez Turrent', 'Salvador Sánchez, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Enrique Lucero, Arturo Alegro, Roberto Sosa Sr., Carlos Chávez, Gerardo Vigil, Jaime Garza', null, 'A group of students arrives in a small town during a hiking expedition. Once there, the local priest accuses them of being communist agitators on the run from an army crack-down against student demonstrations in nearby Mexico City and rallies the townsfolk to lynch them. Based on a true story.', 'A group of students arrives in a small town during a hiking expedition. Once there, the local priest accuses them of being communist agitators on the run from an army crack-down against student demonstrations in nearby Mexico City and rallies the townsfolk to lynch them. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ag35bvtquwiDPsY4itNH895NguW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116982'),
  ('386104734789871671', 'Canola', 2016, 'Drama', 'Chang, Park Jun-gyu, Park Jang-hyuk', 'Huh Ah-reum, Chang', 'Youn Yuh-jung, Kim Go-eun, Kim Hie-won, Shin Eun-jung, Yang Ik-june, Minho, Ryu Jun-yeol, Park Min-ji', null, 'A girl who went missing after an accident returns 10 years later and reunites with her grandmother.', 'A girl who went missing after an accident returns 10 years later and reunites with her grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pEgQwzWGhJY2Y41wNhPfwfcGMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387886'),
  ('774900218296608851', 'Canon', 1964, 'Animation, Music', 'Norman McLaren, Grant Munro', null, null, null, 'Perhaps the only film whose content is totally based on the musical form known as canon. The first sequence is a simple demonstration of the canon "Frere Jacques" where four cubes dance and combine with one another on a checkerboard. The second sequence show four little human-like figures dancing in space. The third and most elaborate sequence shows a human going through several strange gesticulations. Through multiple printing we realize that the man, as in the previous sequences, is part of a visual canon and is making the gestures to himself. As we hear variations on the canonic theme so too do we witness visual variations: a woman and cat enters the canon. To show the musical technique of inversion, the image of the man is printed upside down.', 'Perhaps the only film whose content is totally based on the musical form known as canon. The first sequence is a simple demonstration of the canon "Frere Jacques" where four cubes dance and combine with one another on a checkerboard. The second sequence show four little human-like figures dancing in space. The third and most elaborate sequence shows a human going through several strange gesticulations. Through multiple printing we realize that the man, as in the previous sequences, is part of a visual canon and is making the gestures to himself. As we hear variations on the canonic theme so too do we witness visual variations: a woman and cat enters the canon. To show the musical technique of inversion, the image of the man is printed upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3r7KRIC1Zyo5KUotnZREhxp1FSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246648'),
