  ('677665145394993311', 'Canvas Back Duck', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher, Dal McKennon', 'NR', 'Donald and his nephews are visiting the carnival. After Donald makes a relatively high score on a weight testing machine, he is thought to be a veritable strong man and takes on an offer from a little boy to fight his uncle in a boxing match. Unfortunately for Donald, that "little boy" is actually a con man in cahoots with boxer Peewee Pete who is anything but what his name implies. His nephews notice and try to warn Donald but he finds himself in the ring with Pete anyway.', 'Donald and his nephews are visiting the carnival. After Donald makes a relatively high score on a weight testing machine, he is thought to be a veritable strong man and takes on an offer from a little boy to fight his uncle in a boxing match. Unfortunately for Donald, that "little boy" is actually a con man in cahoots with boxer Peewee Pete who is anything but what his name implies. His nephews notice and try to warn Donald but he finds himself in the ring with Pete anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjuzQJtkr4uCdsI5zJ2TOYvOpYl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53469'),
  ('33451081073945927', 'Canyon', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Jon Jost', null, null, null, '“A silent perusal of the Grand Canyon, morning to night, from a single, fixed camera position, by means of constant dissolves spaced a few seconds apart. Man — entirely absent — is no longer the center of the universe; the canyon exists outside of him. Despite the invisible photographer and his technologically-caused dissolves, this is a creditable approximation of the true foreign-ness of nature.” — Amos Vogel, Film as a Subversive Art (1974)', '“A silent perusal of the Grand Canyon, morning to night, from a single, fixed camera position, by means of constant dissolves spaced a few seconds apart. Man — entirely absent — is no longer the center of the universe; the canyon exists outside of him. Despite the invisible photographer and his technologically-caused dissolves, this is a creditable approximation of the true foreign-ness of nature.” — Amos Vogel, Film as a Subversive Art (1974)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/728SBtjky7pKr9meN7RMDx9kS4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154818'),
  ('972773334591954106', 'Canyon Passage', 1946, 'Western', 'Jacques Tourneur, Bernard B. Brown, Frank Skinner', 'Ernest Haycox', 'Dana Andrews, Brian Donlevy, Susan Hayward, Patricia Roc, Ward Bond, Hoagy Carmichael, Fay Holden, Stanley Ridges', 'NR', 'In 1850s Oregon, a businessman is torn between his love of two very different women and his loyalty to a compulsive gambler friend who goes over the line.', 'In 1850s Oregon, a businessman is torn between his love of two very different women and his loyalty to a compulsive gambler friend who goes over the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duWXNlo39CSJvvrnkrvFGfupasc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37309'),
  ('183020618399038479', 'Cap Tourmente', 1993, 'Drama', 'Michel Langlois, Louis-Philippe Rochon, Eric Cayla', 'Michel Langlois, Marcel Beaulieu', 'Roy Dupuis, Élise Guilbault, Andrée Lachapelle, Gilbert Sicotte, Luc Picard, Macha Limonchik, Gabriel Gascon, Michèle Deslauriers', null, 'Alex has a deeply troubled mind. He also has a seriously dysfunctional - not to say incestuous - family. Why then, has he returned from his merchant seaman job to the rocky coasts of his home? Perhaps he couldn''t cut manage to march in his father''s footsteps in that job. His mother doesn''t seem to mind, and lets him stay at her bed and breakfast hotel. His sister still seems to have the hots for him, just as she does for his (and her) old boyfriend Jean-Louis, who has just shown up. Even his mother seems to find him sexy. All these people appear eager to get their hands on his body, but he''s too wrapped up in what''s going on inside his head to notice.', 'Alex has a deeply troubled mind. He also has a seriously dysfunctional - not to say incestuous - family. Why then, has he returned from his merchant seaman job to the rocky coasts of his home? Perhaps he couldn''t cut manage to march in his father''s footsteps in that job. His mother doesn''t seem to mind, and lets him stay at her bed and breakfast hotel. His sister still seems to have the hots for him, just as she does for his (and her) old boyfriend Jean-Louis, who has just shown up. Even his mother seems to find him sexy. All these people appear eager to get their hands on his body, but he''s too wrapped up in what''s going on inside his head to notice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOmTwITGLowDpCTW2J3zG2jlOJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197545'),
  ('1068462500579457717', 'Cape Fear', 1962, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'J. Lee Thompson, Sam Leavitt, Ray Gosnell Jr.', 'James R. Webb', 'Gregory Peck, Robert Mitchum, Polly Bergen, Martin Balsam, Lori Martin, Jack Kruschen, Telly Savalas, Barrie Chase', 'PG', 'Sam Bowden witnesses a rape committed by Max Cady and testifies against him. When released after 8 years in prison, Cady begins stalking Bowden and his family but is always clever enough not to violate the law.', 'Sam Bowden witnesses a rape committed by Max Cady and testifies against him. When released after 8 years in prison, Cady begins stalking Bowden and his family but is always clever enough not to violate the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDqaHjMbnebtB05QWgAR8wW86sb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11349'),
  ('1116731523284716249', 'Cape Fear', 1991, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Freddie Francis, Martin Scorsese, Joseph P. Reidy', 'James R. Webb', 'Robert De Niro, Nick Nolte, Jessica Lange, Juliette Lewis, Joe Don Baker, Robert Mitchum, Gregory Peck, Martin Balsam', 'R', 'Sam Bowden is a small-town corporate attorney. Max Cady is a tattooed, cigar-smoking, Bible-quoting, psychotic rapist. What do they have in common? 14 years ago, Sam was a public defender assigned to Max Cady''s rape trial, and he made a serious error: he hid a document from his illiterate client that could have gotten him acquitted. Now, the cagey Cady has been released, and he intends to teach Sam Bowden and his family a thing or two about loss.', 'Sam Bowden is a small-town corporate attorney. Max Cady is a tattooed, cigar-smoking, Bible-quoting, psychotic rapist. What do they have in common? 14 years ago, Sam was a public defender assigned to Max Cady''s rape trial, and he made a serious error: he hid a document from his illiterate client that could have gotten him acquitted. Now, the cagey Cady has been released, and he intends to teach Sam Bowden and his family a thing or two about loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meJZAAuVcjic2ipvbOPz5UlE4P9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1598'),
  ('1107680220906113489', 'Cape No. 7', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Wei Te-sheng', 'Wei Te-sheng', 'Van Fan, Chie Tanaka, Min-Hsiung, Ying Wei-min, Ma Nien-Hsien, Johnny Chung-Jen Lin, Joanne Yang, Shino Lin', null, 'Aga, a band singer, returns to Hengchun with frustration. Tomoko is a Japanese model assigned to organize a local warm-up band for the Japanese super star beach concert. Together with other five ordinary Hengchun residents who were not expected to be great or anything, they formed an impossible band.', 'Aga, a band singer, returns to Hengchun with frustration. Tomoko is a Japanese model assigned to organize a local warm-up band for the Japanese super star beach concert. Together with other five ordinary Hengchun residents who were not expected to be great or anything, they formed an impossible band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LUTL0OJcDiF9NbXgVQkCVJlEMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19939'),
  ('902745705281932935', 'Capitaine X', 1994, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jan Kounen, Jean Poisson', null, 'Abel Abouliaten, Dominique Bettenfeld, Rodolph Freytt, Eric Laugérias', null, 'You wake up in a warehouse where a bunch of degenerates is willing to execute you.', 'You wake up in a warehouse where a bunch of degenerates is willing to execute you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKb6JCYqxfd0aDFrN5oEukfsiEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135150'),
  ('812122981497639587', 'Capital', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Costa-Gavras, Éric Gautier, Scott Bunce', 'Karim Boukercha, Jean-Claude Grumberg, Costa-Gavras', 'Gad Elmaleh, Natacha Régnier, Gabriel Byrne, Bernard Le Coq, Liya Kebede, Céline Sallette, Hippolyte Girardot, Paul Barrett', 'R', 'The head of a giant European investment bank desperately clings to power when an American hedge fund company tries to buy them out.', 'The head of a giant European investment bank desperately clings to power when an American hedge fund company tries to buy them out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vUOc5i1nDaP4gmTQ9rpEsUJOUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121793'),
  ('740986437499669119', 'Capital in the Twenty-First Century', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Justin Pemberton, Darryl Ward', null, 'Thomas Piketty, Ian Bremmer, Lucas Chancel, Bryce Edwards, Rana Foroohar, Francis Fukuyama, Simon Johnson, Paul Mason', null, 'Film adaptation of French economist Thomas Piketty''s ground-breaking global bestseller of the same name: an eye-opening journey through wealth and power.', 'Film adaptation of French economist Thomas Piketty''s ground-breaking global bestseller of the same name: an eye-opening journey through wealth and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfxi1TZ5OwYMoz4OWjuQlcxI3VQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603106'),
  ('827699041581674045', 'Capitalism: A Love Story', 2009, 'Documentary, History', 'Michael Moore, Eric Merola', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore, Elijah Cummings, Marcy Kaptur, Bernie Sanders, Elizabeth Warren, Thora Birch, Baron Hill, Wallace Shawn', 'R', 'Michael Moore comes home to the issue he''s been examining throughout his career: the disastrous impact of corporate dominance on the everyday lives of Americans (and by default, the rest of the world).', 'Michael Moore comes home to the issue he''s been examining throughout his career: the disastrous impact of corporate dominance on the everyday lives of Americans (and by default, the rest of the world).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJBkIPakBXdu3cEgGqKCPHUNXVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22074'),
  ('393154240013508629', 'Capitán de Rurales', 1951, null, 'Alejandro Galindo', null, 'Luis Aguilar, Alicia Caro, Agustín Isunza, José Elías Moreno, Julio Villarreal, Miguel Manzano', null, 'Idealistic young police officer deals with corruption in local government.', 'Idealistic young police officer deals with corruption in local government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JzIe7XrH2a6yfAhTBZekbaprVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343030'),
  ('576008005360887295', 'Capitu and the Chapter', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Júlio Bressane, Lucas Barbi', 'Júlio Bressane', 'Mariana Ximenes, Enrique Díaz, Vladimir Brichta, Djin Sganzerla, Saulo Rodrigues, Cláudio Mendes, Josie Antello', null, '“If you had to choose between me and your mother, who would it be?” Capitu asks provocatively of her problematic lover. Elsewhere, they dance to inaudible music with their friends, each couple keeping to a rhythm of their own. At times, this depiction of the memories we see one Dom Casmurro commit to paper with a flamboyant pen seems to be an interplay of conflicting emotions – particularly when jealousy raises its head. Adapted from the Brazilian classic novel ''Dom Casmurro'' (1899) by Machado de Assis as an ironic/philosophical essay on poetry and jealousy, and featuring fragments of Bressane’s previous works.', '“If you had to choose between me and your mother, who would it be?” Capitu asks provocatively of her problematic lover. Elsewhere, they dance to inaudible music with their friends, each couple keeping to a rhythm of their own. At times, this depiction of the memories we see one Dom Casmurro commit to paper with a flamboyant pen seems to be an interplay of conflicting emotions – particularly when jealousy raises its head. Adapted from the Brazilian classic novel ''Dom Casmurro'' (1899) by Machado de Assis as an ironic/philosophical essay on poetry and jealousy, and featuring fragments of Bressane’s previous works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwiTk067WV6tnpBz080vAb8v1Go.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818836'),
  ('242166682525824547', 'Capone', 1975, 'Crime, Drama', 'Steve Carver, Vilis Lapenieks, Eugene Mazzola', 'Howard Browne', 'Ben Gazzara, Harry Guardino, Sylvester Stallone, Susan Blakely, John Cassavetes, Frank Campanella, John Orchard, Carmen Argenziano', 'R', 'Young Al Capone catches the eye of Johnny Torrio, a criminal visiting New York from Chicago. Torrio invites Capone to move to Illinois to help run his Prohibition-era alcohol sales operation. Capone rises through the ranks of Torrio''s gang and eventually takes over. On top, he works to consolidate his power by eliminating his enemies, fixing elections to his advantage and getting rich. In his spare time, Capone courts the principled Iris Crawford.', 'Young Al Capone catches the eye of Johnny Torrio, a criminal visiting New York from Chicago. Torrio invites Capone to move to Illinois to help run his Prohibition-era alcohol sales operation. Capone rises through the ranks of Torrio''s gang and eventually takes over. On top, he works to consolidate his power by eliminating his enemies, fixing elections to his advantage and getting rich. In his spare time, Capone courts the principled Iris Crawford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBJIuRdfhl0h7GwaXIgrSe9asAa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18710'),
  ('35240094552089092', 'Capone', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tomas Deckaj, Scott Bowers, Spencer Davison', 'Josh Trank', 'Tom Hardy, Linda Cardellini, Matt Dillon, Kyle MacLachlan, Kathrine Narducci, Jack Lowden, Noel Fisher, Tilda Del Toro', 'R', 'The 47-year old Al Capone, after 10 years in prison, starts suffering from dementia and comes to be haunted by his violent past.', 'The 47-year old Al Capone, after 10 years in prison, starts suffering from dementia and comes to be haunted by his violent past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75gDv38UgRtAukSxNXcjatyQmEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429422'),
  ('1091313385568590', 'Capote', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bennett Miller, Adam Kimmel', 'Dan Futterman', 'Philip Seymour Hoffman, Catherine Keener, Clifton Collins Jr., Bruce Greenwood, Bob Balaban, Mark Pellegrino, Marshall Bell, Amy Ryan', 'R', 'A biopic of writer Truman Capote and his assignment for The New Yorker to write the non-fiction book "In Cold Blood".', 'A biopic of writer Truman Capote and his assignment for The New Yorker to write the non-fiction book "In Cold Blood".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzsxkZMnJvozpHQEl1KzO8KwWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398'),
  ('1049618928646055091', 'Cappuccino', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tamer Ruggli, Michael Facchin, René Schoenenberger', 'Tamer Ruggli', 'Benjamin Décosterd, Manuela Biedermann, Anton Ciurlia, Nathalie Sandoz, Isabel Sabino', null, 'Despite his marginal and extrovert looks, Jérémie is a shy teenager who keeps a heavy secret: his homosexuality. While trying to find his way between his classmate and sexual fantasy Damien and his very generous but protective mother Gina, his life is about to change.', 'Despite his marginal and extrovert looks, Jérémie is a shy teenager who keeps a heavy secret: his homosexuality. While trying to find his way between his classmate and sexual fantasy Damien and his very generous but protective mother Gina, his life is about to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MuBpmIA5xS65QXxMj8ORaiWGFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99779'),
  ('70414100095171134', 'Capri-Revolution', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Francesca Polic Greco, Edoardo Petti, Francesca Lepore', 'Ippolita Di Majo, Mario Martone', 'Marianna Fontana, Reinout Scholten van Aschat, Antonio Folletto, Gianluca Di Gennaro, Eduardo Scarpetta, Jenna Thiam, Ludovico Girardello, Lola Klamroth', null, 'In 1914, with Italy on the cusp of joining World War I, a group of foreign artists establishes a commune on the rural island of Capri, catching the attention of young Lucia, a local illiterate shepherdess who soon falls under their spell.', 'In 1914, with Italy on the cusp of joining World War I, a group of foreign artists establishes a commune on the rural island of Capri, catching the attention of young Lucia, a local illiterate shepherdess who soon falls under their spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKApLM89LJLUIbyjkbIYaorIyeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537880'),
  ('409302638621676368', 'Capricci', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Carmelo Bene, Fabio Garriba', 'Carmelo Bene', 'Carmelo Bene, Tonino Caputo, Anne Wiazemsky, Giovanni Davoli, Ornella Ferrari, Gian Carlo Fusco, Poldo Bendandi, Franco Gulà', null, 'After a fight in their apartment, the story of a writer and a painter are divided. The writer is dedicated with his partner Manon to provoke continuous accidents in a field in which car carcasses abound. The painter is recruited to kill, through a poisoned picture, the old Arden to allow the latter''s wife, Alice to live with her lover Mosbie.', 'After a fight in their apartment, the story of a writer and a painter are divided. The writer is dedicated with his partner Manon to provoke continuous accidents in a field in which car carcasses abound. The painter is recruited to kill, through a poisoned picture, the old Arden to allow the latter''s wife, Alice to live with her lover Mosbie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztbxBy33dNJj6RJJODGcjIdUPPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239210'),
  ('819632733675973933', 'Caprice', 1967, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Frank Tashlin, Leon Shamroy', 'Frank Tashlin, Jay Jayson', 'Doris Day, Richard Harris, Ray Walston, Jack Kruschen, Edward Mulhare, Lilia Skala, Irene Tsu, Michael Romanoff', 'NR', 'Patricia Foster, an industrial designer, causes chaos when she sells a secret cosmetics formula to a rival company.', 'Patricia Foster, an industrial designer, causes chaos when she sells a secret cosmetics formula to a rival company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zn6mHBrlOh5oqrm8EX3DMdYF88A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44769'),
  ('732540948636267772', 'Caprice', 1986, 'Fantasy', 'Chris O''Hare, Gary Davies, Roger Pomphrey', 'David Gale, Joanna Hogg', 'Tilda Swinton, Patti Palladin, Bruce Payne, Rachel Byrd, Marty Cruikshank, Emma Comber, Tatiana Strauss, Kate Lord', null, 'A girl finds herself inside a fashion magazine – Joanna Hogg''s graduation piece at the National Film and Television School starring a then unknown Tilda Swinton.', 'A girl finds herself inside a fashion magazine – Joanna Hogg''s graduation piece at the National Film and Television School starring a then unknown Tilda Swinton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mP0OJJdZcik4rQHyFn6lR7Xa8Yh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586745'),
  ('381858124974956540', 'Caprice', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Laurent Desmet', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Virginie Efira, Anaïs Demoustier, Laurent Stocker, Emmanuel Mouret, Thomas Blanchard, Mathilde Warnier, Olivier Cruveiller, Botum Dupuis', null, 'An average guy meets an actress who is more beautiful than he could ever imagine. But then a pesky girl materializes to make his life a living hell. His perfect girlfriend now thinks that he is involved with this Caprice.', 'An average guy meets an actress who is more beautiful than he could ever imagine. But then a pesky girl materializes to make his life a living hell. His perfect girlfriend now thinks that he is involved with this Caprice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onNsESlvFOWpqDmrg1tK0JMJDqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334299'),
  ('600295885361880284', 'Caprice Italian Style', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Bolognini, Pier Paolo Pasolini, Steno', 'Furio Scarpelli, Roberto Gianviti, Cesare Zavattini', 'Totò, Ugo D''Alessio, Regina Seiffert, Dante Maggio, Sandro Merli, Renzo Marignano, Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia', null, 'The film consists of six short stories created by different directors, but all the stories share one thing: a warm irony to current events.', 'The film consists of six short stories created by different directors, but all the stories share one thing: a warm irony to current events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68tPc0rVZU0dA14uqFgI2FUEgA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73741'),
  ('318462555913463037', 'Capricious Summer', 1968, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jiří Menzel, Anna Pokorná, Miloš Kohout', 'Jiří Menzel, Václav Nývlt', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Míla Myslíková, Vlastimil Brodský, František Řehák, Jana Preissová, Jiří Menzel, Bohuš Záhorský, Vlasta Jelínková', 'NR', 'Middle-aged Antonin and his friends, the major, now retired, and the canon, are in the river, swimming and philosophizing. Then it starts to rain. It just seems to be that sort of summer. Antonin runs the swimming bath with his portly wife Katherine... A man appears with his horse-drawn caravan. He lays a striped pole across the river and walks over. With a handstand and a magic trick, Ernie the Conjuror invites everyone to that evening''s performance... Ernie is a tightrope walker of only modest skill, but with a slim and beautiful assistant, Anna. Antonin speaks to her. The two spend the night in the change room by the river, Antonin massaging her feet all night long. Katherine decides to move into the caravan with Ernie. But now the major and even the canon sense Anna''s attractiveness...', 'Middle-aged Antonin and his friends, the major, now retired, and the canon, are in the river, swimming and philosophizing. Then it starts to rain. It just seems to be that sort of summer. Antonin runs the swimming bath with his portly wife Katherine... A man appears with his horse-drawn caravan. He lays a striped pole across the river and walks over. With a handstand and a magic trick, Ernie the Conjuror invites everyone to that evening''s performance... Ernie is a tightrope walker of only modest skill, but with a slim and beautiful assistant, Anna. Antonin speaks to her. The two spend the night in the change room by the river, Antonin massaging her feet all night long. Katherine decides to move into the caravan with Ernie. But now the major and even the canon sense Anna''s attractiveness...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQvgIj2P8LyjqIjUotlO2XehfWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47189'),
  ('288295303838216103', 'Capricorn One', 1977, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Peter Hyams, Bill Butler, Irby Smith', 'Peter Hyams', 'Elliott Gould, James Brolin, Brenda Vaccaro, Sam Waterston, O. J. Simpson, Hal Holbrook, Karen Black, Telly Savalas', 'PG', 'In order to protect the reputation of the American space program, a team of NASA administrators turn the first Mars mission into a phony Mars landing. Under threat of harm to their families the astronauts play their part in the deception on a staged set in a deserted military base. But once the real ship returns to Earth and burns up on re-entry, the astronauts become liabilities. Now, with the help of a crusading reporter, they must battle a sinister conspiracy that will stop at nothing to keep the truth hidden.', 'In order to protect the reputation of the American space program, a team of NASA administrators turn the first Mars mission into a phony Mars landing. Under threat of harm to their families the astronauts play their part in the deception on a staged set in a deserted military base. But once the real ship returns to Earth and burns up on re-entry, the astronauts become liabilities. Now, with the help of a crusading reporter, they must battle a sinister conspiracy that will stop at nothing to keep the truth hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxsCARg2rxQ2PzFW5ZsADLT9e9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11935'),
  ('203714392700085339', 'Capsule', 2016, 'Drama, History, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Andrew Martin, Felix Forrest, Clare Cahill', 'Andrew Martin', 'Edmund Kingsley, Lisa Greenwood, David Wayman, Nigel Barber, Gil Kolirin, Michael Koltes, Ged Petkunas, Edgar Rove', 'PG-13', '1959: Guy is an experienced British fighter pilot who is in command of Britain''s first manned mission to space. He has trained for this for three years at the height of the Cold War and now he is alone in space, suffering Hypoxia, with a malfunctioning capsule. He has limited contact with the UK, some unusual communication with the US and some unorthodox communication with Tyuratam deep in Soviet Russia. Can he get home? Who will help him? Will he make the right choice?', '1959: Guy is an experienced British fighter pilot who is in command of Britain''s first manned mission to space. He has trained for this for three years at the height of the Cold War and now he is alone in space, suffering Hypoxia, with a malfunctioning capsule. He has limited contact with the UK, some unusual communication with the US and some unorthodox communication with Tyuratam deep in Soviet Russia. Can he get home? Who will help him? Will he make the right choice?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLvS3Mwd9TXiIpGlzClO35N3tw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395560'),
  ('495887175862606495', 'Capt. Grant''s Family', 1936, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Vladimir Vaynshtok, David Gutman, Vyacheslav Leshchyov', 'Oleg Leonidov', 'Nikolai Vitovtov, Mariya Strelkova, Nikolai Cherkasov, Yakov Segel, David Gutman, Olga Bazanova, Mikhail Romanov, Pyotr Repnin', null, 'The son and daughter of a lost-at-sea captain recruit help to find him on the basis of an incomplete note found in a bottle, and encounter adventures in Patagonia, Australia, and New Zealand... Based on Jules Verne novel.', 'The son and daughter of a lost-at-sea captain recruit help to find him on the basis of an incomplete note found in a bottle, and encounter adventures in Patagonia, Australia, and New Zealand... Based on Jules Verne novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91Kvy3D1vswyOlAQOPNCniVlO5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243753'),
  ('880434943383325132', 'Captain Alatriste: The Spanish Musketeer', 2006, 'Action', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes, Paco Femenía, Alejandro Fernández', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes', 'Viggo Mortensen, Elena Anaya, Unax Ugalde, Eduard Fernández, Eduardo Noriega, Ariadna Gil, Juan Echanove, Javier Cámara', 'PG', 'In 17th century Spain Diego Alatriste, a brave and heroic soldier, is fighting in his King''s army in the Flandes region. His best mate, Balboa, falls in a trap and, near to death, asks Diego to look after his son and teach him to be a soldier.', 'In 17th century Spain Diego Alatriste, a brave and heroic soldier, is fighting in his King''s army in the Flandes region. His best mate, Balboa, falls in a trap and, near to death, asks Diego to look after his son and teach him to be a soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ4b8dXp0uCqslHm0jOvjw4BNUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13495'),
  ('830918212596075254', 'Captain America', 1944, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'John English, Elmer Clifton, John MacBurnie', 'Jesse Duffy, Joseph F. Poland, Grant Nelson', 'Dick Purcell, Lorna Gray, Lionel Atwill, Charles Trowbridge, Russell Hicks, George J. Lewis, John Davidson, Frank Reicher', null, 'Superhero Captain America battles the evil forces of the archvillain called The Scarab, who poisons his enemies and steals a secret device capable of destroying buildings by sound vibrations.', 'Superhero Captain America battles the evil forces of the archvillain called The Scarab, who poisons his enemies and steals a secret device capable of destroying buildings by sound vibrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBRcChS66NohR3x6KVYMp6Obutt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106355'),
  ('327579888756611656', 'Captain America', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Rod Holcomb, Ronald W. Browne', null, 'Reb Brown, Len Birman, Heather Menzies, Robin Mattson, Joseph Ruskin, Lance LeGault, Frank Marth, Steve Forrest', 'NR', 'Artist Steve Rogers is nearly murdered by spies, seeking his late father''s national secrets. He is saved during surgery via a secret formula; this serum not only heals him but also gives him fantastic strength and lightning reflexes. To help solve the mystery behind his father’s murder and bring those guilty to justice, a government agency equips him with a special motorcycle loaded with gadgets and an indestructible shield. Now armed, he battles against the nation''s enemies as the Sentinel of Liberty, Captain America.', 'Artist Steve Rogers is nearly murdered by spies, seeking his late father''s national secrets. He is saved during surgery via a secret formula; this serum not only heals him but also gives him fantastic strength and lightning reflexes. To help solve the mystery behind his father’s murder and bring those guilty to justice, a government agency equips him with a special motorcycle loaded with gadgets and an indestructible shield. Now armed, he battles against the nation''s enemies as the Sentinel of Liberty, Captain America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNGq4u0cymxZqGADZrx7AWrSB5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197467'),
  ('908782411912700922', 'Captain America', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, War', 'Albert Pyun, Tom Elliott, Michael Katleman', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Matt Salinger, Ronny Cox, Ned Beatty, Darren McGavin, Michael Nouri, Scott Paulin, Kim Gillingham, Melinda Dillon', 'PG-13', 'During World War II, a brave, patriotic American Soldier undergoes experiments to become a new supersoldier, "Captain America". Racing to Germany to sabotage the rockets of Nazi baddie "Red Skull", Captain America winds up frozen until the 1990s. He reawakens to find that the Red Skull has changed identities and is now planning to kidnap the President of the United States.', 'During World War II, a brave, patriotic American Soldier undergoes experiments to become a new supersoldier, "Captain America". Racing to Germany to sabotage the rockets of Nazi baddie "Red Skull", Captain America winds up frozen until the 1990s. He reawakens to find that the Red Skull has changed identities and is now planning to kidnap the President of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdHrLFfHcJX9nlvUfG3LK2a2hq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13995'),
  ('165154234820665905', 'Captain America II: Death Too Soon', 1979, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Ivan Nagy, Vincent A. Martinelli, Rod Holcomb', 'Wilton Schiller, Patricia Payne', 'Reb Brown, Connie Sellecca, Len Birman, Christopher Lee, Katherine Justice, Christopher Cary, William Lucking, Stanley Kamel', null, 'Crimefighting Captain America rights more wrongs by doing battle with a fanatical terrorist who uses his deadly drug that causes accelerated aging to finance his world revolution.', 'Crimefighting Captain America rights more wrongs by doing battle with a fanatical terrorist who uses his deadly drug that causes accelerated aging to finance his world revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pocmh0P8Ddf5w33pP3Vuqm0JRP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197481'),
  ('453750981349145420', 'Captain America: Brave New World', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Julius Onah, Michele Panelli-Venetis, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Julius Onah, Peter Glanz, Rob Edwards', 'Anthony Mackie, Harrison Ford, Danny Ramirez, Shira Haas, Tim Blake Nelson, Carl Lumbly, Giancarlo Esposito, Liv Tyler', 'PG-13', 'After meeting with newly elected U.S. President Thaddeus Ross, Sam finds himself in the middle of an international incident. He must discover the reason behind a nefarious global plot before the true mastermind has the entire world seeing red.', 'After meeting with newly elected U.S. President Thaddeus Ross, Sam finds himself in the middle of an international incident. He must discover the reason behind a nefarious global plot before the true mastermind has the entire world seeing red.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzIddUEMWhWzfvLI3TwxUG2wGoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822119'),
  ('63354305353969287', 'Captain America: Civil War', 2016, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Darrin Prescott, Trent Opaloch, Greg Berry', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Chris Evans, Robert Downey Jr., Scarlett Johansson, Sebastian Stan, Anthony Mackie, Don Cheadle, Jeremy Renner, Chadwick Boseman', 'PG-13', 'Following the events of Age of Ultron, the collective governments of the world pass an act designed to regulate all superhuman activity. This polarizes opinion amongst the Avengers, causing two factions to side with Iron Man or Captain America, which causes an epic battle between former allies.', 'Following the events of Age of Ultron, the collective governments of the world pass an act designed to regulate all superhuman activity. This polarizes opinion amongst the Avengers, causing two factions to side with Iron Man or Captain America, which causes an epic battle between former allies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAGiXaUfPzY7CDEyNKUofk3Kw2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271110'),
  ('194611235299693115', 'Captain America: The First Avenger', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Joe Johnston, Shelly Johnson, Jonathan Taylor', 'Stephen McFeely, Christopher Markus', 'Chris Evans, Hayley Atwell, Sebastian Stan, Tommy Lee Jones, Hugo Weaving, Dominic Cooper, Richard Armitage, Stanley Tucci', 'PG-13', 'During World War II, Steve Rogers is a sickly man from Brooklyn who''s transformed into super-soldier Captain America to aid in the war effort. Rogers must stop the Red Skull – Adolf Hitler''s ruthless head of weaponry, and the leader of an organization that intends to use a mysterious device of untold powers for world domination.', 'During World War II, Steve Rogers is a sickly man from Brooklyn who''s transformed into super-soldier Captain America to aid in the war effort. Rogers must stop the Red Skull – Adolf Hitler''s ruthless head of weaponry, and the leader of an organization that intends to use a mysterious device of untold powers for world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSNxAJTlD0r02V9sPYpOjqDZXUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1771'),
  ('258423324601823219', 'Captain America: The Winter Soldier', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Thomas Valentine, Joe Russo, Anthony Russo', 'Stephen McFeely, Christopher Markus', 'Chris Evans, Samuel L. Jackson, Scarlett Johansson, Robert Redford, Sebastian Stan, Anthony Mackie, Cobie Smulders, Frank Grillo', 'PG-13', 'After the cataclysmic events in New York with The Avengers, Steve Rogers, aka Captain America is living quietly in Washington, D.C. and trying to adjust to the modern world. But when a S.H.I.E.L.D. colleague comes under attack, Steve becomes embroiled in a web of intrigue that threatens to put the world at risk. Joining forces with the Black Widow, Captain America struggles to expose the ever-widening conspiracy while fighting off professional assassins sent to silence him at every turn. When the full scope of the villainous plot is revealed, Captain America and the Black Widow enlist the help of a new ally, the Falcon. However, they soon find themselves up against an unexpected and formidable enemy—the Winter Soldier.', 'After the cataclysmic events in New York with The Avengers, Steve Rogers, aka Captain America is living quietly in Washington, D.C. and trying to adjust to the modern world. But when a S.H.I.E.L.D. colleague comes under attack, Steve becomes embroiled in a web of intrigue that threatens to put the world at risk. Joining forces with the Black Widow, Captain America struggles to expose the ever-widening conspiracy while fighting off professional assassins sent to silence him at every turn. When the full scope of the villainous plot is revealed, Captain America and the Black Widow enlist the help of a new ally, the Falcon. However, they soon find themselves up against an unexpected and formidable enemy—the Winter Soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVFRpFw3xTedgPGqxW0AOI8Qhh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100402'),
  ('641033142311028965', 'Captain Apache', 1971, 'Western', 'Alexander Singer, Adolfo Aristarain, Martín Sacristán', 'Milton Sperling, Philip Yordan', 'Lee Van Cleef, Carroll Baker, Stuart Whitman, Percy Herbert, Elisa Montés, Tony Vogel, Charles Stalmaker, Charly Bravo', 'PG', 'The title character is a US army Captain of Native American descent who is asked to investigate the murder of an Indian agent. His only clue is "April morning", the last words spoken by the victim. Can he unravel the mystery before the clock runs out?', 'The title character is a US army Captain of Native American descent who is asked to investigate the murder of an Indian agent. His only clue is "April morning", the last words spoken by the victim. Can he unravel the mystery before the clock runs out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIjIPEb06ZivzJYwImj0CJ5QARx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104974'),
  ('399377981323724348', 'Captain Avispa', 2024, 'Animation, Family', 'Jean Gabriel Guerra, Jonathan Meléndez', 'Juan Luis Guerra, Miguel Yarull', 'Luis Fonsi, Joy Huerta, Juanes, José Guillermo Cortines, Amelia Vega, Karen Martínez, Adalgisa Pantaleón, Roger Zayas-Bazán', 'NR', 'In Avispatropolis, the fearless Captain Avispa emerges as an exemplary protector of the city, whose courage and convictions always prevail over the forces of evil. His unbreakable power is nourished by absolute sincerity, as he would lose his strength if he dared to weave deceit. Only in pursuit of noble causes does he allow himself to deviate from the truth. As is common in stories of this kind, Captain Wasp is surrounded by a constellation of close friends and arch-enemies, whose stories have their origins in the artist''s songs.', 'In Avispatropolis, the fearless Captain Avispa emerges as an exemplary protector of the city, whose courage and convictions always prevail over the forces of evil. His unbreakable power is nourished by absolute sincerity, as he would lose his strength if he dared to weave deceit. Only in pursuit of noble causes does he allow himself to deviate from the truth. As is common in stories of this kind, Captain Wasp is surrounded by a constellation of close friends and arch-enemies, whose stories have their origins in the artist''s songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmthz3CuFljmBQcfuaz4hBNwbQ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1198426'),
  ('58453217248014132', 'Captain Blood', 1935, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Ernest Haller, Hal Mohr', 'Casey Robinson', 'Errol Flynn, Olivia de Havilland, Lionel Atwill, Basil Rathbone, Ross Alexander, Guy Kibbee, Henry Stephenson, Robert Barrat', 'NR', 'Dr. Peter Blood, unjustly convicted of treason and exiled from England, becomes a notorious pirate.', 'Dr. Peter Blood, unjustly convicted of treason and exiled from England, becomes a notorious pirate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ae0ltppMl66pAH1odgDU1C4H1iq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16905'),
  ('768396886815647789', 'Captain Blood', 1960, 'Action, Adventure', 'André Hunebelle', 'Pierre Foucaud, André Hunebelle, Jean Halain', 'Jean Marais, Bourvil, Elsa Martinelli, Pierrette Bruno, Arnoldo Foà, Lise Delamare, Annie Anderson, Guy Delorme', null, 'Le capitan is a 1960 French-Italian swashbuckler film directed by André Hunebelle and starring Jean Marais, Bourvil, Elsa Martinelli and Lise Delamare. It is based on a novel by Michel Zévaco.', 'Le capitan is a 1960 French-Italian swashbuckler film directed by André Hunebelle and starring Jean Marais, Bourvil, Elsa Martinelli and Lise Delamare. It is based on a novel by Michel Zévaco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rd4wdM2AufLCEFAWmuFcTkBiKEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56268'),
  ('741078989142988802', 'Captain Carey, U.S.A.', 1950, 'Mystery, Thriller, War', 'Mitchell Leisen, John F. Seitz', 'Robert Thoeren', 'Alan Ladd, Wanda Hendrix, Francis Lederer, Joseph Calleia, Celia Lovsky, Richard Avonde, Frank Puglia, Luis Alberni', 'NR', 'Near the end of World War II, a secret American raid on an enemy transportation hub goes very wrong when a turncoat warns the enemy. Led by Capt. Webster Carey, the mission causes the deaths of many bystanders -- among them, Carey believes, his Italian girlfriend, Giulia de Graffi. Back home, Carey stumbles across evidence that might uncover the identity of the informant. But, when he returns to Italy to get even, Carey is stunned by what he finds.', 'Near the end of World War II, a secret American raid on an enemy transportation hub goes very wrong when a turncoat warns the enemy. Led by Capt. Webster Carey, the mission causes the deaths of many bystanders -- among them, Carey believes, his Italian girlfriend, Giulia de Graffi. Back home, Carey stumbles across evidence that might uncover the identity of the informant. But, when he returns to Italy to get even, Carey is stunned by what he finds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54VkPpMmkZM4GQcESIG6s0PuvHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129529'),
  ('824515897237060789', 'Captain Caution', 1940, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Richard Wallace, Norbert Brodine', 'Grover Jones', 'Victor Mature, Louise Platt, Leo Carrillo, Bruce Cabot, Robert Barrat, Vivienne Osborne, Alan Ladd, Miles Mander', null, 'When her father dies, a young girl helps a young man take command of the ship to fight the British during the war of 1812.', 'When her father dies, a young girl helps a young man take command of the ship to fight the British during the war of 1812.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvsrvuhKtZ3I1ABjfBVIiGHxRCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151970'),
  ('454862197779199137', 'Captain Clegg', 1962, 'Adventure, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Peter Graham Scott, Arthur Grant, John Peverall', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Peter Cushing, Patrick Allen, Oliver Reed, Yvonne Romain, Michael Ripper, Martin Benson, David Lodge, Derek Francis', null, 'A captain and his sailors investigate the rampaging "Marsh Phantoms" terrorizing a coastal town, but their search is hindered by a local reverend and a horrifying curse.', 'A captain and his sailors investigate the rampaging "Marsh Phantoms" terrorizing a coastal town, but their search is hindered by a local reverend and a horrifying curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wQbnaBidXchb2WSSCdEFgX0ZyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19201'),
  ('491142414204560815', 'Captain Conan', 1996, 'Drama, War', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Alain Choquart, Cătălin Dordea', 'Jean Cosmos, Bertrand Tavernier', 'Philippe Torreton, Samuel Le Bihan, Bernard Le Coq, Catherine Rich, François Berléand, Claude Rich, André Falcon, Claude Brosset', null, 'The last days of World War I, Eastern front. Captain Conan, a lone wolf, a true warrior, leads a band of ruthless French fighters who love hand-to-hand combat; they are not fit for peacetime, they only feel really alive in the chaos of the battlefield.', 'The last days of World War I, Eastern front. Captain Conan, a lone wolf, a true warrior, leads a band of ruthless French fighters who love hand-to-hand combat; they are not fit for peacetime, they only feel really alive in the chaos of the battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5prF2brzZEFSqBC5v8d7AemMIQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46334'),
  ('843934504852885184', 'Captain Corelli''s Mandolin', 2001, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'John Madden, John Toll, Deborah Saban', 'Shawn Slovo', 'Nicolas Cage, Penélope Cruz, John Hurt, Christian Bale, David Morrissey, Irene Papas, Gerasimos Skiadaresis, Aspasia Kralli', 'R', 'When a fisherman leaves to fight with the Greek army during World War II, his fiancée falls in love with the local Italian commander.', 'When a fisherman leaves to fight with the Greek army during World War II, his fiancée falls in love with the local Italian commander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YahF8HFypIKFTvOTiYzObA0hom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1722'),
  ('236199683404540887', 'Captain EO', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Music', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Rusty Lemorande, Francis Ford Coppola, George Lucas', 'Michael Jackson, Anjelica Huston, Dick Shawn, Tony Cox, Debbie Lee Carrington, Cindy Sorensen, Gary DePew', null, 'Captain EO and his crew journey to a dark, mechanical world to deliver a gift to the tyrannical Supreme Leader, using the power of music and dance to transform her realm from darkness into light.', 'Captain EO and his crew journey to a dark, mechanical world to deliver a gift to the tyrannical Supreme Leader, using the power of music and dance to transform her realm from darkness into light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7sZDYAMU9Ph42GiyTF8nyKVUKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1500440'),
  ('916359581984638803', 'Captain Fandis Bastounis', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Kostas Lyhnaras', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Labros Konstadaras, Maro Kodou, Lavrentis Dianellos, Dimitris Nikolaidis, Tasso Kavadia, Thanos Martinos, Mitsi Konstadara, Despoina Stylianopoulou', null, 'Captain Andreas, a widower master learns that the planned departure postponed and the crew discovers hidden in the ship''s refrigerator a girl, Marina. The company and the kind of behavior makes him take her with him to his home in Poros, which is home to the sister of Royal and two nephews. The presence of the marina there inflamed passions and causes the scheming sister, culminating when he set sail for the trip. When his ship sinks and he is considered missing, his sister declares him dead, eliminates the Marina and trying to reap his fortune with the help of their lawyer. Some time later, Andrew returns secretly finds Marina, marries her and takes her to his home, where enforce order ...', 'Captain Andreas, a widower master learns that the planned departure postponed and the crew discovers hidden in the ship''s refrigerator a girl, Marina. The company and the kind of behavior makes him take her with him to his home in Poros, which is home to the sister of Royal and two nephews. The presence of the marina there inflamed passions and causes the scheming sister, culminating when he set sail for the trip. When his ship sinks and he is considered missing, his sister declares him dead, eliminates the Marina and trying to reap his fortune with the help of their lawyer. Some time later, Andrew returns secretly finds Marina, marries her and takes her to his home, where enforce order ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjXUQVhy74p1uVLut6IfG9RbNzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377117'),
  ('333990396370585110', 'Captain Fantastic', 2016, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Matt Ross, Stéphane Fontaine', 'Matt Ross', 'Viggo Mortensen, George MacKay, Samantha Isler, Annalise Basso, Nicholas Hamilton, Shree Crooks, Charlie Shotwell, Trin Miller', 'R', 'Deep in the forests of the Pacific Northwest, a father devoted to raising his six kids with a rigorous physical and intellectual education is forced to leave his paradise and enter the world, beginning a journey that challenges his idea of what it means to be a parent.', 'Deep in the forests of the Pacific Northwest, a father devoted to raising his six kids with a rigorous physical and intellectual education is forced to leave his paradise and enter the world, beginning a journey that challenges his idea of what it means to be a parent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sFME73GaD8UsUxPUKe60cPdLif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334533'),
  ('239920714150169578', 'Captain Fracasse', 1961, 'Adventure', 'Marcel Grignon, Pierre Gaspard-Huit, Jacques Bourdon', 'Albert Vidalie, Pierre Gaspard-Huit', 'Jean Marais, Geneviève Grad, Gérard Barray, Riccardo Garrone, Danielle Godet, Sophie Grimaldi, Sacha Pitoëff, Philippe Noiret', null, 'A ruined Baron Philippe de baron, meets one day a troupe of traveling actors led by Herod. Attracted by the one who plays the role of the ingenue: Isabella, and by the dynamism and enthusiasm of his companions, he takes the place of the deceased poet of the troupe. And during performances, Philippe became the captain Sunder. For his part, Isabelle loves Philip, but does not consider marriage, nobility him missing, she refuses to harm the career of Baron. And one day, the Duke of Vallombrosa, seduced by Isabella, finds himself challenged to a duel by Philippe for touching the girl. Defeated, he launched his men against Sunder, then removes Isabelle. The actors throw themselves then to storm the castle where she is being held. This time Vallombrosa was seriously injured, and the duke''s own father, rushed to the scene, Isabelle discovers the girl he had once been an actress. Nothing stands now the union of Sunder and Isabella, under the tender gaze of the actors Herod and Scapin.', 'A ruined Baron Philippe de baron, meets one day a troupe of traveling actors led by Herod. Attracted by the one who plays the role of the ingenue: Isabella, and by the dynamism and enthusiasm of his companions, he takes the place of the deceased poet of the troupe. And during performances, Philippe became the captain Sunder. For his part, Isabelle loves Philip, but does not consider marriage, nobility him missing, she refuses to harm the career of Baron. And one day, the Duke of Vallombrosa, seduced by Isabella, finds himself challenged to a duel by Philippe for touching the girl. Defeated, he launched his men against Sunder, then removes Isabelle. The actors throw themselves then to storm the castle where she is being held. This time Vallombrosa was seriously injured, and the duke''s own father, rushed to the scene, Isabelle discovers the girl he had once been an actress. Nothing stands now the union of Sunder and Isabella, under the tender gaze of the actors Herod and Scapin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11Y05lCjVhdSeOUeNNin1cyG9OK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4732'),
  ('463599068528983651', 'Captain from Castile', 1947, 'Adventure', 'Henry King, Arthur E. Arling, Charles G. Clarke', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Tyrone Power, Jean Peters, Cesar Romero, Lee J. Cobb, John Sutton, Antonio Moreno, Thomas Gomez, Alan Mowbray', 'NR', 'Spain, 1518: young caballero Pedro De Vargas offends his sadistic neighbor De Silva, who just happens to be an officer of the Inquisition. Forced to flee, Pedro, friend Juan Garcia, and adoring servant girl Catana join Cortez'' first expedition to Mexico. Arriving in the rich new land, Cortez decides to switch from exploration to conquest...with only 500 men. Embroiled in continuous adventures and a romantic interlude, Pedro almost forgets he has a deadly enemy...', 'Spain, 1518: young caballero Pedro De Vargas offends his sadistic neighbor De Silva, who just happens to be an officer of the Inquisition. Forced to flee, Pedro, friend Juan Garcia, and adoring servant girl Catana join Cortez'' first expedition to Mexico. Arriving in the rich new land, Cortez decides to switch from exploration to conquest...with only 500 men. Embroiled in continuous adventures and a romantic interlude, Pedro almost forgets he has a deadly enemy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DojmAjGSnISbZLg7C1Bb6dvXVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44534'),
  ('103035704219596550', 'Captain Hareblower', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Bugs will not bend to the threats of the pirate Yosemite Sam.', 'Bugs will not bend to the threats of the pirate Yosemite Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNPD6BMLWT4zmQdFwYnhjUUbxQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235795'),
  ('1000788905629276560', 'Captain Hook: The Cursed Tides', 2025, 'Adventure, Action, Horror', 'Lars Janssen', 'J.M. Barrie, Lars Janssen', 'Sean Cronin, Ewen Weatherburn, Cameron Ashplant, Richard Rowden, Destiny Viva, Brandon Ashplant, Dean Marshall, Dave Hyett', null, 'In the aftermath of a devastating defeat by his archnemesis Admiral Smee, Captain Hook finds refuge in the coastal town of Eldritch Landing.', 'In the aftermath of a devastating defeat by his archnemesis Admiral Smee, Captain Hook finds refuge in the coastal town of Eldritch Landing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKE2xPJs87V9DbDmoo8igAsDeH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1511789'),
  ('552460043254789048', 'Captain Horatio Hornblower R.N.', 1951, 'Adventure, War, History', 'Raoul Walsh, Guy Green, Louis Levy', 'Æneas MacKenzie, Ivan Goff, Ben Roberts', 'Gregory Peck, Virginia Mayo, Robert Beatty, Moultrie Kelsall, Terence Morgan, James Kenney, James Robertson Justice, Denis O''Dea', 'NR', 'Captain Horatio Hornblower leads his ship HMS Lydia on a perilous transatlantic voyage, during which his faithful crew battle both a Spanish warship and a ragged band of Central American rebels.', 'Captain Horatio Hornblower leads his ship HMS Lydia on a perilous transatlantic voyage, during which his faithful crew battle both a Spanish warship and a ragged band of Central American rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oielnqLw4gVpaJDN6QTOapCqRXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23928'),
  ('234982440853129788', 'Captain January', 1924, 'Drama', 'Edward F. Cline, Robert Ives, Glen MacWilliams', null, 'Hobart Bosworth, Baby Peggy, Irene Rich, Lincoln Stedman, Harry T. Morey, Barbara Tennant, Wilmuth Merkyl, Emmett King', 'NR', 'During a tempestuous storm, a lighthouse keeper finds an infant girl who washes ashore tied to some wreckage. He adopts her and they become inseparable. Eventually her real family finds her and wants her to live with them.', 'During a tempestuous storm, a lighthouse keeper finds an infant girl who washes ashore tied to some wreckage. He adopts her and they become inseparable. Eventually her real family finds her and wants her to live with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IjNfi9kGgfBclnEQy5BNJvhOGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148326'),
  ('680522414153098278', 'Captain January', 1936, 'Comedy, Family', 'David Butler, John F. Seitz', 'Sam Hellman, Harry Tugend, Gladys Lehman', 'Shirley Temple, Guy Kibbee, Slim Summerville, Buddy Ebsen, Sara Haden, Jane Darwell, June Lang, Jerry Tucker', 'G', 'A little girl named Star lives with a lighthouse keeper who rescued her when her parents drowned. A truant officer decides she should go to boarding school but she''s rescued by relatives.', 'A little girl named Star lives with a lighthouse keeper who rescued her when her parents drowned. A truant officer decides she should go to boarding school but she''s rescued by relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iRxFqWmhCfEa39EElGfw10wKVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57840'),
  ('1028833336887910903', 'Captain Kidd', 1945, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Rowland V. Lee, Archie Stout, Joseph Depew', 'Norman Reilly Raine', 'Charles Laughton, Randolph Scott, Barbara Britton, Reginald Owen, John Carradine, Gilbert Roland, John Qualen, Sheldon Leonard', 'NR', 'Cutthroat pirate William Kidd captures Admiral Blayne''s treasure ship and hides the bounty in a cave. Three years later, Kidd, posing as a respectable merchant captain, offers his services to the King of England. Seeking a social position, Kidd also negotiates for Blayne''s title and lands, provided he can prove Blayne was associated with piracy. Launched upon his royal mission, Kidd is unaware that Blayne''s son Adam is among the crew, determined to clear his father''s name.', 'Cutthroat pirate William Kidd captures Admiral Blayne''s treasure ship and hides the bounty in a cave. Three years later, Kidd, posing as a respectable merchant captain, offers his services to the King of England. Seeking a social position, Kidd also negotiates for Blayne''s title and lands, provided he can prove Blayne was associated with piracy. Launched upon his royal mission, Kidd is unaware that Blayne''s son Adam is among the crew, determined to clear his father''s name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6Ag6fl5wRX1lwVXq5fP6lHYpsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15401'),
  ('454225629102993279', 'Captain Kronos: Vampire Hunter', 1973, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Brian Clemens', 'Brian Clemens', 'Horst Janson, John Cater, Caroline Munro, John Carson, Shane Briant, Lois Daine, Ian Hendry, Wanda Ventham', 'R', 'When several young girls are found dead, left hideously aged and void of blood, Dr. Marcus suspects vampirism. He enlists the help of the Vampire Hunter. Mysterious and powerful, Kronos has dedicated his life to destroying the evil pestilence. Once a victim of its diabolical depravity, he knows the vampire''s strengths and weaknesses as well as the extreme dangers attached to confronting the potent forces of darkness.', 'When several young girls are found dead, left hideously aged and void of blood, Dr. Marcus suspects vampirism. He enlists the help of the Vampire Hunter. Mysterious and powerful, Kronos has dedicated his life to destroying the evil pestilence. Once a victim of its diabolical depravity, he knows the vampire''s strengths and weaknesses as well as the extreme dangers attached to confronting the potent forces of darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4i6vRcVl9sE3W7ouQ8KC2B5NiJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18979'),
  ('1117143696839182380', 'Captain Lightfoot', 1955, 'Adventure, Romance, History', 'Irving Glassberg, Douglas Sirk', 'W.R. Burnett, Oscar Brodney', 'Rock Hudson, Barbara Rush, Jeff Morrow, Kathleen Ryan, Finlay Currie, Denis O''Dea, Geoffrey Toone, Hilton Edwards', 'NR', 'In 1815, Michael Martin, member of an Irish revolutionary society, turns highwayman to support it, and soon becomes an outlaw. In Dublin, he meets famous rebel "Captain Thunderbolt" and becomes his second-in-command, under the name "Lightfoot."', 'In 1815, Michael Martin, member of an Irish revolutionary society, turns highwayman to support it, and soon becomes an outlaw. In Dublin, he meets famous rebel "Captain Thunderbolt" and becomes his second-in-command, under the name "Lightfoot."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOFq8afzYQiZ35kW9xZgXHwcj22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130461'),
  ('1010654163473092601', 'Captain Marvel', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ryan Fleck, Ben Davis, Anna Boden', 'Geneva Robertson-Dworet, Ryan Fleck, Anna Boden', 'Brie Larson, Samuel L. Jackson, Ben Mendelsohn, Jude Law, Annette Bening, Djimon Hounsou, Lee Pace, Lashana Lynch', 'PG-13', 'The story follows Carol Danvers as she becomes one of the universe’s most powerful heroes when Earth is caught in the middle of a galactic war between two alien races. Set in the 1990s, Captain Marvel is an all-new adventure from a previously unseen period in the history of the Marvel Cinematic Universe.', 'The story follows Carol Danvers as she becomes one of the universe’s most powerful heroes when Earth is caught in the middle of a galactic war between two alien races. Set in the 1990s, Captain Marvel is an all-new adventure from a previously unseen period in the history of the Marvel Cinematic Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtsgWhDnHTq68L0lLsUrCnM7TjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299537'),
  ('823462250545261827', 'Captain Miller', 2024, 'Action, War', 'Arun Matheswaran, Siddhartha Nuni', 'Arun Matheswaran', 'Dhanush, Priyanka Arul Mohan, Nivedhithaa Sathish, Elango Kumaravel, Shiva Rajkumar, Sundeep Kishan, Edward Sonnenblick, John Kokken', null, 'In the 1930s, during the British Raj, Analeesan "Eesa", a former soldier of the British Indian Army called Captain Miller, is on a mission to protect the people from the British after witnessing an atrocity.', 'In the 1930s, during the British Raj, Analeesan "Eesa", a former soldier of the British Indian Army called Captain Miller, is on a mission to protect the people from the British after witnessing an atrocity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qKnVaE5BvA2fO1L6r4i1ScX34G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962074'),
  ('848704281484401477', 'Captain Nemo', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Vasili Levin', 'Vasili Levin, Edgar Smirnov', 'Vladislav Dvorzhetsky, Yuri Rodionov, Mikhail Kononov, Volodymyr Talashko, Marianna Vertinskaya, Vladimir Basov, Viktor Demertash, Gennadiy Nilov', null, 'For several years as a terrible sea monster drowns ships of the Navy. In a small number of ships that managed to survive, in the sides were found huge holes triangular shape. Now any exit to the sea is deadly, so America sends a special frigate called Blue Star. His goal is to find and destroy the terrible monster. One of the participants of the punitive expedition is a famous Professor from France – Pierre Aronnax. He has a deep knowledge of the mysteries of the deep sea. The search for the monster continues for more than three months, but in the end, the frigate still detects it and immediately starts the attack mode. After an unsuccessful battle with the monster ship goes to the bottom, and the Professor, his servant Conseil and whaler Ned Land get on a submarine and make an amazing journey under water.', 'For several years as a terrible sea monster drowns ships of the Navy. In a small number of ships that managed to survive, in the sides were found huge holes triangular shape. Now any exit to the sea is deadly, so America sends a special frigate called Blue Star. His goal is to find and destroy the terrible monster. One of the participants of the punitive expedition is a famous Professor from France – Pierre Aronnax. He has a deep knowledge of the mysteries of the deep sea. The search for the monster continues for more than three months, but in the end, the frigate still detects it and immediately starts the attack mode. After an unsuccessful battle with the monster ship goes to the bottom, and the Professor, his servant Conseil and whaler Ned Land get on a submarine and make an amazing journey under water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46QJWzzhca28oeCXmxiivNH1SyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167627'),
  ('979475555948217603', 'Captain Nemo and the Underwater City', 1969, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'James Hill, Alan Hume, Raymond Becket', 'Jane Baker, R. Wright Campbell , Philip Baker', 'Robert Ryan, Chuck Connors, Nanette Newman, Luciana Paluzzi, John Turner, Bill Fraser, Kenneth Connor, Allan Cuthbertson', 'G', 'Survivors of a sinking ship are rescued by Captain Nemo and his submarine crew. They are taken to an underwater city where they may spend the rest of their lives.', 'Survivors of a sinking ship are rescued by Captain Nemo and his submarine crew. They are taken to an underwater city where they may spend the rest of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whvYatDbIFsPGSt2Pv9Rrk0q7zT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56354'),
  ('888536013722784302', 'Captain Newman, M.D.', 1963, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'David Miller, William S. Gilmore, Terry Morse Jr.', 'Richard L. Breen, Henry Ephron, Phoebe Ephron', 'Gregory Peck, Tony Curtis, Angie Dickinson, Eddie Albert, James Gregory, Bethel Leslie, Robert Duvall, Jane Withers', 'NR', 'In 1944, Capt. Josiah J. Newman is the doctor in charge of Ward 7, the neuropsychiatric ward, at an Army Air Corps hospital in Arizona. The hospital is under-resourced and Newman scrounges what he needs with the help of his inventive staff, especially Cpl. Jake Leibowitz. The military in general is only just coming to accept psychiatric disorders as legitimate and Newman generally has 6 weeks to cure them or send them on to another facility. There are many patients in the ward and his latest include Colonel Norville Bliss who has dissociated from his past; Capt. Paul Winston who is nearly catatonic after spending 13 months hiding in a cellar behind enemy lines; and 20 year-old Cpl. Jim Tompkins who is severely traumatized after his aircraft was shot down. Others come and go, including Italian prisoners of war, but Newman and team all realize that their success means the men will return to their units.', 'In 1944, Capt. Josiah J. Newman is the doctor in charge of Ward 7, the neuropsychiatric ward, at an Army Air Corps hospital in Arizona. The hospital is under-resourced and Newman scrounges what he needs with the help of his inventive staff, especially Cpl. Jake Leibowitz. The military in general is only just coming to accept psychiatric disorders as legitimate and Newman generally has 6 weeks to cure them or send them on to another facility. There are many patients in the ward and his latest include Colonel Norville Bliss who has dissociated from his past; Capt. Paul Winston who is nearly catatonic after spending 13 months hiding in a cellar behind enemy lines; and 20 year-old Cpl. Jim Tompkins who is severely traumatized after his aircraft was shot down. Others come and go, including Italian prisoners of war, but Newman and team all realize that their success means the men will return to their units.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovXBWbk3YjOZB5cmiTvdNaDYGKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33728'),
  ('581928956896880705', 'Captain Nova', 2021, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Robbie van Brussel, Maurice Trouwborst, Bob Aronds', 'Maurice Trouwborst, Lotte Tabbers, Luuk van Bemmelen', 'Kika van de Vijver, Marouane Meftah, Anniek Pheifer, Hannah van Lunteren, Joep Vermolen, Ricky Koole, Ergün Şimşek, Harry van Rijthoven', null, 'A fighter pilot travels back in time to save the future world from environmental disaster, but a side-effect turns her young again and no-one takes her seriously.', 'A fighter pilot travels back in time to save the future world from environmental disaster, but a side-effect turns her young again and no-one takes her seriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prINReSbCkoktcRbrIgmbY4f0tp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881957'),
  ('1088453978176211901', 'Captain Nulle', 1964, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Leonīds Leimanis, Miks Zvirbulis, Gļebs Korotejevs', 'Egons Līvs, Leonīds Leimanis', 'Eduards Pavuls, Karlis Sebris, Ausma Kantāne, Gunārs Cilinskis, Arturs Dimiters, Amalija Jaunvalka, Rūdolfs Kreicums, Ēvalds Valters', null, 'Valdis Nulle is a young and ambitious captain of fishing ship ''Dzintars''. He has his views on fishing methods but the sea makes its own rules. Kolkhoz authorities are forced to include dubious characters in his crew, for example, former captain Bauze and silent alcoholic Juhans. The young captain lacks experience in working with so many fishermen on board. Unexpectedly, pretty engineer Sabīne is ordered to test a new construction fishing net on Nulle''s ship and ''production conflict'' between her and the captain arises...', 'Valdis Nulle is a young and ambitious captain of fishing ship ''Dzintars''. He has his views on fishing methods but the sea makes its own rules. Kolkhoz authorities are forced to include dubious characters in his crew, for example, former captain Bauze and silent alcoholic Juhans. The young captain lacks experience in working with so many fishermen on board. Unexpectedly, pretty engineer Sabīne is ordered to test a new construction fishing net on Nulle''s ship and ''production conflict'' between her and the captain arises...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4NvopZsY3MsJkxLPzDpxBtsuE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239625'),
  ('676820832461409001', 'Captain Pantoja and the Special Services', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francisco J. Lombardi', 'Enrique Moncloa, Giovanna Pollarolo', 'Angie Cepeda, Salvador del Solar, Mónica Sánchez, Pilar Bardem, Aristóteles Picho, Gustavo Bueno, Tatiana Astengo, Gianfranco Brero', 'R', 'The Peruvian army captain Pantaleon Pantoja, a very serious and efficient officer, is chosen by his superiors to set up a special service of ''visitors'' to satisfy the sexual needs of the soldiers posted on remote jungle outposts.', 'The Peruvian army captain Pantaleon Pantoja, a very serious and efficient officer, is chosen by his superiors to set up a special service of ''visitors'' to satisfy the sexual needs of the soldiers posted on remote jungle outposts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at0Pg8I1RSfg18K99cPEnEu6Bt5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19822'),
  ('225489292928960199', 'Captain Phillips', 2013, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Greengrass, Barry Ackroyd, Eric Fox Hays', 'Billy Ray', 'Tom Hanks, Barkhad Abdi, Barkhad Abdirahman, Faysal Ahmed, Mahat M. Ali, Michael Chernus, David Warshofsky, Corey Johnson', 'PG-13', 'The true story of Captain Richard Phillips and the 2009 hijacking by Somali pirates of the US-flagged MV Maersk Alabama, the first American cargo ship to be hijacked in two hundred years.', 'The true story of Captain Richard Phillips and the 2009 hijacking by Somali pirates of the US-flagged MV Maersk Alabama, the first American cargo ship to be hijacked in two hundred years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Td0kkocW6sD3uRpzwfMfkqMWhx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109424'),
  ('979259697964118196', 'Captain Pirate', 1952, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Ralph Murphy, Morris Stoloff, Milton Feldman', 'John Meredyth Lucas, Robert Libott, Frank Burt', 'Louis Hayward, Patricia Medina, John Sutton, Charles Irwin, Ted de Corsia, Rex Evans, Malú Gatica, George Givot', 'NR', 'In 1690, years have passed since Captain Blood was pardoned by the Crown for his daring deeds against the Spanish on the Spanish Main, and he is living quietly on his plantation in the West Indies, practicing medicine and planning his marriage to Isabella. But his peaceful existence is shattered when Hilary Evans arrives and arrests him on a piracy charge. Somebody has been raiding the islands, and making it appear it was Captain Blood. In order to prove his innocence, Captain Blood has to sail again under the "Jolly Roger."', 'In 1690, years have passed since Captain Blood was pardoned by the Crown for his daring deeds against the Spanish on the Spanish Main, and he is living quietly on his plantation in the West Indies, practicing medicine and planning his marriage to Isabella. But his peaceful existence is shattered when Hilary Evans arrives and arrests him on a piracy charge. Somebody has been raiding the islands, and making it appear it was Captain Blood. In order to prove his innocence, Captain Blood has to sail again under the "Jolly Roger."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqX9jUDcsTIi6rYMmyH65H5KL3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42583'),
  ('49541150167625145', 'Captain Ron', 1992, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Thom Eberhardt, Daryn Okada, Marty Eli Schwartz', 'John Dwyer, Thom Eberhardt', 'Kurt Russell, Martin Short, Mary Kay Place, Benjamin Salisbury, Meadow Sisto, Tom McGowan, Dan Butler, Paul Anka', 'PG-13', 'When mild-mannered Martin Harvey finds out that he has inherited a vintage yacht, he decides to take his family on a Caribbean vacation to retrieve the vessel. Upon arriving on a small island and realizing that the ship is in rough shape, Martin and his family end up with more than they bargained for as the roguish Captain Ron signs on to sail the boat to Miami. It doesn''t take long before Ron''s anything-goes antics get the Harveys into plenty of trouble.', 'When mild-mannered Martin Harvey finds out that he has inherited a vintage yacht, he decides to take his family on a Caribbean vacation to retrieve the vessel. Upon arriving on a small island and realizing that the ship is in rough shape, Martin and his family end up with more than they bargained for as the roguish Captain Ron signs on to sail the boat to Miami. It doesn''t take long before Ron''s anything-goes antics get the Harveys into plenty of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otnKFXvqFH2swlrNf2sNiXpnIsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14361'),
  ('787750996519052284', 'Captain Sabertooth and the Magical Diamond', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Todor Iliev, Rasmus A. Sivertsen, Marit Moum Aune', 'Karsten Fullu', 'Kyrre Haugen Sydness, Siri Skjeggedal, Leonard Valestrand Eike, Ida Leonora Valestrand Eike, Bartek Kaminski, Charlotte Frogner, Jon Øigarden, Tobias Santelmann', null, 'Captain Sabertooth and his crew are up against a sunburnt vampire, a manipulating queen, a violent monkey army and two young pirates while on the hunt for the magical diamond.', 'Captain Sabertooth and his crew are up against a sunburnt vampire, a manipulating queen, a violent monkey army and two young pirates while on the hunt for the magical diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3ffIIhlOU8mUFmC4DjsOdVzVN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606149'),
  ('1152196028742668440', 'Captain Sindbad', 1963, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Byron Haskin, Günther Senftleben, Leon Chooluck', 'Ian McLellan Hunter, Guy Endore', 'Guy Williams, Heidi Brühl, Pedro Armendáriz, Abraham Sofaer, Bernie Hamilton, Helmuth Schneider, Margaret Jahnen, Rolf Wanka', 'G', 'After completing his voyages Sindbad the Sailor and his hearty crew have come home to find a palace coup d''etat has occurred and his home city is being run by a brutal dictator played by Pedro Armendariz. He''s got designs on the beautiful young princess, Heidi Bruhl both lustful and political.', 'After completing his voyages Sindbad the Sailor and his hearty crew have come home to find a palace coup d''etat has occurred and his home city is being run by a brutal dictator played by Pedro Armendariz. He''s got designs on the beautiful young princess, Heidi Bruhl both lustful and political.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbGCGCXWh7S22Lg5oonlXSvokLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41725'),
  ('376832218316094557', 'Captain Thunder', 2011, 'Adventure, Action', 'Antonio Hernández, Javier Salmones', 'Pau Vergara', 'Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Natasha Yarovenko, Adrián Lamana, Man Martínez, Gary Piquer, Luis Fernando Alvés, Natalia Rodríguez, Francisco Merino', null, 'The story of "Captain Thunder and the Holy Grail" is set during the Third Crusade in Palestine, when Captain Thunder finds in the dungeons of a fortress a dying Christian named Juan de Ribera, who entrusts him the mission to restore to Spain a cup which is the Holy Grail, stolen from an ancient order. Thunder, with his inseparable friends Crispin and Goliath, and a Viking princess named Sigfrid, will face an evil feudal lord and his black "devils", who are terrorizing the population of low Aragón.', 'The story of "Captain Thunder and the Holy Grail" is set during the Third Crusade in Palestine, when Captain Thunder finds in the dungeons of a fortress a dying Christian named Juan de Ribera, who entrusts him the mission to restore to Spain a cup which is the Holy Grail, stolen from an ancient order. Thunder, with his inseparable friends Crispin and Goliath, and a Viking princess named Sigfrid, will face an evil feudal lord and his black "devils", who are terrorizing the population of low Aragón.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xKbEqLQ2nGqws9HQdjp0vzVhZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80122'),
  ('235007624084804247', 'Captain Tsubasa Movie 01: The Great Competition of Europe', 1985, 'Animation', 'Nobuhiro Okaseko, Hiroshi Yamazaki, Seiichi Morishita', 'Yoshiyuki Suga', 'Akari Hibino, Kouichi Hashimoto, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Eiko Yamada, Hiroko Maruyama, Nobuo Tobita, Keiichi Nanba, Kenyu Horiuchi', null, 'Tsubasa and his comrades take on the "All-Europe Boy''s Soccer Team", a league of players with skills that they have never seen before in previous matches. Will Team Japan come out on top against this diverse group of players?', 'Tsubasa and his comrades take on the "All-Europe Boy''s Soccer Team", a league of players with skills that they have never seen before in previous matches. Will Team Japan come out on top against this diverse group of players?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRjrQjMQ0RxvK90vtitTRwDgMbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171899'),
  ('1070892245526515334', 'Captain Tsubasa Movie 02: Danger! All Japan Junior Team', 1985, 'Animation', 'Kazuhiro Sano, Hiroyoshi Mitsunobu, Hiroshi Yamazaki', 'Yoshiyuki Suga', 'Akari Hibino, Kouichi Hashimoto, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Aya Mizoguchi, Nobuo Tobita, Keiichi Nanba, Kenyu Horiuchi, Shigeru Nakahara', null, 'The return match between the All-Europe and All-Japan Junior teams comes home to Japan, but what sort of problems will occur with the game on Tsubasa''s home turf?', 'The return match between the All-Europe and All-Japan Junior teams comes home to Japan, but what sort of problems will occur with the game on Tsubasa''s home turf?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMlQD13v8vjzqIt1pN0Bj4fsirR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264992'),
  ('1120250071055550656', 'Captain Tsubasa Movie 03: Run Towards Tomorrow!', 1986, 'Animation', 'Hideto Kojima, Noriyuki Nakamura, Hiroshi Yamazaki', 'Yoshiyuki Suga', 'Akari Hibino, Kouichi Hashimoto, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Eiko Yamada, Hiroko Maruyama, Shigeru Nakahara, Yoshikazu Hirano, Kazue Ikura', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBnOHbos7Hn0FcZr2T8e7cxvJp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172409'),
  ('753766931562091038', 'Captain Tsubasa Movie 04: The Great World Competition!! The Junior World Cup', 1986, 'Animation', 'Tatsuya Okamoto, Nobuhiro Okaseko, Hiroshi Yamazaki', 'Yoshiyuki Suga', 'Akari Hibino, Eiko Yamada, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Kouichi Hashimoto, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Nobuo Tobita, Kazuhiko Inoue, Hisao Oyama', null, 'Japan and Europe goes continental! This time, they arrange a tournament with 4 teams: Japan, USA, "All-Europe", and "All-South America". South America is rising to the tops of the bracket with their hidden weapon, Carlos Santana, who manages to avoid the tricks of his international opponents. How will Team Japan counter this impressive player?', 'Japan and Europe goes continental! This time, they arrange a tournament with 4 teams: Japan, USA, "All-Europe", and "All-South America". South America is rising to the tops of the bracket with their hidden weapon, Carlos Santana, who manages to avoid the tricks of his international opponents. How will Team Japan counter this impressive player?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI4qsvm7UXlQHwrzJkGMMuqiBnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172415'),
  ('61276211966324872', 'Captain Tsubasa Movie 05: The Most Powerful Opponent! Holland Youth', 1994, 'Animation', 'Yoriyasu Kogawa, Nobuhiro Okaseko, Katsunori Shimizu', null, 'Akari Hibino, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Yuko Kobayashi, Chie Sato, Daiki Nakamura, Fujiko Takimoto, Yasunori Matsumoto, Masami Kikuchi', null, 'Trapped in a losing streak against Holland, Team Japan is at its lowest point, with Hyuga injured and desperate for a win. Management tries to convince the abroad Wakabayashi and Tsubasa to come to Holland and take the team on, but what will become of our beloved players when both of the most powerful former members decline to return?', 'Trapped in a losing streak against Holland, Team Japan is at its lowest point, with Hyuga injured and desperate for a win. Management tries to convince the abroad Wakabayashi and Tsubasa to come to Holland and take the team on, but what will become of our beloved players when both of the most powerful former members decline to return?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guIoz0TElP6udn9YajiW3ciuL8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172418'),
  ('215974363680481237', 'Captain Underpants Mega Blissmas', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Erik Kling, Kevin Peaty', 'Matt Smith, Mark Banker', 'Nat Faxon, Jay Gragnani, Ramone Hamilton, Sean Astin, Dayci Brookshire, Jim Cummings, Jorge Diaz, Peter Hastings', 'G', 'Christmas gets weird — really weird — after George and Harold go back in time to change up a few of their beloved holiday''s traditions.', 'Christmas gets weird — really weird — after George and Harold go back in time to change up a few of their beloved holiday''s traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiiM9DiRWLyXJfGCQe03CseURFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768509'),
  ('848251430048637391', 'Captain Underpants: The First Epic Movie', 2017, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'David Soren, Sebastien Bruneau', 'Nicholas Stoller', 'Kevin Hart, Thomas Middleditch, Ed Helms, Nick Kroll, Jordan Peele, Kristen Schaal, DeeDee Rescher, Brian Posehn', 'PG', 'Based on the bestselling book series, this outrageous comedy tells the story of George and Harold, two overly imaginative pranksters who hypnotize their principal into thinking he’s an enthusiastic, yet dimwitted, superhero named Captain Underpants.', 'Based on the bestselling book series, this outrageous comedy tells the story of George and Harold, two overly imaginative pranksters who hypnotize their principal into thinking he’s an enthusiastic, yet dimwitted, superhero named Captain Underpants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKSmaPct5OEeMoD8ue30RisHlKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268531'),
  ('960288297631841236', 'Captain Volkonogov Escaped', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Natalya Merkulova, Mart Taniel, Alexey Chupov', 'Mart Taniel', 'Yura Borisov, Timofey Tribuntsev, Nikita Kukushkin, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Natalya Kudryashova, Viktoriya Tolstoganova, Anastasiya Ukolova, Vitaliya Kornienko', null, 'Captain Fedor Volkonogov works in law enforcement. He is on the good books of the management, and his colleagues respect him. But one day, his life abruptly changes: he is declared a criminal. The Captain manages to run away before he is arrested. Suddenly he turns into an outcast, whom his former colleagues search across the whole city. At night Volkonogov is visited by a messenger from the other world, who warns him that after death he will go hell and be tormented forever. But he has an opportunity to change his fate and get to paradise if he repents, and at least one person forgives him. The Captain embarks on his way to find forgiveness. But he cannot even fathom what tests are awaiting him on this way.', 'Captain Fedor Volkonogov works in law enforcement. He is on the good books of the management, and his colleagues respect him. But one day, his life abruptly changes: he is declared a criminal. The Captain manages to run away before he is arrested. Suddenly he turns into an outcast, whom his former colleagues search across the whole city. At night Volkonogov is visited by a messenger from the other world, who warns him that after death he will go hell and be tormented forever. But he has an opportunity to change his fate and get to paradise if he repents, and at least one person forgives him. The Captain embarks on his way to find forgiveness. But he cannot even fathom what tests are awaiting him on this way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM09TKEl1bYcETEKtXB93QJUc4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818621'),
  ('523942711591718456', 'Captain Voyeur', 1969, 'Horror, Comedy', 'John Carpenter, Joanne Willens', 'John Carpenter', 'Jerry Cox, Kathy Maynard, Victor Ponderosa, Jane Whiteridge, Julie Wedgeworth, Alan Marx', null, 'A dull office worker transforms into a costumed peeping tom at night.', 'A dull office worker transforms into a costumed peeping tom at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmR44si494OeER8cwPcioAW2vh5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445054'),
  ('544866543404060911', 'Captains Courageous', 1937, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Victor Fleming, Harold Rosson', 'John Lee Mahin, Dale Van Every, Marc Connelly', 'Freddie Bartholomew, Spencer Tracy, Lionel Barrymore, Melvyn Douglas, Charley Grapewin, Mickey Rooney, John Carradine, Oscar O''Shea', 'G', 'Harvey, the arrogant and spoiled son of an indulgent absentee-father, falls overboard from a transatlantic steamship and is rescued by a fishing vessel on the Grand Banks. Harvey fails to persuade them to take him ashore, nor convince the crew of his wealth. The captain offers him a low-paid job, until they return to port, as part of the crew that turns him into a mature, considerate young man.', 'Harvey, the arrogant and spoiled son of an indulgent absentee-father, falls overboard from a transatlantic steamship and is rescued by a fishing vessel on the Grand Banks. Harvey fails to persuade them to take him ashore, nor convince the crew of his wealth. The captain offers him a low-paid job, until they return to port, as part of the crew that turns him into a mature, considerate young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhJNHLwIcMqDKBwsr9uMDOumO33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16515'),
  ('424969959438041494', 'Captains Courageous', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael Anderson', 'Rudyard Kipling', 'Robert Urich, Kenny Vadas, Kaj-Erik Eriksen, Duncan Fraser, Sandra Nelson, Campbell Lane', 'PG', 'Harvey Cheyne, Jr., second richest person in the world, orphaned and spoiled rotten, encounters a cigar and the sea on his way to England for boarding school. Seasick, over the rail for real, rescued by Dan Troop of a Gloucester fishing sailboat. Three months at sea, under a firm but fair Captain Troop (fair wages of $10.50 a month, if you don''t work you don''t eat). A hard life and a dangerous one, and a lot of growing up to do through hardship and tragedy.', 'Harvey Cheyne, Jr., second richest person in the world, orphaned and spoiled rotten, encounters a cigar and the sea on his way to England for boarding school. Seasick, over the rail for real, rescued by Dan Troop of a Gloucester fishing sailboat. Three months at sea, under a firm but fair Captain Troop (fair wages of $10.50 a month, if you don''t work you don''t eat). A hard life and a dangerous one, and a lot of growing up to do through hardship and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ab5fAOedU84zGrJ7uzZfhDygUpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60713'),
  ('1114745531380582456', 'Captains of the Clouds', 1942, 'Action, War', 'Michael Curtiz, Leo F. Forbstein, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Arthur T. Horman, Richard Macaulay, Norman Reilly Raine', 'James Cagney, Dennis Morgan, Brenda Marshall, Alan Hale, George Tobias, Reginald Gardiner, W.A. Bishop, Reginald Denny', 'NR', 'Inspired by Churchill''s Dunkirk speech, brash, undisciplined Canadian bush pilot Brian MacLean and three friends enlist in the RCAF.', 'Inspired by Churchill''s Dunkirk speech, brash, undisciplined Canadian bush pilot Brian MacLean and three friends enlist in the RCAF.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCFsU3PbbQU530aB6SCzi0PDRna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32921'),
  ('532153088035597332', 'Captains of the Sands', 2011, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Cecília Amado', 'Bernardo Stroppiana, Cecília Amado', 'Jean Luís Amorim, Ana Graciela, Robério Lima, Israel Gouvêia, Paulo Abade, Jordan Mateus, Elielson Conceição, Evaldo Maurício', null, 'About the life and adventures of a gang of abandoned street kids known as "Capitães da Areia" (Captains of the Sands), in Salvador, Bahia, during the 1950s.', 'About the life and adventures of a gang of abandoned street kids known as "Capitães da Areia" (Captains of the Sands), in Salvador, Bahia, during the 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tSzGFkAvvQnSTISDvXGLcELFhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84106'),
  ('36910660493217543', 'Captive', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jerry Jameson, Luis David Sansans', 'Brian Bird', 'Kate Mara, David Oyelowo, Michael Kenneth Williams, Mimi Rogers, Leonor Varela, E. Roger Mitchell, Kevin J. O''Connor, Matt Lowe', 'PG-13', 'Based on a miraculous true story that drew the attention of the entire nation, is the dramatic, thrilling, and spiritual journey of Ashley Smith and Brian Nichols. After being taken hostage by Brian in her own apartment, Ashley turns to Rick Warren’s inspirational book, The Purpose Driven Life, for guidance. In reading from the book, Ashley not only finds purpose in her own life, but helps Brian find a more peaceful resolution to a harrowing situation.', 'Based on a miraculous true story that drew the attention of the entire nation, is the dramatic, thrilling, and spiritual journey of Ashley Smith and Brian Nichols. After being taken hostage by Brian in her own apartment, Ashley turns to Rick Warren’s inspirational book, The Purpose Driven Life, for guidance. In reading from the book, Ashley not only finds purpose in her own life, but helps Brian find a more peaceful resolution to a harrowing situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKOY6QwmnuZYPaMIvdmZQHjxDLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331190'),
  ('466090537675498197', 'Captive', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Savvas Christou, Konstantinos Pateronis, Joud Alamri', 'Savvas Christou', 'William Kircher, Tori Kostic, Jolene Andersen, Meghan Hanako, Jairus Carey, Chris Barry, David Lee Hess', null, 'A teenage runaway who’s trapped by a delusional man, pretends to be his daughter in order to escape.', 'A teenage runaway who’s trapped by a delusional man, pretends to be his daughter in order to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ofszdXTti3my1RGvyruu3rl9Hc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759213'),
  ('144895257531896401', 'Captive State', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Jason Dusenske, Jonas Spaccarotelli, Lance Catania', 'Rupert Wyatt, Erica Beeney', 'John Goodman, Ashton Sanders, Jonathan Majors, Vera Farmiga, Kevin Dunn, Kevin J. O''Connor, Alan Ruck, Ben Daniels', 'PG-13', 'Nearly a decade after occupation by an extraterrestrial force, the lives of a Chicago neighborhood on both sides of the conflict are explored. In a working-class Chicago neighborhood occupied by an alien force for nine years, increased surveillance and the restriction of civil rights have given rise to an authoritarian system -- and dissent among the populace.', 'Nearly a decade after occupation by an extraterrestrial force, the lives of a Chicago neighborhood on both sides of the conflict are explored. In a working-class Chicago neighborhood occupied by an alien force for nine years, increased surveillance and the restriction of civil rights have given rise to an authoritarian system -- and dissent among the populace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2ccL7X3osXwn3txIuXENRHmYQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429471'),
  ('385260593290630575', 'Captive Wild Woman', 1943, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hans J. Salter, Edward Dmytryk, George Robinson', 'Griffin Jay, Henry Sucher', 'John Carradine, Evelyn Ankers, Milburn Stone, Lloyd Corrigan, Fay Helm, Martha Vickers, Acquanetta, Vince Barnett', null, 'An insane scientist doing experimentation in glandular research becomes obsessed with transforming a female gorilla into a human...even though it costs human life.', 'An insane scientist doing experimentation in glandular research becomes obsessed with transforming a female gorilla into a human...even though it costs human life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWOseenyLLFbfHEtt6dX68u3qap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84708'),
  ('154991661697940634', 'Captive Women 4', 1977, 'Thriller, Horror, War', 'Patrice Rhomm, Michel Rocca', 'Victor Hadria', 'Malisa Longo, Olivier Mathot, Patrizia Gori, Pamela Stanford, Claudine Beccarie, Erik Muller, Rudy Lenoir, Jean Le Boulbar', null, 'To improve the morale of the German officers, a train with beautiful girls is arranged to entertain them when on leave.', 'To improve the morale of the German officers, a train with beautiful girls is arranged to entertain them when on leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxuezjXa44JnP2LSHdsGT9vAuDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89644'),
  ('8916468261281238', 'Captive''s Island', 1966, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Shintarō Ishihara', 'Shogen Nitta, Rentaro Mikuni, Kei Satō, Shima Iwashita, Taiji Tonoyama, Nakajirō Tomita, Kinzō Shin, Hōsei Komatsu', null, 'Seeking revenge against the guard who tormented him, a young man returns to the island where he was imprisoned in reform school. But his plans for vengeance are disturbed when he encounters a strange and beautiful young woman', 'Seeking revenge against the guard who tormented him, a young man returns to the island where he was imprisoned in reform school. But his plans for vengeance are disturbed when he encounters a strange and beautiful young woman', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9J51FmsH7RqEzufm8mP7RhRXnRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90558'),
  ('354605100526326116', 'Captives', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Angela Pope, Remi Adefarasin', 'Frank Deasy', 'Julia Ormond, Tim Roth, Colin Salmon, Keith Allen, Mark Strong, Siobhan Redmond, Peter Capaldi, Richard Hawley', 'R', 'A beautiful young dentist working in a tough British prison starts to become attracted to a violent inmate after the break-up of her marriage, and embarks upon an illicit affair with him, with terrible consequences for all.', 'A beautiful young dentist working in a tough British prison starts to become attracted to a violent inmate after the break-up of her marriage, and embarks upon an illicit affair with him, with terrible consequences for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rOOxUNrTLZMT6KAdBd8WMnElsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37667'),
  ('802495781978295676', 'Captivity', 2007, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Roland Joffé, Daniel Pearl, Caitlin Reilly', 'Larry Cohen, Joseph Tura', 'Elisha Cuthbert, Daniel Gillies, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Laz Alonso, Chrysta Olson, Michael Harney, Carl Paoli, Trent Broin', 'R', 'The sought-after images of top model Jennifer adorn magazine covers and billboards worldwide. When alone at a club, she is abducted and incarcerated in a cell with another prisoner. When their captor subjects the two to torture, they commit to escaping the chamber of horrors before they''re killed.', 'The sought-after images of top model Jennifer adorn magazine covers and billboards worldwide. When alone at a club, she is abducted and incarcerated in a cell with another prisoner. When their captor subjects the two to torture, they commit to escaping the chamber of horrors before they''re killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diP1wQRnmvKHPFcHGoi0WkUSHXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14125'),
  ('506079770720334645', 'Capture', 2026, 'Horror', 'Bruce Wemple', 'Bruce Wemple', 'Kaitlyn Lunardi, Cedric Gegel, Chris Cimperman, Grant Schumacher, Leah Eckardt, LeJon Woods', null, 'After mysteriously inheriting her parents house, a lifelong orphan finds a camcorder and a collection of video tapes containing the gruesome secrets of her family''s past, and the horrifying truth behind the camcorder they were captured on.', 'After mysteriously inheriting her parents house, a lifelong orphan finds a camcorder and a collection of video tapes containing the gruesome secrets of her family''s past, and the horrifying truth behind the camcorder they were captured on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jB2P7VlYfRxJA6ajOEuiD4k8mTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1646950'),
  ('241344032187045659', 'Capture the Flag', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Enrique Gato, Maxi Díaz', 'Neil Landau, Jordi Gasull, Javier López Barreira', 'Carme Calvell, Michelle Jenner, Javier Balas, Dani Rovira, Camilo García, Toni Mora, Fernando Cabrera, Xavier Casan', 'PG', 'When the brave and determined 12-year-old Mike Goldwing discovers that an eccentric billionaire plans to fly to the moon, steal its vast, valuable natural resources, and destroy the American flag planted by the Apollo XI astronauts during man''s historic moon landing, the countdown to a spectacular adventure begins! Mike, teamed with his grandfather, best friends Amy and Marty, and a clever chameleon, blasts off on an incredible moon-bound mission, determined to thwart the billionaire''s evil plan, capture the flag, and reunite his family.', 'When the brave and determined 12-year-old Mike Goldwing discovers that an eccentric billionaire plans to fly to the moon, steal its vast, valuable natural resources, and destroy the American flag planted by the Apollo XI astronauts during man''s historic moon landing, the countdown to a spectacular adventure begins! Mike, teamed with his grandfather, best friends Amy and Marty, and a clever chameleon, blasts off on an incredible moon-bound mission, determined to thwart the billionaire''s evil plan, capture the flag, and reunite his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHzwrSVDnu6Uza6GL0WYzkeXHS1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300602'),
  ('565568049061096927', 'Captured!', 1933, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Roy Del Ruth, Barney McGill', 'Edward Chodorov', 'Leslie Howard, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Paul Lukas, Margaret Lindsay, Robert Barrat, Arthur Hohl, John Bleifer, William LeMaire', 'NR', 'While waiting out World War I in a German POW camp, Captain Fred Allison discovers that his oldest and dearest friend Digby has also been captured and put into the same camp with him. Fred longs for news of his wife, Monica, but Digby speaks little of her. Digby knows a secret about Monica, a secret he must keep from his friend, and it wears at his conscience so much that he attempts a reckless escape.', 'While waiting out World War I in a German POW camp, Captain Fred Allison discovers that his oldest and dearest friend Digby has also been captured and put into the same camp with him. Fred longs for news of his wife, Monica, but Digby speaks little of her. Digby knows a secret about Monica, a secret he must keep from his friend, and it wears at his conscience so much that he attempts a reckless escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoFSaYSktzDzPeJ2MC7h0MJvaKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171099'),
  ('389595947923395748', 'Capturing Avatar', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Bouzereau', null, 'James Cameron, Sam Worthington, Zoe Saldaña, Jon Landau, Stephen Lang, Giovanni Ribisi, Sigourney Weaver, Michelle Rodriguez', 'G', 'Capturing Avatar is a feature length behind-the-scenes documentary about the making of Avatar. It uses footage from the film''s development, as well as stock footage from as far back as the production of Titanic in 1995. Also included are numerous interviews with cast, artists, and other crew members. The documentary was released as a bonus feature on the extended collector''s edition of Avatar.', 'Capturing Avatar is a feature length behind-the-scenes documentary about the making of Avatar. It uses footage from the film''s development, as well as stock footage from as far back as the production of Titanic in 1995. Also included are numerous interviews with cast, artists, and other crew members. The documentary was released as a bonus feature on the extended collector''s edition of Avatar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26SMEXJl3978dn2svWBSqHbLl5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183392'),
  ('907547447789654578', 'Capturing Mary', 2007, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Danny Cohen, Stephen Poliakoff', 'Stephen Poliakoff', 'Maggie Smith, Ruth Wilson, David Walliams, Gemma Arterton, Michael Byers, Danny Lee Wynter, Max Dowler, Rebecca Bottone', null, 'A young man ushers an older woman into a dark exploration of her past - back to the time when, as a young girl, she met a stranger who affected her life forever.', 'A young man ushers an older woman into a dark exploration of her past - back to the time when, as a young girl, she met a stranger who affected her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FmbUlNedw3b6KeXRRfSqwco31z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132426'),
  ('518361672283199098', 'Capturing the Friedmans', 2003, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Andrew Jarecki, Adolfo Doring', null, 'Arnold Friedman, Elaine Friedman, David Friedman, Jesse Friedman, Seth Friedman, John McDermott, Frances Galasso, Anthony Sgueglia', 'NR', 'An Oscar nominated documentary about a middle-class American family who is torn apart when the father Arnold and son Jesse are accused of sexually abusing numerous children. Director Jarecki interviews people from different sides of this tragic story and raises the question of whether they were rightfully tried when they claim they were innocent and there was never any evidence against them.', 'An Oscar nominated documentary about a middle-class American family who is torn apart when the father Arnold and son Jesse are accused of sexually abusing numerous children. Director Jarecki interviews people from different sides of this tragic story and raises the question of whether they were rightfully tried when they claim they were innocent and there was never any evidence against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWdMQj0HN7QxKxEkm0tk04nuAQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2260'),
  ('526168701461545989', 'Capturing the Killer Nurse', 2022, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Tim Travers Hawkins, Will Pugh', 'Tim Travers Hawkins, Robin Ockleford', 'Charles Cullen, Amy Loughren, Donna Hargreaves, Dr. Bruce Ruck, Tim Braun, Danny Baldwin, Charles Graeber, Dr. Steven Marcus', 'PG-13', 'Charlie Cullen was an experienced registered nurse, trusted and beloved by his colleagues at Somerset Medical Center in New Jersey. He is also one of history’s most prolific serial killers, with a body count potentially numbering in the hundreds across multiple medical facilities in the Northeast.', 'Charlie Cullen was an experienced registered nurse, trusted and beloved by his colleagues at Somerset Medical Center in New Jersey. He is also one of history’s most prolific serial killers, with a body count potentially numbering in the hundreds across multiple medical facilities in the Northeast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/384EXJadmQGmNMfB9nrGSBhCupO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018647'),
  ('883220511008101006', 'Capulina Chisme Caliente', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Xavier Cruz', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares, Gilberto Martínez Solares, Alfredo Zacarías', 'Gaspar Henaine, Pedro Infante Jr., Regina Torné, Rosalía Valdés, Rubén Aguirre, Alejandra Meyer, Lucy Tovar, Angelines Santana', null, 'When he lands a job as a telephone operator, Capulina -- legendary Mexican funnyman Gaspar Henaine -- quickly discovers that he can get the best gossip in town by eavesdropping on callers'' private conversations. But when he uses these juicy tidbits to help a local newspaper boost its circulation, he unleashes a firestorm of scandal that threatens to ruin him. Gilberto Martínez Solares directs this comedy.', 'When he lands a job as a telephone operator, Capulina -- legendary Mexican funnyman Gaspar Henaine -- quickly discovers that he can get the best gossip in town by eavesdropping on callers'' private conversations. But when he uses these juicy tidbits to help a local newspaper boost its circulation, he unleashes a firestorm of scandal that threatens to ruin him. Gilberto Martínez Solares directs this comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eu4AvyfdsIKF1FZdf0KBM0WI8pX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311277'),
  ('1136828280465783929', 'Capulina Speedy González', 1970, 'Comedy, Family, Western', 'Alfredo Zacarías', null, 'Gaspar Henaine, Leonorilda Ochoa, Xavier Loyá, Víctor Alcocer, Nathanael León', null, 'Pony Express mailman in old west discovers super-powered chiles, gets tangled up with bank robbers.', 'Pony Express mailman in old west discovers super-powered chiles, gets tangled up with bank robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8gaEAvv54NiwkpFFRcHvlfZzcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491115'),
  ('98711351631136352', 'Capulina vs. the Monsters', 1974, 'Horror, Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Miguel Morayta, Raúl Domínguez', 'Alfredo Zacarías', 'Gaspar Henaine, Gloriella, Héctor Andremar, Salvador Zea, Guillermo Amador, Marcos E. Contreras, Nathanael León, Juan Garza', null, 'A very fun film dealing with the overweight comedian Capulina in yet another one of his many similar type of films. This particular film deals with Capulina trying to escape from Dracula, the Wolfman, the Mummy, and Frankenstein''s Monster. A mad scientist is trying to conquer the world using the legendary monsters, but he will need the fear of the people to give them strength, and only one person is capable of giving him enough power: Capulina.', 'A very fun film dealing with the overweight comedian Capulina in yet another one of his many similar type of films. This particular film deals with Capulina trying to escape from Dracula, the Wolfman, the Mummy, and Frankenstein''s Monster. A mad scientist is trying to conquer the world using the legendary monsters, but he will need the fear of the people to give them strength, and only one person is capable of giving him enough power: Capulina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4jVbl4IaMaQte4UpVqs9eeAtTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216879'),
  ('144842697400523213', 'Capulina vs. the Mummies', 1973, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Alfredo Zacarías', null, 'Gaspar Henaine, Jacqueline Voltaire, Freddy Fernández ''El Pichi'', Enrique Pontón, Miguel Ángel Sanroman, Manuel Dondé, Leticia Perdigón', null, 'A taxi driver winds up working as a butler for a scientist who is trying to revive mummies.', 'A taxi driver winds up working as a butler for a scientist who is trying to revive mummies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gugZQoLd5aUZ8FXJGU01dby7j9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422995'),
  ('511150973992171573', 'Capulina vs. the Vampires', 1971, 'Mystery, Comedy, Horror', 'René Cardona, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'René Cardona', 'Gaspar Henaine, Rossy Mendoza, Carlos Agostí, Juan Gallardo, Aurelio Pérez, Armando Acosta, Guillermo Hernández Jr., Francisco Meneses', null, 'Delivery boy answers a call to take some food to that huge spooky mansion on the hill behind the cemetery.', 'Delivery boy answers a call to take some food to that huge spooky mansion on the hill behind the cemetery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDMogC2okdSMkgNP0npYDGv7AoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371161'),
  ('1131309944485785974', 'Car 54, Where Are You?', 1994, 'Action, Comedy', 'Bill Fishman, Rodney Charters', 'Peter McCarthy, Peter Crabbe, Erik Tarloff', 'David Johansen, John C. McGinley, Fran Drescher, Nipsey Russell, Rosie O''Donnell, Daniel Baldwin, Jeremy Piven, Bobby Collins', 'PG-13', 'Brash NYC policeman Officer Gunther Toody is partnered with stiff, by-the-book Officer Francis Muldoon to protect an important mafia witness prior to testifying against orgainzed crime in Brooklyn, all the while dealing with their personal lives, overbearing spouses, common criminals, arms dealers, and their officious boss Captain Anderson.', 'Brash NYC policeman Officer Gunther Toody is partnered with stiff, by-the-book Officer Francis Muldoon to protect an important mafia witness prior to testifying against orgainzed crime in Brooklyn, all the while dealing with their personal lives, overbearing spouses, common criminals, arms dealers, and their officious boss Captain Anderson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wD1ez4d3wSd79eTdFbH5nvc5p5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31395'),
  ('29663762496587974', 'Car Cemetery', 1983, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Fernando Arrabal, Ken Legargeant', 'Fernando Arrabal', 'Juliet Berto, Alain Bashung, Roland Amstutz, Micha Bayard, Denis Manuel, Dominique Maurin, Boris Bergman, Sylvie Kuhn', null, 'The plot is set in a post apocalyptic Junkyard where people take refuge from authority and are able to practice their fantasies and fetishes without being stopped by the police. These people are led by Emanou who is a sort of Messiah, who promises music rather than salvation.', 'The plot is set in a post apocalyptic Junkyard where people take refuge from authority and are able to practice their fantasies and fetishes without being stopped by the police. These people are led by Emanou who is a sort of Messiah, who promises music rather than salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vC36MEriYiWluGUCtgkKCay5Z4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107003'),
  ('305987399550433561', 'Car of Tomorrow', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Tex Avery, June Foray, Frank Lachapelle, Gilman Rankin', null, 'A series of demonstrations of the kind of motoring accessories we''ll all take for granted in the future.', 'A series of demonstrations of the kind of motoring accessories we''ll all take for granted in the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx3RY1fcyI6v4doKgLOytcoRHAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84670'),
  ('9652549419373945', 'Car Wash', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Schultz, Richard Hashimoto, Daniel Franklin', 'Joel Schumacher', 'Ivan Dixon, DeWayne Jessie, Bill Duke, Franklyn Ajaye, Sully Boyar, Melanie Mayron, June Pointer, Bonnie Pointer', 'PG', 'This day-in-the-life cult comedy focuses on a group of friends working at Sully Boyar''s Car Wash in the Los Angeles ghetto. The team meets dozens of eccentric customers -- including a smooth-talking preacher, a wacky cab driver and an ex-convict -- while cracking politically incorrect jokes to a constant soundtrack of disco and funk. Some of the workers find romance as the day moves along, but most are just happy to get through another shift.', 'This day-in-the-life cult comedy focuses on a group of friends working at Sully Boyar''s Car Wash in the Los Angeles ghetto. The team meets dozens of eccentric customers -- including a smooth-talking preacher, a wacky cab driver and an ex-convict -- while cracking politically incorrect jokes to a constant soundtrack of disco and funk. Some of the workers find romance as the day moves along, but most are just happy to get through another shift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bty0IdXh4l2BmoQNVeAH5PYKrMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15462'),
  ('1055830855145678923', 'Caracas', 2024, 'Crime', 'Marco D''Amore, Davide Zurolo, Stefano Meloni', 'Francesco Ghiaccio, Marco D''Amore', 'Toni Servillo, Marco D''Amore, Lina-Camélia Lumbroso, Marco Foschi, Angela Pagano, Brian Salvatore Parisi, Moustapha seck ★', null, 'A well-known Neapolitan writer returns to his hometown after a long absence and encounters an old friend known as Caracas. Caracas, once a neo-fascist skinhead, is now converting to Islam.', 'A well-known Neapolitan writer returns to his hometown after a long absence and encounters an old friend known as Caracas. Caracas, once a neo-fascist skinhead, is now converting to Islam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFYpU1saDoQ4wftGyjn64M4gCGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086357'),
  ('27292019473884082', 'Caramel', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Nadine Labaki, Yves Sehnaoui', 'Jihad Hojeily, Rodney El Haddad, Nadine Labaki', 'Nadine Labaki, Yasmine Al Massri, Adel Karam, Joanna Moukarzel, Gisèle Aouad, Sihame Haddad, Aziza Semaan, Fatmeh Safa', null, 'In a beauty salon in Beirut the lives of five women cross paths. The beauty salon is a colorful and sensual microcosm where they share and entrust their hopes, fears and expectations.', 'In a beauty salon in Beirut the lives of five women cross paths. The beauty salon is a colorful and sensual microcosm where they share and entrust their hopes, fears and expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YAAZuO0Rz33CrIO66NqxMS6R4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7973'),
  ('706487963451167253', 'Caramelo', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Diego Freitas, Kauê Zilli, Cici Nigri', 'Diego Freitas, Rod Azevedo, Vitor Brandt', 'Rafael Vitti, Arianne Botelho, Kelzy Ecard, Bruno Vinicius, Ademara Barros, Noemia Oliveira, Carolina Ferraz, Cristina Pereira', 'PG-13', 'After a life-changing diagnosis, a promising chef finds hope and humor with the help of a fur-midable dog friend.', 'After a life-changing diagnosis, a promising chef finds hope and humor with the help of a fur-midable dog friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4ZEAah5a01cu27w7vT2IAoFogk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277988'),
  ('494872296053511092', 'Caramuru: Brazil Reinvented', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, History', 'Guel Arraes, Félix "Chango" Monti, Lenine', 'Jorge Furtado, Guel Arraes', 'Selton Mello, Camila Pitanga, Luís Melo, Tonico Pereira, Deborah Secco, Débora Bloch, Pedro Paulo Rangel, Diogo Vilela', null, 'Diogo Álvares, a Portuguese map illustrator, reaches the Brazilian coast, after his caravel sinks. He is saved by the Indian chief Itaparica and his two daughters, Paraguaçu and Moema. They call him Caramuru and together they engage in a happy love triangle. But the chance to return to Portugal arises, and it is clear this amoral arrangement cannot last.', 'Diogo Álvares, a Portuguese map illustrator, reaches the Brazilian coast, after his caravel sinks. He is saved by the Indian chief Itaparica and his two daughters, Paraguaçu and Moema. They call him Caramuru and together they engage in a happy love triangle. But the chance to return to Portugal arises, and it is clear this amoral arrangement cannot last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xgs9skiYyB8QdT7aWRJBQaqvnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70815'),
  ('878380859657134256', 'Carancho', 2010, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Pablo Trapero, Martín Carranza, Milagros Hormazábal', 'Alejandro Fadel, Pablo Trapero, Martín Mauregui', 'Ricardo Darín, Martina Gusmán, Carlos Weber, José Luis Arias, Fabio Ronzano, Loren Acuña, Gabriel Almirón, Francisco Acosta', 'R', 'Sosa is a lawyer who haunts hospital waiting rooms hoping to represent the victims of traffic accidents in insurance claims. When he falls in love with ambulance medic Luján, he tries to leave this dark business but the shady law firm that he works for won’t let him off that easily.', 'Sosa is a lawyer who haunts hospital waiting rooms hoping to represent the victims of traffic accidents in insurance claims. When he falls in love with ambulance medic Luján, he tries to leave this dark business but the shady law firm that he works for won’t let him off that easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtj5lQwQiV3x6nAdRERQRm39ovm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47261'),
  ('963031444290229037', 'Carandiru', 2003, 'Drama', 'Héctor Babenco, Walter Carvalho, Olívia Guimarães', 'Héctor Babenco, Fernando Bonassi, Victor Navas', 'Luiz Carlos Vasconcelos, Milton Gonçalves, Ivan de Almeida, Aílton Graça, Maria Luísa Mendonça, Aida Leiner, Rodrigo Santoro, Gero Camilo', 'R', 'When a doctor decides to carry out an AIDS prevention program inside Latin America’s largest prison: the Casa de Detenção de São Paulo - Carandiru, he meets the future victims of one of the darkest days in Brazilian History when the State of São Paulo’s Military Police, with the excuse for law enforcement, shot to death 111 people. Based on real facts and on the book written by Dráuzio Varella.', 'When a doctor decides to carry out an AIDS prevention program inside Latin America’s largest prison: the Casa de Detenção de São Paulo - Carandiru, he meets the future victims of one of the darkest days in Brazilian History when the State of São Paulo’s Military Police, with the excuse for law enforcement, shot to death 111 people. Based on real facts and on the book written by Dráuzio Varella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKAgIMwQWQ6u4s0c56XKSDX3vAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8440'),
  ('634971227073655576', 'Caravaggio', 1986, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Derek Jarman, Gabriel Beristain, Glynn Purcell', 'Derek Jarman', 'Nigel Terry, Sean Bean, Garry Cooper, Dexter Fletcher, Spencer Leigh, Tilda Swinton, Nigel Davenport, Robbie Coltrane', 'NR', 'A retelling of the life of the celebrated 17th-century Baroque painter Michelangelo Merisi da Caravaggio through his brilliant, nearly blasphemous paintings and his flirtations with the underworld.', 'A retelling of the life of the celebrated 17th-century Baroque painter Michelangelo Merisi da Caravaggio through his brilliant, nearly blasphemous paintings and his flirtations with the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TsayIEhoId7iahurgpKSNdSdEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20537'),
  ('616717962593436079', 'Caravaggio', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Angelo Longoni', 'James Carrington, Andrea Purgatori', 'Alessio Boni, Claire Keim, Jordi Mollà, Elena Sofia Ricci, Paolo Briguglia, Paolo Giovannucci, François Montagut, Benjamin Sadler', null, 'The tumultuous and adventurous life of Michelangelo Merisi, controversial artist, called by Fate to become the immortal Caravaggio. A violent genius that will dare to defy the ideal vision of the world imposed by the Renaissance painters. A provoker that scandalized patrons and institutions, raising the altars the outcast figures he knew so well: drunkards, vagrants and prostitutes.', 'The tumultuous and adventurous life of Michelangelo Merisi, controversial artist, called by Fate to become the immortal Caravaggio. A violent genius that will dare to defy the ideal vision of the world imposed by the Renaissance painters. A provoker that scandalized patrons and institutions, raising the altars the outcast figures he knew so well: drunkards, vagrants and prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fU10H6irYzONw2oOAWM73UGSFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159810'),
  ('823283656510675622', 'Caravaggio: The Soul and the Blood', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Jesus Garces Lambert', 'Laura Allievi', 'Manuel Agnelli, Emanuele Marigliano, Mina Gregori, Claudio Strinati, Rossella Vodret, Sara Pallini', null, 'An exciting and unsettling cinematic journey through the life, work and torments of Caravaggio.', 'An exciting and unsettling cinematic journey through the life, work and torments of Caravaggio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2MaC8c3tLNlWZnkhyewa4bu4CK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505321'),
  ('57124428050466583', 'Caravaggio''s Shadow', 2022, 'History, Drama', 'Michele Placido, Michele D''Attanasio', 'Sandro Petraglia, Michele Placido, Fidel Signorile', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Louis Garrel, Isabelle Huppert, Vinicio Marchioni, Lolita Chammah, Micaela Ramazzotti, Alessandro Haber, Michele Placido', null, 'The Catholic Church secretly investigates Caravaggio as the Pope weighs whether to grant him clemency for killing a rival.', 'The Catholic Church secretly investigates Caravaggio as the Pope weighs whether to grant him clemency for killing a rival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwP6AsukkXRguAHMgjM3DOWfITH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693349'),
  ('1137934472097027511', 'Caravan to Vaccarès', 1974, 'Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Geoffrey Reeve, Bert Batt, Mishka Cheyko', 'Paul Wheeler', 'David Birney, Charlotte Rampling, Michael Lonsdale, Marcel Bozzuffi, Michael Bryant, Serge Marquand, Marianne Eggerickx, Françoise Brion', null, 'American Neil Bowman is traveling through France when he meets British photographer Lila. They are hired by French land owner Duc de Croyter to escort a Hungarian scientist to New York. But they soon realize that the job is not a cushy number, and have to deal with a gang of kidnappers who will stop at nothing to get their hands on the scientist', 'American Neil Bowman is traveling through France when he meets British photographer Lila. They are hired by French land owner Duc de Croyter to escort a Hungarian scientist to New York. But they soon realize that the job is not a cushy number, and have to deal with a gang of kidnappers who will stop at nothing to get their hands on the scientist', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rd38mAmbCmRSI0Tt1pnsGX68rdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38649'),
  ('440885691318654812', 'Caravans', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'James Fargo, Douglas Slocombe', 'Thomas A. McMahon, Nancy Voyles Crawford, Lorraine Williams', 'Anthony Quinn, Jennifer O''Neill, Michael Sarrazin, Christopher Lee, Joseph Cotten, Barry Sullivan, Behrouz Vossoughi, Jeremy Kemp', 'PG', 'This epic adventure-drama based on James Michener''s best-selling novel concerns a young American embassy official who is sent into the Middle-Eastern desert to find the missing daughter of a US Senator. The young woman has left her husband, a Colonel in the Shadom - she was his number two wife - and has opted for the lifestyle of a nomadic tribe. When the diplomat locates the girl he joins the caravan and attempts to persuade the girl to return.', 'This epic adventure-drama based on James Michener''s best-selling novel concerns a young American embassy official who is sent into the Middle-Eastern desert to find the missing daughter of a US Senator. The young woman has left her husband, a Colonel in the Shadom - she was his number two wife - and has opted for the lifestyle of a nomadic tribe. When the diplomat locates the girl he joins the caravan and attempts to persuade the girl to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKX4NG5QMuyqDQTAcnpn83Tmokc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41317'),
  ('1062665256669344477', 'Carbide and Sorrel', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Frank Beyer', 'Frank Beyer, Hans Oliva-Hagen', 'Erwin Geschonneck, Marita Böhme, Manja Behrens, Margot Busse, Rudolf Asmus, Hans-Dieter Schlegel, Fred Delmare, Bruno Carstens', null, 'After the second World War, Dresden has a lot of reconstructing to do. To get the cigarette factory he once worked for running again, Kalle has to travel to Wittenberg - the only place where carbide can be found. Once there, Kalle find himself in the unfortunate situation of having to hitchhike his way back to Dresden, transporting seven heavy barrels of carbide. However, his inventiveness and optimistic attitude help transform the grueling task into an adventurous, entertaining, and funny journey.', 'After the second World War, Dresden has a lot of reconstructing to do. To get the cigarette factory he once worked for running again, Kalle has to travel to Wittenberg - the only place where carbide can be found. Once there, Kalle find himself in the unfortunate situation of having to hitchhike his way back to Dresden, transporting seven heavy barrels of carbide. However, his inventiveness and optimistic attitude help transform the grueling task into an adventurous, entertaining, and funny journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SMR0DF4md15hV2OQgfIOF7UfMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48744'),
  ('18737540616038617', 'Carbine Williams', 1952, 'Crime, Drama', 'Richard Thorpe, Al Jennings', 'Art Cohn', 'James Stewart, Jean Hagen, Wendell Corey, Carl Benton Reid, Paul Stewart, Otto Hulett, Rhys Williams, Herbert Heyes', 'NR', 'David Marshall Williams is sent to a prison farm where he works in the tool shop and eventually develops the precursor of the famous M-1 Carbine automatic rifle used in World War II.', 'David Marshall Williams is sent to a prison farm where he works in the tool shop and eventually develops the precursor of the famous M-1 Carbine automatic rifle used in World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxD7BIOWcmmxflBiymKimyQBhrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43961'),
