  ('10489313780916272', 'Cárcel de mujeres', 1951, 'Drama, Crime', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Mauricio Magdaleno', 'Miroslava, Sara Montiel, Katy Jurado, María Douglas, Mercedes Soler, Elda Peralta, Emma Roldán, Eufrosina García', null, 'Evangelina murders her lover Alberto. In prison she meets Dora, Alberto''s girlfriend, who was deprived of her freedom for his illicit business. An interesting story is about to be woven.', 'Evangelina murders her lover Alberto. In prison she meets Dora, Alberto''s girlfriend, who was deprived of her freedom for his illicit business. An interesting story is about to be woven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4K5JlsER7y78o7083lURHfljniX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342011'),
  ('914043892698990485', 'Carcereiros: O Filme', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, Alexandre Ramos', 'Marcelo Starobinas, Fernando Bonassi, Marçal Aquino', 'Rodrigo Lombardi, Jackson Antunes, Bianca Muller, Tony Tornado, Milton Gonçalves, Kaysar Dadour, Dan Stulbach, Rômulo Braga', null, 'Adriano is an honest prison guard who is averse to violence. He tries to keep the prison peaceful, even though he is struggling with major family problems. The arrival of Abdel, a dangerous international terrorist, increases the tension in the prison, which is already experiencing days of terror due to the fight between two criminal factions. Now, Adriano will have to face a rebellion and control Abdel''s every move.', 'Adriano is an honest prison guard who is averse to violence. He tries to keep the prison peaceful, even though he is struggling with major family problems. The arrival of Abdel, a dangerous international terrorist, increases the tension in the prison, which is already experiencing days of terror due to the fight between two criminal factions. Now, Adriano will have to face a rebellion and control Abdel''s every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBY8sQjkc8qDYcUtS8GhlediHHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631360'),
  ('137377246592313193', 'Carcinoma', 2014, 'Horror, Drama', 'Marian Dora', 'Marian Dora', 'Dorian Piquardt, Ulli Lommel, Thomas Goersch, Carina Palmer, Stanley Grimmer, Curd Berger, Lisbeth Piquardt, Ferdinand Hartmann', null, 'The trials and tribulations of a man diagnosed with colorectal cancer who refuses treatment and establishes a carnal fixation on the tumor that slowly siphons the life out of him.', 'The trials and tribulations of a man diagnosed with colorectal cancer who refuses treatment and establishes a carnal fixation on the tumor that slowly siphons the life out of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLdobdB2JFhMsnjJFrrhVEJ0gdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405465'),
  ('558313294937241662', 'Cardcaptor Sakura: The Movie', 1999, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Morio Asaka, Masafumi Mima, Hisao Shirai', 'Nanase Okawa', 'Sakura Tange, Aya Hisakawa, Junko Iwao, Motoko Kumai, Tomokazu Seki, Megumi Ogata, Yukana, Hideyuki Tanaka', null, 'Sakura Kinomoto, a Card Captor, wins a game of chance and is awarded a trip to Hong Kong, along with her best friend Tomoyo and her rival, Syaoran Li. It turns out that the ancient rival of Clow Reed, the creator of the mysterious and powerful Clow Cards, summoned them, and she''s out for revenge. A battle ensues, and secrets are revealed about Clow Reed''s shady past and Sakura''s connection to him.', 'Sakura Kinomoto, a Card Captor, wins a game of chance and is awarded a trip to Hong Kong, along with her best friend Tomoyo and her rival, Syaoran Li. It turns out that the ancient rival of Clow Reed, the creator of the mysterious and powerful Clow Cards, summoned them, and she''s out for revenge. A battle ensues, and secrets are revealed about Clow Reed''s shady past and Sakura''s connection to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgFFwLekxzDYLjc07OqnsSShqwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26945'),
  ('400239615367138514', 'Cardcaptor Sakura: The Sealed Card', 2000, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Morio Asaka, Hisao Shirai, Masao Fukuda', 'Nanase Okawa', 'Sakura Tange, Motoko Kumai, Aya Hisakawa, Masaya Onosaka, Megumi Ogata, Junko Iwao, Yukana, Nozomu Sasaki', null, 'All of the Clow Cards have been captured, and Sakura Kinomoto, the new Master of the Cards, is preparing to play the lead in the play for the town festival. However, a new evil force is causing mysterious events all over Tomoeda, including the disappearance of Sakura''s cards. With Syaoran''s help, Sakura must figure out the cause of these events, and save her town.', 'All of the Clow Cards have been captured, and Sakura Kinomoto, the new Master of the Cards, is preparing to play the lead in the play for the town festival. However, a new evil force is causing mysterious events all over Tomoeda, including the disappearance of Sakura''s cards. With Syaoran''s help, Sakura must figure out the cause of these events, and save her town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doJEr8GLTZYq10jZwKLQnzPZGsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31347'),
  ('137692045862985983', 'Cardiofitness', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Fabio Tagliavia, Attilio Moro, Stefano Ricciotti', 'Marco Ponti, Lucia Moisio, Barbara Frandino', 'Nicoletta Romanoff, Giulia Bevilacqua, Sarah Felberbaum, Federico Costantini, Dino Abbrescia, Fabio Troiano, Daniele De Angelis, Giorgio Colangeli', null, 'An irrepressible passion blossoms between 27 year-old aspiring writer Stefania, and Stefano, a 15 year-old high school student. Their unusual relationship obviously baffles friends and relatives of both components of the unusual couple. Can their feelings withstand their own fears and the pressure of society ? ...', 'An irrepressible passion blossoms between 27 year-old aspiring writer Stefania, and Stefano, a 15 year-old high school student. Their unusual relationship obviously baffles friends and relatives of both components of the unusual couple. Can their feelings withstand their own fears and the pressure of society ? ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37Gwc0f93GNDo3PTrBA163QRF2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58078'),
  ('658002653839021552', 'Care Bears Movie II: A New Generation', 1986, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Dale Schott, Laura Shepherd', 'Peter Sauder', 'Hadley Kay, Chris Wiggins, Cree Summer, Alyson Court, Michael Fantini, Sunny Besen Thrasher, Maxine Miller, Pam Hyatt', 'G', 'This animated adventure goes back in time to the Care Bears'' first-ever Caring Mission, when True Heart Bear and Noble Heart Horse touch down on Earth to boost the spirits of some unhappy kids at summer camp. But the evil Dark Heart has other plans, and convinces one of the campers to help him capture the Care Bears. Will our lovable heroes'' Care Stare be enough to vanquish the villain -- and convince his apprentice that good''s the way to go?', 'This animated adventure goes back in time to the Care Bears'' first-ever Caring Mission, when True Heart Bear and Noble Heart Horse touch down on Earth to boost the spirits of some unhappy kids at summer camp. But the evil Dark Heart has other plans, and convinces one of the campers to help him capture the Care Bears. Will our lovable heroes'' Care Stare be enough to vanquish the villain -- and convince his apprentice that good''s the way to go?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ng1L8jSjG1futBzsFmwmy1KJ7q5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19975'),
  ('1128271507126881685', 'Care Bears Nutcracker Suite', 1988, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Joseph Sherman, Laura Shepherd', 'John de Klein', 'Bob Dermer, Luba Goy, Dan Hennessey, Jim Henshaw, Allyson Lupovich, John Stocker, Michael Beattie, Don Francks', null, 'An animated version, starring the Care Bears, of the fairy tale that inspired the famous ballet.', 'An animated version, starring the Care Bears, of the fairy tale that inspired the famous ballet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncAE3dl0o0JjF0WOLRmHBmTNex2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28557'),
  ('6043988164095758', 'Career', 1959, 'Drama', 'Joseph LaShelle, Joseph Anthony, Ralph Axness', 'Dalton Trumbo, Bert Granet', 'Dean Martin, Anthony Franciosa, Shirley MacLaine, Carolyn Jones, Joan Blackman, Robert Middleton, Donna Douglas, Jerry Paris', 'NR', 'Playwright James Lee adapted his off-Broadway play for the screen in this high-strung adaptation, directed by Joseph Anthony. In this simplistic, backroom show-business-success saga, Anthony Franciosa plays Sam, a struggling young actor who will forsake his family and take any type of menial job in order to become a Broadway star. Dean Martin is on hand as Maury, an aspiring director also trying to claw his way up the ladder of success. When Maury gets his big break, Sam wants a part in his show, but when Maury, who is unwilling to cast Sam in the production, turns down Sam''s request, Sam seduces and marries Maury''s girlfriend (Shirley MacLaine). In spite of everything, Maury wants his girl back, and Sam agrees to a divorce on the stipulation that Maury cast him as the star in his next show. Once again, Maury reneges and, before Sam can exact his revenge, Uncle Sam comes to the rescue and he is drafted into the army.', 'Playwright James Lee adapted his off-Broadway play for the screen in this high-strung adaptation, directed by Joseph Anthony. In this simplistic, backroom show-business-success saga, Anthony Franciosa plays Sam, a struggling young actor who will forsake his family and take any type of menial job in order to become a Broadway star. Dean Martin is on hand as Maury, an aspiring director also trying to claw his way up the ladder of success. When Maury gets his big break, Sam wants a part in his show, but when Maury, who is unwilling to cast Sam in the production, turns down Sam''s request, Sam seduces and marries Maury''s girlfriend (Shirley MacLaine). In spite of everything, Maury wants his girl back, and Sam agrees to a divorce on the stipulation that Maury cast him as the star in his next show. Once again, Maury reneges and, before Sam can exact his revenge, Uncle Sam comes to the rescue and he is drafted into the army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VjhqInHfqDO6n7YzLitqmRKEef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216859'),
  ('5399511864938010', 'Career Girls', 1997, 'Drama', 'Mike Leigh, Josh Robertson, Nick Heckstall-Smith', 'Mike Leigh', 'Katrin Cartlidge, Lynda Steadman, Kate Byers, Mark Benton, Andy Serkis, Joe Tucker, Margo Stanley, Michael Healy', 'R', 'A young college student in London moves into a flat and becomes best friends with a flatmate; the former moves into her own flat 4 years later but 6 years after their parting, the former returns to London to pay the latter a visit.', 'A young college student in London moves into a flat and becomes best friends with a flatmate; the former moves into her own flat 4 years later but 6 years after their parting, the former returns to London to pay the latter a visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bV6ezK5Qcqv9ul9B6yGiKcfA0pG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49462'),
  ('184343467975699311', 'Career Opportunities', 1991, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bryan Gordon, Pam Dixon, Donald McAlpine', 'John Hughes', 'Frank Whaley, Jennifer Connelly, Dermot Mulroney, Kieran Mulroney, John M. Jackson, Jenny O''Hara, Noble Willingham, Nada Despotovich', 'PG-13', 'Josie, the daughter of the town''s wealthiest businessman, faces problems at home and wishes to leave town but is disoriented. Her decision is finalized after she falls asleep in a Target dressing room. She awakens to find herself locked in the store overnight with the janitor, Jim, the town "no hoper" and liar.', 'Josie, the daughter of the town''s wealthiest businessman, faces problems at home and wishes to leave town but is disoriented. Her decision is finalized after she falls asleep in a Target dressing room. She awakens to find herself locked in the store overnight with the janitor, Jim, the town "no hoper" and liar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2sSRi8ZqOIjtk2fpGMTuMf4qJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16270'),
  ('1072385410805780734', 'Carefree', 1938, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Sandrich, Robert De Grasse, Victor Baravalle', 'Allan Scott, Ernest Pagano', 'Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Ralph Bellamy, Luella Gear, Jack Carson, Clarence Kolb, Franklin Pangborn, Walter Kingsford', 'NR', 'Dr. Tony Flagg''s friend Steven has problems in the relationship with his fiancée Amanda, so he persuades her to visit Tony. After some minor misunderstandings, she falls in love with him. When he tries to use hypnosis to strengthen her feelings for Steven, things get complicated.', 'Dr. Tony Flagg''s friend Steven has problems in the relationship with his fiancée Amanda, so he persuades her to visit Tony. After some minor misunderstandings, she falls in love with him. When he tries to use hypnosis to strengthen her feelings for Steven, things get complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vFD6edhyBkRLEHGjsX9UVw890w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29872'),
  ('168888983293045967', 'Careful', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Guy Maddin', 'George Toles, Guy Maddin', 'Kyle McCulloch, Małgorzata Dobrowolska, Sarah Neville, Brent Neale, Paul Cox, Victor Cowie, Michael O''Sullivan, Vince Rimmer', null, 'The mountain-village passions of a German widow and her sons unfold in the style of a 1920s expressionist movie.', 'The mountain-village passions of a German widow and her sons unfold in the style of a 1920s expressionist movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qolQ7M5hpbBwcvpMpfeSMyU64rs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55613'),
  ('923600615568388105', 'Careful What You Wish For', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Elizabeth Allen Rosenbaum, Rogier Stoffers', 'Chris Frisina', 'Nick Jonas, Isabel Lucas, Dermot Mulroney, Kandyse McClure, Graham Rogers, Marc Macaulay, David Sherrill, Kevin J. O''Connor', 'R', 'A guy gets more than he bargained for after entering into an affair with the wife of an investment banker. Soon, a suspicious death and substantial life insurance policy embroil him in a scandal.', 'A guy gets more than he bargained for after entering into an affair with the wife of an investment banker. Soon, a suspicious death and substantial life insurance policy embroil him in a scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alRvln4lzGjdSExC37vr1spSTF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317744'),
  ('1026832361976707039', 'Careful, He Might Hear You', 1983, 'Drama, Family', 'Carl Schultz', 'Michael Jenkins', 'Wendy Hughes, Robyn Nevin, Nicholas Gledhill, John Hargreaves, Geraldine Turner, Isabelle Anderson, Peter Whitford, Colleen Clifford', null, 'Abandoned by his father after his mother dies, young PS lives in suburban Sydney with his aunt Lila and her husband George. While they lead a modest existence, PS is happy with them. However, his contentment is derailed when Lila''s wealthy sister, Vanessa, returns from England and takes an interest in PS.', 'Abandoned by his father after his mother dies, young PS lives in suburban Sydney with his aunt Lila and her husband George. While they lead a modest existence, PS is happy with them. However, his contentment is derailed when Lila''s wealthy sister, Vanessa, returns from England and takes an interest in PS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n357Od4rd8Lx7Z1l3ooEL31Bxhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42104'),
  ('1038621987223987691', 'Careful, Monkeys!', 1984, 'Animation', 'Leonid Shvartsman, Maya Miroshkina', 'Grigoriy Oster', null, null, 'Second film. Adventures of little monkeys, secretly from their mother escaped from a zoo to the city.', 'Second film. Adventures of little monkeys, secretly from their mother escaped from a zoo to the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33s7Oduk9toijF4T2OIgCLDpzPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198803'),
  ('925257466754981690', 'Careless', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Armando Nannuzzi, Mauro Bolognini, Luigi Bazzoni', 'Goffredo Parise, Tullio Pinelli', 'Claudia Cardinale, Anthony Franciosa, Betsy Blair, Philippe Leroy, Raimondo Magni, Aldo Bufi Landi, Nadia Marlowa, Franca Mazzoni', null, 'Emilio Brentani leads a peaceful and uneventful life with his older sister Amalia. Until he meets Angiolina Zarri, a beautiful but fickle, wayward and coquettish young woman. Unfortunately for him, Emilio falls madly in love with her.', 'Emilio Brentani leads a peaceful and uneventful life with his older sister Amalia. Until he meets Angiolina Zarri, a beautiful but fickle, wayward and coquettish young woman. Unfortunately for him, Emilio falls madly in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDXBF7jSfklkH8t4fjJiAlYyyg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251669'),
  ('601100219415452150', 'Careless', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Sue Thomson, Ben Bryan', 'Adam Farrington-Williams, Sue Thomson', 'Margaret Thomson, Olivia Cornwell, Jane Cornwell, Sarah Holland-Batt, Beverly, Hanh Vu, Linda Ford, Luciana Martini', null, 'When director Sue Thomson’s 89-year-old mum, Margaret, begins to need additional help with day-to-day life, they face a decision that most families will encounter: whether to consider a residential aged-care facility; and, if so, how to find a suitable one amid a sector with a reputation for neglect and mistreatment. Margaret’s story becomes a springboard for an investigation of the political history of aged care in Australia, marred by a 40-year bipartisan privatisation agenda. As we hear from advocates, journalists and senior citizens who have experienced the system, a group of schoolkids discuss the situation we’ve reached with aged care and where we need to go from here – and of what they, and we, can expect in the future.', 'When director Sue Thomson’s 89-year-old mum, Margaret, begins to need additional help with day-to-day life, they face a decision that most families will encounter: whether to consider a residential aged-care facility; and, if so, how to find a suitable one amid a sector with a reputation for neglect and mistreatment. Margaret’s story becomes a springboard for an investigation of the political history of aged care in Australia, marred by a 40-year bipartisan privatisation agenda. As we hear from advocates, journalists and senior citizens who have experienced the system, a group of schoolkids discuss the situation we’ve reached with aged care and where we need to go from here – and of what they, and we, can expect in the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXfkTfzN1CaNbhGULhl4vGYSVOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1507199'),
  ('554702677474664301', 'Caresses', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ventura Pons, Jesús Escosa', 'Sergi Belbel', 'Sergi López, David Selvas, Laura Conejero, Julieta Serrano, Montserrat Salvador, Agustín González, Naím Thomas, Mercè Pons', null, 'Eleven episodes portray different encounters in Barcelona during the course of a single night towards the end of the millennium.', 'Eleven episodes portray different encounters in Barcelona during the course of a single night towards the end of the millennium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8GMjCzDNRhiRI04ms5JdETADKW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40921'),
  ('454781622652431039', 'Carga', 2018, 'Drama', 'Bruno Gascon, JP Caldeano', 'Bruno Gascon', 'Michalina Olszańska, Vítor Norte, Rita Blanco, Sara Sampaio, Miguel Borges, Dmitry Bogomolov, Ana Cristina Oliveira, Duarte Grilo', null, 'A lorry, a road and an unpredictable destiny, all intersecting in a human trafficking network. Caught up in this web, Viktoriya has only one chance: fight to survive.', 'A lorry, a road and an unpredictable destiny, all intersecting in a human trafficking network. Caught up in this web, Viktoriya has only one chance: fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLVjYX0q0wdX9CyILF6nMTRIP3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507313'),
