  ('68991517602188994', 'Cargo', 2009, 'Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Ralph Baetschmann, Ivan Engler, Ralph Etter', 'Patrik Steinmann, Thilo Röscheisen, Johnny Hartmann', 'Martin Rapold, Anna-Katharina Schwabroh, Regula Grauwiller, Yangzom Brauen, Michael Finger, Claude-Oliver Rudolph, Pierre Semmler, Noa Strupler', null, 'The story of CARGO takes place on rusty space-freighter KASSANDRA on its way to Station 42. The young medic LAURA is the only one awake on board while the rest of the crew lies frozen in hibernation sleep. In 4 months will Laura''s shift be over.', 'The story of CARGO takes place on rusty space-freighter KASSANDRA on its way to Station 42. The young medic LAURA is the only one awake on board while the rest of the crew lies frozen in hibernation sleep. In 4 months will Laura''s shift be over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybg2be8LaEI8yoDkcsRit3ruaFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34069'),
  ('522664870708095716', 'Cargo', 2013, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Yolanda Ramke, Daniel Foeldes, Ben Howling', 'Yolanda Ramke', 'Andy Rodoreda, Alison Gallagher, Ruth Venn, Yolanda Ramke, Kallan Richards, Effron Heather, Scott Wood', null, 'Stranded in the midst of a zombie apocalypse, a man sets in motion an unlikely plan to protect the precious cargo he carries: his infant daughter.', 'Stranded in the midst of a zombie apocalypse, a man sets in motion an unlikely plan to protect the precious cargo he carries: his infant daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DK8orkKrmxp0VjAwuLFmVcEC4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182972'),
  ('954959231616991565', 'Cargo', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Ben Howling, Yolanda Ramke, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Yolanda Ramke', 'Martin Freeman, Simone Landers, Anthony Hayes, Susie Porter, Caren Pistorius, Kris McQuade, Natasha Wanganeen, Bruce R. Carter', 'NR', 'After being infected in the wake of a violent pandemic and with only 48 hours to live, a father struggles to find a new home for his baby daughter.', 'After being infected in the wake of a violent pandemic and with only 48 hours to live, a father struggles to find a new home for his baby daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdPSUck4tBRvRu6DFk6XciDrssn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425972'),
  ('1074810712343567464', 'Cargo', 2019, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Arati Kadav, Aditya Pawar', 'Arati Kadav', 'Vikrant Massey, Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Nandu Madhav, Biswapati Sarkar, Surender Thakur, Hansal Mehta, Prabal Panjabi, Konkona Sen Sharma', 'PG-13', 'Aboard a spaceship where souls of the deceased are readied for reincarnation, a lone crew member''s rigid existence is disrupted by a spry new assistant.', 'Aboard a spaceship where souls of the deceased are readied for reincarnation, a lone crew member''s rigid existence is disrupted by a spry new assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8qSsI6g2vSrdumtdbb8c2Q2pV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640421'),
  ('757057320179737435', 'Cargo 200', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Aleksandr Simonov', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Agniya Kuznetsova, Aleksey Poluyan, Leonid Gromov, Aleksey Serebryakov, Leonid Bichevin, Natalya Akimova, Mikhail Skryabin, Dmitriy Kubasov', null, 'While returning to Leningrad from a visit to his brother, Professor Artyom''s car breaks down and he finds assistance at an isolated farmhouse occupied by Alexey, his wife, a Vietnamese laborer, and a stranger who wanders around the farm. When his car is repaired, Artyom leaves, drunk on moonshine, and students Valera and Angelika arrive. After Valera gets drunk, the stranger abducts Angelika.', 'While returning to Leningrad from a visit to his brother, Professor Artyom''s car breaks down and he finds assistance at an isolated farmhouse occupied by Alexey, his wife, a Vietnamese laborer, and a stranger who wanders around the farm. When his car is repaired, Artyom leaves, drunk on moonshine, and students Valera and Angelika arrive. After Valera gets drunk, the stranger abducts Angelika.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8F0vN9BNabjIO6edSlFe3RB7dCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34869'),
  ('619359969916905288', 'Caribe', 2004, 'Drama', 'Esteban Ramírez', 'Ana Istarú, Esteban Ramírez', 'Jorge Perugorría, Cuca Escribano, Maya Zapata, Roberto McLean, Vinicio Rojas, Arnoldo Ramos, Gabriel Retes, Thelma Darkings', null, 'Vicente and Abigail run a banana plantation in Limon Province, on the Caribbean coast of Costa Rica. Abigail''s half-sister Irene, about whom Abigail knew nothing, comes to introduce herself. Banana prices start falling, threatening the plantation''s finances. An oil company works with the government to get off-shore drilling rights, over local objection. Vicente is at the center of each cross-current. Will he fall for Irene? Can he save the plantation? Will he sell out to corporate offers?', 'Vicente and Abigail run a banana plantation in Limon Province, on the Caribbean coast of Costa Rica. Abigail''s half-sister Irene, about whom Abigail knew nothing, comes to introduce herself. Banana prices start falling, threatening the plantation''s finances. An oil company works with the government to get off-shore drilling rights, over local objection. Vicente is at the center of each cross-current. Will he fall for Irene? Can he save the plantation? Will he sell out to corporate offers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D29rQBVSFsMyzF9PJ7JzbPkl7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195833'),
  ('457463323869388003', 'Çarıklı Milyoner', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Muzaffer Hiçdurmaz, Ahmet Sezerel', 'İhsan Yüce, Memduh Ün, Kemal Sunal', 'Kemal Sunal, Necla Nazır, Ali Şen, Nermin Denizci, Reha Yurdakul, Hüseyin Kutman, Selim Naşit, Belkıs Dilligil', null, 'Hilmi Tok is a billionaire businessman. He dies one day while driving his own car. His real estate assets goes his son Bayram.', 'Hilmi Tok is a billionaire businessman. He dies one day while driving his own car. His real estate assets goes his son Bayram.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsxt2inqv3z0aTBKAMhVfptra0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80958'),
  ('508868316764055733', 'Carjacked', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'John Bonito, Theo van de Sande, Chuck Picerni Jr.', 'Sherry Compton, Michael Compton', 'Stephen Dorff, Maria Bello, Joanna Cassidy, Catherine Dent, Kristen Kerr, Gary Grubbs, Angelle Brooks, Tim Griffin', 'R', 'A single mom and her child are carjacked by a bank robber who has no intention of letting them go.', 'A single mom and her child are carjacked by a bank robber who has no intention of letting them go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPwccod1wNQrC0aqq6nxr9qC3Sm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72912'),
  ('389073686268802399', 'Carjackers', 2025, 'Action, Adventure', 'Kamel Guemra, James Canal, Stéphanie Seilhean', 'Kamel Guemra, Morade Aïssaoui, Sledge Bidounga', 'Zoé Marchal, Franck Gastambide, Bosh, Mareva Ranarivelo, Alassane Diong, Mylène Jampanoï, Alix Bénézech, Hafid F. Benamar', null, 'By day, they''re invisible—valets, hostesses, and bartenders at a luxury hotel. By night, they''re the Carjackers, a crew of skilled drivers who track and rob wealthy clients on the road. As they plan their ultimate heist, the hotel director hires a ruthless hitman, to stop them at all costs. With danger closing in, can Nora, Zoe, Steve, and Prestance pull off their biggest score yet?', 'By day, they''re invisible—valets, hostesses, and bartenders at a luxury hotel. By night, they''re the Carjackers, a crew of skilled drivers who track and rob wealthy clients on the road. As they plan their ultimate heist, the hotel director hires a ruthless hitman, to stop them at all costs. With danger closing in, can Nora, Zoe, Steve, and Prestance pull off their biggest score yet?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbkPMTz2vVai7Ujyp0ag7AM9SrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229730'),
  ('979400484868133601', 'Carl Th. Dreyer', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Jørgen Roos, Hans Engberg', null, 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Henri-Georges Clouzot, Henri Langlois, François Truffaut, Jean-Luc Godard, Anna Karina', null, 'A documentary about the famous Danish film director Carl Th. Dreyer, made a few years before he died. In this film Dreyer tells about the style in his feature films and about the important things in film making: the script and the casting. He tells about his theories about setting and acting.', 'A documentary about the famous Danish film director Carl Th. Dreyer, made a few years before he died. In this film Dreyer tells about the style in his feature films and about the important things in film making: the script and the casting. He tells about his theories about setting and acting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GznEpCDpI58vg4TlwDW6AwjgNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234301'),
  ('434991867808291689', 'Carl Th. Dreyer: My Metier', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Torben Skjødt Jensen', 'Prami Larsen, Torben Skjødt Jensen', 'Henning Jensen, Henning Bendtsen, Helene Falconetti, Birgitte Federspiel, Preben Lerdorff Rye, Lisbeth Movin, Baard Owe, Jørgen Roos', null, 'Torben Skjødt Jensen’s elegant documentary is a collage of memories and reflections on one of cinema’s greatest directors. Visually rich and densely layered, Carl Th. Dreyer—My Metier illuminates an artist too little understood and too important to overlook. Through interviews, historical writings, and rare archival footage, a portrait of Dreyer emerges: an austere perfectionist, yes, but also a passionate man possessing a genuine sense of humor.', 'Torben Skjødt Jensen’s elegant documentary is a collage of memories and reflections on one of cinema’s greatest directors. Visually rich and densely layered, Carl Th. Dreyer—My Metier illuminates an artist too little understood and too important to overlook. Through interviews, historical writings, and rare archival footage, a portrait of Dreyer emerges: an austere perfectionist, yes, but also a passionate man possessing a genuine sense of humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTrrGTlWqGXOMec6FaieAvnaVY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66133'),
  ('334889891446664515', 'Carl''s Date', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Arjun Rihan, Ryan Michero, Bob Peterson', 'Bob Peterson', 'Ed Asner, Bob Peterson', 'G', 'Carl Fredricksen reluctantly agrees to go on a date with a lady friend—but admittedly has no idea how dating works these days. Ever the helpful friend, Dug steps in to calm Carl''s pre-date jitters and offer some tried-and-true tips for making friends—if you''re a dog.', 'Carl Fredricksen reluctantly agrees to go on a date with a lady friend—but admittedly has no idea how dating works these days. Ever the helpful friend, Dug steps in to calm Carl''s pre-date jitters and offer some tried-and-true tips for making friends—if you''re a dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wakoF2UgsEE3fGs5KpuwMWsaNr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076364'),
  ('893579099110323806', 'Carla', 2021, 'History, Music, TV Movie', 'Emanuele Imbucci, Luigi Martinucci, Fabiola Banzi', 'Emanuele Imbucci, Chiara Laudani, Graziano Diana', 'Alessandra Mastronardi, Stefano Rossi Giordani, Paola Calliari, Euridice Axén, Léo Dussollier, Valentina Romani, Maurizio Donadoni, Maria Amelia Monti', null, 'The extraordinary life of Carla Fracci, the greatest Italian ballerina of all time, told from her first steps at the Accademia del Teatro alla Scala in Milan to the stages of the most prestigious international theaters, passing through the controversial choices, difficult sacrifices, and important satisfactions that marked her rise. Freely inspired by the autobiography “Passo dopo passo – La mia storia” (Step by Step – My Story).', 'The extraordinary life of Carla Fracci, the greatest Italian ballerina of all time, told from her first steps at the Accademia del Teatro alla Scala in Milan to the stages of the most prestigious international theaters, passing through the controversial choices, difficult sacrifices, and important satisfactions that marked her rise. Freely inspired by the autobiography “Passo dopo passo – La mia storia” (Step by Step – My Story).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLMjr9lLWBtMLhAzjQIoKmYhnxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888372'),
  ('19220579053123321', 'Carla''s Song', 1996, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd', 'Paul Laverty', 'Robert Carlyle, Oyanka Cabezas, Scott Glenn, Louise Goodall, Salvador Espinoza, Margaret McAdam, Gary Lewis, Subash Singh Pall', null, 'A Glasgow man visits war-torn Nicaragua with a refugee tormented by her memories.', 'A Glasgow man visits war-torn Nicaragua with a refugee tormented by her memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQtbHH07alTI1knOmt8ZabU6p3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2143'),
  ('763126227131453089', 'Carlin at Carnegie', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Steven J. Santos, Steve Zink', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', 'R', 'Recorded at Carnegie Hall, New York City in 1982, released in 1983. Most of the material comes from his A Place for My Stuff, the album released earlier that same year. The final performance of "Seven Dirty Words," his last recorded performance of the routine, features Carlin''s updated list.', 'Recorded at Carnegie Hall, New York City in 1982, released in 1983. Most of the material comes from his A Place for My Stuff, the album released earlier that same year. The final performance of "Seven Dirty Words," his last recorded performance of the routine, features Carlin''s updated list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3cURcShw8jv8wVO0TaIejjxPW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34506'),
  ('141458321184844966', 'Carlito''s Way', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Brian De Palma, Stephen H. Burum, Eric Schwab', 'David Koepp', 'Al Pacino, Sean Penn, Penelope Ann Miller, John Leguizamo, Ingrid Rogers, Luis Guzmán, James Rebhorn, Joseph Siravo', 'R', 'Free after years in prison, Carlito Brigante intends to give up his criminal ways, but it''s not long before the ex-con is sucked back into the New York City underworld.', 'Free after years in prison, Carlito Brigante intends to give up his criminal ways, but it''s not long before the ex-con is sucked back into the New York City underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6D7mjQtndu768cusGmoEQY9fTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6075'),
  ('496235187937634973', 'Carlito''s Way: Rise to Power', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Bregman, Adam Holender', 'Michael Bregman', 'Jay Hernandez, Mario Van Peebles, Luis Guzmán, Sean Combs, Michael Kelly, Giancarlo Esposito, Burt Young, Casper Martinez', 'PG-13', 'Seduced by the brutal New York underworld, future gangster legend Carlito Brigante enters a deadly circle of greed and retribution. Assisted by his two brothers-in-crime, Carlito is on the fast track to becoming Spanish Harlem''s ultimate kingpin. He quickly learns, however, that the only way to survive at the top is through loyalty to his friends and respect for the rules of the street.', 'Seduced by the brutal New York underworld, future gangster legend Carlito Brigante enters a deadly circle of greed and retribution. Assisted by his two brothers-in-crime, Carlito is on the fast track to becoming Spanish Harlem''s ultimate kingpin. He quickly learns, however, that the only way to survive at the top is through loyalty to his friends and respect for the rules of the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsiAyCvY0qwTzgfRkyvLu2MgvN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12261'),
  ('211651667851807523', 'Carlitos and the Chance of a Lifetime', 2008, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jesús del Cerro, Adolfo Hernández Del Casar', 'Beatriz González Cruz, Manuel Feijóo', 'Guillermo Campra, David Becerra, Irene Visedo, Josep Maria Pou, Gustavo Salmerón, Vicente Díez, Alejandra Lorenzo, Jennifer Manzano', null, 'Carlitos is a heartfelt story about one young boy''s fight for his right to play soccer, while keeping his very essence intact.', 'Carlitos is a heartfelt story about one young boy''s fight for his right to play soccer, while keeping his very essence intact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0QXtetE4iWBw2SzVugaj5rObfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53297'),
  ('774105084715805805', 'Carlitos Medellin', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Stéphane Sauvaire, Jean-Stéphane Sauvaire', null, null, null, 'This documentary reveals the most violent part of the most violent city (Medellin) of the most violent country (Colombia) in the world. For around 75 minutes, different people from Medellin explain how difficult it is to live and survive in a city where violence, weapons, killing is common. Everyday, someone you know may die or get wounded by one of the different armed factions that struggle throughout the country and in the cities to take control over the population, drug cartel, politics, etc... sometimes for no reasons at all but fun.', 'This documentary reveals the most violent part of the most violent city (Medellin) of the most violent country (Colombia) in the world. For around 75 minutes, different people from Medellin explain how difficult it is to live and survive in a city where violence, weapons, killing is common. Everyday, someone you know may die or get wounded by one of the different armed factions that struggle throughout the country and in the cities to take control over the population, drug cartel, politics, etc... sometimes for no reasons at all but fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxCJVC3hH7LgSJT0yOTlqpjAP18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455437'),
  ('284338941353338253', 'Carlos', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, History', 'Olivier Assayas, Yorick Le Saux, Denis Lenoir', 'Dan Franck, Daniel LeConte, Olivier Assayas', 'Edgar Ramírez, Alexander Scheer, Nora Waldstätten, Talal Jurdi, Christoph Bach, Julia Hummer, Ahmad Kaabour, Fadi Abi Samra', 'NR', 'The story of Venezuelan revolutionary, Ilich Ramirez Sanchez, who founded a worldwide terrorist organization and raided the OPEC headquarters in 1975 before being caught by the French police.', 'The story of Venezuelan revolutionary, Ilich Ramirez Sanchez, who founded a worldwide terrorist organization and raided the OPEC headquarters in 1975 before being caught by the French police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ee6EiUOXdvr7DvnBBEG691TNSKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43434'),
  ('457579801425516712', 'Carlos Ballarta: el amor es de putos', 2016, null, 'Raúl Campos, Jan Suter', 'Carlos Ballarta', 'Carlos Ballarta', null, 'Carlos Ballarta mocks daily life in Mexico, including public transit, the education system and the corn seller who betrays your confidence', 'Carlos Ballarta mocks daily life in Mexico, including public transit, the education system and the corn seller who betrays your confidence', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EneX9RhdoHrgtDKINNbeuOusS3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427298'),
  ('801317647500973695', 'Carlos Ballarta: furia ñera', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Raúl Campos, Jan Suter', 'Carlos Ballarta', 'Carlos Ballarta', null, 'Mexican comic Carlos Ballarta mocks himself and points out the absurdities of parenthood and how he uses his wife''s pregnancies to avoid commitments.', 'Mexican comic Carlos Ballarta mocks himself and points out the absurdities of parenthood and how he uses his wife''s pregnancies to avoid commitments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGT6kUWqdx2jt7zICHDhyGRkp3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523704'),
