  ('452429784227791262', 'Carmina or Blow Up', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Juan González Guerrero, Paco León', 'Paco León', 'María León, Antonio Adarve, Miguel Alcíbar, Carmina Barrios, José Mari Bizcocho, Raimundo Carrasco, Paco Casaus, Antonio Estrada', null, 'Carmina, 58, runs a shop selling Iberian products in Seville. After several robberies and no help from her insurance company, she comes up with a way to recover the money she needs to keep her family. While she waits in her kitchen for her plan to kick in, she thinks back over her life, her work and her miracles.', 'Carmina, 58, runs a shop selling Iberian products in Seville. After several robberies and no help from her insurance company, she comes up with a way to recover the money she needs to keep her family. While she waits in her kitchen for her plan to kick in, she thinks back over her life, her work and her miracles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gS3e57zDuMrm8c1NJyP9oCoiVim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107916'),
