  ('397109435488420357', 'Carnage', 2002, 'Drama', 'Delphine Gleize, Crystel Fournier', 'Delphine Gleize', 'Chiara Mastroianni, Ángela Molina, Lio, Esther Gorintin, Maryline Even, Clovis Cornillac, Jacques Gamblin, Féodor Atkine', null, 'After a bull is killed in a bullfight, its body parts are transported across Spain, France, Italy and Belgium. The bull''s parts fall into the wide variety of people, including: an Italian actress selling the bones in a supermarket promotion, a Spanish woman who dines on its steaks, a little girl in France who imagines a world where animals are much larger than humans, and a taxidermist whose wife is simultaneously giving birth to quintuplets.', 'After a bull is killed in a bullfight, its body parts are transported across Spain, France, Italy and Belgium. The bull''s parts fall into the wide variety of people, including: an Italian actress selling the bones in a supermarket promotion, a Spanish woman who dines on its steaks, a little girl in France who imagines a world where animals are much larger than humans, and a taxidermist whose wife is simultaneously giving birth to quintuplets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKRSAP8Mqn8AQJc03D0iSa3KAoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44408'),
