  ('8571122743745361', 'Carnal Excitation', 1978, null, 'Michel Lemoine', null, 'Danièle Troeger, Morgane, Thierry de Brem, Olivier Mathot', null, 'A couple prepares to welcome a friend and his new fiancée, but when an unexpected guest arrives ahead of them, a case of mistaken identity sets everything in motion. As assumptions blur and boundaries loosen, the household quickly slips into a web of flirtation, confusion, and shifting dynamics. When the real fiancée finally appears, nothing is quite as it seems.. and the evening takes a series of surprising turns.', 'A couple prepares to welcome a friend and his new fiancée, but when an unexpected guest arrives ahead of them, a case of mistaken identity sets everything in motion. As assumptions blur and boundaries loosen, the household quickly slips into a web of flirtation, confusion, and shifting dynamics. When the real fiancée finally appears, nothing is quite as it seems.. and the evening takes a series of surprising turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysKUDDAwHGZLbvAYAkAJABSwmFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641284'),
  ('476190887479885958', 'Carnal Knowledge', 1971, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Mike Nichols, Giuseppe Rotunno, Tim Zinnemann', 'Jules Feiffer', 'Jack Nicholson, Candice Bergen, Art Garfunkel, Ann-Margret, Rita Moreno, Cynthia O''Neal, Carol Kane, Sheri Jackson', null, 'Two lifelong friends navigate complex sexual encounters and emotional entanglements, wrestling with societal norms and personal desires.', 'Two lifelong friends navigate complex sexual encounters and emotional entanglements, wrestling with societal norms and personal desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvP2e1J5oDsBG688J6Y2I2rSBE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36492'),
  ('139680448156280562', 'Carnal Sins', 2024, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Juan Sebastian Torales, Ezequiel Salinas, Santiago Massip', 'Juan Sebastian Torales', 'Nicolás Díaz, María Soldi, Cali Coronel, Martina Grimaldi, Luisa Lucía Paz, Beto Frágola, Tania Darchuk, Adrián Ramallo', null, 'Fleeing homophobic attacks, Nino moves to a rural house amidst a forest haunted by Almamula, a monster that takes those who commit carnal sins. In a world of whispers, unspoken desires and prayers, Nino’s curiosity and impulses rise to the surface.', 'Fleeing homophobic attacks, Nino moves to a rural house amidst a forest haunted by Almamula, a monster that takes those who commit carnal sins. In a world of whispers, unspoken desires and prayers, Nino’s curiosity and impulses rise to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wchOgS36PxFpONLtCw61SM2CdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076142'),
  ('602787918913969259', 'Carnaval', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Leandro Neri', 'Felipe Adler, Leandro Neri', 'Giovana Cordeiro, Gessica Kayane, Bruna Inocencio, Samya Pascotto, Flavia Pavanelli, Micael Borges, Jean Pedro, Felipe Adler', 'NR', 'Digital influencer Nina finds out about her boyfriend''s betrayal and ends the relationship. So, she decides to travel with her friends to Salvador and enjoy the city''s Carnival. During this period, they gain more followers and learn the true meaning of friendship.', 'Digital influencer Nina finds out about her boyfriend''s betrayal and ends the relationship. So, she decides to travel with her friends to Salvador and enjoy the city''s Carnival. During this period, they gain more followers and learn the true meaning of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ze1Sdb7WB64TBJhPqg8sJtwQtes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818659'),
