  ('122623432332323300', 'Carnival', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tatyana Lioznova, Pyotr Kataev, Vadim Nabatnikov', 'Anna Rodionova, Tatyana Lioznova', 'Irina Muravyova, Yuriy Yakovlev, Klara Luchko, Aleksandr Abdulov, Vera Vasileva, Aleksandr Mikhaylov, Lidiya Smirnova, Valentina Titova', null, 'A young Russian girl is in love with show business and wants to leave her small town for Moscow and make it big in the big city. She encounters her long missing, remarried father and gets a boy friend who uses her and then leaves her.', 'A young Russian girl is in love with show business and wants to leave her small town for Moscow and make it big in the big city. She encounters her long missing, remarried father and gets a boy friend who uses her and then leaves her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14ypslXrZws6f0CcHbSjJBfnWwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37174'),
  ('568350546505620835', 'Carnival in Flanders', 1935, 'Comedy, History, Romance', 'Jacques Feyder, Harry Stradling Sr., Charles Barrois', 'Robert A. Stemmle', 'Françoise Rosay, Jean Murat, André Alerme, Lyne Clevers, Micheline Cheirel, Maryse Wendling, Ginette Gaubert, Marguerite Ducouret', null, 'Flanders, Hispanic Monarchy, 1616. The inhabitants of the small town of Boom are busy organizing the annual local festivities when the arrival of the Duke of Olivares, who rules the country on behalf of the King Philip III of Spain, is announced. While the male citizens cowardly surrender to panic like rats on a sinking ship, the brave female citizens, led by the bold wife of the burgomaster, decide to become the best hosts the Spaniards can ever meet.', 'Flanders, Hispanic Monarchy, 1616. The inhabitants of the small town of Boom are busy organizing the annual local festivities when the arrival of the Duke of Olivares, who rules the country on behalf of the King Philip III of Spain, is announced. While the male citizens cowardly surrender to panic like rats on a sinking ship, the brave female citizens, led by the bold wife of the burgomaster, decide to become the best hosts the Spaniards can ever meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C4owFvEeQ26u79dVUFm3mIHW6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32543'),
  ('331809389366120296', 'Carnival Magic', 1983, 'Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Al Adamson, Darrell Cathcart, Charles Reynolds', 'Mark Weston, Bob Levine', 'Don Stewart, Jennifer Houlton, Howard Segal, Regina Carrol, Joe Cirillo, Mark Weston, Charles Reynolds, Diane Kettering', 'G', 'A magician in a carnival--who actually can read minds and levitate people and objects--works with a superintelligent chimp named Alex, who can also talk. The magician and the chimp soon become the stars of the carnival, drawing in big crowds. However, the wild-animal trainer, who has been displaced by the team as the carnival''s top act, decides to kidnap Alex and sell him to a medical laboratory for experimentation, thereby getting rid of his competition.', 'A magician in a carnival--who actually can read minds and levitate people and objects--works with a superintelligent chimp named Alex, who can also talk. The magician and the chimp soon become the stars of the carnival, drawing in big crowds. However, the wild-animal trainer, who has been displaced by the team as the carnival''s top act, decides to kidnap Alex and sell him to a medical laboratory for experimentation, thereby getting rid of his competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UEBhca8be67AMKVeW7C1Pa0TKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29419'),
  ('649988340295227379', 'Carnival Night', 1956, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Arkadi Koltsaty, Viktor Zorin', 'Boris Laskin, Vladimir Polyakov', 'Igor Ilyinsky, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Yuri Belov, Georgiy Kulikov, Sergei Filippov, Olga Vlasova, Andrei Tutyshkin, Tamara Nosova', null, 'It is the New Year''s Eve and the employees of an Economics Institute are ready with their annual New Year''s entertainment program. It includes a lot of dancing and singing, jazz band performance and even magic tricks. Suddenly, an announcement is made that a new director has been elected and that he is arriving shortly. Comrade Ogurtsov arrives in time to review and disapprove of the scheduled entertainment. To him, holiday fun has a different meaning. He imagines speakers reading annual reports to show the Institute''s progress over the year, and, perhaps, a bit of serious music, something from the Classics, played by the Veterans'' Orchestra. Obviously, no one wants to change the program a few hours before the show, much less to replace it with something so boring! Now everyone has to team up in order to prevent Ogurtsov from getting to the stage. As some of them trap Ogurtsov one way or another, others perform their scheduled pieces and celebrate New Year''s Eve.', 'It is the New Year''s Eve and the employees of an Economics Institute are ready with their annual New Year''s entertainment program. It includes a lot of dancing and singing, jazz band performance and even magic tricks. Suddenly, an announcement is made that a new director has been elected and that he is arriving shortly. Comrade Ogurtsov arrives in time to review and disapprove of the scheduled entertainment. To him, holiday fun has a different meaning. He imagines speakers reading annual reports to show the Institute''s progress over the year, and, perhaps, a bit of serious music, something from the Classics, played by the Veterans'' Orchestra. Obviously, no one wants to change the program a few hours before the show, much less to replace it with something so boring! Now everyone has to team up in order to prevent Ogurtsov from getting to the stage. As some of them trap Ogurtsov one way or another, others perform their scheduled pieces and celebrate New Year''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQ0Vk0FifhPr21K7oGqBSSkiXF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63258'),
  ('1134553250948057765', 'Carnival of Blood', 1970, 'Horror', 'Leonard Kirtman, David Howe', 'Leonard Kirtman', 'Martin Barolsky, Judith Resnick, Earle Edgerton, Burt Young, Kaly Mills, William Grannel, Linda Kurtz, Glen Kimberley', 'R', 'A psychopathic killer uses the carousel ride at a carnival to pick his victims, whom he then murders and dismembers.', 'A psychopathic killer uses the carousel ride at a carnival to pick his victims, whom he then murders and dismembers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9Y4fRxGsgfqGTkyaiBgXGMCemE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87552'),
  ('765020326792314269', 'Carnival of Sinners', 1943, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Maurice Tourneur, Armand Thirard, Jean Devaivre', 'Jean-Paul Le Chanois', 'Pierre Fresnay, Josseline Gaël, Noël Roquevert, Guillaume de Sax, Pierre Palau, Pierre Larquey, André Gabriello, Antoine Balpêtré', null, 'A struggling artist buys a talisman that gives him love, fame and wealth. The talisman is a severed left hand, and it works perfectly, in fact, magically. But of course there is nothing free in this world, and after one year the devil comes and asks for his due.', 'A struggling artist buys a talisman that gives him love, fame and wealth. The talisman is a severed left hand, and it works perfectly, in fact, magically. But of course there is nothing free in this world, and after one year the devil comes and asks for his due.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKWPDQTIADng8vxQgDmKGRFvfu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54288'),
  ('566354769948141925', 'Carnival of Souls', 1962, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Herk Harvey, Reza Badiyi, Maurice Prather', 'John Clifford', 'Candace Hilligoss, Herk Harvey, Sidney Berger, Frances Feist, Art Ellison, Stan Levitt, Tom McGinnis, Forbes Caldwell', 'NR', 'Mary Henry ends up the sole survivor of a fatal car accident through mysterious circumstances. Trying to put the incident behind her, she moves to Utah and takes a job as a church organist. But her fresh start is interrupted by visions of a fiendish man. As the visions begin to occur more frequently, Mary finds herself drawn to the deserted carnival on the outskirts of town. The strangely alluring carnival may hold the secret to her tragic past.', 'Mary Henry ends up the sole survivor of a fatal car accident through mysterious circumstances. Trying to put the incident behind her, she moves to Utah and takes a job as a church organist. But her fresh start is interrupted by visions of a fiendish man. As the visions begin to occur more frequently, Mary finds herself drawn to the deserted carnival on the outskirts of town. The strangely alluring carnival may hold the secret to her tragic past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ddPGH7kMe81xznwIKCt17VFUPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16093'),
  ('76726759532083964', 'Carnival of Souls', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Grossman, Christopher Baffa', 'Adam Grossman', 'Bobbie Phillips, Shawnee Smith, Paul Johansson, Larry Miller, Cleavant Derricks, Henry G. Sanders, Brendan Dillon, Anna K. McKown', 'R', 'A young woman is pursued in reality and in her subconscious by the sadistic carnival clown who raped and murdered her mother.', 'A young woman is pursued in reality and in her subconscious by the sadistic carnival clown who raped and murdered her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5gPDGcSOQh0W5W2Gfum3D9msCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40341'),
  ('295089836602123936', 'Carnival of the Animals', 1976, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Chuck Jones, Gerry Woolery, Herbert Klynn', 'Chuck Jones', 'Mel Blanc, Michael Tilson Thomas', null, 'Bugs and Daffy perform and act out their own version of the classic "Carnival of the Animals."', 'Bugs and Daffy perform and act out their own version of the classic "Carnival of the Animals."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ithwFUnPg1eEoRsgy1ilIyTLbzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215502'),
  ('531497213564336909', 'Carnival Rock', 1957, 'Crime, Music, Drama', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby', 'Leo Lieberman', 'Susan Cabot, Brian G. Hutton, David J. Stewart, Dick Miller, Iris Adrian, Jonathan Haze, Ed Nelson, Bruno VeSota', 'NR', 'An ocean-side nightclub owner loves a singer who only has eyes for a gambler.', 'An ocean-side nightclub owner loves a singer who only has eyes for a gambler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FAbBXj5ijOgGPnljYIeC51II7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43225'),
  ('66392347826520981', 'Carnival Story', 1954, 'Drama', 'Kurt Neumann, Ernest Haller', 'Hans Jacoby, Kurt Neumann', 'Anne Baxter, Steve Cochran, Lyle Bettger, George Nader, Jay C. Flippen, Helene Stanley, Ady Berber, Anni Trautner', 'NR', 'In search of a better life, a German girl named Willi joins an American carnival passing through Munich. While traveling from town to town, she is torn between two suitors: cruel carnival barker Joe and kindhearted high-dive artist Frank. Frank gets the upper hand when he asks Willi to join his act. The partners soon become the most popular attraction at the carnival. But tragedy is only a slip away.', 'In search of a better life, a German girl named Willi joins an American carnival passing through Munich. While traveling from town to town, she is torn between two suitors: cruel carnival barker Joe and kindhearted high-dive artist Frank. Frank gets the upper hand when he asks Willi to join his act. The partners soon become the most popular attraction at the carnival. But tragedy is only a slip away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3eSVUUFy7BWIsqS3R909vPYtMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44526'),
  ('756326984551970464', 'Carnivale', 2000, 'Animation', 'Deane Taylor', 'Greg Haddrick', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Hugh Laurie, Amanda Abbington, David Antrobus, Steve Brody, Ron Haddrick, Lee Perry, Jamie Oxenbould', null, 'A group of children are transported through a portal to another dimension where they are thrilled to discover a magical amusement park just for them.', 'A group of children are transported through a portal to another dimension where they are thrilled to discover a magical amusement park just for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KQnAoCm8sEYG7A99ytW9uULVj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188154'),
  ('357350222985551811', 'Carnivore', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kenneth Mader, Joseph Kurtz, Kenneth Mader', 'Joseph Kurtz, Kenneth Mader', 'Steven Walker, Jack Solem, J. Douglas Martner, Michael Hogan, Jill Adcock, John Jacob, Angelina Peneff, Michelle Nicole', null, 'A government experiment goes totally wrong as a creature confined in a hidden lab inside and abandoned house escapes. Afterwards, some teens show up to have a little fun in the house, not knowing that the beast is loose and watching them.', 'A government experiment goes totally wrong as a creature confined in a hidden lab inside and abandoned house escapes. Afterwards, some teens show up to have a little fun in the house, not knowing that the beast is loose and watching them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tklZqVj0YcrdDhOewfWBJsUnnN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97544'),
  ('422432512767162081', 'Carnivores', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yannick Renier, Jérémie Renier, Georges Lechaptois', 'Jérémie Renier, Yannick Renier', 'Leïla Bekhti, Zita Hanrot, Maximilien Poullein, Bastien Bouillon, Johan Heldenbergh, Hiam Abbass, Charlotte Campana, Nelia Da Costa', null, 'At the dawn of her thirties, Mona tries relentlessly to take off as an actress. Time passes and proposals do not arrive. Short of resources, she is forced to move to Sam, her younger sister.', 'At the dawn of her thirties, Mona tries relentlessly to take off as an actress. Time passes and proposals do not arrive. Short of resources, she is forced to move to Sam, her younger sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTJ3EeRMGvSP0T3cCBtxLChLQeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467679'),
  ('469393539668685088', 'Carnosaur', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Adam Simon, Keith Holland, Tony Steinberg', 'Adam Simon', 'Diane Ladd, Raphael Sbarge, Jennifer Runyon, Harrison Page, Ned Bellamy, Clint Howard, Frank Novak, Ed Williams', 'R', 'After being driven to extinction, great bloodthirsty dinosaurs come back to life with the assistance of a demented genetic scientist. She plans to replace the human race with a super-race of dinosaurs who will not pollute the planet.', 'After being driven to extinction, great bloodthirsty dinosaurs come back to life with the assistance of a demented genetic scientist. She plans to replace the human race with a super-race of dinosaurs who will not pollute the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbPJ90UJBu908RFtXDsm4i6nuv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39283'),
  ('1098498551154603228', 'Carnosaur 2', 1995, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Louis Morneau, John B. Aronson', 'Michael Palmer', 'John Savage, Cliff DeYoung, Don Stroud, Arabella Holzbog, Rick Dean, Ryan Thomas Johnson, Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Neith Hunter', 'R', 'A team of scientists go to a nuclear mining facility to investigate a possible meltdown and instead find a large amount of cloned dinosaurs.', 'A team of scientists go to a nuclear mining facility to investigate a possible meltdown and instead find a large amount of cloned dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dzRgDdbmEEolKPLpuScsMofHD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65460'),
  ('76598492172074024', 'Carnosaur 3: Primal Species', 1996, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jonathan Winfrey, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'Scott Sandin', 'Scott Valentine, Janet Gunn, Rick Dean, Anthony Peck, Rodger Halston, Terri J. Vaughn, Billy Burnette, Morgan Englund', 'R', 'International terrorists get a surprise when their cargo turns out to contain living dinosaurs. The army commando team now have to think fast, if they want to prevent the extinction of the human species, instead of the reptiles.', 'International terrorists get a surprise when their cargo turns out to contain living dinosaurs. The army commando team now have to think fast, if they want to prevent the extinction of the human species, instead of the reptiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPyp6ukHtpsOr4S0R4Pphgpp1IB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55667'),
  ('620749392650605719', 'Carny', 1980, 'Drama', 'Harry Stradling Jr., Robert Kaylor', 'Robert Kaylor, Robbie Robertson, Phoebe Kaylor', 'Gary Busey, Jodie Foster, Robbie Robertson, Meg Foster, Kenneth McMillan, Elisha Cook Jr., Tim Thomerson, Teddy Wilson', 'R', 'Tired of being a small-town waitress, Donna departs with the latest carnival show, living with entertainers Frankie and Patch in a tense, emotional triangle.', 'Tired of being a small-town waitress, Donna departs with the latest carnival show, living with entertainers Frankie and Patch in a tense, emotional triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXiS5rTxZ9hNdXJbTTIQ1ICtGKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32027'),
  ('579508347235717665', 'Carny', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action, Fantasy', 'Sheldon Wilson, Danny Nowak', 'Douglas G. Davis', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, A.C. Peterson, Vlasta Vrana, Dominic Cuzzocrea, Simone-Elise Girard, Felicia Shulman, Dani Kind, Kyle Gatehouse', null, 'When a traveling carnival comes to a rural Nebraska town, the caged attraction everyone is talking about is the alleged Jersey Devil. When the beast escapes, tearing the citizens to shreds, local sheriff Sam Atlas steps up to form a tracking team. But the carnivorous fugitive is only one of Sam’s problems. The local pastor, enraged by the death of his son at the hands of the beast, has plans for igniting his own brand of hellfire and revenge.', 'When a traveling carnival comes to a rural Nebraska town, the caged attraction everyone is talking about is the alleged Jersey Devil. When the beast escapes, tearing the citizens to shreds, local sheriff Sam Atlas steps up to form a tracking team. But the carnivorous fugitive is only one of Sam’s problems. The local pastor, enraged by the death of his son at the hands of the beast, has plans for igniting his own brand of hellfire and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nviPsOALdIw49zafBLxODoqeQIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36737'),
  ('271239561789920804', 'Carol', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Todd Haynes, Edward Lachman, Jesse Nye', 'Phyllis Nagy', 'Cate Blanchett, Rooney Mara, Kyle Chandler, Jake Lacy, Sarah Paulson, John Magaro, Cory Michael Smith, Kevin Crowley', 'R', 'In 1950s New York, a department-store clerk who dreams of a better life falls for an older, married woman.', 'In 1950s New York, a department-store clerk who dreams of a better life falls for an older, married woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJeled7EyPdur6TnCA5GYg0UVna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258480'),
  ('1072408828421785311', 'Carol for Another Christmas', 1964, 'TV Movie, Drama, Fantasy', 'Dan Eriksen, Lee Aronsohn, Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Rod Serling', 'Britt Ekland, Ben Gazzara, Sterling Hayden, Pat Hingle, Steve Lawrence, Percy Rodriguez, Eva Marie Saint, Peter Sellers', null, 'Wealthy industrialist and fierce isolationist Daniel Grudge, long embittered by the loss of his son in World War II, is visited by three ghosts on Christmas Eve who lead him to reconsider his attitude toward his fellow man.', 'Wealthy industrialist and fierce isolationist Daniel Grudge, long embittered by the loss of his son in World War II, is visited by three ghosts on Christmas Eve who lead him to reconsider his attitude toward his fellow man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8WK3fmkDDZf5lNLe9ulXfih3v1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86778'),
  ('31332823110098373', 'Carol of the Bells', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Olesya Morhunets, Andrii Obod, Yevhenii Kyrei', 'Kseniya Zastavskaya', 'Yana Koroliova, Andrii Mostrenko, Polina Gromova, Joanna Opozda, Mirosław Haniszewski, Khrystyna Ushytska, Tomasz Sobczak, Alla Binieieva', null, 'Immortalised as one of the most scintillating and uplifting Christmas songs, ''Carol of the Bells'' adapted from a popular and loved Ukrainian folk melody, came to represent the spirit of brotherhood and unity all over the world. The peaceful and neighbourly existence of three families, Polish, Ukrainian and Jewish, sharing a large house, musical evenings and merriment in the city of Stanislaviv in the years preceding and post war, is shattered. First in the Soviet occupation and the persecution of the Polish family, then, by the Nazi occupation of Ukraine, and the decimation of the Jewish family. Sacrificing their lives the Ukrainian family manage to save their neighbours'' children and their own daughter. Death and loss come to these families, but the healing power and joy , and a promise that the Future Will Not be Cancelled which "Carol of the Bells'' evokes will be everlasting.', 'Immortalised as one of the most scintillating and uplifting Christmas songs, ''Carol of the Bells'' adapted from a popular and loved Ukrainian folk melody, came to represent the spirit of brotherhood and unity all over the world. The peaceful and neighbourly existence of three families, Polish, Ukrainian and Jewish, sharing a large house, musical evenings and merriment in the city of Stanislaviv in the years preceding and post war, is shattered. First in the Soviet occupation and the persecution of the Polish family, then, by the Nazi occupation of Ukraine, and the decimation of the Jewish family. Sacrificing their lives the Ukrainian family manage to save their neighbours'' children and their own daughter. Death and loss come to these families, but the healing power and joy , and a promise that the Future Will Not be Cancelled which "Carol of the Bells'' evokes will be everlasting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IR8uvrnegx61XD6vnBXY5t5nwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853079'),
  ('163675577383771127', 'Carol''s Journey', 2002, 'Drama', 'Imanol Uribe, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Imanol Uribe, Ángel García Roldán', 'Clara Lago, Juan José Ballesta, Álvaro de Luna, Rosa María Sardà, María Barranco, Carmelo Gómez, Alberto Jiménez, Daniel Retuerta', null, 'Spain, 1938, during the Spanish Civil War. Carol, a 12-year-old Spanish-American girl, arrives in her mother''s hometown and transforms the secretive family environment. Her innocence and rebellious nature drive her at first to reject a world that is at once foreign and completely new.', 'Spain, 1938, during the Spanish Civil War. Carol, a 12-year-old Spanish-American girl, arrives in her mother''s hometown and transforms the secretive family environment. Her innocence and rebellious nature drive her at first to reject a world that is at once foreign and completely new.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRSLoto6mR6OdfpnXPauw1yHwa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56746'),
  ('670528988536997668', 'Carola de día, Carola de noche', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Jaime de Armiñán, Antonio L. Ballesteros, Sinesio Isla', 'Jaime de Armiñán, Leo Anchóriz', 'Marisol, Tony Isbert, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Rafael Alonso, Lili Muráti, Mariano Vidal Molina, Verónica Luján, Emilio Laguna', null, 'Due to the triumph of a revolution, Carola, a young and beautiful heiress to the throne, leaves her country to save her life; but her new existence, constantly watched, threatened by her enemies, subjected to the punctilious demands of her position, bores her desperately.', 'Due to the triumph of a revolution, Carola, a young and beautiful heiress to the throne, leaves her country to save her life; but her new existence, constantly watched, threatened by her enemies, subjected to the punctilious demands of her position, bores her desperately.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCocBALfxHRqIodMLrQbOOyTNLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215401'),
  ('804941407106900151', 'Carole Matthieu', 2016, 'Drama', 'David Chambille, Louis-Julien Petit', 'Samuel Doux, Fanny Burdino, Louis-Julien Petit', 'Isabelle Adjani, Corinne Masiero, Sarah Suco, Ola Rapace, Pablo Pauly, Arnaud Viard, Marie-Christine Orry, Alexandre Carrière', null, 'Isabelle Adjani is Carole Matthieu – a workplace physician employed in a call centre who has become emotionally involved in the suffering of her humiliated co-workers.', 'Isabelle Adjani is Carole Matthieu – a workplace physician employed in a call centre who has become emotionally involved in the suffering of her humiliated co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtvUkiY2eDWCPJf1ZfpFnX5L1Vm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414202'),
