  ('267374419800735398', 'Caroline at Midnight', 1994, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Scott McGinnis, Christian Sebaldt, Scott J. Ateah', 'Travis Rink', 'Clayton Rohner, Mia Sara, Tim Daly, Paul Le Mat, Judd Nelson, Virginia Madsen, Xander Berkeley, Caroline Barclay', 'R', 'A policeman''s wife falls for a reporter who suspects her husband of corruption and murder.', 'A policeman''s wife falls for a reporter who suspects her husband of corruption and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zK3Nd5bPKPiZczH32SG0QE8sZEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222369'),
  ('981563320908090315', 'Caroline?', 1990, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent, Willie E. Simmons, Jr., William Wages', null, 'Stephanie Zimbalist, Pamela Reed, George Grizzard, Patricia Neal, Dorothy McGuire, Shawn Phelan, Jenny Jacobs, Libby Whittemore', null, 'Hallmark Hall of Fame presents the story of a mysterious woman claiming to be the deceased daughter of a rich man tries to solve the problems of his untrusting son and supposedly physically and mentally handicaped daughter. But one question stands in her way: is she really Caroline?', 'Hallmark Hall of Fame presents the story of a mysterious woman claiming to be the deceased daughter of a rich man tries to solve the problems of his untrusting son and supposedly physically and mentally handicaped daughter. But one question stands in her way: is she really Caroline?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmKSJNflQAmUfZpfYNL9AFjEvTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108012'),
  ('556577218153396080', 'Carom Shots', 1963, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Marcel Bluwal, René-Christian Forget, Daniel Wronecki', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean-Claude Brialy, Michel Serrault, Louis de Funès, Sophie Daumier, Anne Tonietti, Henri Virlogeux, Alfred Adam, René Clermont', null, 'Paul Martin is the subservient brown-nosing youngster who needs quick advancement up the hierarchy to pay for the modern lifestyle he is buying on credit. Seeing that marrying his immediate superior''s daughter will not get him the results he wants, he begins plotting the demise of the head of the company. The company itself specializes in holiday travel and unscrupulously brutalizes its customers for maximum profit, spending more thought on publicity gimmicks than customer service...', 'Paul Martin is the subservient brown-nosing youngster who needs quick advancement up the hierarchy to pay for the modern lifestyle he is buying on credit. Seeing that marrying his immediate superior''s daughter will not get him the results he wants, he begins plotting the demise of the head of the company. The company itself specializes in holiday travel and unscrupulously brutalizes its customers for maximum profit, spending more thought on publicity gimmicks than customer service...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cT7JbJx2Mx8XZEyGJQNvTR5GcL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61697'),
  ('922409654196275517', 'Carosello Carosone', 2021, 'TV Movie, Music', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Marco Bassano, Daniele Fontana', 'Francesca Serafini, Giordano Meacci', 'Eduardo Scarpetta, Nicolo Pasetti, Vincenzo Nemolato, Ludovica Martino, Marianna Fontana, Flavio Furno, Alessandro Loffredi, Enzo Casertano', null, 'The life and times of Italian music legend Renato Carosone.', 'The life and times of Italian music legend Renato Carosone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iposKZEIF4zbWCGsR89cBvHzmXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790346'),
  ('265931335859426093', 'Carosello in Love', 2025, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jacopo Bonvicini, Gian Enrico Bianchi', 'Simona Coppini, Armando Festa', 'Giacomo Giorgio, Ludovica Martino, Alessandro Tedeschi, Dora Romano, Federico Tocci, Alberto Astorri, Guido Quaglione, Isabella Mottinelli', null, 'Laura, idealistic and passionate about television, and Mario, a rebellious director who dreams of cinema, start out clashing but gradually develop mutual respect and affection. Over twenty years of encounters, successes, and mistakes, their relationship evolves until they discover that love can appear in the most unexpected places—right in the world of Carosello and the TV stories that marked a generation.', 'Laura, idealistic and passionate about television, and Mario, a rebellious director who dreams of cinema, start out clashing but gradually develop mutual respect and affection. Over twenty years of encounters, successes, and mistakes, their relationship evolves until they discover that love can appear in the most unexpected places—right in the world of Carosello and the TV stories that marked a generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heqMk6UbPHfynLvt2YnjWMGYsTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1589762'),
  ('201020428103730167', 'Carousel', 1956, 'Music, Romance', 'Henry King, Charles G. Clarke, Stanley Hough', 'Phoebe Ephron, Henry Ephron', 'Gordon MacRae, Shirley Jones, Cameron Mitchell, Barbara Ruick, Claramae Turner, Robert Rounseville, Gene Lockhart, Audrey Christie', 'G', 'Billy Bigelow has been dead for 15 years. Now outside the pearly gates, he long ago waived his right to go back to Earth for a day. He has heard that there is a problem with his family: namely with his wife Julie Bigelow, née Jordan, and his child he hasn''t met. He would now like to head back to Earth to assist in rectifying the problem; but before he may go, he has to get permission from the gatekeeper by telling him his story. Adapted from the Rodgers and Hammerstein hit Broadway musical.', 'Billy Bigelow has been dead for 15 years. Now outside the pearly gates, he long ago waived his right to go back to Earth for a day. He has heard that there is a problem with his family: namely with his wife Julie Bigelow, née Jordan, and his child he hasn''t met. He would now like to head back to Earth to assist in rectifying the problem; but before he may go, he has to get permission from the gatekeeper by telling him his story. Adapted from the Rodgers and Hammerstein hit Broadway musical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W7X2rHPTqzfYG5dZbvWcR5MzUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28100'),
  ('26594590306434893', 'Carousel', 2023, 'Horror', 'Simon Sandquist', 'Filip Hammarström, Henry Stenberg, Mårten Gisby', 'Wilma Lidén, Omar Rudberg, Amanda Lindh, Ludvig Deltin, Embla Ingelman-Sundberg, Emil Algpeus, Gunnar Hoaas, Katerina Pavlou', null, 'Park manager Fiona is tasked with taking care of some former friends who won an exclusive private sneak preview of Halloween at Liseberg – a whole night, all alone in the empty park. But cotton candy, lovely rides and lots of laughter soon turn into something completely different, as they realize they are not alone in the park. And the night of dreams quickly turns into a true nightmare.', 'Park manager Fiona is tasked with taking care of some former friends who won an exclusive private sneak preview of Halloween at Liseberg – a whole night, all alone in the empty park. But cotton candy, lovely rides and lots of laughter soon turn into something completely different, as they realize they are not alone in the park. And the night of dreams quickly turns into a true nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhTFWMto4o6ATe6W58bFU8AGUje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058078'),
  ('995317192585700306', 'Carousel', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rachel Lambert, Dustin Lane', 'Rachel Lambert', 'Jenny Slate, Abby Ryder Fortson, Sam Waterston, Katey Sagal, Jessica Harper', null, 'Noah''s settled life caring for his anxious daughter and medical practice is disrupted when his high school ex Rebecca returns. Their old spark remains, making them question if love deserves another chance.', 'Noah''s settled life caring for his anxious daughter and medical practice is disrupted when his high school ex Rebecca returns. Their old spark remains, making them question if love deserves another chance.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmHo3fI2vBEXVwEQkL8TmmDAl3Q.jpg', 'plex:movie:carousel-2026-1'),
  ('356778223499999400', 'Carpenters', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'In front of a building, five carpenters are working on woodworking machines.', 'In front of a building, five carpenters are working on woodworking machines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxI3StLiB81JDjT7LGTyRZTWZRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195098'),
  ('317897271616656273', 'Carpet and Chaos', 2016, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Rémi Mazet, Nader T. Homayoun', 'Nader T. Homayoun, Philippe Blasband', 'Golab Adine, Babak Hamidian, Michel Vuillermoz, Aurélia Petit', null, 'While supposedly taking mud baths in Korea, the paterfamilias of a family from Tehran’s Grand Bazaar dies of a sudden heart attack in Brive-la-Gaillarde. His wife and his oldest son travel to France to bring his body home and to investigate the circumstances of his death.', 'While supposedly taking mud baths in Korea, the paterfamilias of a family from Tehran’s Grand Bazaar dies of a sudden heart attack in Brive-la-Gaillarde. His wife and his oldest son travel to France to bring his body home and to investigate the circumstances of his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4tYkGq50UddeVtSt9gMnNrhbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433890'),
  ('129339974511574893', 'Carpool', 1996, 'Family, Comedy', 'Arthur Hiller, Conrad E. Palmisano, David M. Walsh', 'Don Rhymer', 'Tom Arnold, David Paymer, Rhea Perlman, Rod Steiger, Kim Coates, Rachael Leigh Cook, Mikey Kovar, Jordan Warkol', 'PG', 'A man with an important business meeting finds himself having to take care of the carpool for the neighborhood school children when his wife gets sick. Stopping to get donuts for the kids, things go even more awry when he finds himself a victim of a robbery. However, the situation only gets worse as a desperate man who had been contemplating a bank robbery robs the robbers and takes the man and the kids hostage in their van as his truck is blocked by an armored car. The thing then proceeds into a comedic chase movie. The father finds his kids don''t really respect him and they react better to the robber. The end result is everyone gets a lifestyle change, including the original store owner.', 'A man with an important business meeting finds himself having to take care of the carpool for the neighborhood school children when his wife gets sick. Stopping to get donuts for the kids, things go even more awry when he finds himself a victim of a robbery. However, the situation only gets worse as a desperate man who had been contemplating a bank robbery robs the robbers and takes the man and the kids hostage in their van as his truck is blocked by an armored car. The thing then proceeds into a comedic chase movie. The father finds his kids don''t really respect him and they react better to the robber. The end result is everyone gets a lifestyle change, including the original store owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYoZR4EtrfziT5WXhZzcNbH5GuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23945'),
  ('438478818391971019', 'Carpoolers', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Pablo Bürmann, Hugo Martín Cuervo', 'Hugo Martín Cuervo', 'Salva Reina, Ana Polvorosa, Pol Monen, Andrea Duro, Mara Guil', null, 'Four travellers meet in Madrid’s city centre through a rideshare app. Four individuals who could never imagine the journey they are about to embark on, as they gradually exchange secrets, emotions and mistrust, eventually arriving at a very different destination to the one they had planned. Along the way, they will learn a lot about who they are travelling with... and about themselves.', 'Four travellers meet in Madrid’s city centre through a rideshare app. Four individuals who could never imagine the journey they are about to embark on, as they gradually exchange secrets, emotions and mistrust, eventually arriving at a very different destination to the one they had planned. Along the way, they will learn a lot about who they are travelling with... and about themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdYpdQEo8OP2ajuFddtGP34KR9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797245'),
  ('211955273747540328', 'Carré Blanc', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jean-Baptiste Léonetti, David Nissen, Freddy Verhoeven', 'Jean-Baptiste Léonetti', 'Sami Bouajila, Julie Gayet, Carlos Leal, Dominique Paturel, Jean-Pierre Andréani, Fejria Deliba, Valérie Bodson, Viviana Aliberti', null, 'Philippe lives in a world controlled by a caste system. Those who play the "game" correctly become higher and more powerful. Phillipe plays the game well but his wife wants him to return to reality. Its a love story after marriage.', 'Philippe lives in a world controlled by a caste system. Those who play the "game" correctly become higher and more powerful. Phillipe plays the game well but his wife wants him to return to reality. Its a love story after marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXQFaT5iv0aNsqD0uSeVD0rOE3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84227'),
  ('92536010127316197', 'Carriage to Vienna', 1966, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Milada Mikešová, Karel Kachyňa, Josef Illík', 'Karel Kachyňa, Jan Procházka', 'Iva Janžurová, Jaromír Hanzlík, Luděk Munzar, Vladimír Ptáček, Ivo Niederle, Jiří Žák, Zdeněk Jarolímek, Ladislav Jandoš', null, 'A WW2 story of a young Austrian soldier running from the Russian army and a woman whom he forces to come along in order to save his wounded mate.', 'A WW2 story of a young Austrian soldier running from the Russian army and a woman whom he forces to come along in order to save his wounded mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkosU5OUEs5RJSmahYnnxj2xTg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118497'),
  ('209482673078779674', 'Carrie', 1952, 'Drama, Romance', 'William Wyler, Victor Milner', 'Ruth Goetz, Augustus Goetz', 'Laurence Olivier, Jennifer Jones, Miriam Hopkins, Eddie Albert, Basil Ruysdael, Ray Teal, Barry Kelley, Sara Berner', null, 'In the late 1890s, the ambitious, innocent Carrie arrives in Chicago’s South Side and stays with her nagging, dullish married sister. She then runs for help to traveling salesman Charles Drouet. She soon becomes his mistress, but falls in love with married restaurant manager George Hurstwood.', 'In the late 1890s, the ambitious, innocent Carrie arrives in Chicago’s South Side and stays with her nagging, dullish married sister. She then runs for help to traveling salesman Charles Drouet. She soon becomes his mistress, but falls in love with married restaurant manager George Hurstwood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hif1GraUbvlocgqtrwYMaybsGcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43358'),
  ('382429563386350588', 'Carrie', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brian De Palma, Mario Tosi, Dick Ziker', 'Lawrence D. Cohen', 'Sissy Spacek, Piper Laurie, Amy Irving, William Katt, John Travolta, Nancy Allen, Betty Buckley, P. J. Soles', 'R', 'Withdrawn and sensitive teenager Carrie White faces bullying from classmates and abuse from her fanatically pious mother. When she begins to suspect that she has supernatural powers, things take a dark and violent turn.', 'Withdrawn and sensitive teenager Carrie White faces bullying from classmates and abuse from her fanatically pious mother. When she begins to suspect that she has supernatural powers, things take a dark and violent turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tT1rqlsTguyfUBMrbHR9cv1rxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7340'),
  ('990348416556382269', 'Carrie', 2002, 'Horror, Drama, TV Movie', 'David Carson, Victor Goss, Paul Etherington', null, 'Angela Bettis, Patricia Clarkson, Rena Sofer, Kandyse McClure, Emilie de Ravin, Tobias Mehler, Jesse Cadotte, Meghan Black', 'NR', 'An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl''s lonely life is dominated by relentless bullying at school and an oppressive religious fanatic mother at home. When her tormentors pull a humiliating prank at the senior prom, she unleashes a horrifying chaos on everyone, leaving nothing but destruction in her wake.', 'An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl''s lonely life is dominated by relentless bullying at school and an oppressive religious fanatic mother at home. When her tormentors pull a humiliating prank at the senior prom, she unleashes a horrifying chaos on everyone, leaving nothing but destruction in her wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knjeEeeyIwDkUtZwDfJOcUIuNdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7342'),
  ('665395453368011127', 'Carrie', 2013, 'Drama, Horror', 'Kimberly Peirce, Itsuko Kurono, Jonnie Katz', 'Lawrence D. Cohen, Roberto Aguirre-Sacasa', 'Chloë Grace Moretz, Julianne Moore, Gabriella Wilde, Ansel Elgort, Alex Russell, Judy Greer, Portia Doubleday, Zoë Belkin', 'R', 'An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl is the object of relentless bullying at school and an oppressively religious mother at home.', 'An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl is the object of relentless bullying at school and an oppressively religious mother at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kloXz9qwO23z9Kbt3z3MgnjF4xO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133805'),
  ('1105809816771850506', 'Carrie Pilby', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Susan Johnson, Gonzalo Amat, Marco Londoner', 'Kara Holden', 'Bel Powley, Vanessa Bayer, Colin O''Donoghue, William Moseley, Jason Ritter, Gabriel Byrne, Nathan Lane, Scott Keiji Takeda', null, 'Awkward, isolated and disapproving of most of the people around her, a precocious 19-year-old genius is challenged to put her convictions to the test by venturing out on to the NYC dating scene.', 'Awkward, isolated and disapproving of most of the people around her, a precocious 19-year-old genius is challenged to put her convictions to the test by venturing out on to the NYC dating scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IHuNvCTOsSox1Gj4ykHImrC5EL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317560'),
  ('1109203593508196977', 'Carried Away', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Barreto, Declan Quinn, John Wildermuth', 'Ed Jones', 'Dennis Hopper, Amy Irving, Amy Locane, Julie Harris, Gary Busey, Hal Holbrook, Christopher Pettiet, Priscilla Pointer', 'R', 'Based on Jim Harrison''s book, "Farmer". 47-year-old Joseph Svenden lives on the family farm with his dying mother and teaches at a two room schoolhouse with Rosealee, his lover and his best friend''s widow. Joseph, who lacks a college degree, learns that he will lose his teaching job at the end of the year when the school district expands into his town. Meanwhile, he is seduced by 17-year-old Catherine, a new student in his class. His affair with Catherine and losing his teaching job forces Joseph to take a look at his previously dull life and to decide how he wants to live the rest of it.', 'Based on Jim Harrison''s book, "Farmer". 47-year-old Joseph Svenden lives on the family farm with his dying mother and teaches at a two room schoolhouse with Rosealee, his lover and his best friend''s widow. Joseph, who lacks a college degree, learns that he will lose his teaching job at the end of the year when the school district expands into his town. Meanwhile, he is seduced by 17-year-old Catherine, a new student in his class. His affair with Catherine and losing his teaching job forces Joseph to take a look at his previously dull life and to decide how he wants to live the rest of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58pT6TIvkQNJYefpeKFa3nBwcSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36447'),
  ('539952064906466981', 'Carriers', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor, David Allen Cluck', 'David Pastor, Àlex Pastor', 'Lou Taylor Pucci, Chris Pine, Piper Perabo, Emily VanCamp, Christopher Meloni, Kiernan Shipka, Ron McClary, Mark Moses', 'PG-13', 'A deadly virus has spread across the globe. Contagion is everywhere, no one is safe, and no one can be trusted. Four friends race through the back roads of the American West on their way to a secluded utopian beach in the Gulf of Mexico where they could peacefully wait out the pandemic. Their plans take a grim turn when their car breaks down on an isolated road starting a chain of events that will seal their fates.', 'A deadly virus has spread across the globe. Contagion is everywhere, no one is safe, and no one can be trusted. Four friends race through the back roads of the American West on their way to a secluded utopian beach in the Gulf of Mexico where they could peacefully wait out the pandemic. Their plans take a grim turn when their car breaks down on an isolated road starting a chain of events that will seal their fates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxjnjHtHXgvjdhkwpelE9ZwVMg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25769'),
  ('59936942327959239', 'Carrington', 1995, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Hampton, Denis Lenoir, Andy Semple', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Emma Thompson, Jonathan Pryce, Steven Waddington, Samuel West, Rufus Sewell, Penelope Wilton, Janet McTeer, Jeremy Northam', 'R', 'Painter Dora Carrington develops an intimate but extremely complex bond with writer Lytton Strachey. Though Lytton is a homosexual, he is enchanted by the mysterious Dora and they begin a lifelong friendship that has strangely romantic undertones. Eventually, Lytton and Dora decide to live together, despite the fact that the latter has fallen in love with military man Ralph Partridge, whom she plans to marry.', 'Painter Dora Carrington develops an intimate but extremely complex bond with writer Lytton Strachey. Though Lytton is a homosexual, he is enchanted by the mysterious Dora and they begin a lifelong friendship that has strangely romantic undertones. Eventually, Lytton and Dora decide to live together, despite the fact that the latter has fallen in love with military man Ralph Partridge, whom she plans to marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NmeBTkC4UQa8XT2GGsBN2R8Bqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47018'),
  ('896588607937966627', 'Carrington V.C.', 1954, 'Drama', 'Anthony Asquith, Desmond Dickinson', 'John Hunter', 'David Niven, Margaret Leighton, Noelle Middleton, Allan Cuthbertson, Victor Maddern, Raymond Francis, Geoffrey Keen, Newton Blick', null, 'Major Charles Carrington (David Niven) is arrested for taking £125 from the base safe. He also faces two other charges that could finish his distinguished service career. He decides to act in his own defence at his court martial hearing, his argument being that he is owed a lot of money from the army for his various postings that have cost him out of his own pocket. To further complicate the proceedings, Carrington alleges he told his superior, the very disliked Colonel Henniker, that he was taking the money from the safe. A man''s career, his marriage, and quite a few reputations all hang in the balance.', 'Major Charles Carrington (David Niven) is arrested for taking £125 from the base safe. He also faces two other charges that could finish his distinguished service career. He decides to act in his own defence at his court martial hearing, his argument being that he is owed a lot of money from the army for his various postings that have cost him out of his own pocket. To further complicate the proceedings, Carrington alleges he told his superior, the very disliked Colonel Henniker, that he was taking the money from the safe. A man''s career, his marriage, and quite a few reputations all hang in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awXt1JTzcwmgtxRfkxZz2C36V4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43198'),
  ('539655601595226242', 'Carroceros', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Mariano Frigerio, Denise Urfeig, Ana Clara Benda', 'Denise Urfeig, Mariano Frigerio', 'Mariano Frigerio, Antonio Gasalla, Betiana Blum, Luis Brandoni, Lidia Catalano, Diana Frey, Enrique Pinti, Cecilia Rossetto', null, 'A documentary about the fans of "Waiting for the Carriage", the Argentine film classic directed by Alejandro Doria, and which investigates the obvious and hidden reasons for this phenomenon.', 'A documentary about the fans of "Waiting for the Carriage", the Argentine film classic directed by Alejandro Doria, and which investigates the obvious and hidden reasons for this phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPyhqH1UrFsGgRI0hM1EiTNmnMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790500'),
  ('597809014010542073', 'Carrossel 2: O Sumiço de Maria Joaquina', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Maurício Eça, Pedro Barbalho, Isabela Lazarini', 'Márcio Alemão, Mirna Nogueira', 'Larissa Manoela, Jean Paulo Campos, Maisa Silva, Guilherme Seta, Fernanda Concon, Lucas Santos, Victória Diniz, Matheus Ueta', null, 'The children are invited by a Brazilian music star to one of his shows. But the trip turns into a nightmare when the villains Gonzales and Gonzalito, recently released from prison, decide to kidnap Maria Joaquina.', 'The children are invited by a Brazilian music star to one of his shows. But the trip turns into a nightmare when the villains Gonzales and Gonzalito, recently released from prison, decide to kidnap Maria Joaquina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/D5L9rLe9rWEA9wNXOtJt2jo1J1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352431'),
