  ('882960229584409651', 'Carry On Abroad', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Bill Bennison, Alan Hume', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Bernard Bresslaw, Barbara Windsor, Kenneth Connor, Peter Butterworth', null, 'A group of holidaymakers head for the Spanish resort of Elsbels for a 4-day visit. When they get there, they find the Hotel still hasn''t been finished being built, and the weather is awful. And there is something strange about the staff—they all look very similar. To top it all off, the weather seems to be having an adverse affect on the Hotel''s foundations.', 'A group of holidaymakers head for the Spanish resort of Elsbels for a 4-day visit. When they get there, they find the Hotel still hasn''t been finished being built, and the weather is awful. And there is something strange about the staff—they all look very similar. To top it all off, the weather seems to be having an adverse affect on the Hotel''s foundations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2x2D6yhDJHz5hKM9tWHjP6IIFdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19252'),
  ('2287088795309887', 'Carry On Again Doctor', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Ivor Powell, Brian Lawrence', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Charles Hawtrey, Jim Dale, Joan Sims, Barbara Windsor, Hattie Jacques, Patsy Rowlands', null, 'Dr. Nookey is disgraced and sent to a remote island hospital. He is given a secret slimming potion by a member of staff, Gladstone Screwer, and he flies back to England to fame and fortune. But others want to cash in on his good fortunes, and some just want him brought down a peg or two.', 'Dr. Nookey is disgraced and sent to a remote island hospital. He is given a secret slimming potion by a member of staff, Gladstone Screwer, and he flies back to England to fame and fortune. But others want to cash in on his good fortunes, and some just want him brought down a peg or two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOmUS5fdhjT8nnQI1WiMOyGDm9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19293'),
  ('1148820275061036003', 'Carry On at Your Convenience', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Ernest Steward, David Bracknell', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Hattie Jacques, Bernard Bresslaw, Kenneth Cope, Patsy Rowlands', null, 'At WC Boggs'' Lavatory factory, Vic Spanner is the union representative who calls a strike at the drop of a hat. However, eventually everyone gets fed up with him.', 'At WC Boggs'' Lavatory factory, Vic Spanner is the union representative who calls a strike at the drop of a hat. However, eventually everyone gets fed up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BRVvZOWEO86tsey3KsGNucpmgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19297'),
  ('394239990484097764', 'Carry On Behind', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, David Bracknell, Terry Pearce', 'Dave Freeman', 'Elke Sommer, Kenneth Williams, Bernard Bresslaw, Kenneth Connor, Jack Douglas, Joan Sims, Windsor Davies, Peter Butterworth', 'NR', 'Professors Vooshka and Crump decide to visit an archaeological site to study the artifacts there. Lo and behold, it''s right next to a caravan site where all manner of people are staying. With a randy Major owning the site, a snobbish mother, and the two professors'' constant innuendos, the story ends with a sinking caravan site and a striptease performance as a replacement for the cabaret night.', 'Professors Vooshka and Crump decide to visit an archaeological site to study the artifacts there. Lo and behold, it''s right next to a caravan site where all manner of people are staying. With a randy Major owning the site, a snobbish mother, and the two professors'' constant innuendos, the story ends with a sinking caravan site and a striptease performance as a replacement for the cabaret night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8IglMzitC581htTQ1Vsb0cRSJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19300'),
  ('517270692457323275', 'Carry On Cabby', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Hattie Jacques, Kenneth Connor, Charles Hawtrey, Esma Cannon, Liz Fraser, Bill Owen, Milo O''Shea', null, 'Speedee Taxis is a great success, which means its workaholic owner Charlie starts neglecting Peggy, his wife. Suddenly a fleet of rival taxis appears from nowhere and start pinching all the fares. The rivals are Glamcabs, and they have a secret weapon. All their drivers are very attractive women! Who''s behind Glamcabs? It''s open warfare and only one fleet can survive!', 'Speedee Taxis is a great success, which means its workaholic owner Charlie starts neglecting Peggy, his wife. Suddenly a fleet of rival taxis appears from nowhere and start pinching all the fares. The rivals are Glamcabs, and they have a secret weapon. All their drivers are very attractive women! Who''s behind Glamcabs? It''s open warfare and only one fleet can survive!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3S9fkzkl3kqgnlZUvBF1SqYKVm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19254'),
  ('238818753501791006', 'Carry On Camping', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Jack Causey, Dickie Bamber', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Kenneth Williams, Terry Scott, Barbara Windsor, Hattie Jacques, Bernard Bresslaw', 'R', 'Sid and Bernie keep having their amorous intentions snubbed by their girlfriends Joan and Anthea, so when they decide to take them on a holiday to Paradise Camp, they think they''re off to a nudist colony—but they couldn''t be more wrong, and meet up with the weirdest bunch of campers you can imagine.', 'Sid and Bernie keep having their amorous intentions snubbed by their girlfriends Joan and Anthea, so when they decide to take them on a holiday to Paradise Camp, they think they''re off to a nudist colony—but they couldn''t be more wrong, and meet up with the weirdest bunch of campers you can imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1lFHqOXCJW5yo6MK5d7EdnnJsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19307'),
  ('641035009320563375', 'Carry On Christmas', 1969, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ronnie Baxter', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Terry Scott, Charles Hawtrey, Hattie Jacques, Barbara Windsor, Bernard Bresslaw, Peter Butterworth, Frankie Howerd', null, 'Ebenezer Scrooge is a misery on Christmas, not allowing people money or doing anything to share Christmas cheer around his employees or acquaintances. While Scrooge is visited by three ghosts we see how his penny pinching has affected those around him.', 'Ebenezer Scrooge is a misery on Christmas, not allowing people money or doing anything to share Christmas cheer around his employees or acquaintances. While Scrooge is visited by three ghosts we see how his penny pinching has affected those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iC6fnXUvSaZcc0qearOAjeIcaaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110439'),
  ('517175057954113547', 'Carry On Cleo', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume', null, 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Kenneth Connor, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Jim Dale, Amanda Barrie, Victor Maddern', null, 'Two Britons—inventor Hengist Pod, and Horse, a brave and cunning fighter—are captured and enslaved by invading Romans and taken to Rome. One of their first encounters in Rome leaves Hengist being mistaken for a fighter, and gets drafted into the Royal Guard to protect Cleopatra.', 'Two Britons—inventor Hengist Pod, and Horse, a brave and cunning fighter—are captured and enslaved by invading Romans and taken to Rome. One of their first encounters in Rome leaves Hengist being mistaken for a fighter, and gets drafted into the Royal Guard to protect Cleopatra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qweT0mZYDcnjy7MLIgWZVN2pu8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5066'),
  ('863942918878532479', 'Carry On Columbus', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Gareth Tandy, Terry Bamber, Becky Harris', 'Dave Freeman', 'Jim Dale, Bernard Cribbins, Maureen Lipman, Peter Richardson, Alexei Sayle, Rik Mayall, Charles Fleischer, Larry Miller', null, 'Christopher Columbus believes he can find an alternative route to the far East and persuades the King and Queen of Spain to finance his expedition...', 'Christopher Columbus believes he can find an alternative route to the far East and persuades the King and Queen of Spain to finance his expedition...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2xYxXo2j8RCqxDQCs0c2xxqw8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19725'),
  ('819632646268886473', 'Carry On Constable', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Edward Scaife, Peter Manley', 'Norman Hudis', 'Sidney James, Eric Barker, Kenneth Connor, Charles Hawtrey, Kenneth Williams, Leslie Phillips, Joan Sims, Hattie Jacques', 'NR', 'With a flu epidemic running rife, three new bumbling recruits are assigned to Inspector Mills police station. With help from Special Constable Gorse, they manage to totally wreck operations of the police force and let plenty of criminals get away, even before they arrive at the station. They all have to prove themselves or else they''ll be out of a job and Sgt. Wilkins will be transferred.', 'With a flu epidemic running rife, three new bumbling recruits are assigned to Inspector Mills police station. With help from Special Constable Gorse, they manage to totally wreck operations of the police force and let plenty of criminals get away, even before they arrive at the station. They all have to prove themselves or else they''ll be out of a job and Sgt. Wilkins will be transferred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXdjlhYe3bjKLDebwib5SPkxEea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21240'),
  ('762960336741375958', 'Carry On Cowboy', 1965, 'Comedy, Western', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume', null, 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Jim Dale, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Angela Douglas, Bernard Bresslaw, Peter Butterworth', null, 'Stodge City is in the grip of the Rumpo Kid and his gang. Mistaken identity again takes a hand as a ''sanitary engineer'' named Marshal P. Knutt is mistaken for a law marshal. Being the conscientious sort, Marshal tries to help the town get rid of Rumpo, and a showdown is inevitable. Marshal has two aids—revenge-seeking Annie Oakley and his sanitary expertise.', 'Stodge City is in the grip of the Rumpo Kid and his gang. Mistaken identity again takes a hand as a ''sanitary engineer'' named Marshal P. Knutt is mistaken for a law marshal. Being the conscientious sort, Marshal tries to help the town get rid of Rumpo, and a showdown is inevitable. Marshal has two aids—revenge-seeking Annie Oakley and his sanitary expertise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22EXyio02raVcI6dt6X69NoxBSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5065'),
  ('143335674800736083', 'Carry On Cruising', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume, Jack Causey', 'Norman Hudis', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Kenneth Connor, Liz Fraser, Dilys Laye, Esma Cannon, Lance Percival, Jimmy Thompson', null, 'Captain Crowther''s lot is not a happy one! Five of his crew have to be replaced and at such short notice before the voyage begins there isn''t much to choose from. Not only does he get the five most incompetent shipmates ever to sail the seven seas, but the passengers turn out to be a rather strange bunch too. The SS Happy Wanderer will never be the same.', 'Captain Crowther''s lot is not a happy one! Five of his crew have to be replaced and at such short notice before the voyage begins there isn''t much to choose from. Not only does he get the five most incompetent shipmates ever to sail the seven seas, but the passengers turn out to be a rather strange bunch too. The SS Happy Wanderer will never be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGdrTIuUQK5NkEwVjts1BLn9w9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26190'),
  ('356800384975732622', 'Carry On Dick', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, David Bracknell, Ernest Steward', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Barbara Windsor, Kenneth Williams, Hattie Jacques, Bernard Bresslaw, Joan Sims, Kenneth Connor, Peter Butterworth', null, 'Dick Turpin is terrorising the countryside around Upper Dencher. Captain Fancey and Sergeant Jock Strapp plan to put an end to his escapades, and enlist the help of the Reverend Flasher. Little do they know that the priest leads a double life. Then Madame Desiree and her "Birds of Paradise" arrive in the village...', 'Dick Turpin is terrorising the countryside around Upper Dencher. Captain Fancey and Sergeant Jock Strapp plan to put an end to his escapades, and enlist the help of the Reverend Flasher. Little do they know that the priest leads a double life. Then Madame Desiree and her "Birds of Paradise" arrive in the village...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ShJqgijkZHHrk0WiSkHhxeLzyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26327'),
  ('656209080748583486', 'Carry On Doctor', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Alan Hume, Gerald Thomas, Terence A. Clegg', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Frankie Howerd, Sidney James, Charles Hawtrey, Kenneth Williams, Jim Dale, Barbara Windsor, Joan Sims, Bernard Bresslaw', 'PG', 'Francis Bigger, a notorious charlatan who tours the country lecturing on the subject of mind over matter, slips off the platform in the middle of his performance and ends up in hospital under the care of Dr Tinkle. The hospital is about to enter a period of total chaos.', 'Francis Bigger, a notorious charlatan who tours the country lecturing on the subject of mind over matter, slips off the platform in the middle of his performance and ends up in hospital under the care of Dr Tinkle. The hospital is about to enter a period of total chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97lWSFqD1LU13Acj4TS1um4ltMH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5064'),
  ('411921705163860669', 'Carry On Emmannuelle', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Gregory Dark, Mike Higgins', 'Lance Peters', 'Suzanne Danielle, Kenneth Williams, Kenneth Connor, Joan Sims, Jack Douglas, Peter Butterworth, Larry Dann, Beryl Reid', null, 'The beautiful and sex-starved Emmannuelle Prevert just cannot inflame her husband''s ardour. In frustration she seduces a string of VIPs, including the Prime Minister and the American Ambassador. A jealous lover gives a list of all her conquests to the national press and a scandal ensues. But will she ever manage to get her own husband into bed?', 'The beautiful and sex-starved Emmannuelle Prevert just cannot inflame her husband''s ardour. In frustration she seduces a string of VIPs, including the Prime Minister and the American Ambassador. A jealous lover gives a list of all her conquests to the national press and a scandal ensues. But will she ever manage to get her own husband into bed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rqbcS8SVPDI50JfhyeV5J0tFWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34743'),
  ('562362351871365612', 'Carry On England', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Ernest Steward, Jack Causey', 'David Pursall, Jack Seddon', 'Kenneth Connor, Windsor Davies, Judy Geeson, Patrick Mower, Jack Douglas, Joan Sims, Melvyn Hayes, Peter Butterworth', null, 'Captain S. Melly takes over as the new Commanding Officer at an experimental mixed sex air defence base. It''s 1940 and England is under heavy bombardment, but the crew seem more interested in each other than the enemy planes above. Captain Melly plans to put a stop to all this, and becomes the target of a campaign to abandon his separatist ideals...', 'Captain S. Melly takes over as the new Commanding Officer at an experimental mixed sex air defence base. It''s 1940 and England is under heavy bombardment, but the crew seem more interested in each other than the enemy planes above. Captain Melly plans to put a stop to all this, and becomes the target of a campaign to abandon his separatist ideals...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e44o6rtxR1W3fLa9jumnff2bHXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21251'),
  ('389851491628372', 'Carry On Girls', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Barbara Windsor, Joan Sims, Kenneth Connor, Bernard Bresslaw, June Whitfield, Peter Butterworth, Jack Douglas', null, 'Local councillor Sidney Fiddler persuades the Mayor to help improve the image of their rundown seaside town by holding a beauty contest. But formidable Councillor Prodworthy, head of the local women''s liberation movement, has other ideas. It''s open warfare as the women''s lib attempt to sabotage the contest.', 'Local councillor Sidney Fiddler persuades the Mayor to help improve the image of their rundown seaside town by holding a beauty contest. But formidable Councillor Prodworthy, head of the local women''s liberation movement, has other ideas. It''s open warfare as the women''s lib attempt to sabotage the contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSRcLXg4pz5yg7KQ3fhrRxSXgT3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26329'),
  ('958286074692197115', 'Carry On Henry', 1971, 'Adventure, Comedy, History, Romance', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume, David Bracknell', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Terry Scott, Barbara Windsor, Kenneth Connor, Julian Holloway', null, 'Henry VIII has just married Marie of Normandy, and is eager to consummate their marriage. Unfortunately for Henry, she is always eating garlic, and refuses to stop. Deciding to get rid of her in his usual manner, Henry has to find some way of doing it without provoking war with Marie''s cousin, the King of France. Perhaps if she had an affair...', 'Henry VIII has just married Marie of Normandy, and is eager to consummate their marriage. Unfortunately for Henry, she is always eating garlic, and refuses to stop. Deciding to get rid of her in his usual manner, Henry has to find some way of doing it without provoking war with Marie''s cousin, the King of France. Perhaps if she had an affair...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sU2OyxyGsZm2c9h3MkxQO2wg33h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24569'),
  ('104693692072856120', 'Carry On Jack', 1964, 'Comedy, History', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Kenneth Williams, Bernard Cribbins, Juliet Mills, Charles Hawtrey, Donald Houston, Percy Herbert, Jim Dale, Patrick Cargill', null, 'Able seaman Poop-Decker signs up for adventure on the high seas with the wicked Captain Fearless. Those swabbing the decks include Juliet Mills, Charles Hawtrey and Donald Houston. The film was originally to be titled Up the Armada, but the British Board of Film Censors objected to such a rude title.', 'Able seaman Poop-Decker signs up for adventure on the high seas with the wicked Captain Fearless. Those swabbing the decks include Juliet Mills, Charles Hawtrey and Donald Houston. The film was originally to be titled Up the Armada, but the British Board of Film Censors objected to such a rude title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbX36nhu01POs4ZQjJVXrNP53CP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32105'),
  ('54576940768626443', 'Carry On Loving', 1970, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Ernest Steward, David Bracknell', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Hattie Jacques, Terry Scott, Richard O''Callaghan, Bernard Bresslaw', null, 'The Wedded Bliss computer dating agency aims to bring together the lonely hearts of Much-Snoggin-in-the-Green. Its owner, Sidney Bliss, has enough complications in his own love life, but still produces a pamphlet called ''The Wit to Woo''. The strange collection of hopefuls lead to some outlandish matches—and jealousies are bound to lead to trouble.', 'The Wedded Bliss computer dating agency aims to bring together the lonely hearts of Much-Snoggin-in-the-Green. Its owner, Sidney Bliss, has enough complications in his own love life, but still produces a pamphlet called ''The Wit to Woo''. The strange collection of hopefuls lead to some outlandish matches—and jealousies are bound to lead to trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adUhM6u0drfMqEMBsc8ybXMICgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24570'),
  ('214143443598542592', 'Carry On Matron', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Bert Batt, Ernest Steward', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Hattie Jacques, Bernard Bresslaw, Kenneth Cope, Terry Scott', null, 'A gang of thieves plan to make their fortune by stealing a shipment of contraceptive pills from Finisham maternity hospital. They assume disguises and infiltrate the hospital, but everything doesn''t go according to plan. The hypochondriac consultant Sir Bernard Cutting, Matron and the doctors and nurses at Finisham have a habit of getting in the way.', 'A gang of thieves plan to make their fortune by stealing a shipment of contraceptive pills from Finisham maternity hospital. They assume disguises and infiltrate the hospital, but everything doesn''t go according to plan. The hypochondriac consultant Sir Bernard Cutting, Matron and the doctors and nurses at Finisham have a habit of getting in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Nuin5NRIPYgnJkfd23XGZmraGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24571'),
  ('574236465658921762', 'Carry On Nurse', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Reginald H. Wyer, Maurice Gibson', 'Norman Hudis', 'Kenneth Connor, Shirley Eaton, Charles Hawtrey, Hattie Jacques, Terence Longdon, Bill Owen, Leslie Phillips, Joan Sims', null, 'In Haven Hospital, a certain men''s ward is causing more havoc than the whole hospital altogether. The formidable Matron''s debut gives everyone a chill every time she walks past, with only Reckitt standing up to her. There''s a colonel who''s a constant nuisance, a bumbling nurse, a romance between Ted York and Nurse Denton, and Bell wants his bunion removed straight away, so after a couple of pints, the men decide to remove the bunion themselves!', 'In Haven Hospital, a certain men''s ward is causing more havoc than the whole hospital altogether. The formidable Matron''s debut gives everyone a chill every time she walks past, with only Reckitt standing up to her. There''s a colonel who''s a constant nuisance, a bumbling nurse, a romance between Ted York and Nurse Denton, and Bell wants his bunion removed straight away, so after a couple of pints, the men decide to remove the bunion themselves!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Na65YOj6s9HQM7e1YOhz0Upl13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32107'),
  ('532898632164777216', 'Carry On Pickpocket', 1982, 'Action, Comedy', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Ricky Lau, Lee Chi-Kit', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Frankie Chan Fan-Kei, Deanie Ip, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Pang Sau-Ha, Lau Hak-Suen, Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Dick Wei', null, 'Hung Tai-Kong aka Rice Pot and Chan Yin-Tung aka Chimney are two friends who work with their master Kam Ming and his daughter Ann as a team of pickpockets.', 'Hung Tai-Kong aka Rice Pot and Chan Yin-Tung aka Chimney are two friends who work with their master Kam Ming and his daughter Ann as a team of pickpockets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZJFgROWgMEvgyaLvYjcnB9CHd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97731'),
  ('78608410020536477', 'Carry On Regardless', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Ralph Thomas, Alan Hume', 'Norman Hudis', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Connor, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Kenneth Williams, Bill Owen, Liz Fraser, Terence Longdon', null, 'After a bunch of no-hopers approaches an employment agency, the anarchy mounts as they do a series of odd jobs, including a chimp''s tea party, trying to stay sober at a wine tasting… and demolishing a house.', 'After a bunch of no-hopers approaches an employment agency, the anarchy mounts as they do a series of odd jobs, including a chimp''s tea party, trying to stay sober at a wine tasting… and demolishing a house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axFLimJw7un1RKFcPjGeoonmU0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32115'),
  ('256726050100035718', 'Carry On Screaming!', 1966, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume, Peter Bolton', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Harry H. Corbett, Kenneth Williams, Jim Dale, Charles Hawtrey, Fenella Fielding, Joan Sims, Angela Douglas, Bernard Bresslaw', null, 'The sinister Dr. Watt has an evil scheme going—he''s kidnapping beautiful young women and turning them into mannequins to sell to local stores. Fortunately for him, Detective Sergeant Bung is on the case, and he doesn''t have a clue!', 'The sinister Dr. Watt has an evil scheme going—he''s kidnapping beautiful young women and turning them into mannequins to sell to local stores. Fortunately for him, Detective Sergeant Bung is on the case, and he doesn''t have a clue!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdx7B9BjOBSmMJYYdmdbY55JquJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5060'),
  ('1131466814076607745', 'Carry On Sergeant', 1958, 'Comedy, War', 'Gerald Thomas, Bruce Montgomery, Peter Hennessy', 'John Antrobus', 'Bob Monkhouse, William Hartnell, Shirley Eaton, Eric Barker, Dora Bryan, Bill Owen, Charles Hawtrey, Kenneth Connor', null, 'Sergeant Grimshawe wants to retire in the flush of success by winning the Star Squad prize with his very last platoon of newly called-up National Servicemen. But a motley bunch they turn out to be, and it''s up to Grimshawe to put the no-hopers through their paces.', 'Sergeant Grimshawe wants to retire in the flush of success by winning the Star Squad prize with his very last platoon of newly called-up National Servicemen. But a motley bunch they turn out to be, and it''s up to Grimshawe to put the no-hopers through their paces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nb596JUBIugTkBFugD9Ek6TKJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32110'),
  ('534073481936316974', 'Carry On Spying', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume, Peter Bolton', 'Talbot Rothwell, Sid Colin', 'Kenneth Williams, Barbara Windsor, Bernard Cribbins, Charles Hawtrey, Eric Barker, Dilys Laye, Jim Dale, Richard Wattis', null, 'Carry On favourite Barbara Windsor makes her debut in this outrageous send-up of the James Bond movies. Fearless agent Desmond Simpkins and Charlie Bind, aided and abetted by the comely Agent Honeybutt and Agent Crump, battle against the evil powers of international bad guys STENCH and their three cronies.', 'Carry On favourite Barbara Windsor makes her debut in this outrageous send-up of the James Bond movies. Fearless agent Desmond Simpkins and Charlie Bind, aided and abetted by the comely Agent Honeybutt and Agent Crump, battle against the evil powers of international bad guys STENCH and their three cronies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjzKu4m1XEGi2rmzzP3LOrHyChu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32109'),
  ('903042849257948233', 'Carry On Teacher', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas', 'Norman Hudis', 'Kenneth Connor, Charles Hawtrey, Leslie Phillips, Joan Sims, Kenneth Williams, Hattie Jacques, Rosalind Knight, Cyril Chamberlain', null, 'When a well-loved headmaster decides to retire, his scheming pupils have other ideas. The cunning boys unleash a campaign of practical jokes, armed with gin, itching power, and bombs!', 'When a well-loved headmaster decides to retire, his scheming pupils have other ideas. The cunning boys unleash a campaign of practical jokes, armed with gin, itching power, and bombs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZ3UmWEadN6RDiZZ5FqBSgvnyHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32113'),
  ('581549802920798270', 'Carry On Up the Jungle', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Jack Causey, Nigel Watts', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Frankie Howerd, Sidney James, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Terry Scott, Kenneth Connor, Bernard Bresslaw, Jacki Piper', null, 'The Carry On team send up the Tarzan tradition in great style. Lady Evelyn Bagley mounts an expedition to find her long-lost baby. Bill Boosey is the fearless hunter and guide. Prof. Tinkle is searching for the rare Oozalum bird. Everything is going swimmingly until a gorilla enters the camp, and then the party is captured by an all female tribe from Aphrodisia...', 'The Carry On team send up the Tarzan tradition in great style. Lady Evelyn Bagley mounts an expedition to find her long-lost baby. Bill Boosey is the fearless hunter and guide. Prof. Tinkle is searching for the rare Oozalum bird. Everything is going swimmingly until a gorilla enters the camp, and then the party is captured by an all female tribe from Aphrodisia...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8zrAhPIwY6oh7IN4TZkNfFVPla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17276'),
  ('988934848561996449', 'Carry On Up the Khyber', 1968, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Peter Weingreen, Ivor Powell', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Williams, Charles Hawtrey, Roy Castle, Joan Sims, Bernard Bresslaw, Peter Butterworth, Terry Scott', null, 'Sir Sidney Ruff-Diamond looks after the British outpost near the Khybar pass. Protected by the kilted Third Foot and Mouth regiment, you would think they were safe, but the Khazi of Kalabar has other ideas—he wants all the British dead. But his troops fear the ''skirted-devils, who are rumoured not to wear any underwear.', 'Sir Sidney Ruff-Diamond looks after the British outpost near the Khybar pass. Protected by the kilted Third Foot and Mouth regiment, you would think they were safe, but the Khazi of Kalabar has other ideas—he wants all the British dead. But his troops fear the ''skirted-devils, who are rumoured not to wear any underwear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onwpgb0KjgmKbclw3XUE2XgkZfM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22937'),
  ('776485809601970944', 'Carry-On', 2024, 'Thriller, Action', 'Riley Flanagan, Jaume Collet-Serra, Lyle Vincent', 'T.J. Fixman', 'Taron Egerton, Jason Bateman, Sofia Carson, Danielle Deadwyler, Theo Rossi, Logan Marshall-Green, Dean Norris, Sinqua Walls', 'PG-13', 'An airport security officer races to outsmart a mysterious traveler forcing him to let a dangerous item slip onto a Christmas Eve flight.', 'An airport security officer races to outsmart a mysterious traveler forcing him to let a dangerous item slip onto a Christmas Eve flight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjMN7DRi4sGiledsmllEw5HJjPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005331'),
  ('1025548642729952403', 'Cars', 1979, null, 'Paul Winkler', null, null, null, '“I don’t drive, but I know people who’ll drive 100 metres to go to the shops. Our society is obsessed with the car, with coming and going, getting somewhere. I used very intricate matting, some shaped like knives. I wanted the cars to slice each other in two, creating a kind of hurdy gurdy atmosphere…an abstract rushing to and fro, going nowhere. The first half of the film is silent. The second half, a grainy dupe of the same images, has sound and is far more urgent and aggressive.” (Paul Winkler)', '“I don’t drive, but I know people who’ll drive 100 metres to go to the shops. Our society is obsessed with the car, with coming and going, getting somewhere. I used very intricate matting, some shaped like knives. I wanted the cars to slice each other in two, creating a kind of hurdy gurdy atmosphere…an abstract rushing to and fro, going nowhere. The first half of the film is silent. The second half, a grainy dupe of the same images, has sound and is far more urgent and aggressive.” (Paul Winkler)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szp2sWDXh6uhaEAA00U1Dhlxptk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811913'),
  ('1103744127137288340', 'Cars', 2006, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'John Lasseter, Jeremy Lasky, Eben Ostby', 'Dan Fogelman, Joe Ranft, John Lasseter', 'Owen Wilson, Paul Newman, Bonnie Hunt, Larry the Cable Guy, Cheech Marin, Tony Shalhoub, Guido Quaroni, Jenifer Lewis', 'G', 'Lightning McQueen, a hotshot rookie race car driven to succeed, discovers that life is about the journey, not the finish line, when he finds himself unexpectedly detoured in the sleepy Route 66 town of Radiator Springs. On route across the country to the big Piston Cup Championship in California to compete against two seasoned pros, McQueen gets to know the town''s offbeat characters.', 'Lightning McQueen, a hotshot rookie race car driven to succeed, discovers that life is about the journey, not the finish line, when he finds himself unexpectedly detoured in the sleepy Route 66 town of Radiator Springs. On route across the country to the big Piston Cup Championship in California to compete against two seasoned pros, McQueen gets to know the town''s offbeat characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Touk3m5gzsqr1VsvxypdyHY5ci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920'),
  ('503062641998124300', 'Cars 2', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'John Lasseter, Apurva Shah, Sharon Calahan', 'Ben Queen', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Owen Wilson, Michael Caine, Emily Mortimer, Eddie Izzard, John Turturro, Brent Musburger, Joe Mantegna', 'G', 'Star race car Lightning McQueen and his pal Mater head overseas to compete in the World Grand Prix race. But the road to the championship becomes rocky as Mater gets caught up in an intriguing adventure of his own: international espionage.', 'Star race car Lightning McQueen and his pal Mater head overseas to compete in the World Grand Prix race. But the road to the championship becomes rocky as Mater gets caught up in an intriguing adventure of his own: international espionage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okIz1HyxeVOMzYwwHUjH2pHi74I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49013'),
  ('317561869041294105', 'Cars 3', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Drama', 'Brian Fee, Jeremy Lasky, Kim White', 'Bob Peterson, Kiel Murray, Mike Rich', 'Owen Wilson, Cristela Alonzo, Chris Cooper, Nathan Fillion, Larry the Cable Guy, Armie Hammer, Ray Magliozzi, Tony Shalhoub', 'G', 'Blindsided by a new generation of blazing-fast racers, the legendary Lightning McQueen is suddenly pushed out of the sport he loves. To get back in the game, he will need the help of an eager young race technician with her own plan to win, inspiration from the late Fabulous Hudson Hornet, and a few unexpected turns.', 'Blindsided by a new generation of blazing-fast racers, the legendary Lightning McQueen is suddenly pushed out of the sport he loves. To get back in the game, he will need the help of an eager young race technician with her own plan to win, inspiration from the late Fabulous Hudson Hornet, and a few unexpected turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zg5RDxvIIAKsucjuU2EZJIHEIvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260514'),
  ('856647149071643715', 'Cars of the Revolution', 2008, 'Drama', 'Tolga Örnek', 'Tolga Örnek, Murat Dişli', 'Taner Birsel, Halit Ergenç, Haluk Bilginer, Vahide Perçin, Sait Genay, Altan Gördüm, Ali Düşenkalkar, Seçil Mutlu', null, 'In the years of military coup, Turkey was unable to produce its own cars. But Pasha believed that Turkish people can produce their own cars so he ordered 2 cars. Gunduz and engineers with him must produce 2 cars in only 130 days!', 'In the years of military coup, Turkey was unable to produce its own cars. But Pasha believed that Turkish people can produce their own cars so he ordered 2 cars. Gunduz and engineers with him must produce 2 cars in only 130 days!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FUuUG7bY8QIfoWSVLV7pofVf7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52668'),
  ('517907777066439767', 'Carson City', 1952, 'Western', 'André de Toth, John W. Boyle, Russell Saunders', 'Winston Miller, Sloan Nibley', 'Randolph Scott, Lucille Norman, Raymond Massey, Richard Webb, James Millican, Larry Keating, George Cleveland, William Haade', 'NR', 'Mine owner William Sharon keeps having his gold shipments held up by a gang of bandits. Sharon hires banker Charles Crocker, who happens to have connections in the Central Pacific Railroad, to build a spur line from Virginia City to Carson City, so that the gold can be shipped by railroad. Silent Jeff Kincaid is the railroad engineer. However there is opposition to the railroad, chiefly from another mine owner, Big Jack Davis.', 'Mine owner William Sharon keeps having his gold shipments held up by a gang of bandits. Sharon hires banker Charles Crocker, who happens to have connections in the Central Pacific Railroad, to build a spur line from Virginia City to Carson City, so that the gold can be shipped by railroad. Silent Jeff Kincaid is the railroad engineer. However there is opposition to the railroad, chiefly from another mine owner, Big Jack Davis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUSZEoRWQV4tIqP4K00S0gN3zii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72472'),
  ('73062556072752259', 'Cart', 2014, 'Drama', 'Boo Ji-young, Choi Sung-jin, Kim Woo-hyung', 'Kim Kyung-chan', 'Yum Jung-ah, Moon Jeong-hee, Kim Young-ae, Kim Kang-woo, Hwang Jeong-min, Chun Woo-hee, Doh Kyung-soo, Lee Seung-joon', null, 'In response to a sudden dismissal of staff, workers at a big retail store begin a protest against their employer''s oppressive labor policies.', 'In response to a sudden dismissal of staff, workers at a big retail store begin a protest against their employer''s oppressive labor policies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkLuZTtFGIZdalt06rtntYjJrmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287647'),
  ('84543755688371138', 'Cartagena', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alain Monne, Antoine Roch', 'Alain Monne, Nathalie Vailloud', 'Sophie Marceau, Christopher Lambert, Margarita Rosa de Francisco, Rodolfo De Souza, Linnett Hernandez Valdes, Anibal Gonzalez Parra, Salvatore Basile', null, 'Muriel is beautiful, free-spirited and bed-ridden since a horrific accident. Leo is a drunk middle-aged ex-boxer. Desperate for work and unqualified, he interviews for Muriel, who hires him to cook and care for her against her better judgment. Initially out of his depth, Leo slowly wins Muriel''s trust. As Muriel teaches him to read, he forces her to confront the joys beyond her window.', 'Muriel is beautiful, free-spirited and bed-ridden since a horrific accident. Leo is a drunk middle-aged ex-boxer. Desperate for work and unqualified, he interviews for Muriel, who hires him to cook and care for her against her better judgment. Initially out of his depth, Leo slowly wins Muriel''s trust. As Muriel teaches him to read, he forces her to confront the joys beyond her window.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhIH2G6u4zFB6jyr6Wh3dRexkB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52628'),
  ('615837415471553574', 'Cartel Land', 2015, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Matthew Heineman, Matthew Heineman, Matt Porwoll', null, 'Robert Hetrick, José Manuel Mireles Valverde, Tim Nailer Foley, Paco Valenciano, Chaneque, Caballo, Enrique Peña Nieto, Ana Valencia', 'R', 'In the Mexican state of Michoacán, Dr. Jose Mireles, a small-town physician known as "El Doctor," shepherds a citizen uprising against the Knights Templar, the violent drug cartel that has wreaked havoc on the region for years. Meanwhile, in Arizona''s Altar Valley—a narrow, 52-mile-long desert corridor known as Cocaine Alley—Tim "Nailer" Foley, an American veteran, heads a small paramilitary group called Arizona Border Recon, whose goal is to halt Mexico’s drug wars from seeping across our border.', 'In the Mexican state of Michoacán, Dr. Jose Mireles, a small-town physician known as "El Doctor," shepherds a citizen uprising against the Knights Templar, the violent drug cartel that has wreaked havoc on the region for years. Meanwhile, in Arizona''s Altar Valley—a narrow, 52-mile-long desert corridor known as Cocaine Alley—Tim "Nailer" Foley, an American veteran, heads a small paramilitary group called Arizona Border Recon, whose goal is to halt Mexico’s drug wars from seeping across our border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNNP8IYV1VZKsS5CRavRpRDWV06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317952'),
  ('521335332620890442', 'Carter''s Army', 1975, 'TV Movie, War, Adventure', 'George McCowan, Archie R. Dalzell, Wesley Barry', 'Aaron Spelling, David Kidd', 'Stephen Boyd, Robert Hooks, Susan Oliver, Rosey Grier, Moses Gunn, Richard Pryor, Glynn Turman, Billy Dee Williams', 'R', 'A racist officer is put in charge of an all-black squad of troops charged with the mission of blowing up an important hydro-dam in Nazi Germany. Their failure would delay the Allies'' advance into Germany, thus prolonging the war.', 'A racist officer is put in charge of an all-black squad of troops charged with the mission of blowing up an important hydro-dam in Nazi Germany. Their failure would delay the Allies'' advance into Germany, thus prolonging the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJaaevGRCVXP84Pn1uR7xPffkMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22739'),
  ('1019994968330639661', 'Cartoon All-Stars to the Rescue', 1990, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, TV Movie, Drama', 'Mike Svayko, Milton Gray, Marsh Lamore', 'Tom Swale, Duane Poole', 'Jason Marsden, Lindsay Parker, Townsend Coleman, Laurie O''Brien, Jeff Bergman, Jim Cummings, George C. Scott, Frank Welker', null, 'The plot chronicles the exploits of Michael, a teenager who is using marijuana and stealing his father''s beer. His younger sister, Corey, is worried about him because he started acting differently. When her piggy bank goes missing, her cartoon tie-in toys come to life to help her find it. After discovering it in Michael''s room along with his stash of drugs, the various cartoon characters proceed to work together and take him on a fantasy journey to teach him the risks and consequences a life of drug-use can bring and save the world.', 'The plot chronicles the exploits of Michael, a teenager who is using marijuana and stealing his father''s beer. His younger sister, Corey, is worried about him because he started acting differently. When her piggy bank goes missing, her cartoon tie-in toys come to life to help her find it. After discovering it in Michael''s room along with his stash of drugs, the various cartoon characters proceed to work together and take him on a fantasy journey to teach him the risks and consequences a life of drug-use can bring and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fF73VGKlJ8OY0pAIIPf8EKymi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32638'),
  ('786545664292759489', 'Cartouche', 1962, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Action', 'Philippe de Broca, Christian Matras', 'Charles Spaak, Philippe de Broca, Daniel Boulanger', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Claudia Cardinale, Jess Hahn, Marcel Dalio, Jean Rochefort, Philippe Lemaire, Noël Roquevert, Odile Versois', null, 'In the 18th century, Louis de Bourguignon is working with the Malichot''s gang, but their ways are too ''unethical'' for him. He creates his own band, acting under the name of Cartouche, making audacious robberies of the rich people, and even distributing the takings with the poor. Thus, cartouche attracts the people''s sympathies, Venus''s love, and hate from the Police and Malichot... Cartouche can escape all the traps they set at him - except the entrapments of love. Eventually, he will be saved by a woman, at her own cost.', 'In the 18th century, Louis de Bourguignon is working with the Malichot''s gang, but their ways are too ''unethical'' for him. He creates his own band, acting under the name of Cartouche, making audacious robberies of the rich people, and even distributing the takings with the poor. Thus, cartouche attracts the people''s sympathies, Venus''s love, and hate from the Police and Malichot... Cartouche can escape all the traps they set at him - except the entrapments of love. Eventually, he will be saved by a woman, at her own cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5j6hcUIXzG8ltLk2yQeFdhJx6jA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26866'),
  ('346808994450368841', 'Caruso Pascoski (di padre polacco)', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Nuti, Umberto Angelucci, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'David Grieco, Francesco Nuti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Francesco Nuti, Clarissa Burt, Ricky Tognazzi, Antonio Petrocelli, Novello Novelli, Giovanni Nannini, Maurizio Frittelli, Lorenzo Ariani', null, 'Psychiatrist Caruso is arguably as nutty as his patients. He can remember at two years old being completely besotted by the charms of a naked girl. Even today, he can think of little else besides sex, sex, sex.', 'Psychiatrist Caruso is arguably as nutty as his patients. He can remember at two years old being completely besotted by the charms of a naked girl. Even today, he can think of little else besides sex, sex, sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRwzDXGgCBUKq4nN5cITIs7RNfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56944'),
  ('952931495172616403', 'Caruso, zero in condotta', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Nuti', 'Francesco Nuti, Ugo Chiti, Carla Giulia Casalini', 'Francesco Nuti, Giulia Serafini, Cecilia Dazzi, Lorenzo De Angelis, Carlo Monni, Platinette, Ramona Bădescu, Antonio Petrocelli', null, 'Lorenzo Caruso is a piscologist who lives in a provincial town with his daughter Giulia, the only company since the death of his wife. Suddenly Lorenzo''s life is upset by the discovery that Giulia is part of a baby gang: she steals in supermarkets, she has already collected several complaints. Everything Lorenzo has always believed in: communication, understanding, freedom with your daughter is in crisis.', 'Lorenzo Caruso is a piscologist who lives in a provincial town with his daughter Giulia, the only company since the death of his wife. Suddenly Lorenzo''s life is upset by the discovery that Giulia is part of a baby gang: she steals in supermarkets, she has already collected several complaints. Everything Lorenzo has always believed in: communication, understanding, freedom with your daughter is in crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMhKJVLiC7e81WYVQGyI8l6DpUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268503'),
  ('538691089292534029', 'Carve Her Name with Pride', 1958, 'Drama, War', 'Lewis Gilbert, Frederick Slark, Donald Sharp', 'Lewis Gilbert, Vernon Harris', 'Virginia McKenna, Paul Scofield, Jack Warner, Denise Grey, Maurice Ronet, Alain Saury, Avice Landone, Anne Leon', null, 'London, England, during World War II. After living a tragic life experience, young Violette Szabo joins the Special Operations Executive and crosses the German enemy lines as a secret agent to aid a French Resistance group.', 'London, England, during World War II. After living a tragic life experience, young Violette Szabo joins the Special Operations Executive and crosses the German enemy lines as a secret agent to aid a French Resistance group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geQFs3H8Gw1TjCPqfhTNB3SyrSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44559'),
  ('312061236736543392', 'Carved', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Justin Harding, Sevdije Kastrati', 'Justin Harding', 'Peyton Elizabeth Lee, Corey Fogelmanis, Jackson Kelly, Carla Jimenez, Jonah Lees, Elvis Nolasco, Wyatt Lindner, Sasha Mason', 'R', 'On Halloween 1993, the staff of a historic pioneer village attraction must work together to survive the attack of a monstrous killer pumpkin set on revenge.', 'On Halloween 1993, the staff of a historic pioneer village attraction must work together to survive the attack of a monstrous killer pumpkin set on revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DKH4j80eR4qAcGDoShlUO7D0Is.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1308546'),
  ('744411933527723145', 'Carved: The Slit-Mouthed Woman', 2007, 'Horror', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Naoyuki Yokota, Koji Shiraishi', 'Eriko Sato, Haruhiko Kato, Chiharu Kawai, Rie Kuwana, Kazuyuki Matsuzawa, Kaori Sakagami, Sakina Kuwae, Yûto Kawase', 'NR', 'Legend holds that 30 years ago, a suburban town was terrorized by the spirit of a woman whose horrid face had been grotesquely disfigured. Roaming the streets wearing a long coat and carrying large scissors, the spirit would approach her young victims and, while removing the mask, ask if she was pretty. The victim’s response would almost always lead to their violent death.', 'Legend holds that 30 years ago, a suburban town was terrorized by the spirit of a woman whose horrid face had been grotesquely disfigured. Roaming the streets wearing a long coat and carrying large scissors, the spirit would approach her young victims and, while removing the mask, ask if she was pretty. The victim’s response would almost always lead to their violent death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okrZ7VAfgLGMNK8XdIapSlXQhLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25744'),
  ('145422382558214387', 'Carver', 2008, 'Horror', 'Franklin Guerrero Jr., Ryan Bedell', 'Franklin Guerrero Jr.', 'Natasha Charles Parker, Erik Fones, Matt Carmody, Neil Kubath, Kristyn Green, Jonathan Rockett, Luke Vitale, Ursala Taherain', 'R', 'Based on a true story, Carver depicts the real life events of five 20-something''s that went camping in the mountain town of Halcyon Ridge and never returned.', 'Based on a true story, Carver depicts the real life events of five 20-something''s that went camping in the mountain town of Halcyon Ridge and never returned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ao2vwrhkcXkethKtj5AzO5KBKC1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14983'),
  ('883797802985084309', 'Carwash', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Schmitz', 'Claude Schmitz', 'Wilfrid Ameuille, Francis Soetens, Thomas Depas, Lucie Guien, Hélène Bressiant, Marc Barbé, Olivier Zanotti, Bilal Aya', null, 'Thomas and Francis kidnap Wilfrid, the owner of a carwash. Surprisingly, he is delighted with being kidnapped, this company that imposes itself on him comes to brighten his own lonely life.', 'Thomas and Francis kidnap Wilfrid, the owner of a carwash. Surprisingly, he is delighted with being kidnapped, this company that imposes itself on him comes to brighten his own lonely life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKeWkbAtlXw4kNcVNBft8oiOiGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538065'),
  ('274923168088915193', 'Casa Amor: Exclusive for Ladies', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Park Sang-min, Jung Bum-shik, Lee Seon-yeong', 'Paulo Cursino, Marcelo Saback, Jung Bum-shik', 'Cho Yeo-jeong, Clara Lee, Kim Tae-woo, Kim Bo-yeon, Ra Mi-ran, Go Kyung-pyo, Bae Sung-woo, Oh Na-ra', null, 'A beautiful workaholic is fired from her job as a marketing executive for a children''s toy company. With her life spinning out of control she teams up with her neighbour, who owns a sex shop, to design and promote better sex toys.', 'A beautiful workaholic is fired from her job as a marketing executive for a children''s toy company. With her life spinning out of control she teams up with her neighbour, who owns a sex shop, to design and promote better sex toys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JjotwfRfgHbdE4jXkcRh86QveU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318541'),
  ('951326542769497338', 'Casa de Lava', 1995, 'Drama', 'Pedro Costa, Emmanuel Machuel', 'Pedro Costa', 'Isaach de Bankolé, Inês de Medeiros, Édith Scob, Pedro Hestnes, Raúl Andrade, Manuel Andrade, João Gomes de Pina, Alina Montrond', null, 'The film tells a story of Mariana, a nurse who leaves Lisbon to accompany an immigrant worker in a comatose sleep on his trip home to Cape Verde. The devoted Portuguese nurse took a journey only to find herself lost in abstract drama.', 'The film tells a story of Mariana, a nurse who leaves Lisbon to accompany an immigrant worker in a comatose sleep on his trip home to Cape Verde. The devoted Portuguese nurse took a journey only to find herself lost in abstract drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlHIkGNkZ0xJERngaSQvk77wM7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126376'),
  ('598140907486710591', 'Casa de los Babys', 2003, 'Drama', 'Mauricio Rubinstein, John Sayles, John M. Tyson', 'John Sayles', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal, Daryl Hannah, Marcia Gay Harden, Susan Lynch, Mary Steenburgen, Lili Taylor, Angelina Peláez, Lizzie Curry Martinez', 'R', 'A group of women, including Skipper, the wealthy young Jennifer and the domineering Nan, journey from the United States to South America in hopes of easily adopting children. Unfortunately, their plans are complicated by local laws that require the women to live in the foreign nation for an extended period before they can take in orphaned kids. While stuck in another country, the women bond as they share their aspirations and anxieties.', 'A group of women, including Skipper, the wealthy young Jennifer and the domineering Nan, journey from the United States to South America in hopes of easily adopting children. Unfortunately, their plans are complicated by local laws that require the women to live in the foreign nation for an extended period before they can take in orphaned kids. While stuck in another country, the women bond as they share their aspirations and anxieties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OLDSseQTeHSWwqyqgwMZwxfqGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38244'),
  ('451419982752559614', 'Casa de Mi Padre', 2012, 'Comedy, Western', 'Matt Piedmont, Ramsey Nickell, Eric Fox Hays', 'Harper Steele', 'Will Ferrell, Mariann Gavelo, Molly Shannon, Gael García Bernal, Nick Offerman, Efren Ramirez, Genesis Rodriguez, Diego Luna', 'R', 'Scheming of a way to save their father''s ranch, the Alvarez brothers find themselves in a war with Mexico''s most feared drug lord.', 'Scheming of a way to save their father''s ranch, the Alvarez brothers find themselves in a war with Mexico''s most feared drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVCc7xwTAlckBofazrwIz8x1TXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80304'),
  ('406601196941733128', 'Casa Grande', 2014, 'Drama', 'Fellipe Barbosa, Amanda Gabriel, Clara Linhart', 'Karen Sztajnberg, Fellipe Barbosa', 'Thales Cavalcanti, Marcello Novaes, Suzana Pires, Clarissa Pinheiro, Bruna Amaya, Alice Melo, Georgiana Góes, Sandro Rocha', null, 'As a privileged teenager living in an affluent suburb of Rio de Janeiro, Jean has little to worry about beyond games, grades and girls. But as his overbearing father drags the family into debt, Jean is forced into a change of lifestyle which opens his eyes to the world beyond his ''casa grande'' - not least that of the feisty, mixed-race firecracker Luiza. Cultures, classes and generations collide in this engrossing coming-of-age drama from Brazil.', 'As a privileged teenager living in an affluent suburb of Rio de Janeiro, Jean has little to worry about beyond games, grades and girls. But as his overbearing father drags the family into debt, Jean is forced into a change of lifestyle which opens his eyes to the world beyond his ''casa grande'' - not least that of the feisty, mixed-race firecracker Luiza. Cultures, classes and generations collide in this engrossing coming-of-age drama from Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6xbFgfnpDilkxnXzDlEhYi9qnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268100'),
  ('318384468890226730', 'Casa Roshell', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Camila José Donoso, Pablo Rojo', 'Camila José Donoso', 'Roshell Terranova, Liliana Alba, Lia Garcia, Cristián Aravena, Diego Alberico', null, 'You’d never know this is your home away from home. The surveillance camera outside shows a drab reception area and an unremarkable street in Mexico City; inside, the lights flash, but the tables are empty. Yet preparations are soon underway and fixed categories cease to apply: stubble is removed, make-up applied and strands of hair are teased into place; the camera is trained not on the men themselves, but what they see in the mirror.', 'You’d never know this is your home away from home. The surveillance camera outside shows a drab reception area and an unremarkable street in Mexico City; inside, the lights flash, but the tables are empty. Yet preparations are soon underway and fixed categories cease to apply: stubble is removed, make-up applied and strands of hair are teased into place; the camera is trained not on the men themselves, but what they see in the mirror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6n3F7bhbMRzDgu2lqIlKlhqvLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440100'),
  ('155392594997268971', 'Casablanca', 1943, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Arthur Edeson, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Philip G. Epstein, Julius J. Epstein, Howard Koch', 'Humphrey Bogart, Ingrid Bergman, Paul Henreid, Claude Rains, Conrad Veidt, Sydney Greenstreet, Peter Lorre, S.Z. Sakall', 'PG', 'In Casablanca, Morocco in December 1941, a cynical American expatriate meets a former lover, with unforeseen complications.', 'In Casablanca, Morocco in December 1941, a cynical American expatriate meets a former lover, with unforeseen complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGCEKlJo2CnWydQj7aamY7s1S7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289'),
  ('490335008972371421', 'Casablanca Beats', 2021, 'Drama, Music', 'Virginie Surdej, Amine Messadi, Nabil Ayouch', 'Maryam Touzani, Nabil Ayouch', 'Ismail Adouab, Nouhaila Arif, Samah Baricou, Abdelilah Basbousi, Anas Basbousi, Soufiane Belali, Zineb Boujemaa, Amina Kannan', null, 'When a rapper-turned-teacher brings hip-hop to a community center in an impoverished area of Casablanca, his tough methods spark an explosion of talent.', 'When a rapper-turned-teacher brings hip-hop to a community center in an impoverished area of Casablanca, his tough methods spark an explosion of talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcut4ooPIYbVEKjOolGsH19jhKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575764'),
  ('1023990790577290940', 'Casablanca Driver', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Maurice Barthélemy, James Welland', 'Maurice Barthélemy', 'Maurice Barthélemy, Isabelle Nanty, Dieudonné, Sam Karmann, Jim Carter, Chantal Lauby, Whitfield One, Stéphane De Groodt', null, 'This mockumentary follows the world''s worst boxer and the events that led to his meteoric rise in the year 1969.', 'This mockumentary follows the world''s worst boxer and the events that led to his meteoric rise in the year 1969.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veWo3S34BCCkqqHbVZYLt4rbtrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48394'),
  ('853537776583696185', 'Casablanca, Casablanca', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Nuti, Umberto Angelucci, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Donati, Francesco Nuti', 'Francesco Nuti, Novello Novelli, Marcello Lotti, Giuliana De Sio, Daniel Olbrychski, Domenico Acànfora, Carlo Monni, Clarissa Burt', null, 'Francesco forgot billiards because now he lives with Chiara. She is a musician and she would like to become famous. Francesco is different: he found in her the reason of his life. But when she accepts a job far from home, Francesco comes back to billiards.', 'Francesco forgot billiards because now he lives with Chiara. She is a musician and she would like to become famous. Francesco is different: he found in her the reason of his life. But when she accepts a job far from home, Francesco comes back to billiards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxSXpA0xkEGuyCRZ58EYgqpBvyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62702'),
  ('521179551868902992', 'Casando a mi Ex', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Sariñana', null, 'Zuria Vega, Memo Villegas, Harold Azuara, Danae Reynaud, Odin Ayala, Ana Karina Guevara, Mauricio Llera, Danna Meza', null, 'Mariana believes that weddings are a farce, so she dedicates herself to planning them. When Luis, her boyfriend, proposes to her, she refuses to fall into the business that she despises so much. To pretend that her breakup didn''t hurt her, she decides to organize the wedding of her now-ex. What Mariana doesn''t know is that the reason why Luis marries her is to take revenge on her.', 'Mariana believes that weddings are a farce, so she dedicates herself to planning them. When Luis, her boyfriend, proposes to her, she refuses to fall into the business that she despises so much. To pretend that her breakup didn''t hurt her, she decides to organize the wedding of her now-ex. What Mariana doesn''t know is that the reason why Luis marries her is to take revenge on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NwGv3IvOypQt3sQGFFlffcg1zC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083308'),
  ('314949062927815350', 'Casanova', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Simon Langton, José Luis Alcaine', 'George MacDonald Fraser', 'Richard Chamberlain, Faye Dunaway, Sylvia Kristel, Ornella Muti, Hanna Schygulla, Sophie Ward, Frank Finlay, Roy Kinnear', null, 'The life story of an 18th century womanizer who''s arrested, not so much for his crimes, but because he''s viewed as an undesirable by the husbands and families of the women he seduces.', 'The life story of an 18th century womanizer who''s arrested, not so much for his crimes, but because he''s viewed as an undesirable by the husbands and families of the women he seduces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQrVCKQOL4Z1WyNDIjzpto4MzdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293867'),
  ('637485512894528003', 'Casanova', 2005, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Oliver Stapleton, Lasse Hallström', 'Kimberly Simi, Jeffrey Hatcher', 'Heath Ledger, Sienna Miller, Jeremy Irons, Oliver Platt, Lena Olin, Omid Djalili, Stephen Greif, Ken Stott', 'R', 'With a reputation for seducing members of the opposite sex, regardless of their marital status, a notorious womanizer discovers a beauty who seems impervious to his charms. However, as he continues to pursue the indifferent lady, he finds himself falling in love.', 'With a reputation for seducing members of the opposite sex, regardless of their marital status, a notorious womanizer discovers a beauty who seems impervious to his charms. However, as he continues to pursue the indifferent lady, he finds himself falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pp237jqOnlLojQfvCgJHv5yZofL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9681'),
  ('725815365565058886', 'Casanova ''70', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Aldo Tonti, Mario Monicelli, Renzo Marignano', 'Agenore Incrocci, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Giorgio Salvioni', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Virna Lisi, Marisa Mell, Michèle Mercier, Enrico Maria Salerno, Liana Orfei, Guido Alberti, Moira Orfei', null, 'The amorous adventures of Andrea Rossi-Colombotti, an army officer who finds pleasure with beautiful women in life-threatening situations.', 'The amorous adventures of Andrea Rossi-Colombotti, an army officer who finds pleasure with beautiful women in life-threatening situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x93gr9oIiAviLCOCIcr7eKLDF6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3520'),
  ('457902391074031175', 'Casanova & Co.', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Franz Antel, Hanns Matula', 'Joshua Sinclair, Tom Priman', 'Tony Curtis, Marisa Berenson, Marisa Mell, Jean Lefebvre, Andréa Ferréol, Sylva Koscina, Victor Spinetti, Umberto Orsini', 'R', 'While hiding from the royal authorities, Giacomo Casanova, the famous romancer, encounters his look-alike: Giacomino, a fugitive petty con man. Meanwhile, the Arabian Caliph and his wife are arriving in Venice for a state visit, and she insists on a night with the legendary lover. Through a series of erotic encounters and mistaken-identity comedies, Giacomo and Giacomino make their way back to Venice for their appointment with the Caliph''s wife.', 'While hiding from the royal authorities, Giacomo Casanova, the famous romancer, encounters his look-alike: Giacomino, a fugitive petty con man. Meanwhile, the Arabian Caliph and his wife are arriving in Venice for a state visit, and she insists on a night with the legendary lover. Through a series of erotic encounters and mistaken-identity comedies, Giacomo and Giacomino make their way back to Venice for their appointment with the Caliph''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NWsK5VmsrTYDvhEgcZRyGJTEOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4397'),
  ('571275757037855620', 'Casanova Brown', 1944, 'Comedy', 'Sam Wood, John F. Seitz', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Gary Cooper, Teresa Wright, Frank Morgan, Anita Louise, Edmund Breon, Patricia Collinge, Jill Esmond, Mary Treen', 'NR', 'Cass Brown is about to marry for the second time. His first marriage, to Isabel, was annulled. But when he discovers that Isabel has just had their baby, Cass kidnaps the infant to keep her from being adopted. Isabel''s parents hunt for the child and discover that Cass and Isabel are still hopelessly in love.', 'Cass Brown is about to marry for the second time. His first marriage, to Isabel, was annulled. But when he discovers that Isabel has just had their baby, Cass kidnaps the infant to keep her from being adopted. Isabel''s parents hunt for the child and discover that Cass and Isabel are still hopelessly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Mz3GC5LPWbzR3liMv8ctw7tjxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81751'),
  ('1000927966630218160', 'Casanova Cat', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Jerry Mann', 'NR', 'Tom heads for a big city penthouse to become acquainted with a rich pretty female cat that lives there. He brings her Jerry as a gift and does some humiliating things to Jerry. Jerry, in turn, attracts the attention of another cat who also becomes interested in the female cat. It eventually turns into a fight between Tom and the other cat for the lady''s hand but Jerry is the one who gets her in the end.', 'Tom heads for a big city penthouse to become acquainted with a rich pretty female cat that lives there. He brings her Jerry as a gift and does some humiliating things to Jerry. Jerry, in turn, attracts the attention of another cat who also becomes interested in the female cat. It eventually turns into a fight between Tom and the other cat for the lady''s hand but Jerry is the one who gets her in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjUNlF6mID6qiFCUMLo3N8a17Na.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46844'),
  ('747325958391535996', 'Casanova, Last Love', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Benoît Jacquot, Christophe Beaucarne, Albert Blasius', 'Benoît Jacquot, Jérôme Beaujour, Chantal Thomas', 'Vincent Lindon, Stacy Martin, Valeria Golino, Julia Roy, Nancy Tate, Anna Cottis, Hayley Carmichael, Christian Erickson', null, 'Year 1763. Forced into exile, the famous libertine Giacomo Casanova leaves Paris and travels to London, where he meets Marianne de Charpillon, a young prostitute to whom he is so attracted that he forgets about the other women.', 'Year 1763. Forced into exile, the famous libertine Giacomo Casanova leaves Paris and travels to London, where he meets Marianne de Charpillon, a young prostitute to whom he is so attracted that he forgets about the other women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BaFWAAgg74b8veZvm8uEv7pcjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504605'),
  ('80352180268513878', 'Casanova''s Big Night', 1954, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Michael D. Moore, Ralph Axness', 'Hal Kanter, Edmund L. Hartmann', 'Bob Hope, Joan Fontaine, Audrey Dalton, Basil Rathbone, Hugh Marlowe, Arnold Moss, John Carradine, John Hoyt', 'NR', 'Italy 1757, Pippo Popolino, a lowly tailor, disguises himself as the great Casanova in order to romance the attractive widow Francesca. He little suspects what awaits him... Locked into the incongruous role by the desperation of the real Casanova''s creditors, Pippo must journey to Venice on a delicate mission far beyond his capabilities.', 'Italy 1757, Pippo Popolino, a lowly tailor, disguises himself as the great Casanova in order to romance the attractive widow Francesca. He little suspects what awaits him... Locked into the incongruous role by the desperation of the real Casanova''s creditors, Pippo must journey to Venice on a delicate mission far beyond his capabilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvLvX9EXwdM1br0TMtvfnWvFENb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57849'),
  ('152269643022058505', 'Casanova''s Return', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Italo Petriccione, Gabriele Salvatores', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Sara Mosetti, Umberto Contarello', 'Toni Servillo, Sara Serraiocco, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Natalino Balasso, Bianca Panconi, Ale, Antonio Catania, Elio De Capitani', null, 'Leo Bernardi is a successful and acclaimed Italian director. He’s approaching the end of his career but he cannot accept his slow decline. He has just finished shooting his last movie and he’s deeply sad. The movie is inspired by the novel about Casanova written by Arthur Schnitzler, a character so similar to the director, even more than he could imagine. Schnitzler’s Casanova is aged, glory days are over: he lost his charm and his attraction to women, he’s broke and no more eager to travel through Europe. After a long exile, he just wants to go back to Venice, his homeland. While traveling home Casanova meets a girl, Marcolina. She reawakens his desire, lost for years. So, he tries to seduce her but that leads him to a tragic understanding: he’s an old man now. It’s not by chance that Leo Bernardi decided to tell this story right now, in a pivotal moment of his life and career. The destiny of both Casanova and his director leads them to a final confrontation.', 'Leo Bernardi is a successful and acclaimed Italian director. He’s approaching the end of his career but he cannot accept his slow decline. He has just finished shooting his last movie and he’s deeply sad. The movie is inspired by the novel about Casanova written by Arthur Schnitzler, a character so similar to the director, even more than he could imagine. Schnitzler’s Casanova is aged, glory days are over: he lost his charm and his attraction to women, he’s broke and no more eager to travel through Europe. After a long exile, he just wants to go back to Venice, his homeland. While traveling home Casanova meets a girl, Marcolina. She reawakens his desire, lost for years. So, he tries to seduce her but that leads him to a tragic understanding: he’s an old man now. It’s not by chance that Leo Bernardi decided to tell this story right now, in a pivotal moment of his life and career. The destiny of both Casanova and his director leads them to a final confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4Jo4vgLGK5pByuKHzAtVxmdvMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802124'),
  ('657788752813423141', 'Casbah', 1948, 'Music, Crime', 'John Berry, Irving Glassberg', 'Arnold Manoff, Leslie Bush-Fekete', 'Yvonne De Carlo, Tony Martin, Peter Lorre, Märta Torén, Hugo Haas, Thomas Gomez, Douglas Dick, Herbert Rudley', 'NR', 'Pepe Le Moko leads a gang of jewel thieves in the Casbah of Algiers, where he has exiled himself to escape imprisonment in his native France.', 'Pepe Le Moko leads a gang of jewel thieves in the Casbah of Algiers, where he has exiled himself to escape imprisonment in his native France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wBE8iu1Z424CgvJbtLUGsX35Lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45628'),
  ('68797693734855799', 'Cascabelito', 1962, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jaime Salvador', 'Marco Antonio Campos', 'Marco Antonio Campos, Gaspar Henaine, Begoña Palacios, Enrique Rambal, Ángel Dupeyrón, Julián de Meriche, Augusto Benedico, Héctor Godoy', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4QfiZ0qn4V7nSmEq1yBbyA723X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395274'),
  ('632858554255175035', 'Cascade', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Egidio Coccimiglio', 'Ed Mason', 'Sara Waisglass, Joel Oulette, Sadie Laflamme-Snow, Stephen Kalyn, James Cade, Allegra Fulton, Josh Cruddas, Greg Bryk', null, 'A teenage girl''s wilderness hike with friends spirals after they stumble upon a crashed drug plane, forcing her to outwit a ruthless gang and face an enemy far worse than drug smugglers.', 'A teenage girl''s wilderness hike with friends spirals after they stumble upon a crashed drug plane, forcing her to outwit a ruthless gang and face an enemy far worse than drug smugglers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjeOsh6R3tw4HFLxpnNt3PsfAar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972619'),
  ('450022554819801093', 'Case 137', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dominik Moll, Agathe Hassenforder, Patrick Ghiringhelli', 'Dominik Moll, Gilles Marchand', 'Léa Drucker, Jonathan Turnbull, Mathilde Riu, Guslagie Malanda, Stanislas Merhar, Sandra Colombo, Valentin Campagne, Mathilde Roehrich', null, 'Stéphanie, a police officer working for Internal Affairs, is assigned to a case involving a young man severely wounded during a tense and chaotic demonstration in Paris. While she finds no evidence of illegitimate police violence, the case takes a personal turn when she discovers the victim is from her hometown.', 'Stéphanie, a police officer working for Internal Affairs, is assigned to a case involving a young man severely wounded during a tense and chaotic demonstration in Paris. While she finds no evidence of illegitimate police violence, the case takes a personal turn when she discovers the victim is from her hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t93h1ptV098Q6vzl9gfEymJQ6Qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1294698'),
  ('1105904371300805293', 'Case 39', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Christian Alvart, Hagen Bogdanski, John Burke', 'Ray Wright', 'Renée Zellweger, Jodelle Ferland, Ian McShane, Bradley Cooper, Adrian Lester, Kerry O''Malley, Callum Keith Rennie, Cynthia Stevenson', 'R', 'In her many years as a social worker, Emily Jenkins believes she has seen it all, until she meets 10-year-old Lilith and the girl''s cruel parents. Emily''s worst fears are confirmed when the parents try to harm the child, and so Emily assumes custody of Lilith while she looks for a foster family. However, Emily soon finds that dark forces surround the seemingly innocent girl, and the more she tries to protect Lilith, the more horrors she encounters.', 'In her many years as a social worker, Emily Jenkins believes she has seen it all, until she meets 10-year-old Lilith and the girl''s cruel parents. Emily''s worst fears are confirmed when the parents try to harm the child, and so Emily assumes custody of Lilith while she looks for a foster family. However, Emily soon finds that dark forces surround the seemingly innocent girl, and the more she tries to protect Lilith, the more horrors she encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b16EjFeHd2AwoYXWUne7DA346pU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28355'),
  ('680305014895864465', 'Case Closed: Countdown to Heaven', 2001, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Akio Kawamura, Masahiko Itojima, Kenji Kodama', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Megumi Hayashibara, Kenichi Ogata, Yukiko Iwai, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'As a pair of towers in Tokyo are being prepared for their grand opening, there is a series of murders of people connected to the towers. Conan suspects that the mysterious Syndicate may also be involved.', 'As a pair of towers in Tokyo are being prepared for their grand opening, there is a series of murders of people connected to the towers. Conan suspects that the mysterious Syndicate may also be involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1giFCODG6Bnik84NsyjHwvuX9Da.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32022'),
  ('942845891975207431', 'Case Closed: The Crimson Love Letter', 2017, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Action', 'Keiko Urakami, Yasuyuki Urakami, Yumenosuke Tokuda', 'Takahiro Okura', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Ryo Horikawa, Yuko Miyamura, Satsuki Yukino, Osamu Saka', 'PG-13', 'Bombing case at Nichiuri TV in autumn. The Satsuki Cup, which crowns the winner of Japan''s Hyakunin Isshu, is currently being filmed inside the facility. The incident results in a big commotion and, while the building is burning to ashes, the only people left inside are Hattori and Toyama Kazuha. They get rescued just in time by Conan , who rushes to the scene. Both the identity and purposes of the bomber are unknown.', 'Bombing case at Nichiuri TV in autumn. The Satsuki Cup, which crowns the winner of Japan''s Hyakunin Isshu, is currently being filmed inside the facility. The incident results in a big commotion and, while the building is burning to ashes, the only people left inside are Hattori and Toyama Kazuha. They get rescued just in time by Conan , who rushes to the scene. Both the identity and purposes of the bomber are unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tulrto9RCvIoLdp7xQuADVmTk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438058'),
  ('626799523367130331', 'Case Closed: The Fist of Blue Sapphire', 2019, 'Animation, Mystery, Crime, Action, Adventure', 'Yasuyuki Urakami, Keiko Urakami, Noriko Hashimoto', 'Takahiro Okura', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Naoko Matsui, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara', 'PG-13', 'The world''s greatest blue sapphire, the "blue lapis fist", said to have sunk in a pirate ship in the late 19th century, on the coasts of Singapore. A local millionaire plots to retrieve it, and when it''s exhibited in an exhibition at the Singaporean Marina Sands hotel, a murder takes place.', 'The world''s greatest blue sapphire, the "blue lapis fist", said to have sunk in a pirate ship in the late 19th century, on the coasts of Singapore. A local millionaire plots to retrieve it, and when it''s exhibited in an exhibition at the Singaporean Marina Sands hotel, a murder takes place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IkaZMxpOEFG9lk0T3fpDGAUv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566555'),
  ('15249995648864052', 'Case Closed: The Fourteenth Target', 1998, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Adventure', 'Kenji Kodama, Katsuyoshi Kobayashi, Satoshi Ishino', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Gara Takashima, Chafurin, Kaneto Shiozawa, Kenichi Ogata', 'PG', 'Ran’s secret past revealed! Ten years ago, something happened between her mom and dad. Now, plagued by nightmares, Ran is starting to remember… Meanwhile, a murderous card dealer breaks out of jail to seek revenge. His target: Ran’s father. Can Conan stop him in time and save his girlfriend’s family?', 'Ran’s secret past revealed! Ten years ago, something happened between her mom and dad. Now, plagued by nightmares, Ran is starting to remember… Meanwhile, a murderous card dealer breaks out of jail to seek revenge. His target: Ran’s father. Can Conan stop him in time and save his girlfriend’s family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2W1FwcYpHarzO5GKBYucoGnDffA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21452'),
  ('1035476082965038748', 'Case Closed: Zero the Enforcer', 2018, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Action', 'Masatomo Sudo, Keiko Urakami, Yasuyuki Urakami', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Toru Furuya, Gara Takashima, Tokuyoshi Kawashima, Mina Tominaga', null, 'After a sudden explosion at Edge of Ocean island in Tokyo, Tōru Amuro, codename Zero, begins to investigate. Meanwhile, private eye Kogorō is arrested as a suspect, so Conan Edogawa conducts his own investigation to prove his innocence, but Amuro stands in his way.', 'After a sudden explosion at Edge of Ocean island in Tokyo, Tōru Amuro, codename Zero, begins to investigate. Meanwhile, private eye Kogorō is arrested as a suspect, so Conan Edogawa conducts his own investigation to prove his innocence, but Amuro stands in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4nyOBnP7q0qlVfHAn0j49rs76d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493006'),
  ('489140802797605993', 'Case départ', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Lionel Steketee, Thomas Ngijol, Fabrice Eboué', 'Jérôme L''hotsky, Fabrice Eboué, Thomas Ngijol', 'Thomas Ngijol, Fabrice Eboué, Joséphine de Meaux, Etienne Chicot, Ériq Ebouaney, Michel Crémadès, David Salles, Stéfi Celma', null, 'Two contempo Frenchmen of Antillean descent visit their ancestor''s time as well as their land in the slavery-themed French era.', 'Two contempo Frenchmen of Antillean descent visit their ancestor''s time as well as their land in the slavery-themed French era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGNpK9qDsSK4hgEoLSQTraxOUsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66118'),
  ('673876480714438554', 'Case No. 73', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Milind Mukteshwar Apte', 'Rohit Joshi, Rucha Amit Yenurkar', 'Piyush Apte, Nandita Patkar, Ashok Shinde', 'PG-13', 'Buried memories from his subconscious mind suddenly resurface. A triggering event turns his life upside down. From this turmoil is born a thrilling, suspenseful, and thought-provoking case - Case Number 73.', 'Buried memories from his subconscious mind suddenly resurface. A triggering event turns his life upside down. From this turmoil is born a thrilling, suspenseful, and thought-provoking case - Case Number 73.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FeUTIwSdqvnRRToGPZGo8tArpso8.jpg', 'plex:movie:case-no-73'),
