  ('937251192354455630', 'Casey at the Bat', 1946, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Jerry Colonna', null, 'The over-confident Casey comes to the plate for Mudville in this animated version of the classic 1888 baseball poem by Ernest Thayer', 'The over-confident Casey comes to the plate for Mudville in this animated version of the classic 1888 baseball poem by Ernest Thayer', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YP22bikz9DgKIFSdUARYUmrOMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147240'),
  ('1045687713043269674', 'Casey Bats Again', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Jack Kinney', 'Brice Mack, Dick Kinney', 'Paul Frees', null, 'Casey is upset about having struck out his last chance at bat but his wife suggests they have a son to follow in their dad''s footsteps. Eventually, a child is born but, to Casey''s dismay, it''s a girl, not a boy. His wife suggests they try again several more times but each time, it''s still another girl. Casey is depressed but his pals tell him that in spite of everything, they still make a powerful baseball team. Casey likes the idea and accepts. However, the day of the big game, he is nervous that one of them will strike out and attempts to make the last home run himself disguised as one of his own daughters.', 'Casey is upset about having struck out his last chance at bat but his wife suggests they have a son to follow in their dad''s footsteps. Eventually, a child is born but, to Casey''s dismay, it''s a girl, not a boy. His wife suggests they try again several more times but each time, it''s still another girl. Casey is depressed but his pals tell him that in spite of everything, they still make a powerful baseball team. Casey likes the idea and accepts. However, the day of the big game, he is nervous that one of them will strike out and attempts to make the last home run himself disguised as one of his own daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbiJnTAk26grqs1H3ULYQNhvJi8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160286'),
  ('238491690331640775', 'Casey''s Shadow', 1978, 'Drama, Family', 'Martin Ritt, Ronald L. Schwary, John A. Alonzo', 'Carol Sobieski', 'Walter Matthau, Alexis Smith, Robert Webber, Murray Hamilton, Whit Bissell, Justin Buford, Andrew Rubin, Susan Myers', 'PG', 'Young Casey comes from a family of racehorse trainers, and his best friend, a foal called Casey''s Shadow, may just be a champion.', 'Young Casey comes from a family of racehorse trainers, and his best friend, a foal called Casey''s Shadow, may just be a champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afiwMbtxWQmn7eZ7ay6QZo1y3QS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92264'),
  ('547137579671601665', 'Cash', 2007, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Anubhav Sinha, Ravi Walia', 'Yash Keswani', 'Ajay Devgn, Suniel Shetty, Riteish Deshmukh, Esha Deol, Zayed Khan, Shamita Shetty, Dia Mirza, Ayesha Takia', null, 'When two groups of thieves compete to pull off a successful heist of a priceless diamond, they get caught in a web of murder and lies.', 'When two groups of thieves compete to pull off a successful heist of a priceless diamond, they get caught in a web of murder and lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xomHBsa2FrQqFkrpZyoOtt3HPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20063'),
  ('916332982618584057', 'Cash and Carry', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Harley Wood, Sonny Bupp, John Ince, Lester Dorr, Nick Copeland', 'NR', 'The Stooges find a crippled boy and his sister living in their dumpyard shack. To raise money to pay for the little boys operation they buy a phony treasure map from a con man. Thinking the treasure is buried beneath an old house, the boys start digging and wind up in a US treasury vault where they are promptly arrested. The president (FDR) gives them amnesty and arranges for the boy''s operation.', 'The Stooges find a crippled boy and his sister living in their dumpyard shack. To raise money to pay for the little boys operation they buy a phony treasure map from a con man. Thinking the treasure is buried beneath an old house, the boys start digging and wind up in a US treasury vault where they are promptly arrested. The president (FDR) gives them amnesty and arranges for the boy''s operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tyuquZ3H7Mpi8LetZvkph1LCff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115819'),
  ('399669915641737526', 'Cash Calls Hell', 1966, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Hideo Gosha, Tadashi Sakai, Kenichi Ôse', 'Yasuko Ōno, Hideo Gosha', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Mikijiro Hira, Ichirō Nakatani, Hisashi Igawa, Kunie Tanaka, Kaneko Iwasaki, Atsuko Kawaguchi, Tatsu Nakamura', null, 'Before leaving prison, Oida uncomfortably enters into an agreement with his cell mate: in exchange for a half-share of 30,000,000 yen, he is to assassinate three strangers given to him on a list. However, upon meeting his first potential victim, Oida has second thoughts. Yet, even as he tries to back out, the body count starts climbing. Oida must now try to alert the people on his list of their impending danger, and find out why they are being targeted in the first place.', 'Before leaving prison, Oida uncomfortably enters into an agreement with his cell mate: in exchange for a half-share of 30,000,000 yen, he is to assassinate three strangers given to him on a list. However, upon meeting his first potential victim, Oida has second thoughts. Yet, even as he tries to back out, the body count starts climbing. Oida must now try to alert the people on his list of their impending danger, and find out why they are being targeted in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1jxRgRNOYP2tpbVxP2eRxGBKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58283'),
  ('1039609779038604320', 'Cash McCall', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Chuck Hansen, Gil Kissel, Joseph Pevney', 'Lenore J. Coffee, Marion Hargrove', 'James Garner, Natalie Wood, Nina Foch, Dean Jagger, E.G. Marshall, Henry Jones, Otto Kruger, Roland Winters', null, 'Wealthy hotshot Cash McCall makes his money by purchasing unsuccessful businesses, whipping them into shape and then selling them for a huge profit. When Cash comes across Austen Plastics, a small manufacturing corporation on its last legs, he realizes it might be a gamble to buy the company. But when Cash finds out that the company''s owner is the father of his old flame, Lory, he buys the business just to get a second chance at romance.', 'Wealthy hotshot Cash McCall makes his money by purchasing unsuccessful businesses, whipping them into shape and then selling them for a huge profit. When Cash comes across Austen Plastics, a small manufacturing corporation on its last legs, he realizes it might be a gamble to buy the company. But when Cash finds out that the company''s owner is the father of his old flame, Lory, he buys the business just to get a second chance at romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quzE14JpJ4hNMjgbM2mJBK0QO9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43030'),
  ('256581476029106497', 'Cash on Delivery', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Terry Tong Gei-Ming, Lee Kin-Keung', 'Cheung Kin, James Yuen Sai-Sang, Terry Tong Gei-Ming', 'Simon Yam, Veronica Yip Yuk-Hing, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Michael Chow Man-Kin, Lam Chung, Petrina Fung Bo-Bo, Law Shu-Kei, Louis Roth', null, 'Retired gigolo Simon is engaged in antique trading and brokerage. His cousin Mike is a new gigolo who got into trouble and was caught in a lawsuit. Simon encountered Assistant Prosecutor Sandy in court. Eventually they fall in love with each other. Mrs. Liu and her husband Peter, a wealthy businessman, have no children, which makes the family very dissatisfied. They hire Simon to impregnate her. but she fell in love with Simon and pestered him obsessively. Simon accidentally killed Peter by mistake. Mrs. Liu accused Simon of murdering her husband. Sandy acted as Simon''s defense lawyer and used her resourcefulness to get Simon acquitted.', 'Retired gigolo Simon is engaged in antique trading and brokerage. His cousin Mike is a new gigolo who got into trouble and was caught in a lawsuit. Simon encountered Assistant Prosecutor Sandy in court. Eventually they fall in love with each other. Mrs. Liu and her husband Peter, a wealthy businessman, have no children, which makes the family very dissatisfied. They hire Simon to impregnate her. but she fell in love with Simon and pestered him obsessively. Simon accidentally killed Peter by mistake. Mrs. Liu accused Simon of murdering her husband. Sandy acted as Simon''s defense lawyer and used her resourcefulness to get Simon acquitted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVRqxYjfdiEFblniI2SH9v3KgBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172752'),
  ('1082655629985589450', 'Cash on Demand', 1961, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Quentin Lawrence, Arthur Grant', 'Lewis Greifer, David T. Chantler', 'Peter Cushing, André Morell, Richard Vernon, Norman Bird, Kevin Stoney, Barry Lowe, Edith Sharpe, Lois Daine', 'PG', 'A charming but ruthless criminal holds the family of a bank manager hostage as part of a cold-blooded plan to steal £90,000.', 'A charming but ruthless criminal holds the family of a bank manager hostage as part of a cold-blooded plan to steal £90,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LmxstUXIjILQjuWKhC3SSzp9Ni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37343'),
  ('794989890298608396', 'Cash Out', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Randall Emmett, Alejandro Lalinde', 'Doug Richardson, Dipo Oseni', 'John Travolta, Kristin Davis, Lukas Haas, Quavo, Bernard White, Noel Gugliemi, Natali Yura, Swen Temmel', 'R', 'Criminal mastermind Mason is about to execute the score of a lifetime when his lover and key member of his crew, Decker, takes the team down and reveals she’s an undercover Interpol agent. Heartbroken, Mason escapes and retires from the life of crime until his younger brother Shawn is out of his league taking on a big bank heist all on his own. Mason has no choice left but to come to the rescue, while Interpol brings Decker in hoping to unnerve him. Before the SWAT teams storm the bank, Mason must use every tool in his arsenal to not only escape with the prize, but also the love of his life.', 'Criminal mastermind Mason is about to execute the score of a lifetime when his lover and key member of his crew, Decker, takes the team down and reveals she’s an undercover Interpol agent. Heartbroken, Mason escapes and retires from the life of crime until his younger brother Shawn is out of his league taking on a big bank heist all on his own. Mason has no choice left but to come to the rescue, while Interpol brings Decker in hoping to unnerve him. Before the SWAT teams storm the bank, Mason must use every tool in his arsenal to not only escape with the prize, but also the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3youHDLigrtIis1NqTjlY8Sk38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116490'),
  ('536487538297711604', 'Cash Truck', 2004, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Nicolas Boukhrief, Éric Besnard', 'Albert Dupontel, Jean Dujardin, François Berléand, Claude Perron, Julien Boisselier, Philippe Laudenbach, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus, Olivier Loustau', null, 'Vigilante, a small armored truck company, is in full crisis mode. Victim of three violent hold-ups in a year, which left no survivors, the company is on the verge of bankruptcy and its employees are extremely worried. Some even suggest a complicity between the robbers and the firm. It is in this difficult context that a man, Alexandre Demarre, one morning presents himself to start his first day of work at Vigilante.', 'Vigilante, a small armored truck company, is in full crisis mode. Victim of three violent hold-ups in a year, which left no survivors, the company is on the verge of bankruptcy and its employees are extremely worried. Some even suggest a complicity between the robbers and the firm. It is in this difficult context that a man, Alexandre Demarre, one morning presents himself to start his first day of work at Vigilante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huGODrOTIElqmV3WuOHwo2IFZVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21776'),
  ('359644539345097983', 'Cashback', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sean Ellis, Marco Ciglia, Alex Barber', 'Sean Ellis', 'Sean Biggerstaff, Emilia Fox, Stuart Goodwin, Michael Dixon, Michael Lambourne, Hatti Riemer, Frank Hesketh, Irene Bagach', null, 'Ben is an art college student in London, whose imagination runs wild as he works the late-night shift at the local supermarket. What do he and his colleagues do to pass the long, endless hours of the night?', 'Ben is an art college student in London, whose imagination runs wild as he works the late-night shift at the local supermarket. What do he and his colleagues do to pass the long, endless hours of the night?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vegjV9sk9SF4nTeJSTcZGbojyb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444308'),
  ('75865164710874543', 'Cashback', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sean Ellis, Angus Hudson, Sam Garwood', 'Sean Ellis', 'Sean Biggerstaff, Emilia Fox, Shaun Evans, Michael Dixon, Michelle Ryan, Stuart Goodwin, Frank Hesketh, Daphne Guinness', null, 'After a painful breakup, Ben develops insomnia. To kill time, he starts working the late night shift at the local supermarket, where his artistic imagination runs wild.', 'After a painful breakup, Ben develops insomnia. To kill time, he starts working the late night shift at the local supermarket, where his artistic imagination runs wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXJKrcjHXrL148OfmovdGPBvnSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12225'),
  ('894082287232044214', 'Casi 40', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'David Trueba, Julio César Tortuero', 'David Trueba', 'Lucía Jiménez, Fernando Ramallo, Vito Sanz, Carolina África', null, 'Two old friends. An ex couple. A music tour. Two lives to meet again.', 'Two old friends. An ex couple. A music tour. Two lives to meet again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hdYCs85IaRo7DoQzivk0rRgIvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518000'),
  ('494375325732494761', 'Casi casi', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jaime Vallés, Tony Vallés, Jaime Vallés', 'Jaime Vallés, Tony Vallés', 'Marian Pabón, Marisa Gómez, Tino García, Mario Pabón, Ricardo Arias, Wanda Sais, Maribel Alonso, Irene Sofia Lucio', 'PG', 'Emilio is a normal teenager who somehow finds himself being sent to the principal''s office every other week. He has a crush on Jacklynne, the most popular girl in school, so he decides to run for Student Council President in order to impress her. To his horror, Emilio discovers after announcing his candidacy that Jacklynne will be running for office against him.', 'Emilio is a normal teenager who somehow finds himself being sent to the principal''s office every other week. He has a crush on Jacklynne, the most popular girl in school, so he decides to run for Student Council President in order to impress her. To his horror, Emilio discovers after announcing his candidacy that Jacklynne will be running for office against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMDpsoKBs8GKlQGOidTbaSKPP0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46491'),
  ('732305845220771942', 'Casi divas', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Issa López, Carlos Aguilera', 'Issa López', 'Daniela Schmidt, Diana García, Patricia Llaca, Ana Layevska, Maya Zapata, Julio Bracho, Marina de Tavira, Mónica Huarte', null, 'Four ambitious and beautiful young women. From four very different corners of Mexico. Just like hundreds of others, they are caught up in the frenzy that sweeps the nation when Alejandro Mateos, one of the country''s most powerful producers, dreams up a nationwide talent search to cast the lead in his next big movie. But all this is news to Alejandro''s on-again, off-again lover, Eva Gallardo, a diva of epic proportions, who expected to get the part. While Eva schemes to nail down the role, our four leads begin their own journey on the road to fame.', 'Four ambitious and beautiful young women. From four very different corners of Mexico. Just like hundreds of others, they are caught up in the frenzy that sweeps the nation when Alejandro Mateos, one of the country''s most powerful producers, dreams up a nationwide talent search to cast the lead in his next big movie. But all this is news to Alejandro''s on-again, off-again lover, Eva Gallardo, a diva of epic proportions, who expected to get the part. While Eva schemes to nail down the role, our four leads begin their own journey on the road to fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cmSHd37Sov3dJdVjFwr5eGZ3zm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21194'),
  ('721726630430639576', 'Casi leyendas', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Nesci', 'Gabriel Nesci', 'Diego Peretti, Diego Torres, Santiago Segura, Florencia Bertotti, Claudia Fontán, Leandro Juárez, Uma Salduende, Julieta Cardinali', null, 'Axel, a Spaniard with Asperger syndrome, decides to travel to Buenos Aires in search of his former companions, with whom he formed in the past a music band that was not successful. Axel meets again with Javier, a geography teacher, and Lucas, a health visitor; three estranged friends who reluctantly come together to become the ones they never were: almost legends.', 'Axel, a Spaniard with Asperger syndrome, decides to travel to Buenos Aires in search of his former companions, with whom he formed in the past a music band that was not successful. Axel meets again with Javier, a geography teacher, and Lucas, a health visitor; three estranged friends who reluctantly come together to become the ones they never were: almost legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySp07i0wzkCfRUFnr6jGUYTPutS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443585'),
  ('1019771247525877960', 'Casinha Pequenina', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Rudolf Icsey, Glauco Mirko Laurelli', 'Amacio Mazzaropi', 'Amacio Mazzaropi, Geny Prado, Roberto Duval, Tarcísio Meira, Edgard Franco, Isabel Cristina, Astrogildo Filho, Luis Gustavo', null, 'In colonial Brazil, rich farmer and owner of slaves is blackmailed by a lady; to get rid of the problem, he involves innocent countrymen in a diabolical plan.', 'In colonial Brazil, rich farmer and owner of slaves is blackmailed by a lady; to get rid of the problem, he involves innocent countrymen in a diabolical plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tR0ynVLescjusSwaEBoYohRbAtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147613'),
  ('77774320250683159', 'Casino', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Martin Scorsese, Robert Richardson, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Nicholas Pileggi, Martin Scorsese', 'Robert De Niro, Sharon Stone, Joe Pesci, James Woods, Don Rickles, Alan King, Kevin Pollak, L.Q. Jones', 'R', 'In Las Vegas, two best friends--a casino executive and a Mafia enforcer--compete for a gambling empire and a fast-living, fast-loving socialite.', 'In Las Vegas, two best friends--a casino executive and a Mafia enforcer--compete for a gambling empire and a fast-living, fast-loving socialite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gziIkUSnYuj9ChCi8qOu2ZunpSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524'),
  ('324058474283638252', 'Casino Jack', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'George Hickenlooper, Jonnie Katz, Adam Swica', 'Norman Snider', 'Kevin Spacey, Kelly Preston, Hannah Endicott-Douglas, Rachelle Lefevre, Barry Pepper, Spencer Garrett, Jon Lovitz, Eric Schweig', 'R', 'Based on a true story, a hot shot Washington DC lobbyist and his protégé go down hard as their schemes to peddle influence lead to corruption and murder.', 'Based on a true story, a hot shot Washington DC lobbyist and his protégé go down hard as their schemes to peddle influence lead to corruption and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Dpicp6VEtCSj39XBG5mnbe5TQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45324'),
  ('662497273676396403', 'Casino Raiders', 1989, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Wong Jing, Jimmy Heung Wah-Sing, Henry Chan', 'Wong Jing, Jimmy Heung Wah-Sing', 'Alan Tam, Andy Lau, Idy Chan Yuk-Lin, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Lung Fong, Charles Heung, Kenzō Ogiwara, Kirk Wong Chi-Keung', null, 'Law and Chan are gamblers and friends. Forced into a battle with the Yakuza, How far will friendship go? A high stakes card game will settle it all.', 'Law and Chan are gamblers and friends. Forced into a battle with the Yakuza, How far will friendship go? A high stakes card game will settle it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsCMEM9IaJaSAVrBVD3068c5REZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45507'),
  ('459097113991487053', 'Casino Raiders II', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, Lo Kim-Wah', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Dave Wong Kit, Andy Lau, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Monica Chan Fat-Yung, Kelvin Wong Siu, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Chan Cheuk-Yan, Lau Siu-Ming', null, 'Chicken Feet assists in running an honorable gambling den owned by the crippled Uncle Fan and his son Kit. Having previously tried to shut down the gambling den and take over by paralyzing Fan and framing Kit for another man''s murder, ruthless local Triad boss, James goes a step further by murdering Fan. Driven only by money and the pursuit of two valuable ''Jade stones'', James kidnaps Kit''s daughter so he will surrender gambling in order for James to win the upcoming Championship.', 'Chicken Feet assists in running an honorable gambling den owned by the crippled Uncle Fan and his son Kit. Having previously tried to shut down the gambling den and take over by paralyzing Fan and framing Kit for another man''s murder, ruthless local Triad boss, James goes a step further by murdering Fan. Driven only by money and the pursuit of two valuable ''Jade stones'', James kidnaps Kit''s daughter so he will surrender gambling in order for James to win the upcoming Championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQG1paeCiu2TsFszUfBrZ6yS6LQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59292'),
  ('327412287310506255', 'Casino Royale', 1954, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'William H. Brown Jr.', null, 'Barry Nelson, Peter Lorre, Linda Christian, Michael Pate, Eugene Borden, Jean Del Val, Gene Roth, Kurt Katch', null, 'American spy James Bond must outsmart card wiz and crime boss LeChiffre while monitoring his actions.', 'American spy James Bond must outsmart card wiz and crime boss LeChiffre while monitoring his actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNJeZyaU5UX4VS4jlRcQzlfknVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281661'),
  ('1101232867411421435', 'Casino Royale', 1967, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Val Guest, Ken Hughes, John Huston', 'Wolf Mankowitz, John Law, Michael Sayers', 'David Niven, Peter Sellers, Ursula Andress, Orson Welles, Joanna Pettet, Daliah Lavi, Woody Allen, Deborah Kerr', 'PG', 'Sir James Bond is called back out of retirement to stop SMERSH. In order to trick SMERSH, James thinks up the ultimate plan - that every agent will be named ''James Bond''. One of the Bonds, whose real name is Evelyn Tremble is sent to take on Le Chiffre in a game of baccarat, but all the Bonds get more than they can handle.', 'Sir James Bond is called back out of retirement to stop SMERSH. In order to trick SMERSH, James thinks up the ultimate plan - that every agent will be named ''James Bond''. One of the Bonds, whose real name is Evelyn Tremble is sent to take on Le Chiffre in a game of baccarat, but all the Bonds get more than they can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wdw5H018bgIM8bK2HuDvh8BwOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12208'),
  ('80052419921296308', 'Casino Royale', 2006, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Phil Meheux, Martin Campbell, Lorenzo Marangoni', 'Robert Wade, Paul Haggis, Neal Purvis', 'Daniel Craig, Eva Green, Mads Mikkelsen, Judi Dench, Jeffrey Wright, Giancarlo Giannini, Caterina Murino, Simon Abkarian', 'PG-13', 'Le Chiffre, a banker to the world''s terrorists, is scheduled to participate in a high-stakes poker game in Montenegro, where he intends to use his winnings to establish his financial grip on the terrorist market. M sends Bond—on his maiden mission as a 00 Agent—to attend this game and prevent Le Chiffre from winning. With the help of Vesper Lynd and Felix Leiter, Bond enters the most important poker game in his already dangerous career.', 'Le Chiffre, a banker to the world''s terrorists, is scheduled to participate in a high-stakes poker game in Montenegro, where he intends to use his winnings to establish his financial grip on the terrorist market. M sends Bond—on his maiden mission as a 00 Agent—to attend this game and prevent Le Chiffre from winning. With the help of Vesper Lynd and Felix Leiter, Bond enters the most important poker game in his already dangerous career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMrxYKKhd4lqRzwUHAy5gcx9PSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36557'),
  ('564848190131878049', 'Casino Tycoon', 1992, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Wong Jing, Raymond Yip Wai-Man, Yuen Bun', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Joey Wong, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Wilson Lam Chun-Yin, Paul Chun Pui, Kwan Hoi-San, Lau Siu-Ming', null, 'Set in World War II, Casino Tycoon chronicles the story of Benny, a young graduate played by Andy Lau, who flees Hong-Kong during the Japanese invasion and heads for gambling haven Macau. Once in Macau, he impresses a local business man who has ties to organised crime, he slowly builds his way up in the ranks of the Macau underworld which ultimately leads to trouble.', 'Set in World War II, Casino Tycoon chronicles the story of Benny, a young graduate played by Andy Lau, who flees Hong-Kong during the Japanese invasion and heads for gambling haven Macau. Once in Macau, he impresses a local business man who has ties to organised crime, he slowly builds his way up in the ranks of the Macau underworld which ultimately leads to trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOf4fAI8XxhdvSSPoX3iFqrIOoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118385'),
  ('748707680858031585', 'Casino Tycoon II', 1992, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Wong Jing, Raymond Yip Wai-Man, Wong Chi-Ming', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Michele Reis, Remus Choy Yat-Kit, Lau Siu-Ming, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Vivian Chen', null, 'It is 20 years on and Ho Hsin is now the proud and powerful owner of a chain of casinos in Macau. Unfortunately, he is also the target of many enemies, some of whom are in dangerously close proximity to him. But Ho has faced adversity before and is not about to just roll over and die.', 'It is 20 years on and Ho Hsin is now the proud and powerful owner of a chain of casinos in Macau. Unfortunately, he is also the target of many enemies, some of whom are in dangerously close proximity to him. But Ho has faced adversity before and is not about to just roll over and die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6kpKEzNDQavQ9xUILgtAZXHI7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125186'),
  ('47505881939673396', 'Casomai', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alessandro D''Alatri, Manuel Carlucci, Jurij Razza', 'Alessandro D''Alatri', 'Fabio Volo, Stefania Rocca, Gennaro Nunziante, Mino Manni, Maurizio Scattorin, Andrea Jonasson, Sara D''Amario, Davide Colavini', null, 'Tommaso meets Stefania. They like each other, they fall in love, they get married. A child is also born. It all started very well, it evolved well, then discreetly, little by little until the crisis. It seemed impossible, yet the love, which seemed really solid, perhaps fell apart, even turning into hatred. Who knows if there is still time to do so. Volo, ex Jena, tries to be a real actor. An appeal test is required.', 'Tommaso meets Stefania. They like each other, they fall in love, they get married. A child is also born. It all started very well, it evolved well, then discreetly, little by little until the crisis. It seemed impossible, yet the love, which seemed really solid, perhaps fell apart, even turning into hatred. Who knows if there is still time to do so. Volo, ex Jena, tries to be a real actor. An appeal test is required.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rw1WtV9GczDfybyoCAlf859S95F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62545'),
  ('924164761129866652', 'Casper', 1995, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Brad Silberling, Dean Cundey, Steve E. Andrews', 'Sherri Stoner, Deanna Oliver', 'Christina Ricci, Bill Pullman, Cathy Moriarty, Eric Idle, Malachi Pearson, Joe Alaskey, Joe Nipote, Brad Garrett', 'PG', 'Casper is a kind young ghost who peacefully haunts a mansion in Maine. When specialist James Harvey arrives to communicate with Casper and his fellow spirits, he brings along his teenage daughter, Kat. Casper quickly falls in love with Kat, but their budding relationship is complicated not only by his transparent state, but also by his troublemaking apparition uncles and their mischievous antics.', 'Casper is a kind young ghost who peacefully haunts a mansion in Maine. When specialist James Harvey arrives to communicate with Casper and his fellow spirits, he brings along his teenage daughter, Kat. Casper quickly falls in love with Kat, but their budding relationship is complicated not only by his transparent state, but also by his troublemaking apparition uncles and their mischievous antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ah8fNJFZVU3vcXhU5xfAYi2eym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8839'),
  ('950594672596879158', 'Casper Meets Wendy', 1998, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Sean McNamara, Christian Sebaldt', 'Jymn Magon', 'Hilary Duff, Shelley Duvall, Cathy Moriarty, Teri Garr, George Hamilton, Jeremy Foley, Jim Ward, Jess Harnell', 'PG', 'When a warlock threatens Wendy the Good Little Witch, she and her aunts hide out at a resort where Casper the Ghost is vacationing with his uncles. Although Casper and Wendy are told ghosts and witches don''t get along, the two are kindred spirits! This spooky family-friendly adventure finds Casper and Wendy bridging the ghost-witch divide to battle the warlock who is intent on destroying Wendy.', 'When a warlock threatens Wendy the Good Little Witch, she and her aunts hide out at a resort where Casper the Ghost is vacationing with his uncles. Although Casper and Wendy are told ghosts and witches don''t get along, the two are kindred spirits! This spooky family-friendly adventure finds Casper and Wendy bridging the ghost-witch divide to battle the warlock who is intent on destroying Wendy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYJWQvee9CN6nc9En2KUWewHGHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39345'),
  ('649460885586071327', 'Casper: A Spirited Beginning', 1997, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sean McNamara, Andrea V. Rossotto, Christian Sebaldt', 'Thomas Hart, Jymn Magon', 'Jeremy Foley, Brendon Ryan Barrett, Steve Guttenberg, Lori Loughlin, Rodney Dangerfield, Shannon Chandler, Michael McKean, Richard Moll', 'PG', 'Before he met and befriended the other ghouls at Applegate Manor, friendly ghost Casper meets young Chris Carson, a lonely kid who decides to teach Casper how to be a proper ghost.', 'Before he met and befriended the other ghouls at Applegate Manor, friendly ghost Casper meets young Chris Carson, a lonely kid who decides to teach Casper how to be a proper ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qq3K8HnVa8VEdFWUun0ngvfa19h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39346'),
  ('597611108747412995', 'Casper''s First Christmas', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Richard Olson, Bill Getty, Chuck Couch', null, 'Daws Butler, Ida Sue McCune, Paul DeKorte, Julie McWhirter, Don Messick, John Stephenson, Hal Smith, Michael Redman', null, 'Yogi Bear, Boo Boo, Huckleberry Hound and more Hanna-Barbera characters get lost and decide to spend Christmas by vising Casper, the friendly ghost. But soon they encounter a not-so-friendly ghost.', 'Yogi Bear, Boo Boo, Huckleberry Hound and more Hanna-Barbera characters get lost and decide to spend Christmas by vising Casper, the friendly ghost. But soon they encounter a not-so-friendly ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSZJESirwzUgsSLsBd0G0Scgvto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46163'),
  ('917253435970182162', 'Casper''s Haunted Christmas', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Owen Hurley', 'Seymour Reit, Joseph Oriolo', 'David Kaye, Brendon Ryan Barrett, Kathleen Barr, Ian James Corlett, Graeme Kingston, Terry Klassen, Scott McNeil, Tegan Moss', 'G', 'Kibosh, supreme ruler of all ghosts, decrees that casper must scare at least one person before Christmas Day so Casper visits Kriss, Massachusetts where he meets the Jollimore family and sets out to complete his mission. As usual, kindhearted Casper has a ghastky time trying to scare anyone; so The Ghostly Trio, fed up with his goody-boo-shoes behavior, secretly hires Casper''s look-alike cousin Spooky to do the job-with hilarious results.', 'Kibosh, supreme ruler of all ghosts, decrees that casper must scare at least one person before Christmas Day so Casper visits Kriss, Massachusetts where he meets the Jollimore family and sets out to complete his mission. As usual, kindhearted Casper has a ghastky time trying to scare anyone; so The Ghostly Trio, fed up with his goody-boo-shoes behavior, secretly hires Casper''s look-alike cousin Spooky to do the job-with hilarious results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BFR30kh0O3NKR1Sfea3HXCG6hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5833'),
  ('238595270048526086', 'Casper''s Scare School', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Mark Gravas', 'Andrew Nicholls, Darrell Vickers', 'Devon Werkheiser, Brett DelBuono, Jim Belushi, Bob Saget, John DiMaggio, Billy West, Dan Castellaneta, Kevin Michael Richardson', null, 'When Casper''s been being friendly lately even when playing with a boy named Jimmy, Kibosh: The King of the Underworld has Casper enrolled into a Scare School headed by the two-headed headmaster Alder and Dash. He befriends Ra, a mummy with unraveling issues and Mantha, a zombie girl who keeps falling apart. When Casper discovers the two-headed headmaster''s plot to use a petrification potion to turn Kibosh into stone and take over the Underworld and Deedstown, he and his new friends must stop him.', 'When Casper''s been being friendly lately even when playing with a boy named Jimmy, Kibosh: The King of the Underworld has Casper enrolled into a Scare School headed by the two-headed headmaster Alder and Dash. He befriends Ra, a mummy with unraveling issues and Mantha, a zombie girl who keeps falling apart. When Casper discovers the two-headed headmaster''s plot to use a petrification potion to turn Kibosh into stone and take over the Underworld and Deedstown, he and his new friends must stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtp2bw9rokJ7OjG6o4JhvbpxcrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31170'),
  ('551222486817596375', 'Casque', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Riley Stearns', 'Riley Stearns', 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead', null, 'A girl recites French phrases, some less common than others.', 'A girl recites French phrases, some less common than others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fohHyNeRzUFNDrkPaDs4giw1iTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410610'),
  ('671252786898277405', 'Casque bleu', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Gérard de Battista, Gérard Jugnot', 'Christian Biegalski, Gérard Jugnot, Philippe Lopes-Curval', 'Gérard Jugnot, Victoria Abril, Valérie Lemercier, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Micheline Presle, Claude Piéplu, Jean-Noël Brouté, Roland Marchisio', null, 'Winegrower Patrick Ponsac comes close to ruining his marriage when he has an affair with another woman. By way of atonement, he takes his wife back to the Mediterranean island where, 13 years earlier, they spent their honeymoon. Not such a good move, as it turns out. The peacemaking holiday coincides with the outbreak of a bloody civil war. Having failed to leave the country, Patrick, his wife and their eccentric entourage are taken hostage by merciless guerrillas…', 'Winegrower Patrick Ponsac comes close to ruining his marriage when he has an affair with another woman. By way of atonement, he takes his wife back to the Mediterranean island where, 13 years earlier, they spent their honeymoon. Not such a good move, as it turns out. The peacemaking holiday coincides with the outbreak of a bloody civil war. Having failed to leave the country, Patrick, his wife and their eccentric entourage are taken hostage by merciless guerrillas…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leZEH63gceyvju0iLUnaADJMODV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50156'),
  ('345855403834432492', 'Casque d''Or', 1952, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Jacques Becker, Robert Lefebvre, Henri Baum', 'Jacques Companéez, Jacques Becker', 'Simone Signoret, Serge Reggiani, Claude Dauphin, Raymond Bussières, Odette Barencey, Loleh Bellon, Solange Certin, Jacqueline Dane', 'NR', 'At the end of the 19th century, during a ball in Joinville, on the outskirts of Paris, Georges, a former delinquent working as a carpenter, meets Marie, a young woman connected to a criminal gang.', 'At the end of the 19th century, during a ball in Joinville, on the outskirts of Paris, Georges, a former delinquent working as a carpenter, meets Marie, a young woman connected to a criminal gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7VHPq0FxlvDiwMCvb8VOxeg8ub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68822'),
  ('564559379248339804', 'Cass', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jon S. Baird, Christopher Ross', 'Jon S. Baird', 'Nonso Anozie, Natalie Press, Leo Gregory, Gavin Brocker, Daniel Kaluuya, Peter Wight, Linda Bassett, Paul Kaye', 'R', 'The incredible true story of how an orphaned Jamaican baby, adopted by an elderly white couple and brought up in an all white area of London, became one of the most feared and respected men in Britain.', 'The incredible true story of how an orphaned Jamaican baby, adopted by an elderly white couple and brought up in an all white area of London, became one of the most feared and respected men in Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tZLlHdNe8f9iJ8rGmCiiQgDMuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14524'),
  ('183372658099347575', 'Cassadaga', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Anthony DiBlasi, Jose Zambrano Cassella', 'Bruce Wood, Scott Poiley', 'Kelen Coleman, Kevin Alejandro, Louise Fletcher, Rus Blackwell, Lucas Beck, Lucius Baston, Amy LoCicero, Sarah Sculco', 'R', 'A deaf girl attempts to contact her sister during a séance, only to connect with the ghost of a murdered woman.', 'A deaf girl attempts to contact her sister during a séance, only to connect with the ghost of a murdered woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0BMIR9Af6gi4yGRXmkfqDBhNPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92398'),
  ('1027757064061780052', 'Cassandra''s Dream', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Vilmos Zsigmond, Woody Allen, Ben Howarth', 'Woody Allen', 'Colin Farrell, Ewan McGregor, Hayley Atwell, Sally Hawkins, Tom Wilkinson, Phil Davis, John Benfield, Clare Higgins', 'PG-13', 'The tale of two brothers with serious financial woes. When a third party proposes they turn to crime, things go bad and the two become enemies.', 'The tale of two brothers with serious financial woes. When a third party proposes they turn to crime, things go bad and the two become enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZLKa5mXJzfmJsC9DFNkcpZ5vS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4787'),
  ('734421250789861558', 'Cassandre', 2025, 'Drama', 'Brice Morin, Hélène Merlin, Nathalie Japiot', 'Hélène Merlin', 'Billie Blain, Eric Ruf, Zabou Breitman, Guillaume Gouix, Laïka Blanc-Francard, Florian Lesieur, Agathe Rousselle', null, 'Summer 1998. Countryside. Cassandre is 14. Her parents and older brother notice that her body has changed.', 'Summer 1998. Countryside. Cassandre is 14. Her parents and older brother notice that her body has changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdEtON7g4fIfPdhvZJhdnFgvKDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1178464'),
  ('427316734009544434', 'Cassandro', 2023, 'Drama', 'Matías Penachino, Christina Salgado, Carlos Cruz Suazo', 'Roger Ross Williams, David Teague', 'Gael García Bernal, Roberta Colindrez, Perla de la Rosa, Joaquín Cosío, Raúl Castillo, El Hijo del Santo, Bad Bunny, Gigántico', 'R', 'The true story of Saúl Armendáriz, a gay amateur wrestler from El Paso that rises to international stardom after he creates the character Cassandro, the “Liberace of Lucha Libre.” In the process, he upends not just the macho wrestling world but also his own life.', 'The true story of Saúl Armendáriz, a gay amateur wrestler from El Paso that rises to international stardom after he creates the character Cassandro, the “Liberace of Lucha Libre.” In the process, he upends not just the macho wrestling world but also his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWHwWsKVr5GkmOI1hWgHZBYkRwi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729120'),
  ('949735092483587976', 'Casseta & Planeta: A Taça do Mundo é Nossa!', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Lula Buarque de Hollanda', 'Beto Silva, Bussunda, Cláudio Manoel', 'Beto Silva, Bussunda, Cláudio Manoel, Hélio de la Peña, Hubert, Marcelo Madureira, Deborah Secco, Maria Paula', null, 'A satire about the dictatorship period in Brazil, in which communist militants try to steal the soccer World Cup Trophy from the players Pelé and Carlos Alberto Torres.', 'A satire about the dictatorship period in Brazil, in which communist militants try to steal the soccer World Cup Trophy from the players Pelé and Carlos Alberto Torres.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRZ7dqvQCOiHvMruI7dYPomd7X4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242161'),
  ('1132459581052627049', 'Cassette Girl', 2015, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Haru Yamada, Hiroyasu Kobayashi', 'Yoji Enokido', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Koichi Yamadera', null, 'In a futuristic world where militaristic robots known as the “Media Police” have outlawed entertainment and banned outdated media formats, a young woman and her robotic companion aim to recover vintage content stored on video cassettes and battle their evil robot overlords to protect “obsolete” media from being lost forever.', 'In a futuristic world where militaristic robots known as the “Media Police” have outlawed entertainment and banned outdated media formats, a young woman and her robotic companion aim to recover vintage content stored on video cassettes and battle their evil robot overlords to protect “obsolete” media from being lost forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHq4ZAO6DY3l12BmgDNpqTBblwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363263'),
  ('391250565868742953', 'Casshern', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kazuaki Kiriya, Kazuaki Kiriya', 'Dai Sato, Shoutarou Suga, Kazuaki Kiriya', 'Yūsuke Iseya, Kumiko Aso, Akira Terao, Kanako Higuchi, Fumiyo Kohinata, Hiroyuki Miyasako, Ryo, Tetsuji Tamayama', 'NR', 'Fifty years of war between the Great Eastern Federation and Europa - now merged as Eurasia - have taken their toll on planet Earth. As a result of the use of biological, chemical and nuclear weapons, much of Earth has become uninhabitable and people have become prey to new diseases. Professor Azuma''s "neo-cell" project, which is supposed to be the answer to mankind''s hardships, becomes a nightmare come true when mutants spawned from the experiment escape and declare war on the human race. Azuma''s son Tetsuya, who was killed during the previous war, is reborn into the cyborg Casshern as mankind''s last hope against the new mutant threat. This live-action sci-fi movie based on a 1973 Japanese animé of the same name.', 'Fifty years of war between the Great Eastern Federation and Europa - now merged as Eurasia - have taken their toll on planet Earth. As a result of the use of biological, chemical and nuclear weapons, much of Earth has become uninhabitable and people have become prey to new diseases. Professor Azuma''s "neo-cell" project, which is supposed to be the answer to mankind''s hardships, becomes a nightmare come true when mutants spawned from the experiment escape and declare war on the human race. Azuma''s son Tetsuya, who was killed during the previous war, is reborn into the cyborg Casshern as mankind''s last hope against the new mutant threat. This live-action sci-fi movie based on a 1973 Japanese animé of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naIjHWfQFge69GqeehgsekwDkbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11662'),
  ('15802583186710951', 'Cássia', 2015, 'Documentary, Music', 'Paulo Henrique Fontenelle, Vinicius Brum', null, 'Cássia Eller, Oswaldo Montenegro, Zélia Duncan, Marcelo Saback, Janete Dornellas, Elisa de Alencar, Maria Eugênia Vieira Martins, Mayrton Bahia', null, 'Cássia Eller Rejane. Cássia Eller. Cássia. A powerful restless force on stage, shined herself out of it. One of the greats of Brazilian music, Cássia Eller marked the 1990s and shocked the country with her early death in 2001. A film about the singer, the mother, the woman who exposed her personal life and broke barriers, leaving a beautiful social and artistic legacy.', 'Cássia Eller Rejane. Cássia Eller. Cássia. A powerful restless force on stage, shined herself out of it. One of the greats of Brazilian music, Cássia Eller marked the 1990s and shocked the country with her early death in 2001. A film about the singer, the mother, the woman who exposed her personal life and broke barriers, leaving a beautiful social and artistic legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTdz32TNQB6CazvvsTEdOg05WDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310534'),
  ('829923041661643641', 'Cassiopeia', 2022, 'Drama', 'Choi Jong-ha, Byeon Ji-su, Shin Yeon-shick', 'Shin Yeon-shick, Cho Eu-gene', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Seo Hyun-jin, Joo Ye-rim, Kim Da-huin, Hong Sung-choon, Goo Si-yeon, Choi Hong-il, Shin Yoon-ju', null, 'Su-jin who tries to pursue a perfect life as a successful lawyer, single mother and daughter, plans to send her daughter Gina to study abroad in the United States, where her ex-husband lives. When Su-jin gets busier with work, Su-jin''s dad, In-woo moves in to help Su-jin take care of Gina. The three live together for some time, until one day, Su-jin gets into a car accident and receives an unexpected diagnosis.', 'Su-jin who tries to pursue a perfect life as a successful lawyer, single mother and daughter, plans to send her daughter Gina to study abroad in the United States, where her ex-husband lives. When Su-jin gets busier with work, Su-jin''s dad, In-woo moves in to help Su-jin take care of Gina. The three live together for some time, until one day, Su-jin gets into a car accident and receives an unexpected diagnosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTEGgNAuM5zMTzULzb5BMGGb3Bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875153'),
  ('752938620525327066', 'Cast a Dark Shadow', 1955, 'Thriller', 'Lewis Gilbert, Ted Sturgis, Max Kemp', 'John Cresswell', 'Dirk Bogarde, Margaret Lockwood, Kay Walsh, Kathleen Harrison, Robert Flemyng, Mona Washbourne, Philip Stainton, Walter Hudd', 'NR', 'Edward "Teddy" Bare is a ruthless schemer who thinks he''s hit the big time when he kills his older wife, believing he will inherit a fortune. When things don''t go according to plan, Teddy sets his sights on a new victim: wealthy widow Freda Jeffries. Unfortunately for the unscrupulous criminal, Freda is much more guarded and sassy than his last wife, making separating her from her money considerably more challenging.', 'Edward "Teddy" Bare is a ruthless schemer who thinks he''s hit the big time when he kills his older wife, believing he will inherit a fortune. When things don''t go according to plan, Teddy sets his sights on a new victim: wealthy widow Freda Jeffries. Unfortunately for the unscrupulous criminal, Freda is much more guarded and sassy than his last wife, making separating her from her money considerably more challenging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpkYTyGa9WyG9l9f2W8JSDdT1Xl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33814'),
  ('588918586037150448', 'Cast a Deadly Spell', 1991, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Martin Campbell, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Joseph Dougherty', 'Fred Ward, David Warner, Julianne Moore, Clancy Brown, Alexandra Powers, Charles Hallahan, Arnetia Walker, Raymond O''Connor', 'R', 'In a fantastical 1940s where magic is used by everyone, a hard-boiled detective investigates the theft of a mystical tome.', 'In a fantastical 1940s where magic is used by everyone, a hard-boiled detective investigates the theft of a mystical tome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLGaVrMBga6TyLYSGfSnPB3WkN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52660'),
  ('300170017295334258', 'Cast a Giant Shadow', 1966, 'War, Drama', 'Melville Shavelson, Aldo Tonti, Jack N. Reddish', 'Ted Berkman, Melville Shavelson', 'Kirk Douglas, John Wayne, Senta Berger, Angie Dickinson, James Donald, Yul Brynner, Frank Sinatra, Stathis Giallelis', null, 'An American Army officer is recruited by the yet to exist Israel to help them form an army. He is disturbed by this sudden appeal to his Jewish heritage. Each of Israel''s Arab neighbors has vowed to invade the poorly prepared country as soon as partition is granted. He is made commander of the Israeli forces just before the war begins.', 'An American Army officer is recruited by the yet to exist Israel to help them form an army. He is disturbed by this sudden appeal to his Jewish heritage. Each of Israel''s Arab neighbors has vowed to invade the poorly prepared country as soon as partition is granted. He is made commander of the Israeli forces just before the war begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3IhCoMfbQSMuUCJvpKWKFuOMwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8737'),
  ('40230612386710415', 'Cast a Long Shadow', 1959, 'Western', 'Wilfrid M. Cline, Thomas Carr', 'John McGreevey, Martin Goldsmith', 'Audie Murphy, Terry Moore, John Dehner, Ann Doran, James Best, Denver Pyle, Robert Foulk, Rita Lynn', null, 'A young man without surname inherits a big indebted ranch and has to prove his worthiness managing a cattle drive.', 'A young man without surname inherits a big indebted ranch and has to prove his worthiness managing a cattle drive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xghkQ1xaxi5a8JGKoubVI9pa5PI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172894'),
  ('814256577256343072', 'Cast Away', 2000, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Robert Zemeckis, Don Burgess, Andrew Menzies', 'William Broyles Jr.', 'Tom Hanks, Helen Hunt, Chris Noth, Paul Sanchez, Lari White, Leonid Citer, David Allen Brooks, Semion Sudarikov', 'PG-13', 'Chuck Noland, a top international manager for FedEx, and Kelly, a Ph.D. student, are in love and heading towards marriage. Then Chuck''s plane to Malaysia crashes at sea during a terrible storm. He''s the only survivor, and finds himself marooned on a desolate island. With no way to escape, Chuck must find ways to survive in his new home.', 'Chuck Noland, a top international manager for FedEx, and Kelly, a Ph.D. student, are in love and heading towards marriage. Then Chuck''s plane to Malaysia crashes at sea during a terrible storm. He''s the only survivor, and finds himself marooned on a desolate island. With no way to escape, Chuck must find ways to survive in his new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lLJgKnAicAcR5UEuo8xhSMj18w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8358'),
  ('809499520457478417', 'Cast Iron', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Otar Iosseliani, Chalva Chiochvili', 'Otar Iosseliani', null, null, 'Documentary of the Rustavi Metal Works, in the country of Georgia.', 'Documentary of the Rustavi Metal Works, in the country of Georgia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A28NCy5vWB1jFUUtrZLRUXwjoiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216731'),
  ('721604676483288442', 'Castaway', 1986, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Nicolas Roeg, Harvey Harrison', 'Allan Scott, Lucy Irvine', 'Oliver Reed, Amanda Donohoe, Georgina Hale, Frances Barber, Tony Rickards, Todd Rippon, John Sessions, Virginia Hey', 'R', 'Middle-aged Gerald Kingsland advertises in a London paper for a female companion to spend a year with him on a desert island. The young Lucy Irving takes a chance on contacting him and after a couple of meetings they decide to go ahead. Once on the island things prove a lot less idyllic than in the movies, and gradually it becomes clear that it is Lucy who has the desire and the strength to try and see the year through.', 'Middle-aged Gerald Kingsland advertises in a London paper for a female companion to spend a year with him on a desert island. The young Lucy Irving takes a chance on contacting him and after a couple of meetings they decide to go ahead. Once on the island things prove a lot less idyllic than in the movies, and gradually it becomes clear that it is Lucy who has the desire and the strength to try and see the year through.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mphJksO1hwAEmcMawNFvRZJJ5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52886'),
  ('60976043206109875', 'Castello Cavalcanti', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Darius Khondji, Wes Anderson, Dario Cioni', 'Wes Anderson', 'Jason Schwartzman, Giada Colagrande, Giorgio Zancolla, Paolo Coluccio, Silvano Broglia, Francesco Bonaccorso, Michele de Paolo, Igino Angelini', 'NR', 'In 1955 in Italy, race car driver Jed Cavalcanti suffers a mishap during the Molte Miglia rally and finds himself in a small town with a few familial surprises.', 'In 1955 in Italy, race car driver Jed Cavalcanti suffers a mishap during the Molte Miglia rally and finds himself in a small town with a few familial surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGZHMSIxbsvjG1M5PfUYq1doMDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236028'),
  ('1065249959794282667', 'Castelrotto', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Damiano Giacomelli, Eugenio Cinti Luciani, Stefano Merlini', 'Damiano Giacomelli', 'Giorgio Colangeli, Denise Tantucci, Mirco Abbruzzetti, Fabrizio Ferracane, Giorgio Montanini, Antonella Attili, Stanley Igbokwe, Andrea Caimmi', null, 'A mysterious wrongdoing shakes the life of Castelrotto, a small Apennine village that has always been off the news... and history. Ottone, a former local journalist and retired elementary school teacher, takes advantage of the incident to pick up the pen again and seek revenge for an old injustice suffered. His plan is clear: manipulate the narrative of the new crime to accuse the men who ruined his life.', 'A mysterious wrongdoing shakes the life of Castelrotto, a small Apennine village that has always been off the news... and history. Ottone, a former local journalist and retired elementary school teacher, takes advantage of the incident to pick up the pen again and seek revenge for an old injustice suffered. His plan is clear: manipulate the narrative of the new crime to accuse the men who ruined his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9StjGniLo5xo3uKbJm7xKoQpxMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210580'),
  ('159696404166114707', 'Casting', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nicolas Wackerbarth, Jürgen Carle, Annette Drees', 'Nicolas Wackerbarth, Hannes Held', 'Andreas Lust, Judith Engel, Milena Dreißig, Corinna Kirchhoff, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Marie-Lou Sellem, Andrea Sawatzki, Ursina Lardi', null, 'For her first television film, director Vera wants the perfect cast. But the first day of shooting is fast approaching and the numerous casting sessions have yet to find a suitable actress to play the leading role. Although the producer and crew are getting ever more exasperated with Vera, Gerwin is happy about the extra work, as he earns his money as an audition reader, delivering the lines of dialogue to the starry candidates at the various castings. When the male lead suddenly has to back out, Gerwin thinks that this might just be his chance.', 'For her first television film, director Vera wants the perfect cast. But the first day of shooting is fast approaching and the numerous casting sessions have yet to find a suitable actress to play the leading role. Although the producer and crew are getting ever more exasperated with Vera, Gerwin is happy about the extra work, as he earns his money as an audition reader, delivering the lines of dialogue to the starry candidates at the various castings. When the male lead suddenly has to back out, Gerwin thinks that this might just be his chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2igHZ9EmVih5VXAeNwq5gnZdyxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432887'),
  ('968794174224022075', 'Casting Blossoms to the Sky', 2012, 'Fantasy, Drama, War', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Kujô Sanbongi, Yudai Kato', 'Kôji Hasegawa', 'Yasuko Matsuyuki, Masahiro Takashima, Natsuki Harada, Minami Inomata, Saki Terashima, Toshio Kakei, Naoyuki Morita, Mansaku Ikeuchi', null, 'In the aftermath of the 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami, a journalist arrives in Nagaoka, a city decimated during a WWII air raid and by the 2004 Chūetsu earthquakes, to report on the disaster; there, she learns about the experiences of its inhabitants and stumbles upon a stage play written by an enigmatic student of her ex-boyfriend.', 'In the aftermath of the 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami, a journalist arrives in Nagaoka, a city decimated during a WWII air raid and by the 2004 Chūetsu earthquakes, to report on the disaster; there, she learns about the experiences of its inhabitants and stumbles upon a stage play written by an enigmatic student of her ex-boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy5YGtIfFE77gUsoyFgQYlXNDrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127453'),
  ('958630390907198393', 'Casting JonBenet', 2017, 'Documentary, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Latham, Kitty Green, Tom Farnsworth', 'Kitty Green, John Simpson', 'Hannah Cagwin, Aeona Cruz, Liv Bagley, Shylee Sagle, Danika Toolson, Emma Winslow, Elle Walker, Kaydence Lucero', null, 'Twenty years after the modern world''s most notorious child murder, the legacy of the crime and its impact are explored.', 'Twenty years after the modern world''s most notorious child murder, the legacy of the crime and its impact are explored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHDr48Zq4IojCHRMxzGaS1EMaDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430826'),
  ('252421064266877535', 'Castle Falls', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Frances Chen, Dolph Lundgren', 'Andrew Knauer', 'Scott Adkins, Dolph Lundgren, Kim DeLonghi, Jim E. Chandler, Kevin Wayne, Scott Hunter, Dave Halls, Ida Lundgren', 'NR', 'Rival gangs seek out millions of dollars hidden inside a luxury condominium that''s scheduled to be demolished, but first they have to deal with the demolition prep crewman who found the loot first.', 'Rival gangs seek out millions of dollars hidden inside a luxury condominium that''s scheduled to be demolished, but first they have to deal with the demolition prep crewman who found the loot first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g918jDm2NxYtnOQ83nda82otfdG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683311'),
  ('252454018730212992', 'Castle Freak', 1996, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Stuart Gordon, Mario Vulpiani, James Lawrence Spencer', 'Dennis Paoli', 'Jeffrey Combs, Barbara Crampton, Jonathan Fuller, Jessica Dollarhide, Massimo Sarchielli, Elisabeth Kaza, Luca Zingaretti, Helen Stirling', 'R', 'John Reilly discovers that his family''s newly inherited castle in Italy is haunted by a relentless, bloodthirsty creature.', 'John Reilly discovers that his family''s newly inherited castle in Italy is haunted by a relentless, bloodthirsty creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZv3aUkNngyZeiCgAjOEF5n0tve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18256'),
  ('204022662385679951', 'Castle Freak', 2020, 'Horror', 'Evi Gjoni, Mateo Cingu, Spiro Nino', 'Kathy Charles', 'Clair Catherine, Jake Horowitz, Chris Galust, Emily Sweet, Omar Brunson, Elisha Pratt, Genti Kame, Klodian Hoxha', null, 'After she’s permanently blinded in a tragic car accident, Rebecca receives some bizarre news: her long-lost mother has recently passed away, leaving her their family’s ancestral castle in rural Albania. Traveling to the estate with a group of friends, Rebecca hopes it will be an opportunity for her to reconnect with a past she never knew and a mother who seemingly left her behind. When mysterious events begin to occur and her friends begin to die, Rebecca must unravel the secrets of her family’s history before she too falls prey to the Castle Freak.', 'After she’s permanently blinded in a tragic car accident, Rebecca receives some bizarre news: her long-lost mother has recently passed away, leaving her their family’s ancestral castle in rural Albania. Traveling to the estate with a group of friends, Rebecca hopes it will be an opportunity for her to reconnect with a past she never knew and a mother who seemingly left her behind. When mysterious events begin to occur and her friends begin to die, Rebecca must unravel the secrets of her family’s history before she too falls prey to the Castle Freak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HJEosQRIdBzAHEdZJCUF7e5FmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593655'),
  ('239263176436854594', 'Castle in the Desert', 1942, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Harry Lachman, Virgil Miller', 'John Francis Larkin', 'Sidney Toler, Victor Sen Yung, Lenita Lane, Douglass Dumbrille, Steven Geray, Edmund MacDonald, Arleen Whelan, Ethel Griffies', null, 'Charlie Chan, with son Jimmy on a week''s pass from the Army, takes up a request for help at a castle-home, miles from anywhere in the American desert south-west and inhabited by an eccentric, reclusive historian and his wife, a descendant of Lucrezia Borgia. Once there, he finds the request''s legitimacy denied by all who are present, but still necessary as one houseguest has already been murdered, the other guests are at each other''s throat, and the Borgia-related chatelain is suspected...', 'Charlie Chan, with son Jimmy on a week''s pass from the Army, takes up a request for help at a castle-home, miles from anywhere in the American desert south-west and inhabited by an eccentric, reclusive historian and his wife, a descendant of Lucrezia Borgia. Once there, he finds the request''s legitimacy denied by all who are present, but still necessary as one houseguest has already been murdered, the other guests are at each other''s throat, and the Borgia-related chatelain is suspected...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h33clwUr32JbPzws6KQAOpCOTqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29328'),
  ('1105219753760800858', 'Castle Keep', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Sydney Pollack, Henri Decaë, Ray Kellogg', 'Daniel Taradash, David Rayfiel', 'Burt Lancaster, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Peter Falk, Bruce Dern, Patrick O''Neal, Astrid Heeren, Scott Wilson, Tony Bill', 'R', 'During the Battle of the Bulge, an anachronistic count shelters a ragtag squad of Americans in his isolated castle hoping they will defend it against the advancing Germans.', 'During the Battle of the Bulge, an anachronistic count shelters a ragtag squad of Americans in his isolated castle hoping they will defend it against the advancing Germans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gERA2rTFymgxteyqX6JUlyidMiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45522'),
  ('726158078878565202', 'Castle of Blood', 1964, 'Horror', 'Antonio Margheriti, Ruggero Deodato, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Bruno Corbucci', 'Barbara Steele, Georges Rivière, Margrete Robsahm, Arturo Dominici, Silvano Tranquilli, Sylvia Sorrente, Umberto Raho, Giovanni Cianfriglia', 'NR', 'When a cynical journalist accepts a wager that he won''t survive the night in a haunted castle, it unlocks an odyssey of sexual torment, undead vengeance, and a dark seductress who surrenders the gravest of pleasures.', 'When a cynical journalist accepts a wager that he won''t survive the night in a haunted castle, it unlocks an odyssey of sexual torment, undead vengeance, and a dark seductress who surrenders the gravest of pleasures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A17gEQk617FsLhtPyalRN885KM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28532'),
  ('555631863257081104', 'Castle of Otranto', 1977, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Jiří Šafář', 'Horace Walpole', 'Miloš Frýba, Jaroslav Vozáb', null, 'An adaptation of the 1764 work of the same name, the first Gothic novel. In this mockumentary, the amateur archaeologist Dr. Vozáb has set to prove that the supernatural ghost love story takes place not in Italy, but in Otranto Castle near Náchod in Czechoslovakia.', 'An adaptation of the 1764 work of the same name, the first Gothic novel. In this mockumentary, the amateur archaeologist Dr. Vozáb has set to prove that the supernatural ghost love story takes place not in Italy, but in Otranto Castle near Náchod in Czechoslovakia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UwBCMqzB2pHlxQ6y4jfpMsBJ70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19032'),
  ('1038067784626035601', 'Castle of Purity', 1973, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Alex Phillips, Américo Fernández', 'José Emilio Pacheco, Arturo Ripstein', 'Claudio Brook, Rita Macedo, Arturo Beristáin, Diana Bracho, Gladys Bermejo, David Silva, María Rojo, María Barber', null, 'A disciplined and sexually driven man forces his family to stay isolated in their home in order to protect them from the “evil nature” of human beings.', 'A disciplined and sexually driven man forces his family to stay isolated in their home in order to protect them from the “evil nature” of human beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkJX8gEpbME4a5iDUlr8xYNqLVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47582'),
  ('93926804694761305', 'Castle of the Banned Lovers', 1956, 'Drama', 'Riccardo Freda, Gábor Pogány', 'Jacques Rémy, Filippo Sanjust', 'Micheline Presle, Gino Cervi, Fausto Tozzi, Frank Villard, Claudine Dupuis, Anthony Steffen, Mireille Granelli', null, 'The beautiful Beatrice Cenci, daughter of the noble Francesco, falls in love with Olimpio. But she has to face the jealousy of his violent and morbid father, and the hostility of his stepmother Lucrezia, who has a relationship with her other stepson, James. The stepmother and stepson-lover plan to kill Francesco. And when the latter dies accidentally, they decide to put the blame on Beatrice and Olimpio.', 'The beautiful Beatrice Cenci, daughter of the noble Francesco, falls in love with Olimpio. But she has to face the jealousy of his violent and morbid father, and the hostility of his stepmother Lucrezia, who has a relationship with her other stepson, James. The stepmother and stepson-lover plan to kill Francesco. And when the latter dies accidentally, they decide to put the blame on Beatrice and Olimpio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe8KGX1YTf8SiLKtgcNHv8QwyNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130609'),
  ('573941250669785030', 'Castle of the Creeping Flesh', 1968, 'Horror', 'Adrian Hoven, Jorge Herrero, Franz Hofer', 'Eric Martin Schnitzler, Adrian Hoven', 'Janine Reynaud, Howard Vernon, Michel Lemoine, Elvira Berndorff, Claudia Butenuth, Vladimir Medar, Jan Hendriks, Adrian Hoven', null, 'In an ancient castle, a mad scientist is trying to revive his dead daughter by an operation, but there are certain body parts he needs that he can''t get. His problem is solved when a group of drunken party-goers stumble into his castle.', 'In an ancient castle, a mad scientist is trying to revive his dead daughter by an operation, but there are certain body parts he needs that he can''t get. His problem is solved when a group of drunken party-goers stumble into his castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mQ0wGnlTV74j9Npw357kN7bezw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27701'),
  ('452214013980892634', 'Castle on the Hudson', 1940, 'Crime, Drama', 'Anatole Litvak, Arthur Edeson, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Seton I. Miller, Brown Holmes, Courtney Terrett', 'John Garfield, Ann Sheridan, Pat O''Brien, Burgess Meredith, Henry O''Neill, Jerome Cowan, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, John Litel', 'NR', 'A hardened crook behind bars comes up against a reform-minded warden.', 'A hardened crook behind bars comes up against a reform-minded warden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geSaeS7CoRrvp8dOgZR6hSRJzpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26376'),
  ('365531633423356654', 'Castle Ra-Tim-Bum: The Movie', 1999, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Cao Hamburger', 'Anna Muylaert, José de Carvalho', 'Diego Kozievitch, Rosi Campos, Sérgio Mamberti, Marieta Severo, Pascoal da Conceição, Matheus Nachtergaele, Mayara Constantino', null, 'A young wizard must create new spells in his magic book before the planets align. His uncle and aunt, powerful mages themselves, help him achieve that. Based on the award-winning Brazilian TV series.', 'A young wizard must create new spells in his magic book before the planets align. His uncle and aunt, powerful mages themselves, help him achieve that. Based on the award-winning Brazilian TV series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BmTv2Q2bHjJUlcMKrXwdTh5z17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82142'),
  ('820145303530607896', 'Castle Under Fiery Skies', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Mitsutoshi Tanaka, Takeshi Hamada, Yusuke Nakagawa', null, 'Toshiyuki Nishida, Saki Fukuda, Kippei Shiina, Shozo Endo, Tokuma Nishioka, Ikkei Watanabe, Renji Ishibashi, Takuya Ishida', null, 'The year is 1575 in feudal Japan. Oda Nobunaga''s (Kippei Shiina) forces defeat Takeda Katsuyori, when Nagashino Castle was besieged during the Battle of Nagashino. The next year Oda Nobunada decides to build a lavish new castle symbolizing his unification of various factions. The castle named Azuchi Castle will be built near water and high enough to be seen from the capital city of Kyoto. Director Mitsutoshi Tanaka''s adaptation of Kenichi Yamamoto''s novel of the same name received the 33rd Japan Academy Film Prize for Excellent Art Direction.', 'The year is 1575 in feudal Japan. Oda Nobunaga''s (Kippei Shiina) forces defeat Takeda Katsuyori, when Nagashino Castle was besieged during the Battle of Nagashino. The next year Oda Nobunada decides to build a lavish new castle symbolizing his unification of various factions. The castle named Azuchi Castle will be built near water and high enough to be seen from the capital city of Kyoto. Director Mitsutoshi Tanaka''s adaptation of Kenichi Yamamoto''s novel of the same name received the 33rd Japan Academy Film Prize for Excellent Art Direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77vAmGpF08X71TEYiKmgbZu8oKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158484'),
  ('997645829757339457', 'Castro Street', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Baillie', null, null, null, 'Inspired by a lesson from Erik Satie, a film in the form of a street: Castro Street, running by the Standard Oil Refinery in Richmond, California.', 'Inspired by a lesson from Erik Satie, a film in the form of a street: Castro Street, running by the Standard Oil Refinery in Richmond, California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kych8w0YWnBjiHb7Y37IgJSk70a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129532'),
  ('162984437647786825', 'Casual Day', 2007, 'Drama', 'Max Lemcke', 'Pablo Remón, Daniel Remón', 'Juan Diego, Luis Tosar, Javier Ríos, Estíbaliz Gabilondo, Alberto San Juan, Malena Alterio', null, 'Casual Day is a company practice imported from the USA. Every Friday the workers are asked to exchange their suits for more informal attire. Ruy has always lived as he liked. Though clever, he''s gotten himself into a jam. José Antonio, his girlfriend''s father, has earmarked an important job for him in his company. He wants him to be his successor. At the age of 25, without actually having decided anything, he''s trapped. He''d like to say no to the job, to José Antonio, to Inés, his girlfriend, and to the Casual Day stuff. But it''s not easy to say no. What started out as a simple event, a weekend in the country, ends up deciding the rest of his life.', 'Casual Day is a company practice imported from the USA. Every Friday the workers are asked to exchange their suits for more informal attire. Ruy has always lived as he liked. Though clever, he''s gotten himself into a jam. José Antonio, his girlfriend''s father, has earmarked an important job for him in his company. He wants him to be his successor. At the age of 25, without actually having decided anything, he''s trapped. He''d like to say no to the job, to José Antonio, to Inés, his girlfriend, and to the Casual Day stuff. But it''s not easy to say no. What started out as a simple event, a weekend in the country, ends up deciding the rest of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5qBHvxg7JEes42lE8MjWvO2HZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63110'),
  ('377382374257522843', 'Casual Sex?', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Geneviève Robert, Betsy Magruder, Rolf Kestermann', 'Judy Toll, Wendy Goldman', 'Lea Thompson, Victoria Jackson, Andrew Dice Clay, Stephen Shellen, Jerry Levine, Mary Gross, Peter Dvorsky, Valerie Breiman', 'R', 'Two girls go away to a holiday resort looking for a change of pace, hoping to meet some nice men for a change. They discover that they can''t find the perfect man, and this forces them to reconsider their attitudes to men in general.', 'Two girls go away to a holiday resort looking for a change of pace, hoping to meet some nice men for a change. They discover that they can''t find the perfect man, and this forces them to reconsider their attitudes to men in general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tifvnrOuVN7iq6V58G1yeN9rmlk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34604'),
