  ('1017783454251083525', 'Cat Girl', 1957, 'Horror', 'Alfred Shaughnessy, William Hill, Peter Hennessy', 'Lou Rusoff', 'Barbara Shelley, Robert Ayres, Kay Callard, Ernest Milton, Lily Kann, Jack May, Paddy Webster, John Lee', null, 'A psychiatrist treats a woman who is convinced that she turns into a killer leopard because of a family curse.', 'A psychiatrist treats a woman who is convinced that she turns into a killer leopard because of a family curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiEmwDmWvDSJxmXyPuGc2KsT8o8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28659'),
  ('751929422766887269', 'Cat Girl Kiki', 2006, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Akiyoshi Sugiura', 'Akiyoshi Sugiura', 'Yui Kano, Teruaki Uotani, Minami Aoyama, Katsuya Kobayashi', null, 'Yoshirou, a secluded teenager, brings back home a stray cat after a car accident. The next morning the cat has turned into a nice girl, Kiki, who wants to be his girlfriend... Will catnip get in the way of their love?', 'Yoshirou, a secluded teenager, brings back home a stray cat after a car accident. The next morning the cat has turned into a nice girl, Kiki, who wants to be his girlfriend... Will catnip get in the way of their love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVuY2BP7Qb2JBHuacjNhiBPIYXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52672'),
  ('672645090069946242', 'Cat Nap Pluto', 1948, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Morning, and Figaro the kitten wants to play. Pluto, on the other hand, has been out all night and wants to sleep. Finally, the sandman who has been putting Pluto to sleep calls in Figaro''s sandman.', 'Morning, and Figaro the kitten wants to play. Pluto, on the other hand, has been out all night and wants to sleep. Finally, the sandman who has been putting Pluto to sleep calls in Figaro''s sandman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEn2YRKL1yPx7JBFp1TKdsnD1u0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164934'),
  ('516762081794597049', 'Cat Napping', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'NR', 'Tom has plans to take a nice long nap in a hammock, but Jerry has gotten there first and is snoozing happily, so the two fight it out to see who gets to sleep there.', 'Tom has plans to take a nice long nap in a hammock, but Jerry has gotten there first and is snoozing happily, so the two fight it out to see who gets to sleep there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUZyABnISQtywcfJ1yNrOKR50at.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53014'),
  ('177182679370437893', 'Cat on a Hot Tin Roof', 1984, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Jack Hofsiss', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Jessica Lange, Tommy Lee Jones, Rip Torn, Kim Stanley, Penny Fuller, David Dukes, Macon McCalman, Thomas Hill', null, 'An alcoholic ex-football player drinks his days away, having failed to come to terms with his sexuality and his real feelings for his football buddy who died after an ambiguous accident. His wife is crucified by her desperation to make him desire her: but he resists the affections of his wife. His reunion with his father—who is dying of cancer—jogs a host of memories and revelations for both father and son.', 'An alcoholic ex-football player drinks his days away, having failed to come to terms with his sexuality and his real feelings for his football buddy who died after an ambiguous accident. His wife is crucified by her desperation to make him desire her: but he resists the affections of his wife. His reunion with his father—who is dying of cancer—jogs a host of memories and revelations for both father and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZoQ7aRgq9stcJCxz3fKZhPSjAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4367'),
  ('980213308891174853', 'Cat Pack: A PAW Patrol Exclusive Event', 2022, 'Animation, Family', 'Charles E. Bastien', 'Michael Stokes', 'Kyle Hodgson, Wyatt White, Tianna SwamiNathan, Justin Paul Kelly, Lucien Duncan-Reid, Christian Corrao, Jackson Reid, Lilly Bartlam', 'G', 'When Mayor Humdinger transforms his robot cat Meow-Meow into a tiger-sized metal-eating menace, the PAW Patrol calls in the Cat Pack for help in the stopping the creature.', 'When Mayor Humdinger transforms his robot cat Meow-Meow into a tiger-sized metal-eating menace, the PAW Patrol calls in the Cat Pack for help in the stopping the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dISGpQk5AdAbijIFoU9W90teMkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:991833'),
  ('1135710912699174028', 'Cat People', 1942, 'Mystery, Horror, Romance', 'Jacques Tourneur, Nicholas Musuraca, Doran Cox', 'DeWitt Bodeen', 'Simone Simon, Kent Smith, Tom Conway, Jane Randolph, Jack Holt, Henrietta Burnside, Alec Craig, Eddie Dew', 'NR', 'A Serbian émigré in Manhattan believes that, because of an ancient curse, any physical intimacy with the man she loves will turn her into a feline predator.', 'A Serbian émigré in Manhattan believes that, because of an ancient curse, any physical intimacy with the man she loves will turn her into a feline predator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSNTDd5Q6No5BmY39Zp5BVgl8XE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25508'),
  ('278759876602283782', 'Cat People', 1982, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Schrader, John Bailey, Bud S. Smith', 'Alan Ormsby, Paul Schrader', 'Nastassja Kinski, Malcolm McDowell, John Heard, Annette O''Toole, Ruby Dee, Ed Begley Jr., Scott Paulin, Frankie Faison', 'R', 'After years of separation, Irena Gallier and her minister brother, Paul, reunite in New Orleans. When zoologists capture a wild panther, Irena is drawn to the cat – and zoo curator Oliver to her. Soon, Paul will have to reveal the family secret: that when sexually aroused, they revert into predatory jungle cats.', 'After years of separation, Irena Gallier and her minister brother, Paul, reunite in New Orleans. When zoologists capture a wild panther, Irena is drawn to the cat – and zoo curator Oliver to her. Soon, Paul will have to reveal the family secret: that when sexually aroused, they revert into predatory jungle cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYcQnkbTD4LDmp11HCReQuUoMKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6217'),
  ('574618626165557176', 'Cat Person', 2023, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Susanna Fogel, Manuel Billeter, Zachary Citarella', 'Michelle Ashford', 'Emilia Jones, Nicholas Braun, Geraldine Viswanathan, Isabella Rossellini, Hope Davis, Christopher Shyer, Liza Koshy, Josh Rivera', 'NR', 'When Margot, a college sophomore, goes on a date with the older Robert, she finds that IRL Robert doesn’t live up to the Robert she has been flirting with over texts.', 'When Margot, a college sophomore, goes on a date with the older Robert, she finds that IRL Robert doesn’t live up to the Robert she has been flirting with over texts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atrfmVWmw9NPrpFSfgUE2XG7eF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843394'),
  ('132151418538785322', 'Cat Run', 2011, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'John Stockwell, Jean-François Hensgens, Mark Taylor', 'Nick Ball, John Niven', 'Paz Vega, Janet McTeer, Alphonso McAuley, Scott Mechlowicz, Christopher McDonald, Karel Roden, D.L. Hughley, Tony Curran', 'R', 'When a sexy, high-end escort holds the key evidence to a scandalous government cover-up, two bumbling young detectives become her unlikely protectors from a ruthless assassin hired to silence her.', 'When a sexy, high-end escort holds the key evidence to a scandalous government cover-up, two bumbling young detectives become her unlikely protectors from a ruthless assassin hired to silence her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QnqQn7W2IjVEgK6mmUIkfQWY19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57353'),
  ('619928320717881881', 'Cat Run 2', 2014, 'Action, Comedy', 'John Stockwell, Peter A. Holland, Justin Jones', 'Andrew Manson, Matt Manson', 'Scott Mechlowicz, Alphonso McAuley, Winter Ave Zoli, Kamille Leai, Vanessa Branch, Lawrence P. Beron, David Maldonado, Leonardo Nam', 'R', 'A couple of fumbling best friends run a private detective agency and find themselves solving their next case in New Orleans, becoming embroiled in a web of sexy female spies and government conspiracy in the lively and character-filled backdrops of the Big Easy', 'A couple of fumbling best friends run a private detective agency and find themselves solving their next case in New Orleans, becoming embroiled in a web of sexy female spies and government conspiracy in the lively and character-filled backdrops of the Big Easy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GzDcNWovT05iKrSAPNGlRGuoQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273621'),
  ('947578847373390898', 'Cat Shit One', 2010, 'Animation, War', 'Kazuya Sasahara, Takahiro Miura, Manabu Konno', 'Hiroshi Sekisakai, Kazuya Sasahara', 'Satoshi Hino, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Masashi Nitta, Sawaki Akimoto, Kenta Sakai, Yuki Hirako, Matthew Watkins', null, 'The war against terrorism has gone private. War has always been a profitable business, so having private corporations field their own armies to fight against terrorism is just good business. Who else could protect those innocent bunnies from the religiously fervent turbaned camel fanatics. It falls upon a small cadre of seasoned furry rabbit soldiers to take the battle to the camel''s home turf.Derived from a popular Vietnam-conflict based manga series called Apocalypse Meow , this sequel series uses animal characters to tell the story of the war against terrorism fought in distant countries. Non-human cast of characters notwithstanding, this compelling and painstakingly-researched work places an emphasis on factualism in order to accurately portray the weapons and tactics used by soldiers.', 'The war against terrorism has gone private. War has always been a profitable business, so having private corporations field their own armies to fight against terrorism is just good business. Who else could protect those innocent bunnies from the religiously fervent turbaned camel fanatics. It falls upon a small cadre of seasoned furry rabbit soldiers to take the battle to the camel''s home turf.Derived from a popular Vietnam-conflict based manga series called Apocalypse Meow , this sequel series uses animal characters to tell the story of the war against terrorism fought in distant countries. Non-human cast of characters notwithstanding, this compelling and painstakingly-researched work places an emphasis on factualism in order to accurately portray the weapons and tactics used by soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUFyVlaJzEBrRNm98wCtjhjK1cp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62368'),
  ('335583333303886367', 'Cat Sick Blues', 2016, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Dave Jackson', 'Dave Jackson, Andrew Gallacher', 'Matthew C. Vaughan, Shian Denovan, Rachel Rai, Cat Commander, Noah Moon, Meg Spencer, Andrew Gallacher, Jeni Bezuidenhout', 'R', 'When Ted’s beloved cat dies, the trauma triggers a terrible mental breakdown. His broken brain prompts him to bring his feline friend back – all he needs is nine human lives. Ted dons vicious deadly cat claw gloves and a creepy cat mask, and goes on a murderous rampage. As the butchery escalates, a twisted romance blossoms between Ted and Claire, a young woman who has also recently lost her cat in a horrifying incident.', 'When Ted’s beloved cat dies, the trauma triggers a terrible mental breakdown. His broken brain prompts him to bring his feline friend back – all he needs is nine human lives. Ted dons vicious deadly cat claw gloves and a creepy cat mask, and goes on a murderous rampage. As the butchery escalates, a twisted romance blossoms between Ted and Claire, a young woman who has also recently lost her cat in a horrifying incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jZESEP5x14CiCCx5iYDz274BRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364379'),
  ('1033174207289047741', 'Cat Skin', 1962, 'Drama', 'Mário Carneiro, Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Domingos de Oliveira', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Domingos de Oliveira', 'Paulinho, Riva Nimitz, Henrique César, Milton Gonçalves, Francisco de Assis, Napoleão Muniz Freire, Cláudio Corrêa e Castro, Aylton', null, 'A few weeks before Carnival, slum boys organize huntings for stray cats, whose leather can be used in Samba percussion instruments, like the Tamborim, a small drum.', 'A few weeks before Carnival, slum boys organize huntings for stray cats, whose leather can be used in Samba percussion instruments, like the Tamborim, a small drum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fosHDcEJgqq41mQo4wqGy7uDMxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258108'),
  ('235156728977946625', 'Cat Soup', 2001, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Tatsuo Sato, Masaru Takase, Masaaki Yuasa', 'Masaaki Yuasa, Tatsuo Sato', null, null, 'The surreal black comedy follows Nyatta, an anthropomorphic kitten, on his travel to the land of the dead and back in an effort to save his sister''s soul.', 'The surreal black comedy follows Nyatta, an anthropomorphic kitten, on his travel to the land of the dead and back in an effort to save his sister''s soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85c6VTiUOtizQBoT9ekBBlUz3zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25078'),
  ('268166955138371299', 'Cat-Tails for Two', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'Two cats try to catch Speedy Gonzales aboard a ship, without much success.', 'Two cats try to catch Speedy Gonzales aboard a ship, without much success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBj4BBNgYrugu6It6j99z7GKVYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175183'),
  ('856982397254467439', 'Cat-Women of the Moon', 1953, 'Science Fiction', 'Arthur Hilton, William P. Whitley', 'Roy Hamilton', 'Sonny Tufts, Victor Jory, Marie Windsor, Carol Brewster, William Phipps, Douglas Fowley, Susan Morrow, Suzanne Alexander', null, 'Astronauts travel to the moon where they discover it is inhabited by attractive young women in black tights.', 'Astronauts travel to the moon where they discover it is inhabited by attractive young women in black tights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjN6eqMwirmmWmdgXj6uALFuebm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43341'),
  ('291895397932778429', 'Cat''s Cradle', 1959, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Jane Wodening, Stan Brakhage, Carolee Schneemann, James Tenney, Kitch', null, 'Images of two women, two men, and a gray cat form a montage of rapid bits of movement. A woman is in a bedroom, another wears an apron: they work with their hands, occasionally looking up. A man enters a room, a woman smiles. He sits, another man sits and smokes. The cat stretches. There are close-ups of each. The light is dim; a filter accentuates red. A bare foot stands on a satin sheet. A woman disrobes. She pets the cat. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'Images of two women, two men, and a gray cat form a montage of rapid bits of movement. A woman is in a bedroom, another wears an apron: they work with their hands, occasionally looking up. A man enters a room, a woman smiles. He sits, another man sits and smokes. The cat stretches. There are close-ups of each. The light is dim; a filter accentuates red. A bare foot stands on a satin sheet. A woman disrobes. She pets the cat. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mTKvJp3ktjmeO3xGyX9rrwdUHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97509'),
  ('935987042380646320', 'Cat''s Cradle', 1974, 'Animation', 'Paul Driessen, Michèle Pauzé, Huguette Baril', null, null, null, 'This short animated fable stars witches, cloaked riders and other Gothic characters, in a tale about the hungry natural world. Here the artist plays cat''s cradle with ideas, especially the notion that one thing leads to another and that lives lead from one to another. Without words but featuring a witch''s brew of sounds.', 'This short animated fable stars witches, cloaked riders and other Gothic characters, in a tale about the hungry natural world. Here the artist plays cat''s cradle with ideas, especially the notion that one thing leads to another and that lives lead from one to another. Without words but featuring a witch''s brew of sounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMMdbVfeKqSvQlekcMqmXMcMxfv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90839'),
  ('159366257968467514', 'Cat''s Cradle', 2002, 'Thriller', 'Alexandre Stockler, Murilo Azevedo', 'Alexandre Stockler', 'Caio Blat, Rodrigo Bolzan, Cainan Baladez, Rennata Airoldi, Bárbara Paz, Nany People', null, 'Cristiano, Francisco and Gabriel are three good old friends celebrating their entrance in the University. But in a horror night, the fun gets mixed up with violence.', 'Cristiano, Francisco and Gabriel are three good old friends celebrating their entrance in the University. But in a horror night, the fun gets mixed up with violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkKfL26bUd0H8gtdsRpt0KrLQOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46646'),
  ('1017578553030916687', 'Cat''s Eye', 1985, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lewis Teague, Jack Cardiff, Glenn Randall Jr.', 'Stephen King', 'Drew Barrymore, James Woods, Alan King, Kenneth McMillan, Robert Hays, Candy Clark, James Naughton, Tony Munafo', 'PG-13', 'Three short stories linked by a stray cat that roams from one tale to the next, in this creepy triptych that begins as Dick tries to quit smoking by any means necessary. Next, we meet Johnny, an adulterous man who''s forced by his lover''s husband onto a building''s hazardous ledge. Finally, Amanda is threatened by an evil gnome who throws suspicion on the family cat.', 'Three short stories linked by a stray cat that roams from one tale to the next, in this creepy triptych that begins as Dick tries to quit smoking by any means necessary. Next, we meet Johnny, an adulterous man who''s forced by his lover''s husband onto a building''s hazardous ledge. Finally, Amanda is threatened by an evil gnome who throws suspicion on the family cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKyq7izpMkmr8sT2nLic5qAuJPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10552'),
  ('363373848708199339', 'Cat''s Eye', 1997, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kaizo Hayashi, Hideo Saito, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Kaizo Hayashi, Tokio Tsuchiya', 'Yuki Uchida, Izumi Inamori, Norika Fujiwara, Jiang Wenli, Kenta Harada, Akaji Maro, Naoko Yamazaki, Kane Kosugi', null, 'Three cat burgling sisters have to go up against the police and a Chinese crime syndicate in order to rescue their kidnapped father.', 'Three cat burgling sisters have to go up against the police and a Chinese crime syndicate in order to rescue their kidnapped father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHnFLRNNvA4eX6ExIFVRfTQSoWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34854'),
  ('756642463520717990', 'Cat''s Play', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Károly Makk, János Tóth', 'Károly Makk, János Tóth', 'Dajka Margit, Ildikó Piros, Elma Bulla, Éva Dombrádi, Mari Törőcsik, Margit Makay, Samu Balázs, Gyöngyi Bürös', null, 'Karoly Makk''s heartbreaking story of two unmarried sisters who cast wistful glances back at their lives, but still believe in hope and love, earned an Academy Award Nomination for Best Foreign Language Film in 1974. In this follow-up to the director''s internationally acclaimed Love, Makk once again exhibits his extraordinary skills at drawing emotionally compelling performances from his talented female leads. Makk''s film opposes the bleakness of the outside world with passion, love, and loyalty.', 'Karoly Makk''s heartbreaking story of two unmarried sisters who cast wistful glances back at their lives, but still believe in hope and love, earned an Academy Award Nomination for Best Foreign Language Film in 1974. In this follow-up to the director''s internationally acclaimed Love, Makk once again exhibits his extraordinary skills at drawing emotionally compelling performances from his talented female leads. Makk''s film opposes the bleakness of the outside world with passion, love, and loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9f8Oz2Gwsi7VvioRcaLiGpcEcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42485'),
  ('1121501323964451046', 'Cataclysm', 1980, 'Horror', 'Phillip Marshak, Tom McGowan, Bruce Markoe', 'Philip Yordan', 'Cameron Mitchell, Marc Lawrence, Faith Clift, Richard Moll, Maurice Grandmaison, Robert Bristol, Klint Stevenson, Elizabeth Martin', null, 'Police detective, Mitchell, investigating the death of a victim of a Nazi concentration camp discovers a nightclubbing playboy who has strange powers over women and is seemingly ageless.', 'Police detective, Mitchell, investigating the death of a victim of a Nazi concentration camp discovers a nightclubbing playboy who has strange powers over women and is seemingly ageless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rubazj5K6Llzm8RxzDKGYsEnpVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103254'),
  ('400691034404698853', 'Catacombs', 1965, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Gordon Hessler, Arthur Lavis, Frank Nesbitt', 'Daniel Mainwaring', 'Gary Merrill, Jane Merrow, Georgina Cookson, Neil McCallum, Rachel Thomas, Jack Train, Frederick Piper', null, 'A rich woman who uses meditation to deal with pain is visited by her niece who returns from Paris. The woman can be a handful and one of her employees suggests to her husband that he kill her freeing them both. When an affair starts between the husband and the niece murder becomes a real possibility. However some people won''t stay dead.', 'A rich woman who uses meditation to deal with pain is visited by her niece who returns from Paris. The woman can be a handful and one of her employees suggests to her husband that he kill her freeing them both. When an affair starts between the husband and the niece murder becomes a real possibility. However some people won''t stay dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaMF5hgc9U11vrbVEdFmsHA2nVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262919'),
  ('986825965754294097', 'Catacombs', 1988, 'Horror', 'Sergio Salvati, David Schmoeller', 'R. Barker Price, Giovanni Dimarco', 'Tim Van Patten, Ian Abercrombie, Jeremy West, Laura Schaefer, Vernon Dobtcheff, Feodor Chaliapin Jr., Mapi Galán, Ted Rusoff', 'R', 'In the 17th century, an order of monks in Italy capture and entomb a demon that has possessed a member of their group. 400 years later, school teacher Elizabeth Magrino visits the monastery in order to do some research. What she and the current monks do not realize is that the evil hiding within the catacombs has unwittingly been released.', 'In the 17th century, an order of monks in Italy capture and entomb a demon that has possessed a member of their group. 400 years later, school teacher Elizabeth Magrino visits the monastery in order to do some research. What she and the current monks do not realize is that the evil hiding within the catacombs has unwittingly been released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJZDKPVjX8OYM4vhMdwq8GzrekJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109565'),
  ('1141864644661447975', 'Catacombs', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tomm Coker, David Elliot, Grigore Purcariu', 'David Elliot, Tomm Coker', 'Shannyn Sossamon, P!nk, Mihai Stănescu, Emil Hostina, Sandi Dragoi, Cabral Ibacka, Radu Andrei Micu, Jace Manoli', 'R', 'A young woman in Paris goes to a party in the enormous labyrinth of limestone tunnels beneath Paris. When she becomes separated from her friends, she is convinced something is chasing her through the dark tunnels.', 'A young woman in Paris goes to a party in the enormous labyrinth of limestone tunnels beneath Paris. When she becomes separated from her friends, she is convinced something is chasing her through the dark tunnels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3LWOKFoeKJDn2dHXoJoRWeakRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14126'),
  ('1019157495542583072', 'Catalina Caper', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Lee Sholem, Ted V. Mikels', 'Clyde Ware', 'Tommy Kirk, Del Moore, Peter Duryea, Robert Donner, Ulla Strömstedt, Jim Begg, Sue Casey, Lyle Waggoner', null, 'A group of swingin'' teens take time out from having fun in the sun to try to foil a group of crooks searching for a stolen scroll.', 'A group of swingin'' teens take time out from having fun in the sun to try to foil a group of crooks searching for a stolen scroll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6efmkosmHrbwDqkkq23R5JV0rPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31265'),
  ('991845303509268390', 'Catapult', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Peter Dörfler, Peter Dörfler', 'Peter Dörfler', 'Marcel Witte, Norbert Witte, Pia Witte, Sabrina Witte', null, 'Norbert Witte, once the king of the only amusement park of the former GDR, today he is behind bars in Germany. When fleeing bankruptcy in Berlin, Norbert Witte and his family secretly shipped their rollercoasters to Peru. Things went wrong here too. In a desperate attempt, Norbert tried to smuggle cocaine to Germany. Three years later his 23 years old son Marcel was sentenced to 20 years in a Peruvian prison. Now the father is doing everything he can in order to free his son.', 'Norbert Witte, once the king of the only amusement park of the former GDR, today he is behind bars in Germany. When fleeing bankruptcy in Berlin, Norbert Witte and his family secretly shipped their rollercoasters to Peru. Things went wrong here too. In a desperate attempt, Norbert tried to smuggle cocaine to Germany. Three years later his 23 years old son Marcel was sentenced to 20 years in a Peruvian prison. Now the father is doing everything he can in order to free his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90mmMUigpG02pPnA87VtiNFM2vK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39777'),
  ('106612842676861615', 'Catarina and the others', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'André Badalo', 'André Badalo, Sara Esteves', 'Victoria Guerra, Arminda Badaló, Rui Porto Nunes, Cândido Ferreira, Philippe Leroux, Maria João Bastos, Pedro Carvalho, Tiago Aldeia', null, 'Outside, the first sun rays break the dawn. Sixteen years old Catarina can''t fall asleep. Inconsequently, in the big city adults are moved by desire... Catarina found she is HIV positive. She wants to drag everyone else along.', 'Outside, the first sun rays break the dawn. Sixteen years old Catarina can''t fall asleep. Inconsequently, in the big city adults are moved by desire... Catarina found she is HIV positive. She wants to drag everyone else along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibDLYpA3PfF5fu2X1b5WUZl5v5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280960'),
  ('481797996997750355', 'CatBoy', 2023, 'Drama', 'Oriol Rojas, Cristian Sitjas', 'Cristian Sitjas', 'Javier des León, Cacao Díaz, Gorgeous Jayce Gucci, Chap Rodríguez Rosell, Panterino', null, 'Marc, after receiving several racist and plumophobic comments on a gay dating app, receives a message from his friend Cacao inviting him to a Ballroom. Marc decides to go, there he is surprised by the freedom and diversity of the environment. Arriving at the bar, he exchanges glances with Leo, an attractive guy. After watching her friend walk, the two have an intimate conversation where Cacao encourages Marc to walk that night. Once the Catboy Sex Siren category arrives, Leo goes for a walk while Marc observes the situation with a mixture of desire and doubt.', 'Marc, after receiving several racist and plumophobic comments on a gay dating app, receives a message from his friend Cacao inviting him to a Ballroom. Marc decides to go, there he is surprised by the freedom and diversity of the environment. Arriving at the bar, he exchanges glances with Leo, an attractive guy. After watching her friend walk, the two have an intimate conversation where Cacao encourages Marc to walk that night. Once the Catboy Sex Siren category arrives, Leo goes for a walk while Marc observes the situation with a mixture of desire and doubt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmQu4abmp3qE3A18DDT0olHUSb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146506'),
  ('586029094452844986', 'Catch a Christmas Star', 2013, 'Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'John Bradshaw, Russ Goozee', 'Rickie Castaneda', 'Shannon Elizabeth, Steve Byers, Julia Lalonde, Kyle Breitkopf, Doug MacLeod, Maria Ricossa, Billy MacLellan, Christopher Jacot', 'G', 'Nikki Crandon is one of the biggest pop stars on the planet. Whether she''s singing the National Anthem or promoting her latest album, everyone knows who she is—none more so than New Jersey high school basketball coach and widower Chris Mitchell, who was Nikki''s first love in high school. When Chris'' 10-year-old daughter Sophie finds out her dad still has feelings for the singer, she takes matters into her own hands. With her 8-year-old brother Jackson in tow, Sophie succeeds in reuniting the two. But when a misunderstanding and the growing glare of the public spotlight threaten Chris and Nikki''s happiness, one can only wonder: will fame get in the way of a Merry Christmas?', 'Nikki Crandon is one of the biggest pop stars on the planet. Whether she''s singing the National Anthem or promoting her latest album, everyone knows who she is—none more so than New Jersey high school basketball coach and widower Chris Mitchell, who was Nikki''s first love in high school. When Chris'' 10-year-old daughter Sophie finds out her dad still has feelings for the singer, she takes matters into her own hands. With her 8-year-old brother Jackson in tow, Sophie succeeds in reuniting the two. But when a misunderstanding and the growing glare of the public spotlight threaten Chris and Nikki''s happiness, one can only wonder: will fame get in the way of a Merry Christmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40nMble3uFagwJ7ffagvefbcKCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238304'),
  ('881629616172401228', 'Catch a Fire', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Phillip Noyce, Ron Fortunato', 'Shawn Slovo', 'Tim Robbins, Derek Luke, Bonnie Mbuli, Mncedisi Shabangu, Tumisho Masha, Sithembiso Khumalo, Terry Pheto, Michele Burgers', 'PG-13', 'The true story of anti-apartheid activists in South Africa, and particularly the life of Patrick Chamusso, a timid foreman at Secunda CTL, the largest synthetic fuel plant in the world. Patrick is wrongly accused, imprisoned and tortured for an attempt to bomb the plant, with the injustice transforming the apolitical worker into a radicalised insurgent, who then carries out his own successful sabotage mission.', 'The true story of anti-apartheid activists in South Africa, and particularly the life of Patrick Chamusso, a timid foreman at Secunda CTL, the largest synthetic fuel plant in the world. Patrick is wrongly accused, imprisoned and tortured for an attempt to bomb the plant, with the injustice transforming the apolitical worker into a radicalised insurgent, who then carries out his own successful sabotage mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sgujWX2yWH7REnDI35ZZXsqPiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1123'),
  ('430107257891698914', 'Catch and Release', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Susannah Grant, John Lindley', 'Susannah Grant', 'Jennifer Garner, Timothy Olyphant, Kevin Smith, Sam Jaeger, Juliette Lewis, Fiona Shaw, Joshua Friesen, Tina Lifford', 'PG-13', 'For a grieving fiancée, learning to love again requires the help of her late love''s three best friends.', 'For a grieving fiancée, learning to love again requires the help of her late love''s three best friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcGvcb65JdftAHxyhxd2dxCPNOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13668'),
  ('418687600490638542', 'Catch Hell', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ryan Phillippe, Scott Lazar, Steve Gainer', 'Ryan Phillippe, Joe Gossett', 'Ryan Phillippe, Ian Barford, Stephen Louis Grush, Joyful Drake, Hakim Callender, James DuMont, Tig Notaro, Russ Russo', null, 'Former Hollywood star Reagan Pearce is kidnapped by two men connected to his past while on location in Louisiana. When he wakes up bound and chained in a rundown shack, he soon discovers the real motives of his captors and finds himself in the middle of a twisted scheme with little chance to survive. With no rescue in sight, Reagan must use every ounce of strength he has left to break free and get his revenge.', 'Former Hollywood star Reagan Pearce is kidnapped by two men connected to his past while on location in Louisiana. When he wakes up bound and chained in a rundown shack, he soon discovers the real motives of his captors and finds himself in the middle of a twisted scheme with little chance to survive. With no rescue in sight, Reagan must use every ounce of strength he has left to break free and get his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uwNlBJfgWCraGXwZAwnkwqMJMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293633'),
  ('190748033665921493', 'Catch Me a Spy', 1971, 'Comedy, Action, Thriller', 'Dick Clement, Kip Gowans, Christopher Challis', 'Dick Clement', 'Kirk Douglas, Marlène Jobert, Trevor Howard, Tom Courtenay, Patrick Mower, Bernadette Lafont, Bernard Blier, Angharad Rees', null, 'While on vacation, a woman''s husband is taken by the Russian government. After one attempt fails, she begins looking for a suitable spy to capture and trade in exchange for her husband, but she develops an attraction to the one she thinks is a good candidate.', 'While on vacation, a woman''s husband is taken by the Russian government. After one attempt fails, she begins looking for a suitable spy to capture and trade in exchange for her husband, but she develops an attraction to the one she thinks is a good candidate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHhn3k0YPY6KuwwinyysUKnpcLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85442'),
  ('563670879915723201', 'Catch Me If You Can', 2002, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Sergio Mimica-Gezzan', 'Jeff Nathanson', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Tom Hanks, Christopher Walken, Martin Sheen, Nathalie Baye, Amy Adams, James Brolin, Brian Howe', 'PG-13', 'A true story about Frank Abagnale Jr. who, before his 19th birthday, successfully conned millions of dollars worth of checks as a Pan Am pilot, doctor, and legal prosecutor. An FBI agent makes it his mission to put him behind bars. But Frank not only eludes capture, he revels in the pursuit.', 'A true story about Frank Abagnale Jr. who, before his 19th birthday, successfully conned millions of dollars worth of checks as a Pan Am pilot, doctor, and legal prosecutor. An FBI agent makes it his mission to put him behind bars. But Frank not only eludes capture, he revels in the pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctjEj2xM32OvBXCq8zAdK3ZrsAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640'),
