  ('48537027556294788', 'Catch Me If You Claus', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Bradley Walsh', 'Nina Weinman', 'Italia Ricci, Luke Macfarlane, Michael Barbuto, Katerina Maria, Samantha Brown, Delia Lisette Chambers, Suzanne Cyr, Jennifer de Lucia', 'G', 'On the verge of her big break, aspiring news anchor Avery Quinn catches a home intruder wearing a red suit claiming to be Santa’s son, Chris.', 'On the verge of her big break, aspiring news anchor Avery Quinn catches a home intruder wearing a red suit claiming to be Santa’s son, Chris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdZZaEIYBKhnF72CQASdOC7QN3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180796'),
  ('666058548844833701', 'Catch That Girl', 2002, 'Action, Family, Adventure, Crime', 'Hans Fabian Wullenweber', 'Nikolaj Arcel', 'Julie Zangenberg, Stefan Pagels Andersen, Lars Bom, Nastja Arcel, Anders W. Berthelsen, Christiane Bjørg Nielsen, Jens Brygmann', null, 'Ida''s father suddenly gets a stroke and is rushed to the hospital, diagnosed with a deadly disease with no other opportunity than to travel to USA to attend a medical experimental operation. Unfortunately, the small family have to get the money themselves, as the state doesn''t pay for that kind of experimental procedures. Ida has to get the money - and she got no other way than to steal them from the bank where her mother works...... developing the banks intense security.', 'Ida''s father suddenly gets a stroke and is rushed to the hospital, diagnosed with a deadly disease with no other opportunity than to travel to USA to attend a medical experimental operation. Unfortunately, the small family have to get the money themselves, as the state doesn''t pay for that kind of experimental procedures. Ida has to get the money - and she got no other way than to steal them from the bank where her mother works...... developing the banks intense security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIZ3IY6Ea0DkvhtI8TqXsHoyjkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48761'),
  ('870457492160656871', 'Catch That Kid', 2004, 'Family, Action, Adventure', 'Julio Macat, Bart Freundlich, Mic Rodgers', 'Nikolaj Arcel', 'Kristen Stewart, Corbin Bleu, Max Thieriot, Jennifer Beals, Sam Robards, John Carroll Lynch, James Le Gros, Michael Des Barres', 'PG', 'A determined twelve-year-old mountain climber takes drastic action to save her injured father by planning a high-stakes bank heist, using her skills and teamwork to navigate the challenge.', 'A determined twelve-year-old mountain climber takes drastic action to save her injured father by planning a high-stakes bank heist, using her skills and teamwork to navigate the challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNZTtrzrIsIAHzqH3143oWIzFjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20483'),
  ('384993996977615127', 'Catch the Bullet', 2021, 'Western, Action', 'Michael Feifer, Hank Baumert Jr.', 'Jerry Robbins', 'Jay Pickett, Peter Facinelli, Tom Skerritt, Mason McNulty, Gattlin Griffith, Cody Jones, Callder Griffith, Tucson Vernon Walker', 'R', 'U.S. marshal Britt MacMasters returns from a mission to find his father wounded and his son kidnapped by the outlaw Jed Blake. Hot on their trail, Britt forms a posse with a gunslinging deputy and a stoic Pawnee tracker. But Jed and Britt tread dangerously close to the Red Desert’s Sioux territory.', 'U.S. marshal Britt MacMasters returns from a mission to find his father wounded and his son kidnapped by the outlaw Jed Blake. Hot on their trail, Britt forms a posse with a gunslinging deputy and a stoic Pawnee tracker. But Jed and Britt tread dangerously close to the Red Desert’s Sioux territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iykb2F7SEhC7gspgv5j8qh5p4um.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859860'),
  ('967459964194418763', 'Catch the Fair One', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Josef Kubota Wladyka, Aton Roberts, Jake Martin', 'Josef Kubota Wladyka', 'Kali Reis, Mainaku Borrero, Daniel Henshall, Michael Drayer, Kevin Dunn, Lisa Emery, Kimberly Guerrero, Jonathan Kowalsky', 'NR', 'A Native American boxer embarks on the fight of her life when she goes in search of her missing sister.', 'A Native American boxer embarks on the fight of her life when she goes in search of her missing sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35QvPu5nOGlzDIGOdvtRNNkfjLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821420'),
  ('879632867060208858', 'Catch the Heat', 1987, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Joel Silberg, Claudio Reiter, Fernando Altschul', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Tiana Alexandra, David Dukes, Rod Steiger, Professor Toru Tanaka, John Hancock, Jorge Martínez, Brian Libby, Jessica Schultz', 'R', 'Gorgeous Checkers Goldberg, a police detective, goes undercover as a stripper in order to stop a ruthless kingpin who has been using unsuspecting starlets in order to smuggle drugs into the United States. With her hot looks, street smarts and martial arts prowess, Goldberg seems to have everything she needs to catch this violent criminal -- and will stop at nothing to get the job done.', 'Gorgeous Checkers Goldberg, a police detective, goes undercover as a stripper in order to stop a ruthless kingpin who has been using unsuspecting starlets in order to smuggle drugs into the United States. With her hot looks, street smarts and martial arts prowess, Goldberg seems to have everything she needs to catch this violent criminal -- and will stop at nothing to get the job done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7c5LLeYHAW81mb0DgzFiYSm4pfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111323'),
  ('494705497156696398', 'Catch the Wind', 2017, 'Drama', 'Gaël Morel', 'Gaël Morel, Rachid O.', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Mouna Fettou, Ilian Bergala, Lubna Azabal, Kamal El Amri, Farida Ouchani, Nisrine Radi, Nathanaël Maïni', null, 'Edith, a 45-year-old textile factory worker, sees her life turned upside down by the company’s downsizing measures. Estranged from her son and without any other ties, rather than go into unemployment, she decides to leave her life behind and follow her work at the factory which has been relocated in Morocco.', 'Edith, a 45-year-old textile factory worker, sees her life turned upside down by the company’s downsizing measures. Estranged from her son and without any other ties, rather than go into unemployment, she decides to leave her life behind and follow her work at the factory which has been relocated in Morocco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmInY8mcPSAjJOdw62d0RAYU3RV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459966'),
  ('229650007421147213', 'Catch Us If You Can', 1965, 'Comedy, Music', 'John Boorman, Manny Wynn, David Tringham', 'Peter Nichols', 'Dave Clark, Barbara Ferris, Mike Smith, Lenny Davidson, Rick Huxley, Denis Payton, Clive Swift, David Lodge', null, 'Dinah is a famous model and actress who is getting tired of life in the limelight and wants to take a break. While shooting a commercial spot for meat, she meets Steve, a stuntman. Dinah and Steve hit it off and decide to head to an island to get away from it all, bringing along four of Steve''s friends. Before long, Dinah is reported missing and everyone is looking for her, making their getaway anything but tranquil.', 'Dinah is a famous model and actress who is getting tired of life in the limelight and wants to take a break. While shooting a commercial spot for meat, she meets Steve, a stuntman. Dinah and Steve hit it off and decide to head to an island to get away from it all, bringing along four of Steve''s friends. Before long, Dinah is reported missing and everyone is looking for her, making their getaway anything but tranquil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9uVoefbNxGemQyG0Aoh9xNU0LB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49921'),
  ('222637620277924420', 'Catch-22', 1970, 'War, Comedy', 'Mike Nichols, David Watkin, Edward Teets', 'Buck Henry', 'Alan Arkin, Martin Balsam, Richard Benjamin, Art Garfunkel, Jack Gilford, Buck Henry, Bob Newhart, Anthony Perkins', 'R', 'A WWII military pilot makes a valiant effort to be certified insane in order to be excused from flying missions. But there''s a catch.', 'A WWII military pilot makes a valiant effort to be certified insane in order to be excused from flying missions. But there''s a catch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSB3i3vvFiRTszmZVawWqROzM6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10364'),
  ('690872112981697477', 'Catch.44', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Aaron Harvey, Jeff Cutter, Chad Rosen', 'Aaron Harvey', 'Bruce Willis, Malin Åkerman, Nikki Reed, Deborah Ann Woll, Forest Whitaker, Brad Dourif, Shea Whigham, Michael Rosenbaum', 'R', 'The lives of three female assassins take a sudden turn when their charming boss lures them into one last job. They soon find themselves thrust into a bizarre situation involving a psychotic hit man, a grizzled trucker and a delusional line cook.', 'The lives of three female assassins take a sudden turn when their charming boss lures them into one last job. They soon find themselves thrust into a bizarre situation involving a psychotic hit man, a grizzled trucker and a delusional line cook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbDQA2a3H9CbEHr7bDkaqxAGDO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75736'),
  ('105066474652004962', 'Catcher: Cat City 2', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Béla Ternovszky', 'József Nepp', 'László Sinkó, Péter Rudolf, Miklós Benedek, Péter Haumann, Béla Stenczer, György Dörner, Péter Balázs, Mátyás Usztics', null, '20 years after the events of the Cat Catcher, there is only one cat tribe left in Central Africa, who, after learning of what happened at the end of the first part, summon Moloch to help liberate the tamed cats and regain power over Earth.', '20 years after the events of the Cat Catcher, there is only one cat tribe left in Central Africa, who, after learning of what happened at the end of the first part, summon Moloch to help liberate the tamed cats and regain power over Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0Khw03lhslBAMdbRft6adtK4sP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79880'),
  ('565889507731909286', 'Catchfire', 1990, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Dennis Hopper, Edward Lachman, Randall Badger', 'Rachel Kronstadt Mann, Ann Louise Bardach', 'Dennis Hopper, Jodie Foster, Dean Stockwell, Vincent Price, John Turturro, Fred Ward, Julie Adams, Tony Sirico', 'R', 'A witness to a mob assassination flees for her life from town to town, switching identities, but cannot seem to elude Milo, the chief killer out to get her.', 'A witness to a mob assassination flees for her life from town to town, switching identities, but cannot seem to elude Milo, the chief killer out to get her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cKFLrXTwzNO8NGfF1kf9nQcsNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32924'),
  ('393430001652229582', 'Catching Dust', 2024, 'Drama', 'Stuart Gatt, Aurélien Marra', 'Stuart Gatt', 'Jai Courtney, Erin Moriarty, Dina Shihabi, Ryan Corr, Olwen Fouéré, Gary Fannin, José Altit', null, 'A criminal husband and his wife hide in a lone trailer. Exhausted by her husbands controlling ways, she decides to leave. But then a trailer arrives with a couple which creates dangerous consequences for them all.', 'A criminal husband and his wife hide in a lone trailer. Exhausted by her husbands controlling ways, she decides to leave. But then a trailer arrives with a couple which creates dangerous consequences for them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7LTgu7kiwvBgoKLhtc9vP1IDgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992638'),
  ('519993801735221951', 'Catching Trouble', 1936, 'Documentary', 'Jack Eaton', null, 'Ted Husing, Ross Allen', null, 'This short follows a day of work for an Everglades wildlife trapper catching animals for zoos around America. In this film, his assignment is to go out into the swamp with his Indian assistant and find a bobcat, two black bear cubs and six rattlesnakes.', 'This short follows a day of work for an Everglades wildlife trapper catching animals for zoos around America. In this film, his assignment is to go out into the swamp with his Indian assistant and find a bobcat, two black bear cubs and six rattlesnakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60uaSGDqFni0F8B9Z6nkvUL21ke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204687'),
