  ('723249010449651295', 'Caterina in the Big City', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Virzì, Gianluca Greco, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Francesco Bruni, Paolo Virzì', 'Sergio Castellitto, Margherita Buy, Alice Teghil, Federica Sbrenna, Margherita Mazzola, Carolina Iaquaniello, Martina Tasquetta, Galatea Ranzi', 'NR', 'When her social-climbing father is relocated from a one-horse town to his native Rome, 12-year-old Caterina enrolls in his old school, finding herself adrift in an environment where eighth-graders form friendships based on social class and their parents'' political affiliations.', 'When her social-climbing father is relocated from a one-horse town to his native Rome, 12-year-old Caterina enrolls in his old school, finding herself adrift in an environment where eighth-graders form friendships based on social class and their parents'' political affiliations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20YWJFpf42UxcGUgXimyLrP6A5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18503'),
  ('563258330173767773', 'Catering Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'T.W. Peacocke', 'Cara J. Russell', 'Merritt Patterson, Daniel Lissing, Christopher Hayes, R Austin Ball, Donno Mitoma, Michael Hanrahan, Rosemary Dunsmore, Melanie Leishman', 'G', 'A fledgling caterer, Molly Frost, is hired by Jean Harrison, the perfectionistic director of the renowned Harrison Foundation, to cater this year’s annual Christmas Gala dinner. Things get complicated when Molly falls for Jean’s nephew, Carson, 30s, a travel photographer with no desire to take over the family’s foundation… until his aunt assigns him to the task of making sure the catered dinner goes perfectly.', 'A fledgling caterer, Molly Frost, is hired by Jean Harrison, the perfectionistic director of the renowned Harrison Foundation, to cater this year’s annual Christmas Gala dinner. Things get complicated when Molly falls for Jean’s nephew, Carson, 30s, a travel photographer with no desire to take over the family’s foundation… until his aunt assigns him to the task of making sure the catered dinner goes perfectly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmVZsiEYIN4AtRUCSJSIAZ8idjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961769'),
  ('736421114461905595', 'Caterpillar', 2010, 'Drama, War', 'Kōji Wakamatsu, Yoshihisa Toda, Tomohiko Tsuji', 'Hisako Kurosawa, Izuru Deguchi', 'Shinobu Terajima, Keigo Kasuya, Sabu Kawahara, Maki Ishikawa, Go Jibiki, Arata Iura, Katsuyuki Shinohara, Daisuke Iijima', null, 'The story of a village woman given the grueling task of looking after (and fulfilling the sexual needs of) her quadruple amputee husband, a Japanese soldier in the Second Sino-Japanese War who has been decreed a "War God" by the Emperor.', 'The story of a village woman given the grueling task of looking after (and fulfilling the sexual needs of) her quadruple amputee husband, a Japanese soldier in the Second Sino-Japanese War who has been decreed a "War God" by the Emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5vm2CDnwFwKQv3iXR6lKktYDBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46106'),
  ('1140403025076225354', 'Cateto a babor', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Ramón Fernández', null, 'Alfredo Landa, Florinda Chico, José Gálvez, José Sacristán, Laly Soldevila, Margot Cottens, Rafaela Aparicio, Luis Barbero', null, 'Miguel Cañete is a village man who is called up by the Navy to do military service, but he lives alone with his little brother and doesn''t know where to leave him...', 'Miguel Cañete is a village man who is called up by the Navy to do military service, but he lives alone with his little brother and doesn''t know where to leave him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmydcxnY1QKu5Ij5q0GE1Lm49io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119614'),
  ('259950162238280267', 'Catfight', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Onur Tukel, Zoë White, Laura Klein', 'Onur Tukel', 'Sandra Oh, Anne Heche, Alicia Silverstone, Amy Hill, Myra Lucretia Taylor, Tituss Burgess, Jay O. Sanders, Giullian Yao Gioiello', null, 'The rivalry between two former college friends comes to a head when they both attend the same glamorous event.', 'The rivalry between two former college friends comes to a head when they both attend the same glamorous event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3kLVDNJlU6IIMmtMmFjtSBat7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408272'),
  ('35850382881934394', 'Catfish', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Ariel Schulman, Henry Joost', null, 'Nēv Schulman, Ariel Schulman, Angela Wesselman-Pierce, Melody C. Roscher, Henry Joost, Wendy Whelan, Craig Hall, Tiler Peck', 'PG-13', 'Nev, a 24-year-old New York-based photographer, has no idea what he''s in for when Abby, an eight-year-old girl from rural Michigan, contacts him on Facebook, seeking permission to paint one of his photographs. When he receives her remarkable painting, Nev begins a friendship and correspondence with Abby''s family. But things really get interesting when he develops a cyber-romance with Abby''s attractive older sister, Megan, a musician and model. Prompted by some startling revelations about Megan, Nev and his buddies embark on a road trip in search of the truth.', 'Nev, a 24-year-old New York-based photographer, has no idea what he''s in for when Abby, an eight-year-old girl from rural Michigan, contacts him on Facebook, seeking permission to paint one of his photographs. When he receives her remarkable painting, Nev begins a friendship and correspondence with Abby''s family. But things really get interesting when he develops a cyber-romance with Abby''s attractive older sister, Megan, a musician and model. Prompted by some startling revelations about Megan, Nev and his buddies embark on a road trip in search of the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXNxee2ix6Ke0bSIqFST0UhbVLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42296'),
  ('261908347500197104', 'Catfish in Black Bean Sauce', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chi Muoi Lo', 'Chi Muoi Lo', 'Paul Winfield, Mary Alice, Sanaa Lathan, Chi Muoi Lo, Lauren Tom, Kieu Chinh, Tyler Christopher, Tzi Ma', 'PG-13', 'An African American couple (Winfield and Alice) adopt two orphans from a Vietnamese refugee camp. After 22 years, the children are reunited with their birth mother, bringing deeply submerged resentments and misconceptions to the surface, and forcing the characters to reexamine their identity and relationships in both comical and poignant situations.', 'An African American couple (Winfield and Alice) adopt two orphans from a Vietnamese refugee camp. After 22 years, the children are reunited with their birth mother, bringing deeply submerged resentments and misconceptions to the surface, and forcing the characters to reexamine their identity and relationships in both comical and poignant situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v59Q5tEYZgkBh735RXh83ZVoCiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287821'),
  ('474906488739621886', 'Catherine and I', 1980, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Alberto Sordi, Sergio D''Offizi, Fulvio Marcolin', 'Alberto Sordi, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Edwige Fenech, Valeria Valeri, Catherine Spaak, Rossano Brazzi, Victoria Zinny, Susan Scheerer, Andrew I. Miller', null, 'Enrico Melotti, a middle-aged businessman, has a difficult relationship with his wife, maid and secretary/lover. During a business trip to America, his friend Arturo shows him the key to solving all of his problems: Caterina, a female-looking robotic maid that does all domestic chores better than any human.', 'Enrico Melotti, a middle-aged businessman, has a difficult relationship with his wife, maid and secretary/lover. During a business trip to America, his friend Arturo shows him the key to solving all of his problems: Caterina, a female-looking robotic maid that does all domestic chores better than any human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96Ag1X6B9KQWrDiMtIFcgwRq3tN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68825'),
  ('1077550823190958359', 'Catherine Called Birdy', 2022, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Tim Blake, Cordelia Hardy, Toby Spanton', 'Lena Dunham', 'Bella Ramsey, Billie Piper, Andrew Scott, Lesley Sharp, Joe Alwyn, Sophie Okonedo, Paul Kaye, Dean-Charles Chapman', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl in Medieval England navigates life and tries to avoid the arranged marriages her father maps out for her.', 'A teenage girl in Medieval England navigates life and tries to avoid the arranged marriages her father maps out for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6welBP7DtjHDsr6fwT5IuCS33f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795109'),
  ('176382116804272133', 'Catherine the Great', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Marvin J. Chomsky, John Goldsmith, Elemér Ragályi', 'John Goldsmith, Frank Tudisco', 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Paul McGann, Ian Richardson, Brian Blessed, Christoph Waltz, Hannes Jaenicke, John Rhys-Davies, Agnès Soral', null, 'Trapped in a loveless arranged marriage to the immature future Czar, a young German Princess proves a skillful political infighter and rises to become Catherine the Great.', 'Trapped in a loveless arranged marriage to the immature future Czar, a young German Princess proves a skillful political infighter and rises to become Catherine the Great.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnkdVJyZDaPjazFnQXIKxBeuqif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69931'),
  ('103692509846315115', 'Cathy Come Home', 1966, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Ken Loach, Tony Imi', 'Ken Loach', 'Carol White, Ray Brooks, Wally Patch, Adrienne Frame, Winifred Dennis, Emmett Hennessy, Alec Coleman, Geoffrey Palmer', null, 'Cathy and Reg are a couple with three young children, who find their life spiralling into poverty when Reg loses his well-paid job. Gripping and emotional, Cathy Come Home remains a truly ground-breaking piece of dramatic fiction, engaging viewers with social issues, such as homelessness, unemployment and the rights of mothers to keep their own children.', 'Cathy and Reg are a couple with three young children, who find their life spiralling into poverty when Reg loses his well-paid job. Gripping and emotional, Cathy Come Home remains a truly ground-breaking piece of dramatic fiction, engaging viewers with social issues, such as homelessness, unemployment and the rights of mothers to keep their own children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5tNZXl4eygOZ9DKD0lWU9TfclX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263640'),
  ('370395295383391932', 'Cathy''s Curse', 1977, 'Horror', 'Eddy Matalon, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Myra Clément, Eddy Matalon, Alain Sens-Cazenave', 'Randi Allen, Alan Scarfe, Beverly Murray, Dorothy Davis, Mary Morter, Roy Witham, Bryce Allen, Sonny Forbes', 'R', 'A young girl is possessed by the spirit of her dead aunt, who died in a car accident. Soon members of her family begin to mysteriously die off.', 'A young girl is possessed by the spirit of her dead aunt, who died in a car accident. Soon members of her family begin to mysteriously die off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcX3fAUa1VhLN0rYLYV74eI8UQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106774'),
  ('1063443512852208708', 'Catli', 2026, 'Biography, Drama, Crime', 'Deniz Enyüksek', 'Onur Tan, Nevzat Erkul', 'Vedat İnceefe, Eren Vurdem, Ömer Kurt', null, 'In the early 1980s, Abdullah Catli becomes entangled in an international conflict spanning several European countries. As Europe turns into a stage for covert confrontations, Catli is increasingly faced with existential decisions. Caught between loyalty, responsibility, and the protection of his family, an intense drama unfolds about guilt, loss, and survival.', 'In the early 1980s, Abdullah Catli becomes entangled in an international conflict spanning several European countries. As Europe turns into a stage for covert confrontations, Catli is increasingly faced with existential decisions. Caught between loyalty, responsibility, and the protection of his family, an intense drama unfolds about guilt, loss, and survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpUUIopyCB27zUWg5oj2R7RX8CR1.jpg', 'plex:movie:catli'),
  ('854758201132579653', 'Catlow', 1971, 'Western, Comedy', 'Sam Wanamaker, John Glen, Edward Scaife', 'Scot Finch, James Griffith', 'Yul Brynner, Richard Crenna, Leonard Nimoy, Daliah Lavi, Jo Ann Pflug, Jeff Corey, Michael Delano, Dan van Husen', 'PG-13', 'An outlaw tries to avoid interference as he journeys to Mexico to pull off a $2,000,000 gold robbery.', 'An outlaw tries to avoid interference as he journeys to Mexico to pull off a $2,000,000 gold robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIBCD4pEgO9lcXmGHSqTwKlV7ZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75130'),
