  ('1028040307361436316', 'Cats & Dogs', 2001, 'Family, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Lawrence Guterman, Julio Macat', 'John Requa, Glenn Ficarra', 'Jeff Goldblum, Elizabeth Perkins, Alexander Pollock, Miriam Margolyes, Tobey Maguire, Alec Baldwin, Sean Hayes, Susan Sarandon', 'PG', 'When a professor develops a vaccine that eliminates human allergies to dogs, he unwittingly upsets the fragile balance of power between cats and dogs and touches off an epic battle for pet supremacy. The fur flies as the feline faction, led by Mr. Tinkles, squares off against wide-eyed puppy Lou and his canine cohorts.', 'When a professor develops a vaccine that eliminates human allergies to dogs, he unwittingly upsets the fragile balance of power between cats and dogs and touches off an epic battle for pet supremacy. The fur flies as the feline faction, led by Mr. Tinkles, squares off against wide-eyed puppy Lou and his canine cohorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUWoat7L4vvQburQ8pVEJhRG9L5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10992'),
  ('303234026697921914', 'Cats & Dogs 3: Paws Unite', 2020, 'Family, Comedy, Action', 'Sean McNamara, Adam Sliwinski, Harriet Greenspan', 'Scott Bindley', 'Melissa Rauch, Max Greenfield, George López, Callum Seagram Airlie, Sarah Giles, Lauren K. Robek, John Murphy, Paul Dobson', 'PG', 'It''s been ten years since the creation of the Great Truce, an elaborate joint-species surveillance system designed and monitored by cats and dogs to keep the peace when conflicts arise. But when a tech-savvy villain hacks into wireless networks to use frequencies only heard by cats and dogs, he manipulates them into conflict and the worldwide battle between cats and dogs is BACK ON. Now, a team of inexperienced and untested agents will have to use their old-school animal instincts to restore order and peace between cats and dogs everywhere.', 'It''s been ten years since the creation of the Great Truce, an elaborate joint-species surveillance system designed and monitored by cats and dogs to keep the peace when conflicts arise. But when a tech-savvy villain hacks into wireless networks to use frequencies only heard by cats and dogs, he manipulates them into conflict and the worldwide battle between cats and dogs is BACK ON. Now, a team of inexperienced and untested agents will have to use their old-school animal instincts to restore order and peace between cats and dogs everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BgSWFMW2MJ0dT5metLzsRWO7IJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726739'),
  ('686219860072651705', 'Cats & Dogs: The Revenge of Kitty Galore', 2010, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Brad Peyton, Greg Michael, Steven Poster', 'Steve Bencich, Ron J. Friedman', 'James Marsden, Nick Nolte, Christina Applegate, Bette Midler, Pascale Hutton, Katt Williams, Neil Patrick Harris, Sean Hayes', 'PG', 'The ongoing war between the canine and feline species is put on hold when they join forces to thwart a rogue cat spy with her own sinister plans for conquest.', 'The ongoing war between the canine and feline species is put on hold when they join forces to thwart a rogue cat spy with her own sinister plans for conquest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syV2naEnz7wbakOOk7XanPX8MjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39691'),
  ('212098639262395582', 'Cats Don''t Dance', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Mark Dindal, Michael Serrian', 'Bobs Gannaway, Cliff Ruby, Elana Lesser', 'Scott Bakula, Jasmine Guy, Natalie Cole, Ashley Peldon, Lindsay Ridgeway, Frank Welker, Don Knotts, George Kennedy', 'G', 'An ambitious singing and dancing cat in 1939 Hollywood overcomes several obstacles to fulfill his dream of becoming a movie star.', 'An ambitious singing and dancing cat in 1939 Hollywood overcomes several obstacles to fulfill his dream of becoming a movie star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CrgfB0dNUsanaMWHTv0Y6AFeNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24662'),
  ('293268523237125058', 'Cats Don''t Have Vertigo', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'António-Pedro Vasconcelos, José António Loureiro', 'António-Pedro Vasconcelos, Tiago R. Santos', 'João Jesus, Maria do Céu Guerra, Nicolau Breyner, Fernanda Serrano, António-Pedro Vasconcelos, Joaquim Leitão, Pedro Lamares, Sara Barros Leitão', null, 'Jô is kicked out of home by his father on his birthday. Having no place to go, he takes refuge in the terrace of Rose, who just lost her husband.', 'Jô is kicked out of home by his father on his birthday. Having no place to go, he takes refuge in the terrace of Rose, who just lost her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHzuZLYGWF7GLgMD4l7LWqdivjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280633'),
  ('157064512134075968', 'Cats in the Museum', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Fedor Mezentsev, Vasily Rovensky', 'Elvira Bushtets, Fedor Derevyansky, Vasily Rovensky', 'Jordan Worsley, Stephen Peter Krisel, Maria Smakhtina, Michael Kleeman, Nikki Aaron, Anton Eldarov, Polina Gagarina, Aleksandr Gavrilin', null, 'A cartoon about the famous four-legged inhabitants of the St. Petersburg Winter Palace - museum cats that protect the territory of the State Hermitage from rats and mice.', 'A cartoon about the famous four-legged inhabitants of the St. Petersburg Winter Palace - museum cats that protect the territory of the State Hermitage from rats and mice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOn1mR8ZA7gZ1r7OUFAUbTMGfQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923579'),
  ('785075718795577521', 'Cattiva Coscienza', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Davide Minnella, Marco Bassano, Riccardo Quarta', 'Davide Minnella, Stefano Sardo, Teresa Gelli', 'Beatrice Grannò, Matilde Gioli, Caterina Guzzanti, Francesco Scianna, Gianfranco Gallo, Filippo Scicchitano, Giovanni Esposito, Alessandro Benvenuti', null, 'In a parallel universe, live people’s precious consciences. They all feel disheartened, demotivated, and unheard, except for Otto (Francesco Scianna). He is the top-ranked conscience, because his human Filippo (Filippo Scicchitano) follows him blindly, guaranteeing him happiness.', 'In a parallel universe, live people’s precious consciences. They all feel disheartened, demotivated, and unheard, except for Otto (Francesco Scianna). He is the top-ranked conscience, because his human Filippo (Filippo Scicchitano) follows him blindly, guaranteeing him happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NYCEIKdC8xkkl9hSr8dh78pWsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1048746'),
  ('886280304690446593', 'Cattle Annie and Little Britches', 1981, 'Western', 'Lamont Johnson, Larry Pizer, Penny Perry', 'Robert Ward, David Eyre', 'Amanda Plummer, Diane Lane, Burt Lancaster, Scott Glenn, Redmond Gleeson, William Russ, Kenny Call, John Savage', 'PG', 'In nineteenth century Oklahoma, two teen girls, fans of stories about outlaws, are on a quest to meet and join up with them. They find a shadow of a former gang and although disappointed, still try to help them escape from a vigorous Marshal.', 'In nineteenth century Oklahoma, two teen girls, fans of stories about outlaws, are on a quest to meet and join up with them. They find a shadow of a former gang and although disappointed, still try to help them escape from a vigorous Marshal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbY56Vl2hoW5N5CuPDuaE8sDwpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167262'),
