  ('574889704429682954', 'Catwoman', 2004, 'Action, Fantasy, Crime', 'Pitof, Thierry Arbogast, Mira Caveno', 'John Rogers', 'Halle Berry, Benjamin Bratt, Sharon Stone, Lambert Wilson, Frances Conroy, Alex Borstein, Michael Massee, Byron Mann', 'PG-13', 'Liquidated after discovering a corporate conspiracy, mild-mannered graphic artist Patience Phillips washes up on an island, where she''s resurrected and endowed with the prowess of a cat — and she''s eager to use her new skills... as a vigilante. Before you can say "cat and mouse", handsome gumshoe Tom Lone is on her tail, fascinated by both of her personas.', 'Liquidated after discovering a corporate conspiracy, mild-mannered graphic artist Patience Phillips washes up on an island, where she''s resurrected and endowed with the prowess of a cat — and she''s eager to use her new skills... as a vigilante. Before you can say "cat and mouse", handsome gumshoe Tom Lone is on her tail, fascinated by both of her personas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvnPgukFyEKgCzyOxyLiwyZ8T1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314'),
  ('584986015849447803', 'Catwoman: Hunted', 2022, 'Animation, Action, Crime', 'Shinsuke Terasawa', 'Greg Weisman', 'Elizabeth Gillies, Stephanie Beatriz, Jonathan Banks, Steve Blum, Lauren Cohan, Keith David, Zehra Fazal, Jonathan Frakes', 'PG-13', 'Catwoman''s attempt to steal a priceless jewel puts her squarely in the crosshairs of both a powerful consortium of villains and the ever-resourceful Interpol, not to mention Batwoman.', 'Catwoman''s attempt to steal a priceless jewel puts her squarely in the crosshairs of both a powerful consortium of villains and the ever-resourceful Interpol, not to mention Batwoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iu01cvxs3eLQzra3YNF1pbpXIZa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862491'),
  ('853403232703545459', 'Caught', 1949, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Max Ophüls, Lee Garmes, John Berry', 'Arthur Laurents', 'James Mason, Barbara Bel Geddes, Robert Ryan, Frank Ferguson, Curt Bois, Ruth Brady, Natalie Schafer, Art Smith', null, 'Wide-eyed and poor young Leonora weds an obsessive millionaire named Ohlrig, but the marriage is loveless. Even worse, Ohlrig seems to have manic, violent tendencies. Eventually, young Leonora escapes her unhappy life and begins working with New York City doctor Larry Quinada, who she soon falls for. Unfortunately, Ohlrig refuses to grant his wife a divorce, and things get even darker for Leonora when she realizes she''s pregnant with his child.', 'Wide-eyed and poor young Leonora weds an obsessive millionaire named Ohlrig, but the marriage is loveless. Even worse, Ohlrig seems to have manic, violent tendencies. Eventually, young Leonora escapes her unhappy life and begins working with New York City doctor Larry Quinada, who she soon falls for. Unfortunately, Ohlrig refuses to grant his wife a divorce, and things get even darker for Leonora when she realizes she''s pregnant with his child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htMtSPue5zDW79iL67quA6dM4Gz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43397'),
  ('508989582385125381', 'Caught', 1996, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert M. Young', 'Edward Pomerantz', 'Edward James Olmos, María Conchita Alonso, Arie Verveen, Bitty Schram, Steven Schub, Irma St. Paule', null, 'A middle-aged couple has a drifter enter their lives. The fish-store owners find that the mysterious young man awakens the couple in ways they didn''t expect. Things get tense when the drifter begins an affair with the woman of the house.', 'A middle-aged couple has a drifter enter their lives. The fish-store owners find that the mysterious young man awakens the couple in ways they didn''t expect. Things get tense when the drifter begins an affair with the woman of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33sUPXPUqIe9YnZ80d8xzkiL2gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47260'),
