  ('716623824091949860', 'Caught by a Wave', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Massimiliano Camaiti, Michele Paradisi', 'Massimiliano Camaiti, Claudia Bottino', 'Elvira Camarrone, Christian Roberto, Vincenzo Amato, Donatella Finocchiaro, Corrado Invernizzi, Manuela Ventura, Sofia Migliara, Angelica Alleruzzo', 'NR', 'A summer fling born under the Sicilian sun quickly develops into a heartbreaking love story that forces a boy and girl to grow up too quickly.', 'A summer fling born under the Sicilian sun quickly develops into a heartbreaking love story that forces a boy and girl to grow up too quickly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9O2WXJqF45ynkng4SAsZ1h0OCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694256'),
