  ('496666877158040636', 'Caught by the Tides', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai, Éric Gautier', 'Jiahuan Wan, Jia Zhangke', 'Zhao Tao, Zhubin Li, Pan Jianlin, Zhou Lan, Zhou You, Ren Ke, Mao Tao, Liang Jingdong', null, 'Years after her boyfriend left her for the big city and promised to bring her there after he’s settled down, a Chinese woman sets out on a journey to be reunited with him.', 'Years after her boyfriend left her for the big city and promised to bring her there after he’s settled down, a Chinese woman sets out on a journey to be reunited with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRUsEXHm9iJgXuf8k4BiTLCnUb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136837'),
  ('387716010184910518', 'Caught in His Web', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Hannah Cheesman, Christian Lai', 'Danielle Iman', 'Alison Thornton, Malia Baker, Emma Tremblay, Garcelle Beauvais, Morgan Taylor Campbell, Burkely Duffield, Donavon Stinson, Sarah Strange', 'PG-13', 'Three women join forces to take back their lives after they become the target of a cyberbully who harasses them and tracks their every move, so they decide to seek help from a detective.', 'Three women join forces to take back their lives after they become the target of a cyberbully who harasses them and tracks their every move, so they decide to seek help from a detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tHPEqhCf1HVd4kWg7TLnSSX2XG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940612'),
