  ('839842770628406505', 'Caught in the Draft', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance, War', 'David Butler, Karl Struss', 'Harry Tugend', 'Bob Hope, Dorothy Lamour, Eddie Bracken, Lynne Overman, Clarence Kolb, Paul Hurst, Ferike Boros, Irving Bacon', 'NR', 'Don Bolton is a movie star who can''t stand loud noises. To evade the draft, he decides to get married...but falls for a colonel''s daughter. By mistake, he and his two cronies enlist. In basic training, Don hopes to make a good impression on the fair Antoinette and her father, but his military career is largely slapstick. Will he ever get his corporal''s stripes?', 'Don Bolton is a movie star who can''t stand loud noises. To evade the draft, he decides to get married...but falls for a colonel''s daughter. By mistake, he and his two cronies enlist. In basic training, Don hopes to make a good impression on the fair Antoinette and her father, but his military career is largely slapstick. Will he ever get his corporal''s stripes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aG7BGllrdT5e6Zet2nneuM7TeI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108014'),
  ('520033176394073571', 'Caught in the Net', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Vít Klusák, Barbora Chalupová, Adam Kruliš', 'Barbora Chalupová, Vít Klusák', 'Sabina Dlouhá, Anežka Pithartová, Tereza Těžká', null, 'Everyone knows something like this is happening. But this is the only experiment to fully demonstrate what excessive openness on the internet means. The filmmaking couple hired youthful-looking (but over 18) actresses to pretend to be prepubescent girls and communicate with strangers who approached them based on their fake accounts. They attracted dozens of men in the first ten days, then hundreds, and finally thousands...', 'Everyone knows something like this is happening. But this is the only experiment to fully demonstrate what excessive openness on the internet means. The filmmaking couple hired youthful-looking (but over 18) actresses to pretend to be prepubescent girls and communicate with strangers who approached them based on their fake accounts. They attracted dozens of men in the first ten days, then hundreds, and finally thousands...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jt61E2pvsexKH903PaGFnm2csHi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599876'),
  ('1025707601699813159', 'Caught in the Web', 2012, 'Drama', 'Chen Kaige, Yang Shu', 'Chen Kaige, Tang Danian', 'Gao Yuanyuan, Mark Chao You-Ting, Chen Hong, Wang Xueqi, Yao Chen, Wang Luodan, Chen Ran, Yu Ailei', null, 'The story of three women whose worlds collide - a social commentary about the ''sound bite'' society we are becoming, where perception becomes reality and judgments based on limited facts quickly spread, without regard for the truth or the damage they could cause.', 'The story of three women whose worlds collide - a social commentary about the ''sound bite'' society we are becoming, where perception becomes reality and judgments based on limited facts quickly spread, without regard for the truth or the damage they could cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOiHbBYa6shH6N8zsW2iM6ptqoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121795'),
  ('671031620656993329', 'Caught in Time', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ho Yiu-Leung, Lau Ho-Leung, Pakie Chan', 'Lau Ho-Leung', 'Daniel Wu, Wang Qianyuan, Jessie Li, Michelle Wai Si-Nga, Da Li, Yu Xiao, Hu Zicheng, Li Xiaochuan', 'NR', 'Based on real life events from the 1990s, a ruthless gang manages to pull off several high risk – high reward heists, meticulously planned out and executed over nearly a decade. When a police detective thinks he''s figured out their pattern, the head of the gang starts to openly taunt him, resulting in a race to the ultimate showdown between cops and robbers.', 'Based on real life events from the 1990s, a ruthless gang manages to pull off several high risk – high reward heists, meticulously planned out and executed over nearly a decade. When a police detective thinks he''s figured out their pattern, the head of the gang starts to openly taunt him, resulting in a race to the ultimate showdown between cops and robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikRoKb433FgJtd6KvdQGrMuUwKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751820'),
  ('78111453519621944', 'Caught Stealing', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Darren Aronofsky, Peter Thorell, Laura Ballinger', 'Charlie Huston', 'Austin Butler, Regina King, Zoë Kravitz, Matt Smith, Liev Schreiber, Vincent D''Onofrio, Griffin Dunne, Nikita Kukushkin', 'R', 'Burned-out ex-baseball player Hank Thompson unexpectedly finds himself embroiled in a dangerous struggle for survival amidst the criminal underbelly of late 1990s New York City, forced to navigate a treacherous underworld he never imagined.', 'Burned-out ex-baseball player Hank Thompson unexpectedly finds himself embroiled in a dangerous struggle for survival amidst the criminal underbelly of late 1990s New York City, forced to navigate a treacherous underworld he never imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvda8s5J8YaHjTyEyXQpvD6f3iV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245993'),
  ('478040076902360305', 'Caught Up', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Darin Scott, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Darin Scott', 'Bokeem Woodbine, Cynda Williams, Damon Saleem, Clifton Powell, Tony Todd, Snoop Dogg, LL Cool J, Jeffrey Combs', 'R', 'Daryl gets out of jail after 5 years. His mother has died, his girlfriend is married, and he can''t find a job. His new girlfriend Vanessa, whom he meets when a gunman opens fire on them, gets him a job as a car driver. Hitmen are still after them, and Vanessa tells Daryl that this is her former lover Ahmad who wants revenge.', 'Daryl gets out of jail after 5 years. His mother has died, his girlfriend is married, and he can''t find a job. His new girlfriend Vanessa, whom he meets when a gunman opens fire on them, gets him a job as a car driver. Hitmen are still after them, and Vanessa tells Daryl that this is her former lover Ahmad who wants revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRfULxRff9v6VWgqBFIXTFVqkzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88863'),
  ('999794398447808243', 'Cauldron of Blood', 1968, 'Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Santos Alcocer, Francisco Sempere, Edward Mann', 'José Luis Bayonas', 'Boris Karloff, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Viveca Lindfors, Rosenda Monteros, Milo Quesada, Dyanik Zurakowska, Rubén Rojo, Jacqui Speed', null, 'A blind sculptor works on his magnum opus unaware that the skeletons he has been using for armatures are the remains of the victims of his evil wife and that he is the next target.', 'A blind sculptor works on his magnum opus unaware that the skeletons he has been using for armatures are the remains of the victims of his evil wife and that he is the next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkRde4a4C40uIzgwIvbV7zl9VOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87472'),
  ('75777498789675822', 'Causality', 2021, 'Thriller', 'WHO, Félix "Chango" Monti, Diego Morel', 'WHO', 'Juana Viale, Laura Novoa, Pablo Mónaco, Esteban Bigliardi, María Soldi, Fabián Arenillas, Ariel Gigena, Marcos Woinsky', null, 'Claudia shows up at a bar to meet Luis, a doctor who contacted her through a dating app. Claudia doesn''t suspect what fate has in store for her. A kidnapping that ends with an inevitable and unpredictable death. A suspense story with surprising twists until the last second, narrated in a sequence shot without cuts.', 'Claudia shows up at a bar to meet Luis, a doctor who contacted her through a dating app. Claudia doesn''t suspect what fate has in store for her. A kidnapping that ends with an inevitable and unpredictable death. A suspense story with surprising twists until the last second, narrated in a sequence shot without cuts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqPTx3z2RVOvrIO3aJYO7avSavC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808962'),
  ('152518003977713653', 'Cause for Alarm!', 1951, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Joseph Ruttenberg, Tay Garnett, Jack Greenwood', 'Mel Dinelli, Tom Lewis', 'Loretta Young, Barry Sullivan, Bruce Cowling, Margalo Gillmore, Brad Morrow, Irving Bacon, Georgia Backus, Don Haggerty', 'NR', 'A bedridden and gravely ill man believes his wife and doctor are conspiring to kill him, and outlines his suspicions in a letter.', 'A bedridden and gravely ill man believes his wife and doctor are conspiring to kill him, and outlines his suspicions in a letter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yCPB2jBvNEhG6qFej8ay3Xn5KU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29835'),
  ('790712855060541400', 'Cause toujours... tu m''intéresses', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Michel Leroy, Graziella Molinaro, Édouard Molinaro', 'Francis Veber', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Annie Girardot, Jacques François, Brigitte Roüan, Umban U''kset, Jean-Claude Martin, Christian Marquand, Nathalie Courval', null, 'François Perrin is a journalist who reads the news on RTL radio. Alone in life, his only "amusement" is his neighbor from Africa, who makes mildly fun of him from time to time. One evening, François is bored, and decides to call a random telephone number. He gets Christine on the line, a bit of an old school pharmacist, who hesitates to put down the phone, and plays the game of seduction with the charming "Mr X"...', 'François Perrin is a journalist who reads the news on RTL radio. Alone in life, his only "amusement" is his neighbor from Africa, who makes mildly fun of him from time to time. One evening, François is bored, and decides to call a random telephone number. He gets Christine on the line, a bit of an old school pharmacist, who hesitates to put down the phone, and plays the game of seduction with the charming "Mr X"...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ArDWBUyhanERoRc3iQhr4rgy1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66695'),
  ('182188919134277088', 'Causeway', 2022, 'Drama', 'Cary Lee, Christopher Surgent, Takahide Kawakami', 'Elizabeth Sanders, Luke Goebel, Ottessa Moshfegh', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Brian Tyree Henry, Linda Emond, Jayne Houdyshell, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Russell Harvard, Sean Carvajal, Frederick Weller', 'R', 'A US soldier suffers a traumatic brain injury while fighting in Afghanistan and struggles to adjust to life back home in New Orleans. When she meets local mechanic James, the pair begin to forge an unexpected bond.', 'A US soldier suffers a traumatic brain injury while fighting in Afghanistan and struggles to adjust to life back home in New Orleans. When she meets local mechanic James, the pair begin to forge an unexpected bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUzKIqFIS05Ss31zRTfZfHJIgDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595586'),
  ('916286041585595028', 'Caution, Hazardous Wife: The Movie', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Tōya Satō, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Yukiko Manabe', 'Haruka Ayase, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Kosuke Suzuki, Koshi Mizukami, Atsuko Maeda, Minosuke, Yōsuke Asari, Yuu Yashiro', null, 'At the end of the TV series of the same name, it is revealed that the husband works for the Public Security Bureau, and their marriage is a cover to keep her under surveillance. In spite of his mission, he falls in love with Nami and tries to convince her not to get involved in other people’s affairs. She is being monitored as a state-level security risk, and the bureau is unwilling to tolerate any more trouble from her. However, to save a friend, Nami runs out of the house and risks everything she has to confront the enemy. When she comes home, she finds her husband pointing a gun at her! A gunshot echoes through the quiet, upscale neighborhood…The movie picks up where the controversial ending of the drama series left off!!', 'At the end of the TV series of the same name, it is revealed that the husband works for the Public Security Bureau, and their marriage is a cover to keep her under surveillance. In spite of his mission, he falls in love with Nami and tries to convince her not to get involved in other people’s affairs. She is being monitored as a state-level security risk, and the bureau is unwilling to tolerate any more trouble from her. However, to save a friend, Nami runs out of the house and risks everything she has to confront the enemy. When she comes home, she finds her husband pointing a gun at her! A gunshot echoes through the quiet, upscale neighborhood…The movie picks up where the controversial ending of the drama series left off!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67FAUFk5eduymBslaEzxZ5w7O4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706566'),
  ('409645405325483982', 'Cautiva', 2004, 'Drama', 'Gaston Biraben, Carlos Torlaschi, Abel Peñalba', 'Gaston Biraben', 'Bárbara Lombardo, Susana Campos, Hugo Arana, Osvaldo Santoro, Lidia Catalano, Noemí Frenkel, Mercedes Funes, Silvia Baylé', 'NR', 'Cristina''s life is thrown into turmoil when she is suddenly escorted from her strict Catholic school in Buenos Aires and told that she is really Sofía Lombardi, the daughter of activists who disappeared in the ''70s. Questioning everything she once thought true, Cristina embarks on a journey to find her true identity. Meeting others like herself, the young girl soon discovers the real-life horrors of Argentina''s relatively recent past and the nightmare that claimed tens of thousands of lives during the country''s "dirty war."', 'Cristina''s life is thrown into turmoil when she is suddenly escorted from her strict Catholic school in Buenos Aires and told that she is really Sofía Lombardi, the daughter of activists who disappeared in the ''70s. Questioning everything she once thought true, Cristina embarks on a journey to find her true identity. Meeting others like herself, the young girl soon discovers the real-life horrors of Argentina''s relatively recent past and the nightmare that claimed tens of thousands of lives during the country''s "dirty war."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUZQQFp7Z1DcU9VDLFpcbSdaPMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21616'),
  ('1062078309607201626', 'Cautivo del mas allá', 1968, 'Horror', 'Rafael Portillo, Juan Manuel Herrera', 'Rafael Portillo', 'Ana Luisa Peluffo, Gonzalo Aiza, David Reynoso, Beatriz Aguirre, Roberto Cañedo, Silvia Suárez, Norma Somarriba, Barbara Wells', null, 'Vicky loves Ricardo but Ricardo loves Barbara. So, Vicky goes to a gypsy witch who convinces her she must make a pact with Satan in order to cast an effective love spell on Ricardo. After Vicky gives her body and soul to the Dark One, she engages with Ricardo in a passionate night of lovemaking that is cut short by Satan, who, sensing that Ricardo has not completely fallen under the spell, orders Vicky to kill him. Following Ricardo''s death, his brother Carlos is haunted by nightmares of the dead sibling, who appears and takes possession of Carlos in order to get his revenge on Vicky.', 'Vicky loves Ricardo but Ricardo loves Barbara. So, Vicky goes to a gypsy witch who convinces her she must make a pact with Satan in order to cast an effective love spell on Ricardo. After Vicky gives her body and soul to the Dark One, she engages with Ricardo in a passionate night of lovemaking that is cut short by Satan, who, sensing that Ricardo has not completely fallen under the spell, orders Vicky to kill him. Following Ricardo''s death, his brother Carlos is haunted by nightmares of the dead sibling, who appears and takes possession of Carlos in order to get his revenge on Vicky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9r2tx5FksgeCTr5JCiOVqN8gaN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107058'),
  ('379455009872897895', 'Cavafy', 1996, 'Drama', 'Yannis Smaragdis, Nikos Smaragdis', 'Dimitris Nollas, Stelios Rogakos, Dimitris Katalifos', 'Dimitris Katalifos, Vasilis Diamantopoulos, Maya Lyberopoulou, Lazaros Georgakopoulos, Fotis Sergoulopoulos, Lakis Lazopoulos, Zannino, Mirto Alikaki', null, 'An ailing, elderly poet reminisces about his life of unrest and homosexual urges.', 'An ailing, elderly poet reminisces about his life of unrest and homosexual urges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Asel8MPvOwYUDps5JV4SP55f44z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251361'),
  ('109059176022403058', 'Cavalcade', 1933, 'Drama, War', 'Frank Lloyd, Louis De Francesco, William Tummel', 'Reginald Berkeley, Noël Coward', 'Diana Wynyard, Clive Brook, Una O''Connor, Herbert Mundin, Beryl Mercer, Irene Browne, Tempe Pigott, Merle Tottenham', null, 'A cavalcade of English life from New Year''s Eve 1899 until 1933 is seen through the eyes of well-to-do Londoners Jane and Robert Marryot. Amongst events touching their family are the Boer War, the death of Queen Victoria, the sinking of the Titanic, and the Great War.', 'A cavalcade of English life from New Year''s Eve 1899 until 1933 is seen through the eyes of well-to-do Londoners Jane and Robert Marryot. Amongst events touching their family are the Boer War, the death of Queen Victoria, the sinking of the Titanic, and the Great War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6yld4HmB49b9CP9wmv3wcwk65K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56164'),
  ('826781191068604727', 'Cavalcade', 2005, 'Drama', 'Steve Suissa, Christophe Offenstein, Florent Ricci', 'Lisa Azuelos, Laurent Chalumeau, Steve Suissa', 'Titoff, Marion Cotillard, Richard Bohringer, Bérénice Bejo, Laurent Bateau, Vincent Martinez, Bruno Todeschini, Stéphan Guérin-Tillié', null, 'Leo, an accomplished playboy, neglects his girlfriend and enjoys parties. His girlfriend parts from him and then, when he wants to see her once more, he suffers an accident. He survives, but his whole life is about to change when he becomes wheelchair-bound.', 'Leo, an accomplished playboy, neglects his girlfriend and enjoys parties. His girlfriend parts from him and then, when he wants to see her once more, he suffers an accident. He survives, but his whole life is about to change when he becomes wheelchair-bound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLLSkXJ0qXqV1wdBveT7fitRl4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39192'),
  ('252436527483867002', 'Cavalcade of Dance', 1943, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jean Negulesco, Ernest Haller', null, 'Veloz, Yolanda, Art Gilmore', null, 'Ballroom dancers Veloz and Yolanda perform the various dance fads of the first half of the twentieth century.', 'Ballroom dancers Veloz and Yolanda perform the various dance fads of the first half of the twentieth century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GnPSrQSqcNeJptDvSTE5PnYv9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236875'),
  ('458094085605844805', 'Cavalli', 2011, 'Drama', 'Michele Rho, Andrea Locatelli', 'Francesco Ghiaccio, Michele Rho', 'Vinicio Marchioni, Michele Alhaique, Giulia Michelini, Duccio Camerini, Luigi Fedele, Francesco Fedele, Cesare Apolito, Fausto Maria Sciarappa', null, 'At the end of the 19th century, in a small village in the Apennines, in a house lost in the middle of a valley, live Alessandro and Pietro, two very different but very close brothers. The two children, aged eleven and thirteen, carefree and full of energy, live like two wild animals, always getting into trouble and spending their days racing carts, diving into the river, and stealing from the cellar. When their mother dies, their father sells his last possessions to buy his sons two beautiful, untamed foals, Baio and Sauro. As adults, while Alessandro feels a growing desire to cross the mountains and go far away, Pietro wants to become a breeder and live with Veronica, the girl he loves.', 'At the end of the 19th century, in a small village in the Apennines, in a house lost in the middle of a valley, live Alessandro and Pietro, two very different but very close brothers. The two children, aged eleven and thirteen, carefree and full of energy, live like two wild animals, always getting into trouble and spending their days racing carts, diving into the river, and stealing from the cellar. When their mother dies, their father sells his last possessions to buy his sons two beautiful, untamed foals, Baio and Sauro. As adults, while Alessandro feels a growing desire to cross the mountains and go far away, Pietro wants to become a breeder and live with Veronica, the girl he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtqlSbMYG4DtC8nC6eSUSWz0JBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75798'),
  ('760666119254690419', 'Cave', 2016, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken, Oskar Dahlsbakken', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken', 'Heidi Toini, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Benjamin Helstad, Ingar Helge Gimle', null, 'A group of former military elites set out to explore an uncharted abyss, not knowing their worst nightmare is waiting for them deep beneath the ground.', 'A group of former military elites set out to explore an uncharted abyss, not knowing their worst nightmare is waiting for them deep beneath the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RbStTnnZCDKLNqf9iPNbOBf1Bn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410118'),
  ('1087664943821386759', 'Cave of Forgotten Dreams', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog, Judith Thurman', 'Werner Herzog, Dominique Baffier, Jean Clottes, Jean-Michel Geneste, Michel Philippe, Gilles Tosello, Carole Fritz, Maria Malina', 'G', 'Werner Herzog gains exclusive access to film inside the Chauvet caves of Southern France, capturing the oldest known pictorial creations of humankind in their astonishing natural setting.', 'Werner Herzog gains exclusive access to film inside the Chauvet caves of Southern France, capturing the oldest known pictorial creations of humankind in their astonishing natural setting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qBfQ2x3FnbB7uRaHQOBjfWFBpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59490'),
  ('406178653376642459', 'Cave of Outlaws', 1951, 'Western', 'William Castle, Joseph Gershenson, Irving Glassberg', 'Elizabeth Wilson', 'Macdonald Carey, Alexis Smith, Edgar Buchanan, Victor Jory, Hugh O''Brian, Houseley Stevenson, Hugh Sanders, Raymond Bond', 'NR', 'Having served a prison sentence for robbery, Pete Carver decides to go back for the hidden loot. But someone is on his trail.', 'Having served a prison sentence for robbery, Pete Carver decides to go back for the hidden loot. But someone is on his trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6cuV5J7las4CbCHZnnE7icKmOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129047'),
  ('190202876786017161', 'Cave of the Living Dead', 1964, 'Horror', 'Ákos Ráthonyi, Hrvoje Šarić', 'Kurt Roecken', 'Adrian Hoven, Erika Remberg, Wolfgang Preiss, Karin Field, Carl Möhner, Emmerich Schrenk, John Kitzmiller, Laci Cigoj', null, 'The German police cannot solve the mystery of the seven murders which have alarmed the local villagers. They call in Inspector Doren of Interpol, and the only clue the Chief Constable can give the detective is the fact that, each time a murder was committed, the electric lights in the whole neighborhood went out. The locals believe that the killings of the young girls are linked to the vague shadows in the caves under the local castle and to the mysterious Curse of the Green Eyes.', 'The German police cannot solve the mystery of the seven murders which have alarmed the local villagers. They call in Inspector Doren of Interpol, and the only clue the Chief Constable can give the detective is the fact that, each time a murder was committed, the electric lights in the whole neighborhood went out. The locals believe that the killings of the young girls are linked to the vague shadows in the caves under the local castle and to the mysterious Curse of the Green Eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXcGDa72HvsO5jHxGh4BeWLuEpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27708'),
  ('51772397507828907', 'Cave of the Sharks', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tonino Ricci, Juan Jurado, Blasco Giurato', 'Mauricio Melchiorre, Tonino Ricci, Fernando Galiana', 'Andrés García, Janet Ågren, Arthur Kennedy, Pino Colizzi, Máximo Valverde, Cinzia Monreale, Adriana Falco, Óscar Álvarez', null, 'When Andres and his partner are hired to recover some valuables from an airplane that went down in the Bermuda Triangle, they face not only human treachery but also the mysterious powers of an underwater civilization.', 'When Andres and his partner are hired to recover some valuables from an airplane that went down in the Bermuda Triangle, they face not only human treachery but also the mysterious powers of an underwater civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIzU1LjArriHn5uR4TABgqIml7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259075'),
  ('524389075131013806', 'Caveat', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Damian McCarthy, Kieran Fitzgerald', 'Damian McCarthy', 'Jonathan French, Leila Sykes, Ben Caplan, Conor Dwane, Inma Pavon', 'NR', 'A lone drifter suffering from partial memory loss accepts a job to look after a psychologically troubled woman in an abandoned house on an isolated island.', 'A lone drifter suffering from partial memory loss accepts a job to look after a psychologically troubled woman in an abandoned house on an isolated island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbug05AceVU8PMXIONDFxMRtq54.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744746'),
  ('100235695337674588', 'Caved In: Prehistoric Terror', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Richard Pepin, Aaron Walters, Irina Bryson', 'Neil Elman', 'Christopher Atkins, Colm Meaney, Angela Featherstone, Monica Bîrlădeanu, David Palffy, Chelan Simmons, Stevie Mitchell, Marius Chivu', 'R', 'An extreme adventure tour group headed by deep caving expert John Palmer descends into a 2000 Ft abandoned salt mine , that was mysteriously closed down years ago after an unexplained disaster trapped all of the miners . They prepare for rock slides , blackouts , cave-ins - whatever might threaten their journey and commence their descent into the depths.', 'An extreme adventure tour group headed by deep caving expert John Palmer descends into a 2000 Ft abandoned salt mine , that was mysteriously closed down years ago after an unexplained disaster trapped all of the miners . They prepare for rock slides , blackouts , cave-ins - whatever might threaten their journey and commence their descent into the depths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zY49mkhLBBVYuHN6EMIpyP23ddz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36622'),
  ('474426560055720555', 'Cavegirl', 1985, 'Comedy', 'David Oliver Pfeil, Jack Isgro, David Oliver Pfeil', 'David Oliver Pfeil', 'Daniel Roebuck, Cynthia Thompson, Darren Young, Saba Moor-Doucette, Jeff Chayette, Charles Mitchell, Cynthia Rullo, Tom Hamil', 'R', 'On a class excursion to a cave with stone age paintings the clumsy Rex gets lost. A mysterious crystal opens a gateway in time and sets him back to the stone ages, where he meets a group of prehistoric fellows and the gorgeous Eba. While teaching her English and doing some pseudo-research on her fellows, his main goal is to get her sleeping with him. However the curiosity of the clan chief disturbs his attempts.', 'On a class excursion to a cave with stone age paintings the clumsy Rex gets lost. A mysterious crystal opens a gateway in time and sets him back to the stone ages, where he meets a group of prehistoric fellows and the gorgeous Eba. While teaching her English and doing some pseudo-research on her fellows, his main goal is to get her sleeping with him. However the curiosity of the clan chief disturbs his attempts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kONbgktPKsm3EMj3MiES0IP8BRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30723'),
  ('55672738392751756', 'Caveman', 1981, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Alan Hume, Carl Gottlieb, Mario Cisneros', 'Rudy De Luca, Carl Gottlieb', 'Ringo Starr, Dennis Quaid, Shelley Long, Jack Gilford, Barbara Bach, Carl Lumbly, John Matuszak, Avery Schreiber', 'PG', 'Disgraced and cast out of his tribe for lusting after Lana, the mate of the tribe''s head muscle man, Atouk stumbles along gathering other misfits and learning a bit about the world outside of his cave. Eventually he and friends Lar and Tala learn the secrets of fire, cooked meat, and how to defend themselves from the brutal, yet very stupid dinosaurs.', 'Disgraced and cast out of his tribe for lusting after Lana, the mate of the tribe''s head muscle man, Atouk stumbles along gathering other misfits and learning a bit about the world outside of his cave. Eventually he and friends Lar and Tala learn the secrets of fire, cooked meat, and how to defend themselves from the brutal, yet very stupid dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfZfl3wxO8QxHKJsiWUHZg1D62B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18905'),
  ('484180228893268358', 'Caveman', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Laura Lackmann, Daniela Tolkien, Pascal Schmit', 'Simon Hauschild', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Jürgen Vogel, Laura Tonke, Martina Hill, Esther Schweins, Meikel Engelmann, Jochen Matschke', null, 'Robert Müller has wanted to be a comedian since he was a kid, but he''s only made it as a car salesman so far. This is about to change when he takes part in an open-mic show. He puts the program together with his imaginary friend, the stone-age Caveman. Then his girlfriend Claudia breaks up with him...', 'Robert Müller has wanted to be a comedian since he was a kid, but he''s only made it as a car salesman so far. This is about to change when he takes part in an open-mic show. He puts the program together with his imaginary friend, the stone-age Caveman. Then his girlfriend Claudia breaks up with him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czkgx6O4rOrtgzAf7yWxO7e703L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899946'),
  ('108707875892736073', 'Cavemen', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Herschel Faber', 'Herschel Faber', 'Skylar Astin, Camilla Belle, Chad Michael Murray, Dayo Okeniyi, Alexis Knapp, Kenny Wormald, Jason Patric, Amanda Jane Cooper', 'R', 'A Los Angeles playboy decides to give up his partying ways and find true love.', 'A Los Angeles playboy decides to give up his partying ways and find true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjHzJuERChMzXUvc05WmHkf0PKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192345'),
  ('55752177655925405', 'Caviar', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Elena Tikhonova', 'Elena Tikhonova, Robert Buchschwenter', 'Margarita Breitkreiz, Daria Nosik, Sabrina Reiter, Georg Friedrich, Simon Schwarz, Mikhail Evlanov, Joseph Lorenz, Robert Finster', null, 'Russian Oligarch Igor is as rich as he is extravagant: He plans to build his brand new villa right on a world famous and preserved bridge in the middle of Vienna! To bribe all the politicians, he needs the help of his interpreter Nadja. But Nadja has her own idea of what to do with all the bribe money.', 'Russian Oligarch Igor is as rich as he is extravagant: He plans to build his brand new villa right on a world famous and preserved bridge in the middle of Vienna! To bribe all the politicians, he needs the help of his interpreter Nadja. But Nadja has her own idea of what to do with all the bribe money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qubVRc6raxGS8s2YtXamMtSLFuC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571028'),
  ('502694348944856584', 'Cazador, la película', 2019, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Georgina Zanardi, Marcelo Leguiza, Daniel Zapata', 'Jorge Lucas, Claudio Ramírez', 'Luis María Montanari, Germán Baudino, Pablo Pinto, Julio César Pierangeli, Claudio Ramírez, Robertino Pann, Paul Divano, Laura Vanesa Masso', null, 'Melkor is a rebellious demon who choses Buenos Aires to turn it into his personal hell by unleashing a demonic invasion. Zombies and demons walk the earth. All is chaos, fire, and death. The only one capable of stopping the hordes of the underworld is Cazador, but he only seems interested in drinking, eating, and fucking. To spark his interest the key will be Bussi the bear, his favorite plush toy. Based on the 90s comic.', 'Melkor is a rebellious demon who choses Buenos Aires to turn it into his personal hell by unleashing a demonic invasion. Zombies and demons walk the earth. All is chaos, fire, and death. The only one capable of stopping the hordes of the underworld is Cazador, but he only seems interested in drinking, eating, and fucking. To spark his interest the key will be Bussi the bear, his favorite plush toy. Based on the 90s comic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6PKWyeok28weD3Cjme2FIy6Rey.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647260'),
  ('110782790179475652', 'Cazadora', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Martín Duplaquet, Werner Giesen, Romina Nuñez', 'Valeria Hofmann, Antonio Luco', 'Natalia Reddersen, Willy Semler, Alexandra Von Hummel, Felipe Valenzuela', null, 'In a dystopian future, a mother and her teenage son go hunting in the mountains and encounter a stranger who threatens to upend their relationship.', 'In a dystopian future, a mother and her teenage son go hunting in the mountains and encounter a stranger who threatens to upend their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QxCd3pSSrj6QqaG4fkNkaJmUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076605'),
