  ('81984980672203584', 'Cazuza: Time Doesn''t Stop', 2004, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Walter Carvalho, Sandra Werneck, Walter Carvalho', 'Fernando Bonassi, Victor Navas', 'Daniel de Oliveira, Marieta Severo, Reginaldo Faria, Emílio de Mello, Cadu Fávero, Dudu Azevedo, Arlindo Lopes, André Pfeffer', null, 'Inspired by the moving book “Só as Mães São Felizes”, by Lucinha Araújo, Cazuza''s mother, the film covers a little more than 10 years of the singer’s crazy and brief life – from the beginning of his career in the Circo Voador venue, in 1981, to the huge success and the apotheosis of his shows with the Barão Vermelho band, his solo career, his relations with his parents, friends, lovers and passions, and the courage he had to face his final years, with HIV, until his death, in 1990.', 'Inspired by the moving book “Só as Mães São Felizes”, by Lucinha Araújo, Cazuza''s mother, the film covers a little more than 10 years of the singer’s crazy and brief life – from the beginning of his career in the Circo Voador venue, in 1981, to the huge success and the apotheosis of his shows with the Barão Vermelho band, his solo career, his relations with his parents, friends, lovers and passions, and the courage he had to face his final years, with HIV, until his death, in 1990.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5D3vujJhxAl5Kyvfkr6Hfg7YPpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59474'),
  ('967306359102971909', 'CB4', 1993, 'Comedy, Music', 'Tamra Davis, Karl Walter Lindenlaub', 'Chris Rock, Robert LoCash, Nelson George', 'Chris Rock, Allen Payne, Deezer D, Chris Elliott, Phil Hartman, Charlie Murphy, Khandi Alexander, Art Evans', 'R', 'A "rockumentary", covering the rise to fame of MC Gusto, Stab Master Arson, and Dead Mike: members of the rap group "CB4". We soon learn that these three are not what they seem and don''t appear to know as much about rap music as they claim... but a lack of musical ability in an artist never hurts sales, does it? You''ve just got to play the part of a rap star...', 'A "rockumentary", covering the rise to fame of MC Gusto, Stab Master Arson, and Dead Mike: members of the rap group "CB4". We soon learn that these three are not what they seem and don''t appear to know as much about rap music as they claim... but a lack of musical ability in an artist never hurts sales, does it? You''ve just got to play the part of a rap star...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bP66TCKWPTsiER72xgyKUsjg82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15278'),
  ('560245618173360420', 'CBGB', 2013, 'Drama, Music', 'Randall Miller, Mike Ozier', 'Jody Savin, Randall Miller', 'Alan Rickman, Rupert Grint, Malin Åkerman, Johnny Galecki, Stana Katic, Ashley Greene, Justin Bartha, Ryan Hurst', 'R', 'A look at New York''s dynamic punk rock scene through the lens of the ground-breaking Lower East Side club started by eccentric Hilly Kristal in 1973 which launched thousands of bands.', 'A look at New York''s dynamic punk rock scene through the lens of the ground-breaking Lower East Side club started by eccentric Hilly Kristal in 1973 which launched thousands of bands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xHdRPamTjLG4bosURJju6UYCHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111479'),
