  ('714792188236006067', 'Ceasefire', 2017, 'Drama', 'Yann Maritaud, Emmanuel Courcol, Tom Stern', 'Emmanuel Courcol', 'Romain Duris, Céline Sallette, Julie-Marie Parmentier, Grégory Gadebois, Yvon Martin, Wabinlé Nabié, Morwenna Spagnol, Thibault Pinson', null, 'In the early 1920s, Georges Laffont, traumatized by the horrific trench warfare, decides to leave his life behind and travel to West Africa. In the vast territories of Upper Volta he - with the help of Diofo, artist and also survivor of the Great War - try to recruit the villagers as labor for plantations in Ghana. But his adventure leads him to a dead-end, and he comes back to Paris desperate to find his place in the world.', 'In the early 1920s, Georges Laffont, traumatized by the horrific trench warfare, decides to leave his life behind and travel to West Africa. In the vast territories of Upper Volta he - with the help of Diofo, artist and also survivor of the Great War - try to recruit the villagers as labor for plantations in Ghana. But his adventure leads him to a dead-end, and he comes back to Paris desperate to find his place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZW5XxyoWS03gEguz3dENEJWijk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407201'),
  ('1025608179436228855', 'Cebimde Kelimeler', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', null, 'When it comes to stand-up comedy, one of the first names that comes to mind is Yılmaz Erdoğan, who recounts scenes from his own life and discusses current issues in the country with his usual mastery. In his own words, he "fills his pockets with words" and leaves his audience in stitches.', 'When it comes to stand-up comedy, one of the first names that comes to mind is Yılmaz Erdoğan, who recounts scenes from his own life and discusses current issues in the country with his usual mastery. In his own words, he "fills his pockets with words" and leaves his audience in stitches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcyhBnsEjvh9Juussj6XZpDHL1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205050'),
  ('555128156077002205', 'Cecelia Ahern: Zwischen Himmel und hier', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Karen', 'Stephanie Sycholt, Cecelia Ahern', 'Yvonne Catterfeld, Sebastian Ströbel, Lisa Kreuzer, Julia Richter, Manuel Witting, Marion Mitterhammer, Antje Schmidt, Stuart Dunne', null, 'Young Amelia learns from her mother Magda that she was adopted as a baby. Her biological parents are from Ireland. When Magda dies of a heart attack shortly afterwards, Amelia feels that nothing is keeping her in Germany anymore. She leaves the bookshop she inherited and her bewildered fiancé and sets off headlong to find her real family on the Emerald Isle. Upon arriving in Ireland, something magical happens to the young woman. Amelia follows the mysterious clues. This leads her to meet the attractive private detective Bobby.', 'Young Amelia learns from her mother Magda that she was adopted as a baby. Her biological parents are from Ireland. When Magda dies of a heart attack shortly afterwards, Amelia feels that nothing is keeping her in Germany anymore. She leaves the bookshop she inherited and her bewildered fiancé and sets off headlong to find her real family on the Emerald Isle. Upon arriving in Ireland, something magical happens to the young woman. Amelia follows the mysterious clues. This leads her to meet the attractive private detective Bobby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWVonJaYNGoRLW3QiYvzRYCG8Iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280831'),
  ('619220409868882444', 'Cecil', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Arthur Cary, Johann Perry', null, null, 'R', 'The 2015 killing of Cecil, Zimbabwe''s famous black-maned lion, by US dentist Walter Palmer ignited global debate on trophy hunting, conservation, colonialism, and tourism''s impact on local communities.', 'The 2015 killing of Cecil, Zimbabwe''s famous black-maned lion, by US dentist Walter Palmer ignited global debate on trophy hunting, conservation, colonialism, and tourism''s impact on local communities.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F84ImrPWMsieyIRO1PfX9TMmMFKK.jpg', 'plex:movie:cecil-2026'),
