  ('96583522194370782', 'Cecilia', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Olivier Mathot, Raymond Heil', 'Jesús Franco', 'Muriel Montossé, Antonio Mayans, Antonio de Cabo, Olivier Mathot, Lina Romay, France Lomay, Ana Paula, Richard Darbois', 'NR', 'After repeatedly flaunting her peerless body to her servants, snobbish aristocrat Cecilia becomes the victim of rape. But the experience triggers a carnal awakening, full of socialite sex parties and woodland orgies. And before long, Cecilia finds her amorous adventures spinning out of control, particularly when her husband decides to join in on the free-love lifestyle.', 'After repeatedly flaunting her peerless body to her servants, snobbish aristocrat Cecilia becomes the victim of rape. But the experience triggers a carnal awakening, full of socialite sex parties and woodland orgies. And before long, Cecilia finds her amorous adventures spinning out of control, particularly when her husband decides to join in on the free-love lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrwva7qemUt9v9w9502aVHaiOJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90104'),
  ('682808387603885359', 'Cedar Rapids', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Miguel Arteta, Scott August, Richard L. Fox', 'Phil Johnston', 'Ed Helms, John C. Reilly, Anne Heche, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Stephen Root, Kurtwood Smith, Alia Shawkat, Thomas Lennon', 'R', 'A naive Midwesterner insurance salesman travels to a big-city convention in an effort to save the jobs of his co-workers.', 'A naive Midwesterner insurance salesman travels to a big-city convention in an effort to save the jobs of his co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udHprtPPfDHdcR1ijoY24mt9OB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52067'),
  ('636981315800922116', 'Ceddo', 1978, 'Drama', 'Ousmane Sembène, Georges Carestan', 'Ousmane Sembène', 'Mamadou Dioumé, Ousmane Sembène, Tabata Ndiaye, Moustapha Yade, Ismaila Diagne, Matoura Dia, Omar Gueye, Nar Modou', null, 'The Ceddo people try to preserve their traditional African culture against the onslaught of Islam, Christianity, and the slave trade. When King Demba War sides with the Muslims, the Ceddo kidnap his daughter, Princess Dior Yacine, to protest their forcible conversion to Islam.', 'The Ceddo people try to preserve their traditional African culture against the onslaught of Islam, Christianity, and the slave trade. When King Demba War sides with the Muslims, the Ceddo kidnap his daughter, Princess Dior Yacine, to protest their forcible conversion to Islam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etYZJDjlFDFWEl57RiurNUiqwXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97029'),
  ('384570540144672035', 'Cefalonia', 2005, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Stefano Ricciotti, Riccardo Milani', 'Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia', 'Luca Zingaretti, Luisa Ranieri, Corrado Fortuna, Jasmine Trinca, Claudio Gioè, Claudio Amendola, Antonio Milo, Flavio Pistilli', null, 'Cefalonia tells the real story about what happened in September 1943 on the Greek island of Kefalonia (Cefalonia in Italian), when the 12,000 men in the Italian 33rd Acqui Infantry Division, following Italy''s surrender to the Allied, refused to put themselves under German command and also refused to surrender their weapons. The local German force, supported by Stuka dive-bombers and additional troops, attacked the Italians and after several days of combat the Italians surrendered, having lost 1,300 men. As punishment, the German High Command ordered that all surviving Italians should be executed. Some 5,000 were executed during a week of killings. A handful were rescued by locals and the Greek guerrilla, while the rest were shipped off as prisoners, whereof 3,000 drowned when their ships hit mines. The film "Captain Corelli''s Mandolin" is based on a novel about the Italian occupation of Cefalonia, but the massacre was much toned down in the Hollywood version.', 'Cefalonia tells the real story about what happened in September 1943 on the Greek island of Kefalonia (Cefalonia in Italian), when the 12,000 men in the Italian 33rd Acqui Infantry Division, following Italy''s surrender to the Allied, refused to put themselves under German command and also refused to surrender their weapons. The local German force, supported by Stuka dive-bombers and additional troops, attacked the Italians and after several days of combat the Italians surrendered, having lost 1,300 men. As punishment, the German High Command ordered that all surviving Italians should be executed. Some 5,000 were executed during a week of killings. A handful were rescued by locals and the Greek guerrilla, while the rest were shipped off as prisoners, whereof 3,000 drowned when their ships hit mines. The film "Captain Corelli''s Mandolin" is based on a novel about the Italian occupation of Cefalonia, but the massacre was much toned down in the Hollywood version.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM2NHCBUmVp4RYDWWLWeGEca8zW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116477'),
  ('742561902854931562', 'Ceiling Zero', 1936, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Howard Hawks, Arthur Edeson', 'Frank Wead', 'James Cagney, Pat O''Brien, June Travis, Stuart Erwin, Barton MacLane, Henry Wadsworth, Isabel Jewell, Martha Tibbetts', 'NR', 'War veteran pilots Dizzy Davis, Texas Clark and Jake Lee are working in an airline. Dizzy is fooling with one of the younger pilot''s girl-friend and due to this he changes flights with Texas.', 'War veteran pilots Dizzy Davis, Texas Clark and Jake Lee are working in an airline. Dizzy is fooling with one of the younger pilot''s girl-friend and due to this he changes flights with Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUsasw5UCRbebpD8wk6S0z4C1Ll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84208'),
  ('67812378401171101', 'Celal and Ceren', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Togan Gökbakar, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Şahan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Ezgi Mola, Gökçen Gökçebağ, Dilşah Demir, Timur Kunt, Destan Batmaz', null, 'Celal, who dreams of achieving happiness as a ladies'' man and charmer, soon gets into difficulties and suffers misfortune. Back when Celal was in a relationship, he was jealous of the life of a bachelor.', 'Celal, who dreams of achieving happiness as a ladies'' man and charmer, soon gets into difficulties and suffers misfortune. Back when Celal was in a relationship, he was jealous of the life of a bachelor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBgd9qbZDIx1BzvapdCminIgkSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161808'),
  ('1053116240595104220', 'Celebrity', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Woody Allen, Sven Nykvist, Lisa M. Rowe', 'Woody Allen', 'Hank Azaria, Kenneth Branagh, Judy Davis, Leonardo DiCaprio, Melanie Griffith, Famke Janssen, Michael Lerner, Joe Mantegna', null, 'The career and personal life of writer Lee are at a standstill, so he divorces his bashful wife, Robin, and dives into a new job as an entertainment journalist. His assignments take him to the swankiest corners of Manhattan, but as he jumps from one lavish party to another and engages in numerous empty romances, he starts to doubt the worth of his work. Meanwhile, top TV producer Tony falls for Robin and introduces her to the world of celebrity.', 'The career and personal life of writer Lee are at a standstill, so he divorces his bashful wife, Robin, and dives into a new job as an entertainment journalist. His assignments take him to the swankiest corners of Manhattan, but as he jumps from one lavish party to another and engages in numerous empty romances, he starts to doubt the worth of his work. Meanwhile, top TV producer Tony falls for Robin and introduces her to the world of celebrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4UJHtH14nO8tbMfGtJ3Z3Tw5RW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9466'),
  ('465256394734131714', 'Celebrity Sex Tape', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Scott D. Wheeler, Scott D. Wheeler, Jack Jenkins', 'Jonathan Haug, Patrick Sheehan, Matt Short', 'Jack Cullison, Jonathan Brett, Colbert Alembert, Howard Cai, Andre Meadows, Julie Barzman, Alex Arleo, Jenny Lin', 'NR', 'A group of college nerds secretly record a washed up celebrity having sex and post the tape on the internet. When the publicity revives the actress''s career, every B-list celebrity, reality show reject, and celebutante in Hollywood want to star in the guys next "production."', 'A group of college nerds secretly record a washed up celebrity having sex and post the tape on the internet. When the publicity revives the actress''s career, every B-list celebrity, reality show reject, and celebutante in Hollywood want to star in the guys next "production."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FWSUD1yIvGPmLIXgyOS72MrTrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87584'),
  ('13227947424113629', 'Celeste & Jesse Forever', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lee Toland Krieger, David Lanzenberg', 'Rashida Jones, Will McCormack', 'Rashida Jones, Andy Samberg, Ari Graynor, Eric Christian Olsen, Chris Messina, Emma Roberts, Elijah Wood, Rebecca Dayan', 'R', 'Celeste and Jesse met in high school and got married young. They laugh at the same jokes and finish each other’s sentences. They are forever linked in their friends’ minds as the perfect couple – she, a high-powered businesswoman and budding novelist; he, a free spirit who keeps things from getting boring. Their only problem is that they have decided to get divorced. Can their perfect relationship withstand this minor setback?', 'Celeste and Jesse met in high school and got married young. They laugh at the same jokes and finish each other’s sentences. They are forever linked in their friends’ minds as the perfect couple – she, a high-powered businesswoman and budding novelist; he, a free spirit who keeps things from getting boring. Their only problem is that they have decided to get divorced. Can their perfect relationship withstand this minor setback?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Cr8kW7DjZEORU8jI32bqyHSGKW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84184'),
  ('382034950212485815', 'Celeste... no es un color', 1993, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Víctor Andrés Catena', 'Roberto Romero', 'Lina Morgan, Marisol Ayuso, Antonio Caro, Luis Perezagua, José Cela, Paloma Rodríguez', null, 'Celeste, who was abandoned by her fiancé on her wedding day, receives help from a celestial being. The intervention of this being changes everything and her problems are fixed by returning to enjoy what she had. Great, Lina Morgan playing Celeste and the 427. The 427 is an angel who needs to pass a test to ascend, for this she is sent to earth to help Celeste. Celeste, who lives with her friend Marga, who has no job, was abandoned on her wedding day by her husband. The 427 will help her reunite with love and more.', 'Celeste, who was abandoned by her fiancé on her wedding day, receives help from a celestial being. The intervention of this being changes everything and her problems are fixed by returning to enjoy what she had. Great, Lina Morgan playing Celeste and the 427. The 427 is an angel who needs to pass a test to ascend, for this she is sent to earth to help Celeste. Celeste, who lives with her friend Marga, who has no job, was abandoned on her wedding day by her husband. The 427 will help her reunite with love and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ALjVfMLtSDaDFQ8dSHqFVjsczZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69028'),
  ('979142222962341463', 'Celestina: Burlesk Dancer', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mac Alejandre', 'Mac Alejandre, Ricardo Lee', 'Yen Renee Durano, Christine Bermas, Sid Lucero, Arron Villaflor, Allan Paule, Aiko Garcia, Angie Castrence', null, 'Set in the Philippines during the 1940''s, Celestina is a story about a woman, a burlesk dancer, who struggles to provide for her family while her husband is a gambling and womanizing drunkard. Despite the hardships, Celestina perseveres and finds strength in her love for her son.', 'Set in the Philippines during the 1940''s, Celestina is a story about a woman, a burlesk dancer, who struggles to provide for her family while her husband is a gambling and womanizing drunkard. Despite the hardships, Celestina perseveres and finds strength in her love for her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxhDZP6ddPNHcenrhz6CDxjxQg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1396888'),
  ('32398186137885162', 'Celestine', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Jesús Franco, Étienne Rosenfeld, Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco, Nicole Guettard', 'Lina Romay, Olivier Mathot, Howard Vernon, Pamela Stanford, Monica Swinn, Richard Bigotini, Lynn Monteil, Anna Gladysek', null, 'The story opens with Celestine eluding arrest with a friend as the police raid a brothel. While hiding out in the hayloft of the Count de la Braquette''s estate, she meets the hayseed handyman Sébastien and the butler Malou, who reward her favors with the offer of employment. In a manner recalling Terence Stamp''s effect on the household in TEOREMA, Celestine''s open and relaxed attitude toward sexuality has a transformative effect on the isolated, moribund inhabitants of the mansion, imbuing them with gift of renewed life for the men and women alike, that remains even after a third act twist that forces her to betray them.', 'The story opens with Celestine eluding arrest with a friend as the police raid a brothel. While hiding out in the hayloft of the Count de la Braquette''s estate, she meets the hayseed handyman Sébastien and the butler Malou, who reward her favors with the offer of employment. In a manner recalling Terence Stamp''s effect on the household in TEOREMA, Celestine''s open and relaxed attitude toward sexuality has a transformative effect on the isolated, moribund inhabitants of the mansion, imbuing them with gift of renewed life for the men and women alike, that remains even after a third act twist that forces her to betray them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99MbbIjc3wTSeNKjvE1lqKIj3lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137607'),
  ('214024784741970077', 'Celia', 1989, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Ann Turner, Jaems Grant, Phil Jones', 'Ann Turner', 'Rebecca Smart, Nicholas Eadie, Mary-Anne Fahey, Victoria Longley, Margaret Ricketts, James Newman, Alexander Hutchinson, Adrian Mitchell', null, 'In 1950s Australia, young Celia is growing up with a sense of isolation and mistrust of the world that surrounds her. Her mother and father won''t let her play with the kids next door because their parents are communists. Then her pet bunny is taken away because of rabbit overpopulation. And, more traumatizing yet, when her grandmother dies, she''s the one to discover the corpse. To cope, she retreats into elaborate fantasies.', 'In 1950s Australia, young Celia is growing up with a sense of isolation and mistrust of the world that surrounds her. Her mother and father won''t let her play with the kids next door because their parents are communists. Then her pet bunny is taken away because of rabbit overpopulation. And, more traumatizing yet, when her grandmother dies, she''s the one to discover the corpse. To cope, she retreats into elaborate fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrhapMkOMjaX2sPGgAryxyH9S8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69141'),
  ('930386427589954156', 'Celia''s Lives', 2006, 'Drama', 'Antonio Chavarrías', 'Antonio Chavarrías', 'Nora Navas, Luis Tosar, Najwa Nimri, Aida Folch, Nausicaa Bonnín, Ximena Ayala', null, 'The night Celia unsuccessfully attempts suicide, a teenage girl (Melany) is raped and murdered nearby. Miguel Ángel, the police officer in charge of finding the perpetrator of the crime, digs around Celia and her closest circle, including her two sisters (Carmen and Ángela) and her husband Agustín. While the cop suspects about the girl''s boyfriend (Pedro), Celia suspects about her husband.', 'The night Celia unsuccessfully attempts suicide, a teenage girl (Melany) is raped and murdered nearby. Miguel Ángel, the police officer in charge of finding the perpetrator of the crime, digs around Celia and her closest circle, including her two sisters (Carmen and Ángela) and her husband Agustín. While the cop suspects about the girl''s boyfriend (Pedro), Celia suspects about her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJ5uBEsNkEJ4i0ZnUwFpid4eEWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82566'),
  ('259247984441232451', 'Céline', 1992, 'Drama', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, Romain Winding', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'Isabelle Pasco, María Luisa García, Danièle Lebrun, Daniel Tarrare, Damien Dutrait, Lucien Plazanet, Sébastien Lenfant, François Eychart', null, 'After the death of her father, 22-year-old Céline inherits most of his estate, but gives it to her stepmother, causing her greedy fiancé to leave her. Following several failed suicide attempts, Céline is hospitalized and comes to the attention of a nurse, Genevieve, who has struggled with depression. Under her personal care, Céline gradually recovers, and the two women grow close.', 'After the death of her father, 22-year-old Céline inherits most of his estate, but gives it to her stepmother, causing her greedy fiancé to leave her. Following several failed suicide attempts, Céline is hospitalized and comes to the attention of a nurse, Genevieve, who has struggled with depression. Under her personal care, Céline gradually recovers, and the two women grow close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipmmn3LMpZGG5Sgv7B4jXhO2hkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123348'),
  ('337406257051839477', 'Céline', 2008, 'Music, Drama', 'Jeff Woolnough', null, 'Christine Ghawi, Jodelle Ferland, Peter MacNeill, Louise Pitre, Mac Fyfe, Natalie Radford, Enrico Colantoni, Raymond Accolas', 'PG', 'A biopic on singer Céline Dion.', 'A biopic on singer Céline Dion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3y2mVE8QS0Xl4mZIMP6w1vC3FhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60988'),
  ('693664090934128351', 'Céline and Julie Go Boating', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jacques Rivette, Luc Béraud, Pascal Lemaitre', 'Marie-France Pisier, Juliet Berto, Eduardo de Gregorio', 'Juliet Berto, Dominique Labourier, Bulle Ogier, Marie-France Pisier, Barbet Schroeder, Nathalie Asnar, Marie-Thérèse Saussure, Philippe Clévenot', null, 'Julie, a daydreaming librarian, meets Céline, an enigmatic magician, and together they become the heroines of a time-warping adventure involving a haunted house, psychotropic candy, and a murder-mystery melodrama.', 'Julie, a daydreaming librarian, meets Céline, an enigmatic magician, and together they become the heroines of a time-warping adventure involving a haunted house, psychotropic candy, and a murder-mystery melodrama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijpehUwH4XFNFm8UcYHpRQVRQUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27019'),
  ('753487684337559161', 'Cell', 2016, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tod Williams, Michael Simmonds, Chip Signore', 'Adam Alleca, Stephen King', 'John Cusack, Samuel L. Jackson, Isabelle Fuhrman, Owen Teague, Clark Sarullo, Anthony Reynolds, Erin Elizabeth Burns, Stacy Keach', 'R', 'When a strange signal pulsates through all cell phone networks worldwide, it starts a murderous epidemic of epic proportions when users become bloodthirsty creatures, and a group of people in New England are among the survivors to deal with the ensuing chaos after.', 'When a strange signal pulsates through all cell phone networks worldwide, it starts a murderous epidemic of epic proportions when users become bloodthirsty creatures, and a group of people in New England are among the survivors to deal with the ensuing chaos after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5N6Pw3P6TqQnGcqiVkhO9u85KB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168098'),
  ('843939165769731138', 'Cell 211', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Daniel Monzón, Sergio Francisco, Carles Gusi', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Daniel Monzón', 'Alberto Ammann, Luis Tosar, Antonio Resines, Marta Etura, Manuel Morón, Carlos Bardem, Luis Zahera, Fernando Soto', null, 'The story of two men on different sides of a prison riot -- the inmate leading the rebellion and the young guard trapped in the revolt, who poses as a prisoner in a desperate attempt to survive the ordeal.', 'The story of two men on different sides of a prison riot -- the inmate leading the rebellion and the young guard trapped in the revolt, who poses as a prisoner in a desperate attempt to survive the ordeal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koap5B3bQHQi3yaZ39vpWR66TGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33273'),
  ('998718370951051277', 'Cell 213', 2011, 'Horror', 'Stephen Kay', 'Maninder Chana', 'Bruce Greenwood, Eric Balfour, Michael Rooker, Deborah Valente, Rob Ramsay', 'R', 'Cocky young attorney Michael Gray finds himself framed for murder when an inmate he is defending violently kills himself during their interview at South River State Penitentiary. Now locked in the same nightmarish Cell 213 where his client died, he soon realizes that unnatural forces are behind a string of inmate suicides, making matters of guilt and innocence not as cut and dry as they seem.', 'Cocky young attorney Michael Gray finds himself framed for murder when an inmate he is defending violently kills himself during their interview at South River State Penitentiary. Now locked in the same nightmarish Cell 213 where his client died, he soon realizes that unnatural forces are behind a string of inmate suicides, making matters of guilt and innocence not as cut and dry as they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D2T3mAjNc112JezL3GoFdImd0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289097'),
  ('768848573206710758', 'Cell 2455 Death Row', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fred Jackman Jr., Fred F. Sears, Eddie Saeta', 'Jack DeWitt', 'William Campbell, R. Wright Campbell , Marian Carr, Kathryn Grant, Vince Edwards, Allen Nourse, Diane DeLaire, Bart Braverman', 'NR', 'A Death Row inmate uses his prison law studies to fight for his life. Based on a true story.', 'A Death Row inmate uses his prison law studies to fight for his life. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuYoPN3a7jQsYfIvu0p5N41jJ50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33862'),
  ('382331621407931103', 'Cell Block Sisters: Banished Behind Bars', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Guido Verweyen, Henri Charr, Steven J. Corzan', 'Henri Charr, Robert Newcastle', 'Annie Wood, Gail Harris, Dean Howell, Jenna Bodnar, Sherwin Ace Ross, Jamie Donahue, Jasae, Red Horton', null, 'Sam Connor kidnaps his young daughters, April and May, sells them to strangers, and accidentally kills his wife when she attempts to intervene. Sixteen years later, April is an out of control outlaw who has come into a life of drugs and crime, while May has grown into a straight laced, refined woman. The plot thickens when April avenges her mother''s death by killing her father, and May is sent to jail as the prime suspect. Fortunately, Detective Arman, instantly taken with May, fights for her innocence and tries to get her out before she is taken down by other hostile prisoners.', 'Sam Connor kidnaps his young daughters, April and May, sells them to strangers, and accidentally kills his wife when she attempts to intervene. Sixteen years later, April is an out of control outlaw who has come into a life of drugs and crime, while May has grown into a straight laced, refined woman. The plot thickens when April avenges her mother''s death by killing her father, and May is sent to jail as the prime suspect. Fortunately, Detective Arman, instantly taken with May, fights for her innocence and tries to get her out before she is taken down by other hostile prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYqRlDo8l5eyF5mziBB74hzp4Ct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260326'),
  ('915057165193421803', 'Cell Phone', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Feng Xiaogang, Zhao Fei, Lao Yun', 'Liu Zhenyun', 'Ge You, Xu Fan, Zhang Guoli, Fan Bingbing, Zhang Lu, Yang Xin, Huang Suying, Zhao Kuie', null, 'Follows the story of a television host who''s hidden so much personal and secret information on his phone, that when it gets out, catastrophe strikes.', 'Follows the story of a television host who''s hidden so much personal and secret information on his phone, that when it gets out, catastrophe strikes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLdxjtu88sATLyT7qmqws22ditq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79064'),
