  ('483953704632204519', 'Cellar Dweller', 1988, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Sergio Salvati, John Carl Buechler, Serena Canevari', 'Don Mancini', 'Debrah Farentino, Yvonne De Carlo, Jeffrey Combs, Michael Deak, Brian Robbins, Pamela Bellwood, Miranda Wilson, Vince Edwards', 'R', 'A comic book artist Whitney Taylor is doomed to repeat history in a most grotesque way when she unleashes a demon after drawing it.', 'A comic book artist Whitney Taylor is doomed to repeat history in a most grotesque way when she unleashes a demon after drawing it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66v0nPMbT5GxlUVtthWVG9PdeUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58797'),
