  ('848317786610469109', 'Cemetery Gates', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Roy Knyrim', 'Brian Patrick O''Toole', 'Reggie Bannister, Peter Stickles, Nicole DuPort, Ky Evans, Aime Wolf, Kristin Novak, John Thomas, Chris Finch', null, 'When two ecologists break-in the laboratory of Dr. Belmont, they find a box with a subject and they decide to set the experiment free in the woods. During the transportation, the box opens and releases the mutant Tasmanian Devil that devours the two activists and escapes to the woods. Meanwhile, Dr. Belmont''s son Hunter travels in a van with four friends to film a horror movie in the cemetery in the woods, while Belmont and his associate Dr. Christine Kollar seek their deadly experiment called Precious.', 'When two ecologists break-in the laboratory of Dr. Belmont, they find a box with a subject and they decide to set the experiment free in the woods. During the transportation, the box opens and releases the mutant Tasmanian Devil that devours the two activists and escapes to the woods. Meanwhile, Dr. Belmont''s son Hunter travels in a van with four friends to film a horror movie in the cemetery in the woods, while Belmont and his associate Dr. Christine Kollar seek their deadly experiment called Precious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6aHjoxXeUKjC2pmu98X5SOAVyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39912'),
  ('299232211957379428', 'Cemetery High', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Gorman Bechard, Pati Martí Donoghue, Kristine Bechard', 'Gorman Bechard, Carmine Capobianco', 'Debi Thibeault, Karen Nielsen, Lisa Schmidt, Simone Reyes, Ruth Collins, Tony Kruk, David Coughlin, Frank Stewart', 'R', 'A group of High School girls with guns go on a killing spree. They are intent on ridding the world of scummy men.', 'A group of High School girls with guns go on a killing spree. They are intent on ridding the world of scummy men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCuuUhWFAGpAHtglbC3jjoYqANw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85172'),
  ('837727477027826061', 'Cemetery Junction', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Merchant, Ricky Gervais, Remi Adefarasin', 'Ricky Gervais, Stephen Merchant', 'Christian Cooke, Tom Hughes, Jack Doolan, Felicity Jones, Ralph Fiennes, Ricky Gervais, Emily Watson, Matthew Goode', 'R', 'In 1970s England, three blue-collar friends spend their days joking, drinking, fighting and chasing girls. Freddie wants to leave their working-class world but cool, charismatic Bruce and lovable loser Snork are happy with life the way it is. When Freddie gets a new job as a door-to-door salesman and bumps into his old school sweetheart Julie, the gang are forced to make choices that will change their lives for ever.', 'In 1970s England, three blue-collar friends spend their days joking, drinking, fighting and chasing girls. Freddie wants to leave their working-class world but cool, charismatic Bruce and lovable loser Snork are happy with life the way it is. When Freddie gets a new job as a door-to-door salesman and bumps into his old school sweetheart Julie, the gang are forced to make choices that will change their lives for ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fyzMdRX1kWd9UnceWc2Duh4eFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36801'),
  ('828257824412786768', 'Cemetery Man', 1994, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michele Soavi, Julie Gavras, Enrico Grassi', 'Gianni Romoli', 'Rupert Everett, François Hadji-Lazaro, Anna Falchi, Mickey Knox, Fabiana Formica, Clive Riche, Katja Anton, Barbara Cupisti', 'R', 'Francesco Dellamorte is the groundskeeper at a cemetery where the dead just won’t stay dead—and it’s up to him to deal with those who come back to life with a hunger for human flesh. But Dellamorte’s job soon becomes much more complicated when he falls for an enigmatic young woman whose husband has recently died.', 'Francesco Dellamorte is the groundskeeper at a cemetery where the dead just won’t stay dead—and it’s up to him to deal with those who come back to life with a hunger for human flesh. But Dellamorte’s job soon becomes much more complicated when he falls for an enigmatic young woman whose husband has recently died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cI5AV3jCuxmoQp0N7Z16SI2b7Xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21588'),
  ('834368288373185029', 'Cemetery of Lost Souls', 2020, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Rodrigo Aragão, Alexandre Barcelos', 'Rodrigo Aragão', 'Renato Chocair, Allana Lopes, Diego Garcias, Caio Macedo, Clarissa Pinheiro, Markus Konká, Carol Aragão, Roberto Rowntree', null, 'Corrupted by the power of Cipriano''s Black Book, a Jesuit and his followers begin a reign of horror in colonial Brazil, until they be cursed to live forever trapped under the graves of a cemetery. Now, centuries later, they are ready to break free and spread their evil all over the world.', 'Corrupted by the power of Cipriano''s Black Book, a Jesuit and his followers begin a reign of horror in colonial Brazil, until they be cursed to live forever trapped under the graves of a cemetery. Now, centuries later, they are ready to break free and spread their evil all over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziXXbtWaPuEE50kxT34exku7dyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680615'),
  ('793610189490121186', 'Cemetery of Splendor', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul, Diego García, Sompot Chidgasornpongse', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Jenjira Pongpas, Banlop Lomnoi, Jarinpattra Rueangram, Petcharat Chaiburi, Tawatchai Buawat, Sujittraporn Wongsrikeaw, Bhattaratorn Senkraigul, Sakda Kaewbuadee', 'NR', 'In a hospital, ten soldiers are being treated for a mysterious sleeping sickness. In a story in which dreams can be experienced by others, and in which goddesses can sit casually with mortals, a nurse learns the reason why the patients will never be cured, and forms a telepathic bond with one of them.', 'In a hospital, ten soldiers are being treated for a mysterious sleeping sickness. In a story in which dreams can be experienced by others, and in which goddesses can sit casually with mortals, a nurse learns the reason why the patients will never be cured, and forms a telepathic bond with one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pK5y82ISbaBWa87R5neub8qojDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298721'),
  ('93573528346890195', 'Cemetery of Terror', 1985, 'Horror', 'Rubén Galindo Jr., Rosalío Solano', 'Rubén Galindo Jr.', 'Hugo Stiglitz, Erika Buenfil, Edna Bolkan, María Rebeca, Usi Velasco, José Gómez Parcero, Leo Villanueva, Bety Robles', null, 'On Halloween night, a group of bored teens decide to steal a corpse from the local morgue and take it to a nearby cemetery where they perform a Satanic ritual, unwittingly reviving a bloodthirsty serial killer.', 'On Halloween night, a group of bored teens decide to steal a corpse from the local morgue and take it to a nearby cemetery where they perform a Satanic ritual, unwittingly reviving a bloodthirsty serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGwgyQ1hoDQpp6Yw2YCgWhMPWNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85002'),
  ('961203422372245213', 'Cemetery Without Crosses', 1969, 'Western', 'Robert Hossein, Henri Persin, Sergio Leone', 'Dario Argento, Robert Hossein, Claude Desailly', 'Robert Hossein, Michèle Mercier, Guido Lollobrigida, Daniele Vargas, Serge Marquand, Pierre Hatet, Philippe Baronnet, Pierre Collet', null, 'A melancholic gunfighter is drawn into a vengeful and tragic kidnapping plot by his widowed ex-lover.', 'A melancholic gunfighter is drawn into a vengeful and tragic kidnapping plot by his widowed ex-lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUJnuwDAAMLudOlVpYsjlNNQz6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20361'),
  ('127718059818486736', 'Cena di classe', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesco Mandelli, Massimo Schiavon', 'Roberto Lipari, Andrea Pisani, Ignazio Rosato', 'Francesco Mandelli, Andrea Pisani, Roberto Lipari, Nicola Nocella, Beatrice Arnera, Herbert Ballerina, Giulia Vecchio, Francesco Russo', null, 'A group of former high school classmates reunite after seventeen years for the funeral of an old friend. Aided by alcohol and a forgotten video, they sneak into their old school one night to relive the magic of that time. But a simple reunion quickly turns into a criminal adventure.', 'A group of former high school classmates reunite after seventeen years for the funeral of an old friend. Aided by alcohol and a forgotten video, they sneak into their old school one night to relive the magic of that time. But a simple reunion quickly turns into a criminal adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tq62SABP6986u7fYJ39vnexjgFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397373'),
  ('455439667560074887', 'Cencoroll', 2009, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Atsuya Uki', 'Atsuya Uki', 'Kana Hanazawa, Hiro Shimono, Ryohei Kimura, Satomi Moriya', null, 'A giant monster sends a town''s citizens into a panic, except for a girl named Yuki and her schoolmate Tetsu. Tetsu happens to have his own strange creature named Cenco as a pet. Another boy named Shuu controls the monster threatening the town, and the stage is set for a battle.', 'A giant monster sends a town''s citizens into a panic, except for a girl named Yuki and her schoolmate Tetsu. Tetsu happens to have his own strange creature named Cenco as a pet. Another boy named Shuu controls the monster threatening the town, and the stage is set for a battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1IeVdhsM3vnXjEfZr0kdilnttY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37928'),
  ('781680161847571362', 'Cencoroll Connect', 2019, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Atsuya Uki', 'Atsuya Uki', 'Hiro Shimono, Kana Hanazawa, Ryohei Kimura, Natsumi Takamori, Kenji Akabane, Satomi Moriya', null, 'Student Yuki has never seen one of the giant monsters she always hears about on the news and that threaten her city. But when she meets the lethargic Tetsu one day, things change suddenly. Because Tetsu moves around the houses with a creature called Cencoroll, which he can control with mind control and which can transform into a wide variety of objects. But not only Yuki is fascinated by Cencoroll: the boy Shu tries to take Cencoroll from Tetsu with the help of his own telepathy monster, whereupon the four engage in a bitter fight, in which Yuki also intervenes and the entire city is converted into a battle arena.', 'Student Yuki has never seen one of the giant monsters she always hears about on the news and that threaten her city. But when she meets the lethargic Tetsu one day, things change suddenly. Because Tetsu moves around the houses with a creature called Cencoroll, which he can control with mind control and which can transform into a wide variety of objects. But not only Yuki is fascinated by Cencoroll: the boy Shu tries to take Cencoroll from Tetsu with the help of his own telepathy monster, whereupon the four engage in a bitter fight, in which Yuki also intervenes and the entire city is converted into a battle arena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ayrhipQ6wETRZyixZW8UPKztEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539140'),
  ('960116184714811376', 'Cenizas del paraíso', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Marcelo Piñeyro, Miguel Cohan, Gabriel Arbós', 'Aída Bortnik, Marcelo Piñeyro', 'Héctor Alterio, Cecilia Roth, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Daniel Kuzniecka, Leticia Brédice, Nicolás Abeles, Jorge Marrale, Alejo Garcia Pintos', null, 'A judge falls from the roof of the Federal Courthouse. A woman is murdered. Between them and the three sons of the judge there is a connection that will be investigated by a woman judge who is determined to discover the truth.', 'A judge falls from the roof of the Federal Courthouse. A woman is murdered. Between them and the three sons of the judge there is a connection that will be investigated by a woman judge who is determined to discover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0r5mYcglrJ0GM4Gsb4liCZ3Fwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90171'),
  ('665245846761929627', 'Cenote', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Kaori Oda, Kaori Oda', 'Kaori Oda', 'Araceli del Rosario Chulim Tun, Juan de la Rosa Mibmay', null, 'Cenotes—sources of water that in ancient Mayan civilization were said to connect the real world and the afterlife. The past and present of the people living in and around them intersect, and distant memories echo throughout immersive scenes of light and darkness.', 'Cenotes—sources of water that in ancient Mayan civilization were said to connect the real world and the afterlife. The past and present of the people living in and around them intersect, and distant memories echo throughout immersive scenes of light and darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0u0sf9aiQc46vy1Tv8vjKollgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618510'),
  ('985509003544324666', 'Censor', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Annika Summerson, Prano Bailey-Bond, Paul Morris', 'Prano Bailey-Bond, Anthony Fletcher', 'Niamh Algar, Michael Smiley, Nicholas Burns, Vincent Franklin, Sophia La Porta, Adrian Schiller, Clare Holman, Andrew Havill', 'NR', 'A screener at the British Board of Film Classification (BBFC), who has earned an unsavory reputation for being the strictest censor of violent films, begins to spiral out of control after viewing a low-budget horror with similarities to the disappearance of her sister.', 'A screener at the British Board of Film Classification (BBFC), who has earned an unsavory reputation for being the strictest censor of violent films, begins to spiral out of control after viewing a low-budget horror with similarities to the disappearance of her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FOEEtGFPp5cgpLfPQVMB0UNVpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663866'),
  ('421821555955816186', 'Censor of Dreams', 2021, 'Fantasy, Mystery, Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Raphaël Rodriguez, Khalid Mohtaseb, Léo Berne', 'Léo Berne, Raphaël Rodriguez', 'Damien Bonnard, Yôko Higashi, Sylvain Katan, Alexis Rodney', null, 'Night after night The Censor and his team mould Yoko''s memories into fantastical dreams. Tonight nothing happens as planned.', 'Night after night The Censor and his team mould Yoko''s memories into fantastical dreams. Tonight nothing happens as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBNIqyG7u4x5qWyjKQbZ3lar5vA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876045'),
  ('687536383807278351', 'Censored', 1944, 'Comedy, Animation, War', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Phil Eastman, Dr. Seuss', 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Sara Berner', null, 'Private Snafu wants to tell his sweetheart, Sally Lou, that he thinks his unit will be sent to the South Pacific. But every effort he makes to get his letter through uncensored is thwarted by a resourceful (and unseen) censor with an array of contraptions and booby traps. Not even Snafu''s carrier pigeon can avoid the censor -- not when he has a hawk for an assistant. Technical Fairy, First Class, comes to the rescue and agrees to deliver the letter -- but he has good reason to say that he''ll hate himself in the morning.', 'Private Snafu wants to tell his sweetheart, Sally Lou, that he thinks his unit will be sent to the South Pacific. But every effort he makes to get his letter through uncensored is thwarted by a resourceful (and unseen) censor with an array of contraptions and booby traps. Not even Snafu''s carrier pigeon can avoid the censor -- not when he has a hawk for an assistant. Technical Fairy, First Class, comes to the rescue and agrees to deliver the letter -- but he has good reason to say that he''ll hate himself in the morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhkpl0Un6Iv5wTxlMzfCN8tZeK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101393'),
  ('727197249747647543', 'Centaur', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Daria Korobova, Kirill Holdin, Roman Malyshev', 'Mikhail Zubko', 'Yura Borisov, Anastasia Talyzina, Sergey Gilev, Grigory Vernik, Kirill Melekhov, Kseniya Kutepova, Alexey Medvedev, Oleg Evteev', null, 'Liza works at night, a taxi ride for her is a moment of much-desired peace. The driver Sasha inspires confidence, he knows the approach to the most demanding client. There are many unexpected turns in the lights of the big city, behind each of which lies a terrible threat. And perhaps the main danger is closer than it seems.', 'Liza works at night, a taxi ride for her is a moment of much-desired peace. The driver Sasha inspires confidence, he knows the approach to the most demanding client. There are many unexpected turns in the lights of the big city, behind each of which lies a terrible threat. And perhaps the main danger is closer than it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTGkMXbay5kdAQ7wgZX2E5EFJcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142871'),
  ('365270164005437229', 'Centauro', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Daniel Calparsoro, Mireia Juárez', 'Yann Gozlan, Simon Moutaïrou, Guillaume Lemans', 'Àlex Monner, Begoña Vargas, Abraham Pérez Fernández, Édgar Vittorino, Carlos Bardem, Sebastian Ciontescu, Anderson Brian González Montoya, Dollar Selmouni', null, 'Rafa''s hooked on the pure, fiery feelings he gets from speed racing, but when his kid''s mom gets mixed up with drug dealers, he burns rubber to save her.', 'Rafa''s hooked on the pure, fiery feelings he gets from speed racing, but when his kid''s mom gets mixed up with drug dealers, he burns rubber to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMYROfsn2lm1P8wzOsq3c6TuRxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852592'),
  ('830010808546804968', 'Center of My World', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jakob M. Erwa, The Chau Ngo', 'Jakob M. Erwa', 'Louis Hofmann, Sabine Timoteo, Ada Philine Stappenbeck, Jannik Schümann, Svenja Jung, Inka Friedrich, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Nina Proll', null, 'A strange family: 17-year-old Phil lives with his mother and twin sister in an old mansion on the outskirts of town. When he returns from summer camp, the mood in the mansion has soured somehow. Phil doesn’t worry about it, hanging out with his best friend Kat instead. When he starts to feel attracted to a mysterious new student at school, Phil is plunged into emotional turmoil only exacerbated by the trouble at home.', 'A strange family: 17-year-old Phil lives with his mother and twin sister in an old mansion on the outskirts of town. When he returns from summer camp, the mood in the mansion has soured somehow. Phil doesn’t worry about it, hanging out with his best friend Kat instead. When he starts to feel attracted to a mysterious new student at school, Phil is plunged into emotional turmoil only exacerbated by the trouble at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gXgSBF3baQsHqDuIcuEzWt71Gv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360737'),
  ('99896951403035569', 'Center Stage', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Stanley Kwan Kam-Pang, Poon Hang-Sang, Thomas Chow Wai-Kwan', 'Chiu Kang-Chien', 'Maggie Cheung, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Ronald Chin Han, Carina Lau, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Cecilia Yip Tung, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Paul Chang Chung', 'NR', 'Based on the tragic true story of China''s first prima donna of the silver screen, Ruan Lingyu, chronicling her rise to fame as a movie actress in Shanghai during the 1930s.', 'Based on the tragic true story of China''s first prima donna of the silver screen, Ruan Lingyu, chronicling her rise to fame as a movie actress in Shanghai during the 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxeiEVNJDLwSGByC70gQULpXiKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68004'),
  ('320764507027397618', 'Center Stage', 2000, 'Drama, Music', 'Nicholas Hytner, Sam Hoffman, Miguel López-Castillo', 'Carol Heikkinen', 'Amanda Schull, Zoe Saldaña, Peter Gallagher, Ethan Stiefel, Donna Murphy, Susan May Pratt, Debra Monk, Sascha Radetsky', 'PG-13', 'A group of 12 teenagers from various backgrounds enroll at the American Ballet Academy in New York to make it as ballet dancers and each one deals with the problems and stress of training and getting ahead in the world of dance.', 'A group of 12 teenagers from various backgrounds enroll at the American Ballet Academy in New York to make it as ballet dancers and each one deals with the problems and stress of training and getting ahead in the world of dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95Et0t08Nv6S8FD593HpXyvcRt8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10560'),
  ('309094280276582381', 'Center Stage: On Pointe', 2016, 'Music, TV Movie, Drama', 'Director X., Pieter Stathis', 'Nisha Ganatra, Liam Fearnley', 'Nicole Muñoz, Kenny Wormald, Rachele Brooke Smith, Peter Gallagher, Maude Green, Chloe Lukasiak, Barton Cowperthwaite, Thomas L. Colford', 'PG', 'Jonathan Reeves is tasked with infusing more contemporary styles and modernism into the American Ballet Academy, and enlists his top choreographers Charlie, Cooper and Tommy to recruit dancers to compete at a camp where the winners will be selected to join the Academy. Bella Parker, who has always lived in the shadow of her hugely successful sister Kate, finally gets her chance to step into the limelight as one of the dancers recruited for the camp.', 'Jonathan Reeves is tasked with infusing more contemporary styles and modernism into the American Ballet Academy, and enlists his top choreographers Charlie, Cooper and Tommy to recruit dancers to compete at a camp where the winners will be selected to join the Academy. Bella Parker, who has always lived in the shadow of her hugely successful sister Kate, finally gets her chance to step into the limelight as one of the dancers recruited for the camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhoeKkP9XgYecnFQB7gXv4CzB0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402543'),
  ('378316485977538796', 'Center Stage: Turn It Up', 2008, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Steven Jacobson, Dino Parks', 'Karen Bloch Morse', 'Rachele Brooke Smith, Kenny Wormald, Sarah Jayne Jensen, Peter Gallagher, Nicole Muñoz, Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Ethan Stiefel, Anthony Harrison', 'PG-13', 'All self-taught dancer Kate Parker has ever wanted to do was perform with the American Academy of Ballet. But when she doesnt make it after auditioning, she learns that it takes more than precision and perfection to succeed in the dance world.', 'All self-taught dancer Kate Parker has ever wanted to do was perform with the American Academy of Ballet. But when she doesnt make it after auditioning, she learns that it takes more than precision and perfection to succeed in the dance world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngD6GbYx9auu95YMgfNImOnC6uj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16346'),
  ('1148855867602428083', 'Centigrade', 2022, 'Thriller', 'David Fischer, Brendan Walsh, Seamus Tierney', 'Daley Nixon, Brendan Walsh', 'Genesis Rodriguez, Vincent Piazza, Benjamin Sokolow, Emily Bayiokos', 'NR', 'A young American couple travel to the arctic mountains of Norway. After pulling over during a snowstorm, they wake up trapped in their SUV, buried underneath layers of snow and ice.', 'A young American couple travel to the arctic mountains of Norway. After pulling over during a snowstorm, they wake up trapped in their SUV, buried underneath layers of snow and ice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNGwyT62PSVNp9xoyP6QyRjH6Tg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680028'),
  ('1025684862869481562', 'Centipede Horror', 1982, 'Horror', 'Keith Lee Pak-Ling, Lee Yip, Philip Ma Kam-Cheung', 'Amy Chan Suet-Ming', 'Margaret Lee, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Hussein Abu Hassan, Wang Lai, Stephen T.F. Lau, Stephan Yip Tin-Hang, Yolande Yau Pui-Ling', null, 'A crazed evil wizard uses his powers to take revenge on beautiful women by making them vomit up live centipedes, which then proceed to eat their victims.', 'A crazed evil wizard uses his powers to take revenge on beautiful women by making them vomit up live centipedes, which then proceed to eat their victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGrg9X3G5NFcfPrwGAuBhsDA2EI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39547'),
  ('891025273046335694', 'Central Airport', 1933, 'Drama', 'William A. Wellman, Sidney Hickox', 'Jack Moffitt', 'Richard Barthelmess, Sally Eilers, Tom Brown, Grant Mitchell, James Murray, Claire McDowell, Willard Robertson, Arthur Vinton', 'NR', 'Aviator Jim Blaine and his brother Neil are rivals not only as daredevil flyers, but also for the love of parachutist Jill Collins.', 'Aviator Jim Blaine and his brother Neil are rivals not only as daredevil flyers, but also for the love of parachutist Jill Collins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8oySpJvVSS50DwhWyJZqyLBjNj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99729'),
  ('927968258624950164', 'Central Intelligence', 2016, 'Action, Comedy', 'Rawson Marshall Thurber, Barry Peterson, Jason Ellson', 'David Stassen, Ike Barinholtz, Rawson Marshall Thurber', 'Dwayne Johnson, Kevin Hart, Amy Ryan, Danielle Nicolet, Jason Bateman, Aaron Paul, Ryan Hansen, Tim Griffin', 'PG-13', 'Calvin Joyner, a mild-mannered accountant whose high school glory days are long behind him, reconnects with an awkward pal from high school through Facebook. After meeting up, Calvin’s mundane life takes an unexpectedly thrilling turn when he''s thrust into the world of international espionage.', 'Calvin Joyner, a mild-mannered accountant whose high school glory days are long behind him, reconnects with an awkward pal from high school through Facebook. After meeting up, Calvin’s mundane life takes an unexpectedly thrilling turn when he''s thrust into the world of international espionage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXQVMbRNpf7c93e8clMY4W5DRm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302699'),
  ('355920717734564979', 'Centuries of June', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Joseph Cornell, Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Centuries of June, perhaps more than any Cornell film, is a naked attempt to capture the soul of a place and the mood of a disappearing moment.', 'Centuries of June, perhaps more than any Cornell film, is a naked attempt to capture the soul of a place and the mood of a disappearing moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojfGQ416UtFjcziG8lMuxSDHatQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147681'),
