  ('35225009090055448', 'Century of the Dragon', 1999, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Clarence Ford, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Louis Koo, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Suki Kwan Sau-Mei, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Lawrence Lau Sek-Yin, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Frankie Ng Chi-Hung', null, 'Rookie policeman Shing (Louis Koo) grapples with right and wrong in this action-packed story about Hong Kong gangsters. Assigned to go undercover, Shing is so successful in playing the part of a gang member that he becomes right-hand man to gang leader Fei Ling (Andy Lau). Shing comes to respect Fei Ling and question his original motives, but the troubled cop must make a crucial decision before rival gangs and impatient cops move in for the kill.', 'Rookie policeman Shing (Louis Koo) grapples with right and wrong in this action-packed story about Hong Kong gangsters. Assigned to go undercover, Shing is so successful in playing the part of a gang member that he becomes right-hand man to gang leader Fei Ling (Andy Lau). Shing comes to respect Fei Ling and question his original motives, but the troubled cop must make a crucial decision before rival gangs and impatient cops move in for the kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMvnxaH7NtWsTTMG1RYwbgBrjUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274669'),
  ('895493835251708127', 'Cerasella', 1959, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Raffaello Matarazzo, Roberto Pariante, Václav Vích', 'Sandro Continenza, Dino Verde, Raffaello Matarazzo', 'Claudia Mori, Terence Hill, Luigi De Filippo, Alessandra Panaro, Carlo Croccolo, Mario Carotenuto, Luigi Pavese, Piera Farfarella', null, 'Cerasella escapes just before her marriage with Alfredo and meets Bruno, the son of a wealthy industrialist.', 'Cerasella escapes just before her marriage with Alfredo and meets Bruno, the son of a wealthy industrialist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKgvA0Ii9AyPBggKWVBcCeB0QXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61937'),
  ('142033748938828250', 'Cerberus', 2005, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'John Terlesky, Patricia Radoi, Viorel Sergovici', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis, John Terlesky', 'Emmanuelle Vaugier, Greg Evigan, Sebastian Spence, Gelu Nitu, Brent Florence, Cătălin Paraschiv, Michael Cory Davis, Garret Sato', null, 'The breastplate of Attila the Hun is stolen as it has clues to the location of the Sword of Mars. It is said the Sword of Mars made Attila invincible and is guarded by Cerberus.', 'The breastplate of Attila the Hun is stolen as it has clues to the location of the Sword of Mars. It is said the Sword of Mars made Attila invincible and is guarded by Cerberus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grFI9NJo79IeIPOGgogWEKaXsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31012'),
  ('1030633110543166914', 'Cerebrum', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Arvi', 'Arvi, Gary D. Houk', 'James Russo, Alexxis Lemire, Christian James, John Ruby, Anirudh Pisharody, Aly Trasher, Christopher Carrington, Jesse Willhite', null, 'To make ends meet, Tom signs on as a guinea pig at a home-based lab, but when he commits a crime he cannot remember, he must risk his own sanity to reveal the truth.', 'To make ends meet, Tom signs on as a guinea pig at a home-based lab, but when he commits a crime he cannot remember, he must risk his own sanity to reveal the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mndxZUHHvCCdz7VhLoEYNjkkhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691423'),
  ('482143609394072522', 'Ceremony', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Max Winkler, William Rexer, Yann Sobezynski', 'Max Winkler', 'Uma Thurman, Michael Angarano, Lee Pace, Rebecca Mader, Jake Johnson, Reece Thompson, Brooke Bloom, Harper Dill', 'R', 'Sam Davis convinces his former best friend to spend a weekend with him to rekindle their friendship at an elegant beachside estate owned by a famous documentary filmmaker. However, it soon becomes clear that Sam is secretly infatuated with his ex, Zoe, who is now the filmmaker’s fiancée, and that his true intention is to thwart their impending nuptials. As Sam’s plan begins to unravel, he is forced to realize how complicated love and friendship can be.', 'Sam Davis convinces his former best friend to spend a weekend with him to rekindle their friendship at an elegant beachside estate owned by a famous documentary filmmaker. However, it soon becomes clear that Sam is secretly infatuated with his ex, Zoe, who is now the filmmaker’s fiancée, and that his true intention is to thwart their impending nuptials. As Sam’s plan begins to unravel, he is forced to realize how complicated love and friendship can be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7o2JhrMOYmGoZTeghXqYW9sEQzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55246'),
  ('1087030855542689389', 'Cerise', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Carole Guenot, Jérôme Enrico, Bruno Privat', 'Jérôme Enrico, Irina Gontchar', 'Zoé Adjani, Jonathan Zaccaï, Tania Vuchkova, Pierre Derenne, Olivia Côte, Mykola Mateshko, Emilia Radeva, Yavor Ralinov', null, 'Cerise is fourteen years old but she looks twenty. Cerise grew up on the outskirts, but now she''s exiled to Ukraine. Cerise wears excessive amounts of makeup, but she still has a little girl''s dreams. Cerise doesn''t know her father, even though she''s going to have to live with him. Cerise has only ever thought about herself and now she finds herself in the middle of a revolution.', 'Cerise is fourteen years old but she looks twenty. Cerise grew up on the outskirts, but now she''s exiled to Ukraine. Cerise wears excessive amounts of makeup, but she still has a little girl''s dreams. Cerise doesn''t know her father, even though she''s going to have to live with him. Cerise has only ever thought about herself and now she finds herself in the middle of a revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HbvuTg1bcV9pyUqLmf5A4lTlMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328587'),
  ('419618609167921927', 'Cern and the Sense of Beauty', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Valerio Jalongo, Lisa Di Giannuario, Alessandro Pesci', 'Valerio Jalongo', 'John Heffernan', null, 'An exploration of the link between science and beauty through the work of scientists at CERN, in Geneva.', 'An exploration of the link between science and beauty through the work of scientists at CERN, in Geneva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PTExxqcsLWqs814MhzGxeTHnGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488505'),
  ('1111355741288898566', 'Cero y van cuatro', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alejandro Gamboa, Carlos Carrera, Fernando Sariñana', 'Antonio Armonia', 'Guillermo Iván, Juan Pablo Medina, René Campero, José Manuel Poncelis, Silverio Palacios, Mary Paz Mata, Alexis Ayala, Patricia Muñoz', null, 'Four stories... one city. A dark comedy about crime in the big city: EL TORZON - two friends are smoking grass in their car, when they''re caught by a corrupt Judicial Police Officer; VIDA EXPRESS - a wealthy businesswoman is kidnapped and her deadbeat husband has to come up with the money; BARBACOA DE CHIVO - an angry mob mistakes a college professor with a burglar and decide to lynch him in front of the church; COMIDA PARA PERROS - a bumbling thief tries to rob a restaurant', 'Four stories... one city. A dark comedy about crime in the big city: EL TORZON - two friends are smoking grass in their car, when they''re caught by a corrupt Judicial Police Officer; VIDA EXPRESS - a wealthy businesswoman is kidnapped and her deadbeat husband has to come up with the money; BARBACOA DE CHIVO - an angry mob mistakes a college professor with a burglar and decide to lynch him in front of the church; COMIDA PARA PERROS - a bumbling thief tries to rob a restaurant', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8JqfHSGN2hyWKbMaBX2T4Ygdbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74116'),
