  ('814668968922102478', 'Certain Women', 2016, 'Drama', 'Chris Carroll, Melissa Mugavero, Kelly Reichardt', 'Kelly Reichardt', 'Laura Dern, Kristen Stewart, Michelle Williams, Lily Gladstone, James Le Gros, Jared Harris, René Auberjonois, John Getz', 'R', 'Three strong-willed women strive to forge their own paths amidst the wide-open plains of the American Northwest: a lawyer forced to subdue a troubled client; a wife and mother whose plans to construct her dream home reveal fissures in her marriage; and a lonely ranch hand who forms an ambiguous bond with a young law student.', 'Three strong-willed women strive to forge their own paths amidst the wide-open plains of the American Northwest: a lawyer forced to subdue a troubled client; a wife and mother whose plans to construct her dream home reveal fissures in her marriage; and a lonely ranch hand who forms an ambiguous bond with a young law student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIfW4p27B30zSfGCohB2S4cTRz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340487'),
  ('16448349610358566', 'Certains l''aiment chauve', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Camille Delamarre, Cécile Denis, Stéphane Moreno Carpio', 'Camille Delamarre, Antonin Fourlon', 'Kev Adams, Michaël Youn, Rayane Bensetti, Chantal Ladesou, Faustine Koziel, Clara Joly, Anthony Lewis, Sophie Mounicot', null, 'When Zac’s girlfriend breaks up with him because he’s going bald, he embarks on a daring quest to save his scalp and win her back, with the help of his hair-obsessed uncle.', 'When Zac’s girlfriend breaks up with him because he’s going bald, he embarks on a daring quest to save his scalp and win her back, with the help of his hair-obsessed uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5SdVUKrCCyqg2yCcscudSw8jUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318480'),
  ('59091578357546007', 'Certified Copy', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Luca Bigazzi, Marco Pettini', 'Caroline Eliacheff', 'Juliette Binoche, William Shimell, Jean-Claude Carrière, Agathe Natanson, Gianna Giachetti, Adrian Moore, Angelo Barbagallo, Andrea Laurenzi', 'NR', 'In Tuscany to promote his latest book, a middle-aged English writer meets a French woman who leads him to the village of Lucignano.', 'In Tuscany to promote his latest book, a middle-aged English writer meets a French woman who leads him to the village of Lucignano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soBvtCR33Gv1j6gXwXOIc3JTlNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48303'),
  ('858409207653158504', 'Certifiée Halal', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Mahmoud Zemmouri', 'Mahmoud Zemmouri, Marie-Laurence Attias', 'Smaïn, Hafsia Herzi, Jicey Carina, Nadia Kounda, Mourade Zeguendi, Fatima Hellilou, Abdelhamid Gouri, Omar Taïri', null, 'In the Maghreb, Hajj Achour''s plans for his daughter Sultana''s marriage unravel when a defective dowry takes center stage. Meanwhile, in France, activism meets family tradition as Kenza confronts gender norms, leading to a chaotic wedding where secrets collide.', 'In the Maghreb, Hajj Achour''s plans for his daughter Sultana''s marriage unravel when a defective dowry takes center stage. Meanwhile, in France, activism meets family tradition as Kenza confronts gender norms, leading to a chaotic wedding where secrets collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDDrWP8tL00UM4Z8NMOU2PO5NEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338632'),
  ('473964901228845756', 'César', 1936, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marcel Pagnol, Willy Faktorovitch', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Raimu, Orane Demazis, Pierre Fresnay, Fernand Charpin, Robert Vattier, Paul Dullac, Marcel Maupi, Alida Rouffe', null, 'Leaping forward twenty years, the trilogy continues with the death of Fanny''s husband, Panisse, and the discovery of her secret by her son, Césariot. The young man resolves to track down his biological father, Marius, whose life has been fraught with calamity and poverty.', 'Leaping forward twenty years, the trilogy continues with the death of Fanny''s husband, Panisse, and the discovery of her secret by her son, Césariot. The young man resolves to track down his biological father, Marius, whose life has been fraught with calamity and poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bD2tr5HY23lWMw5b4LgI6YunCPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43873'),
  ('1129262001977879257', 'Cesar and Rosalie', 1972, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jean Boffety, Claude Sautet', 'Claude Néron', 'Romy Schneider, Yves Montand, Sami Frey, Umberto Orsini, Bernard Le Coq, Isabelle Huppert, Eva Maria Meineke, Gisela Hahn', null, 'A young woman becomes entangled with a successful businessman, but her ex tries to win her back, provoking intense jealousy that leads her to reconsider her choice. Ultimately, one man''s actions force a resolution to her dilemma.', 'A young woman becomes entangled with a successful businessman, but her ex tries to win her back, provoking intense jealousy that leads her to reconsider her choice. Ultimately, one man''s actions force a resolution to her dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsFqp6nL4WreueDVK1EQraepWwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3426'),
  ('328493701661043048', 'Cesar Chavez', 2014, 'Drama', 'Enrique Chediak, Diego Luna', 'Keir Pearson, Timothy J. Sexton', 'Michael Peña, Rosario Dawson, America Ferrera, Jacob Vargas, Gabriel Mann, Lisa Brenner, John Malkovich, Kevin Dunn', 'PG-13', 'A biography of the civil-rights activist and labor organizer Cesar Chavez. Chronicling the birth of a modern American labour movement, Cesar Chavez tells the story of the famed civil rights leader and labour organiser torn between his duties as a husband and father and his commitment to securing a living wage for farm workers. Passionate but soft-spoken, Chavez embraced non-violence as he battled greed and prejudice in his struggle to bring dignity to working people.', 'A biography of the civil-rights activist and labor organizer Cesar Chavez. Chronicling the birth of a modern American labour movement, Cesar Chavez tells the story of the famed civil rights leader and labour organiser torn between his duties as a husband and father and his commitment to securing a living wage for farm workers. Passionate but soft-spoken, Chavez embraced non-violence as he battled greed and prejudice in his struggle to bring dignity to working people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyEpCV8nLfhloAkwNxel4OjIhAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230779'),
