  ('115861804287252428', 'Césarée', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Marguerite Duras, Pierre Lhomme, Michel Cénet', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Marguerite Duras', null, 'On images of the Tuileries Gardens, Marguerite Duras recalls Césarée, an ancient destroyed city.', 'On images of the Tuileries Gardens, Marguerite Duras recalls Césarée, an ancient destroyed city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hvW9aBrYNjzrZBkpAbl16Tzbao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169512'),
  ('547918345335771276', 'Cesium Fallout', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Mak Tin-Shu, Wing-Yiu Wong', 'Andy Lau, Bai Yu, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Ivana Wong Yuen-Chi, Louise Wong Tan-Nei, Fish Liew Chi-Yu, Michael Wong', null, 'Hong Kong’s historic first radiation disaster blockbuster! After a fire accident triggers a radiation leakage, the entire city suddenly finds its survival hanging by a thread. In order to tackle the impending catastrophe, expert Simon Fan joins the emergency crisis response team led by Acting Chief Executive Cecilia to tackle this catastrophic disaster. With the lives of 7 million people on the line, the fire brigade is tasked with stopping the spread at all costs by entering the radiation zone. Facing this unprecedented calamity, will Hong Kong wake up to an overnight annihilation?', 'Hong Kong’s historic first radiation disaster blockbuster! After a fire accident triggers a radiation leakage, the entire city suddenly finds its survival hanging by a thread. In order to tackle the impending catastrophe, expert Simon Fan joins the emergency crisis response team led by Acting Chief Executive Cecilia to tackle this catastrophic disaster. With the lives of 7 million people on the line, the fire brigade is tasked with stopping the spread at all costs by entering the radiation zone. Facing this unprecedented calamity, will Hong Kong wake up to an overnight annihilation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raJBPDWKDO9AdHE8bgTIdjOtZEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1305642'),
  ('275946948095845848', 'Cet amour-là', 2001, 'Drama', 'Josée Dayan, Caroline Champetier', 'Yann Andréa', 'Jeanne Moreau, Aymeric Demarigny, Christiane Rorato', null, 'Cet Amour-là is an intimate portrait of a legendary love affair. Set against the beauty of the Breton seaside, it is also a film that revels in the insights that Marguerite Duras'' writing affords.', 'Cet Amour-là is an intimate portrait of a legendary love affair. Set against the beauty of the Breton seaside, it is also a film that revels in the insights that Marguerite Duras'' writing affords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfaXyeKt46s16kbPcNyWL5WFxaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284096'),
  ('612220428314524484', 'Cetto c''è, senzadubbiamente', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Giulio Manfredonia, Roberto Forza', 'Giulio Manfredonia', 'Antonio Albanese, Nicola Rignanese, Caterina Shulha, Aurora Quattrocchi, Gianfelice Imparato, Davide Giordano, Lorenza Indovina, Massimo Cagnina', null, 'Cetto la Qualunque, having set aside all political ambition, is now nothing more than an entrepreneur. But the news of the worsening condition of his aunt leads him to return to Italy, where something from his past will be revealed and, “doubtlessly,” all of our lives will be forever changed.', 'Cetto la Qualunque, having set aside all political ambition, is now nothing more than an entrepreneur. But the news of the worsening condition of his aunt leads him to return to Italy, where something from his past will be revealed and, “doubtlessly,” all of our lives will be forever changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iftgDEhIhgK78BfRvuO7UmtrUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592739'),
  ('1007819969801324607', 'Cezanne and I', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Danièle Thompson, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Danièle Thompson', 'Guillaume Gallienne, Guillaume Canet, Alice Pol, Déborah François, Sabine Azéma, Gérard Meylan, Isabelle Candelier, Freya Mavor', 'R', 'They loved each other with the ardor of thirteen-year-old boys. Rebellion and curiosity, hopes and doubts, girls and dreams of glory – they shared it all. Paul was rich, Emile poor. They went skinny-dipping, drank absinthe, starved, only to overeat. Sketched models by day, caressed them by night... Now, Paul is a painter and Emile a writer. Glory has passed Paul by. But Emile has it all: fame, money, the perfect wife, whom Paul once loved. They judge each other, admire each other, confront each other. They lose touch, meet up again, like a couple who cannot stop loving each other.', 'They loved each other with the ardor of thirteen-year-old boys. Rebellion and curiosity, hopes and doubts, girls and dreams of glory – they shared it all. Paul was rich, Emile poor. They went skinny-dipping, drank absinthe, starved, only to overeat. Sketched models by day, caressed them by night... Now, Paul is a painter and Emile a writer. Glory has passed Paul by. But Emile has it all: fame, money, the perfect wife, whom Paul once loved. They judge each other, admire each other, confront each other. They lose touch, meet up again, like a couple who cannot stop loving each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ErrcTPS1xf05ynSN9VmBOf9686.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382509'),
  ('960679503688357420', 'CFNY: The Spirit of Radio', 2026, 'Documentary, Music', 'Matt Schichter', 'Matt Schichter, Miles Davren', 'Geddy Lee, Deryck Whibley, Jim Kerr, Emily Haines, Peter Hook', null, 'In 1976, CFNY launched in a small suburban house just north of Toronto and went on to become one of the most influential punk, new wave and alternative radio stations in the world. This is the story of their mission to bring the most exciting music in the world to the masses. It''s also a story of the personalities, lawsuits, bankruptcies, concerts, and listener protests that went along with it.', 'In 1976, CFNY launched in a small suburban house just north of Toronto and went on to become one of the most influential punk, new wave and alternative radio stations in the world. This is the story of their mission to bring the most exciting music in the world to the masses. It''s also a story of the personalities, lawsuits, bankruptcies, concerts, and listener protests that went along with it.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fn9UTrNgrgS12XRxW2HL9oOY3kXe.jpg', 'plex:movie:cfny-the-spirit-of-radio'),
  ('860107524344189796', 'Cha cha cha', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marco Risi, Marco Onorato, Barbara Daniele', 'James Carrington, Andrea Purgatori, Marco Risi', 'Luca Argentero, Eva Herzigová, Pippo Delbono, Pietro Ragusa, Mimmo Cuticchio, Bebo Storti, Marco Leonardi, Rodolfo Corsato', null, 'An accident involving a 16-years old prompts private eye Corso to an investigation that will unearth a deep web of corruption in today''s Rome.', 'An accident involving a 16-years old prompts private eye Corso to an investigation that will unearth a deep web of corruption in today''s Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsl5FMxkjZIK4wu9YbBjvSuSBZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201010'),
  ('935435274887198330', 'Cha Cha Chá', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Antonio del Real', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, Antonio del Real, Carlos Asorey', 'Eduardo Noriega, Ana Álvarez, Jorge Sanz, María Adánez, Gabino Diego, Marta Belaustegui, Antonio Medina, Pilar Ordóñez', null, 'Lucia and Maria are two friends who share everything. Everything except Pablo, Maria''s boyfriend. Lucia devises a plan to make Pablo her own while getting María a new boyfriend.', 'Lucia and Maria are two friends who share everything. Everything except Pablo, Maria''s boyfriend. Lucia devises a plan to make Pablo her own while getting María a new boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMIFre5njNIKmsnNoOhdly4EFjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96838'),
  ('380729010329123633', 'Cha Cha Real Smooth', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cooper Raiff, Cédric Chabloz, Tomi Hutton', 'Cooper Raiff', 'Cooper Raiff, Dakota Johnson, Vanessa Burghardt, Evan Assante, Leslie Mann, Raúl Castillo, Odeya Rush, Brad Garrett', 'R', 'Fresh out of college and stuck at his New Jersey home without a clear path forward, 22-year-old Andrew begins working as a party starter for bar/bat mitzvahs—where he strikes up a unique friendship with a young mom and her teenage daughter.', 'Fresh out of college and stuck at his New Jersey home without a clear path forward, 22-year-old Andrew begins working as a party starter for bar/bat mitzvahs—where he strikes up a unique friendship with a young mom and her teenage daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUvoVhvwTlP8DofoqeIu7QAGLAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814340'),
  ('604100980751706175', 'Chaahat', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Ashok Behal, Gudia Mohapatra', null, 'Shah Rukh Khan, Pooja Bhatt, Naseeruddin Shah, Ramya Krishnan, Anupam Kher, Tiku Talsania, Razak Khan, Shri Vallabh Vyas', null, 'Roop and his father come to the city for medical treatment where Reshma falls in love with Roop. However, Roop loves Pooja but when Reshma threatens to kill herself, Roop agrees to marry her.', 'Roop and his father come to the city for medical treatment where Reshma falls in love with Roop. However, Roop loves Pooja but when Reshma threatens to kill herself, Roop agrees to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cn3gL1s7ZshDUTjcZ0W4JCyBBc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102353'),
  ('761371909810885354', 'Chaalbaaz', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Pankaj Parashar, Manmohan Singh', 'Rajesh Mazumdar, Kamlesh Pandey', 'Sridevi, Sunny Deol, Rajinikanth, Anupam Kher, Rohini Hattangadi, Annu Kapoor, Saeed Jaffrey, Shakti Kapoor', null, 'Twins separated at infancy are brought up differently. One weak, one strong. One day, they end up at each others house. Their life is not the same anymore.', 'Twins separated at infancy are brought up differently. One weak, one strong. One day, they end up at each others house. Their life is not the same anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jq1f7uVoQBfKVwKQqsXDV998ftJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168430'),
  ('955568889483638508', 'Chabak - Night of Murder and Romance', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Inhyuk Hyoung', null, 'Danny Ahn, Kim Min-chae, Hong Kyung-in, Han Min-yeob, Lee Yoon-ji, Kim Hak-cheol', null, 'On their first wedding anniversary, a couple ventures into the mountains for a romantic Chabak (car-camping) trip, but their idyllic getaway turns into a living nightmare when they unknowingly cross paths with a bloodthirsty psychopath. The couple must confront the truth before it’s too late.', 'On their first wedding anniversary, a couple ventures into the mountains for a romantic Chabak (car-camping) trip, but their idyllic getaway turns into a living nightmare when they unknowingly cross paths with a bloodthirsty psychopath. The couple must confront the truth before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BXtJhRf7o2RCySbGQiPTh2N9Xg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127546'),
  ('966729703590590026', 'Chabelo Y Pepito Contra Los Monstruos', 1973, 'Horror, Comedy, Family', 'Manuel Gómez Urquiza, José Estrada, Mario Llorca', 'Toni Sbert', 'Xavier López, Martín Ramos Arévalo, Sylvia Pasquel, Pedro Reiguero, Manuel Cepeda, Nathanael León, Emma Grise, Eduardo Cassab', null, 'An ordinary day''s hike gets rough when two youngsters escape from the main group into the woods and, after finding a grotto, discover that there is more to it than just darkness.', 'An ordinary day''s hike gets rough when two youngsters escape from the main group into the woods and, after finding a grotto, discover that there is more to it than just darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2pzMtWon72ZfZCwWwHEpboJoqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123044'),
  ('1002487512606126466', 'Chabelo y Pepito Detectives', 1974, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Drama, Comedy', 'José Estrada, Manuel Gómez Urquiza', 'Toni Sbert', 'Xavier López, Martín Ramos Arévalo, Armando Acosta, Carlos A. Bonilla, Federico González, Enrique Grey, Emma Grise, Nathanael León', null, 'A commanding friend Pepito and Chabelo ask them to help uncover a gang who kidnaps children. They accept and are out to steal to join the band. Whenthey find that the band mesmerizes children with toys and then the kids are controlled by young boys and they controlled in turn by strangers with long hair and blue eyes.', 'A commanding friend Pepito and Chabelo ask them to help uncover a gang who kidnaps children. They accept and are out to steal to join the band. Whenthey find that the band mesmerizes children with toys and then the kids are controlled by young boys and they controlled in turn by strangers with long hair and blue eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHDMvedmhuG9L52MDTsdzYtGmZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187870'),
